('b593a7ca-68af-5fa4-ac62-841bf2fc8547', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '09f1d27d-1950-545a-86bf-26ddd038fd16', 'a6fee9f7-e500-567e-8765-7a053179be07', 'nut', '/nʌt/', '', 'noun', 'Quả có vỏ cứng, thường ăn được.', 'a hard fruit with a shell that contains a seed you can eat.', 'I love eating cashews and almonds; they are my favorite nuts.', 'Tôi thích ăn hạt điều và hạnh nhân; chúng là những loại hạt yêu thích của tôi.', '{\"en\": \"The catering service provides a healthy snack box containing various types of nuts for guests.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ ăn uống cung cấp hộp đồ ăn nhẹ lành mạnh chứa nhiều loại hạt cho khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-ljspeech-85ae1763.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-cori-85ae1763.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nut-86400254.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-cori-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru0-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru5-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru6-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru10-85ae1763.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru9-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru3-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru7-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru8-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-aru2-85ae1763.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-ljspeech-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-lt408-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-lt138-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-lt624-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-lt396-85ae1763.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-lt498-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-lt132-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-lt288-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-lt42-85ae1763.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nut-lt90-85ae1763.mp3\"]}}', '', 'other', 1, 3),
('2d3967de-4f28-52fa-9e47-daf6927c9d88', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '09f1d27d-1950-545a-86bf-26ddd038fd16', 'a6fee9f7-e500-567e-8765-7a053179be07', 'quality', 'UK: /ˈkwɒləti/ | US: /ˈkwɑːləti/', 'A2', 'noun', 'chất lượng', 'The standard or level of excellence of something when compared to other things.', 'We prioritize the quality of our products.', 'Chúng tôi ưu tiên chất lượng sản phẩm của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The manufacturer is committed to delivering high quality electronics to global distributors.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà sản xuất cam kết cung cấp đồ điện tử chất lượng cao cho các nhà phân phối toàn cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-ljspeech-4ff18f00.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-cori-4ff18f00.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/quality-288e26d7.webp', '[\"standard\", \"excellence\", \"grade\"]', '[\"inferiority\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"quality control\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm soát chất lượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"high quality\", \"meaning\": \"chất lượng cao\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"quantity\", \"note_vi\": \"Quality là chất lượng, còn Quantity (/ˈkwɑːntəti/) là số lượng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"qualitative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-cori-4ff18f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-aru0-4ff18f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-aru5-4ff18f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-aru6-4ff18f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-aru10-4ff18f00.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-aru9-4ff18f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-aru3-4ff18f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-aru7-4ff18f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-aru8-4ff18f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-aru2-4ff18f00.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-ljspeech-4ff18f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-lt408-4ff18f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-lt138-4ff18f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-lt624-4ff18f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-lt396-4ff18f00.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-lt498-4ff18f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-lt132-4ff18f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-lt288-4ff18f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-lt42-4ff18f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-lt90-4ff18f00.mp3\"]}}', 'Vừa là danh từ (chất lượng), vừa có thể đặt trước danh từ khác như tính từ bổ nghĩa (ví dụ: quality control, quality service).', 'manufacturing', 1, 4),
('d5ca11a2-fe91-5daf-9d4b-655ac675c58f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '09f1d27d-1950-545a-86bf-26ddd038fd16', 'a6fee9f7-e500-567e-8765-7a053179be07', 'round-trip', 'UK: /ˈraʊnd ˌtrɪp/ | US: /ˈraʊnd ˌtrɪp/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'khứ hồi', 'Describing a journey that takes a traveler to a destination and back again.', 'I bought a round-trip ticket to Seoul.', 'Tôi đã mua vé khứ hồi đi Seoul.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate travel agent reserved a round-trip flight ticket for the CEO\'s business trip.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch doanh nghiệp đã đặt vé máy bay khứ hồi cho chuyến công tác của Giám đốc điều hành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-ljspeech-425738f4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-cori-425738f4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/round-trip-f065291f.webp', '[\"return\", \"two-way\"]', '[\"one-way\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"round-trip ticket\", \"meaning\": \"vé khứ hồi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"round-trip fare\", \"meaning\": \"giá vé khứ hồi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"one-way\", \"note_vi\": \"Round-trip là chuyến đi có đi có về (khứ hồi), trong khi one-way chỉ đi một chiều.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-cori-425738f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru0-425738f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru5-425738f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru6-425738f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru10-425738f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru9-425738f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru3-425738f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru7-425738f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru8-425738f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru2-425738f4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-ljspeech-425738f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt408-425738f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt138-425738f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt624-425738f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt396-425738f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt498-425738f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt132-425738f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt288-425738f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt42-425738f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt90-425738f4.mp3\"]}}', 'Đứng trước danh từ như \'ticket\', \'flight\', \'fare\'. Trái nghĩa trực tiếp với \'one-way\'.', 'travel', 1, 5),
('f3512995-a6b3-599a-9f45-2eb5caab00d1', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '09f1d27d-1950-545a-86bf-26ddd038fd16', 'a6fee9f7-e500-567e-8765-7a053179be07', 'climate', '/ˈklaɪmət/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thời tiết trung bình của một khu vực trong một thời gian dài.', 'the general weather conditions of a place measured over a long period.', 'The tropical climate of Vietnam is characterized by high temperatures and humidity.', 'Khí hậu nhiệt đới của Việt Nam đặc trưng bởi nhiệt độ và độ ẩm cao.', '{\"en\": \"The company aims to expand into regions with a mild climate for tourism.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty mục tiêu mở rộng sang các khu vực có khí hậu ôn hòa để phát triển du lịch.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-ljspeech-9d7ccb90.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-cori-9d7ccb90.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/climate-27c90a89.webp', '[\"weather conditions\", \"environment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"climate change\", \"meaning\": \"biến đổi khí hậu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business climate\", \"meaning\": \"môi trường kinh doanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"weather\", \"note_vi\": \"Weather là thời tiết ngắn hạn, climate là khí hậu dài hạn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"climatic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-cori-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru0-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru5-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru6-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru10-9d7ccb90.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru9-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru3-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru7-9d7ccb90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climate-aru8-9d7ccb90.mp3\