('aba4f5e4-a912-50eb-8b08-26969fe6e86b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '09f1d27d-1950-545a-86bf-26ddd038fd16', 'a6fee9f7-e500-567e-8765-7a053179be07', 'wonder', '/ˈwʌndə(r)/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Tự hỏi, muốn biết điều gì đó.', 'to want to know something or to think about something with curiosity or uncertainty.', 'Clients often wonder why software updates require so much testing time.', 'Khách hàng thường tự hỏi tại sao việc cập nhật phần mềm lại mất nhiều thời gian kiểm thử đến vậy.', '{\"en\": \"I wonder if the client has reviewed the revised contract we sent yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi tự hỏi liệu khách hàng đã xem xét hợp đồng sửa đổi mà chúng tôi gửi hôm qua chưa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-ljspeech-c37424cc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-cori-c37424cc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wonder-db38e05b.webp', '[\"question\", \"ponder\", \"speculate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wonder about\", \"meaning\": \"thắc mắc về điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"I wonder if\", \"meaning\": \"tôi tự hỏi liệu có...\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wonder why\", \"meaning\": \"tự hỏi tại sao\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wander\", \"note_vi\": \"\'wander\' nghĩa là đi lang thang, còn \'wonder\' nghĩa là tự hỏi hoặc ngạc nhiên\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"wonder\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"wonderful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"wonderfully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-cori-c37424cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-aru0-c37424cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-aru5-c37424cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-aru6-c37424cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-aru10-c37424cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-aru9-c37424cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-aru3-c37424cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-aru7-c37424cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-aru8-c37424cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-aru2-c37424cc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-ljspeech-c37424cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-lt408-c37424cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-lt138-c37424cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-lt624-c37424cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-lt396-c37424cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-lt498-c37424cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-lt132-c37424cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-lt288-c37424cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-lt42-c37424cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wonder-lt90-c37424cc.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm \'wonder\' (tự hỏi) với \'wander\' (lang thang); hai từ phát âm gần giống nhau nhưng nghĩa khác hoàn toàn.', 'office', 1, 17),
('069fe654-4aad-5399-8497-68be33b640ae', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '09f1d27d-1950-545a-86bf-26ddd038fd16', 'a6fee9f7-e500-567e-8765-7a053179be07', 'reliable', 'UK: /rɪˈlaɪəbəl/ | US: /rɪˈlaɪəbəl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'đáng tin cậy', 'able to be trusted to perform well or function correctly without fail or error.', 'Our new system is very reliable and efficient.', 'Hệ thống mới của chúng tôi rất đáng tin cậy và hiệu quả.', '{\"en\": \"We are seeking a reliable courier company to handle our urgent document deliveries.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đang tìm kiếm một công ty chuyển phát nhanh đáng tin cậy để xử lý việc giao tài liệu gấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reliable-ljspeech-c5e8cfa7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reliable-cori-c5e8cfa7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reliable-4139a7b3.webp', '[\"dependable\", \"trustworthy\", \"reputable\"]', '[\"unreliable\", \"undependable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reliable service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ đáng tin cậy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reliable source\", \"meaning\": \"nguồn tin đáng tin cậy\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reliability\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"rely\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"reliably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reliable-cori-c5e8cfa7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reliable-aru0-c5e8cfa7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reliable-aru5-c5e8cfa7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reliable-aru6-c5e8cfa7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reliable-aru10-c5e8cfa7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reliable-aru9-c5e8cfa7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reliable-aru3-c5e8cfa7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reliable-aru7-c5e8cfa7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reliable-aru8