('246c0664-eeb6-5947-8641-dff63eef19f3', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '0dd92e15-e283-5a2f-80cd-407bba9a7590', '2f16ffcd-a58d-5a20-b7d9-ea0327708df5', 'capable', '/ˈkeɪpəbəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có năng lực, có khả năng làm gì đó.', 'having the skills, qualities, or power needed to do something successfully.', 'He is a highly capable engineer, always finding solutions to complex problems.', 'Anh ấy là một kỹ sư rất có năng lực, luôn tìm ra giải pháp cho các vấn đề phức tạp.', '{\"en\": \"The candidate is highly capable of managing the international marketing department effectively.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên này hoàn toàn có năng lực quản lý bộ phận tiếp thị quốc tế một cách hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capable-ljspeech-a503f77f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capable-cori-a503f77f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/capable-2fab3b84.webp', '[\"competent\", \"skilled\"]', '[\"incompetent\", \"unable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly capable\", \"meaning\": \"có năng lực cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"capable of\", \"meaning\": \"có khả năng làm gì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"capability\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"capably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capable-cori-a503f77f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capable-aru0-a503f77f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capable-aru5-a503f77f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capable-aru6-a503f77f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capable-aru10-a503f77f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capable-aru9-a503f77f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capable-aru3-a503f77f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capable-aru7-a503f77f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capable-aru8-a503f77f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public