('8d48f2a2-70ed-54d1-b7c1-5a0b05e86b61', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '0dd92e15-e283-5a2f-80cd-407bba9a7590', '2f16ffcd-a58d-5a20-b7d9-ea0327708df5', 'unreliable', '/ˌʌnrɪˈlaɪəbl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không đáng tin cậy, không thể dựa vào được.', 'not able to be trusted or depended on to work correctly or consistently.', 'His old car is quite unreliable; it breaks down frequently.', 'Chiếc xe cũ của anh ấy khá không đáng tin cậy; nó thường xuyên bị hỏng.', '{\"en\": \"The supplier was considered unreliable after missing three consecutive delivery deadlines.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà cung cấp bị coi là không đáng tin cậy sau khi bỏ lỡ ba thời hạn giao hàng liên tiếp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-ljspeech-a8b763fe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-cori-a8b763fe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unreliable-7f145c44.webp', '[\"untrustworthy\", \"inconsistent\", \"undependable\"]', '[\"reliable\", \"dependable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unreliable supplier\", \"meaning\": \"nhà cung cấp không đáng tin cậy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unreliable data\", \"meaning\": \"dữ liệu không đáng tin cậy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prove unreliable\", \"meaning\": \"tỏ ra không đáng tin cậy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unstable\", \"note_vi\": \"unstable nói về sự không ổn định về cấu trúc hoặc tâm lý, unreliable nói về độ tin cậy\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"rely\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reliable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reliability\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-cori-a8b763fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-aru0-a8b763fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-aru5-a8b763fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-aru6-a8b763fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-aru10-a8b763fe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-aru9-a8b763fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-aru3-a8b763fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-aru7-a8b763fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-aru8-a8b763fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-aru2-a8b763fe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-ljspeech-a8b763fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-lt408-a8b763fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-lt138-a8b763fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-lt624-a8b763fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-lt396-a8b763fe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-lt498-a8b763fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-lt132-a8b763fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-lt288-a8b763fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-lt42-a8b763fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreliable-lt90-a8b763fe.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố \'un-\' phủ định reliable; hay gặp trong TOEIC khi đánh giá nhà cung cấp hoặc thiết bị.', 'business', 1, 20),
('c91e6f45-4c85-59b2-a6ca-e5ad943258c9', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '0dd92e15-e283-5a2f-80cd-407bba9a7590', '2f16ffcd-a58d-5a20-b7d9-ea0327708df5', 'cosmos', '/ˈkɒzmɒs/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Toàn bộ vũ trụ, bao gồm tất cả không gian, vật chất và năng lượng.', 'the entire universe, including all space, matter, and energy that exists everywhere.', 'The mysteries of the cosmos have fascinated humanity for centuries.', 'Những bí ẩn của vũ trụ đã mê hoặc nhân loại qua nhiều thế kỷ.', '{\"en\": \"The research team studied the cosmos to understand how distant stars affect global communication.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm nghiên cứu đã nghiên cứu vũ trụ để hiểu cách các ngôi sao xa xôi ảnh hưởng đến thông tin liên lạc toàn cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-ljspeech-094c26f4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-cori-094c26f4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cosmos-99788cb7.webp', '[\"universe\", \"space\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"the vast cosmos\", \"meaning\": \"vũ trụ bao la\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"cosmic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-cori-094c26f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-aru0-094c26f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-aru5-094c26f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-aru6-094c26f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-aru10-094c26f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-aru9-094c26f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-aru3-094c26f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-aru7-094c26f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-aru8-094c26f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-aru2-094c26f4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-ljspeech-094c26f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-lt408-094c26f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-lt138-094c26f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-lt624-094c26f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-lt396-094c26f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-lt498-094c26f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-lt132-094c26f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-lt288-094c26f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-lt42-094c26f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cosmos-lt90-094c26f4.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang sắc thái trang trọng, thường dùng trong khoa học.', 'academic', 1, 21),
('a48412e4-4089-5d6f-b765-a3785ae691c3', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '0dd92e15-e283-5a2f-80cd-407bba9a7590', '2f16ffcd-a58d-5a20-b7d9-ea0327708df5', 'defeated', '/dɪˈfiːtɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Bị đánh bại, thua cuộc hoặc cảm thấy tuyệt vọng.', 'feeling frustrated or disappointed after failing to win or achieve something.', 'The incumbent candidate admitted that he was defeated in the recent local election.', 'Ứng cử viên đương nhiệm đã thừa nhận rằng ông đã bị đánh bại trong cuộc bầu cử địa phương gần đây.', '{\"en\": \"The sales staff felt defeated after the client rejected their final contract proposal.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bán hàng cảm thấy thất vọng sau khi khách hàng từ chối đề xuất hợp đồng cuối cùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-ljspeech-baeaa6d4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-cori-baeaa6d4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/defeated-fed7574d.webp', '[\"beaten\", \"vanquished\", \"disheartened\"]', '[\"victorious\", \"triumphant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel defeated\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy bế tắc hoặc thất vọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"admit defeat\", \"meaning\": \"thừa nhận thất bại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"defective\", \"note_vi\": \"defective nghĩa là bị lỗi hoặc hỏng hóc, không liên quan thua cuộc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"defeat\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"defeat\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-cori-baeaa6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-aru0-baeaa6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-aru5-baeaa6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-aru6-baeaa6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-aru10-baeaa6d4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-aru9-baeaa6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-aru3-baeaa6d