('d824ca9b-fb56-53ee-81fc-929442258779', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '0f4e121c-c7ee-5358-a18e-b58ecb0d2c6a', '996d692f-2d50-5b17-aeef-c7f1cf07f0b9', 'capture', '/ˈkæptʃə/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành động bắt giữ hoặc chiếm được ai/cái gì.', 'the act of catching or taking control of someone or something.', 'The capture of the escaped prisoner was a relief for the whole town.', 'Việc bắt giữ tù nhân trốn thoát là một sự nhẹ nhõm cho cả thị trấn.', '{\"en\": \"The capture of key market data helped the team develop a stronger sales strategy.\", \"vi\": \"Việc thu thập dữ liệu thị trường quan trọng đã giúp nhóm phát triển chiến lược bán hàng mạnh hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-ljspeech-fbc259d1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-cori-fbc259d1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/capture-f980051f.webp', '[\"seizure\", \"acquisition\", \"arrest\"]', '[\"release\", \"liberation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"data capture\", \"meaning\": \"thu thập dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"capture of market share\", \"meaning\": \"chiếm lĩnh thị phần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"image capture\", \"meaning\": \"chụp/lưu hình ảnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"capture\", \"note_vi\": \"seize: chiếm đoạt nhanh, mạnh; capture: bắt giữ hoặc chiếm được sau quá trình.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"capture\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"captive\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"captivity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-cori-fbc259d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-aru0-fbc259d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-aru5-fbc259d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-aru6-fbc259d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-aru10-fbc259d1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-aru9-fbc259d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-aru3-fbc259d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-aru7-fbc259d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-aru8-fbc259d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-aru2-fbc259d1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-ljspeech-fbc259d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-lt408-fbc259d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-lt138-fbc259d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-lt624-fbc259d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-lt396-fbc259d1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-lt498-fbc259d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-lt132-fbc259d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-lt288-fbc259d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-lt42-fbc259d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capture-lt90-fbc259d1.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh kinh doanh, capture thường đi với market share hoặc data — chú ý nghĩa mở rộng này.', 'business', 1, 12),
('a2f1b77f-d88c-585e-9b0a-2fe4de9a65d5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '0f4e121c-c7ee-5358-a18e-b58ecb0d2c6a', '996d692f-2d50-5b17-aeef-c7f1cf07f0b9', 'memory card', '/ˈmem.ər.i kɑːd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một thiết bị lưu trữ dữ liệu nhỏ gọn, dùng trong máy ảnh, điện thoại.', 'a compact digital storage medium utilized to retain media files within portable electronic devices.', 'I need to buy a larger memory card for my camera to store more photos.', 'Tôi cần mua một thẻ nhớ lớn hơn cho máy ảnh để lưu nhiều ảnh hơn.', '{\"en\": \"Please insert the memory card into the office printer to print the scanned documents directly.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng lắp thẻ nhớ vào máy in văn phòng để in trực tiếp các tài liệu đã quét.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memory-card-ljspeech-63b9c052.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memory-card-cori-63b9c052.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/memory-card-e213d695.webp', '[\"flash card\", \"SD card\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"insert a memory card\", \"meaning\": \"lắp thẻ nhớ vào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"format a memory card\", \"meaning\": \"định dạng thẻ nhớ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sim card\", \"note_vi\": \"thẻ sim điện thoại dùng để kết nối mạng\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memory-card-cori-63b9c052.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memory-card-aru0-63b9c052.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memory-card-aru5-63b9c052.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memory-card-aru6-63b9c052.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memory-card-aru10-63b9c052.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memory-card-aru9-63b9c052.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memory-card-aru3-63b9c052.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memory-card-aru7-63b9c052.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/memo