('84858a16-2359-599e-857c-2c7b6ec44cb1', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '0f4e121c-c7ee-5358-a18e-b58ecb0d2c6a', '996d692f-2d50-5b17-aeef-c7f1cf07f0b9', 'sad', '/sæd/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy không vui, đau khổ hoặc thất vọng.', 'feeling unhappy, sorrowful, or showing sorrow because something bad has happened.', 'It was a very sad day when we had to say goodbye to our old pet.', 'Đó là một ngày rất buồn khi chúng tôi phải nói lời tạm biệt với con vật cưng già của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The employees were sad to hear about the sudden closure of the branch office.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên rất buồn khi nghe tin về việc đóng cửa đột ngột của văn phòng chi nhánh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sad-ljspeech-b4914600.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sad-cori-b4914600.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sad-54e7efb4.webp', '[\"unhappy\", \"sorrowful\", \"depressed\"]', '[\"happy\", \"cheerful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sad news\", \"meaning\": \"tin buồn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel sad\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy buồn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sadness\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sadden\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"sadly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sad-cori-b4914600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sad-aru0-b4914600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sad-aru5-b4914600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sad-aru6-b4914600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sad-aru10-b4914600.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sad-aru9-b4914600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sad-aru3-b4914600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sad-aru7-b4914600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sad-aru8-b4914600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sad-aru2-b4914600.mp3\