('bd9693e6-669f-588d-b152-b7dc13017579', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '0f4e121c-c7ee-5358-a18e-b58ecb0d2c6a', '996d692f-2d50-5b17-aeef-c7f1cf07f0b9', 'final', 'UK: /ˈfaɪnəl/ | US: /ˈfaɪnəl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'cuối cùng', 'coming at the very end of a series, process, or period of time.', 'The final decision will be made next week.', 'Quyết định cuối cùng sẽ được đưa ra vào tuần tới.', '{\"en\": \"The project proposal needs final approval from the managing director before implementation.\", \"vi\": \"Đề xuất dự án cần có sự phê duyệt cuối cùng từ giám đốc điều hành trước khi thực hiện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-ljspeech-d594c2cc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-cori-d594c2cc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/final-03d7c039.webp', '[\"ultimate\", \"concluding\", \"definitive\", \"last\"]', '[\"initial\", \"first\", \"preliminary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"final decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định cuối cùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"final approval\", \"meaning\": \"sự phê duyệt cuối cùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"final payment\", \"meaning\": \"thanh toán đợt cuối\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fine\", \"note_vi\": \"Fine là tiền phạt hoặc ổn/tốt, khác với final (cuối cùng).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"finally\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"finalize\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"finalist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-cori-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru0-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru5-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru6-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru10-d594c2cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru9-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru3-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru7-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru8-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-aru2-d594c2cc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-ljspeech-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-lt408-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-lt138-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-lt624-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-lt396-d594c2cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-lt498-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-lt132-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-lt288-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-lt42-d594c2cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/final-lt90-d594c2cc.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay đứng trước danh từ để chỉ trạng thái chốt: final decision, final draft, final payment.', 'general business', 1, 27),
('c047b645-6d1c-512c-86e4-b30d8ab4b8eb', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '0f4e121c-c7ee-5358-a18e-b58ecb0d2c6a', '996d692f-2d50-5b17-aeef-c7f1cf07f0b9', 'install', '/ɪnˈstɔːl/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Cài đặt hoặc lắp ráp thiết bị, phần mềm vào vị trí sử dụng.', 'to put equipment or software into place so that it is ready for use.', 'Technicians will install updated security systems throughout the office tomorrow.', 'Các kỹ thuật viên sẽ cài đặt hệ thống bảo mật cập nhật khắp văn phòng vào ngày mai.', '{\"en\": \"Technicians will install the new security cameras in the main lobby tomorrow morning.\", \"vi\": \"Các kỹ thuật viên sẽ lắp đặt camera an ninh mới tại sảnh chính vào sáng mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-ljspeech-89fb511f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-cori-89fb511f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/install-1dc3a5f6.webp', '[\"set up\", \"mount\", \"fit\"]', '[\"uninstall\", \"remove\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"install software\", \"meaning\": \"cài đặt phần mềm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"install equipment\", \"meaning\": \"lắp đặt thiết bị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"instill\", \"note_vi\": \"instill là vun đắp, thấm nhuần (tư tưởng), install là cài đặt, lắp đặt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"installation\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"installer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-cori-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-aru0-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-aru5-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-aru6-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-aru10-89fb511f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-aru9-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-aru3-89fb511f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/install-aru7