('4936484c-92ab-581c-835c-085ba29d46b2', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '12eb5f45-55a0-5c4b-9444-ff9a864a3ed1', '420300a2-93e1-5993-b89a-659f198c7f88', 'juicy', '/ˈdʒuːsi/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Chứa nhiều nước, đặc biệt là trái cây hoặc thịt.', 'containing a lot of liquid, especially liquid from fruit or cooked meat.', 'These oranges are incredibly juicy and refreshing.', 'Những quả cam này cực kỳ mọng nước và sảng khoái.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel restaurant is famous for serving tender and juicy steak to its guests.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng của khách sạn nổi tiếng với việc phục vụ món bít tết mềm và nhiều nước cho khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-ljspeech-0287ef2d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-cori-0287ef2d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/juicy-272625c7.webp', '[\"succulent\", \"moist\"]', '[\"dry\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"juicy steak\", \"meaning\": \"bít tết nhiều nước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"juicy fruit\", \"meaning\": \"trái cây mọng nước\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"juice\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"juiciness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-cori-0287ef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-aru0-0287ef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-aru5-0287ef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-aru6-0287ef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-aru10-0287ef2d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-aru9-0287ef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-aru3-0287ef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-aru7-0287ef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-aru8-0287ef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-aru2-0287ef2d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-ljspeech-0287ef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-lt408-0287ef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-lt138-0287ef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-lt624-0287ef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-lt396-0287ef2d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-lt498-0287ef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-lt132-0287ef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-lt288-0287ef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-lt42-0287ef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/juicy-lt90-0287ef2d.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong văn nói, từ này còn có nghĩa lóng là thông tin thú vị, giật gân (juicy gossip).', 'dining', 1, 5),
('e2e772bf-f26b-5d71-903b-dea5aa164ce4', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '12eb5f45-55a0-5c4b-9444-ff9a864a3ed1', '420300a2-93e1-5993-b89a-659f198c7f88', 'perhaps', '/pəˈhæps/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Có thể, không chắc chắn.', 'indicates that a statement is not certain or definite.', 'Perhaps it will rain tomorrow, so we should bring an umbrella.', 'Có lẽ ngày mai trời sẽ mưa, vì vậy chúng ta nên mang theo ô.', '{\"en\": \"Perhaps we should reschedule the client meeting to next Monday morning.\", \"vi\": \"Có lẽ chúng ta nên dời cuộc họp khách hàng sang sáng thứ Hai tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perhaps-ljspeech-b81f4a81.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perhaps-cori-b81f4a81.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/perhaps-a5c4146a.webp', '[\"maybe\", \"possibly\"]', '[\"certainly\", \"definitely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"perhaps due to\", \"meaning\": \"có thể do\"}, {\"phrase\": \"perhaps the best\", \"meaning\": \"có lẽ tốt nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"perhaps not\", \"meaning\": \"có lẽ không\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"prospect\", \"note_vi\": \"prospect là triển vọng, dễ nhầm chính tả với perhaps\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perhaps-cori-b81f4a81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perhaps-aru0-b81f4a81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perhaps-aru5-b81f4a81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perhaps-aru6-b81f4a81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perhaps-aru10-b81f4a81.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perhaps-aru9-b81f4a81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perhaps-aru3-b81f4a81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perhaps-aru7-b81f4a81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perhaps-aru8-b81f4a81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perhaps-aru2-b81f4a81.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"n