('32953b88-f7b1-5ea7-8e00-e3654408a9ca', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '12eb5f45-55a0-5c4b-9444-ff9a864a3ed1', '420300a2-93e1-5993-b89a-659f198c7f88', 'maybe', '/ˈmeɪbi/', 'A1', 'adverb', 'Có thể, không chắc chắn nhưng có khả năng.', 'used when stating that a situation might happen or be true without certainty.', 'Maybe we should take a different route to avoid traffic.', 'Có lẽ chúng ta nên đi một con đường khác để tránh tắc đường.', '{\"en\": \"Maybe we should reschedule the client meeting if the manager cannot attend on time.\", \"vi\": \"Có lẽ chúng ta nên dời lịch họp khách hàng nếu quản lý không thể đến đúng giờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-ljspeech-f1b58e1d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-cori-f1b58e1d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/maybe-12b121fa.webp', '[\"perhaps\", \"possibly\"]', '[\"definitely\", \"certainly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"maybe not\", \"meaning\": \"có lẽ là không\"}, {\"phrase\": \"maybe so\", \"meaning\": \"có lẽ là vậy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"may be\", \"note_vi\": \"maybe là trạng từ, may be là cụm động từ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-cori-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru0-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru5-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru6-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru10-f1b58e1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru9-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru3-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru7-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru8-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru2-f1b58e1d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-ljspeech-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-lt408-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-lt138-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-lt624-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-lt396-f1b58e1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-lt498-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-lt132-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-lt288-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-lt42-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-lt90-f1b58e1d.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng viết dính liền \'may be\' (động từ) thành \'maybe\' (trạng từ).', 'daily', 1, 9),
('1b550793-79ca-55af-9d51-98f27964daa4', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '12eb5f45-55a0-5c4b-9444-ff9a864a3ed1', '420300a2-93e1-5993-b89a-659f198c7f88', 'consensus', '/kənˈsensəs/', 'C1', 'noun', 'sự nhất trí hoặc đồng ý chung của một nhóm người.', 'an opinion or decision that all members of a group agree with and accept.', 'After a long discussion, the team finally reached a consensus on the project\'s direction.', 'Sau một cuộc thảo luận dài, nhóm cuối cùng đã đạt được sự đồng thuận về hướng đi của dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The board members reached a consensus to increase the marketing budget for the next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Các thành viên hội đồng đã đạt được sự nhất trí về việc tăng ngân sách tiếp thị cho quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-ljspeech-4f170d6a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-cori-4f170d6a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/consensus-8fe3b82d.webp', '[\"agreement\", \"accord\"]', '[\"disagreement\", \"dissent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reach a consensus\", \"meaning\": \"đạt được sự nhất trí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"general consensus\", \"meaning\": \"sự đồng thuận chung\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"consent\", \"note_vi\": \"consent là sự cho phép, consensus là sự đồng thuận của nhóm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"consensual\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-cori-4f170d6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-aru0-4f170d6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-aru5-4f170d6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-aru6-4f170d6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-aru10-4f170d6a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-aru9-4f170d6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-aru3-4f170d6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-aru7-4f170d6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-aru8-4f170d6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-aru2-4f170d6a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-ljspeech-4f170d6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-lt408-4f170d6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-lt138-4f170d6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-lt624-4f170d6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-lt396-4f170d6a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-lt498-4f170d6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-lt132-4f170d6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-lt288-4f170d6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-lt42-4f170d6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consensus-lt90-4f170d6a.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này rất hay gặp trong các bài đọc TOEIC về họp hành và ra quyết định.', 'office', 1, 10),
('b9c75960-9b93-5b74-8daa-36cce7ae0393', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '12eb5f45-55a0-5c4b-9444-ff9a864a3ed1', '420300a2-93e1-5993-b89a-659f198c7f88', 'experience', '/ɪkˈspɪəriəns/', 'A2', 'noun', 'kiến thức hoặc kỹ năng có được qua thực tế.', 'knowledge or skill that you get from doing, seeing, or feeling things.', 'Her extensive experience in marketing made her the ideal candidate for the job.', 'Kinh nghiệm sâu rộng của cô ấy trong lĩnh vực marketing đã biến cô ấy thành ứng viên lý tưởng cho công việc.', '{\"en\": \"The job description requires candidates to have at least five years of experience.\", \"vi\": \"Mô tả công việc yêu cầu ứng viên phải có ít nhất năm năm kinh nghiệm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-ljspeech-f96da029.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-cori-f96da029.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/experience-33f448f8.webp', '[\"knowledge\", \"expertise\", \"background\"]', '[\"inexperience\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"gain experience\", \"meaning\": \"tích lũy kinh nghiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work experience\", \"meaning\": \"kinh nghiệm làm việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lack of experience\", \"meaning\": \"thiếu kinh nghiệm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"experiment\", \"note_vi\": \"là cuộc thí nghiệm khoa học, không phải kinh nghiệm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"experience\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"experienced\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-cori-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru0-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru5-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru6-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru10-f96da029.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru9-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub