('c3173eb5-39e9-5268-8147-32224d1b220b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '1a181924-4f6e-5f52-b74d-77d621f1cff3', '2f157a07-04dc-5aca-92ad-818e662e26b0', 'tight', '/taɪt/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Khít, bó sát, không lỏng lẻo.', 'fixed firmly in place or fitting very closely to the body without any extra space.', 'Make sure the lid is tight so the food doesn\'t spill.', 'Hãy đảm bảo nắp đậy chặt để thức ăn không bị đổ.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure the safety belt is tight enough to keep you secure during the flight.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo dây an toàn đủ chặt để giữ bạn cố định trong suốt chuyến bay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tight-ljspeech-98b9f356.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tight-cori-98b9f356.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tight-049adc86.webp', '[\"firm\", \"secure\"]', '[\"loose\", \"slack\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tight schedule\", \"meaning\": \"lịch trình dày đặc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tight budget\", \"meaning\": \"ngân sách hạn hẹp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tide\", \"note_vi\": \"Tide là thủy triều, phát âm khác với tight (kết thúc bằng âm t).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"tighten\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"tightly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tight-cori-98b9f356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tight-aru0-98b9f356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tight-aru5-98b9f356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tight-aru6-98b9f356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tight-aru10-98b9f356.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tight-aru9-98b9f356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tight-aru3-98b9f356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tight-aru7-98b9f356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tight-aru8-98b9f356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/