('f9982577-9b25-596d-8168-a03ea876d344', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '1ad28bf7-a913-54fa-a767-9da56b1fba4b', '60ec6ef0-21ee-5719-9bf4-b35d8a2be7bb', 'account', 'UK: /əˈkaʊntɪŋ/ | US: /əˈkaʊntɪŋ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'kế toán', 'a detailed record of financial transactions or money spent and received by a business.', 'She works in the accounting department.', 'Cô ấy làm việc ở phòng kế toán.', '{\"en\": \"The accounting firm is currently auditing all client accounts for the previous fiscal year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty kiểm toán hiện đang kiểm tra toàn bộ các tài khoản khách hàng trong năm tài chính trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-ljspeech-ca20728d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-cori-ca20728d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/account-6c06862a.webp', '[\"record\", \"ledger\", \"report\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take into account\", \"meaning\": \"tính đến, cân nhắc đến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bank account\", \"meaning\": \"tài khoản ngân hàng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"accountant\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"accountable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"accounting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-cori-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru0-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru5-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru6-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru10-ca20728d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru9-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru3-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru7-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru8-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru2-ca20728d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-ljspeech-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt408-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt138-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt624-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt396-ca20728d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt498-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt132-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt288-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt42-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt90-ca20728d.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý các cụm TOEIC quan trọng: \'take into account\' (cân nhắc đến), \'account balance\' (số dư tài khoản), \'client account\' (tài khoản khách hàng).', 'finance', 1, 25),
('6e1d7623-c904-5653-99a1-a17415004efb', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '1ad28bf7-a913-54fa-a767-9da56b1fba4b', '60ec6ef0-21ee-5719-9bf4-b35d8a2be7bb', 'stretch out', '/strɛtʃ aʊt/', 'A2', 'phrasal verb', 'Duỗi thẳng người ra, thường để thư giãn hoặc nghỉ ngơi.', 'extend one\'s body flat to rest or relax comfortably.', 'After a long day, he just wanted to stretch out on the couch.', 'Sau một ngày dài, anh ấy chỉ muốn nằm dài trên ghế sô pha.', '{\"en\": \"After the flight, she liked to stretch out on the hotel bed.\", \"vi\": \"Sau chuyến bay, cô ấy thích duỗi thẳng người trên giường khách sạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-ljspeech-a704973d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-cori-a704973d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stretch-out-b1264873.webp', '[\"lie down\", \"recline\"]', '[\"sit up\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stretch out on bed\", \"meaning\": \"duỗi thẳng người trên giường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stretch out legs\", \"meaning\": \"duỗi thẳng chân\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stretch over\", \"note_vi\": \"stretch over là trải dài, không phải duỗi thẳng người.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-cori-a704973d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-aru0-a704973d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-aru5-a704973d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-aru6-a704973d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-aru10-a704973d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-aru9-a704973d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-aru3-a704973d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-aru7-a704973d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-aru8-a704973d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-aru2-a704973d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-ljspeech-a704973d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-lt408-a704973d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-lt138-a704973d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-lt624-a704973d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-lt396-a704973d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-lt498-a704973d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-lt132-a704973d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-lt288-a704973d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-lt42-a704973d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stretch-out-lt90-a704973d.mp3\"]}}', 'Stretch out là duỗi người thư giãn, khác với stretch over (trải dài).', 'travel', 1, 26),
('94a1cbfb-e9e2-51af-82fa-5791d37f546b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '1ad28bf7-a913-54fa-a767-9da56b1fba4b', '60ec6ef0-21ee-5719-9bf4-b35d8a2be7bb', 'seldom', '/ˈseldəm/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Ít khi, không thường xuyên.', 'almost never or only on rare occasions in a given time.', 'We seldom see him since he moved to another city.', 'Chúng tôi ít khi gặp anh ấy kể từ khi anh ấy chuyển đến thành phố khác.', '{\"en\": \"Our regional manager seldom approves budget extensions without detailed financial reports from supervisors.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý khu vực của chúng tôi hiếm khi phê duyệt gia hạn ngân sách mà không có báo cáo tài chính chi tiết từ các giám sát viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seldom-ljspeech-74e023ef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seldom-cori-74e023ef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/seldom-3e1a808e.webp', '[\"rarely\", \"infrequently\"]', '[\"often\", \"frequently\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"seldom seen\", \"meaning\": \"hiếm khi thấy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seldom occur\", \"meaning\": \"hiếm khi xảy ra\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hardly\", \"note_vi\": \"hardly đi với ever (hardly ever) có nghĩa tương đương với seldom\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seldom-cori-74e023ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seldom-aru0-74e023ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seldom-aru5-74e023ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seldom-aru6-74e023ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seldom-aru10-74e023ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seldom-aru9-74e023ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seldom-aru3-74e023ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seldom-aru7-74e023ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seldom-aru8-74e023ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seldom-a