('8e3ee149-abd3-547c-a771-373c14b6ad15', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '2571624e-24cb-5e80-a7e0-6c2982b9059c', 'e2201365-7c4d-5f64-bca9-27a56c37b203', 'short-tempered', '/ˌʃɔːtˈtɛmpəd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Dễ nổi nóng, hay cáu gắt.', 'Tending to lose patience and show irritation rapidly without much provocation.', 'My boss is quite short-tempered, so I try to avoid bothering him in the mornings.', 'Sếp tôi khá nóng tính, nên tôi cố gắng tránh làm phiền ông ấy vào buổi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"The short-tempered manager upset several staff members during the budget review meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Vị quản lý hay cáu gắt đã làm khó chịu nhiều nhân viên trong cuộc họp xem xét ngân sách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-tempered-ljspeech-bef41f3b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-tempered-cori-bef41f3b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/short-tempered-f97ce4af.webp', '[\"irritable\", \"hot-tempered\", \"quick-tempered\"]', '[\"patient\", \"even-tempered\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"short-tempered person\", \"meaning\": \"người hay nổi nóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"become short-tempered\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên cáu kỉnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"short-tempered reaction\", \"meaning\": \"phản ứng nóng nảy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bad-tempered\", \"note_vi\": \"gần nghĩa nhưng bad-tempered chỉ trạng thái xấu tính nói chung, không nhấn mạnh tốc độ nổi giận\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"temper\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"temperament\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"temperamental\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-tempered-cori-bef41f3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-tempered-aru0-bef41f3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-tempered-aru5-bef41f3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/short-tempered-aru6-bef41f3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/