('ab18fdef-f953-57d0-b3b5-9d181e40e8d3', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '2571624e-24cb-5e80-a7e0-6c2982b9059c', 'e2201365-7c4d-5f64-bca9-27a56c37b203', 'possibly', '/ˈpɒsəbli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Có thể xảy ra, có khả năng.', 'used to say that something might exist, happen, or be true.', 'It\'s possibly going to rain later, so you should bring an umbrella.', 'Có lẽ lát nữa trời sẽ mưa, vì vậy bạn nên mang theo ô.', '{\"en\": \"The shipment could possibly be delayed due to the severe weather conditions at sea.\", \"vi\": \"Lô hàng có thể có khả năng bị trì hoãn do điều kiện thời tiết khắc nghiệt trên biển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possibly-ljspeech-f80adca8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possibly-cori-f80adca8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/possibly-d5607f78.webp', '[\"perhaps\", \"maybe\", \"potentially\"]', '[\"definitely\", \"certainly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"could possibly\", \"meaning\": \"có thể có khả năng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"quite possibly\", \"meaning\": \"rất có thể\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"possible\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"possibility\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possibly-cori-f80adca8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possibly-aru0-f80adca8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possibly-aru5-f80adca8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possibly-aru6-f80adca8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possibly-aru10-f80adca8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possibly-aru9-f80adca8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possibly-aru3-f80adca8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possibly-aru7-f80adca8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possibly-aru8-f80adca8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possibly-aru2-f80adca8.mp3\"]},