('d34d6e0f-68b4-5eb6-881c-024617d5be4b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '2571624e-24cb-5e80-a7e0-6c2982b9059c', 'e2201365-7c4d-5f64-bca9-27a56c37b203', 'belief', '/bɪˈliːf/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự tin tưởng vào một điều gì đó là đúng hoặc có thật.', 'a feeling that something is true, real, or exists.', 'Her strong belief in education led her to become a teacher.', 'Niềm tin mãnh liệt của cô ấy vào giáo dục đã khiến cô ấy trở thành một giáo viên.', '{\"en\": \"The manager expressed his firm belief that the new marketing strategy would succeed.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng bày tỏ niềm tin vững chắc rằng chiến lược tiếp thị mới sẽ thành công.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-ljspeech-4163f690.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-cori-4163f690.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/belief-16615124.webp', '[\"faith\", \"trust\", \"confidence\"]', '[\"disbelief\", \"doubt\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"firm belief\", \"meaning\": \"niềm tin vững chắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"contrary to popular belief\", \"meaning\": \"ngược lại với niềm tin phổ biến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"believe\", \"note_vi\": \"believe là động từ, belief là danh từ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"believe\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"believable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-cori-4163f690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-aru0-4163f690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-aru5-4163f690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-aru6-4163f690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-aru10-4163f690.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-aru9-4163f690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-aru3-4163f690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-aru7-4163f690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-aru8-4163f690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-aru2-4163f690.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-ljspeech-4163f690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-lt408-4163f690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-lt138-4163f690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-lt624-4163f690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-lt396-4163f690.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-lt498-4163f690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-lt132-4163f690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-lt288-4163f690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-lt42-4163f690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belief-lt90-4163f690.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý đuôi -f là danh từ, còn đuôi -ve (believe) là động từ.', 'office', 1, 27),
('be2fb778-5fff-51b2-8313-6fcbcbdc7d96', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '2571624e-24cb-5e80-a7e0-6c2982b9059c', 'e2201365-7c4d-5f64-bca9-27a56c37b203', 'relax', '/rɪˈlæks/', 'A2', 'verb', 'nghỉ ngơi, làm cho bản thân bớt căng thẳng', 'to rest and become free from tension or worry after effort.', 'It\'s important to relax and take a break from work sometimes.', 'Đôi khi, việc thư giãn và nghỉ ngơi sau công việc là rất quan trọng.', '{\"en\": \"Employees can relax in the lounge after the long client meeting ends.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên có thể thư giãn tại phòng chờ sau khi cuộc họp khách hàng kéo dài kết thúc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-ljspeech-63bb094c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-cori-63bb094c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/relax-cc2aa74b.webp', '[\"unwind\", \"rest\", \"de-stress\"]', '[\"tense\", \"stress\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"relax muscles\", \"meaning\": \"thư giãn cơ bắp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"relax rules\", \"meaning\": \"nới lỏng quy tắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"relax at home\", \"meaning\": \"nghỉ ngơi tại nhà\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"release\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa giải phóng, phát hành, dễ nhầm âm\"}, {\"word\": \"relay\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa tiếp truyền, khác chính tả\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"relaxation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"relaxed\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"relaxing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-cori-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru0-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru5-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru6-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru10-63bb094c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru9-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru3-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru7-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru8-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-aru2-63bb094c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-ljspeech-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt408-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt138-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt624-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt396-63bb094c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt498-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt132-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt288-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt42-63bb094c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relax-lt90-63bb094c.mp3\"]}}', 'Không nhầm với \'release\' (giải phóng) hay \'relay\' (tiếp sức).', 'office', 1, 28),
('5d5dab5f-aa0f-52cc-971c-45ada3f8dc31', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '2571624e-24cb-5e80-a7e0-6c2982b9059c', 'e2201365-7c4d-5f64-bca9-27a56c37b203', 'necessarily', '/ˌnesəˈserəli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Chắc chắn phải, không thể tránh khỏi.', 'used to say that something is not always true in every single case.', 'Working long hours does not necessarily guarantee better results for the project.', 'Làm việc nhiều giờ không nhất thiết đảm bảo kết quả tốt hơn cho dự án.', '{\"en\": \"Higher prices do not necessarily mean that the quality of the product is better.\", \"vi\": \"Giá cao hơn không nhất thiết có nghĩa là chất lượng sản phẩm tốt hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-ljspeech-d8e5f74e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-cori-d8e5f74e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/necessarily-0313683a.webp', '[\"inevitably\", \"certainly\"]', '[\"optionally\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"not necessarily\", \"meaning\": \"không nhất thiết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"necessarily true\", \"meaning\": \"chắc chắn đúng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"essentially\", \"note_vi\": \"Necessarily là chắc chắn, essentially là về cơ bản.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"necessary\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"necessity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-cori-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-aru0-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-aru5-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-aru6-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-aru10-d8e5f74e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-aru9-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-aru3-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-aru7-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-aru8-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-aru2-d8e5f74e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-ljspeech-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-lt408-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-lt138-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-lt624-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-lt396-d8e5f74e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-lt498-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-lt132-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-lt288-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-lt42-d8e5f74e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/necessarily-lt90-d8e5f74e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong cấu trúc phủ định \'not necessarily\' (không nhất thiết).', 'business', 1, 29)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('6eccd063-d802-5431-ae47-a54026a0d641', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'unresponsive', '/ˌʌnrɪˈspɒnsɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'không đáp lại, không có phản hồi', 'failing to answer or show reaction when expected to.', 'The technical support team resolved the issue after the server became completely unresponsive.', 'Đội hỗ trợ kỹ thuật đã giải quyết sự cố sau khi máy chủ trở nên hoàn toàn không phản ứng.', '{\"en\": \"The customer was unresponsive to our follow-up emails about the contract.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng không phản hồi các email theo dõi của chúng tôi về hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-ljspeech-11e3f0c0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-cori-11e3f0c0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unresponsive-d4a0671c.webp', '[\"nonresponsive\", \"apathetic\"]', '[\"responsive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unresponsive customer\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng không phản hồi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unresponsive system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống không phản hồi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unresponsive to\", \"meaning\": \"không phản ứng với\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"irresponsible\", \"note_vi\": \"irresponsible là vô trách nhiệm, khác unresponsive không phản hồi\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"respond\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"response\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-cori-11e3f0c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-aru0-11e3f0c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-aru5-11e3f0c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-aru6-11e3f0c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-aru10-11e3f0c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-aru9-11e3f0c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-aru3-11e3f0c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-aru7-11e3f0c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-aru8-11e3f0c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-aru2-11e3f0c0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-ljspeech-11e3f0c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-lt408-11e3f0c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-lt138-11e3f0c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-lt624-11e3f0c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-lt396-11e3f0c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-lt498-11e3f0c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-lt132-11e3f0c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-lt288-11e3f0c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-lt42-11e3f0c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unresponsive-lt90-11e3f0c0.mp3\"]}}', 'Unresponsive = không phản hồi, đừng nhầm với irresponsible (vô trách nhiệm).', 'business', 1, 0),
('ed295097-6b54-5d19-ac24-03d6a3ee1a47', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'occur', 'UK: /əˈkɜː/ | US: /əˈkɜːr/', 'B1', 'verb', 'xảy ra', 'To take place or happen as an event, situation, or process.', 'The meeting will occur on Tuesday morning.', 'Cuộc họp sẽ diễn ra vào sáng thứ Ba.', '{\"en\": \"Technical glitches may occur during the initial rollout of the updated software system.\", \"vi\": \"Các trục trặc kỹ thuật có thể xảy ra trong đợt triển khai ban đầu của hệ thống phần mềm cập nhật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-ljspeech-c40aa649.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-cori-c40aa649.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/occur-87b24e84.webp', '[\"happen\", \"take place\", \"arise\", \"transpire\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"occur naturally\", \"meaning\": \"xảy ra một cách tự nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"occur frequently\", \"meaning\": \"xảy ra thường xuyên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"it occurs to somebody\", \"meaning\": \"ai đó chợt nhận ra / nảy ra ý nghĩ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"incur\", \"note_vi\": \"occur là xảy ra, còn incur là gánh chịu (chi phí, tổn thất: incur costs).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"occurrence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-cori-c40aa649.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-aru0-c40aa649.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-aru5-c40aa649.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-aru6-c40aa649.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-aru10-c40aa649.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-aru9-c40aa649.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-aru3-c40aa649.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-aru7-c40aa649.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-aru8-c40aa649.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-aru2-c40aa649.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-ljspeech-c40aa649.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-lt408-c40aa649.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-lt138-c40aa649.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-lt624-c40aa649.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-lt396-c40aa649.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-lt498-c40aa649.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-lt132-c40aa649.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-lt288-c40aa649.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-lt42-c40aa649.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occur-lt90-c40aa649.mp3\"]}}', 'Là nội động từ (intransitive verb), KHÔNG dùng ở dạng bị động. Có cấu trúc \'it occurs to somebody that...\' (ai đó chợt nảy ra ý nghĩ).', 'technology', 1, 1),
('0c2ced99-aa4b-5fff-9e79-3ce58100d0e1', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'emotional quotient', '/ɪˈməʊʃənəl ˈkwəʊʃənt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Khả năng nhận biết, hiểu và quản lý cảm xúc của bản thân và người khác.', 'A metric measuring individual capacity to perceive, evaluate, and regulate personal and interpersonal affective states.', 'A high emotional quotient often leads to better interpersonal relationships and leadership skills.', 'Chỉ số cảm xúc cao thường dẫn đến các mối quan hệ giữa các cá nhân tốt hơn và kỹ năng lãnh đạo tốt hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The HR department values a high emotional quotient when recruiting new managers.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận nhân sự đánh giá cao chỉ số trí tuệ cảm xúc cao khi tuyển dụng quản lý mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-ljspeech-333ab385.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-cori-333ab385.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/emotional-quotient-e4b89c49.webp', '[\"emotional intelligence\", \"EQ\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"high emotional quotient\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ số trí tuệ cảm xúc cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"measure emotional quotient\", \"meaning\": \"đo lường chỉ số cảm xúc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intelligence quotient\", \"note_vi\": \"IQ là chỉ số thông minh logic, EQ là chỉ số cảm xúc.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-cori-333ab385.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-aru0-333ab385.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-aru5-333ab385.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-aru6-333ab385.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-aru10-333ab385.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-aru9-333ab385.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-aru3-333ab385.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-aru7-333ab385.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-aru8-333ab385.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-aru2-333ab385.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-ljspeech-333ab385.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-lt408-333ab385.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-lt138-333ab385.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-lt624-333ab385.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-lt396-333ab385.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-lt498-333ab385.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-lt132-333ab385.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-lt288-333ab385.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-lt42-333ab385.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emotional-quotient-lt90-333ab385.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường được viết tắt là EQ, phân biệt với IQ (intelligence quotient).', 'hr', 1, 2),
('e100e6db-7790-5630-ad05-bbfa03613673', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'lean', '/liːn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Phần thịt ít mỡ.', 'the portion of animal flesh containing minimal amounts of dietary fat.', 'For a healthier meal, choose lean cuts of meat.', 'Để có bữa ăn lành mạnh hơn, hãy chọn các phần thịt nạc.', '{\"en\": \"The chef ordered a large supply of lean from the local butcher for the banquet.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu bếp đã đặt một lượng lớn thịt nạc từ người bán thịt địa phương cho bữa tiệc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-ljspeech-8be47d2b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-cori-8be47d2b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lean-0a4f332c.webp', NULL, '[\"fat\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cut of lean\", \"meaning\": \"miếng thịt nạc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lean\", \"note_vi\": \"Động từ lean có nghĩa là nghiêng, tựa vào. (verb)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"lean\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"lean\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-cori-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru0-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru5-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru6-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru10-8be47d2b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru9-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru3-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru7-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru8-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru2-8be47d2b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-ljspeech-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-