('5cc8f66c-00cd-59d9-9a05-8e69aacb3a4c', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'contract', '/ˈkɒntrækt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Thỏa thuận pháp lý ràng buộc giữa hai hoặc nhiều bên.', 'an official binding deal executed in writing that establishes legal obligations among distinct parties.', 'The purchasing manager will review the vendor contract before finalizing the annual budget.', 'Trưởng phòng mua sắm sẽ xem xét hợp đồng với nhà cung cấp trước khi hoàn tất ngân sách hàng năm.', '{\"en\": \"Both parties must sign the employment contract before the start date of the project.\", \"vi\": \"Cả hai bên phải ký hợp đồng lao động trước ngày bắt đầu dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-ljspeech-d61ceadb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-cori-d61ceadb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/contract-5b6f755f.webp', '[\"agreement\", \"deal\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sign a contract\", \"meaning\": \"ký hợp đồng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"breach of contract\", \"meaning\": \"vi phạm hợp đồng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"contractual\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-cori-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-aru0-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-aru5-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-aru6-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-aru10-d61ceadb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-aru9-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-aru3-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-aru7-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-aru8-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-aru2-d61ceadb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-ljspeech-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-lt408-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-lt138-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-lt624-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-lt396-d61ceadb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-lt498-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-lt132-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-lt288-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-lt42-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-lt90-d61ceadb.mp3\"]}}', 'Trọng âm rơi vào âm tiết thứ hai khi là động từ.', 'law', 1, 4),
('3f825540-824a-5edc-8632-c7047bb1fe48', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'forceful', '/ˈfɔːsfl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có sức mạnh, đầy sức thuyết phục hoặc kiên quyết.', 'strong, confident, and able to persuade or influence others effectively.', 'The speaker delivered a forceful argument that convinced many in the audience.', 'Diễn giả đã đưa ra một lập luận mạnh mẽ làm thuyết phục nhiều người trong khán giả.', '{\"en\": \"Her forceful presentation persuaded the investors to fund the new project.\", \"vi\": \"Bài thuyết trình đầy thuyết phục của cô ấy đã thuyết phục các nhà đầu tư tài trợ cho dự án mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-ljspeech-4b6a2db7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-cori-4b6a2db7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/forceful-f629a104.webp', '[\"powerful\", \"assertive\", \"compelling\"]', '[\"weak\", \"timid\", \"feeble\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"forceful argument\", \"meaning\": \"lập luận mạnh mẽ, thuyết phục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"forceful personality\", \"meaning\": \"cá tính mạnh mẽ, quyết đoán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"forceful approach\", \"meaning\": \"cách tiếp cận kiên quyết\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"forcible\", \"note_vi\": \"forcible nghĩa là dùng vũ lực, forceful nghĩa là mạnh mẽ, thuyết phục\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"force\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"force\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"forcefully\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"forcefulness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-cori-4b6a2db7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-aru0-4b6a2db7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-aru5-4b6a2db7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-aru6-4b6a2db7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-aru10-4b6a2db7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-aru9-4b6a2db7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-aru3-4b6a2db7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-aru7-4b6a2db7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-aru8-4b6a2db7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-aru2-4b6a2db7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-ljspeech-4b6a2db7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-lt408-4b6a2db7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-lt138-4b6a2db7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-lt624-4b6a2db7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-lt396-4b6a2db7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-lt498-4b6a2db7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-lt132-4b6a2db7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-lt288-4b6a2db7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-lt42-4b6a2db7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forceful-lt90-4b6a2db7.mp3\"]}}', 'Forceful mang nghĩa tích cực (thuyết phục), khác forcible mang nghĩa tiêu cực (cưỡng bức).', 'office', 1, 5),
('a1e9c8ec-954e-5e6b-83d8-922ca7d0cdb7', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'socialize', '/ˈsəʊʃəlaɪz/', 'B1', 'verb', 'giao lưu, hòa nhập xã hội', 'to spend time meeting and talking with other people in a friendly and informal way.', 'It\'s important for children to socialize with others to develop good communication skills.', 'Điều quan trọng là trẻ em phải giao lưu với những người khác để phát triển kỹ năng giao tiếp tốt.', '{\"en\": \"The company held a team dinner to help new employees socialize with their colleagues.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty tổ chức bữa tối nhóm để giúp nhân viên mới giao lưu với đồng nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-ljspeech-af844ff9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-cori-af844ff9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/socialize-1a93438e.webp', '[\"mingle\", \"interact\", \"network\"]', '[\"isolate\", \"withdraw\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"socialize with colleagues\", \"meaning\": \"giao lưu với đồng nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"socialize at events\", \"meaning\": \"giao lưu tại các sự kiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"opportunity to socialize\", \"meaning\": \"cơ hội giao lưu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"network\", \"note_vi\": \"\'network\' thiên về xây dựng quan hệ chuyên nghiệp, \'socialize\' thiên về giao lưu thân thiện tự nhiên\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"social\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"socialization\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"socially\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-cori-af844ff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-aru0-af844ff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-aru5-af844ff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-aru6-af844ff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-aru10-af844ff9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-aru9-af844ff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-aru3-af844ff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-aru7-af844ff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-aru8-af844ff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-aru2-af844ff9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-ljspeech-af844ff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-lt408-af844ff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-lt138-af844ff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-lt624-af844ff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-lt396-af844ff9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-lt498-af844ff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-lt132-af844ff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-lt288-af844ff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-lt42-af844ff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/socialize-lt90-af844ff9.mp3\"]}}', '\'Socialize\' nhấn mạnh giao lưu xã hội tự nhiên, khác với \'network\' mang tính chuyên nghiệp hơn.', 'hr', 1, 6),
('3d511645-8f5a-5bf3-8723-b6692fe765cf', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'huge', '/hjuːdʒ/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Rất lớn về kích thước, số lượng hoặc mức độ.', 'extremely large in size, amount, or degree.', 'The new stadium can accommodate a huge crowd of spectators.', 'Sân vận động mới có thể chứa một lượng khán giả khổng lồ.', '{\"en\": \"The company faced a huge loss after the unexpected decline in global market demand.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty phải đối mặt với khoản lỗ khổng lồ sau sự sụt giảm bất ngờ của nhu cầu thị trường toàn cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/huge-ljspeech-f2104f95.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/huge-cori-f2104f95.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/huge-9b8bb8c3.webp', '[\"enormous\", \"vast\"]', '[\"tiny\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"huge amount\", \"meaning\": \"số lượng lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"huge success\", \"meaning\": \"thành công vang dội\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/huge-cori-f2104f95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/huge-aru0-f2104f95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/huge-aru5-f2104f95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/huge-aru6-f2104f95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/huge-aru10-f2104f95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/huge-aru9-f2104f95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/huge-aru3-f2104f95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/huge-aru7-f2104f95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/huge-aru8-f2104f95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/huge-aru2-f2104f95.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/huge-ljspeech-f2104f95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/huge-lt408-f2104f95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/o