('b87bab81-5baf-5c67-814e-662f11f03f0e', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'complaint', 'UK: /kəmˈpleɪnt/ | US: /kəmˈpleɪnt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'lời than phiền', 'a statement expressing unhappiness, grief, or dissatisfaction with something', 'We received a complaint about the late delivery.', 'Chúng tôi nhận được một lời than phiền về việc giao hàng trễ.', '{\"en\": \"Customer service handled the complaint promptly and offered a full refund.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận chăm sóc khách hàng đã xử lý khiếu nại nhanh chóng và đề nghị hoàn tiền đầy đủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-ljspeech-903571af.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-cori-903571af.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/complaint-8da5e2b0.webp', '[\"grievance\", \"objection\", \"protest\"]', '[\"compliment\", \"praise\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"file a complaint\", \"meaning\": \"nộp đơn khiếu nại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"handle complaints\", \"meaning\": \"xử lý các khiếu nại\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"complain\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-cori-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru0-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru5-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru6-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru10-903571af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru9-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru3-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru7-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru8-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru2-903571af.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-ljspeech-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt408-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt138-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt624-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt396-903571af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt498-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt132-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt288-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt42-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt90-903571af.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ đếm được. Các cụm từ kinh điển trong TOEIC: \'file a complaint\' (nộp đơn khiếu nại), \'handle complaints\' (xử lý khiếu nại).', 'customer service', 1, 12),
('47f31133-22f0-5bb8-acf2-dd139299bcd1', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'recycle', 'UK: /ˌriːˈsaɪkəld/ | US: /ˌriːˈsaɪkəld/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'tái chế', 'Describing materials or items that have been processed to be used again.', 'We use recycled materials to produce our new products.', 'Chúng tôi sử dụng vật liệu tái chế để sản xuất sản phẩm mới.', '{\"en\": \"The company policies mandate using recycle paper for all internal printouts and memos.\", \"vi\": \"Các quy định của công ty bắt buộc sử dụng giấy tái chế cho tất cả các bản in và thông báo nội bộ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-ljspeech-089f4e36.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-cori-089f4e36.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/recycle-5b7bb876.webp', '[\"reprocessed\", \"reclaimed\"]', '[\"discarded\", \"disposable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"recycle bin\", \"meaning\": \"thùng rác tái chế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"recycle paper\", \"meaning\": \"giấy tái chế\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"recyclable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"recycling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-cori-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru0-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru5-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru6-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru10-089f4e36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru9-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru3-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru7-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru8-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-aru2-089f4e36.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-ljspeech-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt408-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt138-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt624-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt396-089f4e36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt498-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt132-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt288-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt42-089f4e36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recycle-lt90-089f4e36.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài dạng động từ (tái chế), \'recycle\' còn hay xuất hiện như tính từ/bổ ngữ trong cụm \'recycle paper\' (giấy tái chế), \'recycle bin\' (thùng rác tái chế).', 'environment', 1, 13),
('acbea11b-f96a-5d50-bfad-70104e51bbda', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'rain', '/reɪn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Nước rơi từ mây xuống đất dưới dạng giọt.', 'Atmospheric moisture condensed into liquid drops that fall heavily toward the ground.', 'We had to cancel our picnic because of the heavy rain.', 'Chúng tôi phải hủy buổi dã ngoại vì trời mưa lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The outdoor corporate event was moved indoors due to the heavy rain forecast.\", \"vi\": \"Sự kiện ngoài trời của công ty đã được chuyển vào trong nhà do dự báo có mưa lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-ljspeech-fbec17cb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-cori-fbec17cb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rain-2d6a44e9.webp', '[\"rainfall\", \"precipitation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"heavy rain\", \"meaning\": \"mưa to\"}, {\"phrase\": \"acid rain\", \"meaning\": \"mưa axit\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"rainy\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"rain\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-cori-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru0-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru5-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru6-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru10-fbec17cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru9-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru3-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru7-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru8-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-aru2-fbec17cb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rain-ljspeech-fbec17cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publi