('3bc85d6b-6786-5dd2-9732-faf5fe0c9c05', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'ordinary', '/ˈɔːdnri/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Bình thường, không có gì đặc biệt hoặc khác lạ.', 'not special, different, or unusual in any way, but just like many other things.', 'It was just an ordinary Tuesday, but something extraordinary happened.', 'Đó chỉ là một ngày thứ Ba bình thường, nhưng một điều phi thường đã xảy ra.', '{\"en\": \"It was an ordinary business meeting until the director announced the new company expansion plan.\", \"vi\": \"Đó là một cuộc họp kinh doanh bình thường cho đến khi giám đốc công bố kế hoạch mở rộng công ty mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-ljspeech-eb9e4a90.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-cori-eb9e4a90.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ordinary-d23f87cc.webp', '[\"normal\", \"average\"]', '[\"extraordinary\", \"special\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ordinary day\", \"meaning\": \"ngày bình thường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ordinary person\", \"meaning\": \"người bình thường\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"ordinarily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-cori-eb9e4a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-aru0-eb9e4a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-aru5-eb9e4a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-aru6-eb9e4a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-aru10-eb9e4a90.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-aru9-eb9e4a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-aru3-eb9e4a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-aru7-eb9e4a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-aru8-eb9e4a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-aru2-eb9e4a90.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-ljspeech-eb9e4a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-lt408-eb9e4a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-lt138-eb9e4a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-lt624-eb9e4a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-lt396-eb9e4a90.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-lt498-eb9e4a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-lt132-eb9e4a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-lt288-eb9e4a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-lt42-eb9e4a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordinary-lt90-eb9e4a90.mp3\"]}}', 'Trái nghĩa với \'extraordinary\' (phi thường/đặc biệt).', 'daily', 1, 19),
('0245a254-f1a8-5c90-ab29-20310fa59728', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'handle', '/ˈhændl̩/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Giải quyết, đối phó với một tình huống hoặc vấn đề.', 'to deal with or take care of a situation, problem, or task.', 'She knows how to handle difficult customers with patience and skill.', 'Cô ấy biết cách xử lý những khách hàng khó tính một cách kiên nhẫn và khéo léo.', '{\"en\": \"The customer service manager will handle all complaints regarding the delayed shipments.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý dịch vụ khách hàng sẽ xử lý tất cả khiếu nại liên quan đến các lô hàng bị trễ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-ljspeech-a2dd7ec6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-cori-a2dd7ec6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/handle-4ca8225e.webp', '[\"manage\", \"tackle\"]', '[\"ignore\", \"neglect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"handle a complaint\", \"meaning\": \"xử lý khiếu nại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"handle pressure\", \"meaning\": \"chịu đựng áp lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"handle with care\", \"meaning\": \"xử lý cẩn thận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tackle\", \"note_vi\": \"tackle nhấn mạnh việc bắt tay vào giải quyết khó khăn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"handler\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"handle\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-cori-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru0-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru5-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru6-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru10-a2dd7ec6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru9-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru3-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru7-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru8-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-aru2-a2dd7ec6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-ljspeech-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-lt408-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-lt138-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-lt624-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-lt396-a2dd7ec6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-lt498-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-lt132-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-lt288-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-lt42-a2dd7ec6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handle-lt90-a2dd7ec6.mp3\"]}}', 'Handle có nghĩa là giải quyết công việc, ngoài ra làm danh từ nghĩa là tay cầm.', 'office', 1, 20),
('64ed0d2c-f052-5963-9e91-66b75d4ebfa6', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'evaluate', '/ɪˈvæljueɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'xem xét và phán đoán giá trị, chất lượng hoặc tầm quan trọng của cái gì đó.', 'to examine and determine the performance, standard, or worth of a specific item or situation.', 'The manager needs to evaluate the performance of all employees this quarter.', 'Người quản lý cần đánh giá hiệu suất của tất cả nhân viên trong quý này.', '{\"en\": \"The committee will evaluate the new marketing strategy before deciding to invest more capital into it.\", \"vi\": \"Ủy ban sẽ đánh giá chiến lược tiếp thị mới trước khi quyết định đầu tư thêm vốn vào đó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-ljspeech-3709214f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-cori-3709214f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/evaluate-586921b4.webp', '[\"assess\", \"appraise\"]', '[\"ignore\", \"neglect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"evaluate performance\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá hiệu suất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"carefully evaluate\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá cẩn thận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"estimate\", \"note_vi\": \"estimate là ước tính con số, evaluate là đánh giá chất lượng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"evaluation\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"evaluator\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-cori-3709214f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-aru0-3709214f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-aru5-3709214f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-aru6-3709214f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-aru10-3709214f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-aru9-3709214f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-aru3-3709214f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-aru7-3709214f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-aru8-3709214f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-aru2-3709214f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-ljspeech-3709214f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-lt408-3709214f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-lt138-3709214f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-lt624-3709214f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-lt396-3709214f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-lt498-3709214f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-lt132-3709214f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-lt288-3709214f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-lt42-3709214f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaluate-lt90-3709214f.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện trong các bài đánh giá nhân viên hoặc dự án.', 'business', 1, 21),
('ff5f041c-6365-5096-b8b9-f3eb7afb6ec7', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'torture', '/ˈtɔːtʃə(r)/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Hành hạ, gây đau đớn dữ dội về thể xác hoặc tinh thần.', 'to cause great physical or mental pain to someone, often to get information.', 'The prisoner claimed that he was tortured during his interrogation.', 'Tù nhân tuyên bố rằng anh ta đã bị tra tấn trong quá trình thẩm vấn.', '{\"en\": \"The long and boring presentation seemed to torture the employees in the meeting room.\", \"vi\": \"Bài thuyết trình dài và nhàm chán dường như tra tấn các nhân viên trong phòng họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-ljspeech-0734b72a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-cori-0734b72a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/torture-606f8835.webp', '[\"torment\", \"abuse\", \"persecute\"]', '[\"comfort\", \"soothe\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"torture someone mentally\", \"meaning\": \"tra tấn tinh thần ai đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be tortured by doubts\", \"meaning\": \"bị dày vò bởi những nghi ngờ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"torment\", \"note_vi\": \"torment thường nhấn mạnh sự dày vò tinh thần kéo dài\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"torture\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"torturous\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-cori-0734b72a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-aru0-0734b72a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-aru5-0734b72a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-aru6-0734b72a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-aru10-0734b72a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-aru9-0734b72a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-aru3-0734b72a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-aru7-0734b72a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-aru8-0734b72a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-aru2-0734b72a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-ljspeech-0734b72a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-lt408-0734b72a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-lt138-0734b72a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-lt624-0734b72a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-lt396-0734b72a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-lt498-0734b72a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-lt132-0734b72a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-lt288-0734b72a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-lt42-0734b72a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torture-lt90-0734b72a.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong công sở, từ này thường dùng ẩn dụ để chỉ sự mệt mỏi, chán nản tột cùng.', 'other', 1, 22),
('0fcd5edb-330a-540e-8f6a-507a7e92565d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'educate', '/ˈedʒukeɪt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Dạy dỗ, cung cấp kiến thức hoặc kỹ năng.', 'to provide knowledge or training to someone through a formal process of learning.', 'The human resources manager organized workshops to educate staff on new policies.', 'Trưởng phòng nhân sự đã tổ chức các buổi hội thảo để giáo dục nhân viên về các chính sách mới.', '{\"en\": \"Our company plans to educate employees on the latest software updates to improve overall productivity.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi dự định đào tạo nhân viên về các bản cập nhật phần mềm mới nhất để cải thiện năng suất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-ljspeech-a62a9670.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-cori-a62a9670.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/educate-8323f11f.webp', '[\"train\", \"instruct\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"educate staff\", \"meaning\": \"đào tạo nhân viên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"educate the public\", \"meaning\": \"giáo dục công chúng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"education\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"educational\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-cori-a62a9670.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-aru0-a62a9670.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-aru5-a62a9670.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-aru6-a62a9670.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-aru10-a62a9670.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-aru9-a62a9670.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-aru3-a62a9670.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-aru7-a62a9670.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-aru8-a62a9670.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-aru2-a62a9670.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-ljspeech-a62a9670.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-lt408-a62a9670.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-lt138-a62a9670.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-lt624-a62a9670.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-lt396-a62a9670.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-lt498-a62a9670.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-lt132-a62a9670.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-lt288-a62a9670.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-lt42-a62a9670.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/educate-lt90-a62a9670.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong bối cảnh đào tạo kỹ năng chuyên môn tại công sở.', 'education', 1, 23),
('48128f00-1588-5b9c-9b76-f01d93f0d727', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'ashamed', '/əˈʃeɪmd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy bẽ mặt hoặc hối hận vì điều gì đó đã làm.', 'feeling guilty or embarrassed about something one has done wrong.', 'He felt deeply ashamed of his behavior at the party last night.', 'Anh ấy cảm thấy vô cùng xấu hổ vì hành vi của mình tại bữa tiệc tối qua.', '{\"en\": \"She was ashamed after forgetting the client\'s name during the sales meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Cô ấy cảm thấy xấu hổ sau khi quên tên khách hàng trong cuộc họp bán hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ashamed-ljspeech-0f43c8dd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ashamed-cori-0f43c8dd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ashamed-ef14bd91.webp', '[\"guilty\", \"embarrassed\", \"remorseful\"]', '[\"proud\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ashamed of\", \"meaning\": \"xấu hổ về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel ashamed\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy hối lỗi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deeply ashamed\", \"meaning\": \"vô cùng hổ thẹn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"shameful\", \"note_vi\": \"shameful là đáng xấu hổ, ashamed là cảm thấy xấu hổ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"shame\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"shameful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ashamed-cori-0f43c8dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ashamed-aru0-0f43c8dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ashamed-aru5-0f43c8dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ashamed-aru6-0f43c8dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ashamed-aru10-0f43c8dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ashamed-aru9-0f43c8dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ashamed-aru3-0f43c8dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ashamed-aru7-0f43c8dd.mp3\", \"/