('db5648e8-21cd-5bcb-9197-d66de5977e59', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '28145f39-5dfb-5d51-bbab-491c37b72b44', 'f7fb80da-747f-5063-ad4f-c60ce0679bf9', 'theft', '/θeft/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hành vi lấy cắp tài sản của người khác một cách bất hợp pháp.', 'An illegal action involving stealing personal or corporate property from its rightful owner.', 'Strict security measures were introduced at the warehouse to prevent product theft.', 'Các biện pháp an ninh nghiêm ngặt đã được áp dụng tại kho hàng để ngăn chặn nạn trộm cắp sản phẩm.', '{\"en\": \"The security manager reported a theft of office equipment from the storage room last night.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý an ninh đã báo cáo về vụ mất trộm thiết bị văn phòng từ kho tối qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theft-ljspeech-3df6031b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theft-cori-3df6031b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/theft-78591831.webp', '[\"robbery\", \"stealing\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"commit a theft\", \"meaning\": \"phạm tội trộm cắp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prevent theft\", \"meaning\": \"ngăn chặn hành vi trộm cắp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"robbery\", \"note_vi\": \"robbery dùng cho cướp có bạo lực, theft là lấy trộm lén lút.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"thieve\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"thief\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theft-cori-3df6031b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theft-aru0-3df6031b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theft-aru5-3df6031b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theft-aru6-3df6031b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theft-aru10-3df6031b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theft-aru9-3df6031b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theft-aru3-3df6031b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theft-aru7-3df6031b.mp3\", \"/stor