('4d476e87-c534-567d-917d-c6347c27bae2', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '2aa91667-29fe-562c-9787-7b31622d202d', '9f08db32-1cb0-5a23-a7ff-eedef8cf952b', 'guide', '/ɡaɪd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người chỉ đường, người hướng dẫn một chuyến đi hoặc hoạt động.', 'a person whose job is to show a place to visitors or tourists.', 'The tour guide provided interesting facts about the ancient city.', 'Hướng dẫn viên du lịch đã cung cấp những thông tin thú vị về thành phố cổ.', '{\"en\": \"Our experienced guide will show you around the factory and explain the production process.\", \"vi\": \"Hướng dẫn viên giàu kinh nghiệm của chúng tôi sẽ đưa bạn đi tham quan nhà máy và giải thích quy trình sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-ljspeech-4956fadd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-cori-4956fadd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/guide-a1430ec6.webp', '[\"escort\", \"leader\", \"director\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tour guide\", \"meaning\": \"hướng dẫn viên du lịch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"travel guide\", \"meaning\": \"sách/người hướng dẫn du lịch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"step-by-step guide\", \"meaning\": \"hướng dẫn từng bước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"guy\", \"note_vi\": \"guy là chàng trai, guide là người hướng dẫn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"guide\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"guidance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-cori-4956fadd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-aru0-4956fadd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-aru5-4956fadd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-aru6-4956fadd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-aru10-4956fadd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-aru9-4956fadd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-aru3-4956fadd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-aru7-4956fadd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-aru8-4956fadd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-aru2-4956fadd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-ljspeech-4956fadd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-lt408-4956fadd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-lt138-4956fadd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-lt624-4956fadd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-lt396-4956fadd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-lt498-4956fadd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-lt132-4956fadd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-lt288-4956fadd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-lt42-4956fadd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/guide-lt90-4956fadd.mp3\"]}}', '\'Guide\' vừa là danh từ (người/sách hướng dẫn) vừa là động từ (hướng dẫn).', 'travel', 1, 3),
('6eb0f962-531a-5cd9-b2c5-756da801c9eb', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '2aa91667-29fe-562c-9787-7b31622d202d', '9f08db32-1cb0-5a23-a7ff-eedef8cf952b', 'originally', 'UK: /əˈrɪdʒɪnəli/ | US: /əˈrɪdʒənəli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'ban đầu', 'In the beginning or at the time when a situation first started.', 'She was originally hired as a junior assistant.', 'Cô ấy ban đầu được thuê làm trợ lý cấp dưới.', '{\"en\": \"The meeting was originally scheduled for Monday, but it has been moved to Wednesday.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc họp ban đầu được lên lịch vào thứ Hai, nhưng nó đã được dời sang thứ Tư.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-ljspeech-d18ff89a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-cori-d18ff89a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/originally-f61ad0ab.webp', '[\"initially\", \"at first\", \"in the beginning\"]', '[\"finally\", \"ultimately\", \"eventually\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"originally scheduled\", \"meaning\": \"ban đầu được lên lịch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"originally planned\", \"meaning\": \"dự định ban đầu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"origin\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"original\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"originate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-cori-d18ff89a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-aru0-d18ff89a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-aru5-d18ff89a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-aru6-d18ff89a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-aru10-d18ff89a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-aru9-d18ff89a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-aru3-d18ff89a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-aru7-d18ff89a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-aru8-d18ff89a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-aru2-d18ff89a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-ljspeech-d18ff89a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-lt408-d18ff89a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-lt138-d18ff89a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-lt624-d18ff89a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-lt396-d18ff89a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-lt498-d18ff89a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-lt132-d18ff89a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-lt288-d18ff89a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-lt42-d18ff89a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/originally-lt90-d18ff89a.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất hay đi kèm động từ bị động như \'originally scheduled\' (lúc đầu được lên lịch) để nói về sự thay đổi lịch trình.', 'office', 1, 4),
('cfa441dc-dc86-511c-8910-bc8277c1fa16', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '2aa91667-29fe-562c-9787-7b31622d202d', '9f08db32-1cb0-5a23-a7ff-eedef8cf952b', 'predictable', '/prɪˈdɪktəbl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'có thể biết trước hoặc đoán trước được.', 'happening or behaving in a way that you expect and not unusual or interesting.', 'The plot of the movie was so predictable that I knew the ending from the start.', 'Cốt truyện của bộ phim quá dễ đoán đến nỗi tôi đã biết kết thúc ngay từ đầu.', '{\"en\": \"The decline in retail sales was highly predictable due to the recent economic downturn.\", \"vi\": \"Sự sụt giảm trong doanh số bán lẻ là rất dễ đoán trước do suy thoái kinh tế gần đây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predictable-ljspeech-254ed7b8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predictable-cori-254ed7b8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/predictable-5ae465cf.webp', '[\"expected\", \"foreseeable\", \"anticipated\"]', '[\"unpredictable\", \"surprising\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly predictable\", \"meaning\": \"rất dễ đoán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"predictable outcome\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả có thể đoán trước\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"predict\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"prediction\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"predictably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predictable-cori-254ed7b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predictable-aru0-254ed7b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predictable-aru5-254ed7b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predictable-aru6-254ed7b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predictable-aru10-254ed7b8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predictable-aru9-254ed7b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predictable-aru3-254ed7b8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pre