('68523b1b-b6da-561d-8f0f-a6e8550236eb', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '2aa91667-29fe-562c-9787-7b31622d202d', '9f08db32-1cb0-5a23-a7ff-eedef8cf952b', 'in spite of', '', 'B1', 'preposition', 'mặc dù', 'Without being prevented or affected by a particular factor, condition, or obstacle.', 'In spite of the rain, we enjoyed the picnic.', 'Mặc dù trời mưa, chúng tôi vẫn thích buổi dã ngoại.', '{\"en\": \"In spite of the severe weather, the outdoor promotional event went ahead as scheduled.\", \"vi\": \"Mặc dù thời tiết xấu, sự kiện quảng bá ngoài trời vẫn diễn ra theo đúng kế hoạch.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-ljspeech-fbb11912.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-cori-fbb11912.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/in-spite-of-cec33a6b.webp', '[\"despite\", \"regardless of\", \"notwithstanding\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"in spite of the fact that\", \"meaning\": \"mặc dù thực tế là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in spite of oneself\", \"meaning\": \"trái với ý muốn / không kìm được\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"despite\", \"note_vi\": \"Cách dùng tương tự nhưng \'despite\' đi trực tiếp với danh từ, không có giới từ \'of\'.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-cori-fbb11912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-aru0-fbb11912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-aru5-fbb11912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-aru6-fbb11912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-aru10-fbb11912.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-aru9-fbb11912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-aru3-fbb11912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-aru7-fbb11912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-aru8-fbb11912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-aru2-fbb11912.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-ljspeech-fbb11912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-lt408-fbb11912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-lt138-fbb11912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-lt624-fbb11912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-lt396-fbb11912.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-lt498-fbb11912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-lt132-fbb11912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-lt288-fbb11912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-lt42-fbb11912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-spite-of-lt90-fbb11912.mp3\"]}}', 'Theo sau \'in spite of\' là danh từ, V-ing hoặc cụm danh từ (hoặc \'the fact that + S + V\'). Không dùng \'in spite of + S + V\'.', 'general business', 1, 7),
('6b529373-a288-5ee5-9ef3-74c77d5d63a8', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '2aa91667-29fe-562c-9787-7b31622d202d', '9f08db32-1cb0-5a23-a7ff-eedef8cf952b', 'dessert', '/dɪˈzɜːt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Món ăn ngọt được dùng sau bữa chính.', 'a sweet food that is served at the end of a main meal.', 'For dessert, we had a delicious chocolate cake.', 'Món tráng miệng của chúng tôi là một chiếc bánh sô cô la rất ngon.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant offers a complimentary chocolate cake as a dessert for all dinner guests.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng phục vụ món bánh sô-cô-la miễn phí làm món tráng miệng cho tất cả thực khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-ljspeech-f5194be9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-cori-f5194be9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dessert-a63f44c9.webp', '[\"sweet\", \"pudding\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have dessert\", \"meaning\": \"ăn món tráng miệng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dessert menu\", \"meaning\": \"thực đơn món tráng miệng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"desert\", \"note_vi\": \"Desert (danh từ) là sa mạc, (động từ) là bỏ rơi.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-cori-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru0-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru5-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru6-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru10-f5194be9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru9-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru3-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru7-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru8-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru2-f5194be9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati