('c4587617-fd1a-58d8-8c0d-7e1165531425', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '2aa91667-29fe-562c-9787-7b31622d202d', '9f08db32-1cb0-5a23-a7ff-eedef8cf952b', 'mop', 'UK: /mɒp/ | US: /mɑp/', 'B1', 'verb', 'lau (sàn)', 'To clean or wash a floor using a bundle of absorbent material.', 'She decided to mop the kitchen floor.', 'Cô ấy quyết định lau sàn bếp.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance staff mops the main lobby floor every evening after office hours.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo trì lau sàn sảnh chính vào mỗi tối sau giờ làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-ljspeech-e428b54c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-cori-e428b54c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mop-cbbe70b3.webp', '[\"wipe\", \"clean\", \"swab\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"mop the floor\", \"meaning\": \"lau sàn nhà\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mop up a spill\", \"meaning\": \"lau sạch vết nước tràn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"map\", \"note_vi\": \"bản đồ / lập bản đồ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mop\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-cori-e428b54c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-aru0-e428b54c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-aru5-e428b54c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-aru6-e428b54c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-aru10-e428b54c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-aru9-e428b54c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-aru3-e428b54c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-aru7-e428b54c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-aru8-e428b54c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-aru2-e428b54c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-ljspeech-e428b54c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mop-lt408-e428b54c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub