('8289637c-08b6-50b4-87fe-fdda779fe8ae', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3b3d989f-8cca-501e-b52e-28011ad32d61', '2e09ac97-0a71-5f58-a443-b5990b9f3f67', 'clip', '/klɪp/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một đoạn ngắn được cắt ra từ phim, nhạc, video hoặc bài viết.', 'a short part of a film, video, or television program that is shown by itself.', 'We watched a short clip from the new movie trailer.', 'Chúng tôi đã xem một đoạn trích ngắn từ đoạn giới thiệu phim mới.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team showed a short video clip of the new product during the presentation.\", \"vi\": \"Đội tiếp thị đã chiếu một đoạn video ngắn về sản phẩm mới trong buổi thuyết trình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-ljspeech-e3a93fa8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-cori-e3a93fa8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clip-967b789e.webp', '[\"excerpt\", \"extract\", \"snippet\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"video clip\", \"meaning\": \"đoạn video\"}, {\"phrase\": \"audio clip\", \"meaning\": \"đoạn âm thanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"click\", \"note_vi\": \"click là tiếng lách cách hoặc cú nhấp chuột.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"clip\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-cori-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru0-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru5-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru6-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru10-e3a93fa8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru9-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru3-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru7-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru8-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-aru2-e3a93fa8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-ljspeech-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-lt408-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-lt138-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-lt624-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-lt396-e3a93fa8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-lt498-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-lt132-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-lt288-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-lt42-e3a93fa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clip-lt90-e3a93fa8.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm \'clip\' (đoạn phim/kẹp) với \'click\' (nhấp chuột).', 'marketing', 1, 12),
('1d5df831-df5c-5b94-9f11-3ecbfc1c6cf2', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3b3d989f-8cca-501e-b52e-28011ad32d61', '2e09ac97-0a71-5f58-a443-b5990b9f3f67', 'drowse', '/draʊz/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Ở trong trạng thái buồn ngủ, lơ mơ.', 'to be in a light sleep or to feel very sleepy and ready to sleep.', 'The warm afternoon sun made me drowse off during the lecture.', 'Nắng chiều ấm áp khiến tôi ngủ gà gật trong giờ giảng.', '{\"en\": \"The long and boring presentation caused several employees to drowse in the conference room.\", \"vi\": \"Bài thuyết trình dài và nhàm chán đã khiến một số nhân viên ngủ gật trong phòng họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drowse-ljspeech-ce6f813c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drowse-cori-ce6f813c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/drowse-82d36599.webp', '[\"doze\", \"nap\", \"snooze\"]', '[\"wake\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"drowse off\", \"meaning\": \"ngủ gật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"drowse in the sun\", \"meaning\": \"ngủ lơ mơ dưới nắng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"drowsy\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"drowsiness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drowse-cori-ce6f813c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drowse-aru0-ce6f813c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drowse-aru5-ce6f813c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drowse-aru6-ce6f813c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drowse-aru10-ce6f813c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drowse-aru9-ce6f813c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drowse-aru3-ce6f813c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drowse-aru7-ce6f813c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drowse-aru8-ce6f813c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drowse-aru2-ce6f813c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunci