('d7853373-4233-50b7-a16d-4f214d446db3', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3b3d989f-8cca-501e-b52e-28011ad32d61', '2e09ac97-0a71-5f58-a443-b5990b9f3f67', 'uprising', '/ˈʌpraɪzɪŋ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một hành động chống lại chính quyền hoặc quyền lực.', 'an act of opposition by a group of people against a government or leader.', 'The government quickly suppressed the uprising in the northern provinces.', 'Chính phủ đã nhanh chóng đàn áp cuộc nổi dậy ở các tỉnh phía bắc.', '{\"en\": \"The military movement caused a sudden uprising that disrupted local trading activities.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc binh biến đã gây ra một cuộc nổi dậy đột ngột làm gián đoạn các hoạt động thương mại địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-ljspeech-ffce1882.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-cori-ffce1882.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/uprising-04c233c0.webp', '[\"rebellion\", \"revolt\", \"insurrection\"]', '[\"submission\", \"surrender\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"armed uprising\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc nổi dậy vũ trang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stage an uprising\", \"meaning\": \"nổ ra cuộc nổi dậy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"surprise\", \"note_vi\": \"surprise là sự ngạc nhiên, khác với uprising là cuộc nổi dậy\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"uprise\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-cori-ffce1882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-aru0-ffce1882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-aru5-ffce1882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-aru6-ffce1882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-aru10-ffce1882.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-aru9-ffce1882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-aru3-ffce1882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-aru7-ffce1882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-aru8-ffce1882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-aru2-ffce1882.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-ljspeech-ffce1882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-lt408-ffce1882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-lt138-ffce1882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-lt624-ffce1882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-lt396-ffce1882.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-lt498-ffce1882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-lt132-ffce1882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-lt288-ffce1882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-lt42-ffce1882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uprising-lt90-ffce1882.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để chỉ các cuộc nổi dậy, khởi nghĩa chống lại chính quyền.', 'other', 1, 19),
('c22b5ac8-0928-5f07-be6e-63788d50f089', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3b3d989f-8cca-501e-b52e-28011ad32d61', '2e09ac97-0a71-5f58-a443-b5990b9f3f67', 'seem', 'UK: /siːm/ | US: /sim/', 'A2', 'verb', 'có vẻ như', 'To give the impression of possessing a particular quality or being in a specific state.', 'The new policy seems to be effective.', 'Chính sách mới có vẻ hiệu quả.', '{\"en\": \"The new software update seems to have resolved the system connectivity issues.\", \"vi\": \"Bản cập nhật phần mềm mới có vẻ như đã giải quyết được các sự cố kết nối hệ thống.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-ljspeech-72f15b25.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-cori-72f15b25.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/seem-752c1260.webp', '[\"appear\", \"look\", \"sound\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"seem to be\", \"meaning\": \"dường như là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"it seems that\", \"meaning\": \"có vẻ như là\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"seeming\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"seemingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-cori-72f15b25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-aru0-72f15b25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-aru5-72f15b25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-aru6-72f15b25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-aru10-72f15b25.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-aru9-72f15b25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-aru3-72f15b25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-aru7-72f15b25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-aru8-72f15b25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-aru2-72f15b25.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-ljspeech-72f15b25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-lt408-72f15b25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-lt138-72f15b25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-lt624-72f15b25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-lt396-72f15b25.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-lt498-72f15b25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-lt132-72f15b25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-lt288-72f15b25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-lt42-72f15b25.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seem-lt90-72f15b25.mp3\"]}}', 'Là động từ nối (linking verb), theo sau bởi tính từ (seem happy) hoặc to-V (seem to be). Không dùng ở các thì tiếp diễn.', 'office', 1, 20),
('9d71e489-db59-59f0-9972-80e8e21e8902', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3b3d989f-8cca-501e-b52e-28011ad32d61', '2e09ac97-0a71-5f58-a443-b5990b9f3f67', 'serious', '/ˈsɪəriəs/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'trang trọng, không đùa cợt; quan trọng, cần được chú ý.', 'thinking carefully about things and not laughing, or needing deep thought and attention.', 'She gave him a serious look, indicating that she wasn\'t joking.', 'Cô ấy nhìn anh một cách nghiêm túc, ra hiệu rằng cô ấy không đùa.', '{\"en\": \"The manager called a meeting to discuss a serious budget deficit in the marketing department.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng đã triệu tập một cuộc họp để thảo luận về tình trạng thâm hụt ngân sách nghiêm trọng ở bộ phận tiếp thị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-ljspeech-2b334818.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-cori-2b334818.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/serious-b7644c2e.webp', '[\"grave\", \"solemn\", \"severe\"]', '[\"frivolous\", \"playful\", \"minor\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"serious problem\", \"meaning\": \"vấn đề nghiêm trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"serious consideration\", \"meaning\": \"sự cân nhắc nghiêm túc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"seriously\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"seriousness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-cori-2b334818.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-aru0-2b334818.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-aru5-2b334818.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-aru6-2b334818.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-aru10-2b334818.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-aru9-2b334818.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-aru3-2b334818.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-aru7-2b334818.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-aru8-2b334818.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-aru2-2b334818.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-ljspeech-2b334818.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-lt408-2b334818.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-lt138-2b334818.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-lt624-2b334818.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-lt396-2b334818.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-lt498-2b334818.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-lt132-2b334818.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-lt288-2b334818.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-lt42-2b334818.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serious-lt90-2b334818.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này vừa có nghĩa là nghiêm túc (thái độ) vừa là nghiêm trọng (tính chất sự việc).', 'office', 1, 21),
('8781dbc9-6c3e-537a-bb07-7ee023127313', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3b3d989f-8cca-501e-b52e-28011ad32d61', '2e09ac97-0a71-5f58-a443-b5990b9f3f67', 'construction', '/kənˈstrʌkʃən/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Quá trình hoặc hoạt động xây dựng một công trình.', 'the work of building something such as a house, bridge, or large office building.', 'The new building is still under construction and will be finished next year.', 'Tòa nhà mới vẫn đang trong quá trình xây dựng và sẽ hoàn thành vào năm tới.', '{\"en\": \"The construction of the new warehouse will begin as soon as the permits are approved.\", \"vi\": \"Việc xây dựng nhà kho mới sẽ bắt đầu ngay khi các giấy phép được phê duyệt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-ljspeech-535ae678.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-cori-535ae678.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/construction-7ca1d5db.webp', '[\"building\", \"development\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"under construction\", \"meaning\": \"đang trong quá trình xây dựng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"construction site\", \"meaning\": \"công trường xây dựng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"construct\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-cori-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru0-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru5-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru6-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru10-535ae678.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru9-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru3-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru7-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru8-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru2-535ae678.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-ljspeech-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt408-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt138-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt624-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt396-535ae678.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt498-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt132-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt288-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt42-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt90-535ae678.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'under construction\' rất phổ biến trong đề thi TOEIC.', 'housing', 1, 22),
('b50ae1eb-25de-5d1e-ab3e-cfc0c9aaef85', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3b3d989f-8cca-501e-b52e-28011ad32d61', '2e09ac97-0a71-5f58-a443-b5990b9f3f67', 'trim', '/trɪm/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Cắt tỉa hoặc làm gọn bớt.', 'To remove excess material or edges from an object to improve its appearance.', 'She asked the hairdresser to just trim the ends of her hair.', 'Cô ấy yêu cầu thợ làm tóc chỉ cắt tỉa phần ngọn tóc.', '{\"en\": \"The manager asked the staff to trim the budget for the upcoming marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý yêu cầu nhân viên cắt giảm ngân sách cho chiến dịch tiếp thị sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-ljspeech-7ab4b0a8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-cori-7ab4b0a8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trim-09f7b28b.webp', '[\"cut\", \"prune\", \"crop\"]', '[\"extend\", \"lengthen\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"trim the budget\", \"meaning\": \"cắt giảm ngân sách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"trim the hedges\", \"meaning\": \"cắt tỉa hàng rào\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"slim\", \"note_vi\": \"slim là mảnh khảnh, trim là cắt tỉa hoặc thon gọn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"trim\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"trimmer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-cori-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru0-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru5-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru6-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru10-7ab4b0a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru9-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru3-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru7-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru8-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru2-7ab4b0a8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-ljspeech-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt408-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt138-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt624-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt396-7ab4b0a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt498-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt132-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt288-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt42-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt90-7ab4b0a8.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'trim\' thường đi với \'budget\' nghĩa là cắt giảm ngân sách.', 'business', 1, 23),
('1646b445-d4b0-5244-96d1-2e1f978c8ecc', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3b3d989f-8cca-501e-b52e-28011ad32d61', '2e09ac97-0a71-5f58-a443-b5990b9f3f67', 'prosperous', '/ˈprɒspərəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Giàu có, thành công, phát triển tốt.', 'having a lot of money and being very successful in business or personal life.', 'The city has become more prosperous thanks to new investments and tourism.', 'Thành phố đã trở nên thịnh vượng hơn nhờ các khoản đầu tư và du lịch mới.', '{\"en\": \"The company has become a prosperous business by expanding into several international markets this year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã trở thành một doanh nghiệp thịnh vượng bằng cách mở rộng sang nhiều thị trường quốc tế trong năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prosperous-ljspeech-db9a7e4c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prosperous-cori-db9a7e4c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prosperous-f858e975.webp', '[\"wealthy\", \"thriving\"]', '[\"poor\", \"failing\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"prosperous future\", \"meaning\": \"tương lai thịnh vượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prosperous economy\", \"meaning\": \"nền kinh tế phát triển\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"generous\", \"note_vi\": \"generous là hào phóng, prosperous là giàu có, phát đạt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"prosper\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"prosperity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prosperous-cori-db9a7e4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prosperous-aru0-db9a7e4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prosperous-aru5-db9a7e4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prosperous-aru6-db9a7e4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prosperous-aru10-db9a7e4c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prosperous-aru9-db9a7e4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prosperous-aru3-db9a7e4c.mp3\", \"/stora