('3a32d451-1441-58a1-9042-028516f7213d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3b3d989f-8cca-501e-b52e-28011ad32d61', '2e09ac97-0a71-5f58-a443-b5990b9f3f67', 'costume', 'UK: /ˈkɒstjuːm/ | US: /ˈkɑːstuːm/', 'B1', 'noun', 'trang phục, y phục', 'clothes worn by actors or performer groups to portray a particular character or era', 'Actors wore colorful costumes for the play.', 'Các diễn viên mặc trang phục sặc sỡ cho vở kịch.', '{\"en\": \"The theater group hired a designer to create historical costumes for the play.\", \"vi\": \"Đoàn kịch đã thuê một nhà thiết kế để tạo ra các trang phục lịch sử cho vở diễn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-ljspeech-d55c6418.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-cori-d55c6418.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/costume-e730f1bb.webp', '[\"outfit\", \"attire\", \"garment\", \"disguise\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"costume party\", \"meaning\": \"tiệc hóa trang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stage costume\", \"meaning\": \"trang phục sân khấu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"custom\", \"note_vi\": \"phong tục, tập quán\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"costumier\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-cori-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru0-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru5-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru6-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru10-d55c6418.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru9-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru3-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru7-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru8-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru2-d55c6418.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-ljspeech-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt408-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt138-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt624-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt396-d55c6418.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt498-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt132-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt288-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt42-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt90-d55c6418.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'costume\' (trang phục biểu diễn/hóa trang) với \'custom\' (tập quán, phong tục).', 'entertainment', 1, 29),
('a92dab50-9ae7-57b4-ad98-4dc34ebd4b42', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3c8a45cd-6754-5eb1-baf8-caa1f49c9ef1', '6f167af3-4d6f-58af-91d6-6dea02aa75a3', 'knowledge', 'UK: /ˈnɒlɪdʒ/ | US: /ˈnɑlɪdʒ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'kiến thức', 'Information, skills, and understanding that a person acquires through experience, education, or study.', 'Deep knowledge of the product is essential for this role.', 'Kiến thức sâu sắc về sản phẩm là cần thiết cho vai trò này.', '{\"en\": \"The workshop aims to expand employees\' practical knowledge of digital marketing.\", \"vi\": \"Hội thảo nhằm mở rộng kiến thức thực tế của nhân viên về tiếp thị kỹ thuật số.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-ljspeech-cce245fb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-cori-cce245fb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/knowledge-48fb9d1f.webp', '[\"understanding\", \"expertise\", \"awareness\"]', '[\"ignorance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"gain knowledge\", \"meaning\": \"tích lũy kiến thức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extensive knowledge\", \"meaning\": \"kiến thức sâu rộng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"experience\", \"note_vi\": \"Experience là kinh nghiệm thực tế làm việc, còn knowledge là tri thức/thông tin tiếp thu được.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"know\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"knowledgeable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"knowledgeably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-cori-cce245fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-aru0-cce245fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-aru5-cce245fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-aru6-cce245fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-aru10-cce245fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-aru9-cce245fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-aru3-cce245fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-aru7-cce245fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-aru8-cce245fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-aru2-cce245fb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-ljspeech-cce245fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-lt408-cce245fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-lt138-cce245fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-lt624-cce245fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-lt396-cce245fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-lt498-cce245fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-lt132-cce245fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-lt288-cce245fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-lt42-cce245fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/knowledge-lt90-cce245fb.mp3\"]}}', '\'Knowledge\' là danh từ không đếm được. Cụm hay gặp trong TOEIC: \'acquire knowledge\' (tích lũy kiến thức).', 'personnel', 1, 0),
('0f80abef-53b8-5065-af79-4075a9ea1c60', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3c8a45cd-6754-5eb1-baf8-caa1f49c9ef1', '6f167af3-4d6f-58af-91d6-6dea02aa75a3', 'expensive', '/ɪkˈspensɪv/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Có giá cao, tốn nhiều tiền để mua.', 'costing a lot of money and requiring significant financial resources to buy or maintain.', 'Buying a house in the city center can be very expensive.', 'Mua một căn nhà ở trung tâm thành phố có thể rất đắt đỏ.', '{\"en\": \"Upgrading the office software proved to be too expensive for our current quarterly budget.\", \"vi\": \"Việc nâng cấp phần mềm văn phòng tỏ ra quá đắt đỏ so với ngân sách hàng quý hiện tại của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-ljspeech-e0d587ce.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-cori-e0d587ce.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/expensive-5f43d5bf.webp', '[\"costly\", \"pricey\"]', '[\"cheap\", \"affordable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"expensive equipment\", \"meaning\": \"thiết bị đắt tiền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extremely expensive\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ đắt đỏ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"valuable\", \"note_vi\": \"valuable là có giá trị cao, expensive là giá bán cao.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"expense\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"expensively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-cori-e0d587ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-aru0-e0d587ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-aru5-e0d587ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-aru6-e0d587ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-aru10-e0d587ce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-aru9-e0d587ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-aru3-e0d587ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expensive-aru7-e0d587ce.mp3\", \"/s