('8393a09a-3b96-5002-b695-48cadeedb82b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3c8a45cd-6754-5eb1-baf8-caa1f49c9ef1', '6f167af3-4d6f-58af-91d6-6dea02aa75a3', 'printer', '/ˈprɪntə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị dùng để in văn bản hoặc hình ảnh ra giấy.', 'a machine that is connected to a computer and produces text or images on paper.', 'My old printer ran out of ink, so I need to buy a new cartridge.', 'Máy in cũ của tôi hết mực rồi, nên tôi cần mua một hộp mực mới.', '{\"en\": \"We need to purchase a new office printer because the old one keeps jamming.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi cần mua một máy in văn phòng mới vì chiếc máy cũ liên tục bị kẹt giấy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-ljspeech-3d3221b2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-cori-3d3221b2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/printer-64603864.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"laser printer\", \"meaning\": \"máy in laser\"}, {\"phrase\": \"printer cartridge\", \"meaning\": \"hộp mực máy in\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"print\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"printable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-cori-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru0-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru5-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru6-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru10-3d3221b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru9-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru3-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru7-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru8-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-aru2-3d3221b2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-ljspeech-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-lt408-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-lt138-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-lt624-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-lt396-3d3221b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-lt498-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-lt132-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-lt288-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-lt42-3d3221b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/printer-lt90-3d3221b2.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể chỉ máy in (thiết bị) hoặc thợ in (người).', 'office', 1, 7),
('f44d6d83-278b-508f-ae85-29228420577a', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3c8a45cd-6754-5eb1-baf8-caa1f49c9ef1', '6f167af3-4d6f-58af-91d6-6dea02aa75a3', 'natural', '/ˈnætʃrəl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về tự nhiên, không do con người tạo ra.', 'existing in or caused by the physical world, not made by humans.', 'We spent the day exploring the beautiful natural landscape of the park.', 'Chúng tôi đã dành cả ngày để khám phá cảnh quan thiên nhiên tươi đẹp của công viên.', '{\"en\": \"The company uses only natural ingredients in its new line of organic cosmetics.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chỉ sử dụng các thành phần tự nhiên trong dòng mỹ phẩm hữu cơ mới của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-ljspeech-11e60b0e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-cori-11e60b0e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/natural-9d90316b.webp', '[\"organic\", \"native\", \"wild\"]', '[\"artificial\", \"synthetic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"natural resources\", \"meaning\": \"tài nguyên thiên nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"natural disaster\", \"meaning\": \"thiên tai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"nature\", \"note_vi\": \"nature là danh từ (tự nhiên), natural là tính từ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"nature\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"naturally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-cori-11e60b0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-aru0-11e60b0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-aru5-11e60b0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-aru6-11e60b0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-aru10-11e60b0e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-aru9-11e60b0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-aru3-11e60b0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-aru7-11e60b0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publ