('4cc7b5c1-ff54-56cd-9114-9d59db917d3e', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3d4b0c1e-59ee-5507-89fe-8f7af0966854', '475c5858-44f0-5a8d-9d67-d86645186834', 'steal', '/stiːl/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Lấy trộm tài sản của người khác mà không được phép.', 'To unlawfully remove another person\'s property without their consent or knowledge.', 'Someone tried to steal my bicycle yesterday, but luckily they failed.', 'Ai đó đã cố gắng trộm xe đạp của tôi hôm qua, nhưng may mắn là họ đã không thành công.', '{\"en\": \"Security cameras were installed to prevent shoplifters who try to steal merchandise.\", \"vi\": \"Camera an ninh đã được lắp đặt để ngăn chặn những kẻ trộm cố gắng ăn cắp hàng hóa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steal-ljspeech-b07df62b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steal-cori-b07df62b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/steal-69e0fe34.webp', '[\"rob\", \"thieve\", \"pilfer\"]', '[\"give\", \"return\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"steal money\", \"meaning\": \"ăn trộm tiền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"steal ideas\", \"meaning\": \"ăn cắp ý tưởng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"steel\", \"note_vi\": \"thép (danh từ), phát âm giống nhưng viết khác\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stealth\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steal-cori-b07df62b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steal-aru0-b07df62b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steal-aru5-b07df62b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steal-aru6-b07df62b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steal-aru10-b07df62b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steal-aru9-b07df62b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steal-aru3-b07df62b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steal-aru7-b07df62b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steal-aru8-b07df62b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun