('9aa0eed2-1359-5f69-9987-5a0cd0fc7451', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3d4b0c1e-59ee-5507-89fe-8f7af0966854', '475c5858-44f0-5a8d-9d67-d86645186834', 'feeble', '/ˈfiːbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Yếu ớt, không có sức lực.', 'lacking physical strength or energy, often due to illness or age.', 'After the long illness, he felt too feeble to stand for long.', 'Sau trận ốm dài, anh ấy cảm thấy quá yếu ớt để đứng lâu.', '{\"en\": \"The old computer system made a feeble attempt to process the large data files.\", \"vi\": \"Hệ thống máy tính cũ đã nỗ lực yếu ớt để xử lý các tệp dữ liệu lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feeble-ljspeech-302e5ed7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feeble-cori-302e5ed7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/feeble-53fe9370.webp', '[\"weak\", \"frail\"]', '[\"strong\", \"powerful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feeble attempt\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực yếu ớt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feeble signal\", \"meaning\": \"tín hiệu yếu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"feebly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feeble-cori-302e5ed7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feeble-aru0-302e5ed7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feeble-aru5-302e5ed7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feeble-aru6-302e5ed7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feeble-aru10-302e5ed7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feeble-aru9-302e5ed7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feeble-aru3-302e5ed7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feeble-aru7-302e5ed7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feeble-aru8-302e5ed7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feeble-aru2-302e5ed7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feeble-ljspeech-302e5ed7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunci