('6ac548a3-5895-5b06-b629-67a7a425c80c', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3d4b0c1e-59ee-5507-89fe-8f7af0966854', '475c5858-44f0-5a8d-9d67-d86645186834', 'jury', '/ˈdʒʊəri/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một nhóm người dân được chọn để đưa ra phán quyết trong phiên tòa.', 'a group of citizens chosen to give a verdict in a court of law.', 'The jury will decide if the defendant is guilty or innocent.', 'Bồi thẩm đoàn sẽ quyết định bị cáo có tội hay vô tội.', '{\"en\": \"The jury received the case file after the closing arguments yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Bồi thẩm đoàn đã nhận hồ sơ vụ án sau các tranh luận bác bỏ hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-ljspeech-c7d663b6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-cori-c7d663b6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/jury-9fb69b1e.webp', '[\"panel\", \"tribunal\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"serve on a jury\", \"meaning\": \"phục vụ trong bồi thẩm đoàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"jury verdict\", \"meaning\": \"phán quyết bồi thẩm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"journey\", \"note_vi\": \"journey là hành trình, jury là bồi thẩm đoàn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"juror\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-cori-c7d663b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-aru0-c7d663b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-aru5-c7d663b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-aru6-c7d663b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-aru10-c7d663b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-aru9-c7d663b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-aru3-c7d663b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-aru7-c7d663b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-aru8-c7d663b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-aru2-c7d663b6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-ljspeech-c7d663b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-lt408-c7d663b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-lt138-c7d663b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-lt624-c7d663b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-lt396-c7d663b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-lt498-c7d663b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-lt132-c7d663b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-lt288-c7d663b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-lt42-c7d663b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jury-lt90-c7d663b6.mp3\"]}}', 'Jury chỉ nhóm bồi thẩm; juror là thành viên trong đó.', 'law', 1, 22),
('a704a93c-b145-51f8-a6be-4cf286090a4a', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3d4b0c1e-59ee-5507-89fe-8f7af0966854', '475c5858-44f0-5a8d-9d67-d86645186834', 'eat out', '/iːt aʊt/', 'A1', 'phrasal verb', 'Ăn ở nhà hàng hoặc quán ăn thay vì ở nhà.', 'to have a meal in a restaurant rather than at home.', 'We often eat out on weekends when we don\'t feel like cooking.', 'Chúng tôi thường ăn ngoài vào cuối tuần khi không muốn nấu ăn.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing department decided to eat out at a nearby Italian restaurant to celebrate their success.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận tiếp thị đã quyết định đi ăn ngoài tại một nhà hàng Ý gần đó để ăn mừng thành công của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eat-out-ljspeech-43ba39a7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eat-out-cori-43ba39a7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eat-out-acb84367.webp', '[\"dine out\"]', '[\"eat in\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"eat out regularly\", \"meaning\": \"thường xuyên đi ăn ngoài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"afford to eat out\", \"meaning\": \"có đủ tiền để đi ăn ngoài\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eat-out-cori-43ba39a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eat-out-aru0-43ba39a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eat-out-aru5-43ba39a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eat-out-aru6-43ba39a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eat-out-aru10-43ba39a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eat-out-aru9-43ba39a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eat-out-aru3-43ba39a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eat-out-aru7-43ba39a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eat-out-aru8-43ba39a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eat-out-aru2-43ba39a7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eat-out-ljspeech-43