('a5e12a92-9b3b-5568-ab96-8883d96a4ab0', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3ef6bf7f-fdfa-511f-ae12-c4a4c5d92c59', '6c57a716-a589-53a9-aace-8e7b43e68147', 'tackle', '/ˈtækl/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Giải quyết, xử lý một vấn đề khó khăn.', 'to deal with or try to solve a difficult problem or situation.', 'The new management team plans to tackle the rising production costs immediately.', 'Ban quản lý mới dự định giải quyết chi phí sản xuất đang tăng lên ngay lập tức.', '{\"en\": \"The team met on Monday to tackle the delays in the product delivery schedule.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm đã họp vào thứ Hai để giải quyết tình trạng chậm trễ trong lịch giao hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-ljspeech-93d42315.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-cori-93d42315.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tackle-b9e41069.webp', '[\"address\", \"handle\", \"deal with\"]', '[\"avoid\", \"ignore\", \"neglect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tackle a problem\", \"meaning\": \"giải quyết một vấn đề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tackle an issue\", \"meaning\": \"xử lý một vấn đề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tackle head-on\", \"meaning\": \"đối mặt trực tiếp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"attack\", \"note_vi\": \"attack mang nghĩa tấn công hung hăng, tackle mang nghĩa xử lý có chủ đích\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-cori-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru0-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru5-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru6-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru10-93d42315.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru9-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru3-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru7-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru8-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru2-93d42315.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-ljspeech-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt408-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt138-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt624-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt396-93d42315.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt498-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt132-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt288-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt42-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt90-93d42315.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'tackle\' thường xuất hiện với \'problem\', \'issue\', \'challenge\' trong bối cảnh họp hành.', 'office', 1, 13),
('5b14da17-410f-5904-a4c3-a3ea50c1f8ac', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3ef6bf7f-fdfa-511f-ae12-c4a4c5d92c59', '6c57a716-a589-53a9-aace-8e7b43e68147', 'uninstall', '/ˌʌnɪnˈstɔːl/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Xóa bỏ một chương trình phần mềm khỏi máy tính.', 'to remove a piece of software or program from a computer system.', 'The IT specialist advised me to uninstall the outdated application to boost system efficiency.', 'Chuyên gia CNTT đã khuyên tôi gỡ cài đặt ứng dụng lỗi thời để tăng hiệu suất hệ thống.', '{\"en\": \"The IT technician will uninstall the outdated software from all office computers today.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên CNTT sẽ gỡ cài đặt phần mềm cũ khỏi tất cả máy tính văn phòng hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-ljspeech-84bbfdf0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-cori-84bbfdf0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/uninstall-d15547f1.webp', '[\"remove\", \"delete\"]', '[\"install\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"uninstall software\", \"meaning\": \"gỡ cài đặt phần mềm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"uninstall an app\", \"meaning\": \"gỡ cài đặt ứng dụng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"delete\", \"note_vi\": \"Delete là xóa tệp/dữ liệu, uninstall là gỡ bỏ hoàn toàn một phần mềm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"install\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"installation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-cori-84bbfdf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-aru0-84bbfdf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-aru5-84bbfdf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-aru6-84bbfdf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-aru10-84bbfdf0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-aru9-84bbfdf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-aru3-84bbfdf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-aru7-84bbfdf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-aru8-84bbfdf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-aru2-84bbfdf0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-ljspeech-84bbfdf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-lt408-84bbfdf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-lt138-84bbfdf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-lt624-84bbfdf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-lt396-84bbfdf0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-lt498-84bbfdf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-lt132-84bbfdf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-lt288-84bbfdf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-lt42-84bbfdf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninstall-lt90-84bbfdf0.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này ghép tiền tố un- (ngược lại) với install (cài đặt).', 'technology', 1, 14),
('043558ea-1448-523f-bc1d-eb69d73efd34', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3ef6bf7f-fdfa-511f-ae12-c4a4c5d92c59', '6c57a716-a589-53a9-aace-8e7b43e68147', 'symmetry', '/ˈsɪmətri/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự cân đối hoàn hảo về hình dáng, kích thước giữa các phần.', 'the quality of having two sides that are exactly the same in shape and size.', 'The artist used perfect symmetry in her design.', 'Người nghệ sĩ đã sử dụng sự đối xứng hoàn hảo trong thiết kế của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The architect emphasized the symmetry of the building to create a balanced and professional appearance.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư nhấn mạnh sự cân đối của tòa nhà để tạo ra vẻ ngoài cân bằng và chuyên nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetry-ljspeech-18e1be4e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetry-cori-18e1be4e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/symmetry-46c1cf84.webp', '[\"balance\", \"proportion\"]', '[\"asymmetry\", \"imbalance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"perfect symmetry\", \"meaning\": \"sự cân đối hoàn hảo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bilateral symmetry\", \"meaning\": \"đối xứng hai bên\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"symmetrical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetry-cori-18e1be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetry-aru0-18e1be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetry-aru5-18e1be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetry-aru6-18e1be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetry-aru10-18e1be4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetry-aru9-18e1be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetry-aru3-18e1be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetry-aru7-18e1be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetry-aru8-18e1be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetr