('8ef8d332-046d-56e6-bfdf-d6969afb05b6', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3ef6bf7f-fdfa-511f-ae12-c4a4c5d92c59', '6c57a716-a589-53a9-aace-8e7b43e68147', 'spill', 'UK: /spɪl/ | US: /spɪl/', 'B1', 'verb', 'làm đổ, tràn', 'To cause a liquid or substance to flow out of a container accidentally.', 'Be careful not to spill your drink.', 'Hãy cẩn thận đừng làm đổ đồ uống của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"A technician was dispatched immediately after coffee was spilled onto the conference room printer.\", \"vi\": \"Một kỹ thuật viên đã được cử đến ngay lập tức sau khi cà phê bị đổ lên máy in trong phòng họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-ljspeech-c97bf254.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-cori-c97bf254.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spill-37547d0b.webp', '[\"leak\", \"overflow\", \"slosh\"]', '[\"contain\", \"gather\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"chemical spill\", \"meaning\": \"sự cố rò rỉ/đổ hóa chất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spill over\", \"meaning\": \"tràn ra ngoài\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"split\", \"note_vi\": \"Chia rẽ hoặc tách ra, khác với làm đổ chất lỏng (spill).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"spill\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"spillage\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-cori-c97bf254.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-aru0-c97bf254.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-aru5-c97bf254.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-aru6-c97bf254.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-aru10-c97bf254.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-aru9-c97bf254.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-aru3-c97bf254.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-aru7-c97bf254.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-aru8-c97bf254.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-aru2-c97bf254.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-ljspeech-c97bf254.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-lt408-c97bf254.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-lt138-c97bf254.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-lt624-c97bf254.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-lt396-c97bf254.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-lt498-c97bf254.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-lt132-c97bf254.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-lt288-c97bf254.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-lt42-c97bf254.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spill-lt90-c97bf254.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay đi với cấu trúc \'spill over\' (tràn ra ngoài) hoặc \'spill something on/onto\' (làm đổ cái gì lên bề mặt).', 'office', 1, 17),
('a0f47ad9-def9-53bd-8ea7-04218c08cb24', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3ef6bf7f-fdfa-511f-ae12-c4a4c5d92c59', '6c57a716-a589-53a9-aace-8e7b43e68147', 'in advance', 'UK: /ɪn ədˈvɑːns/ | US: /ɪn ædˈvæns/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'trước, sớm', 'Before a particular time, event, or expected date in the future.', 'Please book your tickets in advance to avoid disappointment.', 'Xin hãy đặt vé trước để tránh thất vọng.', '{\"en\": \"Participants are requested to register for the seminar at least two weeks in advance.\", \"vi\": \"Người tham gia được yêu cầu đăng ký hội thảo trước ít nhất hai tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-ljspeech-dd027479.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-cori-dd027479.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/in-advance-adcca05a.webp', '[\"ahead of time\", \"beforehand\", \"prior to\"]', '[\"afterward\", \"belatedly\", \"at the last minute\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pay in advance\", \"meaning\": \"thanh toán trước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"book in advance\", \"meaning\": \"đặt chỗ trước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"well in advance\", \"meaning\": \"từ rất sớm trước đó\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"advance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"advanced\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-cori-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru0-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru5-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru6-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru10-dd027479.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru9-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru3-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru7-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru8-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru2-dd027479.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-ljspeech-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-lt408-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-lt138-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-lt624-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-lt396-dd027479.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-lt498-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-lt132-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-lt288-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-lt42-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-lt90-dd027479.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đứng sau động từ: pay in advance (thanh toán trước), book in advance (đặt trước), notify in advance (thông báo trước).', 'travel', 1, 18),
('9461a722-ca9d-5eac-9ea6-7a0904814c48', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3ef6bf7f-fdfa-511f-ae12-c4a4c5d92c59', '6c57a716-a589-53a9-aace-8e7b43e68147', 'involve', 'UK: /ɪnˈvɒlvd/ | US: /ɪnˈvɑːlvd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'liên quan', 'Connected with or taking part in a particular activity, event, or project.', 'Several departments were involved in this project.', 'Một số phòng ban đã tham gia vào dự án này.', '{\"en\": \"All team members involved in the marketing campaign will meet in Conference Room B.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả các thành viên liên quan đến chiến dịch tiếp thị sẽ họp tại Phòng họp B.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-ljspeech-968d77ca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-cori-968d77ca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/involve-d45b31c0.webp', '[\"associated\", \"connected\", \"engaged\", \"concerned\"]', '[\"unrelated\", \"detached\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be involved in\", \"meaning\": \"tham gia/liên quan đến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get involved with\", \"meaning\": \"dính dấp/dính líu tới\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"evolve\", \"note_vi\": \"evolve có nghĩa là phát triển, tiến hóa, không phải liên quan\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"involve\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"involvement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-cori-968d77ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-aru0-968d77ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-aru5-968d77ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-aru6-968d77ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-aru10-968d77ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-aru9-968d77ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-aru3-968d77ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-aru7-968d77ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-aru8-968d77ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-aru2-968d77ca.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-ljspeech-968d77ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-lt408-968d77ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-lt138-968d77ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-lt624-968d77ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-lt396-968d77ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-lt498-968d77ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-lt132-968d77ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-lt288-968d77ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-lt42-968d77ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involve-lt90-968d77ca.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm hay gặp trong TOEIC: \'be involved in\' (tham gia vào, liên quan tới công việc/dự án nào đó).', 'office', 1, 19),
('6713b2dd-e2f6-5297-bd3b-b03cd3e06faa', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3ef6bf7f-fdfa-511f-ae12-c4a4c5d92c59', '6c57a716-a589-53a9-aace-8e7b43e68147', 'connect', '/kəˈnekt/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Nối hoặc liên kết hai hoặc nhiều thứ lại với nhau.', 'To establish a physical, electronic, or logical link between distinct objects or systems.', 'Can you connect this printer to my laptop?', 'Bạn có thể nối máy in này vào máy tính xách tay của tôi không?', '{\"en\": \"Please connect the projector to the main computer before the presentation begins.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng kết nối máy chiếu với máy tính chính trước khi buổi thuyết trình bắt đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-ljspeech-f11a107f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-cori-f11a107f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/connect-0929b430.webp', '[\"link\", \"attach\"]', '[\"disconnect\", \"separate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"connect to\", \"meaning\": \"kết nối với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"connect with\", \"meaning\": \"kết nối với (người/mạng lưới)\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"connection\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"connector\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-cori-f11a107f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-aru0-f11a107f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-aru5-f11a107f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-aru6-f11a107f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-aru10-f11a107f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-aru9-f11a107f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-aru3-f11a107f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-aru7-f11a107f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-aru8-f11a107f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-aru2-f11a107f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-ljspeech-f11a107f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-lt408-f11a107f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-lt138-f11a107f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-lt624-f11a107f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-lt396-f11a107f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-lt498-f11a107f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-lt132-f11a107f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-lt288-f11a107f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-lt42-f11a107f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connect-lt90-f11a107f.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất phổ biến trong các bài thi TOEIC về thiết bị văn phòng và IT.', 'technology', 1, 20),
('a4e0091f-199f-5405-a51c-2559b6832068', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3ef6bf7f-fdfa-511f-ae12-c4a4c5d92c59', '6c57a716-a589-53a9-aace-8e7b43e68147', 'love', '/lʌv/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Có tình cảm sâu sắc, yêu thương ai đó hoặc rất thích cái gì đó.', 'to experience intense warm attachment toward an individual or passion for an activity.', 'I truly love spending time with my family and friends on weekends.', 'Tôi thực sự thích dành thời gian với gia đình và bạn bè vào cuối tuần.', '{\"en\": \"Customers love our new mobile application because it is very easy to navigate.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng rất thích ứng dụng di động mới của chúng tôi vì nó rất dễ sử dụng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-ljspeech-9f2feb0f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-cori-9f2feb0f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/love-45392e91.webp', '[\"adore\", \"cherish\", \"like\"]', '[\"hate\", \"detest\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"love to do something\", \"meaning\": \"rất thích làm việc gì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"love\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"lovely\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"lovable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-cori-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru0-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru5-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru6-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru10-9f2feb0f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru9-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru3-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru7-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru8-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-aru2-9f2feb0f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-ljspeech-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-lt408-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-lt138-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-lt624-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-lt396-9f2feb0f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-lt498-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-lt132-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-lt288-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-lt42-9f2feb0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/love-lt90-9f2feb0f.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong văn cảnh công sở, hãy dùng \'like\' hoặc \'enjoy\' thay vì \'love\' để giữ tính chuyên nghiệp.', 'marketing', 1, 21),
('f910d0ac-63ba-5078-995f-e3aeca177d75', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3ef6bf7f-fdfa-511f-ae12-c4a4c5d92c59', '6c57a716-a589-53a9-aace-8e7b43e68147', 'resistance', '/rɪˈzɪstəns/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc khả năng chống lại, phản đối.', 'the act of opposing something or the ability to fight against it.', 'The staff showed considerable resistance when the director proposed changing their working hours.', 'Các nhân viên đã thể hiện sự phản đối đáng kể khi giám đốc đề xuất thay đổi giờ làm việc của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The workers showed resistance to the new scheduling system introduced by management.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân đã phản đối hệ thống lên lịch mới do ban quản lý đưa ra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-ljspeech-181efea9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-cori-181efea9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/resistance-9dd1f552.webp', '[\"opposition\", \"defiance\", \"protest\"]', '[\"acceptance\", \"compliance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strong resistance\", \"meaning\": \"sự phản đối mạnh mẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"meet resistance\", \"meaning\": \"gặp phải sự kháng cự\"}, {\"phrase\": \"resistance group\", \"meaning\": \"nhóm kháng chiến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"assistance\", \"note_vi\": \"resistance là kháng cự, assistance là sự giúp đỡ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"resist\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"resistant\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-cori-181efea9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-aru0-181efea9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-aru5-181efea9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-aru6-181efea9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-aru10-181efea9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-aru9-181efea9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-aru3-181efea9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-aru7-181efea9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-aru8-181efea9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-aru2-181efea9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-ljspeech-181efea9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-lt408-181efea9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-lt138-181efea9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-lt624-181efea9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-lt396-181efea9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-lt498-181efea9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-lt132-181efea9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-lt288-181efea9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-lt42-181efea9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resistance-lt90-181efea9.mp3\"]}}', 'Không nhầm với assistance (giúp đỡ); resistance là chống lại.', 'business', 1, 22),
('efe1a70f-27cb-5b6a-80ba-3037464edecb', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3ef6bf7f-fdfa-511f-ae12-c4a4c5d92c59', '6c57a716-a589-53a9-aace-8e7b43e68147', 'reserve', '/rɪˈzɜːv/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Khu vực được bảo vệ để giữ gìn động vật, thực vật.', 'an area of land where animals and plants are protected by law.', 'We visited a nature reserve where many rare birds live.', 'Chúng tôi đã ghé thăm một khu bảo tồn thiên nhiên nơi nhiều loài chim quý hiếm sinh sống.', '{\"en\": \"The company donated funds to expand the local nature reserve near the new factory site.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã quyên góp quỹ để mở rộng khu bảo tồn thiên nhiên địa phương gần địa điểm nhà máy mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-ljspeech-5bac43c0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-cori-5bac43c0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reserve-548f17ad.webp', '[\"sanctuary\", \"preserve\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"nature reserve\", \"meaning\": \"khu bảo tồn thiên nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wildlife reserve\", \"meaning\": \"khu bảo tồn động vật hoang dã\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reserve\", \"note_vi\": \"Reservation thường dùng cho việc đặt chỗ (nhà hàng, khách sạn).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"reserve\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-cori-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru0-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru5-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru6-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru10-5bac43c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru9-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru3-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru7-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru8-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru2-5bac43c0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-ljspeech-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt408-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt138-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt624-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt396-5bac43c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt498-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt132-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt288-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt42-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt90-5bac43c0.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa khác của \'reserve\' là đặt chỗ hoặc dự trữ.', 'nature', 1, 23),
('27e3cf5c-be90-5611-a799-a01c812cbdd3', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3ef6bf7f-fdfa-511f-ae12-c4a4c5d92c59', '6c57a716-a589-53a9-aace-8e7b43e68147', 'trivial', '/ˈtrɪviəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không quan trọng, nhỏ nhặt, không đáng kể.', 'something that has very little value and does not need much of your time or attention.', 'Don\'t worry about such trivial matters; focus on what\'s truly important.', 'Đừng lo lắng về những chuyện nhỏ nhặt như vậy; hãy tập trung vào điều thực sự quan trọng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager asked us to ignore trivial errors and focus on the main project goals.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý yêu cầu chúng tôi bỏ qua những lỗi nhỏ nhặt và tập trung vào các mục tiêu chính của dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trivial-ljspeech-f2fc8123.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trivial-cori-f2fc8123.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trivial-e23bdf13.webp', '[\"minor\", \"insignificant\"]', '[\"important\", \"significant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"trivial matter\", \"meaning\": \"vấn đề nhỏ nhặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"trivial pursuit\", \"meaning\": \"trò chơi đố vui kiến thức\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"trivially\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trivial-cori-f2fc8123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trivial-aru0-f2fc8123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trivial-aru5-f2fc8123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trivial-aru6-f2fc8123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trivial-aru10-f2fc8123.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trivial-aru9-f2fc8123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trivial-aru3-f2fc8123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trivial-aru7-f2fc8123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trivial-aru8-f2fc8123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pro