('051036ab-7748-548a-9504-c87417c0de52', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '3ef6bf7f-fdfa-511f-ae12-c4a4c5d92c59', '6c57a716-a589-53a9-aace-8e7b43e68147', 'rise', '/raɪz/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Tăng lên, mọc lên.', 'To ascend to a higher altitude or expand in quantity or degree.', 'Fuel prices continue to rise rapidly during the summer holiday season.', 'Giá nhiên liệu tiếp tục tăng nhanh trong suốt mùa nghỉ lễ hè.', '{\"en\": \"The company expects the demand for its new software to rise significantly next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty kỳ vọng nhu cầu cho phần mềm mới của họ sẽ tăng đáng kể vào quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-ljspeech-e5edb94e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-cori-e5edb94e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rise-d3cf6e83.webp', '[\"increase\", \"climb\"]', '[\"fall\", \"decrease\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rise in price\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng giá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rise sharply\", \"meaning\": \"tăng mạnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"raise\", \"note_vi\": \"raise là ngoại động từ (cần tân ngữ), rise là nội động từ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rise\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"rising\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-cori-e5edb94e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru0-e5edb94e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru5-e5edb94e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru6-e5edb94e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru10-e5edb94e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru9-e5edb94e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru3-e5edb94e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru7-e5edb94e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru8-e5edb94e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-aru2-e5edb94e.mp3\"]}, \"us\"