('adbb1f15-0383-5319-b841-5232fde2e9fb', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '41b11418-3030-54e9-b95c-69a1d0cf8612', 'b2ce7d72-3145-5253-9893-f5191b3dc7d2', 'old', '/əʊld/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Đã có từ lâu, không còn mới; lớn tuổi.', 'not new and having existed for a long period.', 'I found an old photo album in the attic filled with memories.', 'Tôi tìm thấy một cuốn album ảnh cũ trên gác mái chứa đầy kỷ niệm.', '{\"en\": \"The old invoice was filed incorrectly by the accounting department last week.\", \"vi\": \"Hóa đơn cũ đã được phòng kế toán lưu trữ sai vào tuần trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/old-ljspeech-c00dbbc9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/old-cori-c00dbbc9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/old-60893b1d.webp', '[\"elderly\", \"aged\", \"ancient\"]', '[\"new\", \"young\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"old friend\", \"meaning\": \"người bạn lâu năm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"old building\", \"meaning\": \"tòa nhà cũ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"old habit\", \"meaning\": \"thói quen cũ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bold\", \"note_vi\": \"viết thiếu chữ o đầu thành bold nghĩa là dạn dĩ\"}, {\"word\": \"cold\", \"note_vi\": \"thêm chữ c thành cold nghĩa là lạnh\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/old-cori-c00dbbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/old-aru0-c00dbbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/old-aru5-c00dbbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/old-aru6-c00dbbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/old-aru10-c00dbbc9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/old-aru9-c00dbbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/old-aru3-c00dbbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/old-aru7-c00dbbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/old-aru8-c00dbbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/old-aru2-c00dbbc9.mp3\"