('fa94fcbc-4dde-56f4-94da-85bd800ba300', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '41b11418-3030-54e9-b95c-69a1d0cf8612', 'b2ce7d72-3145-5253-9893-f5191b3dc7d2', 'beat', '/biːt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Nhịp điệu hoặc phách của âm nhạc.', 'the regular pulse or rhythm in a piece of music.', 'The song has a catchy beat that makes you want to dance.', 'Bài hát có nhịp điệu lôi cuốn khiến bạn muốn nhảy múa.', '{\"en\": \"The radio ad used a fast beat to grab listeners\' attention.\", \"vi\": \"Quảng cáo trên đài dùng nhịp điệu nhanh để thu hút sự chú ý của thính giả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-ljspeech-47668d39.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-cori-47668d39.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/beat-fe399ded.webp', '[\"rhythm\", \"pulse\", \"tempo\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"steady beat\", \"meaning\": \"nhịp đều\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dance beat\", \"meaning\": \"nhịp nhảy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strong beat\", \"meaning\": \"nhịp mạnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"beet\", \"note_vi\": \"beet là củ dền, đồng âm khác nghĩa với beat\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"beat\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-cori-47668d39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-aru0-47668d39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-aru5-47668d39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-aru6-47668d39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-aru10-47668d39.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-aru9-47668d39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-aru3-47668d39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-aru7-47668d39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-aru8-47668d39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-aru2-47668d39.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-ljspeech-47668d39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-lt408-47668d39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-lt138-47668d39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-lt624-47668d39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-lt396-47668d39.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-lt498-47668d39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-lt132-47668d39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-lt288-47668d39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-lt42-47668d39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beat-lt90-47668d39.mp3\"]}}', 'Beat là danh từ chỉ nhịp, không đọc là /biːt/ giống beet.', 'media', 1, 28),
('45eb4101-b6a3-5f6d-8ec6-d21a850588e5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '41b11418-3030-54e9-b95c-69a1d0cf8612', 'b2ce7d72-3145-5253-9893-f5191b3dc7d2', 'smile', '/smaɪl/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Biểu hiện vui vẻ trên khuôn mặt.', 'a facial expression showing happiness by turning up the corners of the mouth.', 'A friendly smile can make a big difference in someone\'s day.', 'Một nụ cười thân thiện có thể tạo ra sự khác biệt lớn trong ngày của ai đó.', '{\"en\": \"The receptionist greeted every client with a warm smile to create a welcoming office atmosphere.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên lễ tân chào đón mọi khách hàng bằng một nụ cười ấm áp để tạo bầu không khí văn phòng thân thiện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-ljspeech-26f580ae.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-cori-26f580ae.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/smile-3e4a68eb.webp', '[\"grin\", \"beam\"]', '[\"frown\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a broad smile\", \"meaning\": \"nụ cười tươi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wear a smile\", \"meaning\": \"đeo nụ cười trên môi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"smile\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"smiling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-cori-26f580ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-aru0-26f580ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-aru5-26f580ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-aru6-26f580ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-aru10-26f580ae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-aru9-26f580ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-aru3-26f580ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-aru7-26f580ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-aru8-26f580ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-aru2-26f580ae.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-ljspeech-26f580ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-lt408-26f580ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-lt138-26f580ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-lt624-26f580ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-lt396-26f580ae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-lt498-26f580ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-lt132-26f580ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-lt288-26f580ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-lt42-26f580ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/smile-lt90-26f580ae.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để mô tả thái độ tích cực trong giao tiếp công sở.', 'office', 1, 29),
('763f54ed-58e5-5b97-8493-e443113f2900', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '426c2f02-baa2-5cf2-a3bb-e2f3668f4286', '3daf5918-880d-5376-9da2-ae6e9c452727', 'offense', '/əˈfens/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành vi phạm pháp; hoặc điều gây khó chịu, xúc phạm.', 'A breach of law or conduct that causes anger, displeasure, or resentment.', 'Parking in front of the fire hydrant is considered a serious traffic offense.', 'Đỗ xe trước trụ nước chữa cháy được coi là một hành vi vi phạm giao thông nghiêm trọng.', '{\"en\": \"The company has a strict policy against any form of harassment, which is considered a serious offense.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty có chính sách nghiêm ngặt chống lại mọi hình thức quấy rối, vốn được coi là một hành vi vi phạm nghiêm trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-ljspeech-540319d5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-cori-540319d5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/offense-e0ff818d.webp', '[\"crime\", \"violation\"]', '[\"obedience\", \"compliance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"minor offense\", \"meaning\": \"vi phạm nhỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"commit an offense\", \"meaning\": \"phạm tội\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"offend\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"offensive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-cori-540319d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-aru0-540319d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-aru5-540319d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-aru6-540319d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-aru10-540319d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-aru9-540319d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-aru3-540319d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-aru7-540319d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-aru8-540319d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-aru2-540319d5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-ljspeech-540319d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-lt408-540319d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-lt138-540319d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-lt624-540319d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-lt396-540319d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-lt498-540319d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-lt132-540319d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-lt288-540319d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-lt42-540319d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offense-lt90-540319d5.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng trong các văn bản quy định hoặc chính sách công ty.', 'law', 1, 0),
('3035d879-49b4-5d87-802e-e6049f2d23f5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '426c2f02-baa2-5cf2-a3bb-e2f3668f4286', '3daf5918-880d-5376-9da2-ae6e9c452727', 'lightweight', '/ˈlaɪtweɪt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người hoặc vật có trọng lượng nhẹ, hoặc kém quan trọng/ảnh hưởng.', 'a person or object that is not very heavy or lacks significant influence.', 'Despite being a lightweight, the boxer showed incredible speed and agility in the ring.', 'Mặc dù là một võ sĩ hạng nhẹ, anh ta đã thể hiện tốc độ và sự nhanh nhẹn đáng kinh ngạc trên sàn đấu.', '{\"en\": \"This lightweight laptop is perfect for business travelers who need to work on flights.\", \"vi\": \"Chiếc máy tính xách tay nhẹ này hoàn hảo cho những người đi công tác cần làm việc trên chuyến bay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-ljspeech-b30e7369.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-cori-b30e7369.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lightweight-d33a672e.webp', '[\"portable\", \"slight\"]', '[\"heavyweight\", \"bulky\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lightweight material\", \"meaning\": \"vật liệu nhẹ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lightweight design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế nhẹ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"light\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-cori-b30e7369.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-aru0-b30e7369.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-aru5-b30e7369.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-aru6-b30e7369.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-aru10-b30e7369.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-aru9-b30e7369.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-aru3-b30e7369.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-aru7-b30e7369.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-aru8-b30e7369.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-aru2-b30e7369.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-ljspeech-b30e7369.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-lt408-b30e7369.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-lt138-b30e7369.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-lt624-b30e7369.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-lt396-b30e7369.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-lt498-b30e7369.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-lt132-b30e7369.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-lt288-b30e7369.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-lt42-b30e7369.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightweight-lt90-b30e7369.mp3\"]}}', 'nghĩa đen là nhẹ, nghĩa bóng là thiếu sức ảnh hưởng.', 'technology', 1, 1),
('76776a98-ecb3-5220-b7d2-7a2629f7529f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '426c2f02-baa2-5cf2-a3bb-e2f3668f4286', '3daf5918-880d-5376-9da2-ae6e9c452727', 'lot', 'UK: /lɒt/ | US: /lɑːt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'lô đất, bãi đất', 'an area of land set aside for a particular purpose, such as building or parking vehicles.', 'The company plans to build on the vacant lot.', 'Công ty dự định xây dựng trên lô đất trống.', '{\"en\": \"Visitors are requested to park their vehicles in the lot adjacent to the main building.\", \"vi\": \"Khách tham quan được yêu cầu đỗ xe tại bãi đất liền kề tòa nhà chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-ljspeech-dcf6aa54.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-cori-dcf6aa54.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lot-788e221b.webp', '[\"plot\", \"parcel\", \"site\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"parking lot\", \"meaning\": \"bãi đỗ xe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vacant lot\", \"meaning\": \"lô đất trống\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"plot\", \"note_vi\": \"Plot thường là mảnh đất nhỏ quy hoạch cho mục đích xây dựng cụ thể\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-cori-dcf6aa54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-aru0-dcf6aa54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-aru5-dcf6aa54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-aru6-dcf6aa54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-aru10-dcf6aa54.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-aru9-dcf6aa54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-aru3-dcf6aa54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-aru7-dcf6aa54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-aru8-dcf6aa54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-aru2-dcf6aa54.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-ljspeech-dcf6aa54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-lt408-dcf6aa54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-lt138-dcf6aa54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-lt624-dcf6aa54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-lt396-dcf6aa54.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-lt498-dcf6aa54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-lt132-dcf6aa54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-lt288-dcf6aa54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-lt42-dcf6aa54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lot-lt90-dcf6aa54.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'lot\' rất hay xuất hiện trong các cụm như \'parking lot\' (bãi đỗ xe) hoặc \'vacant lot\' (lô đất trống).', 'real estate', 1, 2),
('80e1f009-e6d8-54a4-a8dc-3f8827987f38', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '426c2f02-baa2-5cf2-a3bb-e2f3668f4286', '3daf5918-880d-5376-9da2-ae6e9c452727', 'categorize', '/ˈkætəɡəraɪz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Sắp xếp, phân loại các vật hoặc ý tưởng vào các nhóm.', 'to put things into groups according to their type, features, or qualities.', 'Software algorithms can quickly categorize incoming emails into spam or primary folders.', 'Các thuật toán phần mềm có thể nhanh chóng phân loại thư điện tử đến thành thư rác hoặc thư mục chính.', '{\"en\": \"The software allows users to categorize their business expenses by department automatically.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm cho phép người dùng tự động phân loại chi phí kinh doanh theo phòng ban.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/categorize-ljspeech-30d8a00b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/categorize-cori-30d8a00b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/categorize-c6f1104a.webp', '[\"classify\", \"group\", \"sort\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"categorize into\", \"meaning\": \"phân loại thành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"broadly categorize\", \"meaning\": \"phân loại một cách tổng quát\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"catalog\", \"note_vi\": \"catalog là lập danh mục, categorize là phân loại vào nhóm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"category\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"categorization\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/categorize-cori-30d8a00b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/categorize-aru0-30d8a00b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/categorize-aru5-30d8a00b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/categorize-aru6-30d8a00b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/categorize-aru10-30d8a00b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/categorize-aru9-30d8a00b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/categorize-aru3-30d8a00b.mp3\", \"/sto