('cf055043-8ec2-5a5a-aced-abc200ad8e02', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '426c2f02-baa2-5cf2-a3bb-e2f3668f4286', '3daf5918-880d-5376-9da2-ae6e9c452727', 'careless', '/ˈkeələs/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Bất cẩn, không cẩn thận hoặc thiếu chú ý.', 'not taking enough thought, attention, or effort to avoid mistakes or damage.', 'It was a careless mistake that cost him the game.', 'Đó là một sai lầm bất cẩn đã khiến anh ấy thua trận đấu.', '{\"en\": \"The delay was caused by a careless error in the shipping address documentation.\", \"vi\": \"Sự chậm trễ bị gây ra bởi một lỗi bất cẩn trong tài liệu địa chỉ giao hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-ljspeech-eeaae8b6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-cori-eeaae8b6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/careless-fbaafad3.webp', '[\"inattentive\", \"reckless\", \"negligent\"]', '[\"careful\", \"cautious\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"careless mistake\", \"meaning\": \"lỗi sai bất cẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"careless driving\", \"meaning\": \"lái xe ẩu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"carefree\", \"note_vi\": \"careless là bất cẩn, carefree là vô tư không lo nghĩ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"carelessly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"carelessness\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"care\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-cori-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru0-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru5-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru6-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru10-eeaae8b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru9-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru3-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careless-aru7-eeaae8b6.mp3\", \"/storage/