('534b516e-9ae9-5848-ad6f-8cab1071680f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '426c2f02-baa2-5cf2-a3bb-e2f3668f4286', '3daf5918-880d-5376-9da2-ae6e9c452727', 'break up', '/breɪk ʌp/', 'B1', 'phrasal verb', 'Chấm dứt một mối quan hệ tình cảm.', 'to terminate a romantic relationship or marriage with someone.', 'After months of frequent arguments, the young couple finally decided to break up.', 'Sau nhiều tháng tranh cãi thường xuyên, cặp đôi trẻ cuối cùng đã quyết định chia tay.', '{\"en\": \"A coworker mentioned she plans to break up with her fiancé next week.\", \"vi\": \"Một đồng nghiệp chia sẻ cô ấy dự định chia tay hôn phu vào tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-ljspeech-b313d196.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-cori-b313d196.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/break-up-c2003fd2.webp', '[\"split up\", \"break off\", \"part ways\"]', '[\"make up\", \"get together\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"break up with\", \"meaning\": \"chia tay ai đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"break up a fight\", \"meaning\": \"can ngăn cuộc chiến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"break up a meeting\", \"meaning\": \"kết thúc cuộc họp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"break down\", \"note_vi\": \"break down là hỏng máy, khác break up chia tay.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"breakup\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-cori-b313d196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-aru0-b313d196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-aru5-b313d196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-aru6-b313d196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-aru10-b313d196.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-aru9-b313d196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-aru3-b313d196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-aru7-b313d196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-aru8-b313d196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-aru2-b313d196.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-ljspeech-b313d196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-lt408-b313d196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-lt138-b313d196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-lt624-b313d196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-lt396-b313d196.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-lt498-b313d196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-lt132-b313d196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-lt288-b313d196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-lt42-b313d196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-up-lt90-b313d196.mp3\"]}}', 'Break up dùng cho tình cảm; break down cho máy móc hỏng.', 'office', 1, 9),
('0b574a0a-f705-5389-91c4-914423ae7dbf', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '426c2f02-baa2-5cf2-a3bb-e2f3668f4286', '3daf5918-880d-5376-9da2-ae6e9c452727', 'webcam', '/ˈwɛbkæm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một camera kỹ thuật số nhỏ dùng để truyền hình ảnh trực tiếp qua internet.', 'a small digital video camera connected to a computer to stream live video online.', 'We used a webcam to video call our relatives who live abroad.', 'Chúng tôi đã dùng webcam để gọi video cho người thân sống ở nước ngoài.', '{\"en\": \"All employees must turn on their webcam during the virtual staff meeting this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên phải bật máy ghi hình trực tuyến trong buổi họp trực tuyến sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webcam-ljspeech-75f5540a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webcam-cori-75f5540a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/webcam-f19ad470.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"built-in webcam\", \"meaning\": \"webcam tích hợp sẵn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"turn on webcam\", \"meaning\": \"bật webcam\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"camera\", \"note_vi\": \"webcam kết nối máy tính để truyền hình ảnh qua internet, camera là máy ảnh/quay phim chung.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webcam-cori-75f5540a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webcam-aru0-75f5540a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webcam-aru5-75f5540a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webcam-aru6-75f5540a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webcam-aru10-75f5540a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webcam-aru9-75f5540a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webcam-aru3-75f5540a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webcam-aru7-75f5540a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webcam-aru8-75f5540a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webcam-