('bfcfe691-7a1e-5437-9e13-6789b4b9ba3d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '47356f54-6eb6-5f84-b0ef-a6f86ca9bf8e', 'f4f5d6b3-ca83-5159-80ad-5cadb8ce2339', 'option', 'UK: /ˈɒpʃənz/ | US: /ˈɑːpʃənz/', 'A2', 'noun', 'sự lựa chọn, phương án', 'A choice or alternative that is available in a given situation.', 'The company offers various health insurance options to its staff.', 'Công ty cung cấp nhiều lựa chọn bảo hiểm y tế cho nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors is considering several options to expand into foreign markets.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đang xem xét một số phương án để mở rộng sang các thị trường nước ngoài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-ljspeech-14eb14ec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-cori-14eb14ec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/option-b50169ee.webp', '[\"choice\", \"alternative\", \"selection\"]', '[\"requirement\", \"obligation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"viable option\", \"meaning\": \"phương án khả thi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"exercise an option\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện quyền chọn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"opinion\", \"note_vi\": \"opinion nghĩa là ý kiến/quan điểm, khác với option là sự lựa chọn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"opt\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"optional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-cori-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru0-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru5-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru6-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru10-14eb14ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru9-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru3-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru7-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru8-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru2-14eb14ec.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-ljspeech-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt408-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt138-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt624-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt396-14eb14ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt498-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt132-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt288-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt42-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt90-14eb14ec.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ \'option\' đi với các động từ như \'choose\', \'select\' hoặc \'exercise\' (thực hiện quyền lựa chọn).', 'business policy', 1, 9),
('598f8f0e-9618-5d86-8c51-d777eeb0265d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '47356f54-6eb6-5f84-b0ef-a6f86ca9bf8e', 'f4f5d6b3-ca83-5159-80ad-5cadb8ce2339', 'side by side', '', 'B1', 'adverb', 'sát nhau', 'Positioned next to each other while facing in the same general direction.', 'The chairs are placed side by side.', 'Những chiếc ghế được đặt cạnh nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The two technicians worked side by side to resolve the server failure.\", \"vi\": \"Hai kỹ thuật viên đã làm việc kề bên nhau để khắc phục sự cố máy chủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-by-side-ljspeech-d4f78d08.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-by-side-cori-d4f78d08.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/side-by-side-b3d0ecb3.webp', '[\"alongside\", \"next to each other\", \"abreast\"]', '[\"far apart\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sit side by side\", \"meaning\": \"ngồi cạnh nhau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work side by side\", \"meaning\": \"kề vai sát cánh làm việc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"face to face\", \"note_vi\": \"face to face là đối mặt nhau, trong khi side by side là đứng/ngồi cạnh nhau cùng hướng\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-by-side-cori-d4f78d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-by-side-aru0-d4f78d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-by-side-aru5-d4f78d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-by-side-aru6-d4f78d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-by-side-aru10-d4f78d08.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-by-side-aru9-d4f78d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-by-side-aru3-d4f78d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-by-side-aru7-d4f78d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-by-side-aru8-d4f78d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-by-side-aru2-d4f78d08.