('48034edd-379a-5200-a61d-ce3e66dd3fc9', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '47356f54-6eb6-5f84-b0ef-a6f86ca9bf8e', 'f4f5d6b3-ca83-5159-80ad-5cadb8ce2339', 'bitter', '/ˈbɪtə/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có vị đắng; hoặc cảm giác cay đắng, khó chịu.', 'having a sharp unpleasant taste like coffee without sugar or beer.', 'The dark chocolate was very bitter, but I still enjoyed it.', 'Thanh sô cô la đen rất đắng, nhưng tôi vẫn thích nó.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was bitter about losing the major contract to a rival company.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý cảm thấy cay đắng vì để mất hợp đồng lớn vào tay công ty đối thủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-ljspeech-23fda791.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-cori-23fda791.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bitter-4c321540.webp', '[\"sharp\", \"harsh\", \"resentful\"]', '[\"sweet\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bitter taste\", \"meaning\": \"vị đắng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bitter disappointment\", \"meaning\": \"nỗi thất vọng cay đắng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sour\", \"note_vi\": \"bitter là vị đắng hoặc cảm giác cay đắng; sour là vị chua.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bitterness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"bitterly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-cori-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-aru0-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-aru5-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-aru6-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-aru10-23fda791.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-aru9-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-aru3-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-aru7-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-aru8-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-aru2-23fda791.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-ljspeech-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-lt408-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-lt138-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-lt624-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-lt396-23fda791.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-lt498-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-lt132-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-lt288-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-lt42-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-lt90-23fda791.mp3\"]}}', 'Bitter vừa tả vị giác (đắng), vừa tả cảm xúc (cay đắng, chua xát).', 'dining', 1, 18),
('d1556cfc-fa41-579e-9320-e9f5747a2648', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '47356f54-6eb6-5f84-b0ef-a6f86ca9bf8e', 'f4f5d6b3-ca83-5159-80ad-5cadb8ce2339', 'karma', '/ˈkɑːmə/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tổng hòa hành động của một người và hậu quả của chúng trong cuộc sống này hoặc kiếp sau.', 'the belief that your actions in this life will influence your future experiences.', 'Many believe that good actions lead to good karma.', 'Nhiều người tin rằng hành động tốt sẽ dẫn đến nghiệp tốt.', '{\"en\": \"The manager believes in good karma, so he always treats his employees with great respect.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý tin vào luật nhân quả, vì vậy ông ấy luôn đối xử với nhân viên bằng sự tôn trọng cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-ljspeech-512423cb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-cori-512423cb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/karma-b462b3e3.webp', '[\"fate\", \"destiny\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"good karma\", \"meaning\": \"nghiệp tốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bad karma\", \"meaning\": \"nghiệp xấu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-cori-512423cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-aru0-512423cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-aru5-512423cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-aru6-512423cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-aru10-512423cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-aru9-512423cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-aru3-512423cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-aru7-512423cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-aru8-512423cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-aru2-512423cb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-ljspeech-512423cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-lt408-512423cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-lt138-512423cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-lt624-512423cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-lt396-512423cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-lt498-512423cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-lt132-512423cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-lt288-512423cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-lt42-512423cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karma-lt90-512423cb.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang tính triết lý, ít dùng trong văn bản thương mại thuần túy.', 'other', 1, 19),
('2957cb98-d41b-5ffc-976d-7d17889d75af', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '47356f54-6eb6-5f84-b0ef-a6f86ca9bf8e', 'f4f5d6b3-ca83-5159-80ad-5cadb8ce2339', 'theater', '/ˈθɪə.tər/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Nơi biểu diễn kịch, phim hoặc các loại hình nghệ thuật khác.', 'a building or place with a stage where plays and shows are performed for an audience.', 'The historic theater downtown was recently renovated to host modern musical performances.', 'Nhà hát lịch sử ở trung tâm thành phố gần đây đã được cải tạo để tổ chức các buổi biểu diễn âm nhạc hiện đại.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate event will be held at the grand theater downtown to accommodate all the guests.\", \"vi\": \"Sự kiện của công ty sẽ được tổ chức tại nhà hát lớn ở trung tâm thành phố để đủ chỗ cho tất cả khách mời.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-ljspeech-d19df7d3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-cori-d19df7d3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/theater-0f247c5f.webp', '[\"cinema\", \"playhouse\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"movie theater\", \"meaning\": \"rạp chiếu phim\"}, {\"phrase\": \"local theater\", \"meaning\": \"nhà hát địa phương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"theater director\", \"meaning\": \"đạo diễn sân khấu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"theatrical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-cori-d19df7d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-aru0-d19df7d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-aru5-d19df7d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-aru6-d19df7d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-aru10-d19df7d3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-aru9-d19df7d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-aru3-d19df7d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-aru7-d19df7d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-aru8-d19df7d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-aru2-d19df7d3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-ljspeech-d19df7d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-lt408-d19df7d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-lt138-d19df7d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-lt624-d19df7d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-lt396-d19df7d3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-lt498-d19df7d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-lt132-d19df7d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-lt288-d19df7d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-lt42-d19df7d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theater-lt90-d19df7d3.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể viết là theatre (Anh-Anh) hoặc theater (Anh-Mỹ).', 'travel', 1, 20),
('7f4ef989-f2e2-53c7-a68b-bc5018957857', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '47356f54-6eb6-5f84-b0ef-a6f86ca9bf8e', 'f4f5d6b3-ca83-5159-80ad-5cadb8ce2339', 'task', 'UK: /tɑːsk/ | US: /tæsk/', 'B1', 'noun', 'nhiệm vụ', 'A specific piece of work or duty assigned to someone to be completed.', 'She completed all her tasks before the deadline.', 'Cô ấy đã hoàn thành tất cả các nhiệm vụ của mình trước thời hạn.', '{\"en\": \"The project manager assigned several urgent tasks to the team members.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý dự án đã giao một số nhiệm vụ khẩn cấp cho các thành viên trong đội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-ljspeech-7fbb727d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-cori-7fbb727d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/task-05525111.webp', '[\"assignment\", \"duty\", \"job\", \"chore\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"assign a task\", \"meaning\": \"giao nhiệm vụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"complete a task\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn thành nhiệm vụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"task force\", \"meaning\": \"nhóm công tác đặc nhiệm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tax\", \"note_vi\": \"\'tax\' nghĩa là tiền thuế, tránh nhầm lẫn do phát âm gần giống với \'task\'.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"task\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-cori-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru0-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru5-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru6-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru10-7fbb727d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru9-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru3-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru7-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/task-aru8-7fbb727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/t