('03f0d707-c0d8-57d5-94e7-3cd691474070', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '47356f54-6eb6-5f84-b0ef-a6f86ca9bf8e', 'f4f5d6b3-ca83-5159-80ad-5cadb8ce2339', 'immigration', '/ˌɪmɪˈɡreɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành động di chuyển đến sống vĩnh viễn ở một quốc gia khác.', 'the process of coming to live permanently in a country that is not your own.', 'The country has seen a significant increase in immigration over the past decade.', 'Đất nước này đã chứng kiến sự gia tăng đáng kể về nhập cư trong thập kỷ qua.', '{\"en\": \"The HR department assisted the foreign engineer with all the necessary immigration paperwork.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận nhân sự đã hỗ trợ kỹ sư nước ngoài hoàn thành tất cả các thủ tục giấy tờ nhập cư cần thiết.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-ljspeech-2f477683.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-cori-2f477683.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/immigration-c390c719.webp', '[\"migration\", \"colonization\"]', '[\"emigration\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"immigration law\", \"meaning\": \"luật nhập cư\"}, {\"phrase\": \"immigration officer\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên nhập cảnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"emigration\", \"note_vi\": \"immigration là nhập cư (đi vào); emigration là di cư (đi ra khỏi nước).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"immigrate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"immigrant\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-cori-2f477683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-aru0-2f477683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-aru5-2f477683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-aru6-2f477683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-aru10-2f477683.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-aru9-2f477683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-aru3-2f477683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-aru7-2f477683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-aru8-2f477683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-aru2-2f477683.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-ljspeech-2f477683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-lt408-2f477683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-lt138-2f477683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-lt624-2f477683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-lt396-2f477683.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-lt498-2f477683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-lt132-2f477683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-lt288-2f477683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-lt42-2f477683.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigration-lt90-2f477683.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ quy tắc: I-mmigration là đi Vào (In), E-migration là đi ra (Exit).', 'hr', 1, 23),
('c2c153e9-d6fe-558d-8281-b416b48de60d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '47356f54-6eb6-5f84-b0ef-a6f86ca9bf8e', 'f4f5d6b3-ca83-5159-80ad-5cadb8ce2339', 'tense', '/tɛns/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Dạng động từ chỉ thời điểm xảy ra hành động (quá khứ, hiện tại, tương lai).', 'a form of a verb that shows the time of an action.', 'In English grammar, the past tense is used to describe actions that happened before now.', 'Trong ngữ pháp tiếng Anh, thì quá khứ được dùng để mô tả các hành động đã xảy ra trước hiện tại.', '{\"en\": \"The language institute hired a consultant to clarify verb tense usage in training manuals.\", \"vi\": \"Học viện ngôn ngữ đã thuê một cố vấn để làm rõ cách sử dụng thì của động từ trong tài liệu đào tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-ljspeech-5d8798fd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-cori-5d8798fd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tense-f76ff1bd.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"past tense\", \"meaning\": \"thì quá khứ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"present tense\", \"meaning\": \"thì hiện tại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"future tense\", \"meaning\": \"thì tương lai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tense\", \"note_vi\": \"Tense (danh từ) là thì trong ngữ pháp; Tense (tính từ) là căng thẳng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"tense\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-cori-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-aru0-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-aru5-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-aru6-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-aru10-5d8798fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-aru9-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-aru3-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-aru7-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-aru8-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-aru2-5d8798fd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-ljspeech-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-lt408-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-lt138-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-lt624-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-lt396-5d8798fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-lt498-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-lt132-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-lt288-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-lt42-5d8798fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tense-lt90-5d8798fd.mp3\"]}}', 'Cần phân biệt nghĩa danh từ (thì ngữ pháp) và tính từ (căng thẳng, lo âu).', 'education', 1, 24),
('ea53a0e6-b25b-50b3-9fef-82ed4c342bc1', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '47356f54-6eb6-5f84-b0ef-a6f86ca9bf8e', 'f4f5d6b3-ca83-5159-80ad-5cadb8ce2339', 'construct', '/kənˈstrʌkt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Xây dựng, tạo dựng một cái gì đó, thường là công trình lớn.', 'to build or create something large, such as a road, bridge, or building.', 'The company plans to construct a modern warehouse near the highway next year.', 'Công ty có kế hoạch xây dựng một nhà kho hiện đại gần đường cao tốc vào năm tới.', '{\"en\": \"The contractor plans to construct a modern office building in the downtown area next year.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thầu có kế hoạch xây dựng một tòa nhà văn phòng hiện đại ở khu vực trung tâm thành phố vào năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-ljspeech-b012113a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-cori-b012113a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/construct-cbae7fce.webp', '[\"build\", \"erect\", \"assemble\"]', '[\"demolish\", \"destroy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"construct a building\", \"meaning\": \"xây dựng một tòa nhà\"}, {\"phrase\": \"construct a model\", \"meaning\": \"xây dựng một mô hình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"structure\", \"note_vi\": \"structure là danh từ cấu trúc hoặc động từ tổ chức, sắp xếp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"construction\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"constructive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-cori-b012113a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-aru0-b012113a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-aru5-b012113a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-aru6-b012113a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-aru10-b012113a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-aru9-b012113a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-aru3-b012113a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-aru7-b012113a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-aru8-b012113a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-aru2-b012113a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-ljspeech-b012113a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-lt408-b012113a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-lt138-b012113a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-lt624-b012113a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-lt396-b012113a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-lt498-b012113a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-lt132-b012113a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-lt288-b012113a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-lt42-b012113a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construct-lt90-b012113a.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ này trang trọng hơn build, thường dùng cho công trình lớn hoặc hệ thống lý thuyết.', 'manufacturing', 1, 25),
('e4d0f535-4d46-5128-8697-85d30b5da602', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '47356f54-6eb6-5f84-b0ef-a6f86ca9bf8e', 'f4f5d6b3-ca83-5159-80ad-5cadb8ce2339', 'efficient', '/ɪˈfɪʃnt/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Hoạt động tốt, đạt kết quả cao mà không lãng phí.', 'working well and producing good results without wasting time, money, or energy.', 'Using automated software made our accounting department far more efficient.', 'Việc sử dụng phần mềm tự động đã giúp bộ phận kế toán của chúng tôi hiệu quả hơn nhiều.', '{\"en\": \"The new software made our billing process far more efficient and accurate.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm mới đã giúp quy trình lập hóa đơn của chúng tôi hiệu quả và chính xác hơn nhiều.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-ljspeech-8527edb7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-cori-8527edb7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/efficient-020a87a4.webp', '[\"effective\", \"productive\", \"streamlined\"]', '[\"inefficient\", \"wasteful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly efficient\", \"meaning\": \"rất hiệu quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"efficient use of resources\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng tài nguyên hiệu quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cost-efficient\", \"meaning\": \"tiết kiệm chi phí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"effective\", \"note_vi\": \"\'effective\' nhấn mạnh đạt kết quả, \'efficient\' nhấn mạnh không lãng phí\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"efficiency\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"efficiently\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"inefficient\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-cori-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru0-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru5-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru6-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru10-8527edb7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru9-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru3-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru7-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru8-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru2-8527edb7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-ljspeech-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt408-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt138-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt624-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt396-8527edb7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt498-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt132-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt288-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt42-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt90-8527edb7.mp3\"]}}', 'Người Việt hay nhầm \'efficient\' và \'effective\'; nhớ \'efficient\' gắn với tiết kiệm nguồn lực.', 'office', 1, 26),
('197adcaf-a710-51d9-8556-c4fc752dc01a', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '47356f54-6eb6-5f84-b0ef-a6f86ca9bf8e', 'f4f5d6b3-ca83-5159-80ad-5cadb8ce2339', 'production', '/prəˈdʌkʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Quá trình tạo ra hoặc chế tạo hàng hóa và dịch vụ.', 'the process of making or growing goods to be sold or used.', 'The company increased its production to meet the high demand for its new product.', 'Công ty đã tăng sản lượng để đáp ứng nhu cầu cao về sản phẩm mới của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The factory halted production due to a sudden shortage of raw materials.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy đã tạm dừng sản xuất do thiếu hụt nguyên liệu thô đột ngột.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-ljspeech-90a8834d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-cori-90a8834d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/production-50dd0c73.webp', '[\"manufacturing\", \"creation\", \"generation\"]', '[\"destruction\", \"consumption\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"mass production\", \"meaning\": \"sản xuất hàng loạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"production cost\", \"meaning\": \"chi phí sản xuất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"production line\", \"meaning\": \"dây chuyền sản xuất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"product\", \"note_vi\": \"sản phẩm, là kết quả của quá trình sản xuất\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"produce\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"productive\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"product\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-cori-90a8834d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-aru0-90a8834d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-aru5-90a8834d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-aru6-90a8834d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-aru10-90a8834d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-aru9-90a8834d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-aru3-90a8834d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-aru7-90a8834d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-aru8-90a8834d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-aru2-90a8834d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-ljspeech-90a8834d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-lt408-90a8834d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-lt138-90a8834d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-lt624-90a8834d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-lt396-90a8834d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-lt498-90a8834d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-lt132-90a8834d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-lt288-90a8834d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-lt42-90a8834d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/production-lt90-90a8834d.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với product (sản phẩm) và productivity (năng suất).', 'manufacturing', 1, 27),
('b527377e-a099-5854-840c-c824f022d89d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '47356f54-6eb6-5f84-b0ef-a6f86ca9bf8e', 'f4f5d6b3-ca83-5159-80ad-5cadb8ce2339', 'poor', '/pɔː(r)/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Nghèo khó, không có đủ tiền hoặc tài sản.', 'having very little money and not enough to buy basic things.', 'Many families in the region are struggling and live in poor conditions.', 'Nhiều gia đình trong vùng đang gặp khó khăn và sống trong điều kiện nghèo nàn.', '{\"en\": \"The company decided to donate a portion of its profits to help poor communities.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã quyết định quyên góp một phần lợi nhuận để giúp đỡ các cộng đồng nghèo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-ljspeech-2156e40a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-cori-2156e40a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/poor-4f6bca15.webp', '[\"impoverished\", \"needy\", \"penniless\"]', '[\"rich\", \"wealthy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"poor family\", \"meaning\": \"gia đình nghèo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"poor quality\", \"meaning\": \"chất lượng kém\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pour\", \"note_vi\": \"phát âm giống nhau nhưng pour là rót nước\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"poverty\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"poorly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-cori-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru0-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru5-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru6-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru10-2156e40a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru9-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru3-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru7-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru8-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-aru2-2156e40a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-ljspeech-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-lt408-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-lt138-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-lt624-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-lt396-2156e40a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-lt498-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-lt132-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-lt288-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-lt42-2156e40a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poor-lt90-2156e40a.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý \'the poor\' dùng như danh từ số nhiều chỉ những người nghèo nói chung.', 'other', 1, 28),
('398fc8c9-51bc-52e6-9c4b-a2cfd6d58d00', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '47356f54-6eb6-5f84-b0ef-a6f86ca9bf8e', 'f4f5d6b3-ca83-5159-80ad-5cadb8ce2339', 'culture', '/ˈkʌltʃə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tập hợp các giá trị, tín ngưỡng, phong tục của một nhóm người.', 'the beliefs, way of life, art, and customs shared by a group of people.', 'Learning about different cultures helps us understand the world better.', 'Tìm hiểu về các nền văn hóa khác nhau giúp chúng ta hiểu thế giới tốt hơn.', '{\"en\": \"Our new CEO wants to foster a culture of open communication and innovation.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành mới của chúng tôi muốn thúc đẩy một văn hóa giao tiếp cởi mở và đổi mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-ljspeech-8f2e7cd7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-cori-8f2e7cd7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/culture-90ca97b0.webp', '[\"customs\", \"lifestyle\", \"civilization\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"corporate culture\", \"meaning\": \"văn hóa doanh nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pop culture\", \"meaning\": \"văn hóa đại chúng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"cultural\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"culturally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-cori-8f2e7cd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-aru0-8f2e7cd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-aru5-8f2e7cd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-aru6-8f2e7cd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-aru10-8f2e7cd7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-aru9-8f2e7cd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-aru3-8f2e7cd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-aru7-8f2e7cd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-aru8-8f2e7cd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-aru2-8f2e7cd7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-ljspeech-8f2e7cd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-lt408-8f2e7cd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-lt138-8f2e7cd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-lt624-8f2e7cd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-lt396-8f2e7cd7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-lt498-8f2e7cd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-lt132-8f2e7cd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-lt288-8f2e7cd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-lt42-8f2e7cd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culture-lt90-8f2e7cd7.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong công sở, \'corporate culture\' nghĩa là văn hóa doanh nghiệp.', 'hr', 1, 29)
