"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt408-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt138-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt624-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt396-6acd6212.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt498-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt132-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt288-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt42-6acd6212.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pack-lt90-6acd6212.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với cụm \'pack up\' (thu dọn đồ đạc) hoặc \'pack sth into sth\' (xếp đồ vào túi/hộp).', 'travel', 1, 0),
('21fa011c-c921-51ee-8b4d-142536dfe28b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '487ab82a-aa40-5480-9267-a8f9ffdc02bc', '924c7d35-ee5c-5051-8081-94892b40e66a', 'divorce', '/dɪˈvɔːs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự chấm dứt hôn nhân hợp pháp giữa vợ và chồng.', 'the legal ending of a marriage between a husband and a wife.', 'After years of trying to make it work, they decided to get a divorce.', 'Sau nhiều năm cố gắng hàn gắn, họ quyết định ly hôn.', '{\"en\": \"The company lawyer handled the complex divorce settlement involving shared assets and business properties.\", \"vi\": \"Luật sư công ty đã xử lý thỏa thuận ly hôn phức tạp liên quan đến tài sản chung và bất động sản kinh doanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/divorce-ljspeech-7c5c57a4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/divorce-cori-7c5c57a4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/divorce-d538d611.webp', '[\"separation\", \"split\"]', '[\"marriage\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"file for divorce\", \"meaning\": \"nộp đơn ly hôn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"divorce settlement\", \"meaning\": \"thỏa thuận ly hôn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"divorce\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/divorce-cori-7c5c57a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/divorce-aru0-7c5c57a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/divorce-aru5-7c5c57a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/divorce-aru6-7c5c57a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/divorce-aru10-7c5c57a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/divorce-aru9-7c5c57a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/divorce-aru3-7c5c57a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/divorce-aru7-7c5c57a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/divorce-aru8-7c5c57a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/divorce-aru2-7c5c57a4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/stora