('bf71739c-0f91-58cc-baf4-47597dcf6e51', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '487ab82a-aa40-5480-9267-a8f9ffdc02bc', '924c7d35-ee5c-5051-8081-94892b40e66a', 'progress', '/ˈprəʊɡres/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Sự tiến triển, phát triển tốt hơn.', 'the process of moving forward or getting closer to finishing a specific task.', 'We are making good progress on the project, expecting to finish ahead of schedule.', 'Chúng tôi đang có nhiều tiến triển tốt trong dự án, dự kiến sẽ hoàn thành sớm hơn lịch trình.', '{\"en\": \"The manager requested a weekly report to track the progress of the construction project.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã yêu cầu một bản báo cáo hàng tuần để theo dõi tiến độ của dự án xây dựng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-ljspeech-5aaf8905.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-cori-5aaf8905.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/progress-94f151e4.webp', '[\"advancement\", \"development\"]', '[\"delay\", \"setback\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"make progress\", \"meaning\": \"đạt được tiến bộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"track progress\", \"meaning\": \"theo dõi tiến độ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"progressive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-cori-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru0-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru5-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru6-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru10-5aaf8905.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru9-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru3-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru7-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/progress-aru8-5aaf8905.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2