('9371a240-9db4-5f81-8753-92b465fcb012', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '487ab82a-aa40-5480-9267-a8f9ffdc02bc', '924c7d35-ee5c-5051-8081-94892b40e66a', 'possible', '/ˈpɒsəbl/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Có thể xảy ra hoặc thực hiện được.', 'able to be done, achieved, or existing in a particular situation.', 'It\'s possible that the train will be delayed due to bad weather.', 'Có khả năng tàu sẽ bị hoãn vì thời tiết xấu.', '{\"en\": \"Please send the financial report as soon as possible to the regional director.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng gửi báo cáo tài chính càng sớm càng tốt cho giám đốc khu vực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possible-ljspeech-db7c8cf9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possible-cori-db7c8cf9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/possible-d8d35cc8.webp', '[\"feasible\", \"achievable\", \"likely\"]', '[\"impossible\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"as soon as possible\", \"meaning\": \"càng sớm càng tốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make it possible\", \"meaning\": \"làm cho điều gì có thể xảy ra\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"probable\", \"note_vi\": \"possible là có thể xảy ra, probable là rất có thể xảy ra\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"possibility\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"possibly\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"impossible\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possible-cori-db7c8cf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possible-aru0-db7c8cf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possible-aru5-db7c8cf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possible-aru6-db7c8cf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possible-aru10-db7c8cf9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possible-aru9-db7c8cf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possible-aru3-db7c8cf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/possible-aru7-db7c8cf9.mp3\", \"/storag