('6f865263-91d7-50d0-99cc-1c8decd40cd0', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '487ab82a-aa40-5480-9267-a8f9ffdc02bc', '924c7d35-ee5c-5051-8081-94892b40e66a', 'allow', '/əˈlaʊ/', 'A2', 'verb', 'cấp phép, cho phép ai đó làm gì.', 'to let someone do something or give permission for an activity to happen.', 'My parents don\'t allow me to stay out late on weekdays.', 'Bố mẹ tôi không cho phép tôi về muộn vào các ngày trong tuần.', '{\"en\": \"The security policy does not allow visitors to enter the warehouse without a badge.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách an ninh không cho phép khách tham quan vào kho mà không có thẻ đeo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-ljspeech-6452e7c5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-cori-6452e7c5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/allow-768a5175.webp', '[\"permit\", \"authorize\"]', '[\"forbid\", \"prohibit\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"allow someone to do\", \"meaning\": \"cho phép ai làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"allow access\", \"meaning\": \"cho phép truy cập\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"let\", \"note_vi\": \"let thân mật hơn, allow dùng trong văn bản chính thức.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"allowance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-cori-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru0-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru5-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru6-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru10-6452e7c5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru9-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru3-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru7-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru8-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru2-6452e7c5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-ljspeech-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt408-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt138-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt624-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt396-6452e7c5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt498-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt132-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt288-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt42-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt90-6452e7c5.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc: allow + object + to-infinitive.', 'office', 1, 9),
('95107627-7811-5f5a-889b-63a0d2caec92', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '487ab82a-aa40-5480-9267-a8f9ffdc02bc', '924c7d35-ee5c-5051-8081-94892b40e66a', 'extended', '/ɪkˈstendɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Được kéo dài ra, mở rộng ra.', 'made longer than usual or lasting for a long period of time.', 'We took an extended vacation to visit several countries in Europe.', 'Chúng tôi đã có một kỳ nghỉ kéo dài để thăm nhiều quốc gia ở Châu Âu.', '{\"en\": \"The store offers an extended warranty on all electronic appliances purchased this month.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng cung cấp gói bảo hành mở rộng cho tất cả các thiết bị điện tử được mua trong tháng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-ljspeech-a74a18cf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-cori-a74a18cf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extended-adefa346.webp', '[\"prolonged\", \"lengthened\", \"expanded\"]', '[\"shortened\", \"brief\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"extended warranty\", \"meaning\": \"bảo hành mở rộng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extended family\", \"meaning\": \"đại gia đình (nhiều thế hệ)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extended period\", \"meaning\": \"khoảng thời gian kéo dài\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"extensive\", \"note_vi\": \"extensive nghĩa là rộng lớn về phạm vi hoặc diện tích\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"extend\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"extension\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"extensive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-cori-a74a18cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-aru0-a74a18cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-aru5-a74a18cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-aru6-a74a18cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-aru10-a74a18cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-aru9-a74a18cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/p