('caa5ebda-625e-59d1-bf94-c92414ffa432', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '487ab82a-aa40-5480-9267-a8f9ffdc02bc', '924c7d35-ee5c-5051-8081-94892b40e66a', 'obvious', '/ˈɒbviəs/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rõ ràng, dễ thấy, hiển nhiên.', 'easy to see, recognize, or understand for almost everyone.', 'It was obvious that she was upset, even though she tried to hide it.', 'Rõ ràng là cô ấy đang buồn, mặc dù cô ấy cố giấu đi.', '{\"en\": \"There was an obvious mistake in the financial report that required immediate correction.\", \"vi\": \"Có một lỗi rõ ràng trong báo cáo tài chính cần được sửa chữa ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-ljspeech-e3ff2d9f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-cori-e3ff2d9f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/obvious-aab00613.webp', '[\"apparent\", \"evident\", \"clear\"]', '[\"hidden\", \"obscure\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"obvious choice\", \"meaning\": \"lựa chọn hiển nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"obvious reason\", \"meaning\": \"lý do rõ ràng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"evident\", \"note_vi\": \"Evident dựa trên bằng chứng thu thập, obvious là hiển nhiên thấy ngay.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"obviously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-cori-e3ff2d9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-aru0-e3ff2d9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-aru5-e3ff2d9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-aru6-e3ff2d9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-aru10-e3ff2d9f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-aru9-e3ff2d9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-aru3-e3ff2d9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-aru7-e3ff2d9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obvious-aru8-e3ff2d9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunci