('7ae7489d-c57c-5fac-b058-56b49e878425', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '487ab82a-aa40-5480-9267-a8f9ffdc02bc', '924c7d35-ee5c-5051-8081-94892b40e66a', 'NASA', '/ˈnæsə/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cơ quan hàng không và vũ trụ quốc gia của Hoa Kỳ.', 'an American public institution overseeing national aerospace endeavors, cosmic studies, and satellite technological advancements.', 'NASA has launched many missions to explore space and study Earth.', 'NASA đã phóng nhiều sứ mệnh để khám phá không gian và nghiên cứu Trái Đất.', '{\"en\": \"NASA is collaborating with private companies to develop new technology for future space missions.\", \"vi\": \"NASA đang hợp tác với các công ty tư nhân để phát triển công nghệ mới cho các sứ mệnh không gian tương lai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-ljspeech-d7a5ffd7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-cori-d7a5ffd7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nasa-94c1f09f.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"NASA mission\", \"meaning\": \"sứ mệnh của NASA\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work for NASA\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc cho NASA\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-cori-d7a5ffd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-aru0-d7a5ffd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-aru5-d7a5ffd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-aru6-d7a5ffd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-aru10-d7a5ffd7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-aru9-d7a5ffd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-aru3-d7a5ffd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-aru7-d7a5ffd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-aru8-d7a5ffd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-aru2-d7a5ffd7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-ljspeech-d7a5ffd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-lt408-d7a5ffd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-lt138-d7a5ffd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-lt624-d7a5ffd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-lt396-d7a5ffd7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-lt498-d7a5ffd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-lt132-d7a5ffd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-lt288-d7a5ffd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-lt42-d7a5ffd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasa-lt90-d7a5ffd7.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết tắt của National Aeronautics and Space Administration.', 'technology', 1, 19),
('c67d0452-5877-57ca-a557-455bb91a4c79', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '487ab82a-aa40-5480-9267-a8f9ffdc02bc', '924c7d35-ee5c-5051-8081-94892b40e66a', 'competitor', 'UK: /kəmˈpɛtɪtə/ | US: /kəmˈpɛtɪtər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'đối thủ cạnh tranh', 'a business entity or person offering similar products or services in the same market', 'Our main competitor just launched a similar product.', 'Đối thủ cạnh tranh chính của chúng tôi vừa ra mắt một sản phẩm tương tự.', '{\"en\": \"Our main competitor has just launched a new marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Đối thủ cạnh tranh chính của chúng tôi vừa mới tung ra một chiến dịch tiếp thị mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-ljspeech-52143c6b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-cori-52143c6b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/competitor-60e85dec.webp', '[\"rival\", \"opponent\", \"contender\"]', '[\"partner\", \"ally\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"main competitor\", \"meaning\": \"đối thủ cạnh tranh chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"outperform competitors\", \"meaning\": \"vượt trội hơn các đối thủ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"compete\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"competition\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"competitive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-cori-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru0-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru5-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru6-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru10-52143c6b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru9-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru3-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru7-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru8-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru2-52143c6b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-ljspeech-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt408-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt138-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt624-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt396-52143c6b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt498-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt132-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt288-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt42-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt90-52143c6b.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ đếm được chỉ một cá nhân hoặc công ty đối thủ (khác với \'competition\' vừa là danh từ không đếm được vừa mang nghĩa rộng hơn).', 'business strategy', 1, 20),
('049be5ea-eb6f-56ca-911a-aaf89649e39a', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '487ab82a-aa40-5480-9267-a8f9ffdc02bc', '924c7d35-ee5c-5051-8081-94892b40e66a', 'similar', 'UK: /ˈsɪmələ/ | US: /ˈsɪmələr/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'tương tự', 'having a resemblance in appearance, character, or quantity without being entirely identical.', 'The new design is similar to the old version.', 'Thiết kế mới tương tự phiên bản cũ.', '{\"en\": \"The new policy is very similar to the one implemented by our regional branch last year.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách mới rất tương tự với chính sách đã được chi nhánh khu vực áp dụng vào năm ngoái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-ljspeech-af62f302.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-cori-af62f302.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/similar-bf62002b.webp', '[\"alike\", \"comparable\", \"resembling\", \"equivalent\"]', '[\"different\", \"dissimilar\", \"unlike\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"similar to\", \"meaning\": \"tương tự với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in a similar manner\", \"meaning\": \"theo cách tương tự\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strikingly similar\", \"meaning\": \"giống nhau một cách kinh ngạc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"same\", \"note_vi\": \"same là hoàn toàn giống hệt (đi với \'as\'), còn similar là tương tự/gần giống (đi với \'to\').\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"similarly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"similarity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-cori-af62f302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-aru0-af62f302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-aru5-af62f302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-aru6-af62f302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-aru10-af62f302.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-aru9-af62f302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-aru3-af62f302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-aru7-af62f302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-aru8-af62f302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-aru2-af62f302.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-ljspeech-af62f302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-lt408-af62f302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-lt138-af62f302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-lt624-af62f302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-lt396-af62f302.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-lt498-af62f302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-lt132-af62f302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-lt288-af62f302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-lt42-af62f302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/similar-lt90-af62f302.mp3\"]}}', 'Luôn đi với giới từ \'to\' (similar to something). Tránh dùng \'similar with\'.', 'general business', 1, 21),
('3395bca1-d00d-5d46-8de4-1a37c8b05046', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '487ab82a-aa40-5480-9267-a8f9ffdc02bc', '924c7d35-ee5c-5051-8081-94892b40e66a', 'afterlife', '/ˈɑːftəlaɪf/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cuộc sống được cho là tiếp diễn sau khi chết.', 'a life that some people believe exists after a person dies.', 'Many cultures have different beliefs about what happens in the afterlife.', 'Nhiều nền văn hóa có những niềm tin khác nhau về những gì xảy ra ở thế giới bên kia.', '{\"en\": \"The museum exhibition featured ancient artifacts related to beliefs about the afterlife.\", \"vi\": \"Triển lãm bảo tàng trưng bày các cổ vật liên quan đến tín ngưỡng về thế giới bên kia.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterlife-ljspeech-b73aec01.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterlife-cori-b73aec01.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/afterlife-3584ac28.webp', '[\"immortality\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"belief in an afterlife\", \"meaning\": \"niềm tin vào thế giới bên kia\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterlife-cori-b73aec01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterlife-aru0-b73aec01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterlife-aru5-b73aec01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterlife-aru6-b73aec01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterlife-aru10-b73aec01.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterlife-aru9-b73aec01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterlife-aru3-b73aec01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterlife-aru7-b73aec01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterlife-aru8-b73aec01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterlife-aru2-b73aec01.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterlife-ljspeech-b73aec01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/