('e7690b20-c8da-551d-b0e0-fddfea8e474f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4917b637-3a7b-5505-a373-06969c31dd51', '49feb4c8-4efc-584e-967c-a39869520bda', 'enlarge', '/ɪnˈlɑːdʒ/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Làm cho cái gì đó lớn hơn, mở rộng ra.', 'to expand the physical dimensions, volume, or scope of an object or area.', 'The business plans to enlarge its main office to accommodate more staff members.', 'Doanh nghiệp có kế hoạch mở rộng văn phòng chính để có chỗ cho thêm nhiều nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"The company decided to enlarge its main office building to accommodate new staff members.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã quyết định mở rộng tòa nhà văn phòng chính để tiếp nhận các nhân viên mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-ljspeech-15c0fd6d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-cori-15c0fd6d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enlarge-5796c1f9.webp', '[\"expand\", \"extend\", \"magnify\"]', '[\"shrink\", \"reduce\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"enlarge a photo\", \"meaning\": \"phóng to ảnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"enlarge a market\", \"meaning\": \"mở rộng thị trường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"expand\", \"note_vi\": \"expand là mở rộng quy mô/phạm vi, enlarge chú trọng tăng kích thước vật lý\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"enlargement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-cori-15c0fd6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-aru0-15c0fd6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-aru5-15c0fd6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-aru6-15c0fd6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-aru10-15c0fd6d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-aru9-15c0fd6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-aru3-15c0fd6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-aru7-15c0fd6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-aru8-15c0fd6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-aru2-15c0fd6d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-ljspeech-15c0fd6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-lt408-15c0fd6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-lt138-15c0fd6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-lt624-15c0fd6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-lt396-15c0fd6d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-lt498-15c0fd6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-lt132-15c0fd6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-lt288-15c0fd6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-lt42-15c0fd6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enlarge-lt90-15c0fd6d.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý tiền tố en- làm động từ hóa từ large.', 'office', 1, 1),
