('cf6d2b07-a6ba-5b2d-8336-0b29c1319d38', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4917b637-3a7b-5505-a373-06969c31dd51', '49feb4c8-4efc-584e-967c-a39869520bda', 'doubtful', '/ˈdaʊtfl/', '', 'adjective', 'Không chắc chắn, có khả năng không đúng hoặc không xảy ra.', 'not feeling sure about the truth or success of something that might happen.', 'It\'s doubtful whether the new policy will actually solve the problem.', 'Còn nghi ngờ liệu chính sách mới có thực sự giải quyết được vấn đề hay không.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was doubtful about the success of the project without additional funding from investors.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý cảm thấy nghi ngờ về sự thành công của dự án nếu không có thêm vốn từ nhà đầu tư.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-ljspeech-a66ad0d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-cori-a66ad0d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/doubtful-6d42fd57.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-cori-a66ad0d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-aru0-a66ad0d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-aru5-a66ad0d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-aru6-a66ad0d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-aru10-a66ad0d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-aru9-a66ad0d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-aru3-a66ad0d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-aru7-a66ad0d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-aru8-a66ad0d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-aru2-a66ad0d7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-ljspeech-a66ad0d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doubtful-lt408-a66ad0d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/p