('12cb6bb1-4c31-5867-9f96-8cf93df62884', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4917b637-3a7b-5505-a373-06969c31dd51', '49feb4c8-4efc-584e-967c-a39869520bda', 'yawn', '/jɔːn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cơn ngáp, hành động ngáp.', 'an involuntary opening of the mouth when one is tired or bored.', 'A big yawn escaped her lips, showing how tired she was.', 'Một cái ngáp lớn thoát ra khỏi môi cô ấy, cho thấy cô ấy mệt mỏi đến mức nào.', '{\"en\": \"He tried to hide a yawn during the presentation, but his colleagues noticed it.\", \"vi\": \"Anh ấy cố gắng che một cái ngáp trong buổi thuyết trình, nhưng các đồng nghiệp đã nhận ra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yawn-ljspeech-aff7d18a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yawn-cori-aff7d18a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/yawn-1aa940b9.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"suppress a yawn\", \"meaning\": \"kìm nén cơn ngáp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stifle a yawn\", \"meaning\": \"cố nén cái ngáp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"yawn\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yawn-cori-aff7d18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yawn-aru0-aff7d18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yawn-aru5-aff7d18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yawn-aru6-aff7d18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yawn-aru10-aff7d18a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yawn-aru9-aff7d18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yawn-aru3-aff7d18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yawn-aru7-aff7d18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yawn-aru8-aff7d18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yawn-aru2-aff7d18a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yawn-ljspeech-aff7d18a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yawn-lt408-aff7d18a.mp3\", \"/s