('872e6b6c-4ee4-52ef-bc30-13f126b77b9e', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4917b637-3a7b-5505-a373-06969c31dd51', '49feb4c8-4efc-584e-967c-a39869520bda', 'inform', '/ɪnˈfɔːm/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Cung cấp thông tin, báo tin cho ai đó.', 'to tell someone about something or give them facts or details about a topic.', 'The manager will inform all team members about the new project guidelines tomorrow morning.', 'Quản lý sẽ thông báo cho tất cả thành viên trong nhóm về các hướng dẫn dự án mới vào sáng mai.', '{\"en\": \"Please inform all department heads about the change in the meeting venue.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng thông báo cho tất cả trưởng phòng về sự thay đổi địa điểm họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-ljspeech-c44cec63.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-cori-c44cec63.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inform-39a402bd.webp', '[\"notify\", \"advise\", \"alert\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"inform someone of\", \"meaning\": \"thông báo cho ai về điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keep informed\", \"meaning\": \"giữ cho ai được cập nhật thông tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inform in advance\", \"meaning\": \"thông báo trước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"notify\", \"note_vi\": \"notify mang tính chính thức hơn, inform dùng được cả văn nói lẫn văn viết\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"information\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"informative\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"informed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-cori-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru0-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru5-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru6-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru10-c44cec63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru9-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru3-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru7-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru8-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-aru2-c44cec63.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-ljspeech-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt408-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt138-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt624-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt396-c44cec63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt498-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt132-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt288-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt42-c44cec63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inform-lt90-c44cec63.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc hay gặp: inform + someone + of/about + something; đừng nói \'inform to someone\'.', 'office', 1, 28),
('fd8e49e0-6c07-55eb-99f1-e23477262fce', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4917b637-3a7b-5505-a373-06969c31dd51', '49feb4c8-4efc-584e-967c-a39869520bda', 'historic', 'UK: /hɪˈstɒrɪk/ | US: /hɪˈstɔːrɪk/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'lịch sử (thuộc về lịch sử)', 'Having great importance in relation to past events or important moments in time.', 'The city is dedicated to preserving its historic structures for future generations.', 'Thành phố cam kết bảo tồn các công trình lịch sử của mình cho các thế hệ tương lai.', '{\"en\": \"The two companies signed a historic merger agreement yesterday after months of negotiation.\", \"vi\": \"Hai công ty đã ký một thỏa thuận sáp nhập mang tính lịch sử vào ngày hôm qua sau nhiều tháng đàm phán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-ljspeech-f13122a4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-cori-f13122a4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/historic-b1521209.webp', '[\"significant\", \"momentous\", \"landmark\"]', '[\"unremarkable\", \"insignificant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"historic agreement\", \"meaning\": \"thỏa thuận mang tính lịch sử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"historic event\", \"meaning\": \"sự kiện lịch sử quan trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"historical\", \"note_vi\": \"chỉ những gì thuộc về quá khứ/lịch sử nói chung (vd: historical documents/novels), không nhất thiết là sự kiện trọng đại\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"history\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"historical\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"historically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-cori-f13122a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-aru0-f13122a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-aru5-f13122a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-aru6-f13122a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-aru10-f13122a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-aru9-f13122a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-aru3-f13122a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-aru7-f13122a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-aru8-f13122a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-aru2-f13122a4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-ljspeech-f13122a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-lt408-f13122a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-lt138-f13122a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-lt624-f13122a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-lt396-f13122a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-lt498-f13122a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-lt132-f13122a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-lt288-f13122a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-lt42-f13122a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/historic-lt90-f13122a4.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'historic\' (mang tính lịch sử, trọng đại) với \'historical\' (thuộc về lịch sử, liên quan tới quá khứ).', 'business', 1, 29),
('6d05368f-c8b3-5d14-b0a5-becfd06258de', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4b36b96b-cc52-5535-8be1-1896658aa6c5', 'b5f8f8ae-d2e7-5b21-8d2b-9b4261a8cf20', 'motivating', '/ˈməʊtɪveɪt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng thúc đẩy, tạo động lực.', 'providing enthusiasm and encouraging someone to achieve a goal.', 'Her speech was incredibly motivating and inspired many students to pursue their dreams.', 'Bài phát biểu của cô ấy cực kỳ tạo động lực và đã truyền cảm hứng cho nhiều sinh viên theo đuổi ước mơ của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager delivered a motivating speech to boost team morale before the product launch.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã đưa ra một bài phát biểu đầy động lực để nâng cao tinh thần đội ngũ trước khi ra mắt sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-ljspeech-22f82c37.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-cori-22f82c37.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/motivating-5b42a213.webp', '[\"inspiring\", \"encouraging\", \"stimulating\"]', '[\"discouraging\", \"demotivating\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"motivating factor\", \"meaning\": \"yếu tố tạo động lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"motivating speech\", \"meaning\": \"bài phát biểu truyền động lực\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"motivated\", \"note_vi\": \"motivating miêu tả vật/sự việc tạo ra động lực, motivated miêu tả người có động lực.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"motivate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"motivation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"motivated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-cori-22f82c37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-aru0-22f82c37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-aru5-22f82c37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-aru6-22f82c37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-aru10-22f82c37.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-aru9-22f82c37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-aru3-22f82c37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-aru7-22f82c37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-aru8-22f82c37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-aru2-22f82c37.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-ljspeech-22f82c37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-lt408-22f82c37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-lt138-22f82c37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-lt624-22f82c37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-lt396-22f82c37.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-lt498-22f82c37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-lt132-22f82c37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-lt288-22f82c37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-lt42-22f82c37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motivating-lt90-22f82c37.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'motivated\' dùng cho cảm xúc con người.', 'hr', 1, 0),
('5d16a2cf-3a2a-5ff9-b06f-be4958c55ca5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4b36b96b-cc52-5535-8be1-1896658aa6c5', 'b5f8f8ae-d2e7-5b21-8d2b-9b4261a8cf20', 'terrific', '/təˈrɪfɪk/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất tuyệt vời, xuất sắc hoặc cực kỳ tốt.', 'extremely good, wonderful, or impressive in quality or amount.', 'The sales team achieved a terrific result during the fourth quarter sales drive.', 'Đội ngũ kinh doanh đã đạt được một kết quả tuyệt vời trong chiến dịch bán hàng quý IV.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team did a terrific job organizing the international product launch event.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã làm một công việc tuyệt vời khi tổ chức sự kiện ra mắt sản phẩm quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-ljspeech-6c80e648.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-cori-6c80e648.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/terrific-78311124.webp', '[\"excellent\", \"wonderful\", \"fantastic\"]', '[\"terrible\", \"awful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"terrific job\", \"meaning\": \"công việc tuyệt vời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"terrific success\", \"meaning\": \"thành công rực rỡ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"terrible\", \"note_vi\": \"Terrific mang nghĩa rất tốt/tuyệt vời, trong khi terrible nghĩa là rất tồi tệ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"terrifically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-cori-6c80e648.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-aru0-6c80e648.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-aru5-6c80e648.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-aru6-6c80e648.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-aru10-6c80e648.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-aru9-6c80e648.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-aru3-6c80e648.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-aru7-6c80e648.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-aru8-6c80e648.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-aru2-6c80e648.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-ljspeech-6c80e648.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-lt408-6c80e648.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-lt138-6c80e648.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-lt624-6c80e648.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-lt396-6c80e648.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-lt498-6c80e648.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-lt132-6c80e648.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-lt288-6c80e648.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-lt42-6c80e648.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrific-lt90-6c80e648.mp3\"]}}', 'Cảnh báo: Dù có gốc từ gần giống terrible, terrific mang nghĩa cực kỳ tốt chứ không xấu.', 'marketing', 1, 1),
('ce0180c2-4c69-5853-9f45-4fa38efdc6ab', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4b36b96b-cc52-5535-8be1-1896658aa6c5', 'b5f8f8ae-d2e7-5b21-8d2b-9b4261a8cf20', 'listen', '/ˈlɪsn/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Chú ý lắng nghe âm thanh hoặc lời nói.', 'to give attention to someone or something in order to hear them.', 'Employees are encouraged to listen attentively to the keynote speech at the seminar.', 'Nhân viên được khuyến khích lắng nghe chăm chú bài phát biểu chính tại hội thảo.', '{\"en\": \"Customer service representatives must listen carefully to client complaints to resolve issues effectively.\", \"vi\": \"Đại diện dịch vụ khách hàng phải lắng nghe cẩn thận khiếu nại của khách để giải quyết vấn đề hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-ljspeech-2147a9e5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-cori-2147a9e5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/listen-a2ffe9ef.webp', '[\"hear\", \"attend\"]', '[\"ignore\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"listen carefully\", \"meaning\": \"lắng nghe cẩn thận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"listen closely\", \"meaning\": \"lắng nghe kỹ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hear\", \"note_vi\": \"hear là nghe thụ động, listen là lắng nghe có chủ đích.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"listener\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"listening\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-cori-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru0-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru5-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru6-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru10-2147a9e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru9-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru3-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru7-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru8-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-aru2-2147a9e5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-ljspeech-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt408-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt138-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt624-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt396-2147a9e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt498-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt132-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt288-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt42-2147a9e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listen-lt90-2147a9e5.mp3\"]}}', 'Luôn đi với giới từ \"to\" khi có tân ngữ theo sau (listen to me).', 'hr', 1, 2),
('7b2569fa-0e88-5e60-aa72-ac2a6ff9bb7c', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4b36b96b-cc52-5535-8be1-1896658aa6c5', 'b5f8f8ae-d2e7-5b21-8d2b-9b4261a8cf20', 'clearly', '/ˈklɪəli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Một cách rõ ràng, dễ hiểu hoặc dễ thấy.', 'in a way that is easy to see, hear, read, or understand.', 'The new safety guidelines were clearly displayed on the notice board near the entrance.', 'Các hướng dẫn an toàn mới đã được hiển thị rõ ràng trên bảng thông báo gần lối vào.', '{\"en\": \"Please state your name and employee number clearly when leaving a voice message.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đọc rõ tên và mã số nhân viên của bạn khi để lại tin nhắn thoại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-ljspeech-27eddd83.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-cori-27eddd83.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clearly-ef9a71b7.webp', '[\"obviously\", \"evidently\", \"plainly\"]', '[\"vaguely\", \"unclearly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"state clearly\", \"meaning\": \"trình bày rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"see clearly\", \"meaning\": \"nhìn rõ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clearly understand\", \"meaning\": \"hiểu rõ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"clear\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"clarify\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-cori-27eddd83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-aru0-27eddd83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-aru5-27eddd83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-aru6-27eddd83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-aru10-27eddd83.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-aru9-27eddd83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-aru3-27eddd83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-aru7-27eddd83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-aru8-27eddd83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-aru2-27eddd83.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-ljspeech-27eddd83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-lt408-27eddd83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-lt138-27eddd83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-lt624-27eddd83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-lt396-27eddd83.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-lt498-27eddd83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-lt132-27eddd83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-lt288-27eddd83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-lt42-27eddd83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clearly-lt90-27eddd83.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với các động từ chỉ sự giao tiếp như state, explain, speak.', 'office', 1, 3),
('cd116635-4f88-526e-930f-ad74bea7d6de', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4b36b96b-cc52-5535-8be1-1896658aa6c5', 'b5f8f8ae-d2e7-5b21-8d2b-9b4261a8cf20', 'enterprise', '/ˈentəpraɪz/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một dự án hoặc công việc khó khăn, phức tạp hoặc quan trọng; một công ty.', 'a large business organization or a difficult project that requires effort.', 'The government offers grants to support joint commercial enterprises in rural areas.', 'Chính phủ cung cấp các khoản tài trợ để hỗ trợ các tổ chức kinh doanh liên doanh ở khu vực nông thôn.', '{\"en\": \"The government offers special tax benefits to encourage the growth of small and medium enterprise.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ cung cấp các ưu đãi thuế đặc biệt để khuyến khích sự phát triển của doanh nghiệp vừa và nhỏ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-ljspeech-052a3c16.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-cori-052a3c16.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enterprise-6d3af114.webp', '[\"business\", \"company\", \"venture\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"private enterprise\", \"meaning\": \"doanh nghiệp tư nhân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"joint enterprise\", \"meaning\": \"dự án liên doanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"entrepreneur\", \"note_vi\": \"entrepreneur là doanh nhân, enterprise là doanh nghiệp\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"enterprising\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-cori-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-aru0-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-aru5-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-aru6-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-aru10-052a3c16.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-aru9-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-aru3-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-aru7-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-aru8-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-aru2-052a3c16.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-ljspeech-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-lt408-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-lt138-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-lt624-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-lt396-052a3c16.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-lt498-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-lt132-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-lt288-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-lt42-052a3c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enterprise-lt90-052a3c16.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thường dùng trang trọng hơn \'business\' hoặc \'company\'.', 'business', 1, 4),
('4673a5e2-d547-5713-b968-57415e621eb3', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4b36b96b-cc52-5535-8be1-1896658aa6c5', 'b5f8f8ae-d2e7-5b21-8d2b-9b4261a8cf20', 'greedy', '/ˈɡriːdi/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Muốn có nhiều hơn mức cần thiết, đặc biệt là tiền hoặc thức ăn.', 'wanting more money, food, or power than you really need.', 'The greedy king always wanted more gold, even though his kingdom was already rich.', 'Vị vua tham lam luôn muốn có thêm vàng, mặc dù vương quốc của ông đã giàu có rồi.', '{\"en\": \"The firm lost several loyal clients due to greedy price hikes during the crisis.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã mất nhiều khách hàng thân thiết do việc tăng giá tham lam trong đợt khủng hoảng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-ljspeech-0793b775.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-cori-0793b775.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/greedy-ff451386.webp', '[\"avaricious\", \"grasping\"]', '[\"generous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"greedy for power\", \"meaning\": \"tham vọng quyền lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"greedy behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi tham lam\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"needy\", \"note_vi\": \"greedy là tham lam; needy là nghèo khổ, túng thiếu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"greed\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"greedily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-cori-0793b775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-aru0-0793b775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-aru5-0793b775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-aru6-0793b775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-aru10-0793b775.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-aru9-0793b775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-aru3-0793b775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-aru7-0793b775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-aru8-0793b775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-aru2-0793b775.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-ljspeech-0793b775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-lt408-0793b775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-lt138-0793b775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-lt624-0793b775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-lt396-0793b775.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-lt498-0793b775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-lt132-0793b775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-lt288-0793b775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-lt42-0793b775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/greedy-lt90-0793b775.mp3\"]}}', 'Greedy mang sắc thái tiêu cực, diễn tả sự thèm muốn thái quá.', 'business', 1, 5),
('709f48b1-8d1d-5489-b292-2d32eb529147', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4b36b96b-cc52-5535-8be1-1896658aa6c5', 'b5f8f8ae-d2e7-5b21-8d2b-9b4261a8cf20', 'praise', '/pɹeɪz/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Khen ngợi, bày tỏ sự ngưỡng mộ hoặc tán thành.', 'To publicly show appreciation or commend the high quality of a person\'s achievements.', 'The teacher praised her students for their hard work on the project.', 'Giáo viên đã khen ngợi học sinh của mình vì đã làm việc chăm chỉ trong dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The manager decided to praise the sales team for achieving their quarterly targets.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã quyết định khen ngợi đội ngũ bán hàng vì đạt được các mục tiêu quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praise-ljspeech-59dfae37.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praise-cori-59dfae37.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/praise-280e3a43.webp', '[\"commend\", \"applaud\"]', '[\"criticize\", \"blame\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"praise highly\", \"meaning\": \"khen ngợi hết lời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"praise publicly\", \"meaning\": \"khen ngợi công khai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"appraise\", \"note_vi\": \"appraise nghĩa là định giá, đánh giá; praise là khen ngợi\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"praise\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"praiseworthy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praise-cori-59dfae37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praise-aru0-59dfae37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praise-aru5-59dfae37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praise-aru6-59dfae37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praise-aru10-59dfae37.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praise-aru9-59dfae37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praise-aru3-59dfae37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praise-aru7-59dfae37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pr