('5d144747-ba98-5a00-bba0-5829079f994c', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4b36b96b-cc52-5535-8be1-1896658aa6c5', 'b5f8f8ae-d2e7-5b21-8d2b-9b4261a8cf20', 'increase', '/ɪnˈkriːs/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Làm cho lớn hơn về số lượng, kích thước hoặc mức độ.', 'to make something larger in amount, size, or degree than it was before.', 'The company plans to increase its production next quarter.', 'Công ty dự định tăng sản lượng vào quý tới.', '{\"en\": \"We need to increase our output to meet the growing demand from our overseas clients.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần tăng sản lượng để đáp ứng nhu cầu ngày càng tăng từ các khách hàng nước ngoài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-ljspeech-f9c9758a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-cori-f9c9758a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/increase-d321e0a5.webp', '[\"boost\", \"expand\"]', '[\"decrease\", \"reduce\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"increase production\", \"meaning\": \"tăng sản xuất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"increase efficiency\", \"meaning\": \"tăng hiệu quả\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"raise\", \"note_vi\": \"thường dùng với tân ngữ trực tiếp (raise prices).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"increase\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"increasingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-cori-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru0-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru5-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru6-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru10-f9c9758a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru9-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru3-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru7-f9c9758a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increase-aru