('e56aad9a-66fc-5785-8033-58fa369fee47', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4b36b96b-cc52-5535-8be1-1896658aa6c5', 'b5f8f8ae-d2e7-5b21-8d2b-9b4261a8cf20', 'design', '/dɪˈzaɪn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Kế hoạch hoặc bản vẽ chi tiết về cách một thứ gì đó sẽ được tạo ra.', 'a detailed blueprint or specification outlining the appearance, structure, and operation of an object.', 'The new building has a very modern and innovative design.', 'Tòa nhà mới có một thiết kế rất hiện đại và đổi mới.', '{\"en\": \"The client approved the final design for the corporate website after several revisions.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng đã phê duyệt thiết kế cuối cùng cho trang web doanh nghiệp sau nhiều lần sửa đổi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-ljspeech-056f1182.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-cori-056f1182.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/design-9471173f.webp', '[\"plan\", \"layout\", \"blueprint\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"interior design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế nội thất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"graphic design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế đồ họa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"assign\", \"note_vi\": \"assign là phân công công việc, design là thiết kế\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"design\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"designer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-cori-056f1182.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-aru0-056f1182.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-aru5-056f1182.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-aru6-056f1182.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-aru10-056f1182.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-aru9-056f1182.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-aru3-056f1182.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-aru7-056f1182.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-aru8-056f1182.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-aru2-056f1182.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-ljspeech-056f1182.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-lt408-056f1182.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-lt138-056f1182.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-lt624-056f1182.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-lt396-056f1182.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-lt498-056f1182.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-lt132-056f1182.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-lt288-056f1182.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-lt42-056f1182.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/design-lt90-056f1182.mp3\"]}}', 'Design vừa là danh từ (bản thiết kế) vừa là động từ (thiết kế).', 'marketing', 1, 12),
('97ccf264-80a5-55a8-b8d2-06282c2fe7f9', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4b36b96b-cc52-5535-8be1-1896658aa6c5', 'b5f8f8ae-d2e7-5b21-8d2b-9b4261a8cf20', 'pasta', '/ˈpæstə/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Món ăn làm từ bột mì, nước, thường có hình dạng khác nhau, nguồn gốc Ý.', 'a type of food made from flour and water, shaped in various forms, originally from italy.', 'My favorite dish at the Italian restaurant is the creamy tomato pasta.', 'Món ăn yêu thích của tôi ở nhà hàng Ý là mì ống sốt cà chua kem.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel restaurant offers a special pasta dish on its lunch menu every Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng khách sạn phục vụ một món pasta đặc biệt trong thực đơn bữa trưa mỗi thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-ljspeech-46139b0b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-cori-46139b0b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pasta-6d8eb8d3.webp', '[\"noodles\", \"macaroni\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cook pasta\", \"meaning\": \"nấu mì ống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pasta dish\", \"meaning\": \"món ăn từ mì ống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pasta sauce\", \"meaning\": \"nước sốt mì ống\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pastry\", \"note_vi\": \"pastry là bánh ngọt làm từ bột, không phải mì ống\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-cori-46139b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-aru0-46139b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-aru5-46139b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-aru6-46139b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-aru10-46139b0b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-aru9-46139b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-aru3-46139b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-aru7-46139b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-aru8-46139b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-aru2-46139b0b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-ljspeech-46139b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-lt408-46139b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-lt138-46139b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-lt624-46139b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-lt396-46139b0b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-lt498-46139b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-lt132-46139b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-lt288-46139b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-lt42-46139b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pasta-lt90-46139b0b.mp3\"]}}', '\'Pasta\' không có số nhiều thông thường; nói \'a plate of pasta\', không nói \'pastas\'.', 'dining', 1, 13),
('ec355801-e7e0-5bb6-a52b-80f5d5e87888', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4b36b96b-cc52-5535-8be1-1896658aa6c5', 'b5f8f8ae-d2e7-5b21-8d2b-9b4261a8cf20', 'on purpose', '/ɒn ˈpɜːpəs/', 'B1', 'phrase', 'Có chủ đích, không phải ngẫu nhiên.', 'done in a way that is planned or intended, not by accident.', 'He left the door unlocked on purpose so his cat could go in and out.', 'Anh ấy cố tình không khóa cửa để mèo có thể ra vào.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor did not delete the file on purpose; it was a technical error.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát không cố ý xóa tệp tin đó; đó là một lỗi kỹ thuật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-purpose-ljspeech-55eb437b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-purpose-cori-55eb437b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/on-purpose-200b913f.webp', '[\"intentionally\", \"deliberately\"]', '[\"accidentally\", \"unintentionally\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"do something on purpose\", \"meaning\": \"cố tình làm gì đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"not on purpose\", \"meaning\": \"không cố ý\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-purpose-cori-55eb437b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-purpose-aru0-55eb437b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-purpose-aru5-55eb437b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-purpose-aru6-55eb437b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-purpose-aru10-55eb437b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-purpose-aru9-55eb437b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-purpose-aru3-55eb437b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-purpose-aru7-55eb437b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-purpose-aru8-55eb437b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-purpose-aru2-55eb437b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-purpose-