('d7eadaee-ba98-53a1-a060-8a141d894bb9', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4b36b96b-cc52-5535-8be1-1896658aa6c5', 'b5f8f8ae-d2e7-5b21-8d2b-9b4261a8cf20', 'rainbow', '/ˈreɪnbəʊ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Vòng cung nhiều màu sắc xuất hiện trên bầu trời sau mưa.', 'a curved line of bright colors appearing in the sky when rain falls.', 'After the rain, a beautiful rainbow appeared across the sky.', 'Sau cơn mưa, một cầu vồng tuyệt đẹp hiện ra trên bầu trời.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency launched a campaign featuring a rainbow logo to attract customers.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch đã khởi động chiến dịch có biểu trưng cầu vồng để thu hút khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainbow-ljspeech-f1eb08c4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainbow-cori-f1eb08c4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rainbow-d42bc122.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"chase rainbows\", \"meaning\": \"theo đuổi ước mơ viển vông\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rainbow colors\", \"meaning\": \"các màu sắc cầu vồng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainbow-cori-f1eb08c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainbow-aru0-f1eb08c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainbow-aru5-f1eb08c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainbow-aru6-f1eb08c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainbow-aru10-f1eb08c4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainbow-aru9-f1eb08c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainbow-aru3-f1eb08c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainbow-aru7-f1eb08c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainbow-aru8-f1eb08c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainbow-aru2-f1eb08c4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainbow-ljspeech-f1eb08c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/p