('ee8a329b-d712-5914-8298-a1780b8a2554', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4b36b96b-cc52-5535-8be1-1896658aa6c5', 'b5f8f8ae-d2e7-5b21-8d2b-9b4261a8cf20', 'scale', '/skeɪl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Kích thước, mức độ hoặc phạm vi của một cái gì đó.', 'the size or extent of something, often used to describe large business operations.', 'This emergency response plan was designed for events on a massive scale.', 'Kế hoạch ứng phó khẩn cấp này được thiết kế cho các sự kiện trên quy mô lớn.', '{\"en\": \"We need to analyze the scale of the project before allocating more budget to it.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần phân tích quy mô của dự án trước khi phân bổ thêm ngân sách cho nó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-ljspeech-60020d1b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-cori-60020d1b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scale-687fae73.webp', '[\"size\", \"extent\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"large scale\", \"meaning\": \"quy mô lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"global scale\", \"meaning\": \"quy mô toàn cầu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"scalable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-cori-60020d1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-aru0-60020d1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-aru5-60020d1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-aru6-60020d1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-aru10-60020d1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-aru9-60020d1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-aru3-60020d1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-aru7-60020d1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-aru8-60020d1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-aru2-60020d1b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-ljspeech-60020d1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-lt408-60020d1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-lt138-60020d1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-lt624-60020d1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-lt396-60020d1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-lt498-60020d1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-lt132-60020d1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-lt288-60020d1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-lt42-60020d1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scale-lt90-60020d1b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với \'on a ... scale\'.', 'business', 1, 28),
('b3d8190f-00dd-5729-8e98-cd51eaad763e', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4b36b96b-cc52-5535-8be1-1896658aa6c5', 'b5f8f8ae-d2e7-5b21-8d2b-9b4261a8cf20', 'occasionally', '/əˈkeɪʒənəli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Đôi khi, không thường xuyên.', 'Happening from time to time, but without any fixed schedule or high frequency.', 'We occasionally go out for dinner, maybe once or twice a month.', 'Thỉnh thoảng chúng tôi đi ăn tối bên ngoài, có lẽ một hoặc hai lần một tháng.', '{\"en\": \"The director occasionally visits the branch office to review operations and meet staff.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc thỉnh thoảng đến thăm văn phòng chi nhánh để xem xét hoạt động và gặp gỡ nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-ljspeech-11b0b7df.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-cori-11b0b7df.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/occasionally-27aa0f63.webp', '[\"sometimes\", \"from time to time\", \"now and then\"]', '[\"always\", \"constantly\", \"regularly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"occasionally visit\", \"meaning\": \"thỉnh thoảng ghé thăm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"occasionally happen\", \"meaning\": \"thỉnh thoảng xảy ra\"}, {\"phrase\": \"only occasionally\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ thỉnh thoảng thôi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rarely\", \"note_vi\": \"rarely nghĩa là hiếm khi (ít hơn occasionally), occasionally là đôi khi\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"occasional\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"occasion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-cori-11b0b7df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-aru0-11b0b7df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-aru5-11b0b7df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-aru6-11b0b7df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-aru10-11b0b7df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-aru9-11b0b7df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-aru3-11b0b7df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-aru7-11b0b7df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-aru8-11b0b7df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-aru2-11b0b7df.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-ljspeech-11b0b7df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-lt408-11b0b7df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-lt138-11b0b7df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-lt624-11b0b7df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-lt396-11b0b7df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-lt498-11b0b7df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-lt132-11b0b7df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-lt288-11b0b7df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-lt42-11b0b7df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/occasionally-lt90-11b0b7df.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt tần suất: always > usually > often > sometimes > occasionally > rarely > never.', 'office', 1, 29),
('8a2127c5-6618-57c7-ad36-b4a93b5deb73', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4ccb785c-644a-51b8-a446-4f7608873000', 'b1db80e2-2db3-59ed-bd0d-6b5caa356601', 'site', 'UK: /saɪt/ | US: /saɪt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'địa điểm, vị trí', 'an area of ground set aside or used for a specific purpose or building project.', 'The company is looking for a new construction site.', 'Công ty đang tìm một địa điểm xây dựng mới.', '{\"en\": \"Safety inspectors visited the construction site to ensure all workers were wearing hard hats.\", \"vi\": \"Các thanh tra an toàn đã đến thăm công trường xây dựng để đảm bảo tất cả công nhân đều đội mũ bảo hộ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/site-ljspeech-c099a42a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/site-cori-c099a42a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/site-7fad4da7.webp', '[\"location\", \"place\", \"spot\", \"venue\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"construction site\", \"meaning\": \"công trường xây dựng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"on site\", \"meaning\": \"tại chỗ / tại hiện trường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"site inspection\", \"meaning\": \"sự kiểm tra tại hiện trường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sight\", \"note_vi\": \"sight là thị lực / tầm nhìn / cảnh vật, còn site là địa điểm / vị trí / trang web.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"site\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/site-cori-c099a42a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/site-aru0-c099a42a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/site-aru5-c099a42a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/site-aru6-c099a42a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/site-aru10-c099a42a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/site-aru9-c099a42a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/site-aru3-c099a42a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/site-aru7-c099a42a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/