('2bd7c340-a3e3-54ff-aaa0-97f588bcafbc', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4ccb785c-644a-51b8-a446-4f7608873000', 'b1db80e2-2db3-59ed-bd0d-6b5caa356601', 'completely', '/kəmˈpliːtli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Một cách đầy đủ, không thiếu sót phần nào.', 'to the greatest extent or degree; in every part or detail.', 'The puzzle was so difficult that I couldn\'t solve it completely.', 'Câu đố khó đến mức tôi không thể giải nó hoàn toàn.', '{\"en\": \"The renovation of the office building was completely finished before the grand opening date.\", \"vi\": \"Việc cải tạo tòa nhà văn phòng đã hoàn thành hoàn toàn trước ngày khai trương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completely-ljspeech-36152587.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completely-cori-36152587.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/completely-e7381848.webp', '[\"entirely\", \"totally\"]', '[\"partially\", \"slightly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"completely finished\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn thành hoàn toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"completely different\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn khác biệt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"complete\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completely-cori-36152587.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completely-aru0-36152587.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completely-aru5-36152587.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completely-aru6-36152587.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completely-aru10-36152587.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completely-aru9-36152587.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completely-aru3-36152587.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completely-aru7-36152587.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completely-aru8-36152587.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completely-aru2-36152587.mp3\"]},