('33ed1d20-03ad-5c12-8513-5c7c6339a817', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4ccb785c-644a-51b8-a446-4f7608873000', 'b1db80e2-2db3-59ed-bd0d-6b5caa356601', 'colonel', '/ˈkɜːnl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cấp bậc sĩ quan cao cấp trong quân đội, trên thiếu tá.', 'an officer of high rank in an army, navy, or air force.', 'The colonel gave clear orders to his troops before the mission.', 'Vị đại tá đã ra lệnh rõ ràng cho binh lính của mình trước khi làm nhiệm vụ.', '{\"en\": \"The retired colonel was hired as a senior security consultant for the international firm.\", \"vi\": \"Vị đại tá đã nghỉ hưu đã được thuê làm cố vấn an ninh cao cấp cho công ty quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-ljspeech-af3926c3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-cori-af3926c3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/colonel-b1b63139.webp', '[\"commander\", \"officer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"army colonel\", \"meaning\": \"đại tá quân đội\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"kernel\", \"note_vi\": \"Kernel (hạt nhân) phát âm giống hệt colonel nhưng khác nghĩa và viết.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-cori-af3926c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-aru0-af3926c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-aru5-af3926c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-aru6-af3926c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-aru10-af3926c3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-aru9-af3926c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-aru3-af3926c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-aru7-af3926c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-aru8-af3926c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-aru2-af3926c3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-ljspeech-af3926c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-lt408-af3926c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-lt138-af3926c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-lt624-af3926c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-lt396-af3926c3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-lt498-af3926c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-lt132-af3926c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-lt288-af3926c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-lt42-af3926c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colonel-lt90-af3926c3.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này phát âm là /ˈkɜːnəl/ (âm \'l\' đầu tiên là âm câm).', 'other', 1, 22),
('e12ddf6f-6ce0-5310-8fad-274f8be7c1a5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4ccb785c-644a-51b8-a446-4f7608873000', 'b1db80e2-2db3-59ed-bd0d-6b5caa356601', 'benefit', 'UK: /ˈbɛn.ɪ.fɪt/ | US: /ˈbɛn.ə.fɪt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'lợi ích', 'an advantage or helpful effect that something provides to a person or system.', 'The new policy will bring many benefits to our employees.', 'Chính sách mới sẽ mang lại nhiều lợi ích cho nhân viên của chúng ta.', '{\"en\": \"Our company offers a competitive salary along with an attractive benefits package.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi cung cấp mức lương cạnh tranh cùng gói phúc lợi hấp dẫn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-ljspeech-2124037c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-cori-2124037c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/benefit-a64e4a41.webp', '[\"advantage\", \"gain\", \"profit\", \"perk\"]', '[\"disadvantage\", \"drawback\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"employee benefits\", \"meaning\": \"phúc lợi cho nhân viên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fringe benefits\", \"meaning\": \"phúc lợi phụ trội\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"benefit\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"beneficial\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-cori-2124037c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-aru0-2124037c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-aru5-2124037c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-aru6-2124037c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-aru10-2124037c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-aru9-2124037c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-aru3-2124037c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-aru7-2124037c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-aru8-2124037c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-aru2-2124037c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-ljspeech-2124037c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-lt408-2124037c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-lt138-2124037c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-lt624-2124037c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-lt396-2124037c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-lt498-2124037c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-lt132-2124037c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-lt288-2124037c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-lt42-2124037c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benefit-lt90-2124037c.mp3\"]}}', '\'Employee benefits\' là cụm từ rất phổ biến trong bài thi TOEIC, chỉ các chế độ đãi ngộ ngoài lương.', 'human resources', 1, 23),
('f13edbb2-5769-541e-bd60-820c5839b822', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4ccb785c-644a-51b8-a446-4f7608873000', 'b1db80e2-2db3-59ed-bd0d-6b5caa356601', 'unbelievable', '/ˌʌnbɪˈliːvəbl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Khó tin, phi thường hoặc gây ngạc nhiên.', 'so extraordinary that it is difficult for people to accept as true.', 'The magician performed an unbelievable trick that left everyone speechless.', 'Nhà ảo thuật đã biểu diễn một màn ảo thuật không thể tin được khiến mọi người chết lặng.', '{\"en\": \"The sales team achieved an unbelievable target in just one quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ bán hàng đạt chỉ tiêu khó tin chỉ trong một quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-ljspeech-80927930.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-cori-80927930.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unbelievable-7687d08a.webp', '[\"incredible\", \"amazing\", \"astonishing\"]', '[\"believable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unbelievable story\", \"meaning\": \"câu chuyện khó tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unbelievable price\", \"meaning\": \"giá cực tốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unbelievable speed\", \"meaning\": \"tốc độ phi thường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unbreakable\", \"note_vi\": \"unbreakable nghĩa là không thể vỡ, không phải khó tin.\"}, {\"word\": \"believable\", \"note_vi\": \"believable là có thể tin, trái nghĩa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"unbelievably\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"believe\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-cori-80927930.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-aru0-80927930.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-aru5-80927930.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-aru6-80927930.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-aru10-80927930.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-aru9-80927930.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-aru3-80927930.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-aru7-80927930.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-aru8-80927930.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-aru2-80927930.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-ljspeech-80927930.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-lt408-80927930.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-lt138-80927930.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-lt624-80927930.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-lt396-80927930.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-lt498-80927930.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-lt132-80927930.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-lt288-80927930.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-lt42-80927930.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unbelievable-lt90-80927930.mp3\"]}}', 'Unbelievable = un + believe + able; không nhầm với unbreakable (không vỡ).', 'business', 1, 24),
('92e6431f-4650-5ba1-8bdc-0630cba4132f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4ccb785c-644a-51b8-a446-4f7608873000', 'b1db80e2-2db3-59ed-bd0d-6b5caa356601', 'simply', '/ˈsɪmpli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Một cách đơn giản, dễ hiểu.', 'in a way that is easy to understand or not complicated.', 'To solve this problem, you simply need to follow these three steps.', 'Để giải quyết vấn đề này, bạn chỉ cần làm theo ba bước này một cách đơn giản.', '{\"en\": \"You can simply submit the form online to complete your registration.\", \"vi\": \"Bạn chỉ cần nộp mẫu đơn trực tuyến để hoàn tất đăng ký.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simply-ljspeech-46ae5ea6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simply-cori-46ae5ea6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/simply-d0569205.webp', '[\"just\", \"merely\", \"plainly\"]', '[\"complexly\", \"elaborately\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"simply put\", \"meaning\": \"nói một cách đơn giản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"simply explained\", \"meaning\": \"được giải thích đơn giản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"quite simply\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn đơn giản mà nói\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"only\", \"note_vi\": \"\'only\' nhấn mạnh giới hạn, \'simply\' nhấn mạnh sự dễ dàng hoặc đơn giản\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"simple\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"simplify\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"simplicity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simply-cori-46ae5ea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simply-aru0-46ae5ea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simply-aru5-46ae5ea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simply-aru6-46ae5ea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simply-aru10-46ae5ea6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simply-aru9-46ae5ea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simply-aru3-46ae5ea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun