('175bc712-583b-5fc9-ba7a-07a65a561128', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '4ccb785c-644a-51b8-a446-4f7608873000', 'b1db80e2-2db3-59ed-bd0d-6b5caa356601', 'trying', '/ˈtraɪɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gây khó khăn, thử thách hoặc mệt mỏi.', 'causing a lot of stress or difficulty that requires patience to deal with successfully.', 'Moving to a new country can be a very trying experience.', 'Chuyển đến một đất nước mới có thể là một trải nghiệm rất khó khăn.', '{\"en\": \"Handling the difficult client during the busy season was a very trying task for the team.\", \"vi\": \"Việc xử lý vị khách khó tính trong mùa cao điểm là một nhiệm vụ đầy thử thách cho cả đội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trying-ljspeech-d33f85fc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trying-cori-d33f85fc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trying-8ed52a04.webp', '[\"difficult\", \"challenging\"]', '[\"easy\", \"pleasant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"trying time\", \"meaning\": \"thời gian khó khăn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"trying experience\", \"meaning\": \"trải nghiệm thử thách\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tiring\", \"note_vi\": \"tiring là gây mệt mỏi thể xác, trying là gây khó khăn/thử thách tinh thần.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"try\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trying-cori-d33f85fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trying-aru0-d33f85fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trying-aru5-d33f85fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trying-aru6-d33f85fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trying-aru10-d33f85fc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trying-aru9-d33f85fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trying-aru3-d33f85fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trying-aru7-d33f85fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trying-aru8-d33f85fc.mp3\"