('35abb734-63e6-5153-81db-fa28bb9b1489', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '56322a68-d531-5a89-9fae-368c98f8b9bd', '99d6c7c6-16a5-5472-8788-de271ad43aa5', 'browse', '/braʊz/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Nhìn lướt qua các trang sách, cửa hàng hoặc trang web.', 'to look through something in a relaxed and informal way without a specific goal.', 'I like to browse through old books at the second-hand shop.', 'Tôi thích đọc lướt qua những cuốn sách cũ ở cửa hàng đồ cũ.', '{\"en\": \"Clients can browse our new product catalog on the company portal.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng có thể xem lướt danh mục sản phẩm mới của chúng tôi trên cổng thông tin công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-ljspeech-0f6a24fa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-cori-0f6a24fa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/browse-79693834.webp', '[\"skim\", \"scan\", \"surf\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"browse the internet\", \"meaning\": \"lướt internet\"}, {\"phrase\": \"browse through\", \"meaning\": \"xem lướt qua\"}, {\"phrase\": \"browse online\", \"meaning\": \"duyệt web\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"search\", \"note_vi\": \"search là tìm kiếm có mục tiêu, browse là xem lướt tự do\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"browser\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"browsing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-cori-0f6a24fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-aru0-0f6a24fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-aru5-0f6a24fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-aru6-0f6a24fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-aru10-0f6a24fa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-aru9-0f6a24fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-aru3-0f6a24fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-aru7-0f6a24fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-aru8-0f6a24fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-aru2-0f6a24fa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-ljspeech-0f6a24fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-lt408-0f6a24fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-lt138-0f6a24fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-lt624-0f6a24fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-lt396-0f6a24fa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-lt498-0f6a24fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-lt132-0f6a24fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-lt288-0f6a24fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-lt42-0f6a24fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/browse-lt90-0f6a24fa.mp3\"]}}', 'Browse the internet = lướt web; đừng nhầm với search = tìm kiếm cụ thể.', 'technology', 1, 0),
('ec67ba6c-e3b7-586c-9ed1-4462f7b4762e', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '56322a68-d531-5a89-9fae-368c98f8b9bd', '99d6c7c6-16a5-5472-8788-de271ad43aa5', 'fill', 'UK: /fɪl/ | US: /fɪl/', 'A2', 'verb', 'hoàn thành, đáp ứng (đơn hàng)', 'to supply the required items or services needed to satisfy an official request or order.', 'We strive to fill all orders promptly.', 'Chúng tôi cố gắng hoàn thành tất cả các đơn hàng kịp thời.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse was able to fill the large rush order ahead of schedule.\", \"vi\": \"Kho hàng đã có thể xử lý hoàn thành đơn hàng gấp lớn trước kế hoạch.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-ljspeech-7aec9744.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-cori-7aec9744.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fill-9c6fb89b.webp', '[\"fulfill\", \"supply\", \"execute\", \"meet\"]', '[\"empty\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fill an order\", \"meaning\": \"đáp ứng/xử lý đơn hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fill a vacancy\", \"meaning\": \"tuyển người vào vị trí trống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fill a position\", \"meaning\": \"đảm nhận vị trí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"file\", \"note_vi\": \"File (lưu trữ hồ sơ) khác fill (làm đầy, xử lý đơn hàng).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"filled\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-cori-7aec9744.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-aru0-7aec9744.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-aru5-7aec9744.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-aru6-7aec9744.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-aru10-7aec9744.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-aru9-7aec9744.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-aru3-7aec9744.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-aru7-7aec9744.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-aru8-7aec9744.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec