('d4233219-be0f-5f00-ae7b-b63efc66f21a', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '56322a68-d531-5a89-9fae-368c98f8b9bd', '99d6c7c6-16a5-5472-8788-de271ad43aa5', 'kiss', '/kɪs/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Hành động chạm môi thể hiện tình cảm.', 'the act of touching someone with your lips to show love, affection, or greeting.', 'The couple shared a gentle kiss before parting at the train station.', 'Cặp đôi trao nhau một nụ hôn nhẹ nhàng trước khi chia tay tại ga tàu.', '{\"en\": \"The actress blew a kiss to the audience after her successful performance at the theater.\", \"vi\": \"Nữ diễn viên đã gửi một nụ hôn gió tới khán giả sau màn trình diễn thành công tại nhà hát.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kiss-ljspeech-07a2e256.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kiss-cori-07a2e256.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/kiss-2d6983d8.webp', '[\"peck\", \"salutation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"blow a kiss\", \"meaning\": \"hôn gió\"}, {\"phrase\": \"goodbye kiss\", \"meaning\": \"nụ hôn tạm biệt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"kiss\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kiss-cori-07a2e256.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kiss-aru0-07a2e256.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kiss-aru5-07a2e256.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kiss-aru6-07a2e256.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kiss-aru10-07a2e256.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kiss-aru9-07a2e256.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kiss-aru3-07a2e256.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kiss-aru7-07a2e256.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kiss-aru8-07a2e256.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kiss-aru2-07a2e256.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kiss-ljspeech-07a2e256.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub