('69d7aecc-f45f-53cc-aff6-8e493967e6c2', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5a637551-9dbb-55df-ac11-67c9fe0e3d8f', '56fe7a2b-c76b-54cd-b2f5-bbe330b16b1d', 'review', '/rɪˈvjuː/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Bài viết hoặc ý kiến đánh giá về một sản phẩm, dịch vụ, sách, phim.', 'a report or opinion that evaluates the quality of a product or service.', 'The movie received excellent reviews from critics and audiences alike.', 'Bộ phim đã nhận được những đánh giá xuất sắc từ cả giới phê bình và khán giả.', '{\"en\": \"The manager read the customer review to identify areas for improving our service quality.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã đọc đánh giá của khách hàng để xác định các lĩnh vực cần cải thiện chất lượng dịch vụ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-ljspeech-61e62b21.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-cori-61e62b21.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/review-55735555.webp', '[\"evaluation\", \"assessment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"customer review\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá của khách hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"positive review\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá tích cực\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"review\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-cori-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru0-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru5-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru6-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru10-61e62b21.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru9-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru3-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru7-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru8-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru2-61e62b21.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-ljspeech-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt408-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt138-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt624-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt396-61e62b21.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt498-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt132-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt288-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt42-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt90-61e62b21.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất phổ biến trong các bài đọc TOEIC về phản hồi khách hàng.', 'marketing', 1, 8),
('6645caa0-07e1-54ff-b1f3-0d751d5cf5fb', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5a637551-9dbb-55df-ac11-67c9fe0e3d8f', '56fe7a2b-c76b-54cd-b2f5-bbe330b16b1d', 'protein', '/ˈprəʊtiːn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Chất dinh dưỡng thiết yếu cho sự phát triển và sửa chữa cơ thể, có nhiều trong thịt, trứng, đậu.', 'a substance found in food such as meat or eggs that helps body growth.', 'Athletes often consume a lot of protein to build muscle.', 'Các vận động viên thường tiêu thụ nhiều protein để xây dựng cơ bắp.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate cafeteria now offers high protein meal options for health-conscious employees.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà ăn công ty hiện cung cấp các lựa chọn bữa ăn giàu protein cho nhân viên quan tâm đến sức khỏe.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-ljspeech-2c65275a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-cori-2c65275a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/protein-bd3c261b.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"protein intake\", \"meaning\": \"lượng protein tiêu thụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rich in protein\", \"meaning\": \"giàu protein\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-cori-2c65275a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-aru0-2c65275a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-aru5-2c65275a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-aru6-2c65275a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-aru10-2c65275a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-aru9-2c65275a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-aru3-2c65275a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-aru7-2c65275a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-aru8-2c65275a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-aru2-2c65275a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-ljspeech-2c65275a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-lt408-2c65275a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-lt138-2c65275a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-lt624-2c65275a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-lt396-2c65275a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-lt498-2c65275a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-lt132-2c65275a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-lt288-2c65275a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-lt42-2c65275a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protein-lt90-2c65275a.mp3\"]}}', 'Protein là danh từ không đếm được khi nói chung về chất dinh dưỡng.', 'health', 1, 9),
('dc4878b9-0231-5866-ad00-f24cce7ba94d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5a637551-9dbb-55df-ac11-67c9fe0e3d8f', '56fe7a2b-c76b-54cd-b2f5-bbe330b16b1d', 'carelessly', '/ˈkeələsli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một cách không cẩn thận, thiếu suy nghĩ.', 'in a way that shows a lack of attention, thought, or caution.', 'She carelessly spilled hot coffee over the confidential financial reports during the morning meeting.', 'Cô ấy đã bất cẩn làm đổ cà phê nóng lên các báo cáo tài chính bảo mật trong cuộc họp buổi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"The employee carelessly filed the wrong documents, causing a delay in the audit.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên đã nộp nhầm tài liệu một cách bất cẩn, gây ra sự chậm trễ trong quá trình kiểm toán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-ljspeech-b2e8727a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-cori-b2e8727a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/carelessly-a74ea24e.webp', '[\"negligently\", \"recklessly\", \"heedlessly\"]', '[\"carefully\", \"cautiously\", \"attentively\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"act carelessly\", \"meaning\": \"hành động bất cẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"carelessly handled\", \"meaning\": \"xử lý một cách bất cẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"carelessly overlooked\", \"meaning\": \"bỏ qua một cách bất cẩn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"recklessly\", \"note_vi\": \"recklessly mang nghĩa liều lĩnh, nguy hiểm hơn; carelessly chỉ đơn giản là thiếu cẩn thận\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"careless\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"carelessness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"careful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"carefully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-cori-b2e8727a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-aru0-b2e8727a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-aru5-b2e8727a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-aru6-b2e8727a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-aru10-b2e8727a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-aru9-b2e8727a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-aru3-b2e8727a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-aru7-b2e8727a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-aru8-b2e8727a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-aru2-b2e8727a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-ljspeech-b2e8727a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-lt408-b2e8727a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-lt138-b2e8727a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-lt624-b2e8727a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-lt396-b2e8727a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-lt498-b2e8727a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-lt132-b2e8727a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-lt288-b2e8727a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-lt42-b2e8727a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carelessly-lt90-b2e8727a.mp3\"]}}', '\'Careless\' là tính từ, \'carelessly\' là trạng từ — thêm \'-ly\' để bổ nghĩa cho động từ.', 'office', 1, 10),
('b751b717-e0a1-5c04-b791-6d3c9b8a8e38', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5a637551-9dbb-55df-ac11-67c9fe0e3d8f', '56fe7a2b-c76b-54cd-b2f5-bbe330b16b1d', 'cousin', '/ˈkʌzn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Con của cô, dì, chú, bác của bạn.', 'a relative who is the offspring of one\'s aunt or uncle.', 'My favorite cousin is coming to visit us from another city next month.', 'Người anh họ yêu thích của tôi sẽ đến thăm chúng tôi từ một thành phố khác vào tháng tới.', '{\"en\": \"My cousin will join our company as a new intern in the marketing department.\", \"vi\": \"Anh/chị/em họ của tôi sẽ tham gia công ty chúng tôi với tư cách thực tập sinh mới ở phòng marketing.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-ljspeech-980578c2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-cori-980578c2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cousin-483fe3e2.webp', '[\"relative\", \"kin\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"first cousin\", \"meaning\": \"anh chị em họ đời đầu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-cori-980578c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-aru0-980578c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-aru5-980578c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-aru6-980578c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-aru10-980578c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-aru9-980578c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-aru3-980578c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-aru7-980578c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-aru8-980578c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-aru2-980578c2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-ljspeech-980578c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-lt408-980578c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-lt138-980578c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-lt624-980578c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-lt396-980578c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-lt498-980578c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-lt132-980578c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-lt288-980578c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-lt42-980578c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cousin-lt90-980578c2.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận nhầm với \'cozen\' (lừa đảo) dù phát âm khá giống nhau.', 'daily', 1, 11),
('098661d0-85fe-50cd-9459-7535bf0df0e3', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5a637551-9dbb-55df-ac11-67c9fe0e3d8f', '56fe7a2b-c76b-54cd-b2f5-bbe330b16b1d', 'nod', '/nɒd/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Cúi đầu xuống rồi nâng lên để ra hiệu đồng ý hoặc chào.', 'to move your head down and then up to show agreement or as a greeting.', 'She gave a quick nod to show that she understood.', 'Cô ấy gật đầu nhanh để ra hiệu là đã hiểu.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor nodded in agreement when the team presented the new budget proposal.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát gật đầu đồng ý khi nhóm trình bày đề xuất ngân sách mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-ljspeech-55e5f07f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-cori-55e5f07f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nod-094e91ff.webp', '[\"gesture\", \"signal\", \"acknowledge\"]', '[\"shake one\'s head\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"nod in agreement\", \"meaning\": \"gật đầu đồng ý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"nod one\'s head\", \"meaning\": \"gật đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"give a nod\", \"meaning\": \"gật đầu ra hiệu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bow\", \"note_vi\": \"bow là cúi người chào, nod chỉ là gật đầu nhẹ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"nod\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-cori-55e5f07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-aru0-55e5f07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-aru5-55e5f07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-aru6-55e5f07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-aru10-55e5f07f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-aru9-55e5f07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-aru3-55e5f07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-aru7-55e5f07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-aru8-55e5f07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-aru2-55e5f07f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-ljspeech-55e5f07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-lt408-55e5f07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-lt138-55e5f07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-lt624-55e5f07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-lt396-55e5f07f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-lt498-55e5f07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-lt132-55e5f07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-lt288-55e5f07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-lt42-55e5f07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nod-lt90-55e5f07f.mp3\"]}}', 'Nod dùng để đồng ý hoặc chào; shake one\'s head là lắc đầu để từ chối — hai cử chỉ trái ngược nhau.', 'office', 1, 12),
('882f09c3-84bd-5944-a34e-861e1584f323', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5a637551-9dbb-55df-ac11-67c9fe0e3d8f', '56fe7a2b-c76b-54cd-b2f5-bbe330b16b1d', 'row', '/rəʊ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một dãy người hoặc vật xếp cạnh nhau.', 'an arrangement of items or individuals positioned side by side along a continuous direct alignment.', 'We reserved seats in the front row to watch the presentation clearly.', 'Chúng tôi đã đặt trước các chỗ ngồi ở hàng đầu để theo dõi buổi thuyết trình rõ ràng.', '{\"en\": \"Please arrange the extra chairs in a neat row at the back of the conference room.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng xếp những chiếc ghế thừa thành một hàng ngay ngắn ở cuối phòng hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-ljspeech-e8cdc05b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-cori-e8cdc05b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/row-cd0762e0.webp', '[\"line\", \"queue\", \"column\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"front row\", \"meaning\": \"hàng ghế đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"back row\", \"meaning\": \"hàng ghế cuối\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"raw\", \"note_vi\": \"raw nghĩa là sống, chưa nấu chín hoặc thô.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-cori-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru0-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru5-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru6-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru10-e8cdc05b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru9-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru3-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru7-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru8-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-aru2-e8cdc05b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-ljspeech-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt408-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt138-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt624-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt396-e8cdc05b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt498-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt132-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt288-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt42-e8cdc05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/row-lt90-e8cdc05b.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'in a row\' (liên tiếp) rất hay xuất hiện trong các báo cáo kinh doanh.', 'office', 1, 13),
('8254fa0b-8267-54ea-905e-11650ca92776', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5a637551-9dbb-55df-ac11-67c9fe0e3d8f', '56fe7a2b-c76b-54cd-b2f5-bbe330b16b1d', 'core', '/kɔː/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Phần trung tâm hoặc quan trọng nhất của một vật thể, vấn đề hoặc nhóm.', 'the central, most essential, or important part of something larger.', 'The Earth\'s core is made up of iron and nickel.', 'Lõi Trái Đất được cấu tạo từ sắt và niken.', '{\"en\": \"Customer satisfaction remains the core of our corporate growth strategy for next year.\", \"vi\": \"Sự hài lòng của khách hàng vẫn là cốt lõi trong chiến lược phát triển doanh nghiệp của chúng tôi năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-ljspeech-94a0426e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-cori-94a0426e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/core-5d355be5.webp', '[\"center\", \"essence\", \"heart\"]', '[\"periphery\", \"surface\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"core value\", \"meaning\": \"giá trị cốt lõi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at the core\", \"meaning\": \"ở phần cốt lõi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"corps\", \"note_vi\": \"core phát âm /kɔːr/, corps phát âm /kɔːr/ nhưng nghĩa là đoàn/quân đoàn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"core\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-cori-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru0-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru5-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru6-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru10-94a0426e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru9-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru3-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru7-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru8-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-aru2-94a0426e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-ljspeech-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-lt408-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-lt138-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-lt624-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-lt396-94a0426e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-lt498-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-lt132-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-lt288-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-lt42-94a0426e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/core-lt90-94a0426e.mp3\"]}}', '', 'business', 1, 14),
('7a400c82-bcff-59db-97a5-8a6e96aa27cd', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5a637551-9dbb-55df-ac11-67c9fe0e3d8f', '56fe7a2b-c76b-54cd-b2f5-bbe330b16b1d', 'episode', '/ˈepɪsəʊd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một phần riêng biệt của một bộ phim truyền hình, podcast hoặc câu chuyện.', 'one of the single parts into which a story or television programme is divided.', 'The final episode of this documentary will air on national television tonight.', 'Tập cuối của bộ phim tài liệu này sẽ được phát sóng trên truyền hình quốc gia tối nay.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team discussed the latest podcast episode to gather ideas for our new campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã thảo luận về tập podcast mới nhất để thu thập ý tưởng cho chiến dịch mới của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-ljspeech-39ae6b3c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-cori-39ae6b3c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/episode-3571797e.webp', '[\"part\", \"installment\", \"chapter\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a new episode\", \"meaning\": \"một tập mới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"the final episode\", \"meaning\": \"tập cuối cùng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"episodic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-cori-39ae6b3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-aru0-39ae6b3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-aru5-39ae6b3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-aru6-39ae6b3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-aru10-39ae6b3c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-aru9-39ae6b3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-aru3-39ae6b3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-aru7-39ae6b3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-aru8-39ae6b3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-aru2-39ae6b3c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-ljspeech-39ae6b3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-lt408-39ae6b3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-lt138-39ae6b3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-lt624-39ae6b3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-lt396-39ae6b3c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-lt498-39ae6b3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-lt132-39ae6b3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-lt288-39ae6b3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-lt42-39ae6b3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/episode-lt90-39ae6b3c.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng cho phim truyền hình (TV series) hoặc podcast.', 'media', 1, 15),
('0a6f8319-e6be-52f1-8510-57f7a941003f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5a637551-9dbb-55df-ac11-67c9fe0e3d8f', '56fe7a2b-c76b-54cd-b2f5-bbe330b16b1d', 'properly', 'UK: /ˈprɒpəli/ | US: /ˈprɑːpərli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'một cách đúng đắn, thích hợp', 'in a correct, suitable, or appropriate manner according to accepted standards.', 'Please ensure all documents are filed properly.', 'Vui lòng đảm bảo tất cả tài liệu được lưu trữ đúng cách.', '{\"en\": \"All new office equipment must be installed properly to avoid safety hazards.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả thiết bị văn phòng mới phải được lắp đặt đúng cách để tránh các nguy cơ mất an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-ljspeech-6348da66.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-cori-6348da66.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/properly-2d8eb946.webp', '[\"correctly\", \"appropriately\", \"suitably\", \"rightly\"]', '[\"improperly\", \"incorrectly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"function properly\", \"meaning\": \"hoạt động bình thường/đúng cách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work properly\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc/vận hành tốt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"promptly\", \"note_vi\": \"promptly nghĩa là một cách nhanh chóng/ngay lập tức, còn properly là một cách đúng đắn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"proper\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"properness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-cori-6348da66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-aru0-6348da66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-aru5-6348da66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-aru6-6348da66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-aru10-6348da66.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-aru9-6348da66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-aru3-6348da66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-aru7-6348da66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-aru8-6348da66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-aru2-6348da66.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-ljspeech-6348da66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-lt408-6348da66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-lt138-6348da66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-lt624-6348da66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-lt396-6348da66.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-lt498-6348da66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-lt132-6348da66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-lt288-6348da66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-lt42-6348da66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/properly-lt90-6348da66.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đứng sau động từ hoặc tân ngữ để mô tả hành động được thực hiện đúng quy chuẩn/yêu cầu.', 'office', 1, 16),
('70a77f98-0ec1-57c4-838a-1155a435b12a', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5a637551-9dbb-55df-ac11-67c9fe0e3d8f', '56fe7a2b-c76b-54cd-b2f5-bbe330b16b1d', 'admit', '/ədˈmɪt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Thừa nhận, thú nhận một sự thật, thường là điều không mong muốn.', 'to agree that something is true, especially when you feel unhappy or embarrassed about it.', 'The team lead refused to admit her mistake during the quarterly review.', 'Trưởng nhóm từ chối thừa nhận sai lầm của mình trong buổi đánh giá hàng quý.', '{\"en\": \"The manager had to admit that the new software system caused initial delay in processing orders.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng đã phải thừa nhận rằng hệ thống phần mềm mới đã gây ra sự chậm trễ ban đầu trong việc xử lý đơn hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-ljspeech-4a4f47d5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-cori-4a4f47d5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/admit-8919f5df.webp', '[\"concede\", \"acknowledge\", \"confess\"]', '[\"deny\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"admit a mistake\", \"meaning\": \"thừa nhận sai lầm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"refuse to admit\", \"meaning\": \"từ chối thừa nhận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"adopt\", \"note_vi\": \"admit là thừa nhận, adopt là nhận nuôi hoặc thông qua.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"admission\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"admittedly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-cori-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru0-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru5-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru6-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru10-4a4f47d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru9-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru3-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru7-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru8-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru2-4a4f47d5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-ljspeech-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt408-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt138-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt624-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt396-4a4f47d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt498-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt132-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt288-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt42-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt90-4a4f47d5.mp3\"]}}', 'Sau admit có thể đi với động từ thêm -ing hoặc mệnh đề \'that\'.', 'office', 1, 17),
('77d21916-7812-57de-b487-5796b51ad264', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5a637551-9dbb-55df-ac11-67c9fe0e3d8f', '56fe7a2b-c76b-54cd-b2f5-bbe330b16b1d', 'SIM card', '/sɪm kɑːd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thẻ nhỏ chứa thông tin người dùng điện thoại di động.', 'a small plastic chip that stores personal data for a mobile phone to connect network.', 'I need to insert my SIM card into the new phone before I can make calls.', 'Tôi cần lắp thẻ SIM vào điện thoại mới trước khi có thể gọi điện.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure your SIM card is activated before you travel abroad for the business trip.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo thẻ SIM của bạn đã được kích hoạt trước khi bạn đi công tác nước ngoài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sim-card-ljspeech-a4a3daf9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sim-card-cori-a4a3daf9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sim-card-7bdace08.webp', '[\"subscriber identity module\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"insert a SIM card\", \"meaning\": \"lắp thẻ SIM\"}, {\"phrase\": \"activate a SIM card\", \"meaning\": \"kích hoạt thẻ SIM\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sim-card-cori-a4a3daf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sim-card-aru0-a4a3daf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sim-card-aru5-a4a3daf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sim-card-aru6-a4a3daf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sim-card-aru10-a4a3daf9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sim-card-aru9-a4a3daf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sim-card-aru3-a4a3daf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sim-card-aru7-a4a3daf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sim-card-aru8-a4a3daf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sim-card-aru2-a4a3daf9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu