('ba4231d3-934d-5e7f-8bcd-2b356a5f9d98', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5a637551-9dbb-55df-ac11-67c9fe0e3d8f', '56fe7a2b-c76b-54cd-b2f5-bbe330b16b1d', 'assign', '/əˈsaɪn/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Giao một nhiệm vụ, công việc hoặc vai trò cho ai đó.', 'to give a specific job or responsibility to someone to complete.', 'The teacher will assign a new project to the students next week.', 'Giáo viên sẽ giao một dự án mới cho học sinh vào tuần tới.', '{\"en\": \"The manager will assign new tasks to the team after the morning meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý sẽ giao các nhiệm vụ mới cho đội ngũ sau cuộc họp buổi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-ljspeech-9009b730.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-cori-9009b730.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/assign-80b45e6d.webp', '[\"allocate\", \"delegate\", \"appoint\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"assign tasks\", \"meaning\": \"giao nhiệm vụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"assign responsibility\", \"meaning\": \"giao trách nhiệm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"design\", \"note_vi\": \"Thiết kế, khác với assign là phân công nhiệm vụ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"assignment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-cori-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru0-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru5-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru6-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru10-9009b730.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru9-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru3-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru7-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru8-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-aru2-9009b730.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-ljspeech-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt408-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt138-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt624-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt396-9009b730.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt498-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt132-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt288-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt42-9009b730.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assign-lt90-9009b730.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc thường gặp: assign something to someone hoặc assign someone something.', 'office', 1, 28),
('493b2897-9913-55d3-a15b-4271d42b8b2e', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5a637551-9dbb-55df-ac11-67c9fe0e3d8f', '56fe7a2b-c76b-54cd-b2f5-bbe330b16b1d', 'sale', 'UK: /seɪl/ | US: /seɪl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'đợt giảm giá, đợt khuyến mại', 'An event where goods are sold at lower prices than usual.', 'The department store announced a big sale on electronics.', 'Cửa hàng bách hóa đã thông báo một đợt giảm giá lớn cho đồ điện tử.', '{\"en\": \"The annual clearance sale attracted hundreds of shoppers looking for discounted office furniture.\", \"vi\": \"Đợt bán hàng giảm giá thanh lý hàng năm đã thu hút hàng trăm người mua sắm muốn tìm nội thất văn phòng giá rẻ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-ljspeech-5b8a763b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-cori-5b8a763b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sale-a7716eb8.webp', '[\"discount\", \"promotion\", \"clearance\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"on sale\", \"meaning\": \"đang được giảm giá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"for sale\", \"meaning\": \"để bán / sẵn sàng bán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clearance sale\", \"meaning\": \"đợt bán hàng thanh lý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sales\", \"note_vi\": \"sale (số ít) chỉ đợt giảm giá hoặc hành động bán hàng; sales (số nhiều) chỉ bộ phận bán hàng hoặc doanh số.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sales\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sell\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-cori-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru0-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru5-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru6-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru10-5b8a763b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru9-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru3-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru7-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru8-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru2-5b8a763b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-ljspeech-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt408-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt138-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt624-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt396-5b8a763b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt498-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt132-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt288-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt42-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-lt90-5b8a763b.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'on sale\' (đang được giảm giá) và \'for sale\' (có bán/được rao bán).', 'retail', 1, 29),
('e889b7ec-4046-55bb-9b0f-9ba93ed7d2d4', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5b361965-caad-5cbc-a22c-50880f8ad743', '29c954df-f017-5770-9f99-a5e55af79e7d', 'hand out', 'UK: /ˌhænd ˈaʊt/ | US: /ˌhænd ˈaʊt/', 'B1', 'v.phr', 'phân phát', 'to distribute printed documents or items to each person in a group.', 'Please hand out the brochures to all attendees.', 'Vui lòng phân phát tài liệu quảng cáo cho tất cả những người tham dự.', '{\"en\": \"The speaker will hand out the conference schedule before starting the presentation.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả sẽ phát lịch trình hội nghị trước khi bắt đầu bài thuyết trình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-ljspeech-68cd03ff.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-cori-68cd03ff.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hand-out-a1f4516a.webp', '[\"distribute\", \"pass out\", \"give out\", \"issue\"]', '[\"collect\", \"gather\", \"withhold\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hand out promotional flyers\", \"meaning\": \"phát tờ rơi quảng cáo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hand out meeting materials\", \"meaning\": \"phát tài liệu cuộc họp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"handout\", \"note_vi\": \"Danh từ viết liền nghĩa là tài liệu phát tay, còn hand out là động từ phrasal verb.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"handout\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-cori-68cd03ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-aru0-68cd03ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-aru5-68cd03ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-aru6-68cd03ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-aru10-68cd03ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-aru9-68cd03ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-aru3-68cd03ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-aru7-68cd03ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-aru8-68cd03ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-aru2-68cd03ff.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-ljspeech-68cd03ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-lt408-68cd03ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-lt138-68cd03ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-lt624-68cd03ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-lt396-68cd03ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-lt498-68cd03ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-lt132-68cd03ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-lt288-68cd03ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-lt42-68cd03ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-out-lt90-68cd03ff.mp3\"]}}', 'Đi kèm với tân ngữ chỉ tài liệu (hand out flyers/brochures). Phân biệt với danh từ ghép \'handout\' (tài liệu phát tay).', 'office', 1, 0),
('d7c8ba0e-0a43-5433-b89b-a643987faed6', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5b361965-caad-5cbc-a22c-50880f8ad743', '29c954df-f017-5770-9f99-a5e55af79e7d', 'suppose', '/səˈpəʊz/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Cho là, giả định điều gì đó đúng.', 'to believe that something is true or likely even though you are not certain.', 'I suppose you\'re right about the weather, it looks like it\'s clearing up.', 'Tôi cho rằng bạn nói đúng về thời tiết, có vẻ như trời đang quang đãng hơn.', '{\"en\": \"I suppose the shipping department will need more time to process these international orders.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi cho rằng bộ phận vận chuyển sẽ cần thêm thời gian để xử lý các đơn hàng quốc tế này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppose-ljspeech-e78b52d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppose-cori-e78b52d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/suppose-68cbe632.webp', '[\"assume\", \"presume\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"suppose that\", \"meaning\": \"giả sử rằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be supposed to\", \"meaning\": \"được cho là, có nghĩa vụ phải\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"suppose\", \"note_vi\": \"Suppose là giả định, suspect là nghi ngờ có điều xấu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"supposition\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppose-cori-e78b52d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppose-aru0-e78b52d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppose-aru5-e78b52d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppose-aru6-e78b52d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppose-aru10-e78b52d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppose-aru9-e78b52d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppose-aru3-e78b52d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppose-aru7-e78b52d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppose-aru8-e78b52d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje