('e48159bb-2574-580a-8d7d-4cbaeb40bae2', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5b361965-caad-5cbc-a22c-50880f8ad743', '29c954df-f017-5770-9f99-a5e55af79e7d', 'god', '/ɡɒd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một đấng siêu nhiên được tôn thờ, có quyền năng tối cao.', 'a supernatural being worshipped by people as having great power over the world.', 'Many ancient cultures believed in multiple gods and goddesses.', 'Nhiều nền văn hóa cổ đại tin vào nhiều vị thần và nữ thần.', '{\"en\": \"The conference hall was named after a local god of wisdom.\", \"vi\": \"Hội trường hội nghị được đặt tên theo một vị thần trí tuệ địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-ljspeech-21298df8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-cori-21298df8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/god-0f76461a.webp', '[\"deity\", \"divinity\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"believe in a god\", \"meaning\": \"tin vào một vị thần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"worship a god\", \"meaning\": \"thờ phụng một vị thần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ancient god\", \"meaning\": \"vị thần cổ đại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"good\", \"note_vi\": \"\'good\' nghĩa là tốt, không liên quan đến thần thánh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"godly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"goddess\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"godlike\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-cori-21298df8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-aru0-21298df8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-aru5-21298df8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-aru6-21298df8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-aru10-21298df8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-aru9-21298df8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-aru3-21298df8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-aru7-21298df8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-aru8-21298df8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-aru2-21298df8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-ljspeech-21298df8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-lt408-21298df8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-lt138-21298df8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-lt624-21298df8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-lt396-21298df8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-lt498-21298df8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-lt132-21298df8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-lt288-21298df8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-lt42-21298df8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/god-lt90-21298df8.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết hoa \'God\' khi chỉ Thiên Chúa trong Kitô giáo, viết thường \'god\' khi chỉ thần nói chung.', 'other', 1, 6),
('de9f0a74-860f-5473-8398-2737663a5cd5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5b361965-caad-5cbc-a22c-50880f8ad743', '29c954df-f017-5770-9f99-a5e55af79e7d', 'aggressive', '/əˈɡresɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Hung hăng, gây hấn, hoặc quyết liệt trong hành động, lời nói.', 'behaving in an angry or violent way, or using strong force to succeed.', 'The dog became aggressive when a stranger approached its owner.', 'Con chó trở nên hung hăng khi một người lạ đến gần chủ của nó.', '{\"en\": \"The firm launched an aggressive marketing campaign to win new customers.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã phát động một chiến dịch tiếp thị quyết liệt để giành được khách hàng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-ljspeech-64c90140.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-cori-64c90140.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/aggressive-80d1a609.webp', '[\"assertive\", \"hostile\", \"forceful\"]', '[\"passive\", \"gentle\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"aggressive campaign\", \"meaning\": \"chiến dịch quyết liệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"aggressive behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi hung hăng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"aggressively\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"aggression\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-cori-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru0-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru5-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru6-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru10-64c90140.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru9-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru3-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru7-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru8-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-aru2-64c90140.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-ljspeech-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt408-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt138-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt624-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt396-64c90140.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt498-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt132-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt288-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt42-64c90140.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aggressive-lt90-64c90140.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong kinh doanh, từ này thường mang nghĩa tích cực là năng nổ, quyết liệt, xông xáo.', 'marketing', 1, 7),
('04cf182d-df6c-5f70-a0c0-6965add9062e', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5b361965-caad-5cbc-a22c-50880f8ad743', '29c954df-f017-5770-9f99-a5e55af79e7d', 'harassment', '/ˈhærəsmənt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Hành vi gây khó chịu, đe dọa hoặc quấy rầy liên tục.', 'illegal or unfair behavior that annoys or threatens someone repeatedly over a period of time.', 'Employees are encouraged to report any instances of online harassment to the human resources department.', 'Nhân viên được khuyến khích báo cáo bất kỳ trường hợp quấy rối trực tuyến nào cho bộ phận nhân sự.', '{\"en\": \"All new employees must attend a mandatory training session on preventing workplace harassment next week.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên mới phải tham gia buổi đào tạo bắt buộc về phòng chống quấy rối nơi công sở vào tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harassment-ljspeech-dd8aa8cf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harassment-cori-dd8aa8cf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/harassment-d50474ff.webp', '[\"intimidation\", \"annoyance\", \"persecution\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sexual harassment\", \"meaning\": \"quấy rối tình dục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"workplace harassment\", \"meaning\": \"quấy rối nơi công sở\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"harass\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harassment-cori-dd8aa8cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harassment-aru0-dd8aa8cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harassment-aru5-dd8aa8cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harassment-aru6-dd8aa8cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harassment-aru10-dd8aa8cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harassment-aru9-dd8aa8cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harassment-aru3-dd8aa8cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/harassment-aru7-dd8aa8cf.mp3\", \"