('4f14510e-c26c-56b8-9312-25f214df9485', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5b361965-caad-5cbc-a22c-50880f8ad743', '29c954df-f017-5770-9f99-a5e55af79e7d', 'heighten', '/ˈhaɪtn/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Làm tăng lên, tăng cường độ hoặc mức độ.', 'to increase the amount, degree, or intensity of something.', 'The sudden news served to heighten the tension in the room.', 'Tin tức bất ngờ đã làm tăng thêm sự căng thẳng trong phòng.', '{\"en\": \"The new security measures will heighten safety for all employees in the building.\", \"vi\": \"Các biện pháp an ninh mới sẽ tăng cường sự an toàn cho tất cả nhân viên trong tòa nhà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heighten-ljspeech-3f9975d9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heighten-cori-3f9975d9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/heighten-b8b2c32d.webp', '[\"increase\", \"intensify\", \"enhance\"]', '[\"lower\", \"reduce\", \"diminish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"heighten awareness\", \"meaning\": \"nâng cao nhận thức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"heighten tension\", \"meaning\": \"làm gia tăng căng thẳng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"height\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"high\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heighten-cori-3f9975d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heighten-aru0-3f9975d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heighten-aru5-3f9975d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heighten-aru6-3f9975d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heighten-aru10-3f9975d9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heighten-aru9-3f9975d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heighten-aru3-3f9975d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heighten-aru7-3f9975d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heighten-aru8-3f9975d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heighten-a