('3fd75d69-30de-5f5f-a52a-9de85328e004', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '5e074065-244f-56e4-ade2-e04b9f1cd245', '0eb574ba-3b61-572b-acee-b81d4df1a040', 'flood', '/flʌd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hiện tượng nước dâng cao tràn ngập một khu vực thường khô ráo.', 'An overflow of a substantial body of water onto terrain that normally remains un-submerged.', 'Rising river levels threatened to flood nearby agricultural fields after the intense storm.', 'Mực nước sông dâng cao đe dọa làm ngập tràn các cánh đồng nông nghiệp lân cận sau cơn bão lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The heavy rain caused a severe flood that damaged the office basement.\", \"vi\": \"Cơn mưa lớn đã gây ra một trận lũ lụt nghiêm trọng làm hư hại tầng hầm văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-ljspeech-ff0db992.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-cori-ff0db992.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flood-fbada72b.webp', '[\"deluge\", \"inundation\"]', '[\"drought\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"flash flood\", \"meaning\": \"lũ quét\"}, {\"phrase\": \"flood warning\", \"meaning\": \"cảnh báo lũ lụt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"flush\", \"note_vi\": \"dội nước, đỏ mặt, không phải lũ lụt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"flood\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"flooding\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-cori-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru0-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru5-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru6-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru10-ff0db992.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru9-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru3-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru7-ff0db992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flood-aru8-