('d27d20cc-a47b-5642-9c43-1e7ff5009604', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '60f8e9a3-6bd3-5105-93b8-6991b1c0594c', '194cd974-88ee-5458-8a3b-28c91cd6fb23', 'infection', '/ɪnˈfekʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng bị vi khuẩn hoặc virus gây bệnh tấn công.', 'a condition in which bacteria or viruses enter and damage the body.', 'He took antibiotics to treat the bacterial infection in his throat.', 'Anh ấy uống kháng sinh để điều trị nhiễm trùng do vi khuẩn ở họng.', '{\"en\": \"The medical clinic provided effective treatment to cure his minor skin infection.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng khám y tế đã cung cấp phương pháp điều trị hiệu quả để chữa khỏi bệnh nhiễm trùng da nhẹ của anh ấy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-ljspeech-afb56160.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-cori-afb56160.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/infection-e03ead4f.webp', '[\"contamination\", \"disease\", \"contagion\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bacterial infection\", \"meaning\": \"sự nhiễm khuẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prevent infection\", \"meaning\": \"ngăn ngừa nhiễm trùng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"affection\", \"note_vi\": \"Infection là sự nhiễm trùng; affection là sự yêu mến.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"infect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"infectious\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-cori-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru0-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru5-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru6-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru10-afb56160.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru9-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru3-afb56160.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infection-aru7-afb5616