('5aa12089-ea95-51dc-b56d-df1c9a1827c4', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '61377552-6c6b-5179-b223-aba5395da38a', '646ab1e5-daec-5e82-9c92-8d3d25242633', 'pretty', '/ˈprɪti/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Dễ nhìn, hấp dẫn về mặt ngoại hình.', 'attractive to look at in a delicate or pleasant way without being grand.', 'The garden looked very pretty with all the flowers in bloom.', 'Khu vườn trông rất xinh đẹp với tất cả các loài hoa đang nở rộ.', '{\"en\": \"The flower shop arranged a pretty display of roses to attract weekend shoppers.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng hoa đã sắp xếp một góc trưng bày hoa hồng xinh đẹp để thu hút khách mua sắm cuối tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretty-ljspeech-162fd259.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretty-cori-162fd259.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pretty-2f89210a.webp', '[\"attractive\", \"charming\", \"lovely\"]', '[\"ugly\", \"unattractive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pretty picture\", \"meaning\": \"bức tranh đẹp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pretty design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế đẹp mắt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pretty\", \"note_vi\": \"Phân biệt pretty (tính từ: đẹp) và pretty (trạng từ: khá/tương đối).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"prettily\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"prettiness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretty-cori-162fd259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretty-aru0-162fd259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretty-aru5-162fd259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretty-aru6-162fd259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretty-aru10-162fd259.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretty-aru9-162fd259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretty-aru3-162fd259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretty-aru7-162fd259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/