('5a27a336-3261-5a15-9c67-a2af711e0bf7', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '61377552-6c6b-5179-b223-aba5395da38a', '646ab1e5-daec-5e82-9c92-8d3d25242633', 'motorcycle', 'UK: /ˈməʊtəsaɪkl/ | US: /ˈmoʊtərsɪkəl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'xe máy', 'A two-wheeled vehicle driven by an engine and ridden like a bicycle.', 'He rides his motorcycle to work every day.', 'Anh ấy lái xe máy đi làm mỗi ngày.', '{\"en\": \"All employees commuting by motorcycle must display a valid parking permit on their vehicle.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên đi làm bằng xe máy phải dán thẻ gửi xe hợp lệ trên phương tiện của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-ljspeech-438bc3e3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-cori-438bc3e3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/motorcycle-3c4d38ba.webp', '[\"motorbike\", \"scooter\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"motorcycle parking\", \"meaning\": \"bãi đỗ xe máy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ride a motorcycle\", \"meaning\": \"đi xe máy\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"motorcyclist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-cori-438bc3e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-aru0-438bc3e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-aru5-438bc3e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-aru6-438bc3e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-aru10-438bc3e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-aru9-438bc3e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-aru3-438bc3e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-aru7-438bc3e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-aru8-438bc3e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-aru2-438bc3e3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-ljspeech-438bc3e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-lt408-438bc3e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-lt138-438bc3e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-lt624-438bc3e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-lt396-438bc3e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-lt498-438bc3e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-lt132-438bc3e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-lt288-438bc3e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-lt42-438bc3e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motorcycle-lt90-438bc3e3.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong văn bản trang trọng hoặc câu hỏi TOEIC thường dùng \'motorcycle\' thay vì từ thân mật \'motorbike\'.', 'transportation', 1, 22),
('ee2c5dbc-35e8-58af-b73a-421a56c6fece', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '61377552-6c6b-5179-b223-aba5395da38a', '646ab1e5-daec-5e82-9c92-8d3d25242633', 'crush', '/krʌʃ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự phải lòng, tình cảm nhất thời.', 'a strong feeling of love or attraction for someone that usually lasts a short time.', 'Mark admitted having a strong crush on his colleague from the marketing department.', 'Mark thừa nhận mình trót phải lòng một đồng nghiệp ở bộ phận tiếp thị.', '{\"en\": \"Many employees felt a workplace crush on the friendly new marketing director during her visit.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều nhân viên đã phải lòng vị giám đốc tiếp thị mới thân thiện trong chuyến thăm của cô ấy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-ljspeech-54eda0d3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-cori-54eda0d3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/crush-f151626d.webp', '[\"infatuation\", \"passion\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have a crush on\", \"meaning\": \"phải lòng ai đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"secret crush\", \"meaning\": \"sự thầm thương trộm nhớ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"love\", \"note_vi\": \"love là tình yêu sâu sắc lâu dài, crush thường là tình cảm nhất thời\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"crush\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"crushing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-cori-54eda0d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-aru0-54eda0d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-aru5-54eda0d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-aru6-54eda0d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-aru10-54eda0d3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-aru9-54eda0d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-aru3-54eda0d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crush-aru7-54eda0d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/