('51287c4d-3af3-5f34-93c7-459922c4d7af', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '61377552-6c6b-5179-b223-aba5395da38a', '646ab1e5-daec-5e82-9c92-8d3d25242633', 'cheat', '/tʃiːt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hành động gian lận, không trung thực.', 'a dishonest act to gain an unfair advantage in a situation.', 'The company was accused of a massive cheat to avoid paying taxes.', 'Công ty bị cáo buộc về một vụ gian lận lớn để trốn thuế.', '{\"en\": \"The auditor discovered a cheat in the financial records that led to a full investigation.\", \"vi\": \"Kiểm toán viên đã phát hiện một hành vi gian lận trong hồ sơ tài chính dẫn đến một cuộc điều tra toàn diện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheat-ljspeech-8e132eb5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheat-cori-8e132eb5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cheat-efd49232.webp', '[\"fraud\", \"deception\"]', '[\"honesty\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tax cheat\", \"meaning\": \"kẻ trốn thuế\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"cheat\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheat-cori-8e132eb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheat-aru0-8e132eb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheat-aru5-8e132eb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheat-aru6-8e132eb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheat-aru10-8e132eb5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheat-aru9-8e132eb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheat-aru3-8e132eb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheat-aru7-8e132eb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheat-aru8-8e132eb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheat-aru2-8e132eb5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheat-ljspeech-8e132eb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheat-lt408-8e132eb5.mp3\", \"/s