('ec28c351-d7c1-5fc7-9e7c-d784846af74c', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '61d9424b-40ab-5a79-aaee-d3e8f7b08141', '4c6135b4-9196-5a35-8df0-394522ca858f', 'sponsor', 'UK: /ˈspɒnsə/ | US: /ˈspɑːnsər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'nhà tài trợ', 'An individual or organization that provides financial support for an event, project, or person.', 'The event thanked its corporate sponsors.', 'Sự kiện đã cảm ơn các nhà tài trợ doanh nghiệp của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The annual technology summit is looking for major corporate sponsors to cover venue expenses.\", \"vi\": \"Hội nghị thượng đỉnh công nghệ hàng năm đang tìm kiếm các nhà tài trợ doanh nghiệp lớn để trang trải chi phí địa điểm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-ljspeech-ab2137f0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-cori-ab2137f0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sponsor-843fdd4e.webp', '[\"patron\", \"backer\", \"benefactor\", \"promoter\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"corporate sponsor\", \"meaning\": \"nhà tài trợ doanh nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"official sponsor\", \"meaning\": \"nhà tài trợ chính thức\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"investor\", \"note_vi\": \"Nhà đầu tư (tìm kiếm lợi nhuận), trong khi sponsor là nhà tài trợ (nhằm quảng bá/truyền thông).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sponsor\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sponsorship\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-cori-ab2137f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-aru0-ab2137f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-aru5-ab2137f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-aru6-ab2137f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-aru10-ab2137f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-aru9-ab2137f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-aru3-ab2137f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-aru7-ab2137f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-aru8-ab2137f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-aru2-ab2137f0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-ljspeech-ab2137f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-lt408-ab2137f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-lt138-ab2137f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-lt624-ab2137f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-lt396-ab2137f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-lt498-ab2137f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-lt132-ab2137f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-lt288-ab2137f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-lt42-ab2137f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sponsor-lt90-ab2137f0.mp3\"]}}', 'Sponsor vừa là danh từ vừa là động từ. Phân biệt với \'investor\' (đầu tư kỳ vọng lợi nhuận tài chính).', 'marketing', 1, 1),
('e6ea1322-0f9c-539f-b36c-e62f5eba4f9f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '61d9424b-40ab-5a79-aaee-d3e8f7b08141', '4c6135b4-9196-5a35-8df0-394522ca858f', 'sometimes', '/ˈsʌmtaɪmz/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'vào một vài thời điểm, không thường xuyên.', 'on certain occasions, but not regularly or often.', 'Sometimes, I like to read a book in the park on a sunny afternoon.', 'Đôi khi, tôi thích đọc sách trong công viên vào một buổi chiều nắng đẹp.', '{\"en\": \"The manager sometimes approves leave requests without a formal meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đôi khi phê duyệt yêu cầu nghỉ phép mà không họp chính thức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-ljspeech-297f31f0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-cori-297f31f0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sometimes-8051a53c.webp', NULL, '[\"always\", \"never\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sometimes necessary\", \"meaning\": \"đôi khi cần thiết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sometimes difficult\", \"meaning\": \"đôi khi khó khăn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sometimes true\", \"meaning\": \"đôi khi đúng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sometime\", \"note_vi\": \"sometime (adj) nghĩa là trước đây, khác sometimes (trạng từ).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sometime\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-cori-297f31f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-aru0-297f31f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-aru5-297f31f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-aru6-297f31f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-aru10-297f31f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-aru9-297f31f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-aru3-297f31f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-aru7-297f31f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-aru8-297f31f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-aru2-297f31f0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-ljspeech-297f31f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-lt408-297f31f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-lt138-297f31f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-lt624-297f31f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-lt396-297f31f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-lt498-297f31f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-lt132-297f31f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-lt288-297f31f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-lt42-297f31f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sometimes-lt90-297f31f0.mp3\"]}}', 'Sometime (từ láy) là tính từ, sometimes là trạng từ chỉ tần suất.', 'office', 1, 2),
('1fdd86d3-3670-516b-8912-bdf982e16249', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '61d9424b-40ab-5a79-aaee-d3e8f7b08141', '4c6135b4-9196-5a35-8df0-394522ca858f', 'politician', 'UK: /ˌpɒl.ɪˈtɪʃ.ən/ | US: /ˌpɑː.ləˈtɪʃ.ən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'chính trị gia', 'a person who is professionally involved in politics or government affairs.', 'The politician addressed the public about new policies.', 'Chính trị gia đã phát biểu trước công chúng về các chính sách mới.', '{\"en\": \"Several local politicians attended the opening ceremony of the new commercial port.\", \"vi\": \"Một số chính trị gia địa phương đã tham dự lễ khai trương cảng thương mại mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-ljspeech-8279ece1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-cori-8279ece1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/politician-afa1a58f.webp', '[\"statesman\", \"officeholder\", \"public servant\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"local politician\", \"meaning\": \"chính trị gia địa phương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prominent politician\", \"meaning\": \"chính trị gia nổi bật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"politics\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Politics\' là danh từ chỉ hoạt động/ngành chính trị, còn \'politician\' là người làm chính trị.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"politics\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"political\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"politically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-cori-8279ece1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-aru0-8279ece1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-aru5-8279ece1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-aru6-8279ece1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-aru10-8279ece1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-aru9-8279ece1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-aru3-8279ece1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-aru7-8279ece1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-aru8-8279ece1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-aru2-8279ece1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-ljspeech-8279ece1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-lt408-8279ece1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-lt138-8279ece1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-lt624-8279ece1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-lt396-8279ece1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-lt498-8279ece1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-lt132-8279ece1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-lt288-8279ece1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-lt42-8279ece1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/politician-lt90-8279ece1.mp3\"]}}', 'Lưu ý trọng âm của \'politician\' rơi vào âm tiết thứ 3 /ˌpɒl.əˈtɪʃ.ən/.', '', 1, 3),
('25c4bbab-3c7c-5c22-8f16-1cc9b602a962', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '61d9424b-40ab-5a79-aaee-d3e8f7b08141', '4c6135b4-9196-5a35-8df0-394522ca858f', 'lazy', '/ˈleɪzi/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Lười biếng, không muốn làm việc.', 'unwilling to work or use energy, preferring to do nothing instead of being active.', 'On Sunday mornings, I often feel too lazy to get out of bed.', 'Vào những buổi sáng Chủ Nhật, tôi thường cảm thấy quá lười biếng để ra khỏi giường.', '{\"en\": \"It is unprofessional to be lazy when completing tasks assigned by your supervisor during work hours.\", \"vi\": \"Thật thiếu chuyên nghiệp khi lười biếng lúc hoàn thành các nhiệm vụ được cấp trên giao trong giờ làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-ljspeech-1078cf41.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-cori-1078cf41.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lazy-dd1d174a.webp', '[\"idle\", \"inactive\"]', '[\"hardworking\", \"active\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lazy afternoon\", \"meaning\": \"buổi chiều lười biếng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel lazy\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy lười\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"lazily\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"laziness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-cori-1078cf41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-aru0-1078cf41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-aru5-1078cf41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-aru6-1078cf41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-aru10-1078cf41.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-aru9-1078cf41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-aru3-1078cf41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-aru7-1078cf41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-aru8-1078cf41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-aru2-1078cf41.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-ljspeech-1078cf41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-lt408-1078cf41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-lt138-1078cf41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-lt624-1078cf41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-lt396-1078cf41.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-lt498-1078cf41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-lt132-1078cf41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-lt288-1078cf41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-lt42-1078cf41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazy-lt90-1078cf41.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh dùng từ này để nhận xét đồng nghiệp vì nó mang tính xúc phạm.', 'daily', 1, 4),
('c48111c5-366e-56a1-8540-9ec3d5255d2e', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '61d9424b-40ab-5a79-aaee-d3e8f7b08141', '4c6135b4-9196-5a35-8df0-394522ca858f', 'activism', '/ˈæktɪvɪzəm/', '', 'noun', 'Hoạt động vận động hoặc đấu tranh cho một sự thay đổi xã hội hoặc chính trị.', 'the act of working hard to achieve social or political change through public actions.', 'Environmental activism has become increasingly important in recent years.', 'Hoạt động bảo vệ môi trường ngày càng trở nên quan trọng trong những năm gần đây.', '{\"en\": \"The company supports environmental activism by donating a portion of its profits to green charities.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty ủng hộ các hoạt động vì môi trường bằng cách quyên góp một phần lợi nhuận cho các tổ chức từ thiện xanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-ljspeech-822cb18f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-cori-822cb18f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/activism-009ffbad.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-cori-822cb18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-aru0-822cb18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-aru5-822cb18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-aru6-822cb18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-aru10-822cb18f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-aru9-822cb18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-aru3-822cb18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-aru7-822cb18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-aru8-822cb18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-aru2-822cb18f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-ljspeech-822cb18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-lt408-822cb18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-lt138-822cb18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-lt624-822cb18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-lt396-822cb18f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-lt498-822cb18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-lt132-822cb18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-lt288-822cb18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-lt42-822cb18f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activism-lt90-822cb18f.mp3\"]}}', '', 'other', 1, 5),
('10427d9b-3b45-5f99-9f4e-e02a465912fa', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '61d9424b-40ab-5a79-aaee-d3e8f7b08141', '4c6135b4-9196-5a35-8df0-394522ca858f', 'prescription', '/prɪˈskrɪpʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Giấy ghi thuốc và hướng dẫn sử dụng do bác sĩ kê.', 'a piece of paper on which a doctor writes the medicine you need.', 'The physician wrote a prescription for antibiotics to treat the severe infection.', 'Bác sĩ đã kê một đơn thuốc kháng sinh để điều trị tình trạng nhiễm trùng nặng.', '{\"en\": \"Please present your prescription at the pharmacy counter to receive your medication.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng trình đơn thuốc của bạn tại quầy thuốc để nhận thuốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-ljspeech-9fd01ae4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-cori-9fd01ae4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prescription-f20cc915.webp', '[\"order\", \"instruction\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fill a prescription\", \"meaning\": \"bốc thuốc theo đơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"write a prescription\", \"meaning\": \"kê đơn thuốc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"subscription\", \"note_vi\": \"sự đăng ký mua báo hoặc dịch vụ định kỳ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"prescribe\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-cori-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru0-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru5-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru6-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru10-9fd01ae4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru9-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru3-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru7-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru8-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru2-9fd01ae4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-ljspeech-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt408-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt138-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt624-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt396-9fd01ae4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt498-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt132-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt288-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt42-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-lt90-9fd01ae4.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với subscription (sự đăng ký dài hạn) hay recipe (công thức nấu ăn).', 'health', 1, 6),
('050223c3-28ad-50c8-954e-78ce99e85743', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '61d9424b-40ab-5a79-aaee-d3e8f7b08141', '4c6135b4-9196-5a35-8df0-394522ca858f', 'dream', '/driːm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Những hình ảnh, âm thanh, cảm xúc xuất hiện trong tâm trí khi ngủ; một mong muốn mạnh mẽ.', 'a series of thoughts or pictures in your mind during sleep, or a strong hope.', 'I had a vivid dream about flying last night.', 'Tối qua tôi có một giấc mơ sống động về việc bay.', '{\"en\": \"Opening his own restaurant in the city center has always been his biggest dream.\", \"vi\": \"Mở nhà hàng riêng ở trung tâm thành phố luôn là ước mơ lớn nhất của anh ấy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-ljspeech-5f04a884.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-cori-5f04a884.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dream-054f27a3.webp', '[\"ambition\", \"aspiration\", \"fantasy\"]', '[\"reality\", \"nightmare\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"achieve a dream\", \"meaning\": \"đạt được ước mơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"childhood dream\", \"meaning\": \"ước mơ thời thơ ấu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"dream\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dreamy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-cori-5f04a884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-aru0-5f04a884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-aru5-5f04a884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-aru6-5f04a884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-aru10-5f04a884.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-aru9-5f04a884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-aru3-5f04a884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-aru7-5f04a884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-aru8-5f04a884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-aru2-5f04a884.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-ljspeech-5f04a884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-lt408-5f04a884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-lt138-5f04a884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-lt624-5f04a884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-lt396-5f04a884.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-lt498-5f04a884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-lt132-5f04a884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-lt288-5f04a884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-lt42-5f04a884.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dream-lt90-5f04a884.mp3\"]}}', 'Vừa là giấc mơ khi ngủ, vừa là ước mơ hoài bão trong cuộc sống.', 'daily', 1, 7),
('32e4f800-181c-588d-844f-1360acbec623', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '61d9424b-40ab-5a79-aaee-d3e8f7b08141', '4c6135b4-9196-5a35-8df0-394522ca858f', 'responsibility', 'UK: /rɪˌspɒnsəˈbɪləti/ | US: /rɪˌspɑnsəˈbɪləti/', 'B1', 'noun', 'trách nhiệm', 'the state or duty of being accountable for taking care of something or making decisions.', 'Team leaders have a lot of responsibility.', 'Trưởng nhóm có nhiều trách nhiệm.', '{\"en\": \"The project manager assumes full responsibility for ensuring the software update is delivered on schedule.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý dự án chịu trách nhiệm hoàn toàn về việc đảm bảo bản cập nhật phần mềm được giao đúng tiến độ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-ljspeech-0cbd2645.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-cori-0cbd2645.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/responsibility-b1f74d53.webp', '[\"duty\", \"obligation\", \"accountability\", \"liability\"]', '[\"irresponsibility\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"assume responsibility\", \"meaning\": \"gánh vác trách nhiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"job responsibilities\", \"meaning\": \"trách nhiệm công việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take responsibility for\", \"meaning\": \"chịu trách nhiệm về\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"duty\", \"note_vi\": \"Duty là nhiệm vụ cụ thể phải làm, còn responsibility thiên về tinh thần chịu trách nhiệm và nghĩa vụ chung.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"responsible\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"responsibly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-cori-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru0-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru5-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru6-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru10-0cbd2645.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru9-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru3-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru7-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru8-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru2-0cbd2645.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-ljspeech-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt408-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt138-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt624-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt396-0cbd2645.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt498-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt132-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt288-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt42-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt90-0cbd2645.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'for\' (responsibility for something) hoặc cấu trúc \'take/assume responsibility for\'.', 'personnel', 1, 8),
('0b744b5a-e3fd-5b23-8092-926702ddca82', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '61d9424b-40ab-5a79-aaee-d3e8f7b08141', '4c6135b4-9196-5a35-8df0-394522ca858f', 'hallway', '/ˈhɔːlweɪ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Lối đi dài trong một tòa nhà, thường nối các phòng với nhau.', 'a corridor in a building that provides access to various adjoining rooms.', 'The students walked quietly down the hallway to their classrooms.', 'Các học sinh đi bộ một cách yên lặng dọc hành lang đến các lớp học của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Maintenance staff painted the main hallway on the third floor during the weekend.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo trì đã sơn lại hành lang chính ở tầng ba trong suốt cuối tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallway-ljspeech-4862b605.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallway-cori-4862b605.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hallway-acc4749f.webp', '[\"corridor\", \"passageway\", \"aisle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"long hallway\", \"meaning\": \"hành lang dài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"down the hallway\", \"meaning\": \"dọc theo hành lang\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"highway\", \"note_vi\": \"highway là đường quốc lộ hoặc xa lộ, khác hoàn toàn hallway là hành lang.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallway-cori-4862b605.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallway-aru0-4862b605.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallway-aru5-4862b605.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallway-aru6-4862b605.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallway-aru10-4862b605.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallway-aru9-4862b605.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallway-aru3-4862b605.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallway-aru7-4862b605.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallway-aru8-4862b605.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/