('b0c02dad-2a0d-56fd-a95e-40e0f5909d79', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '61d9424b-40ab-5a79-aaee-d3e8f7b08141', '4c6135b4-9196-5a35-8df0-394522ca858f', 'Photoshop', '/ˈfəʊtəʃɒp/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Phần mềm chỉnh sửa ảnh chuyên nghiệp của Adobe.', 'a popular computer program used for editing digital images and graphic design.', 'She used Photoshop to enhance the colors in her landscape photo.', 'Cô ấy đã dùng Photoshop để tăng cường màu sắc cho bức ảnh phong cảnh của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The graphic designer used Photoshop to create an attractive poster for the product campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thiết kế đồ họa đã dùng Photoshop để tạo một áp phích hấp dẫn cho chiến dịch sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-ljspeech-32ee117b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-cori-32ee117b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/photoshop-e60ca717.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"use Photoshop\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng phần mềm Photoshop\"}, {\"phrase\": \"master Photoshop\", \"meaning\": \"thành thạo Photoshop\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"photoshop\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-cori-32ee117b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-aru0-32ee117b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-aru5-32ee117b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-aru6-32ee117b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-aru10-32ee117b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-aru9-32ee117b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-aru3-32ee117b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-aru7-32ee117b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-aru8-32ee117b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-aru2-32ee117b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-ljspeech-32ee117b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-lt408-32ee117b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-lt138-32ee117b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-lt624-32ee117b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-lt396-32ee117b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-lt498-32ee117b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-lt132-32ee117b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-lt288-32ee117b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-lt42-32ee117b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photoshop-lt90-32ee117b.mp3\"]}}', 'Photoshop là danh từ riêng chỉ phần mềm, nhưng trong giao tiếp hiện đại có thể dùng như động từ.', 'technology', 1, 18),
('b8c56769-daa8-5641-9409-a337d6e0599b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '61d9424b-40ab-5a79-aaee-d3e8f7b08141', '4c6135b4-9196-5a35-8df0-394522ca858f', 'credit', '/ˈkredɪt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự tin tưởng cho phép mua hàng hoặc vay tiền và trả sau.', 'an arrangement where you receive goods or money now and pay for them later.', 'Many people use a credit card to pay for large purchases.', 'Nhiều người sử dụng thẻ tín dụng để thanh toán cho các khoản mua sắm lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The finance department decided to extend more credit to our long-term business partners.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng tài chính đã quyết định mở rộng thêm hạn mức tín dụng cho các đối tác kinh doanh lâu năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-ljspeech-9cf5e7cd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-cori-9cf5e7cd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/credit-302e1372.webp', '[\"loan\", \"trust\"]', '[\"debt\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"credit card\", \"meaning\": \"thẻ tín dụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extend credit\", \"meaning\": \"cấp tín dụng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"debit\", \"note_vi\": \"Debit là ghi nợ, trừ tiền trực tiếp từ tài khoản của bạn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"creditor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-cori-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru0-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru5-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru6-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru10-9cf5e7cd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru9-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru3-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru7-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru8-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru2-9cf5e7cd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-ljspeech-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt408-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt138-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt624-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt396-9cf5e7cd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt498-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt132-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt288-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt42-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt90-9cf5e7cd.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh tài chính ngân hàng hoặc thanh toán hóa đơn.', 'finance', 1, 19),
('ffc9ccfc-33aa-5cc2-8312-4a544d5b35df', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '61d9424b-40ab-5a79-aaee-d3e8f7b08141', '4c6135b4-9196-5a35-8df0-394522ca858f', 'terrorize', '/ˈterəraɪz/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Gây ra sự sợ hãi tột độ, đe dọa bằng bạo lực.', 'to make someone feel very frightened by using threats or violence.', 'The gang used to terrorize the local shopkeepers into paying protection money.', 'Băng đảng đó từng khủng bố các chủ cửa hàng địa phương để buộc họ phải trả tiền bảo kê.', '{\"en\": \"The security guards were hired to prevent local gangs from trying to terrorize the shoppers.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên bảo vệ đã được thuê để ngăn chặn các băng nhóm địa phương đe dọa người mua sắm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrorize-ljspeech-2de9e923.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrorize-cori-2de9e923.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/terrorize-7f6b996a.webp', '[\"frighten\", \"intimidate\", \"scare\"]', '[\"comfort\", \"reassure\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"terrorize the population\", \"meaning\": \"khủng bố người dân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"terrorize the neighborhood\", \"meaning\": \"đe dọa khu dân cư\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"terror\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"terrorism\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"terrorist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrorize-cori-2de9e923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrorize-aru0-2de9e923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrorize-aru5-2de9e923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrorize-aru6-2de9e923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrorize-aru10-2de9e923.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrorize-aru9-2de9e923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrorize-aru3-2de9e923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrorize-aru7-2de9e923