('51926e46-eb5e-5423-82e3-af54ef6af451', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '63abfa10-f728-52d3-9e58-3474703d1a0b', '77cb815c-6b73-5881-bb55-b7c3a2aa0f44', 'tail', '/teɪl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Phần kéo dài ra phía sau của cơ thể động vật.', 'the part at the back of an animal\'s body that sticks out.', 'The cat flicked its bushy tail while watching birds through the open window.', 'Con mèo ngoắc ngoắc chiếc đuôi xù khi quan sát những chú chim qua cửa sổ mở.', '{\"en\": \"The airline logo features a colorful bird with a long decorative tail pattern.\", \"vi\": \"Biểu trưng của hãng hàng không có hình một chú chim đầy màu sắc với hoa văn đuôi dài trang trí.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tail-ljspeech-fbf5f2a2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tail-cori-fbf5f2a2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tail-305c6fea.webp', '[\"rear\", \"back end\"]', '[\"head\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wag its tail\", \"meaning\": \"vẫy đuôi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tail light\", \"meaning\": \"đèn sau xe\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tale\", \"note_vi\": \"câu chuyện, phát âm giống tail nhưng khác nghĩa\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"tail\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tail-cori-fbf5f2a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tail-aru0-fbf5f2a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tail-aru5-fbf5f2a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tail-aru6-fbf5f2a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tail-aru10-fbf5f2a2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tail-aru9-fbf5f2a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tail-aru3-fbf5f2a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tail-aru7-fbf5f2a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tail-aru8-fbf5f2a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tail-aru2-fbf5f2a2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/o