('83af755c-12d6-5939-b03c-7d2efb5c6826', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '66104cc2-5f36-5c59-af87-428f9bea1fe1', 'ab5ee32d-f39d-5198-8130-9ecde4ac3cef', 'seafood', '/ˈsiːfuːd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Các loài động vật biển dùng làm thức ăn.', 'animals from the sea that you can eat, such as fish and shells.', 'We had fresh seafood for dinner, including shrimp and crab.', 'Chúng tôi đã ăn hải sản tươi sống cho bữa tối, bao gồm tôm và cua.', '{\"en\": \"The company banquet will be held at a famous seafood restaurant near the central harbor.\", \"vi\": \"Bữa tiệc của công ty sẽ được tổ chức tại một nhà hàng hải sản nổi tiếng gần bến cảng trung tâm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seafood-ljspeech-6386a429.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seafood-cori-6386a429.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/seafood-ebe4b410.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fresh seafood\", \"meaning\": \"hải sản tươi sống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a seafood restaurant\", \"meaning\": \"nhà hàng hải sản\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seafood-cori-6386a429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seafood-aru0-6386a429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seafood-aru5-6386a429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seafood-aru6-6386a429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seafood-aru10-6386a429.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seafood-aru9-6386a429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seafood-aru3-6386a429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seafood-aru7-6386a429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seafood-aru8-6386a429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seafood-aru2-6386a429.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seafood-ljspeech-6386a429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia