('9d75ad6b-461a-5fc6-a0a0-717402020c83', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '66104cc2-5f36-5c59-af87-428f9bea1fe1', 'ab5ee32d-f39d-5198-8130-9ecde4ac3cef', 'lie', '/laɪ/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Nói điều không đúng sự thật.', 'To make an intentionally false statement to mislead or betray another person.', 'It\'s never a good idea to lie to your friends, even about small things.', 'Nói dối bạn bè không bao giờ là một ý hay, dù chỉ là về những chuyện nhỏ nhặt.', '{\"en\": \"The auditor discovered that the accountant attempted to lie about the quarterly expenses.\", \"vi\": \"Kiểm toán viên phát hiện ra rằng kế toán viên đã cố tình nói dối về các chi phí theo quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-ljspeech-54e2fcb9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-cori-54e2fcb9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lie-9e7fc261.webp', '[\"deceive\", \"mislead\"]', '[\"be honest\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lie about something\", \"meaning\": \"nói dối về điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lie to someone\", \"meaning\": \"nói dối ai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lay\", \"note_vi\": \"lay (đặt, để) là động từ có tân ngữ, còn lie (nằm/nói dối) là nội động từ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"liar\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"lying\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-cori-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru0-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru5-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru6-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru10-54e2fcb9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru9-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru3-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru7-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru8-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-aru2-54e2fcb9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-ljspeech-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt408-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt138-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt624-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt396-54e2fcb9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt498-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt132-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt288-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt42-54e2fcb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lie-lt90-54e2fcb9.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi mang nghĩa \'nói dối\', quá khứ và quá khứ phân từ của lie là lied – lied.', 'business', 1, 2),
('e72d38ef-d14f-5129-a5ee-49424781953e', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '66104cc2-5f36-5c59-af87-428f9bea1fe1', 'ab5ee32d-f39d-5198-8130-9ecde4ac3cef', 'get along', '/ɡɛt əˈlɒŋ/', 'A2', 'phrasal verb', 'có mối quan hệ tốt, hòa hợp với ai đó.', 'to have a good relationship and interact harmoniously with someone else.', 'Despite their differences, the two sisters always manage to get along well.', 'Mặc dù có những khác biệt, hai chị em vẫn luôn hòa thuận với nhau.', '{\"en\": \"New coworkers should get along to maintain a productive work environment.\", \"vi\": \"Đồng nghiệp mới nên hòa hợp để duy trì môi trường làm việc năng suất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-along-ljspeech-3f34a764.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-along-cori-3f34a764.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/get-along-995be0e5.webp', '[\"get on\", \"hit it off\"]', '[\"fall out\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"get along with\", \"meaning\": \"hòa hợp với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get along well\", \"meaning\": \"rất hợp nhau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"go along\", \"note_vi\": \"go along là đi theo, không phải hòa hợp\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-along-cori-3f34a764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-along-aru0-3f34a764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-along-aru5-3f34a764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-along-aru6-3f34a764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-along-aru10-3f34a764.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-along-aru9-3f34a764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-along-aru3-3f34a764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-along-aru7-3f34a764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-along-aru8-3f34a764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-along-aru2-3f34a764.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {