('7c915737-58b1-5cae-958f-b82c2aa824e1', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '66104cc2-5f36-5c59-af87-428f9bea1fe1', 'ab5ee32d-f39d-5198-8130-9ecde4ac3cef', 'confusing', '/kənˈfjuːzɪŋ/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Gây bối rối, khó hiểu.', 'difficult to understand clearly or causing a lack of clarity and order.', 'The instructions for assembling the furniture were very confusing.', 'Hướng dẫn lắp ráp đồ nội thất rất khó hiểu.', '{\"en\": \"The software update had a confusing user interface that frustrated many office workers.\", \"vi\": \"Bản cập nhật phần mềm có giao diện người dùng gây khó hiểu khiến nhiều nhân viên văn phòng thất vọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-ljspeech-5bccaca1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-cori-5bccaca1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/confusing-149175b4.webp', '[\"puzzling\", \"unclear\", \"perplexing\"]', '[\"clear\", \"understandable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"confusing instructions\", \"meaning\": \"hướng dẫn khó hiểu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"confusing situation\", \"meaning\": \"tình huống rối rắm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"confused\", \"note_vi\": \"confusing mô tả bản chất sự vật, confused mô tả cảm xúc con người\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"confuse\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"confused\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"confusion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-cori-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru0-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru5-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru6-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru10-5bccaca1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru9-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru3-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/