('6841d759-b68f-5272-8abf-2d1ac99d0ed6', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '66104cc2-5f36-5c59-af87-428f9bea1fe1', 'ab5ee32d-f39d-5198-8130-9ecde4ac3cef', 'season', '/ˈsiːzn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một trong bốn khoảng thời gian chính trong năm, thường có đặc điểm thời tiết riêng.', 'one of four periods in a year with distinct weather conditions.', 'Hotels usually raise their room rates during the peak tourist season in summer.', 'Các khách sạn thường tăng giá phòng trong mùa du lịch cao điểm vào mùa hè.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers lower rates during the low season for tourists.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp giá thấp hơn trong mùa thấp điểm cho du khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-ljspeech-76f5e403.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-cori-76f5e403.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/season-22c3ef36.webp', '[\"period\", \"time of year\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dry season\", \"meaning\": \"mùa khô\"}, {\"phrase\": \"peak season\", \"meaning\": \"mùa cao điểm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"session\", \"note_vi\": \"session là phiên họp, phát âm khác season.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"seasonal\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"seasonally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-cori-76f5e403.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-aru0-76f5e403.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-aru5-76f5e403.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-aru6-76f5e403.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-aru10-76f5e403.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-aru9-76f5e403.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-aru3-76f5e403.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-aru7-76f5e403.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/season-aru8-76f5e403.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub