('44b68270-78be-50e8-88c5-cca242e00793', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '69a06e9e-dd6b-546a-9e69-4e67705c0ebb', 'ca164514-2734-5184-8bac-aa95896c728b', 'introduce', 'UK: /ˌɪntrəˈdjuːs/ | US: /ˌɪntrəˈduːs/', 'A2', 'verb', 'giới thiệu, ra mắt', 'To present a person, idea, or product to someone or to make it available for use.', 'The company will introduce a new product next month.', 'Công ty sẽ ra mắt sản phẩm mới vào tháng tới.', '{\"en\": \"The company plans to introduce a new line of eco-friendly office furniture next month.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty có kế hoạch ra mắt dòng nội thất văn phòng thân thiện với môi trường mới vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-ljspeech-a69afe5d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-cori-a69afe5d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/introduce-12b0e022.webp', '[\"launch\", \"present\", \"unveil\", \"implement\"]', '[\"withdraw\", \"remove\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"introduce a new product\", \"meaning\": \"ra mắt sản phẩm mới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"introduce a policy\", \"meaning\": \"ban hành/áp dụng một chính sách\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"induce\", \"note_vi\": \"xui khiến, gây ra; không liên quan tới ra mắt/giới thiệu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"introduction\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"introductory\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-cori-a69afe5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-aru0-a69afe5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-aru5-a69afe5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-aru6-a69afe5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-aru10-a69afe5d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-aru9-a69afe5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-aru3-a69afe5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-aru7-a69afe5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-aru8-a69afe5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-aru2-a69afe5d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-ljspeech-a69afe5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-lt408-a69afe5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-lt138-a69afe5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-lt624-a69afe5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-lt396-a69afe5d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-lt498-a69afe5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-lt132-a69afe5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-lt288-a69afe5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-lt42-a69afe5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/introduce-lt90-a69afe5d.mp3\"]}}', 'Đi với cấu trúc \'introduce somebody/something to somebody\' hoặc mang nghĩa ra mắt/áp dụng sản phẩm/chính sách mới.', 'marketing', 1, 10),
('cf53f687-bf7f-5132-a673-0261ccb7328f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '69a06e9e-dd6b-546a-9e69-4e67705c0ebb', 'ca164514-2734-5184-8bac-aa95896c728b', 'stop by', 'UK: /stɒp baɪ/ | US: /stɑp baɪ/', 'B1', 'v.phr', 'ghé qua', 'to pay a brief, casual visit to a person or place while on the way somewhere else.', 'I will stop by the office later today.', 'Tôi sẽ ghé qua văn phòng vào cuối ngày hôm nay.', '{\"en\": \"Could you stop by my office before you leave for lunch?\", \"vi\": \"Bạn có thể ghé qua văn phòng tôi trước khi đi ăn trưa được không?\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-ljspeech-8e31b743.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-cori-8e31b743.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stop-by-36b5aff2.webp', '[\"drop by\", \"come by\", \"visit briefly\"]', '[\"depart\", \"leave\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stop by the office\", \"meaning\": \"ghé qua văn phòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stop by briefly\", \"meaning\": \"tạt qua một lát\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stop off\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Stop off\' là dừng chân nghỉ giữa một chuyến đi xa dài hơn, trong khi \'stop by\' là ghé thăm nhanh một địa điểm gần đó.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-cori-8e31b743.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-aru0-8e31b743.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-aru5-8e31b743.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-aru6-8e31b743.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-aru10-8e31b743.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-aru9-8e31b743.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-aru3-8e31b743.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-aru7-8e31b743.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-aru8-8e31b743.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-aru2-8e31b743.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-ljspeech-8e31b743.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-lt408-8e31b743.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-lt138-8e31b743.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-lt624-8e31b743.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-lt396-8e31b743.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-lt498-8e31b743.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-lt132-8e31b743.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-lt288-8e31b743.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-lt42-8e31b743.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stop-by-lt90-8e31b743.mp3\"]}}', '\'Stop by\' đồng nghĩa với \'drop by\' hoặc \'come by\', dùng khi ghé qua đâu đó trong thời gian ngắn mà không cần lên lịch trước.', 'office', 1, 11),
('e38266c2-cbdd-57a4-8236-b1fc18adc5dc', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '69a06e9e-dd6b-546a-9e69-4e67705c0ebb', 'ca164514-2734-5184-8bac-aa95896c728b', 'tariff', '/ˈtærɪf/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Thuế mà một quốc gia đánh vào hàng hóa nhập khẩu hoặc xuất khẩu.', 'a tax that a government charges on goods that are brought into the country.', 'Heavy tariff penalties were placed on foreign electronic products to protect domestic manufacturers.', 'Mức thuế quan nặng đã được áp đặt lên các sản phẩm điện tử nước ngoài để bảo vệ các nhà sản xuất trong nước.', '{\"en\": \"The new trade agreement aims to reduce the tariff on imported electronic components significantly.\", \"vi\": \"Hiệp định thương mại mới nhằm mục đích giảm đáng kể thuế đối với các linh kiện điện tử nhập khẩu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tariff-ljspeech-551b6724.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tariff-cori-551b6724.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tariff-58129702.webp', '[\"tax\", \"duty\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"import tariff\", \"meaning\": \"thuế nhập khẩu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"impose a tariff\", \"meaning\": \"áp đặt thuế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"traffic\", \"note_vi\": \"traffic là giao thông, tariff là thuế quan.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tariff-cori-551b6724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tariff-aru0-551b6724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tariff-aru5-551b6724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tariff-aru6-551b6724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tariff-aru10-551b6724.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tariff-aru9-551b6724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tariff-aru3-551b6724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tariff-aru7-551b6724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tariff-aru8-551b6724.mp3\", \"/s