('b2cfb7cd-8743-5655-874e-3f1151be6726', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '69a06e9e-dd6b-546a-9e69-4e67705c0ebb', 'ca164514-2734-5184-8bac-aa95896c728b', 'endangered species', '/ɪnˈdeɪn.dʒəd ˈspiː.ʃiːz/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Loài động thực vật có nguy cơ tuyệt chủng cao.', 'A category of living organisms facing a very serious risk of extinction.', 'Protecting endangered species is crucial for biodiversity.', 'Bảo vệ các loài nguy cấp là rất quan trọng đối với đa dạng sinh học.', '{\"en\": \"The eco-friendly resort donates a portion of its profits to protect endangered species.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng thân thiện với môi trường quyên góp một phần lợi nhuận để bảo vệ các loài có nguy cơ tuyệt chủng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-ljspeech-695188af.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-cori-695188af.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/endangered-species-6285b669.webp', '[\"threatened species\", \"vanishing species\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"protect endangered species\", \"meaning\": \"bảo vệ các loài có nguy cơ tuyệt chủng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"save endangered species\", \"meaning\": \"cứu các loài có nguy cơ tuyệt chủng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-cori-695188af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-aru0-695188af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-aru5-695188af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-aru6-695188af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-aru10-695188af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-aru9-695188af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-aru3-695188af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-aru7-695188af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-aru8-695188af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-aru2-695188af.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-ljspeech-695188af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-lt408-695188af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-lt138-695188af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-lt624-695188af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-lt396-695188af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-lt498-695188af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-lt132-695188af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-lt288-695188af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-lt42-695188af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-species-lt90-695188af.mp3\"]}}', 'Đây là danh từ ghép, \'species\' luôn có dạng số ít và số nhiều giống nhau.', 'nature', 1, 18),
('dfd7f1ef-8009-51c9-8a71-db3252d35ac0', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '69a06e9e-dd6b-546a-9e69-4e67705c0ebb', 'ca164514-2734-5184-8bac-aa95896c728b', 'importance', 'UK: /ɪmˈpɔːtəns/ | US: /ɪmˈpɔrtəns/', 'B1', 'noun', 'tầm quan trọng', 'The quality or state of being valuable, significant, or having great influence.', 'The manager emphasized the importance of teamwork.', 'Người quản lý nhấn mạnh tầm quan trọng của làm việc nhóm.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO emphasized the importance of maintaining high quality standards during the merger.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành đã nhấn mạnh tầm quan trọng của việc duy trì các tiêu chuẩn chất lượng cao trong quá trình sáp nhập.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-ljspeech-f6fa22a7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-cori-f6fa22a7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/importance-940a6e8b.webp', '[\"significance\", \"consequence\", \"relevance\", \"weight\"]', '[\"insignificance\", \"unimportance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"paramount importance\", \"meaning\": \"tầm quan trọng tối cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"attach importance to\", \"meaning\": \"coi trọng, chú ý tới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stress the importance of\", \"meaning\": \"nhấn mạnh tầm quan trọng của\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"impotence\", \"note_vi\": \"sự bất lực, không đủ sức mạnh (dễ nhầm chính tả với importance)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"important\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"importantly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-cori-f6fa22a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-aru0-f6fa22a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-aru5-f6fa22a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-aru6-f6fa22a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-aru10-f6fa22a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-aru9-f6fa22a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-aru3-f6fa22a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-aru7-f6fa22a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-aru8-f6fa22a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-aru2-f6fa22a7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-ljspeech-f6fa22a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-lt408-f6fa22a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-lt138-f6fa22a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-lt624-f6fa22a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-lt396-f6fa22a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-lt498-f6fa22a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-lt132-f6fa22a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-lt288-f6fa22a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-lt42-f6fa22a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/importance-lt90-f6fa22a7.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ hay gặp trong TOEIC: \'of paramount importance\' (có tầm quan trọng tối cao) hoặc \'attach importance to\' (coi trọng).', 'management', 1, 19),
('e4a3feca-4bb4-551d-864a-a32e7aeca6f4', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '69a06e9e-dd6b-546a-9e69-4e67705c0ebb', 'ca164514-2734-5184-8bac-aa95896c728b', 'unremarkable', '/ˌʌnrɪˈmɑːkəbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'không có gì đặc biệt, tầm thường', 'not interesting, unusual, or special in any way so that nobody notices it.', 'The movie was quite unremarkable; I barely remember anything about it.', 'Bộ phim khá bình thường; tôi hầu như không nhớ gì về nó.', '{\"en\": \"The sales performance last quarter was quite unremarkable despite our extensive marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Hiệu suất bán hàng quý trước khá bình thường mặc dù chúng tôi đã có chiến dịch tiếp thị sâu rộng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unremarkable-ljspeech-0b74cb0d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unremarkable-cori-0b74cb0d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unremarkable-be2424cb.webp', '[\"ordinary\", \"average\", \"unexceptional\"]', '[\"remarkable\", \"extraordinary\", \"exceptional\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unremarkable performance\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu suất bình thường, không nổi bật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seem unremarkable\", \"meaning\": \"có vẻ bình thường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unforgettable\", \"note_vi\": \"unforgettable là không thể quên, trái ngược nghĩa với unremarkable (tầm thường)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"remark\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"remarkable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unremarkable-cori-0b74cb0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unremarkable-aru0-0b74cb0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unremarkable-aru5-0b74cb0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unremarkable-aru6-0b74cb0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unremarkable-aru10-0b74cb0d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unremarkable-aru9-0b74cb0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v