('dc55e909-b8f4-5c14-a09a-414a70c4ce35', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '69a06e9e-dd6b-546a-9e69-4e67705c0ebb', 'ca164514-2734-5184-8bac-aa95896c728b', 'supplies', 'UK: /ˈɒfɪs səˈplaɪz/ | US: /ˈɔːfɪs səˈplaɪz/', 'B1', 'noun', 'vật tư văn phòng', 'Necessary equipment, materials, or provisions needed for a specific purpose or organization.', 'Please order necessary office supplies for the department.', 'Vui lòng đặt hàng văn phòng phẩm cần thiết cho bộ phận.', '{\"en\": \"Please reorder office supplies before the inventory runs completely out.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đặt thêm vật tư văn phòng trước khi kho hàng cạn kiệt hoàn toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-ljspeech-72275625.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-cori-72275625.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/supplies-2f02c5d6.webp', '[\"materials\", \"provisions\", \"stock\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"office supplies\", \"meaning\": \"vật tư văn phòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"medical supplies\", \"meaning\": \"vật tư y tế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"supplier\", \"note_vi\": \"supplier là nhà cung cấp (người/công ty), còn supplies là vật tư/hàng hóa\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"supply\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"supplier\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-cori-72275625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-aru0-72275625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-aru5-72275625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-aru6-72275625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-aru10-72275625.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-aru9-72275625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-aru3-72275625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-aru7-72275625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-aru8-72275625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-aru2-72275625.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-ljspeech-72275625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-lt408-72275625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-lt138-72275625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-lt624-72275625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-lt396-72275625.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-lt498-72275625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-lt132-72275625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-lt288-72275625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-lt42-72275625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplies-lt90-72275625.mp3\"]}}', 'Dạng số nhiều \'supplies\' dùng để chỉ đồ dùng, vật tư (như office supplies - vật tư văn phòng).', 'office', 1, 27),
('711fe6b7-a2ee-5da8-9d7a-8383b96efe84', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '69a06e9e-dd6b-546a-9e69-4e67705c0ebb', 'ca164514-2734-5184-8bac-aa95896c728b', 'demanding', '/dɪˈmɑːndɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'đòi hỏi nhiều, khó đáp ứng', 'needing a lot of time, effort, or attention from someone to be done well.', 'Her new job is very demanding, requiring long hours and a lot of focus.', 'Công việc mới của cô ấy rất đòi hỏi, yêu cầu làm nhiều giờ và tập trung cao độ.', '{\"en\": \"The demanding schedule of the project requires employees to work extra hours during the week.\", \"vi\": \"Lịch trình khắt khe của dự án đòi hỏi nhân viên phải làm thêm giờ trong tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-ljspeech-30fd0a45.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-cori-30fd0a45.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/demanding-e04b245d.webp', '[\"challenging\", \"taxing\"]', '[\"easy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"demanding job\", \"meaning\": \"công việc đòi hỏi cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"demanding task\", \"meaning\": \"nhiệm vụ khó khăn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"demand\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"demand\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-cori-30fd0a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-aru0-30fd0a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-aru5-30fd0a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-aru6-30fd0a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-aru10-30fd0a45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-aru9-30fd0a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-aru3-30fd0a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-aru7-30fd0a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-aru8-30fd0a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-aru2-30fd0a45.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-ljspeech-30fd0a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-lt408-30fd0a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-lt138-30fd0a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-lt624-30fd0a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-lt396-30fd0a45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-lt498-30fd0a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-lt132-30fd0a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-lt288-30fd0a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-lt42-30fd0a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demanding-lt90-30fd0a45.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để mô tả công việc hoặc sếp khó tính, yêu cầu cao.', 'office', 1, 28),
('e6538132-0add-5d72-bbda-8245279b38ab', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '69a06e9e-dd6b-546a-9e69-4e67705c0ebb', 'ca164514-2734-5184-8bac-aa95896c728b', 'mission', 'UK: /ˈmɪʃən/ | US: /ˈmɪʃən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'nhiệm vụ', 'An important official job or duty assigned to a person or group.', 'Our company\'s mission is to provide excellent customer service.', 'Nhiệm vụ của công ty chúng tôi là cung cấp dịch vụ khách hàng xuất sắc.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate mission statement emphasizes sustainable growth and exceptional customer service.\", \"vi\": \"Tuyên bố sứ mệnh của công ty nhấn mạnh vào sự phát triển bền vững và dịch vụ khách hàng xuất sắc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-ljspeech-e59abed3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-cori-e59abed3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mission-a575111a.webp', '[\"objective\", \"goal\", \"purpose\", \"assignment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"mission statement\", \"meaning\": \"tuyên bố sứ mệnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"company mission\", \"meaning\": \"nhiệm vụ/sứ mệnh của công ty\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"commission\", \"note_vi\": \"Commission là tiền hoa hồng hoặc sự ủy nhiệm; mission là sứ mệnh hoặc nhiệm vụ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"missionary\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-cori-e59abed3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-aru0-e59abed3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-aru5-e59abed3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-aru6-e59abed3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-aru10-e59abed3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-aru9-e59abed3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-aru3-e59abed3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-aru7-e59abed3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-aru8-e59abed3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-aru2-e59abed3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-ljspeech-e59abed3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-lt408-e59abed3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-lt138-e59abed3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-lt624-e59abed3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-lt396-e59abed3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-lt498-e59abed3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-lt132-e59abed3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-lt288-e59abed3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-lt42-e59abed3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mission-lt90-e59abed3.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất phổ biến trong cụm \'mission statement\' (tuyên bố sứ mệnh của công ty).', 'corporate policy', 1, 29)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('e75e2941-436c-5eac-9f8c-08d0086d073c', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6a88767f-ba11-51f8-87cd-9fe26b3c0a3f', '4035c945-0e7b-5f89-a6e2-d6ac48c103e3', 'fire', '/ˈfaɪə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Sự cháy, ngọn lửa tạo ra nhiệt và ánh sáng.', 'the heat and light produced when something burns, with visible flames.', 'Emergency crews responded quickly to extinguish the fire at the downtown warehouse.', 'Lực lượng cứu hộ khẩn cấp đã ứng cứu nhanh chóng để dập tắt đám cháy tại nhà kho trung tâm thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"Staff must follow safety procedures in case of a fire in the building.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải tuân theo quy trình an toàn trong trường hợp xảy ra hỏa hoạn trong tòa nhà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-ljspeech-1da84024.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-cori-1da84024.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fire-3836ed7f.webp', '[\"blaze\", \"flame\", \"inferno\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"catch fire\", \"meaning\": \"bốc cháy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fire alarm\", \"meaning\": \"báo động cháy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"put out a fire\", \"meaning\": \"dập tắt đám cháy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"flame\", \"note_vi\": \"\'flame\' chỉ ngọn lửa cụ thể, \'fire\' chỉ hiện tượng cháy nói chung\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fiery\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"fire\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"firefighter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-cori-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru0-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru5-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru6-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru10-1da84024.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru9-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru3-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru7-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru8-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-aru2-1da84024.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-ljspeech-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt408-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt138-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt624-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt396-1da84024.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt498-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt132-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt288-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt42-1da84024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fire-lt90-1da84024.mp3\"]}}', '\'Fire\' còn có nghĩa là sa thải nhân viên (động từ); chú ý ngữ cảnh trong đề TOEIC.', 'office', 1, 0),
('7e87bf3f-2e30-5aaa-aedf-ab4240e74ec7', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6a88767f-ba11-51f8-87cd-9fe26b3c0a3f', '4035c945-0e7b-5f89-a6e2-d6ac48c103e3', 'extreme', '/ɪkˈstriːm/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Ở mức độ cao nhất, vượt quá giới hạn thông thường.', 'very great in degree or intensity, far beyond what is normal or usual.', 'He went to extreme lengths to ensure the success of the project.', 'Anh ấy đã nỗ lực hết sức để đảm bảo sự thành công của dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The project manager took extreme measures to meet the tight deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý dự án đã thực hiện các biện pháp cực đoan để đáp ứng thời hạn gấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-ljspeech-6928e849.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-cori-6928e849.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extreme-bf5baf3c.webp', '[\"intense\", \"severe\", \"excessive\"]', '[\"moderate\", \"mild\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"extreme measures\", \"meaning\": \"các biện pháp cực đoan\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extreme pressure\", \"meaning\": \"áp lực cực lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extreme caution\", \"meaning\": \"sự thận trọng tột độ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"excessive\", \"note_vi\": \"excessive nhấn mạnh vượt quá giới hạn cho phép, extreme nhấn mạnh mức độ cao nhất\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"extremely\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"extremity\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"extremism\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-cori-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru0-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru5-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru6-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru10-6928e849.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru9-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru3-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru7-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru8-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-aru2-6928e849.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-ljspeech-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt408-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt138-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt624-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt396-6928e849.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt498-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt132-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt288-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt42-6928e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extreme-lt90-6928e849.mp3\"]}}', 'Extreme thường đi với danh từ chỉ hành động hoặc điều kiện; đừng nhầm với \'extremely\' là trạng từ.', 'office', 1, 1),
('4c8a328d-cad7-5cb3-ba1a-f80d452e5718', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6a88767f-ba11-51f8-87cd-9fe26b3c0a3f', '4035c945-0e7b-5f89-a6e2-d6ac48c103e3', 'amount', '/əˈmaʊnt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Số lượng hoặc tổng số của một thứ gì đó, đặc biệt là thứ không đếm được.', 'a quantity or total number of something, especially uncountable things or money.', 'A large amount of rain fell last night, causing some flooding.', 'Một lượng lớn mưa đã rơi đêm qua, gây ra một số trận lụt.', '{\"en\": \"The company spent a large amount of money on the new marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã chi một khoản tiền lớn cho chiến dịch tiếp thị mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-ljspeech-9cb6ff12.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-cori-9cb6ff12.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/amount-861ff19f.webp', '[\"quantity\", \"total\", \"sum\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"large amount\", \"meaning\": \"số lượng lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"amount of money\", \"meaning\": \"khoản tiền\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"number\", \"note_vi\": \"Amount dùng cho danh từ không đếm được, number dùng cho danh từ đếm được.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"amount\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-cori-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru0-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru5-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru6-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru10-9cb6ff12.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru9-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru3-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru7-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru8-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-aru2-9cb6ff12.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-ljspeech-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt408-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt138-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt624-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt396-9cb6ff12.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt498-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt132-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt288-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt42-9cb6ff12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amount-lt90-9cb6ff12.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ dùng amount cho danh từ không đếm được như money, time, information.', 'finance', 1, 2),
('b016ea28-c933-5c59-9bca-21423e5f2471', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6a88767f-ba11-51f8-87cd-9fe26b3c0a3f', '4035c945-0e7b-5f89-a6e2-d6ac48c103e3', 'award-winning', '/əˈwɔːdˌwɪnɪŋ/', '', 'adjective', 'Đã giành được giải thưởng.', 'having received one or more prizes for being very good at something.', 'The restaurant is famous for its award-winning cuisine.', 'Nhà hàng nổi tiếng với ẩm thực từng đoạt giải thưởng.', '{\"en\": \"Our award-winning design team will present their new marketing strategy at the conference tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ thiết kế từng đoạt giải thưởng của chúng tôi sẽ trình bày chiến lược tiếp thị mới tại hội nghị ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-ljspeech-00843495.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-cori-00843495.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/award-winning-4582e46f.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-cori-00843495.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-aru0-00843495.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-aru5-00843495.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-aru6-00843495.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-aru10-00843495.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-aru9-00843495.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-aru3-00843495.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-aru7-00843495.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-aru8-00843495.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-aru2-00843495.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-ljspeech-00843495.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-lt408-00843495.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-lt138-00843495.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-lt624-00843495.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-lt396-00843495.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-lt498-00843495.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-lt132-00843495.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-lt288-00843495.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-lt42-00843495.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/award-winning-lt90-00843495.mp3\"]}}', '', 'other', 1, 3),
('71755aff-c2c0-5500-af1f-1d38886fe341', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6a88767f-ba11-51f8-87cd-9fe26b3c0a3f', '4035c945-0e7b-5f89-a6e2-d6ac48c103e3', 'spacecraft', '/ˈspeɪskrɑːft/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tàu được thiết kế để bay vào không gian.', 'a vehicle that is used for traveling outside the earth\'s atmosphere into space.', 'The new spacecraft is designed to explore distant planets.', 'Con tàu vũ trụ mới được thiết kế để khám phá các hành tinh xa xôi.', '{\"en\": \"The aerospace company is testing a new spacecraft for future commercial flights into orbit.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty hàng không vũ trụ đang thử nghiệm một tàu vũ trụ mới cho các chuyến bay thương mại vào quỹ đạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-ljspeech-b0e44b65.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-cori-b0e44b65.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spacecraft-3d0b0f7f.webp', '[\"spaceship\", \"shuttle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"launch a spacecraft\", \"meaning\": \"phóng tàu vũ trụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"space travel\", \"meaning\": \"du hành vũ trụ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"aircraft\", \"note_vi\": \"Spacecraft là tàu vũ trụ, aircraft là máy bay.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"space\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-cori-b0e44b65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-aru0-b0e44b65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-aru5-b0e44b65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-aru6-b0e44b65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-aru10-b0e44b65.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-aru9-b0e44b65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-aru3-b0e44b65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-aru7-b0e44b65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-aru8-b0e44b65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-aru2-b0e44b65.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-ljspeech-b0e44b65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-lt408-b0e44b65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-lt138-b0e44b65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-lt624-b0e44b65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-lt396-b0e44b65.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-lt498-b0e44b65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-lt132-b0e44b65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-lt288-b0e44b65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-lt42-b0e44b65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacecraft-lt90-b0e44b65.mp3\"]}}', 'Spacecraft là tàu vũ trụ, aircraft là máy bay.', 'technology', 1, 4),
('e327cdf1-5fda-5e1f-a6f0-3efc10bfaaac', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6a88767f-ba11-51f8-87cd-9fe26b3c0a3f', '4035c945-0e7b-5f89-a6e2-d6ac48c103e3', 'headset', '/ˈhedset/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị gồm tai nghe và micro, dùng để giao tiếp hoặc nghe âm thanh.', 'a piece of equipment worn on the head with a microphone and headphones.', 'He put on his gaming headset to talk with his teammates online.', 'Anh ấy đeo tai nghe chơi game để nói chuyện với đồng đội trực tuyến.', '{\"en\": \"Every customer service representative is required to wear a wireless headset during calls.\", \"vi\": \"Mỗi đại diện dịch vụ khách hàng được yêu cầu đeo tai nghe không dây khi gọi điện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headset-ljspeech-d67dd5a2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headset-cori-d67dd5a2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/headset-993e9471.webp', '[\"headphones\", \"earphones\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wireless headset\", \"meaning\": \"tai nghe không dây\"}, {\"phrase\": \"virtual reality headset\", \"meaning\": \"kính thực tế ảo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"headphones\", \"note_vi\": \"headphones thường chỉ có tai nghe, headset có kèm thêm micro.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headset-cori-d67dd5a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headset-aru0-d67dd5a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headset-aru5-d67dd5a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headset-aru6-d67dd5a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headset-aru10-d67dd5a2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headset-aru9-d67dd5a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headset-aru3-d67dd5a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headset-aru7-d67dd5a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/headset-aru8-d67dd5a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciat