('55d93a46-cc43-5748-8910-265845571f6d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6a88767f-ba11-51f8-87cd-9fe26b3c0a3f', '4035c945-0e7b-5f89-a6e2-d6ac48c103e3', 'irregular', '/ɪˈreɡjələ(r)/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không đều đặn, không theo quy tắc.', 'not happening at regular times or not following a standard pattern or shape.', 'His heartbeat was irregular, so the doctor ordered more tests.', 'Nhịp tim của anh ấy không đều, nên bác sĩ đã yêu cầu làm thêm xét nghiệm.', '{\"en\": \"The irregular delivery schedule caused some delays in our production line last month.\", \"vi\": \"Lịch giao hàng không đều đặn đã gây ra một số chậm trễ trong dây chuyền sản xuất tháng trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-ljspeech-6719f3fd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-cori-6719f3fd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/irregular-35e5eee4.webp', '[\"uneven\", \"unpredictable\"]', '[\"regular\", \"steady\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"irregular schedule\", \"meaning\": \"lịch trình không đều\"}, {\"phrase\": \"irregular shape\", \"meaning\": \"hình dạng không đều\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"regular\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-cori-6719f3fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-aru0-6719f3fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-aru5-6719f3fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-aru6-6719f3fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-aru10-6719f3fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-aru9-6719f3fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-aru3-6719f3fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-aru7-6719f3fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-aru8-6719f3fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-aru2-6719f3fd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-ljspeech-6719f3fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-lt408-6719f3fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-lt138-6719f3fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-lt624-6719f3fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-lt396-6719f3fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-lt498-6719f3fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-lt132-6719f3fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-lt288-6719f3fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-lt42-6719f3fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irregular-lt90-6719f3fd.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để phàn nàn về dịch vụ hoặc quy trình không ổn định.', 'manufacturing', 1, 12),
('fad47b36-e705-5941-9207-5a7181b8cd7f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6a88767f-ba11-51f8-87cd-9fe26b3c0a3f', '4035c945-0e7b-5f89-a6e2-d6ac48c103e3', 'once', '/wʌns/', 'B1', 'conjunction', 'Ngay khi; một khi (diễn tả điều kiện hoặc thời điểm).', 'as soon as or at the moment that a particular thing happens in time.', 'Once you finish your homework, you can watch TV.', 'Một khi con làm xong bài tập về nhà, con có thể xem TV.', '{\"en\": \"Once the contract is signed by both parties, we can start the new project immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Một khi hợp đồng được ký bởi cả hai bên, chúng tôi có thể bắt đầu dự án mới ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-ljspeech-18638356.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-cori-18638356.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/once-de04318e.webp', '[\"as soon as\", \"when\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"once again\", \"meaning\": \"một lần nữa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"once upon a time\", \"meaning\": \"ngày xửa ngày xưa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"one\", \"note_vi\": \"Once là một khi/một lần, phân biệt với số một (one).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-cori-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru0-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru5-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru6-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru10-18638356.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru9-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru3-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru7-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru8-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-aru2-18638356.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-ljspeech-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt408-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt138-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt624-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt396-18638356.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt498-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt132-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt288-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt42-18638356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/once-lt90-18638356.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi làm liên từ, once đi với mệnh đề chỉ thời điểm hoàn thành một việc trước khi việc khác xảy ra.', 'business', 1, 13),
('13724b96-9c67-5f65-9307-3aadf8ceafa2', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6a88767f-ba11-51f8-87cd-9fe26b3c0a3f', '4035c945-0e7b-5f89-a6e2-d6ac48c103e3', 'unexpected', '/ˌʌnɪkˈspɛktɪd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Xảy ra một cách bất ngờ, không được dự đoán trước.', 'happening suddenly without being planned or expected by anyone in advance.', 'The sudden rain was completely unexpected for this time of year.', 'Trận mưa bất chợt hoàn toàn bất ngờ vào thời điểm này trong năm.', '{\"en\": \"The company faced an unexpected delay in shipping due to severe weather conditions at the port.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đối mặt với sự chậm trễ bất ngờ trong việc vận chuyển do thời tiết khắc nghiệt tại cảng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-ljspeech-fd2a2764.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-cori-fd2a2764.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unexpected-0f1dd964.webp', '[\"unforeseen\", \"sudden\"]', '[\"expected\", \"planned\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unexpected delay\", \"meaning\": \"sự chậm trễ bất ngờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unexpected result\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả không lường trước\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"expect\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-cori-fd2a2764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-aru0-fd2a2764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-aru5-fd2a2764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-aru6-fd2a2764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-aru10-fd2a2764.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-aru9-fd2a2764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-aru3-fd2a2764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-aru7-fd2a2764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-aru8-fd2a2764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-aru2-fd2a2764.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-ljspeech-fd2a2764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-lt408-fd2a2764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-lt138-fd2a2764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-lt624-fd2a2764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-lt396-fd2a2764.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-lt498-fd2a2764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-lt132-fd2a2764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-lt288-fd2a2764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-lt42-fd2a2764.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unexpected-lt90-fd2a2764.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất hay gặp trong các email xin lỗi khách hàng về sự cố.', 'business', 1, 14),
('f6f47768-9cd4-5fde-86b0-33d63d5e8947', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6a88767f-ba11-51f8-87cd-9fe26b3c0a3f', '4035c945-0e7b-5f89-a6e2-d6ac48c103e3', 'weep', '/wiːp/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Khóc, nhỏ lệ.', 'to cry tears because of strong emotions such as sadness or happiness.', 'She began to weep silently after hearing the sad news.', 'Cô ấy bắt đầu khóc thầm lặng lẽ sau khi nghe tin buồn.', '{\"en\": \"The retiring manager began to weep as her colleagues presented her with a farewell gift.\", \"vi\": \"Vị quản lý nghỉ hưu đã bật khóc khi các đồng nghiệp trao cho cô món quà chia tay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weep-ljspeech-8245da4d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weep-cori-8245da4d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/weep-685d24ed.webp', '[\"cry\", \"sob\"]', '[\"laugh\", \"smile\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"weep with joy\", \"meaning\": \"khóc vì vui mừng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"weep bitterly\", \"meaning\": \"khóc cay đắng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wipe\", \"note_vi\": \"weep là khóc, wipe là lau chùi (dễ nhầm phát âm/chính tả)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"weeper\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"weepy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weep-cori-8245da4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weep-aru0-8245da4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weep-aru5-8245da4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weep-aru6-8245da4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weep-aru10-8245da4d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weep-aru9-8245da4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weep-aru3-8245da4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weep-aru7-8245da4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weep-aru8-8245da4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weep-aru2-8245da4d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/s