('7c968c39-a1c7-5193-aab5-2716a70b265f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6b1b4ed1-4c6c-5220-8c84-f675771c17f2', '5501a11f-6ea2-5600-af4d-7159c1b8a79d', 'reduce', '/rɪˈdjuːs/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Làm cho cái gì đó ít hơn về số lượng, kích thước hoặc mức độ.', 'to make the size, amount, or degree of something smaller than it was before.', 'The company aims to reduce operating expenses by ten percent this quarter.', 'Công ty hướng tới việc giảm chi phí hoạt động 10% trong quý này.', '{\"en\": \"The manager decided to reduce the production costs to improve the company\'s quarterly profit.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý quyết định cắt giảm chi phí sản xuất để cải thiện lợi nhuận hàng quý của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-ljspeech-48c3689f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-cori-48c3689f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reduce-ccd49741.webp', '[\"decrease\", \"lower\"]', '[\"increase\", \"raise\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reduce costs\", \"meaning\": \"cắt giảm chi phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reduce the risk\", \"meaning\": \"giảm thiểu rủi ro\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"deduce\", \"note_vi\": \"deduce là suy luận, reduce là làm giảm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reduction\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-cori-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru0-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru5-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru6-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru10-48c3689f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru9-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru3-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru7-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduce-aru8-48c3689f.mp3\", \"/st