('d11f398a-e8b8-5c7d-af20-462424a9f973', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6b1b4ed1-4c6c-5220-8c84-f675771c17f2', '5501a11f-6ea2-5600-af4d-7159c1b8a79d', 'vast', '/vɑːst/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất rộng lớn về diện tích, số lượng hoặc quy mô.', 'extremely large in area, size, amount, or degree, covering a very wide space.', 'The desert stretched out before them, a vast expanse of sand.', 'Sa mạc trải dài trước mặt họ, một vùng cát mênh mông.', '{\"en\": \"The company has a vast network of distributors across the country to ensure fast delivery.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty có một mạng lưới nhà phân phối rộng lớn trên khắp cả nước để đảm bảo giao hàng nhanh chóng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-ljspeech-6a7ebfc5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-cori-6a7ebfc5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vast-d9f5d358.webp', '[\"huge\", \"immense\"]', '[\"tiny\", \"small\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"vast majority\", \"meaning\": \"phần lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vast experience\", \"meaning\": \"kinh nghiệm dày dặn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"vastly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-cori-6a7ebfc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru0-6a7ebfc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru5-6a7ebfc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru6-6a7ebfc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru10-6a7ebfc5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru9-6a7ebfc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru3-6a7ebfc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru7-6a7ebfc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru8-6a7ebfc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-aru2-6a7ebfc5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vast-ljspeech-6a7ebfc