('86867b72-bee7-5322-a18b-652d4588bfa2', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6b1b4ed1-4c6c-5220-8c84-f675771c17f2', '5501a11f-6ea2-5600-af4d-7159c1b8a79d', 'method', '/ˈmeθəd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Cách thức, phương pháp cụ thể để làm việc gì đó.', 'a particular way of doing something, especially a systematic or planned one.', 'Her teaching method encourages students to think critically and creatively.', 'Phương pháp giảng dạy của cô ấy khuyến khích học sinh tư duy phản biện và sáng tạo.', '{\"en\": \"The research team tested a new training method to improve employee work productivity.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm nghiên cứu đã thử nghiệm một phương pháp đào tạo mới để cải thiện năng suất lao động.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-ljspeech-bfbaf8b2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-cori-bfbaf8b2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/method-a5acef7e.webp', '[\"approach\", \"technique\", \"system\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"payment method\", \"meaning\": \"phương thức thanh toán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"effective method\", \"meaning\": \"phương pháp hiệu quả\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"methodology\", \"note_vi\": \"Methodology là phương pháp luận, method là phương pháp cụ thể.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"methodical\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"methodically\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"methodology\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-cori-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru0-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru5-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru6-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru10-bfbaf8b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru9-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru3-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru7-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru8-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-aru2-bfbaf8b2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-ljspeech-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt408-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt138-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt624-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt396-bfbaf8b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt498-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt132-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt288-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt42-bfbaf8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/method-lt90-bfbaf8b2.mp3\"]}}', 'Cực kỳ phổ biến trong đề thi TOEIC dưới dạng \'payment method\'.', 'business', 1, 26),
('2f068e0e-a0a0-5f2b-a853-687d9474c164', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6b1b4ed1-4c6c-5220-8c84-f675771c17f2', '5501a11f-6ea2-5600-af4d-7159c1b8a79d', 'satisfying', '/ˈsætɪsfaɪɪŋ/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Mang lại cảm giác hài lòng hoặc mãn nguyện.', 'making you feel happy and pleased because you have achieved what you wanted to do.', 'Receiving positive feedback from international clients was a deeply satisfying outcome for our team.', 'Nhận được phản hồi tích cực từ các khách hàng quốc tế là một kết quả hết sức thỏa mãn đối với đội ngũ của chúng tôi.', '{\"en\": \"It is very satisfying to complete all the pending tasks before the end of the day.\", \"vi\": \"Thật thỏa mãn khi hoàn thành tất cả các nhiệm vụ đang chờ xử lý trước khi kết thúc ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfying-ljspeech-ae045ec3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfying-cori-ae045ec3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/satisfying-b54ad5ee.webp', '[\"rewarding\", \"fulfilling\", \"gratifying\"]', '[\"unsatisfying\", \"disappointing\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deeply satisfying\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ thỏa mãn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"satisfying experience\", \"meaning\": \"trải nghiệm đáng giá\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"satisfy\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"satisfaction\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfying-cori-ae045ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfying-aru0-ae045ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfying-aru5-ae045ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfying-aru6-ae045ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfying-aru10-ae045ec3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfying-aru9-ae045ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfying-aru3-ae045ec3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciat