('ab186b4a-1097-586f-9e00-4767cdd68aaa', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6b1b4ed1-4c6c-5220-8c84-f675771c17f2', '5501a11f-6ea2-5600-af4d-7159c1b8a79d', 'courtesy', '/ˈkɜːtəsi/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Thái độ và cách cư xử nhã nhặn, tôn trọng người khác.', 'good manners and consideration displayed towards individuals in daily interactions.', 'The hotel staff extended every courtesy to ensure our stay was comfortable.', 'Nhân viên khách sạn đã thể hiện mọi sự lịch sự để đảm bảo kỳ nghỉ của chúng tôi được thoải mái.', '{\"en\": \"It is common courtesy to reply to all client emails within twenty-four hours of receipt.\", \"vi\": \"Phép lịch sự thông thường là trả lời tất cả email của khách hàng trong vòng 24 giờ kể từ khi nhận được.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-ljspeech-d95df593.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-cori-d95df593.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/courtesy-95d56dbd.webp', '[\"politeness\", \"civility\"]', '[\"rudeness\", \"impoliteness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"common courtesy\", \"meaning\": \"phép lịch sự thông thường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extend the courtesy\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện sự lịch thiệp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"courteous\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-cori-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru0-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru5-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru6-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru10-d95df593.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru9-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru3-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru7-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru8-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-aru2-d95df593.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-ljspeech-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt408-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt138-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt624-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt396-d95df593.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt498-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt132-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt288-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt42-d95df593.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courtesy-lt90-d95df593.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong cụm \'common courtesy\' để chỉ những hành động lịch sự tối thiểu.', 'office', 1, 29),
('f1bb4e1d-7515-5418-af97-e4a1c96e0262', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6d459a51-0b3b-590e-8ed2-4fc0e7f4ac00', 'fbd50459-4063-5abc-92b8-486914a12076', 'development', 'UK: /dɪˈveləpmənt/ | US: /dɪˈveləpmənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'sự phát triển', 'An area of land with new buildings or housing projects constructed on it.', 'The city council approved the new housing development.', 'Hội đồng thành phố đã phê duyệt dự án phát triển nhà ở mới.', '{\"en\": \"The city council approved funding for a new residential development near the railway station.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng thành phố đã phê duyệt kinh phí cho một khu quy hoạch dân cư mới gần ga tàu hỏa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-ljspeech-05134426.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-cori-05134426.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/development-e4f313c3.webp', '[\"expansion\", \"growth\", \"project\", \"construction\"]', '[\"decline\", \"stagnation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"residential development\", \"meaning\": \"khu phát triển nhà ở / dân cư\"}, {\"phrase\": \"research and development\", \"meaning\": \"nghiên cứu và phát triển (R&D)\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"develop\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"developer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-cori-05134426.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-aru0-05134426.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-aru5-05134426.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-aru6-05134426.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-aru10-05134426.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-aru9-05134426.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-aru3-05134426.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-aru7-05134426.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-aru8-05134426.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-aru2-05134426.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-ljspeech-05134426.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-lt408-05134426.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-lt138-05134426.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-lt624-05134426.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-lt396-05134426.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-lt498-05134426.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-lt132-05134426.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-lt288-05134426.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-lt42-05134426.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/development-lt90-05134426.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa sự phát triển, định nghĩa này nhấn mạnh vào khu quy hoạch/dự án xây dựng mới (như housing development).', 'real estate', 1, 0),
('c42caec6-1c18-5219-b1aa-5e770758b894', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6d459a51-0b3b-590e-8ed2-4fc0e7f4ac00', 'fbd50459-4063-5abc-92b8-486914a12076', 'employer', '/ɪmˈplɔɪə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người hoặc tổ chức thuê nhân viên làm việc.', 'a person or organization that pays people to work for them.', 'The large tech employer announced plans to hire five hundred new engineers.', 'Chủ lao động công nghệ lớn này đã thông báo các kế hoạch tuyển dụng năm trăm kỹ sư mới.', '{\"en\": \"The new employer offered a competitive salary and flexible working hours to attract talent.\", \"vi\": \"Người sử dụng lao động mới đã đưa ra mức lương cạnh tranh và giờ làm việc linh hoạt để thu hút tài năng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/employer-ljspeech-70cafc7b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/employer-cori-70cafc7b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/employer-07e3288a.webp', '[\"boss\", \"recruiter\", \"hirer\"]', '[\"employee\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"prospective employer\", \"meaning\": \"nhà tuyển dụng tiềm năng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"current employer\", \"meaning\": \"người sử dụng lao động hiện tại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"employee\", \"note_vi\": \"là người lao động (nhân viên), còn employer là người thuê.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"employ\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"employee\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"employment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/employer-cori-70cafc7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/employer-aru0-70cafc7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/employer-aru5-70cafc7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/employer-aru6-70cafc7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/employer-aru10-70cafc7b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/employer-aru9-70cafc7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/employer-aru3-70cafc