('8307db6e-8155-54af-8450-b4e23c579298', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6d459a51-0b3b-590e-8ed2-4fc0e7f4ac00', 'fbd50459-4063-5abc-92b8-486914a12076', 'best', '/best/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Điều tốt nhất, xuất sắc nhất.', 'the highest quality or most excellent thing or result possible.', 'Our team will choose the best solution to solve this technical problem quickly.', 'Đội của chúng tôi sẽ chọn giải pháp tốt nhất để giải quyết sự cố kỹ thuật này một cách nhanh chóng.', '{\"en\": \"Our team delivered its best performance during the annual sales competition.\", \"vi\": \"Đội của chúng tôi đã thể hiện màn trình diễn tốt nhất trong cuộc thi doanh số hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-ljspeech-c5f5e4d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-cori-c5f5e4d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/best-40c5a25b.webp', '[\"top\", \"finest\", \"optimum\"]', '[\"worst\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"do one\'s best\", \"meaning\": \"cố gắng hết sức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at best\", \"meaning\": \"trong trường hợp tốt nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"best of luck\", \"meaning\": \"chúc may mắn nhất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"better\", \"note_vi\": \"better là so sánh hơn, best là so sánh nhất của good\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"best\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"best\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"better\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-cori-c5f5e4d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-aru0-c5f5e4d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-aru5-c5f5e4d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-aru6-c5f5e4d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-aru10-c5f5e4d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-aru9-c5f5e4d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-aru3-c5f5e4d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-aru7-c5f5e4d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-aru8-c5f5e4d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-aru2-c5f5e4d7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-ljspeech-c5f5e4d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-lt408-c5f5e4d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-lt138-c5f5e4d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-lt624-c5f5e4d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-lt396-c5f5e4d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-lt498-c5f5e4d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-lt132-c5f5e4d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-lt288-c5f5e4d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-lt42-c5f5e4d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-lt90-c5f5e4d7.mp3\"]}}', 'Best là danh từ trong \'do your best\' (cố hết sức); đừng nhầm với best là tính từ so sánh nhất.', 'hr', 1, 4),
('d4d96994-2686-566e-bb18-b9b4130679e6', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6d459a51-0b3b-590e-8ed2-4fc0e7f4ac00', 'fbd50459-4063-5abc-92b8-486914a12076', 'florist', 'UK: /ˈflɒrɪst/ | US: /ˈflɔːrɪst/', 'B1', 'noun', 'người bán hoa, cửa hàng hoa', 'A person or shop that sells and arranges cut plants with colorful blooms.', 'The florist designed a beautiful bouquet for the event.', 'Người bán hoa đã thiết kế một bó hoa đẹp cho sự kiện.', '{\"en\": \"The event coordinator hired a popular florist to design floral arrangements for the annual banquet.\", \"vi\": \"Điều phối viên sự kiện đã thuê một tiệm hoa nổi tiếng thiết kế các bình hoa trang trí cho bữa tiệc thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-ljspeech-1c178dd9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-cori-1c178dd9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/florist-fbfef8c4.webp', '[\"flower seller\", \"botanical designer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"local florist\", \"meaning\": \"cửa hàng hoa địa phương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"florist shop\", \"meaning\": \"tiệm bán hoa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"flower\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-cori-1c178dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-aru0-1c178dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-aru5-1c178dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-aru6-1c178dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-aru10-1c178dd9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-aru9-1c178dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-aru3-1c178dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-aru7-1c178dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-aru8-1c178dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-aru2-1c178dd9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-ljspeech-1c178dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-lt408-1c178dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-lt138-1c178dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-lt624-1c178dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-lt396-1c178dd9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-lt498-1c178dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-lt132-1c178dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-lt288-1c178dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-lt42-1c178dd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/florist-lt90-1c178dd9.mp3\"]}}', '\'Florist\' chỉ cả người làm/bán hoa lẫn cửa hàng bán hoa. Thường xuất hiện trong bài thi TOEIC liên quan đến chuẩn bị sự kiện/tiệc tùng.', 'entertainment', 1, 5),
('c5ffd1cb-94bd-54a9-aab2-b377f3975eb4', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6d459a51-0b3b-590e-8ed2-4fc0e7f4ac00', 'fbd50459-4063-5abc-92b8-486914a12076', 'impersonal', '/ɪmˈpɜːsənl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không thể hiện cảm xúc cá nhân; khách quan hoặc lạnh lùng.', 'not showing human warm feelings, friendliness, or emotional connection towards other people.', 'The large corporation often felt impersonal to its employees.', 'Công ty lớn đó thường khiến nhân viên cảm thấy xa cách, thiếu sự quan tâm.', '{\"en\": \"The manager sent an impersonal email to inform staff about the new working policy.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã gửi một email mang tính xã giao lạnh lùng để thông báo cho nhân viên về chính sách làm việc mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-ljspeech-d1570e91.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-cori-d1570e91.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/impersonal-1ea1a952.webp', '[\"unfeeling\", \"cold\", \"detached\"]', '[\"personal\", \"warm\", \"friendly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"impersonal service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ thiếu thân thiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"impersonal style\", \"meaning\": \"phong cách khách quan\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unpersonal\", \"note_vi\": \"Unpersonal không phải là từ hợp lệ, tính từ phủ định là impersonal.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"impersonally\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"impersonality\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-cori-d1570e91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-aru0-d1570e91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-aru5-d1570e91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-aru6-d1570e91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-aru10-d1570e91.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-aru9-d1570e91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-aru3-d1570e91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-aru7-d1570e91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-aru8-d1570e91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-aru2-d1570e91.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-ljspeech-d1570e91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-lt408-d1570e91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-lt138-d1570e91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-lt624-d1570e91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-lt396-d1570e91.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-lt498-d1570e91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-lt132-d1570e91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-lt288-d1570e91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-lt42-d1570e91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impersonal-lt90-d1570e91.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố \'im-\' đóng vai trò phủ định nghĩa của tính từ gốc \'personal\'.', 'office', 1, 6),
('39d8c02c-15c0-51eb-9bc8-580941359a5a', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6d459a51-0b3b-590e-8ed2-4fc0e7f4ac00', 'fbd50459-4063-5abc-92b8-486914a12076', 'immigrate', '/ˈɪmɪɡreɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Đến sống vĩnh viễn ở một quốc gia không phải quê hương mình.', 'to move to a new country to live there permanently, leaving your home country.', 'Many people choose to immigrate to Canada for better job opportunities.', 'Nhiều người chọn nhập cư vào Canada để tìm kiếm cơ hội việc làm tốt hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The company helped several skilled workers immigrate and obtain the necessary work visas.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã giúp một số lao động có tay nghề nhập cư và xin visa lao động cần thiết.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-ljspeech-cc499e62.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-cori-cc499e62.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/immigrate-0fb9705c.webp', '[\"migrate\", \"relocate\", \"settle\"]', '[\"emigrate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"immigrate to a country\", \"meaning\": \"nhập cư vào một quốc gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"immigrate legally\", \"meaning\": \"nhập cư hợp pháp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"immigrate for work\", \"meaning\": \"nhập cư vì công việc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"emigrate\", \"note_vi\": \"emigrate = rời khỏi quê hương; immigrate = đến nước mới định cư\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"immigration\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"immigrant\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"immigrated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-cori-cc499e62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-aru0-cc499e62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-aru5-cc499e62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-aru6-cc499e62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-aru10-cc499e62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-aru9-cc499e62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-aru3-cc499e62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-aru7-cc499e62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-aru8-cc499e62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-aru2-cc499e62.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-ljspeech-cc499e62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-lt408-cc499e62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-lt138-cc499e62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-lt624-cc499e62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-lt396-cc499e62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-lt498-cc499e62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-lt132-cc499e62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-lt288-cc499e62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-lt42-cc499e62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immigrate-lt90-cc499e62.mp3\"]}}', 'Immigrate = đến nước mới; emigrate = rời nước cũ. Nhớ: im- = vào trong.', 'hr', 1, 7),
('f742a569-deb7-5578-a02d-9c5b7375da7b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6d459a51-0b3b-590e-8ed2-4fc0e7f4ac00', 'fbd50459-4063-5abc-92b8-486914a12076', 'satisfy', 'UK: /ˈsætɪsfaɪd/ | US: /ˈsætɪsfaɪd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'hài lòng, thỏa mãn', 'Content and pleased because one\'s desires, needs, or expectations have been completely fulfilled.', 'Our satisfied customers often leave positive feedback.', 'Khách hàng hài lòng của chúng tôi thường để lại phản hồi tích cực.', '{\"en\": \"To satisfy client demand, the manufacturer decided to increase production of the popular model.\", \"vi\": \"Để đáp ứng nhu cầu của khách hàng, nhà sản xuất đã quyết định tăng sản lượng của dòng sản phẩm được ưa chuộng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-ljspeech-fb36f0d0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-cori-fb36f0d0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/satisfy-37f23e5c.webp', '[\"fulfill\", \"meet\", \"gratify\", \"please\"]', '[\"dissatisfy\", \"fail\", \"displease\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"satisfy requirements\", \"meaning\": \"đáp ứng các yêu cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"satisfy demand\", \"meaning\": \"thỏa mãn nhu cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"satisfy conditions\", \"meaning\": \"đáp ứng các điều kiện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"meet\", \"note_vi\": \"cả satisfy và meet đều mang nghĩa đáp ứng (nhu cầu/yêu cầu), có thể dùng thay thế nhau trong ngữ cảnh công việc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"satisfaction\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"satisfied\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"satisfactory\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-cori-fb36f0d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-aru0-fb36f0d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-aru5-fb36f0d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-aru6-fb36f0d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-aru10-fb36f0d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-aru9-fb36f0d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-aru3-fb36f0d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-aru7-fb36f0d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-aru8-fb36f0d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-aru2-fb36f0d0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-ljspeech-fb36f0d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-lt408-fb36f0d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-lt138-fb36f0d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-lt624-fb36f0d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-lt396-fb36f0d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-lt498-fb36f0d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-lt132-fb36f0d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-lt288-fb36f0d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-lt42-fb36f0d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satisfy-lt90-fb36f0d0.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ \'satisfy\' thường đi với các tân ngữ như requirement, condition, demand, need (nghĩa là đáp ứng hoặc thỏa mãn điều kiện/nhu cầu).', 'business', 1, 8),
('662882e0-e7f2-5eca-9c39-fa32f9951710', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6d459a51-0b3b-590e-8ed2-4fc0e7f4ac00', 'fbd50459-4063-5abc-92b8-486914a12076', 'angel', '/ˈeɪndʒl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sinh vật siêu nhiên, thường có cánh, được coi là sứ giả của Chúa.', 'a spiritual being with wings seen as a messenger from the divine.', 'Many children believe in guardian angels who protect them.', 'Nhiều trẻ em tin vào những thiên thần hộ mệnh bảo vệ chúng.', '{\"en\": \"The angel investor from the conference agreed to fund our startup project.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà đầu tư thiên thần từ hội nghị đã đồng ý tài trợ dự án khởi nghiệp của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-ljspeech-c8a50f63.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-cori-c8a50f63.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/angel-c63a04ea.webp', '[\"celestial being\", \"spirit\"]', '[\"demon\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"guardian angel\", \"meaning\": \"thiên thần hộ mệnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"angel investor\", \"meaning\": \"nhà đầu tư thiên thần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"angle\", \"note_vi\": \"angle là góc, phát âm gần nhưng nghĩa khác.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"angelic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-cori-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru0-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru5-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru6-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru10-c8a50f63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru9-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru3-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru7-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru8-c8a50f63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/angel-aru2-c8a50f63.mp3\"]