('156b8569-3f5b-5525-aae1-ed02c10708af', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6d459a51-0b3b-590e-8ed2-4fc0e7f4ac00', 'fbd50459-4063-5abc-92b8-486914a12076', 'hike', 'UK: /haɪk/ | US: /haɪk/', 'B1', 'verb', 'đi bộ đường dài, leo núi', 'To walk a long distance through natural environments such as mountains or forests.', 'They plan to hike a new trail this weekend.', 'Họ dự định đi bộ trên một con đường mòn mới vào cuối tuần này.', '{\"en\": \"Many employees enjoy hiking in the national park during the annual company retreat.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều nhân viên thích đi bộ đường dài trong công viên quốc gia trong chuyến dã ngoại thường niên của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-ljspeech-ecec1d54.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-cori-ecec1d54.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hike-4c190dc4.webp', '[\"trek\", \"tramp\", \"tudge\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"go for a hike\", \"meaning\": \"đi bộ đường dài dã ngoại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hike trails\", \"meaning\": \"đi theo các tuyến đường mòn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"walk\", \"note_vi\": \"\'walk\' là đi bộ thông thường, \'hike\' là đi bộ đường dài/leo núi trong môi trường thiên nhiên.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hiker\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hiking\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-cori-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-aru0-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-aru5-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-aru6-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-aru10-ecec1d54.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-aru9-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-aru3-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-aru7-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-aru8-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-aru2-ecec1d54.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-ljspeech-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-lt408-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-lt138-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-lt624-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-lt396-ecec1d54.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-lt498-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-lt132-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-lt288-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-lt42-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-lt90-ecec1d54.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa đi bộ dã ngoại (v), trong TOEIC danh từ \'hike\' còn hay dùng nghĩa \'sự tăng giá/tăng lương đột ngột\' (price hike / rate hike).', 'recreation', 1, 10),
('f3ebb2e3-f81f-5f46-8ca4-654de2565e7c', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6d459a51-0b3b-590e-8ed2-4fc0e7f4ac00', 'fbd50459-4063-5abc-92b8-486914a12076', 'captain', '/ˈkæptɪn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người chỉ huy một con tàu, máy bay hoặc đội thể thao.', 'An officer who commands a ship, aircraft, or military unit during operations.', 'The captain safely navigated the ship through the stormy seas.', 'Thuyền trưởng đã lái con tàu an toàn qua vùng biển bão tố.', '{\"en\": \"The experienced captain welcomed the passengers aboard the cruise ship before departure.\", \"vi\": \"Người thuyền trưởng dày dạn kinh nghiệm đã chào đón các hành khách lên tàu du lịch trước khi khởi hành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/captain-ljspeech-85f45e16.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/captain-cori-85f45e16.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/captain-e1dfd3b5.webp', '[\"commander\", \"leader\", \"chief\"]', '[\"follower\", \"crew member\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ship captain\", \"meaning\": \"thuyền trưởng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"team captain\", \"meaning\": \"đội trưởng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"captaincy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/captain-cori-85f45e16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/captain-aru0-85f45e16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/captain-aru5-85f45e16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/captain-aru6-85f45e16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/captain-aru10-85f45e16.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/captain-aru9-85f45e16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/captain-aru3-85f45e16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/captain-aru7-85f45e16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/captain-aru8-85f45e16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/captain-aru2-85f45e16.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\