('237e9f2a-1cb1-537f-b36a-141a525c5f16', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '6d459a51-0b3b-590e-8ed2-4fc0e7f4ac00', 'fbd50459-4063-5abc-92b8-486914a12076', 'milligram', '/ˈmɪlɪɡræm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Đơn vị đo khối lượng bằng một phần nghìn gram.', 'a unit of weight equal to one thousandth of a gram.', 'The doctor prescribed a very small dose, only a few milligrams of the medicine.', 'Bác sĩ kê đơn một liều rất nhỏ, chỉ vài miligam thuốc.', '{\"en\": \"The laboratory technician carefully measured exactly fifty milligrams of the chemical for the experiment.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên phòng thí nghiệm đã đo cẩn thận chính xác năm mươi miligam hóa chất cho thí nghiệm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milligram-ljspeech-ba3850b4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milligram-cori-ba3850b4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/milligram-da3cb69d.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a few milligrams\", \"meaning\": \"vài miligam\"}, {\"phrase\": \"measured in milligrams\", \"meaning\": \"được đo bằng miligam\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"gram\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"kilogram\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milligram-cori-ba3850b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milligram-aru0-ba3850b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milligram-aru5-ba3850b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milligram-aru6-ba3850b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milligram-aru10-ba3850b4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milligram-aru9-ba3850b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milligram-aru3-ba3850b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milligram-aru7-ba3850b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milligram-aru8-ba3850b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/milligram-aru2-ba3850b4.mp3\"