('822ddf5b-ae4f-5622-871e-8fe2f8242c9a', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '736c6ab8-ef30-5a53-a67c-4d9dfd3a6304', '9c17952d-25fe-503a-b76f-efdd60abd3f9', 'fountain', 'UK: /ˈfaʊn.tɪn/ | US: /ˈfaʊn.tən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'đài phun nước', 'A decorative structure that sprays streams of water into the air.', 'A beautiful fountain stands in the center of the park.', 'Một đài phun nước tuyệt đẹp nằm ở trung tâm công viên.', '{\"en\": \"A decorative water fountain has been installed in the courtyard near the main entrance.\", \"vi\": \"Một đài phun nước trang trí đã được lắp đặt ở sân trong gần lối vào chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-ljspeech-4620ade6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-cori-4620ade6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fountain-bc9bffe7.webp', '[\"jet\", \"spray\", \"spout\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"water fountain\", \"meaning\": \"đài phun nước / vòi nước uống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"drinking fountain\", \"meaning\": \"vòi nước uống công cộng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mountain\", \"note_vi\": \"Mountain có nghĩa là ngọn núi, chú ý phát âm vần đuôi dễ nhầm với fountain.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-cori-4620ade6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-aru0-4620ade6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-aru5-4620ade6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-aru6-4620ade6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-aru10-4620ade6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-aru9-4620ade6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-aru3-4620ade6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-aru7-4620ade6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-aru8-4620ade6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-aru2-4620ade6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-ljspeech-4620ade6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-lt408-4620ade6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-lt138-4620ade6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-lt624-4620ade6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-lt396-4620ade6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-lt498-4620ade6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-lt132-4620ade6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-lt288-4620ade6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-lt42-4620ade6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fountain-lt90-4620ade6.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong đề thi TOEIC Part 1, cụm \'water fountain\' hoặc \'drinking fountain\' rất hay xuất hiện trong tranh miêu tả khung cảnh công viên hoặc sảnh tòa nhà.', 'office', 1, 9),
('31721d98-e9a5-5cae-bb02-ee7af63d0227', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '736c6ab8-ef30-5a53-a67c-4d9dfd3a6304', '9c17952d-25fe-503a-b76f-efdd60abd3f9', 'trustful', '/ˈtrʌst.fəl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có xu hướng tin tưởng người khác.', 'tending to believe that other people are honest and will not do anything bad.', 'She has a very trustful nature, always believing the best in people.', 'Cô ấy có bản tính rất tin người, luôn tin vào những điều tốt đẹp nhất ở mọi người.', '{\"en\": \"The manager is very trustful of his team members to complete the project on time.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý rất tin tưởng các thành viên trong nhóm của mình sẽ hoàn thành dự án đúng hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trustful-ljspeech-1f6d34d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trustful-cori-1f6d34d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trustful-a8ed8939.webp', '[\"trusting\", \"naive\", \"credulous\"]', '[\"suspicious\", \"doubtful\", \"cynical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"trustful nature\", \"meaning\": \"bản tính hay tin người\"}, {\"phrase\": \"trustful relationship\", \"meaning\": \"mối quan hệ tin cậy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"trustworthy\", \"note_vi\": \"trustworthy là đáng tin cậy, trustful là dễ tin người khác\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"trust\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"trust\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"trustworthy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trustful-cori-1f6d34d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trustful-aru0-1f6d34d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trustful-aru5-1f6d34d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trustful-aru6-1f6d34d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trustful-aru10-1f6d34d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trustful-aru9-1f6d34d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trustful-aru3-1f6d