('07366812-e1e9-5ae3-ae38-0f02293ea952', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '736c6ab8-ef30-5a53-a67c-4d9dfd3a6304', '9c17952d-25fe-503a-b76f-efdd60abd3f9', 'extensive', '/ɪkˈstensɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rộng lớn về quy mô, phạm vi hoặc chi tiết.', 'covering a large area or containing a lot of details and information.', 'The company conducted extensive research before launching the new product.', 'Công ty đã tiến hành nghiên cứu sâu rộng trước khi ra mắt sản phẩm mới.', '{\"en\": \"The candidate was hired because of her extensive experience in international marketing and sales.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên được thuê vì kinh nghiệm sâu rộng của cô ấy trong lĩnh vực tiếp thị và bán hàng quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-ljspeech-e9691a0d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-cori-e9691a0d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extensive-c51edc63.webp', '[\"comprehensive\", \"widespread\", \"broad\"]', '[\"limited\", \"narrow\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"extensive experience\", \"meaning\": \"kinh nghiệm dày dặn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extensive knowledge\", \"meaning\": \"kiến thức sâu rộng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extensive research\", \"meaning\": \"nghiên cứu sâu rộng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intensive\", \"note_vi\": \"intensive là chuyên sâu/tập trung, extensive là rộng rãi/bao quát.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"extend\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"extension\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"extensively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-cori-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru0-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru5-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru6-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru10-e9691a0d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru9-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru3-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru7-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru8-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru2-e9691a0d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-ljspeech-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt408-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt138-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt624-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt396-e9691a0d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt498-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt132-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt288-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt42-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt90-e9691a0d.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất hay đi kèm với \'experience\' hoặc \'knowledge\' trong các bài đọc TOEIC.', 'hr', 1, 21),
