('23d2a73e-8cb9-5a1d-96b0-e4092e0df3a9', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '73e7410d-d158-59a8-832a-2ce17f2e2165', '0e9cb2b7-4b9e-5a76-8225-b17756721a97', 'terribly', '/ˈterəbli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Rất nhiều, ở mức độ cao.', 'very much or to a great degree, often used to emphasize a quality or feeling.', 'She was terribly sorry for her mistake and apologized immediately.', 'Cô ấy vô cùng hối hận về lỗi lầm của mình và đã xin lỗi ngay lập tức.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was terribly busy preparing the quarterly financial reports for the board meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã cực kỳ bận rộn chuẩn bị báo cáo tài chính hàng quý cho cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terribly-ljspeech-1293adb6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terribly-cori-1293adb6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/terribly-b50a3b36.webp', '[\"extremely\", \"very\", \"exceedingly\"]', '[\"slightly\", \"hardly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"terribly sorry\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ xin lỗi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"terribly busy\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ bận rộn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"terrific\", \"note_vi\": \"Terrific nghĩa là tuyệt vời, không mang nghĩa tồi tệ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"terrible\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terribly-cori-1293adb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terribly-aru0-1293adb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terribly-aru5-1293adb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terribly-aru6-1293adb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terribly-aru10-1293adb6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terribly-aru9-1293adb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terribly-aru3-1293adb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terribly-aru7-1293adb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terribly-aru8-1