('d31ff229-cfef-51f3-8253-f709416698b7', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '7941cc56-14b3-5bb3-8c65-f1ddd698c173', '8418c740-b283-5117-818d-5c92afdf484e', 'blueprint', '/ˈbluːprɪnt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Bản vẽ chi tiết hoặc kế hoạch cho một công trình, dự án.', 'a detailed technical drawing or plan that shows how something should be built or organized.', 'Engineers carefully reviewed the revised blueprint before starting construction on the bridge.', 'Các kỹ sư đã xem xét kỹ bản thiết kế sửa đổi trước khi bắt đầu xây dựng cây cầu.', '{\"en\": \"The engineering team reviewed the blueprint before starting the construction of the new warehouse facility.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ kỹ thuật đã xem xét bản thiết kế trước khi bắt đầu xây dựng cơ sở kho bãi mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueprint-ljspeech-1f99b38b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueprint-cori-1f99b38b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/blueprint-1ee7b967.webp', '[\"plan\", \"design\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"original blueprint\", \"meaning\": \"bản vẽ gốc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"follow the blueprint\", \"meaning\": \"tuân theo bản kế hoạch\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueprint-cori-1f99b38b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueprint-aru0-1f99b38b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueprint-aru5-1f99b38b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueprint-aru6-1f99b38b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueprint-aru10-1f99b38b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueprint-aru9-1f99b38b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueprint-aru3-1f99b38b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueprint-aru7-1f99b38b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueprint-aru8-1f99b38b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueprint