('41c5e0ca-f673-5081-b5c5-87bb10489954', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '7941cc56-14b3-5bb3-8c65-f1ddd698c173', '8418c740-b283-5117-818d-5c92afdf484e', 'time zone', '/taɪm zəʊn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một khu vực địa lý có cùng một giờ chuẩn.', 'one of the areas into which the world is divided according to local hours.', 'When traveling across continents, you often have to adjust to a new time zone.', 'Khi đi du lịch qua các châu lục, bạn thường phải điều chỉnh theo múi giờ mới.', '{\"en\": \"Please check the client\'s local time zone before scheduling the international conference call.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng kiểm tra múi giờ địa phương của khách hàng trước khi lên lịch cuộc gọi hội nghị quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-zone-ljspeech-53f5956e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-zone-cori-53f5956e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/time-zone-bd8e4aab.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"different time zone\", \"meaning\": \"múi giờ khác nhau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cross time zones\", \"meaning\": \"vượt qua các múi giờ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-zone-cori-53f5956e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-zone-aru0-53f5956e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-zone-aru5-53f5956e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-zone-aru6-53f5956e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-zone-aru10-53f5956e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-zone-aru9-53f5956e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-zone-aru3-53f5956e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-zone-aru7-53f5956e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-zone-aru8-53f5956e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/time-zone-aru2-53f5956e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/p