('fe3aa4e8-c3f7-52b9-8fba-57a7912e1238', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '7941cc56-14b3-5bb3-8c65-f1ddd698c173', '8418c740-b283-5117-818d-5c92afdf484e', 'upper', '/ˈʌpə/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Ở vị trí cao hơn hoặc phía trên.', 'located in a higher position or place compared to something else.', 'The upper floor of the building offers a beautiful view of the city.', 'Tầng trên của tòa nhà có tầm nhìn tuyệt đẹp ra thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"The upper management team will meet tomorrow to discuss the new budget proposal.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý cấp cao sẽ họp vào ngày mai để thảo luận về đề xuất ngân sách mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-ljspeech-c538c170.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-cori-c538c170.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/upper-1318c8c4.webp', '[\"higher\", \"superior\"]', '[\"lower\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"upper management\", \"meaning\": \"ban quản lý cấp cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"upper limit\", \"meaning\": \"giới hạn trên\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-cori-c538c170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-aru0-c538c170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-aru5-c538c170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-aru6-c538c170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-aru10-c538c170.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-aru9-c538c170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-aru3-c538c170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-aru7-c538c170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-aru8-c538c170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-aru2-c538c170.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-ljspeech-c538c170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-lt408-c538c170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-lt138-c538c170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-lt624-c538c170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-lt396-c538c170.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-lt498-c538c170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-lt132-c538c170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-lt288-c538c170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-lt42-c538c170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upper-lt90-c538c170.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong cụm \'upper management\' để chỉ ban lãnh đạo cấp cao trong doanh nghiệp.', 'office', 1, 29),
('72d7235e-58bd-5bac-b993-235e228dd5bc', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '87788b67-1a86-5708-8e13-5fd46069eac6', '39d2a820-1d76-5960-a37c-1b42b726a205', 'sorrow', '/ˈsɒrəʊ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Nỗi buồn, sự đau khổ.', 'a feeling of great sadness because something very bad has happened.', 'The director expressed immense sorrow over the unexpected closure of the factory.', 'Giám đốc đã bày tỏ niềm đau buồn to lớn trước việc nhà máy đóng cửa đột ngột.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO expressed his deep sorrow over the sudden passing of the company founder.\", \"vi\": \"Vị giám đốc điều hành bày tỏ niềm tiếc thương sâu sắc trước sự ra đi đột ngột của người sáng lập công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sorrow-ljspeech-ccd7764f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sorrow-cori-ccd7764f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sorrow-c9939f8a.webp', '[\"sadness\", \"grief\", \"misery\"]', '[\"joy\", \"happiness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deep sorrow\", \"meaning\": \"nỗi buồn sâu sắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"express sorrow\", \"meaning\": \"bày tỏ sự tiếc thương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"regret\", \"note_vi\": \"regret là sự hối hận hoặc tiếc nuối, sorrow nhấn mạnh vào nỗi buồn sâu sắc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sorrowful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sorrow-cori-ccd7764f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sorrow-aru0-ccd7764f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sorrow-aru5-ccd7764f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sorrow-aru6-ccd7764f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sorrow-aru10-ccd7764f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sorrow-aru9-ccd7764f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sorrow-aru3-ccd7764f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sorrow-aru7-ccd7764f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sorrow-aru8-cc