('4e742260-a0d9-599b-ac9b-3f3eb919c6a5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '87788b67-1a86-5708-8e13-5fd46069eac6', '39d2a820-1d76-5960-a37c-1b42b726a205', 'receipt', 'UK: /rɪˈsiːt/ | US: /rɪˈsiːt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'biên lai, hóa đơn', 'A written statement confirming that money or goods have been officially handed over.', 'Keep your receipt as proof of purchase.', 'Giữ biên lai của bạn làm bằng chứng mua hàng.', '{\"en\": \"Please retain your receipt as proof of purchase if you wish to return the item.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng giữ lại biên lai làm bằng chứng mua hàng nếu bạn muốn trả lại sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-ljspeech-14e60ace.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-cori-14e60ace.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/receipt-8062d95f.webp', '[\"proof of purchase\", \"voucher\", \"acknowledgment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"keep the receipt\", \"meaning\": \"giữ biên lai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"upon receipt of\", \"meaning\": \"ngay khi nhận được\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sales receipt\", \"meaning\": \"hóa đơn bán hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"recipe\", \"note_vi\": \"recipe (/ˈresəpi/) là công thức nấu ăn, không phải biên lai.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"receive\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"recipient\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-cori-14e60ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-aru0-14e60ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-aru5-14e60ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-aru6-14e60ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-aru10-14e60ace.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-aru9-14e60ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-aru3-14e60ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-aru7-14e60ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-aru8-14e60ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-aru2-14e60ace.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-ljspeech-14e60ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-lt408-14e60ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-lt138-14e60ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-lt624-14e60ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-lt396-14e60ace.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-lt498-14e60ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-lt132-14e60ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-lt288-14e60ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-lt42-14e60ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receipt-lt90-14e60ace.mp3\"]}}', 'Âm \'p\' trong receipt là âm câm /rɪˈsiːt/. Phân biệt với \'invoice\' (hóa đơn yêu cầu thanh toán). Cụm \'upon receipt of\' nghĩa là \'khi nhận được\'.', 'shopping', 1, 1),
('cba67394-d07b-5764-8142-6b0b18121e6d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '87788b67-1a86-5708-8e13-5fd46069eac6', '39d2a820-1d76-5960-a37c-1b42b726a205', 'conquest', '/ˈkɒŋkwest/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự chiếm đoạt hoặc giành quyền kiểm soát bằng vũ lực.', 'the act of taking control of a country or area by force.', 'Alexander the Great was known for his military conquests across vast territories.', 'Alexander Đại đế nổi tiếng với những cuộc chinh phục quân sự trên các vùng lãnh thổ rộng lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The company achieved the total conquest of the regional market after launching new products.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã đạt được sự chinh phục hoàn toàn thị trường khu vực sau khi ra mắt các sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-ljspeech-ac3043e0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-cori-ac3043e0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conquest-6c6b626f.webp', '[\"takeover\", \"capture\", \"mastery\"]', '[\"surrender\", \"defeat\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"military conquest\", \"meaning\": \"sự chinh phục quân sự\"}, {\"phrase\": \"market conquest\", \"meaning\": \"sự chinh phục thị trường\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"conquer\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conqueror\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-cori-ac3043e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-aru0-ac3043e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-aru5-ac3043e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-aru6-ac3043e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-aru10-ac3043e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-aru9-ac3043e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-aru3-ac3043e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-aru7-ac3043e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-aru8-ac3043e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-aru2-ac3043e0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-ljspeech-ac3043e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-lt408-ac3043e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-lt138-ac3043e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-lt624-ac3043e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-lt396-ac3043e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-lt498-ac3043e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-lt132-ac3043e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-lt288-ac3043e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-lt42-ac3043e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conquest-lt90-ac3043e0.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh kinh doanh, conquest ám chỉ việc chiếm lĩnh thị trường.', 'business', 1, 2),
('2e80e25f-5905-58c1-88c8-e7297efd33cf', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '87788b67-1a86-5708-8e13-5fd46069eac6', '39d2a820-1d76-5960-a37c-1b42b726a205', 'refreshed', '/rɪˈfreʃ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy khỏe khoắn, tỉnh táo hơn.', 'feeling less tired and having more energy after resting or eating.', 'Taking a short walk outside during lunch break left her feeling energized and refreshed.', 'Đi dạo một quãng ngắn bên ngoài trong giờ nghỉ trưa đã giúp cô ấy cảm thấy tràn đầy năng lượng và sảng khoái.', '{\"en\": \"Employees returned to work feeling refreshed after the annual company retreat.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên trở lại làm việc cảm thấy khỏe khoắn sau kỳ nghỉ dưỡng hàng năm của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refreshed-ljspeech-a2956bd7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refreshed-cori-a2956bd7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/refreshed-22dbc381.webp', '[\"rejuvenated\", \"rested\", \"energized\"]', '[\"exhausted\", \"tired\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel refreshed\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy tỉnh táo, khỏe khoắn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"look refreshed\", \"meaning\": \"trông tươi tắn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"refreshing\", \"note_vi\": \"mang lại cảm giác sảng khoái (dùng cho vật/sự việc)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"refresh\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"refreshment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refreshed-cori-a2956bd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refreshed-aru0-a2956bd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refreshed-aru5-a2956bd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refreshed-aru6-a2956bd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refreshed-aru10-a2956bd7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refreshed-aru9-a2956bd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refreshed-aru3-a2956bd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub