('689eef50-8890-5d68-8a09-c140a2ac39b6', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '87788b67-1a86-5708-8e13-5fd46069eac6', '39d2a820-1d76-5960-a37c-1b42b726a205', 'rope', 'UK: /rəʊp/ | US: /roʊp/', 'B1', 'noun', 'dây thừng', 'A strong, thick cord made by twisting together several strands of fiber or wire.', 'They used a rope to secure the load.', 'Họ dùng dây thừng để cố định tải trọng.', '{\"en\": \"Construction workers secured the heavy machinery using reinforced industrial ropes.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân xây dựng đã buộc chặt máy móc hạng nặng bằng dây thừng công nghiệp gia cố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-ljspeech-03976920.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-cori-03976920.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rope-79de3e34.webp', '[\"cord\", \"cable\", \"line\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"safety rope\", \"meaning\": \"dây thừng an toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"learn the ropes\", \"meaning\": \"nắm rõ quy trình/cách làm việc\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-cori-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru0-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru5-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru6-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru10-03976920.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru9-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru3-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru7-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru8-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-aru2-03976920.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-ljspeech-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt408-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt138-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt624-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt396-03976920.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt498-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt132-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt288-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt42-03976920.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rope-lt90-03976920.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ \'learn the ropes\' nghĩa là học cách làm một công việc mới.', 'safety', 1, 5),
('a46e48be-4bb1-5e14-86bb-05f14cc49f08', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '87788b67-1a86-5708-8e13-5fd46069eac6', '39d2a820-1d76-5960-a37c-1b42b726a205', 'intensify', '/ɪnˈtensɪfaɪ/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Làm cho cái gì đó trở nên mạnh hơn, dữ dội hơn.', 'to become greater, stronger, or more extreme, or to make something do this.', 'The company decided to intensify its efforts in marketing to reach more customers.', 'Công ty quyết định tăng cường nỗ lực tiếp thị để tiếp cận nhiều khách hàng hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team plans to intensify their promotional efforts before the product launch next month.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị lên kế hoạch tăng cường các nỗ lực quảng bá trước khi ra mắt sản phẩm vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-ljspeech-b1cf0ab0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-cori-b1cf0ab0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intensify-0fe3b6db.webp', '[\"strengthen\", \"heighten\", \"escalate\"]', '[\"weaken\", \"diminish\", \"decrease\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"intensify efforts\", \"meaning\": \"tăng cường các nỗ lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"intensify competition\", \"meaning\": \"làm gia tăng sự cạnh tranh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intensity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"intense\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intensification\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-cori-b1cf0ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-aru0-b1cf0ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-aru5-b1cf0ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-aru6-b1cf0ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-aru10-b1cf0ab0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-aru9-b1cf0ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intensify-aru3-b1cf0ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/