('2bd37ab5-cd3c-56bd-8156-484b052a81ce', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '87788b67-1a86-5708-8e13-5fd46069eac6', '39d2a820-1d76-5960-a37c-1b42b726a205', 'policy', '/ˈpɒləsi/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một tập hợp các quy tắc hoặc nguyên tắc được một tổ chức tuân theo.', 'a set of ideas or a plan of what to do in particular situations.', 'The new company policy states that all employees must work from the office.', 'Chính sách mới của công ty quy định tất cả nhân viên phải làm việc tại văn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"Please review the company policy regarding travel expenses before submitting your reimbursement request.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng xem lại chính sách công ty về chi phí đi lại trước khi gửi yêu cầu hoàn tiền.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-ljspeech-9f00fad9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-cori-9f00fad9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/policy-fc75c348.webp', '[\"strategy\", \"guideline\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"company policy\", \"meaning\": \"chính sách công ty\"}, {\"phrase\": \"insurance policy\", \"meaning\": \"hợp đồng bảo hiểm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"police\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là cảnh sát, phát âm khác nhau\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-cori-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru0-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru5-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru6-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru10-9f00fad9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru9-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru3-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru7-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru8-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru2-9f00fad9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-ljspeech-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt408-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt138-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt624-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt396-9f00fad9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt498-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt132-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt288-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt42-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt90-9f00fad9.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong bảo hiểm, \'policy\' còn có nghĩa là đơn bảo hiểm/hợp đồng bảo hiểm.', 'hr', 1, 14),
('18f406bc-8913-55ef-9f8e-7394f0f18695', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '87788b67-1a86-5708-8e13-5fd46069eac6', '39d2a820-1d76-5960-a37c-1b42b726a205', 'corporation', '/ˌkɔːpəˈreɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một công ty lớn hoặc tập đoàn kinh doanh.', 'a large business company or group of companies that acts as a single entity.', 'Many people dream of working for a large multinational corporation.', 'Nhiều người mơ ước được làm việc cho một tập đoàn đa quốc gia lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The multinational corporation decided to open a new branch office in downtown Tokyo next month.\", \"vi\": \"Tập đoàn đa quốc gia đã quyết định mở một văn phòng chi nhánh mới ở trung tâm Tokyo vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-ljspeech-626a8be2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-cori-626a8be2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/corporation-a05a5ad1.webp', '[\"enterprise\", \"company\", \"firm\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"multinational corporation\", \"meaning\": \"tập đoàn đa quốc gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"large corporation\", \"meaning\": \"tập đoàn lớn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cooperation\", \"note_vi\": \"sự hợp tác, viết gần giống corporation\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"corporate\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"incorporate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-cori-626a8be2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-aru0-626a8be2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-aru5-626a8be2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-aru6-626a8be2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-aru10-626a8be2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-aru9-626a8be2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-aru3-626a8be2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-aru7-626a8be2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-aru8-626a8be2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-aru2-626a8be2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-ljspeech-626a8be2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-lt408-626a8be2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-lt138-626a8be2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-lt624-626a8be2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-lt396-626a8be2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-lt498-626a8be2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-lt132-626a8be2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-lt288-626a8be2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-lt42-626a8be2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporation-lt90-626a8be2.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn với cooperation (sự hợp tác).', 'business', 1, 15),
('32e871b6-e1d3-5b54-856f-58e585dc659b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '87788b67-1a86-5708-8e13-5fd46069eac6', '39d2a820-1d76-5960-a37c-1b42b726a205', 'then', '/ðen/', 'A1', 'adverb', 'Vào thời điểm hoặc sau đó; tiếp theo.', 'at a particular time in the past or future, or happening next in a series of events.', 'We finished dinner, and then we watched a movie.', 'Chúng tôi ăn tối xong, rồi sau đó xem phim.', '{\"en\": \"Please review the financial report first, and then submit it to the director.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng xem xét báo cáo tài chính trước, và sau đó nộp cho giám đốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/then-ljspeech-6f8f8e9f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/then-cori-6f8f8e9f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/then-0a540b3b.webp', '[\"next\", \"subsequently\", \"later\"]', '[\"before\", \"previously\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"back then\", \"meaning\": \"hồi đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"since then\", \"meaning\": \"kể từ đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"then again\", \"meaning\": \"tuy nhiên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"than\", \"note_vi\": \"than dùng trong so sánh hơn, then chỉ thời gian\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/then-cori-6f8f8e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/then-aru0-6f8f8e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/then-aru5-6f8f8e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/then-aru6-6f8f8e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/then-aru10-6f8f8e9f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/then-aru9-6f8f8e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/then-aru3-6f8f8e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/then-aru7-6f8f8e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/then-aru8-6f8f8e9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/then-aru2-6f8f8e9f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati