('69c1bf08-9d0b-5b82-bd34-2d23fc12bcc7', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '87788b67-1a86-5708-8e13-5fd46069eac6', '39d2a820-1d76-5960-a37c-1b42b726a205', 'probably', '/ˈprɒbəbli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Rất có thể xảy ra, gần như chắc chắn.', 'Indicates a high degree of certainty that a situation exists or an action occurs.', 'Mr. Davis will probably finalize the budget report before the board meeting begins tomorrow.', 'Ông Davis có lẽ sẽ hoàn tất báo cáo ngân sách trước khi cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị bắt đầu vào ngày mai.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors will probably approve the new budget proposal during tomorrow\'s meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc rất có thể sẽ phê duyệt đề xuất ngân sách mới trong cuộc họp ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-ljspeech-a843d409.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-cori-a843d409.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/probably-86f2e779.webp', '[\"likely\", \"perhaps\", \"possibly\"]', '[\"improbably\", \"unlikely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"most probably\", \"meaning\": \"rất có khả năng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"probably not\", \"meaning\": \"chắc là không\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"properly\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là một cách đúng đắn, dễ nhầm mặt chữ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"probable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"probability\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-cori-a843d409.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-aru0-a843d409.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-aru5-a843d409.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-aru6-a843d409.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-aru10-a843d409.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-aru9-a843d409.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-aru3-a843d409.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-aru7-a843d409.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-aru8-a843d409.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-aru2-a843d409.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-ljspeech-a843d409.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-lt408-a843d409.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-lt138-a843d409.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-lt624-a843d409.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-lt396-a843d409.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-lt498-a843d409.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-lt132-a843d409.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-lt288-a843d409.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-lt42-a843d409.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probably-lt90-a843d409.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn với properly (một cách đúng đắn/thích hợp).', 'office', 1, 28),
('fef706cb-152d-5420-9186-703705195911', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '87788b67-1a86-5708-8e13-5fd46069eac6', '39d2a820-1d76-5960-a37c-1b42b726a205', 'suggest', '/səˈdʒest/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Đề nghị, gợi ý một ý tưởng hoặc kế hoạch.', 'to mention a plan or an idea for someone to consider.', 'I would suggest that we postpone the meeting until next week.', 'Tôi đề xuất rằng chúng ta nên hoãn cuộc họp đến tuần sau.', '{\"en\": \"I would suggest that we review the budget proposal before submitting it to management.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi muốn đề xuất chúng ta xem lại bản ngân sách trước khi trình lên ban quản lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-ljspeech-fd0a4950.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-cori-fd0a4950.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/suggest-61491452.webp', '[\"propose\", \"recommend\", \"advise\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"suggest a solution\", \"meaning\": \"đề xuất giải pháp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"suggest doing something\", \"meaning\": \"gợi ý làm việc gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"advise\", \"note_vi\": \"suggest là gợi ý chung, advise mang tính khuyên bảo từ người có chuyên môn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"suggestion\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"suggestive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-cori-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru0-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru5-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru6-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru10-fd0a4950.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru9-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru3-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru7-fd0a4950.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suggest-aru