('70c0dfcf-31da-5e9d-adde-f119ca0054a2', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '88de92aa-fcf6-53b9-a56d-9186eb241c2f', '4878bcda-e33e-5ff4-a386-93606e8cea5f', 'eventually', '/ɪˈventʃuəli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Sau một thời gian dài hoặc nhiều sự kiện, điều gì đó xảy ra.', 'at the end of a period of time or after a series of events.', 'After many attempts, he eventually succeeded in solving the puzzle.', 'Sau nhiều lần thử, cuối cùng anh ấy đã giải được câu đố.', '{\"en\": \"Although the negotiations were difficult, the two companies eventually signed the contract.\", \"vi\": \"Mặc dù các cuộc đàm phán rất khó khăn, hai công ty cuối cùng đã ký hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-ljspeech-5865020f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-cori-5865020f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eventually-56fb6a72.webp', '[\"finally\", \"ultimately\", \"in the end\"]', '[\"immediately\", \"initially\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"eventually lead to\", \"meaning\": \"cuối cùng dẫn đến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"possibly\", \"note_vi\": \"có lẽ, có khả năng (không chắc chắn như eventually)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"eventual\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-cori-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru0-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru5-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru6-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru10-5865020f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru9-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru3-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru7-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru8-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/p