('703cd7c0-6f55-5a76-8b35-ffc284999e4b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '88de92aa-fcf6-53b9-a56d-9186eb241c2f', '4878bcda-e33e-5ff4-a386-93606e8cea5f', 'hug', '/hʌɡ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Cái ôm, hành động ôm.', 'an embrace where two people fold their arms around each other to express warmth or care.', 'She gave her friend a warm hug to congratulate her on the good news.', 'Cô ấy dành cho bạn mình một cái ôm ấm áp để chúc mừng tin tốt.', '{\"en\": \"The manager gave her team a warm hug after completing the difficult project.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã dành cho nhóm của mình một cái ôm ấm áp sau khi hoàn thành dự án khó khăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hug-ljspeech-f11fb55c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hug-cori-f11fb55c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hug-cd3ecd7b.webp', '[\"embrace\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"give a hug\", \"meaning\": \"trao một cái ôm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"warm hug\", \"meaning\": \"cái ôm ấm áp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"hug\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hug-cori-f11fb55c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hug-aru0-f11fb55c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hug-aru5-f11fb55c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hug-aru6-f11fb55c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hug-aru10-f11fb55c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hug-aru9-f11fb55c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hug-aru3-f11fb55c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hug-aru7-f11fb55c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hug-aru8-f11fb55c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hug-aru2-f11fb55c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hug-ljspeech-f11fb55c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hug-lt408-f11fb55c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/