('58355d31-906f-5e36-bf64-baf718c1f086', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '8aa7a2f1-65bc-5272-bc71-781cf9340043', 'b9acebe9-ddc9-5384-8ffa-34f4dfb51309', 'hopelessness', '/ˈhəʊpləsnəs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác tuyệt vọng, không còn hy vọng.', 'a feeling that there is no hope and that a situation cannot improve.', 'A deep sense of hopelessness settled over him after he lost his job.', 'Một cảm giác tuyệt vọng sâu sắc bao trùm anh ấy sau khi mất việc.', '{\"en\": \"The staff felt a sense of hopelessness when the major contract was unexpectedly canceled.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên cảm thấy tuyệt vọng khi hợp đồng lớn bất ngờ bị hủy bỏ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopelessness-ljspeech-16bf3cf6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopelessness-cori-16bf3cf6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hopelessness-b537abc6.webp', '[\"despair\", \"desperation\"]', '[\"hopefulness\", \"optimism\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sense of hopelessness\", \"meaning\": \"cảm giác tuyệt vọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deep hopelessness\", \"meaning\": \"nỗi tuyệt vọng sâu sắc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"helplessness\", \"note_vi\": \"Cảm giác bất lực, không thể tự giúp mình.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hopeless\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"hopelessly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hope\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopelessness-cori-16bf3cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopelessness-aru0-16bf3cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopelessness-aru5-16bf3cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopelessness-aru6-16bf3cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopelessness-aru10-16bf3cf6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopelessness-aru9-16bf3cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopelessness-aru3-16bf3cf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object