('2d7329d5-a1d8-5c2d-b623-8b246f1ea966', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '8aa7a2f1-65bc-5272-bc71-781cf9340043', 'b9acebe9-ddc9-5384-8ffa-34f4dfb51309', 'shout', '/ʃaʊt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một tiếng kêu lớn, thường thể hiện cảm xúc mạnh.', 'a very loud sound made by a person when they are feeling strong emotions like anger.', 'We heard a shout from the crowd as the team scored the winning goal.', 'Chúng tôi nghe thấy một tiếng la hét từ đám đông khi đội ghi bàn thắng quyết định.', '{\"en\": \"There was a sudden shout from the warehouse when the heavy box fell down yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Có một tiếng hét lớn từ nhà kho khi chiếc hộp nặng rơi xuống vào ngày hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-ljspeech-d1c79aa3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-cori-d1c79aa3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shout-5d2a5302.webp', '[\"yell\", \"cry\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"let out a shout\", \"meaning\": \"thốt lên một tiếng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"loud shout\", \"meaning\": \"tiếng hét lớn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"shouting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-cori-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru0-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru5-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru6-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru10-d1c79aa3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru9-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru3-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru7-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru8-d1c79aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-aru2-d1c79aa3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shout-ljspeech-d1c79