('bff92391-0e8d-5b78-8a1b-67eb468b1bd4', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '8aa7a2f1-65bc-5272-bc71-781cf9340043', 'b9acebe9-ddc9-5384-8ffa-34f4dfb51309', 'regret', '/rɪˈɡrɛt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Hối hận, tiếc nuối về điều đã làm hoặc không làm.', 'to feel sad or unhappy about an action you did or did not do in the past.', 'She began to regret her decision to move to another city.', 'Cô ấy bắt đầu hối tiếc về quyết định chuyển đến thành phố khác.', '{\"en\": \"The manager did not regret his decision to hire the new assistant for the project.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý không hối hận về quyết định thuê trợ lý mới cho dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-ljspeech-66450d95.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-cori-66450d95.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/regret-0214890d.webp', '[\"rue\", \"lament\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"deeply regret\", \"meaning\": \"vô cùng hối hận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"regret to inform\", \"meaning\": \"lấy làm tiếc phải thông báo\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"regretful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"regrettable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-cori-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru0-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru5-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru6-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru10-66450d95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru9-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru3-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru7-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru8-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-aru2-66450d95.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-ljspeech-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt408-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt138-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt624-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt396-66450d95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt498-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt132-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt288-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt42-66450d95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regret-lt90-66450d95.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc: regret + V-ing (hối hận đã làm) khác với regret + to V (lấy làm tiếc phải làm).', 'office', 1, 25),
('239418a4-9287-50c1-b730-4f242ed555d5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '8aa7a2f1-65bc-5272-bc71-781cf9340043', 'b9acebe9-ddc9-5384-8ffa-34f4dfb51309', 'pottery', '/ˈpɒtəri/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Các vật dụng làm từ đất sét nung, như bát, đĩa, bình.', 'pots, dishes, and other articles made of baked clay.', 'Local artisans displayed handmade ceramic pottery at the weekend cultural festival.', 'Các nghệ nhân địa phương đã trưng bày đồ gốm thủ công tại lễ hội văn hóa cuối tuần.', '{\"en\": \"The local gift shop sells handmade pottery to tourists visiting the town.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng quà tặng địa phương bán đồ gốm thủ công cho khách du lịch ghé thăm thị trấn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pottery-ljspeech-429d1859.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pottery-cori-429d1859.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pottery-3a42a1b8.webp', '[\"ceramics\", \"earthenware\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make pottery\", \"meaning\": \"làm đồ gốm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pottery class\", \"meaning\": \"lớp học làm gốm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"poetry\", \"note_vi\": \"poetry là thơ ca, pottery là đồ gốm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"potter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pottery-cori-429d1859.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pottery-aru0-429d1859.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pottery-aru5-429d1859.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pottery-aru6-429d1859.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pottery-aru10-429d1859.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pottery-aru9-429d1859.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pottery-aru3-429d1859.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pottery-aru7-429d1859.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pottery-aru8-429d1859.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pottery-aru2-429d