('d623c77a-b4ac-55f5-941c-abafb576d5d6', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '8b6bdb7f-6904-516c-b3e4-0618ae28efbe', '4e48da87-6e17-5e86-affd-79a94772c728', 'difficult', '/ˈdɪfɪkəlt/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Không dễ dàng, đòi hỏi nhiều nỗ lực hoặc gây rắc rối.', 'not easy; needing much effort or causing problems.', 'Learning a new language can be difficult at first, but it\'s rewarding.', 'Học một ngôn ngữ mới ban đầu có thể khó khăn, nhưng rất đáng giá.', '{\"en\": \"The client\'s request made the project timeline very difficult to meet.\", \"vi\": \"Yêu cầu của khách hàng đã khiến tiến độ dự án rất khó để đáp ứng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-ljspeech-d2a26f03.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-cori-d2a26f03.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/difficult-42ded813.webp', '[\"hard\", \"tough\"]', '[\"easy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"difficult task\", \"meaning\": \"nhiệm vụ khó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"difficult decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định khó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"difficult customer\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng khó tính\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"deficit\", \"note_vi\": \"difficult là khó, deficit là thâm hụt ngân sách\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"difficulty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-cori-d2a26f03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru0-d2a26f03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru5-d2a26f03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru6-d2a26f03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru10-d2a26f03.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru9-d2a26f03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru3-d2a26f03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru7-d2a26f03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/difficult-aru8-