('c575801e-2a49-5cd4-9aca-971647d2ae37', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '8b6bdb7f-6904-516c-b3e4-0618ae28efbe', '4e48da87-6e17-5e86-affd-79a94772c728', 'jump', '/dʒʌmp/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hành động bật người lên khỏi mặt đất hoặc di chuyển đột ngột.', 'a sudden movement off the ground or a large and sudden increase in amount.', 'With a powerful jump, the athlete cleared the high bar easily.', 'Với một cú nhảy mạnh mẽ, vận động viên đã vượt qua xà cao một cách dễ dàng.', '{\"en\": \"The company reported a sharp jump in sales following the new product launch.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty báo cáo doanh số tăng mạnh sau khi ra mắt sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jump-ljspeech-271e9a56.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jump-cori-271e9a56.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/jump-48cbc6f8.webp', '[\"leap\", \"increase\", \"rise\"]', '[\"drop\", \"fall\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sharp jump\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng vọt đột ngột\"}, {\"phrase\": \"jump in price\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng giá\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"jump\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jump-cori-271e9a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jump-aru0-271e9a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jump-aru5-271e9a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jump-aru6-271e9a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jump-aru10-271e9a56.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jump-aru9-271e9a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jump-aru3-271e9a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jump-aru7-271e9a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jump-aru8-271e9a56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jump-aru2-271e9a56.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jump-ljspeech-271e9a56.mp3\", \"/stora