('a6567ef5-9971-5a7d-af8a-0fc79862c82b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '94fd27f3-3921-5071-bc5e-f2385f340b0e', '5a3e130e-6f62-56cb-8db4-7d9b2366207a', 'cold', '/kəʊld/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Bệnh nhiễm trùng đường hô hấp trên, thường gây sổ mũi, hắt hơi và ho.', 'a common illness causing runny nose, sneezing, and cough.', 'She stayed home from work because she had a bad cold.', 'Cô ấy nghỉ làm vì bị cảm lạnh nặng.', '{\"en\": \"The receptionist took a sick day after catching a cold from a guest.\", \"vi\": \"Lễ tân đã xin nghỉ ốm sau khi bị cảm lạnh từ một vị khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-ljspeech-424fa439.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-cori-424fa439.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cold-7fab123d.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"catch a cold\", \"meaning\": \"bị cảm lạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"common cold\", \"meaning\": \"cảm lạnh thông thường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bad cold\", \"meaning\": \"cảm lạnh nặng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bold\", \"note_vi\": \"bold nghĩa là táo bạo, không liên quan cảm lạnh.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"cold\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"coldly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-cori-424fa439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru0-424fa439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru5-424fa439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru6-424fa439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru10-424fa439.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru9-424fa439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru3-424fa439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru7-424fa439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru8-424fa439.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-aru2-424fa439.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/sto