('25d19493-9907-5ab8-87e9-2b277dc2a588', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '94fd27f3-3921-5071-bc5e-f2385f340b0e', '5a3e130e-6f62-56cb-8db4-7d9b2366207a', 'market', '/ˈmɑːkɪt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Nơi người mua và người bán gặp nhau để trao đổi hàng hóa, dịch vụ.', 'An arena or network where commercial transactions involving commodities, assets, or services take place.', 'The company is trying to expand its market share in Asia.', 'Công ty đang cố gắng mở rộng thị phần của mình ở châu Á.', '{\"en\": \"Our company plans to enter the European market by the end of next year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi kế hoạch thâm nhập thị trường châu Âu vào cuối năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-ljspeech-5c9f73af.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-cori-5c9f73af.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/market-9f2efecf.webp', '[\"marketplace\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"market share\", \"meaning\": \"thị phần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"target market\", \"meaning\": \"thị trường mục tiêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"market research\", \"meaning\": \"nghiên cứu thị trường\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"market\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"marketing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-cori-5c9f73af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-aru0-5c9f73af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-aru5-5c9f73af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-aru6-5c9f73af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-aru10-5c9f73af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-aru9-5c9f73af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-aru3-5c9f73af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-aru7-5c9f73af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-aru8-5c9f73af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-aru2-5c9f73af.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-ljspeech-5c9f73af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-lt408-5c9f73af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-lt138-5c9f73af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-lt624-5c9f73af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-lt396-5c9f73af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-lt498-5c9f73af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-lt132-5c9f73af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-lt288-5c9f73af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-lt42-5c9f73af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/market-lt90-5c9f73af.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, từ này thường mang nghĩa thị trường kinh doanh hơn là cái chợ truyền thống.', 'marketing', 1, 12),
('12099826-77ed-5708-969c-c245645c16a5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '94fd27f3-3921-5071-bc5e-f2385f340b0e', '5a3e130e-6f62-56cb-8db4-7d9b2366207a', 'imagine', '/ɪˈmædʒɪn/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Hình dung, nghĩ ra điều gì đó trong đầu.', 'to form a picture or idea of something in your mind.', 'It\'s hard to imagine life without the internet now.', 'Thật khó để tưởng tượng cuộc sống không có internet bây giờ.', '{\"en\": \"It is difficult to imagine how the company will operate without its founder.\", \"vi\": \"Thật khó để hình dung công ty sẽ hoạt động như thế nào nếu không có người sáng lập.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-ljspeech-971687e3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-cori-971687e3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/imagine-ae3b1a58.webp', '[\"visualize\", \"picture\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hard to imagine\", \"meaning\": \"khó mà hình dung nổi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"imagine doing something\", \"meaning\": \"tưởng tượng làm việc gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"imaginative\", \"note_vi\": \"imaginative là giàu tưởng tượng; imaginary là ảo, không có thật.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"imagination\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"imaginative\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"imaginary\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-cori-971687e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-aru0-971687e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-aru5-971687e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-aru6-971687e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-aru10-971687e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-aru9-971687e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-aru3-971687e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-aru7-971687e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-aru8-971687e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-aru2-971687e3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-ljspeech-971687e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-lt408-971687e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-lt138-971687e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-lt624-971687e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-lt396-971687e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-lt498-971687e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-lt132-971687e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-lt288-971687e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-lt42-971687e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imagine-lt90-971687e3.mp3\"]}}', 'Theo sau \'imagine\' thường là một danh động từ (V-ing) hoặc một mệnh đề.', 'business', 1, 13),
('1819b267-42a1-50b1-a9a6-04d5a434aa65', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '94fd27f3-3921-5071-bc5e-f2385f340b0e', '5a3e130e-6f62-56cb-8db4-7d9b2366207a', 'rainforest', '/ˈreɪnfɒrɪst/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Khu rừng rậm rạp, xanh tốt quanh năm với lượng mưa lớn, thường ở vùng nhiệt đới.', 'a thick forest in tropical areas that receives a large amount of rain.', 'The Amazon rainforest is home to an incredible diversity of plant and animal species.', 'Rừng nhiệt đới Amazon là nơi sinh sống của sự đa dạng đáng kinh ngạc của các loài thực vật và động vật.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency promotes eco-friendly tours to explore the national park and its tropical rainforest.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch quảng bá các chuyến tham quan thân thiện với môi trường để khám phá công viên quốc gia và rừng mưa nhiệt đới ở đó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-ljspeech-7a7ef5b1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-cori-7a7ef5b1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rainforest-ed60b20c.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tropical rainforest\", \"meaning\": \"rừng mưa nhiệt đới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rainforest conservation\", \"meaning\": \"sự bảo tồn rừng mưa\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-cori-7a7ef5b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-aru0-7a7ef5b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-aru5-7a7ef5b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-aru6-7a7ef5b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-aru10-7a7ef5b1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-aru9-7a7ef5b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-aru3-7a7ef5b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-aru7-7a7ef5b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-aru8-7a7ef5b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-aru2-7a7ef5b1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-ljspeech-7a7ef5b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-lt408-7a7ef5b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-lt138-7a7ef5b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-lt624-7a7ef5b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-lt396-7a7ef5b1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-lt498-7a7ef5b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-lt132-7a7ef5b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-lt288-7a7ef5b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-lt42-7a7ef5b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rainforest-lt90-7a7ef5b1.mp3\"]}}', 'Là từ ghép của rain (mưa) và forest (rừng).', 'nature', 1, 14),
('6da879a1-dd10-5be7-a3df-08d7b52eaab3', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '94fd27f3-3921-5071-bc5e-f2385f340b0e', '5a3e130e-6f62-56cb-8db4-7d9b2366207a', 'cry', '/kraɪ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Tiếng khóc, tiếng kêu.', 'a loud sound made by a person to express strong emotion or physical pain.', 'We heard a cry for help coming from the forest.', 'Chúng tôi nghe thấy một tiếng kêu cứu vọng ra từ khu rừng.', '{\"en\": \"We heard a sudden cry from the warehouse, so we immediately called the safety manager.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi nghe thấy tiếng kêu bất ngờ từ nhà kho, nên đã gọi ngay cho quản lý an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-ljspeech-a05d478d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-cori-a05d478d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cry-ef1d28f6.webp', '[\"shout\", \"scream\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cry for help\", \"meaning\": \"tiếng kêu cứu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"let out a cry\", \"meaning\": \"thốt lên một tiếng kêu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"cry\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-cori-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru0-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru5-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru6-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru10-a05d478d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru9-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru3-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru7-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru8-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-aru2-a05d478d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-ljspeech-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cry-lt408-a05d478d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob