('56023d93-65bc-55b3-9d85-1514f1836ac4', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '94fd27f3-3921-5071-bc5e-f2385f340b0e', '5a3e130e-6f62-56cb-8db4-7d9b2366207a', 'technical', '', 'B1', 'adjective', 'thuộc về kỹ thuật', 'Relating to practical skills, specialized knowledge, or complex scientific and engineering methods.', 'He has strong technical skills in software development.', 'Anh ấy có kỹ năng kỹ thuật vững chắc trong phát triển phần mềm.', '{\"en\": \"Please contact technical support if you encounter any software installation errors.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng liên hệ bộ phận hỗ trợ kỹ thuật nếu bạn gặp bất kỳ lỗi cài đặt phần mềm nào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-ljspeech-60944e57.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-cori-60944e57.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/technical-62ccba5d.webp', '[\"specialized\", \"technological\", \"scientific\", \"mechanical\"]', '[\"nontechnical\", \"general\", \"simple\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"technical support\", \"meaning\": \"hỗ trợ kỹ thuật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"technical specification\", \"meaning\": \"thông số kỹ thuật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"technical expertise\", \"meaning\": \"chuyên môn kỹ thuật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tactical\", \"note_vi\": \"\'tactical\' nghĩa là thuộc về chiến thuật, khác với \'technical\' (thuộc về kỹ thuật).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"technician\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"technique\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"technically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-cori-60944e57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-aru0-60944e57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-aru5-60944e57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-aru6-60944e57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-aru10-60944e57.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-aru9-60944e57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-aru3-60944e57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-aru7-60944e57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-aru8-60944e57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-aru2-60944e57.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-ljspeech-60944e57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-lt408-60944e57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-lt138-60944e57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-lt624-60944e57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-lt396-60944e57.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-lt498-60944e57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-lt132-60944e57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-lt288-60944e57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-lt42-60944e57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/technical-lt90-60944e57.mp3\"]}}', '\'Technical\' miêu tả yếu tố chuyên môn kỹ thuật, hay đứng trước các danh từ như \'support\', \'specifications\', \'expertise\'.', 'technology', 1, 26),
('dcc1c463-b5ef-5c4d-b70e-68898bbc6894', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '94fd27f3-3921-5071-bc5e-f2385f340b0e', '5a3e130e-6f62-56cb-8db4-7d9b2366207a', 'previously', 'UK: /ˈpriːviəsli/ | US: /ˈpriviəsli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'trước đây', 'at an earlier time or before a particular event or period being discussed', 'The manager previously worked in the sales department.', 'Người quản lý trước đây làm việc ở phòng kinh doanh.', '{\"en\": \"The software engineer was previously employed by a major telecommunications firm.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ sư phần mềm này trước đây từng được thuê làm việc cho một công ty viễn thông lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previously-ljspeech-3523c6c1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previously-cori-3523c6c1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/previously-09307693.webp', '[\"formerly\", \"earlier\", \"beforehand\"]', '[\"afterward\", \"subsequently\", \"later\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"as previously stated\", \"meaning\": \"như đã trình bày trước đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"previously known as\", \"meaning\": \"trước đây được biết đến là\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"previous\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previously-cori-3523c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previously-aru0-3523c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previously-aru5-3523c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previously-aru6-3523c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previously-aru10-3523c6c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previously-aru9-3523c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previously-aru3-3523c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previously-aru7-3523c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previously-aru8-3523c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/