('8cd3c473-6f46-5c80-ace2-4dc3f8ef8c10', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '94fd27f3-3921-5071-bc5e-f2385f340b0e', '5a3e130e-6f62-56cb-8db4-7d9b2366207a', 'meter', '/ˈmiːtə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Đơn vị đo chiều dài, bằng 100 centimet.', 'a standard unit of length equal to one hundred centimeters used to measure how long something is.', 'The swimming pool is 25 meters long.', 'Bể bơi dài 25 mét.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance team needs to measure the office floor, which is exactly twenty meters in length.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì cần đo sàn văn phòng, dài chính xác hai mươi mét.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-ljspeech-17272b9d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-cori-17272b9d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/meter-a862e6d0.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"square meter\", \"meaning\": \"mét vuông\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cubic meter\", \"meaning\": \"mét khối\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"metre\", \"note_vi\": \"cách viết kiểu Anh-Anh, meter là kiểu Anh-Mỹ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"metrical\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"metric\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-cori-17272b9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-aru0-17272b9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-aru5-17272b9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-aru6-17272b9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-aru10-17272b9d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-aru9-17272b9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-aru3-17272b9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-aru7-17272b9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-aru8-17272b9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-aru2-17272b9d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-ljspeech-17272b9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-lt408-17272b9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-lt138-17272b9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-lt624-17272b9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-lt396-17272b9d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-lt498-17272b9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-lt132-17272b9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-lt288-17272b9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-lt42-17272b9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meter-lt90-17272b9d.mp3\"]}}', 'Lưu ý sự khác biệt chính tả giữa Anh-Anh (metre) và Anh-Mỹ (meter).', 'daily', 1, 29),
('f300a417-e105-51fb-9a5b-9f82842ac360', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '95033cf9-f704-5556-ba8d-63e768ef0a64', 'f32f6e70-ae60-5013-a24a-4a8593e68a9b', 'monitor', '/ˈmɒnɪtə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị hiển thị hình ảnh hoặc thông tin từ máy tính.', 'a piece of equipment with a screen that shows information or pictures from a computer.', 'The graphic designer adjusted the dual monitor setup to display complex visual details.', 'Nhà thiết kế đồ họa đã điều chỉnh thiết lập màn hình kép để hiển thị các chi tiết hình ảnh phức tạp.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure that your computer monitor is turned off before leaving the office for the weekend.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo rằng màn hình máy tính của bạn đã được tắt trước khi rời văn phòng vào cuối tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-ljspeech-9796809f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-cori-9796809f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/monitor-87856ddd.webp', '[\"screen\", \"display\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"computer monitor\", \"meaning\": \"màn hình máy tính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"flat-screen monitor\", \"meaning\": \"màn hình phẳng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"monitor\", \"note_vi\": \"Dạng động từ có nghĩa là giám sát, theo dõi quá trình.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"monitor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-cori-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru0-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru5-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru6-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru10-9796809f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru9-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru3-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru7-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru8-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru2-9796809f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-ljspeech-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt408-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt138-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt624-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt396-9796809f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt498-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt132-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt288-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt42-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-lt90-9796809f.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, từ này xuất hiện nhiều ở cả dạng danh từ (màn hình) và động từ (giám sát).', 'technology', 1, 0),
('9992577e-60d3-5ba0-a32e-f478f80b4ef6', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '95033cf9-f704-5556-ba8d-63e768ef0a64', 'f32f6e70-ae60-5013-a24a-4a8593e68a9b', 'impress', '/ɪmˈpres/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Tạo ra cảm giác ngưỡng mộ hoặc tôn trọng.', 'to make someone feel admiration or respect because of your skills or qualities.', 'Her outstanding presentation managed to impress key clients during the annual business conference.', 'Bài thuyết trình xuất sắc của cô ấy đã thành công gây ấn tượng với các khách hàng quan trọng trong hội nghị kinh doanh hàng năm.', '{\"en\": \"She worked hard to impress the hiring manager during her final interview for the position.\", \"vi\": \"Cô ấy đã làm việc chăm chỉ để gây ấn tượng với người quản lý tuyển dụng trong buổi phỏng vấn cuối cùng cho vị trí này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-ljspeech-ad68fcd9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-cori-ad68fcd9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/impress-c1677ec0.webp', '[\"influence\", \"dazzle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"impress someone\", \"meaning\": \"gây ấn tượng với ai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deeply impress\", \"meaning\": \"gây ấn tượng sâu sắc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"impression\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"impressive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-cori-ad68fcd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-aru0-ad68fcd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-aru5-ad68fcd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-aru6-ad68fcd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-aru10-ad68fcd9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-aru9-ad68fcd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-aru3-ad68fcd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-aru7-ad68fcd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-aru8-ad68fcd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-aru2-ad68fcd9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-ljspeech-ad68fcd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-lt408-ad68fcd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-lt138-ad68fcd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-lt624-ad68fcd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-lt396-ad68fcd9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-lt498-ad68fcd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-lt132-ad68fcd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-lt288-ad68fcd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-lt42-ad68fcd9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impress-lt90-ad68fcd9.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất phổ biến trong ngữ cảnh phỏng vấn xin việc.', 'hr', 1, 1),
('7aacd29a-76ce-5232-8c7a-7aeb75bad29e', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '95033cf9-f704-5556-ba8d-63e768ef0a64', 'f32f6e70-ae60-5013-a24a-4a8593e68a9b', 'electron', '/ɪˈlektrɒn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hạt hạ nguyên tử mang điện tích âm, là một thành phần cơ bản của nguyên tử.', 'A stable subatomic particle carrying an element of negative charge, orbiting atomic nuclei.', 'An electron orbits the nucleus of an atom.', 'Một electron quay quanh hạt nhân của nguyên tử.', '{\"en\": \"The research team published a report about electron behavior in new semiconductor materials.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm nghiên cứu đã xuất bản báo cáo về hành vi của electron trong vật liệu bán dẫn mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-ljspeech-da005969.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-cori-da005969.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/electron-2ab43299.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"electron microscope\", \"meaning\": \"kính hiển vi điện tử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"free electron\", \"meaning\": \"electron tự do\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"electricity\", \"note_vi\": \"electricity là dòng điện/điện năng, electron là hạt hạ nguyên tử\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"electronic\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"electronics\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-cori-da005969.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-aru0-da005969.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-aru5-da005969.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-aru6-da005969.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-aru10-da005969.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-aru9-da005969.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-aru3-da005969.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-aru7-da005969.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-aru8-da005969.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-aru2-da005969.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-ljspeech-da005969.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-lt408-da005969.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-lt138-da005969.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-lt624-da005969.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-lt396-da005969.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-lt498-da005969.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-lt132-da005969.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-lt288-da005969.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-lt42-da005969.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electron-lt90-da005969.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt electron (hạt mang điện tích âm) với electronic (thuộc về điện tử).', 'technology', 1, 2),
('c200a1eb-729c-5165-8a72-b49a82a1079d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '95033cf9-f704-5556-ba8d-63e768ef0a64', 'f32f6e70-ae60-5013-a24a-4a8593e68a9b', 'note', '/nəʊt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một lời nhắn ngắn hoặc thông tin được viết ra.', 'a short written record of information to help you remember something important later.', 'Please make a note of the meeting time and date in your calendar.', 'Xin hãy ghi chú lại thời gian và ngày họp vào lịch của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"Please leave a note on the receptionist\'s desk if you arrive before the office opens.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng để lại lời nhắn trên bàn lễ tân nếu bạn đến trước giờ mở cửa văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-ljspeech-c51048b7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-cori-c51048b7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/note-826167cd.webp', '[\"memo\", \"message\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take a note\", \"meaning\": \"ghi chú\"}, {\"phrase\": \"leave a note\", \"meaning\": \"để lại lời nhắn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"notice\", \"note_vi\": \"Notice là thông báo hoặc sự chú ý, note là ghi chú.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"notify\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"notable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-cori-c51048b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-aru0-c51048b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-aru5-c51048b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-aru6-c51048b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-aru10-c51048b7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-aru9-c51048b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-aru3-c51048b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-aru7-c51048b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-aru8-c51048b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-aru2-c51048b7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-ljspeech-c51048b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-lt408-c51048b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-lt138-c51048b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-lt624-c51048b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-lt396-c51048b7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-lt498-c51048b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-lt132-c51048b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-lt288-c51048b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-lt42-c51048b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/note-lt90-c51048b7.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \"note\" (ghi chú) và \"notice\" (thông báo/chú ý).', 'office', 1, 3),
('bf191345-4fc8-5e01-b96e-d01795b3d391', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '95033cf9-f704-5556-ba8d-63e768ef0a64', 'f32f6e70-ae60-5013-a24a-4a8593e68a9b', 'frame', 'UK: /freɪm/ | US: /freɪm/', 'B1', 'noun', 'khung', 'A rigid structure that surrounds and supports a picture, window, or door.', 'The picture frame is made of wood.', 'Khung ảnh được làm bằng gỗ.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance team repaired the wooden frame of the main office window.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì đã sửa chữa khung gỗ của cửa sổ văn phòng chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-ljspeech-39d88b57.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-cori-39d88b57.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/frame-29aac374.webp', '[\"structure\", \"framework\", \"casing\", \"border\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"picture frame\", \"meaning\": \"khung ảnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"time frame\", \"meaning\": \"khung thời gian\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"flame\", \"note_vi\": \"Flame có nghĩa là ngọn lửa, tránh phát âm nhầm với frame.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"frame\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"framework\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-cori-39d88b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-aru0-39d88b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-aru5-39d88b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-aru6-39d88b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-aru10-39d88b57.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-aru9-39d88b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-aru3-39d88b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-aru7-39d88b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-aru8-39d88b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-aru2-39d88b57.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-ljspeech-39d88b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-lt408-39d88b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-lt138-39d88b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-lt624-39d88b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-lt396-39d88b57.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-lt498-39d88b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-lt132-39d88b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-lt288-39d88b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-lt42-39d88b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frame-lt90-39d88b57.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa khung ảnh/khung cửa (picture frame), từ này còn xuất hiện trong cụm \'time frame\' (khung thời gian thực hiện dự án).', 'office', 1, 4),
('bb092c5c-ece5-5a73-b535-a46bf6831ffc', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '95033cf9-f704-5556-ba8d-63e768ef0a64', 'f32f6e70-ae60-5013-a24a-4a8593e68a9b', 'postpone', 'UK: /pəˈspəʊn/ | US: /poʊˈspoʊn/', 'B1', 'verb', 'hoãn lại', 'To delay an event or arrangement so that it happens at a later time.', 'We need to postpone the client meeting until next week.', 'Chúng ta cần hoãn cuộc họp khách hàng đến tuần sau.', '{\"en\": \"Due to the severe weather, the outdoor product launch has been postponed until next Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Do thời tiết xấu, lễ ra mắt sản phẩm ngoài trời đã bị hoãn lại cho đến thứ Sáu tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-ljspeech-cdbd03bc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-cori-cdbd03bc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/postpone-e355176f.webp', '[\"delay\", \"put off\", \"reschedule\", \"defer\"]', '[\"advance\", \"expedite\", \"bring forward\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"postpone a meeting\", \"meaning\": \"hoãn cuộc họp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"postpone until further notice\", \"meaning\": \"hoãn cho đến khi có thông báo mới\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cancel\", \"note_vi\": \"\'cancel\' là hủy bỏ hoàn toàn, còn \'postpone\' chỉ là hoãn lại sang thời điểm khác.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"postponement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-cori-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru0-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru5-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru6-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru10-cdbd03bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru9-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru3-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru7-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru8-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru2-cdbd03bc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-ljspeech-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-lt408-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-lt138-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-lt624-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-lt396-cdbd03bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-lt498-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-lt132-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-lt288-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-lt42-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-lt90-cdbd03bc.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ rất hay xuất hiện trong TOEIC Part 3 & 4. Đồng nghĩa với \'put off\', \'delay\'.', 'meetings', 1, 5),
('c2cad20b-15ec-5e00-b891-98a7881f4cac', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '95033cf9-f704-5556-ba8d-63e768ef0a64', 'f32f6e70-ae60-5013-a24a-4a8593e68a9b', 'handsome', '/ˈhænsəm/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Đẹp trai (thường dùng cho nam giới); hoặc đẹp đẽ, ấn tượng.', 'having a pleasant, attractive, and good-looking appearance, usually used for men.', 'The young manager looked very handsome in his dark blue tailor-made suit.', 'Vị quản lý trẻ trông rất đẹp trai trong bộ vest may đo màu xanh đen.', '{\"en\": \"The real estate agent showed the clients a handsome building near the financial center.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bất động sản đã cho khách hàng xem một tòa nhà đẹp đẽ gần trung tâm tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handsome-ljspeech-11e1d0e1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handsome-cori-11e1d0e1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/handsome-e3672ca3.webp', '[\"good-looking\", \"attractive\", \"charming\"]', '[\"ugly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"handsome man\", \"meaning\": \"người đàn ông đẹp trai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"handsome profit\", \"meaning\": \"khoản lợi nhuận lớn, ấn tượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"handsome salary\", \"meaning\": \"mức lương hậu đãi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pretty\", \"note_vi\": \"Handsome thường dùng cho nam hoặc công trình/lợi nhuận; pretty dùng cho nữ/vật nhỏ nhắn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"handsomely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handsome-cori-11e1d0e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handsome-aru0-11e1d0e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handsome-aru5-11e1d0e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handsome-aru6-11e1d0e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handsome-aru10-11e1d0e1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handsome-aru9-11e1d0e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/handsome-aru3-