('cc310446-a432-5055-a313-63563b9f513f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '96faf88c-716f-561b-807f-e11fa6a12866', 'e5141d65-dca3-5aa4-ab03-3a91dcb3a870', 'fever', '/ˈfiːvə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng nhiệt độ cơ thể cao hơn bình thường.', 'a medical condition in which the body temperature is higher than normal.', 'The child had a high fever and needed to see a doctor immediately.', 'Đứa trẻ bị sốt cao và cần gặp bác sĩ ngay lập tức.', '{\"en\": \"The employee stayed home because he developed a high fever during the night.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên này đã ở nhà vì anh ấy bị sốt cao vào ban đêm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-ljspeech-e2f347fb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-cori-e2f347fb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fever-f24117e9.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"high fever\", \"meaning\": \"sốt cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"run a fever\", \"meaning\": \"bị sốt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"favor\", \"note_vi\": \"Favor phát âm khác và mang nghĩa là sự giúp đỡ hoặc ân huệ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"feverish\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"feverishly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-cori-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru0-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru5-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru6-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru10-e2f347fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru9-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru3-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru7-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru8-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru2-e2f347fb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/p