('905190c8-a9e0-5c6c-af07-fa8d59d69c65', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '96faf88c-716f-561b-807f-e11fa6a12866', 'e5141d65-dca3-5aa4-ab03-3a91dcb3a870', 'split', 'UK: /splɪt/ | US: /splɪt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'chia, tách', 'To divide or cause something to separate into two or more distinct parts.', 'We need to split the large group into smaller teams.', 'Chúng ta cần chia nhóm lớn thành các đội nhỏ hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The project leader decided to split the team into two units to meet the deadline efficiently.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng nhóm dự án quyết định chia đội thành hai đơn vị để hoàn thành hạn chót một cách hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-ljspeech-94d5cab6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-cori-94d5cab6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/split-9c237304.webp', '[\"divide\", \"separate\", \"share\", \"cleave\"]', '[\"unite\", \"combine\", \"join\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"split the bill\", \"meaning\": \"chia tiền hóa đơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"split into groups\", \"meaning\": \"chia thành các nhóm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"spill\", \"note_vi\": \"Làm đổ tràn chất lỏng, khác với split (chia/tách).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"split\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"split\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-cori-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru0-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru5-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru6-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru10-94d5cab6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru9-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru3-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru7-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru8-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru2-94d5cab6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-ljspeech-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-lt408-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-lt138-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-lt624-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-lt396-94d5cab6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-lt498-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-lt132-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-lt288-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-lt42-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-lt90-94d5cab6.mp3\"]}}', 'Phổ biến trong các cụm như \'split the bill\' (chia tiền hóa đơn) hoặc \'split into\' (tách thành các nhóm/phần).', 'general business', 1, 5),
('d322da6d-d8fc-5a81-9432-136fc07f0b1a', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '96faf88c-716f-561b-807f-e11fa6a12866', 'e5141d65-dca3-5aa4-ab03-3a91dcb3a870', 'in fact', '/ɪn fækt/', 'A2', 'idiom', 'Thực ra, trên thực tế (dùng để nhấn mạnh hoặc đính chính).', 'Employed to state an actual truth or to provide extra detail supporting a previous statement.', 'He said he was busy, but in fact, he was just watching TV.', 'Anh ấy nói anh ấy bận, nhưng thực tế, anh ấy chỉ đang xem TV.', '{\"en\": \"The project was not delayed; in fact, we finished it two days early.\", \"vi\": \"Dự án không hề bị trễ; thực ra, chúng tôi đã hoàn thành nó sớm hai ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-fact-ljspeech-2fc79987.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-fact-cori-2fc79987.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/in-fact-5600544d.webp', '[\"actually\", \"indeed\", \"really\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"as a matter of fact\", \"meaning\": \"thực tế là (đồng nghĩa)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"in effect\", \"note_vi\": \"in effect nghĩa là có hiệu lực hoặc thực tế là (kết quả)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-fact-cori-2fc79987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-fact-aru0-2fc79987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-fact-aru5-2fc79987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-fact-aru6-2fc79987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-fact-aru10-2fc79987.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-fact-aru9-2fc79987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-fact-aru3-2fc79987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-fact-aru7-2fc79987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-fact-aru8-2fc79987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-fact-aru2-2fc79987.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v