('7b139110-2e80-55fd-a43c-3363a99eae7f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '96faf88c-716f-561b-807f-e11fa6a12866', 'e5141d65-dca3-5aa4-ab03-3a91dcb3a870', 'grateful', '/ˈɡreɪtfl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy biết ơn hoặc cảm kích về điều gì đó.', 'feeling or showing thanks for something received or done for you.', 'The manager was extremely grateful to the team for completing the project early.', 'Người quản lý cực kỳ biết ơn đội ngũ vì đã hoàn thành dự án sớm.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was grateful for the team\'s extra effort on the project.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý rất biết ơn nỗ lực thêm của nhóm cho dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-ljspeech-54bb9bd5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-cori-54bb9bd5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grateful-b14fbfe2.webp', '[\"thankful\", \"appreciative\"]', '[\"ungrateful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"grateful for\", \"meaning\": \"biết ơn về điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"grateful to\", \"meaning\": \"biết ơn ai đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deeply grateful\", \"meaning\": \"vô cùng biết ơn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"graceful\", \"note_vi\": \"graceful là duyên dáng, không phải biết ơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"gratitude\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"gratefully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-cori-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru0-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru5-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru6-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru10-54bb9bd5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru9-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru3-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru7-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru8-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-aru2-54bb9bd5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-ljspeech-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt408-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt138-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt624-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt396-54bb9bd5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt498-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt132-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt288-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt42-54bb9bd5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grateful-lt90-54bb9bd5.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ viết là grateful, nhiều người viết sai thành greatful.', 'office', 1, 17),
('b8a54932-7974-5599-9cf1-b3a5a1f0347c', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '96faf88c-716f-561b-807f-e11fa6a12866', 'e5141d65-dca3-5aa4-ab03-3a91dcb3a870', 'tour', '/tʊə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Chuyến đi tham quan nhiều địa điểm khác nhau.', 'a journey made to visit several places for pleasure or business.', 'The delegation will take a private tour around the manufacturing facility tomorrow morning.', 'Phái đoàn sẽ đi tham quan riêng một vòng cơ sở sản xuất vào sáng mai.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency organized a guided tour of the factory for potential clients.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch đã tổ chức một chuyến tham quan nhà máy có hướng dẫn cho các khách hàng tiềm năng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-ljspeech-2c8bbd4e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-cori-2c8bbd4e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tour-9ee05f13.webp', '[\"trip\", \"excursion\", \"expedition\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"guided tour\", \"meaning\": \"chuyến tham quan có hướng dẫn viên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"package tour\", \"meaning\": \"chuyến du lịch trọn gói\"}, {\"phrase\": \"factory tour\", \"meaning\": \"chuyến tham quan nhà máy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"trip\", \"note_vi\": \"Trip là chuyến đi nói chung, tour là chuyến đi qua nhiều nơi có hành trình định sẵn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tourist\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tourism\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"tour\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-cori-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru0-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru5-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru6-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru10-2c8bbd4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru9-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru3-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru7-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru8-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-aru2-2c8bbd4e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-ljspeech-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt408-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt138-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt624-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt396-2c8bbd4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt498-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt132-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt288-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt42-2c8bbd4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tour-lt90-2c8bbd4e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong các cụm như guided tour, tour guide, tour package.', 'travel', 1, 18),
('f866b5d6-8779-57ac-b3d4-22481a827618', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '96faf88c-716f-561b-807f-e11fa6a12866', 'e5141d65-dca3-5aa4-ab03-3a91dcb3a870', 'strategy', '/ˈstrætədʒi/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Kế hoạch tổng thể để đạt được một mục tiêu cụ thể.', 'a detailed plan designed to achieve a specific long-term goal or success.', 'Our marketing team developed a new strategy to reach more potential customers.', 'Đội ngũ tiếp thị của chúng tôi đã phát triển một chiến lược mới để tiếp cận nhiều khách hàng tiềm năng hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors met yesterday to discuss a new strategy for corporate expansion.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã họp hôm qua để thảo luận về chiến lược mới nhằm mở rộng doanh nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strategy-ljspeech-31e10e63.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strategy-cori-31e10e63.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/strategy-f21b8afc.webp', '[\"plan\", \"scheme\", \"tactic\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"business strategy\", \"meaning\": \"chiến lược kinh doanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"develop a strategy\", \"meaning\": \"phát triển chiến lược\"}, {\"phrase\": \"effective strategy\", \"meaning\": \"chiến lược hiệu quả\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tactic\", \"note_vi\": \"Strategy là chiến lược tổng thể dài hạn, tactic là thủ thuật/biện pháp ngắn hạn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"strategic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"strategically\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"strategist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strategy-cori-31e10e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strategy-aru0-31e10e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strategy-aru5-31e10e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strategy-aru6-31e10e63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strategy-aru10-31e10e63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pron