('7bf5b306-bae8-5346-9977-20f28b76fc22', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '98d338d0-b2a7-511f-a725-2586982f9729', 'fe813c83-4a26-5c7a-850a-d0d915585b87', 'muscular', '/ˈmʌskjələ(r)/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có nhiều cơ bắp, khỏe mạnh và vạm vỡ.', 'having well-developed muscles or relating to the muscles of the body in a healthy way.', 'The weightlifter had a very muscular physique from years of training.', 'Vận động viên cử tạ có một thân hình rất vạm vỡ nhờ nhiều năm tập luyện.', '{\"en\": \"The fitness center hired a muscular trainer to lead the new morning exercise classes for staff.\", \"vi\": \"Trung tâm thể hình đã thuê một huấn luyện viên cơ bắp để dẫn dắt các lớp tập thể dục sáng cho nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-ljspeech-fdec1044.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-cori-fdec1044.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/muscular-32cf80fd.webp', '[\"strong\", \"athletic\"]', '[\"weak\", \"thin\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"muscular build\", \"meaning\": \"thể hình cơ bắp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"muscular pain\", \"meaning\": \"đau cơ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"muscle\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-cori-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru0-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru5-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru6-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru10-fdec1044.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru9-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru3-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru7-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru8-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-aru2-fdec1044.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-ljspeech-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-lt408-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-lt138-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-lt624-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-lt396-fdec1044.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-lt498-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-lt132-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-lt288-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-lt42-fdec1044.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscular-lt90-fdec1044.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để mô tả vóc dáng khỏe mạnh, săn chắc.', 'health', 1, 6),
('73047427-8ec3-5039-9e1e-0c9c6757eb22', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '98d338d0-b2a7-511f-a725-2586982f9729', 'fe813c83-4a26-5c7a-850a-d0d915585b87', 'altogether', '/ˌɔːltəˈɡeðə(r)/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Hoàn toàn, toàn bộ, tổng cộng.', 'completely or to a total extent in every way or part of something.', 'I don\'t altogether agree with his proposal.', 'Tôi không hoàn toàn đồng ý với đề xuất của anh ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The board members did not altogether agree with the new budget plan presented yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Các thành viên hội đồng quản trị không hoàn toàn đồng ý với kế hoạch ngân sách mới được trình bày hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-ljspeech-6c29a823.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-cori-6c29a823.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/altogether-a0f73d7b.webp', '[\"entirely\", \"completely\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"not altogether\", \"meaning\": \"không hoàn toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"altogether different\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn khác biệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"all together\", \"note_vi\": \"all together là tất cả cùng nhau, altogether là hoàn toàn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-cori-6c29a823.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-aru0-6c29a823.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-aru5-6c29a823.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-aru6-6c29a823.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-aru10-6c29a823.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-aru9-6c29a823.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-aru3-6c29a823.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-aru7-6c29a823.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-aru8-6c29a823.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-aru2-6c29a823.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-ljspeech-6c29a823.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-lt408-6c29a823.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-lt138-6c29a823.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-lt624-6c29a823.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-lt396-6c29a823.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-lt498-6c29a823.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-lt132-6c29a823.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-lt288-6c29a823.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-lt42-6c29a823.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altogether-lt90-6c29a823.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận nhầm với \'all together\' (tất cả cùng nhau).', 'business', 1, 7),
('c91e21e7-c1b4-528b-aa71-5eebff650cef', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', '98d338d0-b2a7-511f-a725-2586982f9729', 'fe813c83-4a26-5c7a-850a-d0d915585b87', 'unfortunately', '/ʌnˈfɔːtʃənətli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Một cách không may mắn, gây thất vọng.', 'used to say that something is sad or has had a bad effect.', 'Unfortunately, the concert was canceled due to bad weather.', 'Thật không may, buổi hòa nhạc đã bị hủy do thời tiết xấu.', '{\"en\": \"Unfortunately, the shipment of office supplies will be delayed due to a logistics error.\", \"vi\": \"Thật không May, lô hàng văn phòng phẩm sẽ bị trì hoãn do lỗi hậu cần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunately-ljspeech-bf9d6230.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunately-cori-bf9d6230.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unfortunately-f29d3f7c.webp', '[\"regrettably\", \"sadly\"]', '[\"fortunately\", \"luckily\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unfortunately for\", \"meaning\": \"thật không may cho\"}, {\"phrase\": \"it is unfortunately\", \"meaning\": \"thật đáng tiếc là\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unfortunate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunately-cori-bf9d6230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunately-aru0-bf9d6230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunately-aru5-bf9d6230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunately-aru6-bf9d6230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunately-aru10-bf9d6230.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunately-aru9-bf9d6230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunately-aru3-bf9d6230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunately-aru7-bf9d6230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunately-aru8-bf9d6230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfortunat