('f98b1e2c-5058-5638-8069-d8efe874dd19', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a21c02be-f598-5ba0-8b85-3783d30990a7', '5fbf2e42-9681-5bb8-a000-3043f034b78a', 'recipe', 'UK: /ˈrɛsɪpi/ | US: /ˈrɛsəpi/', 'A2', 'noun', 'công thức nấu ăn', 'A set of instructions describing how to prepare and cook a particular dish.', 'This recipe is easy to follow.', 'Công thức này rất dễ làm theo.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant chain modified its secret recipe to offer healthier choices to diners.\", \"vi\": \"Chuỗi nhà hàng đã sửa đổi công thức bí truyền của mình để mang lại sự lựa chọn lành mạnh hơn cho khách ăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-ljspeech-e2a2270c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-cori-e2a2270c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/recipe-75d11f28.webp', '[\"formula\", \"instructions\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"secret recipe\", \"meaning\": \"công thức bí truyền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"recipe for success\", \"meaning\": \"bí quyết/công thức dẫn đến thành công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"receipt\", \"note_vi\": \"receipt nghĩa là biên lai, hóa đơn thanh toán.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-cori-e2a2270c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-aru0-e2a2270c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-aru5-e2a2270c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-aru6-e2a2270c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-aru10-e2a2270c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-aru9-e2a2270c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-aru3-e2a2270c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-aru7-e2a2270c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-aru8-e2a2270c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-aru2-e2a2270c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-ljspeech-e2a2270c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-lt408-e2a2270c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-lt138-e2a2270c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-lt624-e2a2270c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-lt396-e2a2270c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-lt498-e2a2270c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-lt132-e2a2270c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-lt288-e2a2270c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-lt42-e2a2270c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recipe-lt90-e2a2270c.mp3\"]}}', 'Phát âm 3 âm tiết /ˈresəpi/. Tránh nhầm lẫn chính tả và nghĩa với \'receipt\' (/rɪˈsiːt/ - biên lai).', 'restaurant', 1, 3),
('1713945b-4418-563d-af68-b82b8c793515', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a21c02be-f598-5ba0-8b85-3783d30990a7', '5fbf2e42-9681-5bb8-a000-3043f034b78a', 'follow up', 'UK: /ˈfɒloʊ ʌp/ | US: /ˈfɑloʊ ʌp/', 'B1', 'v.phr', 'theo dõi, tiếp tục sau đó', 'To take further action or investigate more on something previously initiated.', 'I will follow up on the new project soon.', 'Tôi sẽ theo dõi dự án mới sớm thôi.', '{\"en\": \"The sales representative promised to follow up on the customer\'s inquiry by tomorrow afternoon.\", \"vi\": \"Đại diện kinh doanh hứa sẽ tiếp tục xử lý thắc mắc của khách hàng trước chiều mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-ljspeech-af153c29.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-cori-af153c29.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/follow-up-b62dd071.webp', '[\"pursue\", \"check back\", \"investigate further\"]', '[\"abandon\", \"neglect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"follow up on an inquiry\", \"meaning\": \"theo dõi/xử lý một thắc mắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"follow up with a phone call\", \"meaning\": \"liên hệ lại bằng một cuộc điện thoại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"follow up promptly\", \"meaning\": \"theo dõi/xử lý nhanh chóng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"follow-up\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"follow-up\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-cori-af153c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-aru0-af153c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-aru5-af153c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-aru6-af153c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-aru10-af153c29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-aru9-af153c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-aru3-af153c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-aru7-af153c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-aru8-af153c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-aru2-af153c29.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-ljspeech-af153c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-lt408-af153c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-lt138-af153c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-lt624-af153c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-lt396-af153c29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-lt498-af153c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-lt132-af153c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-lt288-af153c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-lt42-af153c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/follow-up-lt90-af153c29.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng cấu trúc \'follow up on something\' (theo dõi/tiếp tục xử lý một công việc) hoặc \'follow up with someone\' (liên hệ lại với ai).', 'office', 1, 4),
('386e5d34-709d-5e81-8565-5c09102c1548', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a21c02be-f598-5ba0-8b85-3783d30990a7', '5fbf2e42-9681-5bb8-a000-3043f034b78a', 'expected', '/ɪkˈspektɪd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Được mong đợi, dự đoán sẽ xảy ra.', 'something that you think will happen or arrive at a particular time in the future.', 'The expected delivery date for the package is next Tuesday.', 'Ngày giao hàng dự kiến cho gói hàng là thứ Ba tới.', '{\"en\": \"The expected arrival time of the shipment is delayed due to heavy traffic on the highway.\", \"vi\": \"Thời gian đến dự kiến của lô hàng bị trì hoãn do giao thông đông đúc trên đường cao tốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-ljspeech-5dcbdf37.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-cori-5dcbdf37.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/expected-f700a082.webp', '[\"anticipated\", \"predicted\", \"scheduled\"]', '[\"unexpected\", \"surprising\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"expected result\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả dự kiến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"expected time\", \"meaning\": \"thời gian dự kiến\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"expect\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"expectation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-cori-5dcbdf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-aru0-5dcbdf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-aru5-5dcbdf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-aru6-5dcbdf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-aru10-5dcbdf37.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-aru9-5dcbdf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-aru3-5dcbdf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-aru7-5dcbdf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-aru8-5dcbdf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-aru2-5dcbdf37.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-ljspeech-5dcbdf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-lt408-5dcbdf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-lt138-5dcbdf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-lt624-5dcbdf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-lt396-5dcbdf37.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-lt498-5dcbdf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-lt132-5dcbdf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-lt288-5dcbdf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-lt42-5dcbdf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expected-lt90-5dcbdf37.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong cụm \'expected to\' hoặc \'expected time\'.', 'business', 1, 5),
('a8aa7dc9-c3b1-5e26-9f92-e4375eb8a601', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a21c02be-f598-5ba0-8b85-3783d30990a7', '5fbf2e42-9681-5bb8-a000-3043f034b78a', 'assume', '/əˈsjuːm/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Cho rằng điều gì đó là đúng mà không có bằng chứng chắc chắn.', 'to accept something as true without checking or having proof.', 'Let\'s assume the train will be on time and plan accordingly.', 'Cứ cho là tàu sẽ đến đúng giờ và chúng ta hãy lên kế hoạch cho phù hợp.', '{\"en\": \"We should not assume that the client will renew the contract without negotiating the price.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta không nên giả định rằng khách hàng sẽ gia hạn hợp đồng mà không thương lượng giá cả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-ljspeech-661e458e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-cori-661e458e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/assume-1a475879.webp', '[\"presume\", \"suppose\", \"take for granted\"]', '[\"prove\", \"doubt\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"assume responsibility\", \"meaning\": \"gánh vác trách nhiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"assume control\", \"meaning\": \"nắm quyền kiểm soát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reasonable to assume\", \"meaning\": \"hợp lý khi cho rằng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"presume\", \"note_vi\": \"presume là tin là đúng dựa trên xác suất; assume là giả định không căn cứ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"assumption\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"assumed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-cori-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru0-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru5-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru6-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru10-661e458e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru9-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru3-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru7-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru8-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru2-661e458e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-ljspeech-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt408-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt138-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt624-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt396-661e458e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt498-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt132-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt288-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt42-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt90-661e458e.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa \'giả định\', từ này còn có nghĩa là \'gánh vác\' (trách nhiệm, chức vụ).', 'business', 1, 6),
('ec4a70a7-155f-5a07-820b-4e1fd75546a8', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a21c02be-f598-5ba0-8b85-3783d30990a7', '5fbf2e42-9681-5bb8-a000-3043f034b78a', 'sun', '/sʌn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Ngôi sao trung tâm của hệ mặt trời, cung cấp ánh sáng và nhiệt cho Trái Đất.', 'the large, bright star in the center of our solar system that gives light and heat to the earth.', 'Don\'t forget to wear sunscreen when you\'re out in the sun.', 'Đừng quên thoa kem chống nắng khi bạn ra ngoài nắng.', '{\"en\": \"The outdoor cafe tables are popular because they get plenty of warm sun during lunchtime.\", \"vi\": \"Các bàn cà phê ngoài trời rất được ưa chuộng vì chúng đón nhiều ánh nắng ấm áp vào giờ trưa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-ljspeech-22fa6121.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-cori-22fa6121.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sun-010adff8.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"morning sun\", \"meaning\": \"nắng sớm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"block the sun\", \"meaning\": \"che ánh nắng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"son\", \"note_vi\": \"phát âm giống hệt nhưng nghĩa là con trai\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sunny\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sunlight\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-cori-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru0-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru5-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru6-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru10-22fa6121.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru9-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru3-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru7-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru8-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-aru2-22fa6121.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-ljspeech-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-lt408-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-lt138-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-lt624-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-lt396-22fa6121.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-lt498-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-lt132-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-lt288-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-lt42-22fa6121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sun-lt90-22fa6121.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm phát âm với từ \'son\' (con trai).', 'nature', 1, 7),
('d831b6bb-e7ad-5cda-88f8-1c9f2e90504c', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a21c02be-f598-5ba0-8b85-3783d30990a7', '5fbf2e42-9681-5bb8-a000-3043f034b78a', 'cube', '/kjuːb/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một vật thể ba chiều có sáu mặt vuông bằng nhau.', 'a solid shape that has six equal square sides.', 'We learned how to calculate the volume of a cube in math class.', 'Chúng tôi đã học cách tính thể tích của một hình lập phương trong giờ toán.', '{\"en\": \"Please put an ice cube into each glass before serving the cold drinks.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng cho một viên đá vào mỗi ly trước khi phục vụ đồ uống lạnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cube-ljspeech-55f7d1f7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cube-cori-55f7d1f7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cube-045ce722.webp', '[\"block\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ice cube\", \"meaning\": \"viên đá lạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sugar cube\", \"meaning\": \"viên đường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cubicle\", \"note_vi\": \"cube là khối lập phương, cubicle là gian phòng nhỏ/vách ngăn làm việc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"cubic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cube-cori-55f7d1f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cube-aru0-55f7d1f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cube-aru5-55f7d1f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cube-aru6-55f7d1f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cube-aru10-55f7d1f7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cube-aru9-55f7d1f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cube-aru3-55f7d1f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cube-aru7-55f7d1f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cube-aru8-55f7d1f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cube-aru2-55f7d1f7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cube-ljspeech-55f7