('78153233-4273-57f6-9ab2-e92a8099e351', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a21c02be-f598-5ba0-8b85-3783d30990a7', '5fbf2e42-9681-5bb8-a000-3043f034b78a', 'stinky', '/stɪŋki/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có mùi rất khó chịu, hôi hám.', 'having a strong and very unpleasant smell that makes people uncomfortable.', 'The garbage left out in the sun became really stinky.', 'Đống rác để ngoài nắng trở nên bốc mùi rất hôi thối.', '{\"en\": \"Maintenance staff cleaned the stinky drainage pipe in the office basement yesterday morning.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo trì đã dọn dẹp đường ống thoát nước hôi hám ở tầng hầm văn phòng sáng qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stinky-ljspeech-b0d90bbe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stinky-cori-b0d90bbe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stinky-9c80723f.webp', '[\"foul\", \"smelly\", \"malodorous\"]', '[\"fragrant\", \"aromatic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stinky garbage\", \"meaning\": \"rác hôi thối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stinky smell\", \"meaning\": \"mùi hôi nồng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sticky\", \"note_vi\": \"Sticky nghĩa là dính, còn stinky là có mùi hôi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"stink\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stink\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stinky-cori-b0d90bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stinky-aru0-b0d90bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stinky-aru5-b0d90bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stinky-aru6-b0d90bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stinky-aru10-b0d90bbe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stinky-aru9-b0d90bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stinky-aru3-b0d90bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stinky-aru7-b0d90bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stinky-aru8-b0d90bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publi