('eb285d25-47ae-5195-805d-863ac89c5bf9', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a21e4311-9885-53f6-b05a-7cb932ae0e48', 'b6ce0b86-21d5-50a2-9fb2-9c7739ac17c9', 'fat', '/fæt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Chất béo, mỡ trong cơ thể hoặc thức ăn.', 'an oily substance found in food or in the bodies of people and animals.', 'Eating too much saturated fat can raise your cholesterol levels.', 'Ăn quá nhiều chất béo bão hòa có thể làm tăng mức cholesterol của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"The new menu clearly lists the amount of fat in each healthy lunch option.\", \"vi\": \"Thực đơn mới liệt kê rõ ràng lượng chất béo trong mỗi lựa chọn bữa trưa lành mạnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-ljspeech-5b5fb1c9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-cori-5b5fb1c9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fat-fc975313.webp', '[\"lipid\", \"oil\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"saturated fat\", \"meaning\": \"chất béo bão hòa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"low fat\", \"meaning\": \"ít béo\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fatty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-cori-5b5fb1c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-aru0-5b5fb1c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-aru5-5b5fb1c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-aru6-5b5fb1c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-aru10-5b5fb1c9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-aru9-5b5fb1c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-aru3-5b5fb1c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-aru7-5b5fb1c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-aru8-5b5fb1c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-aru2-5b5fb1c9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-ljspeech-5b5fb1c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fat-lt408-5b5fb1c9.mp3\", \"/