('12e65283-b20d-565e-b978-96fef18a7832', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a21e4311-9885-53f6-b05a-7cb932ae0e48', 'b6ce0b86-21d5-50a2-9fb2-9c7739ac17c9', 'royal', '/ˈrɔɪəl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về hoặc liên quan đến vua, nữ hoàng hoặc gia đình hoàng tộc.', 'Associated with, suitable for, or directly descended from a sovereign monarch.', 'The royal family attended the annual charity gala.', 'Gia đình hoàng gia đã tham dự buổi dạ tiệc từ thiện thường niên.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel was honored to host a reception for the royal delegation last week.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn vinh dự được tổ chức buổi tiếp đón cho phái đoàn hoàng gia tuần trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-ljspeech-9d644bbc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-cori-9d644bbc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/royal-0afaf41c.webp', '[\"regal\", \"imperial\", \"majestic\"]', '[\"common\", \"ordinary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"royal family\", \"meaning\": \"gia đình hoàng gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"royal palace\", \"meaning\": \"cung điện hoàng gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"royal decree\", \"meaning\": \"sắc lệnh hoàng gia\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"loyal\", \"note_vi\": \"loyal nghĩa là trung thành, royal nghĩa là thuộc hoàng gia\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"royalty\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"royally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-cori-9d644bbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-aru0-9d644bbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-aru5-9d644bbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-aru6-9d644bbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-aru10-9d644bbc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-aru9-9d644bbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-aru3-9d644bbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-aru7-9d644bbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-aru8-9d644bbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-aru2-9d644bbc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-ljspeech-9d644bbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-lt408-9d644bbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-lt138-9d644bbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-lt624-9d644bbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-lt396-9d644bbc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-lt498-9d644bbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-lt132-9d644bbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-lt288-9d644bbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-lt42-9d644bbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/royal-lt90-9d644bbc.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm royal (hoàng gia) với loyal (trung thành) vì chỉ khác nhau một chữ cái đầu.', 'travel', 1, 15),
('1db9cc51-adf2-56aa-b4a5-ec1573783438', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a21e4311-9885-53f6-b05a-7cb932ae0e48', 'b6ce0b86-21d5-50a2-9fb2-9c7739ac17c9', 'imply', '/ɪmˈplaɪ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Gợi ý hoặc ám chỉ điều gì đó mà không nói trực tiếp.', 'to express something in an indirect way without stating it clearly in words.', 'The report does not directly state the result but seems to imply a major failure.', 'Báo cáo không trực tiếp nêu rõ kết quả nhưng dường như ngụ ý một thất bại lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The report did not directly blame the staff but seemed to imply that errors were made.\", \"vi\": \"Bản báo cáo không trực tiếp đổ lỗi cho nhân viên nhưng dường như ám chỉ rằng đã có sai sót xảy ra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-ljspeech-8f6568c8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-cori-8f6568c8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/imply-f5be27ef.webp', '[\"suggest\", \"insinuate\"]', '[\"state\", \"declare\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strongly imply\", \"meaning\": \"ám chỉ mạnh mẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clearly imply\", \"meaning\": \"ám chỉ rõ ràng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"infer\", \"note_vi\": \"imply là người nói gợi ý, infer là người nghe suy luận ra.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"implication\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-cori-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-aru0-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-aru5-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-aru6-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-aru10-8f6568c8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-aru9-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-aru3-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-aru7-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-aru8-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-aru2-8f6568c8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-ljspeech-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-lt408-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-lt138-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-lt624-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-lt396-8f6568c8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-lt498-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-lt132-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-lt288-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-lt42-8f6568c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imply-lt90-8f6568c8.mp3\"]}}', 'cần phân biệt rõ với \'infer\' (suy luận) để tránh dùng sai trong bài đọc hiểu.', 'academic', 1, 16),
('511ca5f3-29c6-5247-af02-03dfc3a04eee', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a21e4311-9885-53f6-b05a-7cb932ae0e48', 'b6ce0b86-21d5-50a2-9fb2-9c7739ac17c9', 'cross your fingers', '/krɒs jɔː ˈfɪŋɡəz/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Cầu nguyện hoặc hy vọng điều tốt đẹp sẽ xảy ra.', 'to hope very much that something will happen or turn out successfully.', 'I\'m crossing my fingers that I get the job offer.', 'Tôi đang cầu mong mình sẽ nhận được lời mời làm việc đó.', '{\"en\": \"We are crossing our fingers that the client will accept our new contract offer.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đang cầu mong rằng khách hàng sẽ chấp nhận đề xuất hợp đồng mới của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-your-fingers-ljspeech-e927a5bf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-your-fingers-cori-e927a5bf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cross-your-fingers-46e4d744.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-your-fingers-cori-e927a5bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-your-fingers-aru0-e927a5bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-your-fingers-aru5-e927a5bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-your-fingers-aru6-e927a5bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-your-fingers-aru10-e927a5bf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-your-fingers-aru9-e927a5bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-your-fingers-aru3-e927a5bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-your-fingers-aru7-e927a5bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-your-fingers-aru8-e927a5bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-your-fingers-aru2-e927a5bf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cross-your-fingers-ljspeech-e927a5bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publi