('dfe3878b-2163-5dae-9d40-4da18c4b8cdb', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a21e4311-9885-53f6-b05a-7cb932ae0e48', 'b6ce0b86-21d5-50a2-9fb2-9c7739ac17c9', 'prophet', '/ˈprɒfɪt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Người được cho là có khả năng truyền đạt thông điệp từ thần linh hoặc dự đoán tương lai.', 'a person who is believed to have special powers to predict future events or share messages.', 'The ancient prophet foretold a time of great change for the kingdom.', 'Nhà tiên tri cổ đại đã báo trước một thời kỳ thay đổi lớn cho vương quốc.', '{\"en\": \"The historical document describes the leader as a visionary prophet who guided his people through crises.\", \"vi\": \"Tài liệu lịch sử mô tả vị lãnh đạo như một nhà tiên tri có tầm nhìn, người đã dẫn dắt dân tộc vượt qua khủng hoảng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-ljspeech-a5afbb5e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-cori-a5afbb5e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prophet-d30bd6eb.webp', '[\"seer\", \"oracle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"false prophet\", \"meaning\": \"kẻ tiên tri giả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"major prophet\", \"meaning\": \"nhà tiên tri lớn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"prophecy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-cori-a5afbb5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-aru0-a5afbb5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-aru5-a5afbb5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-aru6-a5afbb5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-aru10-a5afbb5e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-aru9-a5afbb5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-aru3-a5afbb5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-aru7-a5afbb5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-aru8-a5afbb5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-aru2-a5afbb5e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-ljspeech-a5afbb5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-lt408-a5afbb5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-lt138-a5afbb5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-lt624-a5afbb5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-lt396-a5afbb5e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-lt498-a5afbb5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-lt132-a5afbb5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-lt288-a5afbb5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-lt42-a5afbb5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophet-lt90-a5afbb5e.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang sắc thái tôn giáo hoặc văn học cổ điển.', 'academic', 1, 22),
('593feaaa-37d1-507d-a5f2-9563f9ca5e2e', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a21e4311-9885-53f6-b05a-7cb932ae0e48', 'b6ce0b86-21d5-50a2-9fb2-9c7739ac17c9', 'there', '/ðeə(r)/', 'A1', 'adverb', 'Tại một địa điểm, vị trí cụ thể nào đó.', 'in, at, or to that specific place or position away from the speaker.', 'Look! Your book is over there on the table.', 'Nhìn kìa! Cuốn sách của bạn ở đằng kia trên bàn.', '{\"en\": \"Please place the newly arrived office supplies over there near the storage room door.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đặt văn phòng phẩm mới giao ở đằng kia, gần cửa phòng kho.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-ljspeech-490528f3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-cori-490528f3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/there-3f89081b.webp', NULL, '[\"here\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"over there\", \"meaning\": \"ở đằng kia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"here and there\", \"meaning\": \"đó đây\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"their\", \"note_vi\": \"Their là tính từ sở hữu (của họ), đồng âm với there.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-cori-490528f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-aru0-490528f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-aru5-490528f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-aru6-490528f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-aru10-490528f3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-aru9-490528f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-aru3-490528f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-aru7-490528f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-aru8-490528f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-aru2-490528f3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-ljspeech-490528f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-lt408-490528f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-lt138-490528f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-lt624-490528f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-lt396-490528f3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-lt498-490528f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-lt132-490528f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-lt288-490528f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-lt42-490528f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-lt90-490528f3.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn cách viết giữa \'there\' (ở đó), \'their\' (của họ) và \'they\'re\' (họ là).', 'office', 1, 23),
('4ee7b915-e805-5e4f-b526-0c39646c984b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a21e4311-9885-53f6-b05a-7cb932ae0e48', 'b6ce0b86-21d5-50a2-9fb2-9c7739ac17c9', 'hardware', '/ˈhɑːdweə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Các bộ phận vật lý của máy tính hoặc hệ thống điện tử.', 'the physical parts of a computer system or electronic device.', 'Upgrading your computer\'s hardware can significantly improve its performance.', 'Nâng cấp phần cứng máy tính có thể cải thiện đáng kể hiệu suất của nó.', '{\"en\": \"The IT department will upgrade the computer hardware to support the new software.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận CNTT sẽ nâng cấp phần cứng máy tính để hỗ trợ phần mềm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardware-ljspeech-608cb271.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardware-cori-608cb271.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hardware-dced6fb7.webp', '[\"equipment\", \"machinery\"]', '[\"software\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"computer hardware\", \"meaning\": \"phần cứng máy tính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hardware store\", \"meaning\": \"cửa hàng ngũ kim (kim khí)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"software\", \"note_vi\": \"phần mềm, các chương trình chạy trên máy tính\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardware-cori-608cb271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardware-aru0-608cb271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardware-aru5-608cb271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardware-aru6-608cb271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardware-aru10-608cb271.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardware-aru9-608cb271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardware-aru3-608cb271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardware-aru7-608cb271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardware-aru8-608cb271.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardware-ar