('8c70660b-f15e-5d7b-9159-f9d3d59f40db', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a21e4311-9885-53f6-b05a-7cb932ae0e48', 'b6ce0b86-21d5-50a2-9fb2-9c7739ac17c9', 'rarely', '/ˈreəli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Không thường xuyên, hiếm khi xảy ra.', 'not often or almost never in any situation or period of time.', 'She rarely eats fast food; she prefers home-cooked meals.', 'Cô ấy hiếm khi ăn đồ ăn nhanh; cô ấy thích các bữa ăn tự nấu hơn.', '{\"en\": \"Our company executive rarely misses the monthly strategy planning sessions with department heads.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành công ty chúng tôi hiếm khi vắng mặt trong các buổi lập kế hoạch chiến lược hàng tháng với các trưởng bộ phận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-ljspeech-bc87c943.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-cori-bc87c943.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rarely-7ca90a73.webp', '[\"seldom\", \"infrequently\", \"hardly\"]', '[\"often\", \"frequently\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rarely see\", \"meaning\": \"hiếm khi thấy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rarely use\", \"meaning\": \"hiếm khi sử dụng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"barely\", \"note_vi\": \"Barely nghĩa là suýt soát hoặc vừa đủ; rarely nghĩa là hiếm khi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"rare\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rarity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-cori-bc87c943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-aru0-bc87c943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-aru5-bc87c943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-aru6-bc87c943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-aru10-bc87c943.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-aru9-bc87c943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-aru3-bc87c943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-aru7-bc87c943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-aru8-bc87c943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-aru2-bc87c943.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-ljspeech-bc87c943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-lt408-bc87c943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-lt138-bc87c943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-lt624-bc87c943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-lt396-bc87c943.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-lt498-bc87c943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-lt132-bc87c943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-lt288-bc87c943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-lt42-bc87c943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rarely-lt90-bc87c943.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi đứng đầu câu, rarely đòi hỏi đảo ngữ động từ.', 'daily', 1, 28),
('4e22a977-b938-5487-b1bb-18830325bcdd', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a21e4311-9885-53f6-b05a-7cb932ae0e48', 'b6ce0b86-21d5-50a2-9fb2-9c7739ac17c9', 'tickle', '/ˈtɪkl/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác buồn cười khi bị cù.', 'a feeling of being touched lightly that makes you want to laugh or scratch.', 'She couldn\'t stop giggling from the tickle on her feet.', 'Cô ấy không thể ngừng cười khúc khích vì cảm giác buồn ở chân.', '{\"en\": \"The wool scarf left an annoying tickle on the customer\'s neck, so she returned it.\", \"vi\": \"Chiếc khăn len để lại cảm giác ngứa ngáy khó chịu trên cổ khách hàng, nên cô ấy đã trả lại nó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-ljspeech-61ecb633.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-cori-61ecb633.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tickle-779d1a02.webp', '[\"itch\", \"tingle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a tickle in the throat\", \"meaning\": \"cảm giác ngứa ở cổ họng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"itch\", \"note_vi\": \"itch là cảm giác ngứa ngáy muốn gãi, tickle là cảm giác nhột buồn cười\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"tickle\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"ticklish\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-cori-61ecb633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-aru0-61ecb633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-aru5-61ecb633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-aru6-61ecb633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-aru10-61ecb633.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-aru9-61ecb633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-aru3-61ecb633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-aru7-61ecb633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-aru8-61ecb633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-aru2-61ecb633.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-ljspeech-61ecb633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-lt408-61ecb633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-lt138-61ecb633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-lt624-61ecb633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-lt396-61ecb633.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-lt498-61ecb633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-lt132-61ecb633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-lt288-61ecb633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-lt42-61ecb633.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tickle-lt90-61ecb633.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'a tickle in one\'s throat\' rất hay dùng khi nói về triệu chứng sắp ho.', 'health', 1, 29),
('6712cb63-c022-5ccf-a1b6-1eb9ab305f3f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'a52ff7c4-af0f-54c0-a6f3-7592e28420a5', '0ba0c2cc-94a6-56e4-a267-d7646ebbc5b1', 'request', '/rɪˈkwest/', 'B1', 'verb', 'đề nghị hoặc yêu cầu ai đó làm gì một cách lịch sự.', 'to ask for something in a formal or polite way from someone else.', 'The hotel guest requested an extra pillow for her room.', 'Vị khách sạn đã yêu cầu thêm một chiếc gối cho phòng của cô ấy.', '{\"en\": \"Please request a meeting with the department head to discuss the new project timeline.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng yêu cầu một cuộc họp với trưởng bộ phận để thảo luận về tiến độ dự án mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/request-ljspeech-088e29b0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/request-cori-088e29b0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/request-1aa45eb7.webp', '[\"ask\", \"solicit\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"request information\", \"meaning\": \"yêu cầu thông tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"submit a request\", \"meaning\": \"gửi một yêu cầu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"require\", \"note_vi\": \"require là bắt buộc, request là đề nghị lịch sự.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"request\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/request-cori-088e29b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/request-aru0-088e29b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/request-aru5-088e29b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/request-aru6-088e29b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/request-aru10-088e29b0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/request-aru9-088e29b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/request-aru3-088e29b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/request-aru7-088e29b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/request-aru8-088e29b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/request-aru2-088e29