('57d8251a-4718-56b2-a6e7-dd91b0ae2ca2', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'aed4f2b4-bb6c-5d9d-8eac-96374a106120', 'c12a3157-d087-56e1-93f9-1d45c6aa41b0', 'ineffective', '/ˌɪnɪˈfektɪv/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không hiệu quả, không đạt được kết quả mong muốn.', 'not producing the result that you want or intended to achieve.', 'The old method proved to be ineffective for solving the complex problem.', 'Phương pháp cũ đã tỏ ra không hiệu quả trong việc giải quyết vấn đề phức tạp.', '{\"en\": \"The current advertising strategy is ineffective and needs a complete revision by management.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến lược quảng cáo hiện tại không hiệu quả và cần được ban quản lý sửa đổi hoàn toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-ljspeech-0b835482.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-cori-0b835482.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ineffective-99ab5f76.webp', '[\"useless\", \"futile\"]', '[\"effective\", \"productive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ineffective measure\", \"meaning\": \"biện pháp không hiệu quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ineffective communication\", \"meaning\": \"giao tiếp kém hiệu quả\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"effect\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"effectiveness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-cori-0b835482.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-aru0-0b835482.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-aru5-0b835482.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-aru6-0b835482.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-aru10-0b835482.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-aru9-0b835482.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-aru3-0b835482.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-aru7-0b835482.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-aru8-0b835482.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-aru2-0b835482.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-ljspeech-0b835482.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-lt408-0b835482.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-lt138-0b835482.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-lt624-0b835482.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-lt396-0b835482.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-lt498-0b835482.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-lt132-0b835482.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-lt288-0b835482.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-lt42-0b835482.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ineffective-lt90-0b835482.mp3\"]}}', 'Thêm tiền tố \'in-\' để tạo nghĩa phủ định.', 'business', 1, 4),
('808089d6-1ced-53f4-95d5-27ddbbb8e57b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'aed4f2b4-bb6c-5d9d-8eac-96374a106120', 'c12a3157-d087-56e1-93f9-1d45c6aa41b0', 'natural resources', '/ˈnætʃərəl rɪˈzɔːsɪz/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Các vật liệu và chất có sẵn trong tự nhiên, được con người sử dụng.', 'materials found in the environment that are valuable and used by people every day.', 'Protecting our planet\'s natural resources is crucial for future generations.', 'Bảo vệ tài nguyên thiên nhiên của hành tinh chúng ta là vô cùng quan trọng cho các thế hệ tương lai.', '{\"en\": \"The government is investing in renewable energy to protect our limited natural resources for future.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ đang đầu tư vào năng lượng tái tạo để bảo vệ các nguồn tài nguyên thiên nhiên hữu hạn cho tương lai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-resources-ljspeech-3f49c2c3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-resources-cori-3f49c2c3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/natural-resources-01403ac4.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"protect natural resources\", \"meaning\": \"bảo vệ tài nguyên thiên nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"manage natural resources\", \"meaning\": \"quản lý tài nguyên thiên nhiên\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-resources-cori-3f49c2c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-resources-aru0-3f49c2c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-resources-aru5-3f49c2c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-resources-aru6-3f49c2c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-resources-aru10-3f49c2c3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-resources-aru9-3f49c2c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-resources-aru3-3f49c2c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/natural-resources-aru7-3