('5bffe3b0-7330-5655-8611-18d902e93b8e', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'aed4f2b4-bb6c-5d9d-8eac-96374a106120', 'c12a3157-d087-56e1-93f9-1d45c6aa41b0', 'preposition', '/ˌprepəˈzɪʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Từ dùng để chỉ mối quan hệ giữa danh từ/đại từ với các từ khác trong câu.', 'a word used before a noun to show place, time, or direction.', 'In the sentence \"The book is on the table,\" \"on\" is a preposition.', 'Trong câu \"The book is on the table,\" \"on\" là một giới từ.', '{\"en\": \"The English trainer explained how to use the correct preposition in business emails.\", \"vi\": \"Giảng viên tiếng Anh đã giải thích cách sử dụng đúng giới từ trong email công việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preposition-ljspeech-e8b242ff.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preposition-cori-e8b242ff.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/preposition-f52cb6b3.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"prepositional phrase\", \"meaning\": \"cụm giới từ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"use a preposition\", \"meaning\": \"dùng một giới từ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"prepositional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preposition-cori-e8b242ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preposition-aru0-e8b242ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preposition-aru5-e8b242ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preposition-aru6-e8b242ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preposition-aru10-e8b242ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preposition-aru9-e8b242ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preposition-aru3-e8b242ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preposition-aru7-e8b242ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preposition-aru8-e8b242ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preposition-aru2-e8b242ff.mp3\"]}, \"