('9441cf11-6d38-521c-8d2c-40077388be5f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'aed4f2b4-bb6c-5d9d-8eac-96374a106120', 'c12a3157-d087-56e1-93f9-1d45c6aa41b0', 'energy', '/ˈenədʒi/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Khả năng làm việc, hoạt động hoặc tạo ra nhiệt.', 'the power from physical or chemical sources to provide light, heat, or work.', 'We need more renewable energy sources to protect the environment.', 'Chúng ta cần nhiều nguồn năng lượng tái tạo hơn để bảo vệ môi trường.', '{\"en\": \"Our company is investing in renewable energy to lower electricity costs for the office.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đang đầu tư vào năng lượng tái tạo để giảm chi phí điện cho văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-ljspeech-173d9168.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-cori-173d9168.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/energy-b5221343.webp', '[\"power\", \"vitality\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"solar energy\", \"meaning\": \"năng lượng mặt trời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"save energy\", \"meaning\": \"tiết kiệm năng lượng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"energetic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-cori-173d9168.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-aru0-173d9168.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-aru5-173d9168.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-aru6-173d9168.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-aru10-173d9168.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-aru9-173d9168.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-aru3-173d9168.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-aru7-173d9168.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-aru8-173d9168.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-aru2-173d9168.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-ljspeech-173d9168.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-lt408-173d9168.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-lt138-173d9168.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-lt624-173d9168.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-lt396-173d9168.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-lt498-173d9168.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-lt132-173d9168.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-lt288-173d9168.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-lt42-173d9168.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/energy-lt90-173d9168.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể chỉ năng lượng vật lý hoặc sức lực con người.', 'technology', 1, 16),
('d8904b0d-e25b-560d-8229-9b9a89f74e78', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'aed4f2b4-bb6c-5d9d-8eac-96374a106120', 'c12a3157-d087-56e1-93f9-1d45c6aa41b0', 'entrance', '/ˈentrəns/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Lối đi hoặc điểm mà qua đó người ta có thể đi vào một nơi.', 'a door, gate, or opening that allows people to enter a building or a room.', 'Visitors must present their security badges before passing through the building entrance.', 'Khách tham quan phải trình thẻ bảo vệ của họ trước khi đi qua lối vào tòa nhà.', '{\"en\": \"Please wait for the clients at the main entrance of the hotel lobby at ten o\'clock.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đợi khách hàng tại lối vào chính của sảnh khách sạn lúc mười giờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entrance-ljspeech-df33994d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entrance-cori-df33994d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/entrance-5fedb0a3.webp', '[\"entry\", \"access\"]', '[\"exit\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"main entrance\", \"meaning\": \"lối vào chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"front entrance\", \"meaning\": \"lối vào phía trước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"entry\", \"note_vi\": \"entry là hành động đi vào hoặc mục ghi chép, entrance là lối đi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"enter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entrance-cori-df33994d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entrance-aru0-df33994d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entrance-aru5-df33994d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entrance-aru6-df33994d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entrance-aru10-df33994d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entrance-aru9-df33994d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entrance-aru3-df33994d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entrance-aru7-df33994d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entrance-aru8-d