('bc8139ed-688a-54fc-96ea-e240eeb7f59b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'b5edeb8f-eb7a-5513-b7e5-2be916e93632', '535709c2-f727-5001-a551-61c3f08c8e47', 'carefully', '/ˈkeəfəli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Một cách cẩn trọng, chú ý để tránh sai sót hoặc nguy hiểm.', 'in a way that shows attention to detail to avoid mistakes or danger.', 'The technicians examined the delicate electronic components carefully before starting the repair process.', 'Các kỹ thuật viên đã kiểm tra cẩn thận các linh kiện điện tử tinh vi trước khi bắt đầu quá trình sửa chữa.', '{\"en\": \"Please read the terms of the contract carefully before signing it.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đọc kỹ các điều khoản của hợp đồng trước khi ký.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-ljspeech-00f74c9d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-cori-00f74c9d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/carefully-32236c67.webp', '[\"cautiously\", \"attentively\", \"meticulously\"]', '[\"carelessly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"read carefully\", \"meaning\": \"đọc kỹ lưỡng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"listen carefully\", \"meaning\": \"lắng nghe cẩn thận\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"careful\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"care\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"care\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-cori-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-aru0-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-aru5-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-aru6-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-aru10-00f74c9d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-aru9-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-aru3-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefully-aru7-00f74c9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/p