('5e74d3e2-b24f-5be2-bbab-338cd1f3f3fe', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'b5edeb8f-eb7a-5513-b7e5-2be916e93632', '535709c2-f727-5001-a551-61c3f08c8e47', 'nun', '/nʌn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một phụ nữ đã thề sống đời tu hành trong một cộng đồng tôn giáo.', 'a woman who has taken religious vows and lives in a convent.', 'The nun dedicated her life to helping the poor.', 'Nữ tu đã cống hiến cuộc đời mình để giúp đỡ người nghèo.', '{\"en\": \"The hospital was founded by a group of nuns to provide care for the community.\", \"vi\": \"Bệnh viện được thành lập bởi một nhóm nữ tu để cung cấp dịch vụ chăm sóc cho cộng đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-ljspeech-3de17696.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-cori-3de17696.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nun-020e18e4.webp', '[\"sister\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a religious nun\", \"meaning\": \"một nữ tu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"none\", \"note_vi\": \"None là không có gì, nun là nữ tu.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-cori-3de17696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-aru0-3de17696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-aru5-3de17696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-aru6-3de17696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-aru10-3de17696.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-aru9-3de17696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-aru3-3de17696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-aru7-3de17696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-aru8-3de17696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-aru2-3de17696.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-ljspeech-3de17696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-lt408-3de17696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-lt138-3de17696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-lt624-3de17696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-lt396-3de17696.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-lt498-3de17696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-lt132-3de17696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-lt288-3de17696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-lt42-3de17696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nun-lt90-3de17696.mp3\"]}}', 'Dễ nhầm với từ \'none\' về cách phát âm.', 'other', 1, 8),
('008b9404-ce70-5ab8-aa51-037df54f07d7', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'b5edeb8f-eb7a-5513-b7e5-2be916e93632', '535709c2-f727-5001-a551-61c3f08c8e47', 'turn', '/tɜːn/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Di chuyển để thay đổi hướng hoặc vị trí.', 'to move or rotate so as to change direction or position.', 'Drivers must turn right after passing the main entrance of the building.', 'Các tài xế phải rẽ phải sau khi đi qua cổng chính của tòa nhà.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse worker had to turn the forklift to avoid the stacked boxes.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân kho phải xoay xe nâng để tránh các thùng xếp chồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-ljspeech-b09c738b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-cori-b09c738b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/turn-341b4a05.webp', '[\"rotate\", \"spin\", \"twist\"]', '[\"continue\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"turn left\", \"meaning\": \"rẽ trái\"}, {\"phrase\": \"turn around\", \"meaning\": \"quay người lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"turn off\", \"meaning\": \"tắt (thiết bị)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"burn\", \"note_vi\": \"turn là xoay/hướng, burn là đốt cháy.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"turn\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"turning\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-cori-b09c738b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-aru0-b09c738b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-aru5-b09c738b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-aru6-b09c738b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-aru10-b09c738b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-aru9-b09c738b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-aru3-b09c738b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-aru7-b09c738b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-aru8-b09c738b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-aru2-b09c73