('88911a3a-a50a-53e9-85f7-11df834ed8ca', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'b5edeb8f-eb7a-5513-b7e5-2be916e93632', '535709c2-f727-5001-a551-61c3f08c8e47', 'promptly', 'UK: /ˈprɒmptli/ | US: /ˈprɑːmptli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'một cách nhanh chóng, ngay lập tức', 'with extreme speed and efficiency without any hesitation or delay in time', 'Please reply promptly to all customer emails.', 'Vui lòng trả lời nhanh chóng tất cả các email của khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"The staff meeting will start promptly at nine o\'clock tomorrow morning.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc họp nhân viên sẽ bắt đầu chính xác vào lúc chín giờ sáng mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-ljspeech-1beb1853.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-cori-1beb1853.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/promptly-6a8e45d6.webp', '[\"immediately\", \"instantly\", \"punctually\", \"without delay\"]', '[\"late\", \"tardily\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"arrive promptly\", \"meaning\": \"đến đúng giờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"respond promptly\", \"meaning\": \"phản hồi nhanh chóng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"prompt\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"promptness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-cori-1beb1853.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-aru0-1beb1853.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-aru5-1beb1853.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-aru6-1beb1853.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-aru10-1beb1853.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-aru9-1beb1853.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-aru3-1beb1853.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-aru7-1beb1853.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-aru8-1beb1853.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-aru2-1beb1853.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-ljspeech-1beb1853.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-lt408-1beb1853.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-lt138-1beb1853.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-lt624-1beb1853.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-lt396-1beb1853.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-lt498-1beb1853.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-lt132-1beb1853.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-lt288-1beb1853.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-lt42-1beb1853.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promptly-lt90-1beb1853.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đứng trước động từ (respond promptly) hoặc đi cùng thời gian cụ thể (at 9:00 AM promptly).', 'office', 1, 13),
('5033612a-529c-54d5-96be-a96d139d5ef6', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'b5edeb8f-eb7a-5513-b7e5-2be916e93632', '535709c2-f727-5001-a551-61c3f08c8e47', 'microphone', '/ˈmaɪkrəfəʊn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị dùng để thu âm thanh và khuếch đại.', 'a device that captures voice and makes it louder.', 'Please adjust your wireless microphone before beginning the conference presentation.', 'Vui lòng điều chỉnh chiếc mi-crô không dây của bạn trước khi bắt đầu bài thuyết trình tại hội nghị.', '{\"en\": \"The trainer used a microphone to address the large conference audience.\", \"vi\": \"Người hướng dẫn đã dùng microphone để nói trước đám đông hội nghị lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-ljspeech-17d39602.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-cori-17d39602.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/microphone-516efcf0.webp', '[\"mic\", \"mike\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wireless microphone\", \"meaning\": \"microphone không dây\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pass the microphone\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển microphone\"}, {\"phrase\": \"microphone stand\", \"meaning\": \"giá đỡ microphone\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"megaphone\", \"note_vi\": \"megaphone là loa cầm tay, phát âm to hơn microphone\"}, {\"word\": \"telephone\", \"note_vi\": \"telephone là điện thoại, khác thiết bị thu âm\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-cori-17d39602.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-aru0-17d39602.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-aru5-17d39602.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-aru6-17d39602.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-aru10-17d39602.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-aru9-17d39602.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-aru3-17d39602.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-aru7-17d39602.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-aru8-17d39602.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-aru2-17d39602.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-ljspeech-17d39602.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-lt408-17d39602.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-lt138-17d39602.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-lt624-17d39602.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-lt396-17d39602.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-lt498-17d39602.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-lt132-17d39602.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-lt288-17d39602.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-lt42-17d39602.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microphone-lt90-17d39602.mp3\"]}}', 'Microphone thường viết tắt là mic; nhầm với megaphone (loa) là sai.', 'office', 1, 14),
('c29688dd-4e42-54f8-ae76-dad583fa0b7b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'b5edeb8f-eb7a-5513-b7e5-2be916e93632', '535709c2-f727-5001-a551-61c3f08c8e47', 'monologue', '/ˈmɒnəlɒɡ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một đoạn thoại dài do một nhân vật nói một mình trên sân khấu hoặc trong phim.', 'a continuous speech given by a single speaker, especially during a theatrical performance.', 'The director asked the lead actress to rehearse her emotional monologue again.', 'Đạo diễn đã yêu cầu nữ diễn viên chính tập lại đoạn độc thoại giàu cảm xúc của cô ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The keynote speaker delivered a long monologue about the future of technology.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả chính đã trình bày một bài độc thoại dài về tương lai của công nghệ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-ljspeech-b68bc9aa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-cori-b68bc9aa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/monologue-4ab70c17.webp', '[\"soliloquy\", \"speech\", \"address\"]', '[\"dialogue\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dramatic monologue\", \"meaning\": \"độc thoại kịch tính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deliver a monologue\", \"meaning\": \"trình bày một bài độc thoại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dialogue\", \"note_vi\": \"dialogue là cuộc đối thoại giữa hai hay nhiều người.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-cori-b68bc9aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-aru0-b68bc9aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-aru5-b68bc9aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-aru6-b68bc9aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-aru10-b68bc9aa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-aru9-b68bc9aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-aru3-b68bc9aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-aru7-b68bc9aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-aru8-b68bc9aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-aru2-b68bc9aa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-ljspeech-b68bc9aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-lt408-b68bc9aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-lt138-b68bc9aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-lt624-b68bc9aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-lt396-b68bc9aa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-lt498-b68bc9aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-lt132-b68bc9aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-lt288-b68bc9aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-lt42-b68bc9aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monologue-lt90-b68bc9aa.mp3\"]}}', 'Mono- nghĩa là một, biểu thị hành động nói một mình (độc thoại).', 'media', 1, 15),
('dc516d04-52ef-536c-b14e-d60945826f24', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'b5edeb8f-eb7a-5513-b7e5-2be916e93632', '535709c2-f727-5001-a551-61c3f08c8e47', 'ocean', '/ˈəʊʃn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Vùng nước mặn rất lớn bao phủ phần lớn bề mặt Trái Đất.', 'a very large area of salt water that covers most of the surface of the earth.', 'We spent our vacation swimming in the vast blue ocean.', 'Chúng tôi đã dành kỳ nghỉ của mình để bơi lội trong đại dương xanh bao la.', '{\"en\": \"The new luxury resort offers rooms with a spectacular view of the Pacific Ocean.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng sang trọng mới cung cấp các phòng với tầm nhìn ngoạn mục ra Thái Bình Dương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ocean-ljspeech-721a45b6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ocean-cori-721a45b6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ocean-98eca03f.webp', '[\"sea\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ocean view\", \"meaning\": \"tầm nhìn ra đại dương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"across the ocean\", \"meaning\": \"bên kia đại dương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sea\", \"note_vi\": \"sea thường nhỏ hơn và có thể được bao quanh một phần bởi đất liền\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"oceanic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ocean-cori-721a45b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ocean-aru0-721a45b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ocean-aru5-721a45b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ocean-aru6-721a45b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ocean-aru10-721a45b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ocean-aru9-721a45b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ocean-aru3-721a45b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ocean-aru7-721a45b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ocean-aru8-721a45b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ocean-aru2-721a45b