('51d2de2b-aadf-5bc1-acb3-cbf4c2aa340a', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'b5edeb8f-eb7a-5513-b7e5-2be916e93632', '535709c2-f727-5001-a551-61c3f08c8e47', 'commit', '/kəˈmɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Hứa làm điều gì đó hoặc dành hết sức lực cho một việc.', 'to promise sincerely to give time and energy to a particular activity or plan.', 'She decided to commit herself to finishing the marathon, despite the pain.', 'Cô ấy quyết tâm hoàn thành cuộc chạy marathon, bất chấp cơn đau.', '{\"en\": \"Our team will commit all available resources to complete the construction project on time.\", \"vi\": \"Đội của chúng tôi sẽ dồn toàn bộ nguồn lực hiện có để hoàn thành dự án xây dựng đúng hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commit-ljspeech-4015b57a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commit-cori-4015b57a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/commit-2a3c10b7.webp', '[\"dedicate\", \"devote\", \"pledge\"]', '[\"neglect\", \"abandon\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"commit resources\", \"meaning\": \"dành nguồn lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"commit oneself to\", \"meaning\": \"cam kết làm gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"comment\", \"note_vi\": \"Khác nghĩa hoàn toàn, comment nghĩa là bình luận.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"commitment\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"committed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commit-cori-4015b57a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commit-aru0-4015b57a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commit-aru5-4015b57a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commit-aru6-4015b57a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commit-aru10-4015b57a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commit-aru9-4015b57a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commit-aru3-4015b57a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commit-aru7-4015b57a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obj