('569d10e0-6595-5a37-a72f-1f1a7f0ffca5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'b5edeb8f-eb7a-5513-b7e5-2be916e93632', '535709c2-f727-5001-a551-61c3f08c8e47', 'does', '/dʌz/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Thực hiện một hành động hoặc công việc nào đó.', 'performs an action, task, or activity in a general sense.', 'She always does her homework right after school.', 'Cô ấy luôn làm bài tập về nhà ngay sau khi tan trường.', '{\"en\": \"Our company regularly does business with several international suppliers across Asia.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi thường xuyên kinh doanh với một số nhà cung cấp quốc tế khắp châu Á.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-ljspeech-f0d521a5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-cori-f0d521a5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/does-0a4f638e.webp', '[\"performs\", \"executes\", \"carries out\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"does business\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện kinh doanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"does research\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện nghiên cứu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"make\", \"note_vi\": \"Do/does dùng cho công việc hay hành động chung, make dùng cho việc tạo ra sản phẩm mới.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"do\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"deed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-cori-f0d521a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-aru0-f0d521a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-aru5-f0d521a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-aru6-f0d521a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-aru10-f0d521a5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-aru9-f0d521a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-aru3-f0d521a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-aru7-f0d521a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-aru8-f0d521a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-aru2-f0d521a5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-ljspeech-f0d521a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-lt408-f0d521a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-lt138-f0d521a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-lt624-f0d521a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-lt396-f0d521a5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-lt498-f0d521a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-lt132-f0d521a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-lt288-f0d521a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-lt42-f0d521a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/does-lt90-f0d521a5.mp3\"]}}', 'Does là dạng chia ở ngôi thứ ba số ít hiện tại đơn của động từ do.', 'business', 1, 27),
('aa8986f8-b11e-5c78-ae67-84c7f20236a3', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'b5edeb8f-eb7a-5513-b7e5-2be916e93632', '535709c2-f727-5001-a551-61c3f08c8e47', 'qualified', 'UK: /ˈkwɒlɪfaɪd/ | US: /ˈkwɑːlɪfaɪd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'có năng lực, đủ tiêu chuẩn', 'Having finished the necessary training or having the required skills for a job.', 'She is highly qualified for the managerial position.', 'Cô ấy có năng lực cao cho vị trí quản lý.', '{\"en\": \"The HR department is looking for highly qualified candidates for the senior auditor position.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng nhân sự đang tìm kiếm các ứng viên có đủ năng lực cao cho vị trí kiểm toán viên cao cấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-ljspeech-9f04d6a7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-cori-9f04d6a7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/qualified-71893217.webp', '[\"eligible\", \"competent\", \"capable\", \"certified\"]', '[\"unqualified\", \"incompetent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"well qualified\", \"meaning\": \"có chuyên môn/năng lực cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"qualified for the role\", \"meaning\": \"đủ tiêu chuẩn cho vị trí\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"qualification\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"qualify\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-cori-9f04d6a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-aru0-9f04d6a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-aru5-9f04d6a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-aru6-9f04d6a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-aru10-9f04d6a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-aru9-9f04d6a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-aru3-9f04d6a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-aru7-9f04d6a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-aru8-9f04d6a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-aru2-9f04d6a7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-ljspeech-9f04d6a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-lt408-9f04d6a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-lt138-9f04d6a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-lt624-9f04d6a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-lt396-9f04d6a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-lt498-9f04d6a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-lt132-9f04d6a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-lt288-9f04d6a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-lt42-9f04d6a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/qualified-lt90-9f04d6a7.mp3\"]}}', 'Tính từ chỉ người có đủ năng lực/bằng cấp. Thường đi với giới từ \'for\' (qualified for the post) hoặc \'to\' (qualified to instruct).', 'recruitment', 1, 28),
('4bf83a7c-b3bf-54d8-887a-bb00f6911ce7', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'b5edeb8f-eb7a-5513-b7e5-2be916e93632', '535709c2-f727-5001-a551-61c3f08c8e47', 'plea', '/pliː/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Lời thỉnh cầu hoặc yêu cầu khẩn thiết.', 'a serious and emotional request for something to be done or given.', 'She made a heartfelt plea for donations to help the victims of the flood.', 'Cô ấy đã đưa ra một lời kêu gọi chân thành để quyên góp giúp đỡ các nạn nhân lũ lụt.', '{\"en\": \"The union made a final plea for better working conditions during the contract negotiations.\", \"vi\": \"Công đoàn đã đưa ra lời thỉnh cầu cuối cùng về điều kiện làm việc tốt hơn trong các cuộc đàm phán hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-ljspeech-9c5c4237.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-cori-9c5c4237.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/plea-b579663c.webp', '[\"appeal\", \"request\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make a plea\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra lời thỉnh cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"urgent plea\", \"meaning\": \"lời kêu gọi khẩn cấp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"plead\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-cori-9c5c4237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-aru0-9c5c4237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-aru5-9c5c4237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-aru6-9c5c4237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-aru10-9c5c4237.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-aru9-9c5c4237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-aru3-9c5c4237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-aru7-9c5c4237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-aru8-9c5c4237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-aru2-9c5c4237.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-ljspeech-9c5c4237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-lt408-9c5c4237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-lt138-9c5c4237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-lt624-9c5c4237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-lt396-9c5c4237.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-lt498-9c5c4237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-lt132-9c5c4237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-lt288-9c5c4237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-lt42-9c5c4237.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plea-lt90-9c5c4237.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh pháp lý hoặc kêu gọi từ thiện.', 'law', 1, 29)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('3bf469a9-97e6-5cb5-b2a3-9a232231baad', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'b6f85088-0fcf-51aa-ac51-a431d0882781', 'ca025e10-81c5-5cd7-abb3-a6de5dc9e2cd', 'webinar', '/ˈwɛbɪnɑː/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một buổi hội thảo hoặc bài thuyết trình được tổ chức trực tuyến qua internet.', 'a live online event where participants learn through presentations and discussion.', 'The company hosted a free webinar on effective business strategies.', 'Công ty đã tổ chức một hội thảo trực tuyến miễn phí về các chiến lược kinh doanh hiệu quả.', '{\"en\": \"Our department joined a webinar about time management hosted by external experts.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng ban chúng tôi đã tham gia một hội thảo trực tuyến về quản lý thời gian do chuyên gia bên ngoài tổ chức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-ljspeech-9656d2fe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-cori-9656d2fe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/webinar-ac114e45.webp', '[\"webcast\", \"online seminar\", \"virtual conference\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"attend a webinar\", \"meaning\": \"tham gia hội thảo trực tuyến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"host a webinar\", \"meaning\": \"tổ chức webinar\"}, {\"phrase\": \"live webinar\", \"meaning\": \"webinar trực tiếp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"seminar\", \"note_vi\": \"seminar là hội thảo trực tiếp, không qua internet như webinar.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-cori-9656d2fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-aru0-9656d2fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-aru5-9656d2fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-aru6-9656d2fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-aru10-9656d2fe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-aru9-9656d2fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-aru3-9656d2fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-aru7-9656d2fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-aru8-9656d2fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-aru2-9656d2fe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-ljspeech-9656d2fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-lt408-9656d2fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-lt138-9656d2fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-lt624-9656d2fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-lt396-9656d2fe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-lt498-9656d2fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-lt132-9656d2fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-lt288-9656d2fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-lt42-9656d2fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/webinar-lt90-9656d2fe.mp3\"]}}', 'Webinar = web + seminar; chỉ hội thảo online, không phải gặp mặt trực tiếp.', 'hr', 1, 0),
('41d41814-6a83-5b29-a502-b107b9c1347d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'b6f85088-0fcf-51aa-ac51-a431d0882781', 'ca025e10-81c5-5cd7-abb3-a6de5dc9e2cd', 'somewhat', '/ˈsʌm.wɒt/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Ở một mức độ nào đó, hơi hơi.', 'to a certain extent or degree, but not completely or very much.', 'I was somewhat surprised by her decision to quit her job so suddenly.', 'Tôi hơi ngạc nhiên trước quyết định nghỉ việc đột ngột của cô ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The client was somewhat satisfied with the initial proposal but requested several major changes later.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng khá hài lòng với đề xuất ban đầu nhưng sau đó đã yêu cầu một vài thay đổi lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-ljspeech-1899fd45.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-cori-1899fd45.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/somewhat-316ed83a.webp', '[\"slightly\", \"rather\"]', '[\"completely\", \"entirely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"somewhat surprised\", \"meaning\": \"hơi ngạc nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"somewhat difficult\", \"meaning\": \"hơi khó khăn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-cori-1899fd45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-aru0-1899fd45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-aru5-1899fd45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-aru6-1899fd45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-aru10-1899fd45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-aru9-1899fd45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-aru3-1899fd45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-aru7-1899fd45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-aru8-1899fd45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-aru2-1899fd45.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-ljspeech-1899fd45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-lt408-1899fd45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-lt138-1899fd45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-lt624-1899fd45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-lt396-1899fd45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-lt498-1899fd45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-lt132-1899fd45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-lt288-1899fd45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-lt42-1899fd45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/somewhat-lt90-1899fd45.mp3\"]}}', 'dùng để giảm nhẹ mức độ của tính từ hoặc trạng từ.', 'business', 1, 1),
('90a55cd4-862b-5ef4-b30b-1f9ce58cef38', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'b6f85088-0fcf-51aa-ac51-a431d0882781', 'ca025e10-81c5-5cd7-abb3-a6de5dc9e2cd', 'client', '/ˈklaɪənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người hoặc công ty mua dịch vụ từ một chuyên gia hoặc tổ chức.', 'a person or organization that pays for the professional services of another person.', 'The lawyer met with his client to discuss the details of the case.', 'Luật sư đã gặp khách hàng của mình để thảo luận chi tiết vụ án.', '{\"en\": \"Our marketing team is preparing a new presentation for a potential international client.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị của chúng tôi đang chuẩn bị bài thuyết trình cho một khách hàng quốc tế tiềm năng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-ljspeech-d2a04d71.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-cori-d2a04d71.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/client-fcdfdab8.webp', '[\"customer\", \"patron\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"loyal client\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng trung thành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"meet a client\", \"meaning\": \"gặp gỡ khách hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"customer\", \"note_vi\": \"Customer mua hàng hóa, client mua dịch vụ chuyên môn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-cori-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru0-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru5-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru6-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru10-d2a04d71.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru9-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru3-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru7-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru8-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-ar