('c03e325f-0de3-5f44-9750-71a39d8833d5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'ba1d26cd-4912-55cf-b82f-d24759945c39', '492e3130-16db-5fd3-8116-e0dcd23ad212', 'light pollution', '/laɪt pəˈluːʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự chiếu sáng quá mức hoặc không phù hợp, gây hại cho môi trường và sức khỏe.', 'too much artificial brightness in the night sky that makes it difficult to see stars.', 'In big cities, light pollution often makes it impossible to see the stars clearly.', 'Ở các thành phố lớn, ô nhiễm ánh sáng thường khiến người ta không thể nhìn rõ các vì sao.', '{\"en\": \"The city council is discussing ways to reduce light pollution around the new manufacturing plant.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng thành phố đang thảo luận các cách giảm ô nhiễm ánh sáng quanh nhà máy sản xuất mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-pollution-ljspeech-b12f06ef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-pollution-cori-b12f06ef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/light-pollution-9fc03e94.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"reduce light pollution\", \"meaning\": \"giảm ô nhiễm ánh sáng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cause light pollution\", \"meaning\": \"gây ô nhiễm ánh sáng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"pollute\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"polluted\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-pollution-cori-b12f06ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-pollution-aru0-b12f06ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-pollution-aru5-b12f06ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-pollution-aru6-b12f06ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-pollution-aru10-b12f06ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-pollution-aru9-b12f06ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/light-pollution-aru3-b12f06ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/