('7fe3ead8-f9c3-5bae-992a-722151a86f09', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'ba1d26cd-4912-55cf-b82f-d24759945c39', '492e3130-16db-5fd3-8116-e0dcd23ad212', 'rather', '/ˈrɑːðə(r)/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Khá là, tương đối, dùng để nhấn mạnh mức độ.', 'to a fairly large degree or extent; moderately.', 'The movie was rather good, much better than I expected.', 'Bộ phim khá hay, tốt hơn nhiều so với tôi mong đợi.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery of the office supplies was rather slow this month.\", \"vi\": \"Việc giao văn phòng phẩm tháng này khá là chậm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-ljspeech-7e8b7811.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-cori-7e8b7811.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rather-b5cdaeb1.webp', '[\"quite\", \"fairly\", \"somewhat\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"rather than\", \"meaning\": \"thay vì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"would rather\", \"meaning\": \"thích... hơn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"instead\", \"note_vi\": \"instead đứng cuối câu hoặc đi với of, còn rather than nối hai lựa chọn\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-cori-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru0-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru5-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru6-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru10-7e8b7811.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru9-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru3-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru7-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru8-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-aru2-7e8b7811.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rather-ljspeech-7e8b7811.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pr