('13f65a89-06bd-5392-95cf-da74dd599627', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'bd9b2c5f-69d4-50ce-bbfe-66cafacdebc7', '26681c80-2e9a-53b7-9343-ee21d8d4e339', 'fog', '/fɒɡ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hiện tượng khí quyển có nhiều hạt nước nhỏ li ti làm giảm tầm nhìn.', 'a cloud of tiny water drops near the ground that makes it difficult to see clearly.', 'Driving was difficult this morning because of the thick fog.', 'Sáng nay lái xe rất khó khăn vì sương mù dày đặc.', '{\"en\": \"Heavy fog caused a significant delay for all flights arriving at the international airport today.\", \"vi\": \"Sương mù dày đặc đã gây ra sự chậm trễ đáng kể cho tất cả các chuyến bay đến sân bay quốc tế hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fog-ljspeech-dfebbda7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fog-cori-dfebbda7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fog-43819bce.webp', '[\"mist\", \"haze\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"thick fog\", \"meaning\": \"sương mù dày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dense fog\", \"meaning\": \"sương mù đặc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"foggy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fog-cori-dfebbda7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fog-aru0-dfebbda7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fog-aru5-dfebbda7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fog-aru6-dfebbda7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fog-aru10-dfebbda7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fog-aru9-dfebbda7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fog-aru3-dfebbda7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fog-aru7-dfebbda7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fog-aru8-dfebbda7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fog-aru2-dfebbda7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fog-ljspeech-dfebbda7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obj