('34bef3f7-318d-578f-840e-7c9e0f447007', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'bd9b2c5f-69d4-50ce-bbfe-66cafacdebc7', '26681c80-2e9a-53b7-9343-ee21d8d4e339', 'urban', '/ˈɜːbən/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về hoặc liên quan đến thành phố, đô thị.', 'relating to a city or a densely populated area rather than the countryside.', 'Many people are moving to urban areas for better job opportunities.', 'Nhiều người đang chuyển đến các khu vực đô thị để có cơ hội việc làm tốt hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The company is planning to open new urban branches to attract more customers in the city.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đang có kế hoạch mở các chi nhánh mới ở đô thị để thu hút thêm khách hàng trong thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-ljspeech-ba7a82a9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-cori-ba7a82a9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/urban-22cdb0ae.webp', '[\"metropolitan\", \"city\"]', '[\"rural\", \"country\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"urban area\", \"meaning\": \"khu vực đô thị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"urban development\", \"meaning\": \"phát triển đô thị\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-cori-ba7a82a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-aru0-ba7a82a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-aru5-ba7a82a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-aru6-ba7a82a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-aru10-ba7a82a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-aru9-ba7a82a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-aru3-ba7a82a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-aru7-ba7a82a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-aru8-ba7a82a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-aru2-ba7a82a9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-ljspeech-ba7a82a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-lt408-ba7a82a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-lt138-ba7a82a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-lt624-ba7a82a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-lt396-ba7a82a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-lt498-ba7a82a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-lt132-ba7a82a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-lt288-ba7a82a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-lt42-ba7a82a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urban-lt90-ba7a82a9.mp3\"]}}', 'Trái nghĩa với \'rural\' (thuộc về nông thôn).', 'housing', 1, 24),
('173dc511-7d27-5e9e-b910-d7c3d4e3ef1f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'bd9b2c5f-69d4-50ce-bbfe-66cafacdebc7', '26681c80-2e9a-53b7-9343-ee21d8d4e339', 'relativity', '/ˌreləˈtɪvəti/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Trạng thái hoặc chất lượng của việc phụ thuộc vào một cái gì đó khác.', 'the state of being judged or measured in relation to something else, not absolute.', 'The relativity of beauty means that what one person finds attractive, another might not.', 'Tính tương đối của cái đẹp có nghĩa là điều mà một người thấy hấp dẫn, người khác có thể không.', '{\"en\": \"The relativity of the project timeline depends on the availability of the necessary raw materials.\", \"vi\": \"Tính tương đối của tiến độ dự án phụ thuộc vào sự sẵn có của các nguyên liệu thô cần thiết.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-ljspeech-79888a17.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-cori-79888a17.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/relativity-f4b69ba3.webp', '[\"dependence\", \"correlation\"]', '[\"absoluteness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in relativity to\", \"meaning\": \"tương đối với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"the relativity of\", \"meaning\": \"tính tương đối của\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"relative\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"relatively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-cori-79888a17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-aru0-79888a17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-aru5-79888a17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-aru6-79888a17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-aru10-79888a17.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-aru9-79888a17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-aru3-79888a17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-aru7-79888a17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-aru8-79888a17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-aru2-79888a17.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-ljspeech-79888a17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-lt408-79888a17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-lt138-79888a17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-lt624-79888a17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-lt396-79888a17.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-lt498-79888a17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-lt132-79888a17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-lt288-79888a17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-lt42-79888a17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relativity-lt90-79888a17.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang tính học thuật, ít dùng trong giao tiếp công sở thông thường.', 'academic', 1, 25),
('5392dbb6-3c78-5a4b-9fbc-4acaece83984', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'bd9b2c5f-69d4-50ce-bbfe-66cafacdebc7', '26681c80-2e9a-53b7-9343-ee21d8d4e339', 'lick', '/lɪk/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Dùng lưỡi chạm hoặc di chuyển trên bề mặt.', 'to move your tongue across the surface of something to taste, eat, or clean it.', 'The dog likes to lick its owner\'s hand.', 'Con chó thích liếm tay chủ của nó.', '{\"en\": \"The chef watched the customer lick the spoon, indicating that the new sauce was delicious.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu bếp quan sát khách hàng liếm thìa, cho thấy món sốt mới rất ngon.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lick-ljspeech-814395ca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lick-cori-814395ca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lick-2d8848a0.webp', '[\"lap\", \"taste\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"lick your lips\", \"meaning\": \"liếm môi (thèm ăn)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lick clean\", \"meaning\": \"liếm sạch\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"leak\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là rò rỉ, phát âm gần giống\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"lick\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lick-cori-814395ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lick-aru0-814395ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lick-aru5-814395ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lick-aru6-814395ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lick-aru10-814395ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lick-aru9-814395ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lick-aru3-814395ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lick-aru7-814395ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lick-aru8-814395ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lick-aru2-814395ca.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lick-ljspeech-814395ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pr