('60a9eb28-7965-59d8-a889-e40aa20638aa', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c01ec5ee-69a3-502a-b466-6ed7f1234fb0', '885970f6-016e-5a9e-86f7-d82641625b9e', 'in other words', '/ɪn ˈʌðə wɜːdz/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Diễn đạt lại điều gì đó một cách khác, thường là đơn giản hơn.', 'used to explain something more clearly or in a different way.', 'The project failed because of poor planning; in other words, we didn\'t think it through enough.', 'Dự án thất bại vì kế hoạch kém; nói cách khác, chúng tôi đã không suy nghĩ kỹ càng.', '{\"en\": \"The budget is completely empty; in other words, we cannot hire any new staff this year.\", \"vi\": \"Ngân sách đã hoàn toàn trống rỗng; nói cách khác, chúng ta không thể thuê thêm nhân viên mới trong năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-other-words-ljspeech-321d2aeb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-other-words-cori-321d2aeb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/in-other-words-a1938790.webp', '[\"namely\", \"that is to say\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-other-words-cori-321d2aeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-other-words-aru0-321d2aeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-other-words-aru5-321d2aeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-other-words-aru6-321d2aeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-other-words-aru10-321d2aeb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-other-words-aru9-321d2aeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-other-words-aru3-321d2aeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-other-words-aru7-321d2aeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-other-words-aru8-321d2aeb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-other-words-aru2-321d2aeb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciat