('eb50ca2d-e88a-5851-b1ee-dd24b0d30873', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c1b73016-4dae-5e68-ab83-91b80a244823', '28ce885f-2ea9-5294-b544-77806459cabd', 'courageous', '/kəˈreɪdʒəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Dũng cảm, không sợ hãi khi đối mặt với nguy hiểm hoặc khó khăn.', 'showing bravery when facing pain, danger, or difficult situations.', 'It was a courageous decision for her to leave her job and start her own business.', 'Đó là một quyết định dũng cảm khi cô ấy bỏ việc để tự kinh doanh.', '{\"en\": \"The manager made a courageous decision to restructure the department during the crisis.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã đưa ra quyết định dũng cảm khi tái cấu trúc bộ phận trong đợt khủng hoảng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courageous-ljspeech-273e1fcd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courageous-cori-273e1fcd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/courageous-3d822525.webp', '[\"brave\", \"valiant\", \"fearless\"]', '[\"cowardly\", \"fearful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"courageous decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định dũng cảm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"courageous effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực dũng cảm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"courage\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"courageously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courageous-cori-273e1fcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courageous-aru0-273e1fcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courageous-aru5-273e1fcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courageous-aru6-273e1fcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courageous-aru10-273e1fcd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courageous-aru9-273e1fcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courageous-aru3-273e1fcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courageous-aru7-273e1fcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/c