('b552b102-6ad8-5f2f-be49-f2d638d13ef7', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c1b73016-4dae-5e68-ab83-91b80a244823', '28ce885f-2ea9-5294-b544-77806459cabd', 'stressed', '/strest/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Căng thẳng, áp lực về tinh thần.', 'feeling very worried or nervous because you have too much work or too many problems.', 'She felt very stressed before her big presentation, but she managed to do well.', 'Cô ấy cảm thấy rất căng thẳng trước buổi thuyết trình lớn, nhưng cô ấy vẫn làm tốt.', '{\"en\": \"Many employees feel stressed when they have to meet tight deadlines at the end of the month.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều nhân viên cảm thấy căng thẳng khi phải chạy kịp các hạn chót gấp gáp vào cuối tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-ljspeech-8bba0d48.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-cori-8bba0d48.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stressed-dc4ece88.webp', '[\"anxious\", \"tense\", \"overwhelmed\"]', '[\"relaxed\", \"calm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel stressed\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy căng thẳng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get stressed\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên căng thẳng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stressful\", \"note_vi\": \"stressed chỉ cảm giác của người, stressful chỉ tính chất của sự việc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stress\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stressful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-cori-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-aru0-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-aru5-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-aru6-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-aru10-8bba0d48.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-aru9-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-aru3-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-aru7-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-aru8-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-aru2-8bba0d48.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-ljspeech-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-lt408-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-lt138-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-lt624-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-lt396-8bba0d48.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-lt498-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-lt132-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-lt288-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-lt42-8bba0d48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stressed-lt90-8bba0d48.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ quy tắc: người thì \'stressed\', vật/việc thì \'stressful\'.', 'hr', 1, 27),
('038edbc6-099b-5f58-af53-1f1599f50134', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c1b73016-4dae-5e68-ab83-91b80a244823', '28ce885f-2ea9-5294-b544-77806459cabd', 'monthly', '/ˈmʌnθli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Mỗi tháng một lần, theo định kỳ hàng tháng.', 'happening or produced once every four weeks or calculated for thirty days.', 'The club meets monthly to discuss new projects and ideas.', 'Câu lạc bộ họp hàng tháng để thảo luận các dự án và ý tưởng mới.', '{\"en\": \"The accounting department submits financial performance reports monthly to the board of executive directors.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng kế toán nộp các báo cáo hiệu quả tài chính hàng tháng cho hội đồng quản trị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-ljspeech-745d1918.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-cori-745d1918.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/monthly-6e015a58.webp', '[\"per month\", \"every month\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"meet monthly\", \"meaning\": \"họp hàng tháng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"billed monthly\", \"meaning\": \"tính phí hàng tháng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bimonthly\", \"note_vi\": \"Monthly là hàng tháng, bimonthly là hai tháng một lần.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"month\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"monthly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-cori-745d1918.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-aru0-745d1918.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-aru5-745d1918.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-aru6-745d1918.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-aru10-745d1918.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-aru9-745d1918.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-aru3-745d1918.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-aru7-745d1918.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-aru8-745d1918.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-aru2-745d1918.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-ljspeech-745d1918.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-lt408-745d1918.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-lt138-745d1918.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-lt624-745d1918.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-lt396-745d1918.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-lt498-745d1918.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-lt132-745d1918.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-lt288-745d1918.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-lt42-745d1918.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monthly-lt90-745d1918.mp3\"]}}', 'Monthly vừa là tính từ (hàng tháng) vừa là trạng từ (mỗi tháng một lần).', 'finance', 1, 28),
('969a0c0e-7c29-5dfa-b95c-a4ac83ceb237', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c1b73016-4dae-5e68-ab83-91b80a244823', '28ce885f-2ea9-5294-b544-77806459cabd', 'generous', '/ˈdʒenərəs/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'rộng lượng, hào phóng', 'willing to give money, help, or time freely to other people.', 'He is very generous with his time, always helping others.', 'Anh ấy rất rộng lượng về thời gian, luôn giúp đỡ người khác.', '{\"en\": \"The company offered a generous bonus to all employees after reaching their sales target.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã đưa ra một khoản thưởng hào phóng cho tất cả nhân viên sau khi đạt mục tiêu doanh số.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-ljspeech-feb97d0e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-cori-feb97d0e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/generous-91fa5163.webp', '[\"charitable\", \"bountiful\", \"giving\"]', '[\"stingy\", \"selfish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"generous offer\", \"meaning\": \"lời đề nghị hào phóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"generous donation\", \"meaning\": \"khoản quyên góp hào phóng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"general\", \"note_vi\": \"general nghĩa là chung chung, không liên quan đến hào phóng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"generosity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"generously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-cori-feb97d0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-aru0-feb97d0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-aru5-feb97d0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-aru6-feb97d0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-aru10-feb97d0e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-aru9-feb97d0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-aru3-feb97d0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-aru7-feb97d0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-aru8-feb97d0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-aru2-feb97d0e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-ljspeech-feb97d0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-lt408-feb97d0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-lt138-feb97d0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-lt624-feb97d0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-lt396-feb97d0e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-lt498-feb97d0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-lt132-feb97d0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-lt288-feb97d0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-lt42-feb97d0e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/generous-lt90-feb97d0e.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với general (chung chung), generous miêu tả tính cách hào phóng.', 'hr', 1, 29)
