('9a083ebc-0d69-572b-9e14-3eebec176604', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c1deb040-4d4d-56f3-8ebe-de60c9a76317', 'd4495266-3b84-542d-a9bc-5738d434f52d', 'impatient', '/ɪmˈpeɪʃənt/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không kiên nhẫn, dễ bực mình khi phải chờ đợi hoặc chậm trễ.', 'easily annoyed by waiting or wanting something to happen right away.', 'Bank customers became impatient due to the long delay at the service counter.', 'Khách hàng ngân hàng trở nên mất kiên nhẫn do sự chậm trễ kéo dài tại quầy phục vụ.', '{\"en\": \"Passengers became impatient when the flight was delayed without a clear explanation.\", \"vi\": \"Hành khách trở nên mất kiên nhẫn khi chuyến bay bị hoãn mà không có lời giải thích rõ ràng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-ljspeech-9ed7f130.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-cori-9ed7f130.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/impatient-39e18392.webp', '[\"restless\", \"eager\", \"intolerant\"]', '[\"patient\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"impatient with\", \"meaning\": \"mất kiên nhẫn với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"grow impatient\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên mất kiên nhẫn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"anxious\", \"note_vi\": \"anxious là lo âu, bồn chồn; impatient là thiếu kiên nhẫn do chờ đợi\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"impatiently\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"impatience\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"patient\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-cori-9ed7f130.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-aru0-9ed7f130.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-aru5-9ed7f130.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-aru6-9ed7f130.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-aru10-9ed7f130.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-aru9-9ed7f130.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-aru3-9ed7f130.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-aru7-9ed7f130.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-aru8-9ed7f130.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-aru2-9ed7f130.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-ljspeech-9ed7f130.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-lt408-9ed7f130.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-lt138-9ed7f130.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-lt624-9ed7f130.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-lt396-9ed7f130.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-lt498-9ed7f130.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-lt132-9ed7f130.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-lt288-9ed7f130.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-lt42-9ed7f130.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impatient-lt90-9ed7f130.mp3\"]}}', 'Đi kèm giới từ \'with\' (impatient with someone) hoặc \'to do something\' (impatient to do).', 'travel', 1, 18),
('7516f209-0919-5d9f-b7ed-575f9a9e8d35', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c1deb040-4d4d-56f3-8ebe-de60c9a76317', 'd4495266-3b84-542d-a9bc-5738d434f52d', 'showroom', 'UK: /ˈʃəʊˌrum/ | US: /ˈʃoʊˌrum/', 'B1', 'noun', 'phòng trưng bày', 'A large area where products such as automobiles or furniture are displayed for sale.', 'The car showroom displayed the latest models.', 'Phòng trưng bày xe hơi trưng bày những mẫu mới nhất.', '{\"en\": \"Potential buyers are invited to visit our downtown showroom to inspect the new vehicle models.\", \"vi\": \"Các người mua tiềm năng được mời ghé thăm phòng trưng bày ở trung tâm thành phố để xem trực tiếp các mẫu xe mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/showroom-ljspeech-d31f2c8d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/showroom-cori-d31f2c8d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/showroom-c30d3065.webp', '[\"gallery\", \"display room\", \"exhibition space\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"car showroom\", \"meaning\": \"phòng trưng bày ô tô\"}, {\"phrase\": \"furniture showroom\", \"meaning\": \"phòng trưng bày nội thất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"visit the showroom\", \"meaning\": \"ghé thăm phòng trưng bày\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"storeroom\", \"note_vi\": \"Showroom là phòng trưng bày hàng hóa bán, còn storeroom là kho cất giữ đồ đạc.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/showroom-cori-d31f2c8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/showroom-aru0-d31f2c8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/showroom-aru5-d31f2c8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/showroom-aru6-d31f2c8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/showroom-aru10-d31f2c8d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/showroom-aru9-d31f2c8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/showroom-aru3-d31f2c8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/showroom-aru7-d31f2c8d.mp3\