('9ca40826-547e-5a67-8abc-3688d76a3edc', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c213262f-fa1f-51e9-b5b5-6e61d86ce222', '38e59c24-c2ae-507d-a625-8376e4936441', 'mystery', '/ˈmɪstri/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một điều không thể giải thích hoặc khó hiểu.', 'an event or matter that remains unexplained, strange, or unknown.', 'The old house was full of unsolved mysteries.', 'Ngôi nhà cũ chứa đầy những bí ẩn chưa được giải đáp.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden drop in sales remains a mystery that the marketing team must investigate.\", \"vi\": \"Sự sụt giảm doanh số đột ngột vẫn là một bí ẩn mà nhóm tiếp thị phải điều tra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-ljspeech-4dc232a0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-cori-4dc232a0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mystery-eb700d67.webp', '[\"puzzle\", \"enigma\"]', '[\"fact\", \"certainty\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"solve a mystery\", \"meaning\": \"giải quyết bí ẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remain a mystery\", \"meaning\": \"vẫn là một bí ẩn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mysterious\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-cori-4dc232a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru0-4dc232a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru5-4dc232a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru6-4dc232a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru10-4dc232a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru9-4dc232a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru3-4dc232a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru7-4dc232a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru8-4dc232a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-aru2-4dc232a0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystery-ljspeech-4dc23