('512be1f9-55b6-53d1-b637-42b0eadf1356', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c213262f-fa1f-51e9-b5b5-6e61d86ce222', '38e59c24-c2ae-507d-a625-8376e4936441', 'moon', '/muːn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Thiên thể tự nhiên quay quanh Trái Đất hoặc một hành tinh khác.', 'the round object that moves around the earth and shines at night.', 'We watched the full moon rise slowly above the horizon.', 'Chúng tôi đã ngắm nhìn vầng trăng tròn từ từ nhô lên trên đường chân trời.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel rooftop offers guests a clear view of the full moon every evening.\", \"vi\": \"Tầng mái của khách sạn cho phép khách hàng ngắm nhìn rõ mặt trăng tròn mỗi buổi tối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-ljspeech-46dcd4dd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-cori-46dcd4dd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/moon-1d494c77.webp', '[\"satellite\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"full moon\", \"meaning\": \"trăng tròn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"crescent moon\", \"meaning\": \"trăng khuyết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"moonlight\", \"meaning\": \"ánh trăng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"moonlight\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-cori-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru0-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru5-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru6-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru10-46dcd4dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru9-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru3-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru7-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru8-46dcd4dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-aru2-46dcd4dd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moon-ljspeech-46dc