('d8ec269b-4176-51bb-8ca3-67b42740800d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c5bb5589-8463-5320-91d1-04d03692e6d3', 'c2bcc89d-0fa0-5332-8df1-0419a9ae3041', 'impression', 'UK: /ɪmˈprɛʃən/ | US: /ɪmˈprɛʃən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'ấn tượng', 'An idea, feeling, or opinion about someone or something formed without conscious thought.', 'First impressions are very important in business.', 'Ấn tượng đầu tiên rất quan trọng trong kinh doanh.', '{\"en\": \"Dressing professionally for the job interview helps create a positive first impression.\", \"vi\": \"Ăn mặc chuyên nghiệp khi đi phỏng vấn xin việc giúp tạo ấn tượng ban đầu tích cực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-ljspeech-5c00aab5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-cori-5c00aab5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/impression-fcfa19de.webp', '[\"impact\", \"perception\", \"feeling\", \"notion\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"first impression\", \"meaning\": \"ấn tượng ban đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make an impression\", \"meaning\": \"tạo ấn tượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"under the impression\", \"meaning\": \"có cảm tưởng rằng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"expression\", \"note_vi\": \"sự biểu lộ, vẻ mặt, thành ngữ (khác impression là ấn tượng)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"impress\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"impressive\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"impressively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-cori-5c00aab5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-aru0-5c00aab5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-aru5-5c00aab5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-aru6-5c00aab5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-aru10-5c00aab5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-aru9-5c00aab5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-aru3-5c00aab5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-aru7-5c00aab5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-aru8-5c00aab5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-aru2-5c00aab5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-ljspeech-5c00aab5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-lt408-5c00aab5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-lt138-5c00aab5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-lt624-5c00aab5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-lt396-5c00aab5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-lt498-5c00aab5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-lt132-5c00aab5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-lt288-5c00aab5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-lt42-5c00aab5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impression-lt90-5c00aab5.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ phổ biến: \'make a good impression\' (tạo ấn tượng tốt) hoặc \'under the impression that\' (có cảm tưởng rằng).', 'personnel', 1, 14),
('290cb479-eec3-5bed-80f9-3f026f718ec8', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c5bb5589-8463-5320-91d1-04d03692e6d3', 'c2bcc89d-0fa0-5332-8df1-0419a9ae3041', 'factor', '/ˈfæktə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một trong những điều góp phần tạo nên một kết quả hoặc tình huống.', 'one of the things that affects a result or situation.', 'Cost remains a primary factor when clients choose between different service providers.', 'Chi phí vẫn là một yếu tố hàng đầu khi khách hàng lựa chọn giữa các nhà cung cấp dịch vụ khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The main factor in the delay was a shortage of raw materials.\", \"vi\": \"Yếu tố chính dẫn đến sự chậm trễ là thiếu hụt nguyên liệu thô.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-ljspeech-7a7bc449.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-cori-7a7bc449.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/factor-3633658c.webp', '[\"element\", \"component\", \"aspect\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"key factor\", \"meaning\": \"yếu tố then chốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"major factor\", \"meaning\": \"yếu tố chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"contributing factor\", \"meaning\": \"yếu tố góp phần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"feature\", \"note_vi\": \"feature là đặc điểm, không phải nguyên nhân góp phần\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-cori-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru0-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru5-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru6-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru10-7a7bc449.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru9-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru3-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru7-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/factor-aru8-7a7bc449.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob