('bcb24522-a02a-5d60-8f1e-9868de0042b3', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c61d76fe-2c58-5f23-b2b7-e0a9b5c9c080', 'a801876b-b621-50b9-aa88-593b5b4cde8f', 'promote', '/prəˈməʊt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Thúc đẩy, khuyến khích; thăng chức.', 'to encourage something to happen or raise someone to a higher position at work.', 'The company is looking for ways to promote teamwork among employees.', 'Công ty đang tìm cách để thúc đẩy tinh thần làm việc nhóm giữa các nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"The director decided to promote Marketing Assistant Sarah to manager after her successful campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc quyết định thăng chức cho Trợ lý Marketing Sarah lên làm quản lý sau chiến dịch thành công của cô.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-ljspeech-aa87dc4e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-cori-aa87dc4e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/promote-2ba39c0b.webp', '[\"advance\", \"encourage\", \"boost\"]', '[\"demote\", \"hinder\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"promote a product\", \"meaning\": \"quảng bá một sản phẩm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"promote growth\", \"meaning\": \"thúc đẩy sự tăng trưởng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"demote\", \"note_vi\": \"Demote nghĩa là giáng chức, trái ngược nghĩa hoàn toàn với promote.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"promotion\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"promotional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-cori-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru0-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru5-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru6-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru10-aa87dc4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru9-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru3-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru7-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru8-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-aru2-aa87dc4e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-ljspeech-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt408-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt138-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt624-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt396-aa87dc4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt498-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt132-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt288-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt42-aa87dc4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promote-lt90-aa87dc4e.mp3\"]}}', 'Promote có hai nghĩa chính trong TOEIC: thăng chức nhân viên và quảng bá sản phẩm.', 'hr', 1, 7),
('f0f22e9d-7c37-506b-8bca-0219ddc0bee6', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c61d76fe-2c58-5f23-b2b7-e0a9b5c9c080', 'a801876b-b621-50b9-aa88-593b5b4cde8f', 'mumble', '/ˈmʌmbl/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Nói lầm bầm, nói không rõ lời.', 'to speak quietly and in a way that is not clear or easy to understand.', 'He tends to mumble when he\'s nervous, making it hard to understand him.', 'Anh ấy có xu hướng lẩm bẩm khi lo lắng, khiến người khác khó hiểu anh ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The presenter was asked to speak clearly and not mumble during the client proposal.\", \"vi\": \"Người trình bày được yêu cầu nói rõ ràng và không lầm bầm trong buổi đề xuất với khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mumble-ljspeech-9a295ab2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mumble-cori-9a295ab2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mumble-41da3e40.webp', '[\"mutter\", \"whisper\"]', '[\"shout\", \"articulate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"mumble an apology\", \"meaning\": \"lầm bầm lời xin lỗi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mumble softly\", \"meaning\": \"nói lầm bầm khe khẽ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mutter\", \"note_vi\": \"mutter là thì thầm tỏ vẻ bực tức, mumble chỉ là nói không rõ tiếng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mumble\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mumble-cori-9a295ab2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mumble-aru0-9a295ab2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mumble-aru5-9a295ab2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mumble-aru6-9a295ab2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mumble-aru10-9a295ab2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mumble-aru9-9a295ab2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mumble-aru3-9a295ab2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mumble-aru7-9a295ab2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mumble-aru8-9a295ab2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obj