('dc225b18-1ce3-5bb3-b3a1-ed97110a1f0c', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c61d76fe-2c58-5f23-b2b7-e0a9b5c9c080', 'a801876b-b621-50b9-aa88-593b5b4cde8f', 'hopefulness', '/ˈhəʊpflnəs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cảm giác lạc quan, tin rằng điều tốt đẹp sẽ xảy ra.', 'the feeling that good things will happen and that a situation will get better soon.', 'Despite the challenges, her hopefulness inspired everyone around her.', 'Mặc dù có nhiều thử thách, sự lạc quan của cô ấy đã truyền cảm hứng cho mọi người xung quanh.', '{\"en\": \"The manager expressed hopefulness about the company\'s growth in the upcoming fiscal year.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý bày tỏ sự lạc quan về sự tăng trưởng của công ty trong năm tài chính tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopefulness-ljspeech-0202ac27.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopefulness-cori-0202ac27.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hopefulness-aba3b199.webp', '[\"optimism\", \"positivity\"]', '[\"pessimism\", \"despair\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sense of hopefulness\", \"meaning\": \"cảm giác lạc quan\"}, {\"phrase\": \"full of hopefulness\", \"meaning\": \"tràn đầy hy vọng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hope\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hopeful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopefulness-cori-0202ac27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopefulness-aru0-0202ac27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopefulness-aru5-0202ac27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopefulness-aru6-0202ac27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopefulness-aru10-0202ac27.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopefulness-aru9-0202ac27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopefulness-aru3-0202ac27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hopefulness-aru7-0202ac27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pu