('5eedc828-41ab-58f5-b002-a4d7885de5e9', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c61d76fe-2c58-5f23-b2b7-e0a9b5c9c080', 'a801876b-b621-50b9-aa88-593b5b4cde8f', 'league', 'UK: /liːɡ/ | US: /liɡ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'liên đoàn, giải đấu', 'an association of sports teams or individuals that compete against one another in scheduled matches', 'Our team joined the local basketball league.', 'Đội của chúng tôi đã tham gia giải đấu bóng rổ địa phương.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate soccer league matches will be held every Saturday afternoon at the sports complex.\", \"vi\": \"Các trận đấu của giải bóng đá doanh nghiệp sẽ được tổ chức vào mỗi chiều thứ Bảy tại khu phức hợp thể thao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-ljspeech-2df73064.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-cori-2df73064.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/league-3ab45eb1.webp', '[\"association\", \"federation\", \"alliance\", \"union\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sports league\", \"meaning\": \"giải đấu thể thao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in a league of one\'s own\", \"meaning\": \"ở một đẳng cấp riêng biệt\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-cori-2df73064.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-aru0-2df73064.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-aru5-2df73064.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-aru6-2df73064.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-aru10-2df73064.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-aru9-2df73064.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-aru3-2df73064.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-aru7-2df73064.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-aru8-2df73064.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-aru2-2df73064.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-ljspeech-2df73064.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-lt408-2df73064.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-lt138-2df73064.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-lt624-2df73064.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-lt396-2df73064.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-lt498-2df73064.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-lt132-2df73064.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-lt288-2df73064.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-lt42-2df73064.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/league-lt90-2df73064.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện trong bài đọc TOEIC về phong trào thể thao doanh nghiệp hoặc liên minh hiệp hội.', 'general', 1, 28),
('c95df36d-7048-5edd-be78-4ec8e3b73d19', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c61d76fe-2c58-5f23-b2b7-e0a9b5c9c080', 'a801876b-b621-50b9-aa88-593b5b4cde8f', 'inflexible', '/ɪnˈfleksəbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Cứng nhắc, không thể thay đổi hoặc uốn cong.', 'not able to change or be bent easily to suit new situations.', 'His inflexible attitude made it difficult for the team to adapt to new challenges.', 'Thái độ cứng nhắc của anh ấy khiến đội khó thích nghi với những thử thách mới.', '{\"en\": \"The manager\'s inflexible schedule prevented staff members from requesting flexible working hours.\", \"vi\": \"Lịch trình cứng nhắc của người quản lý đã ngăn cản nhân viên yêu cầu giờ làm việc linh hoạt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-ljspeech-93eabe62.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-cori-93eabe62.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inflexible-51a9220a.webp', '[\"rigid\", \"stiff\", \"unyielding\"]', '[\"flexible\", \"adaptable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"inflexible policy\", \"meaning\": \"chính sách cứng nhắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inflexible rule\", \"meaning\": \"quy định hà khắc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unflexible\", \"note_vi\": \"Tiếng Anh chuẩn không dùng unflexible, dùng inflexible.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"inflexibility\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"flexibility\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"flexible\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-cori-93eabe62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-aru0-93eabe62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-aru5-93eabe62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-aru6-93eabe62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-aru10-93eabe62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-aru9-93eabe62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-aru3-93eabe62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-aru7-93eabe62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-aru8-93eabe62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-aru2-93eabe62.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-ljspeech-93eabe62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-lt408-93eabe62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-lt138-93eabe62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-lt624-93eabe62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-lt396-93eabe62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-lt498-93eabe62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-lt132-93eabe62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-lt288-93eabe62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-lt42-93eabe62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflexible-lt90-93eabe62.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này chứa tiền tố in- nghĩa là không; dùng cho cả vật thể lẫn thái độ.', 'office', 1, 29),
('ff0da4c8-8fd7-5474-889d-01818fa1169a', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c6c16da3-9d91-52dc-84c6-154fca4a26af', '5f383099-cf3d-5681-97fa-859dd98dafff', 'digital', '/ˈdɪdʒɪtl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Liên quan đến công nghệ sử dụng tín hiệu điện tử hoặc mã nhị phân.', 'using or relating to computer technology and electronic signals to process information.', 'Many people prefer reading digital books on their tablets nowadays.', 'Ngày nay, nhiều người thích đọc sách kỹ thuật số trên máy tính bảng của họ.', '{\"en\": \"Our company decided to adopt new digital tools to increase office productivity this year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đã quyết định áp dụng các công cụ kỹ thuật số mới để tăng năng suất văn phòng trong năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-ljspeech-16b23c50.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-cori-16b23c50.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/digital-5e26b3ce.webp', '[\"electronic\", \"automated\"]', '[\"analog\", \"manual\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"digital marketing\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp thị kỹ thuật số\"}, {\"phrase\": \"digital signature\", \"meaning\": \"chữ ký số\"}, {\"phrase\": \"digital camera\", \"meaning\": \"máy ảnh kỹ thuật số\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"decimal\", \"note_vi\": \"decimal thuộc về thập phân, digital thuộc về kỹ thuật số.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"digitize\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"digit\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"digitally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-cori-16b23c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-aru0-16b23c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-aru5-16b23c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-aru6-16b23c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-aru10-16b23c50.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-aru9-16b23c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-aru3-16b23c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-aru7-16b23c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-aru8-16b23c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-aru2-16b23c50.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-ljspeech-16b23c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-lt408-16b23c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-lt138-16b23c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-lt624-16b23c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-lt396-16b23c50.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-lt498-16b23c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-lt132-16b23c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-lt288-16b23c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-lt42-16b23c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/digital-lt90-16b23c50.mp3\"]}}', 'Digital dùng để chỉ những gì thuộc công nghệ số, máy tính hoặc điện tử.', 'technology', 1, 0),
('cc765862-715d-54fb-865f-b8b4db8af79c', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c6c16da3-9d91-52dc-84c6-154fca4a26af', '5f383099-cf3d-5681-97fa-859dd98dafff', 'ache', '/eɪk/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Cảm thấy đau nhức liên tục, thường không quá dữ dội.', 'an ongoing, persistent physical soreness that affects a particular region of the body.', 'My head started to ache after working on the computer all day.', 'Đầu tôi bắt đầu đau nhức sau khi làm việc trên máy tính cả ngày.', '{\"en\": \"My back began to ache after sitting in this office chair for eight hours today.\", \"vi\": \"Lưng tôi bắt đầu đau nhức sau khi ngồi trên chiếc ghế văn phòng này suốt tám tiếng hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ache-ljspeech-f4d86d36.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ache-cori-f4d86d36.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ache-7c1d9323.webp', '[\"hurt\", \"throb\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"head ache\", \"meaning\": \"đau đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stomach ache\", \"meaning\": \"đau bụng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"itch\", \"note_vi\": \"itch là ngứa, ache là đau nhức âm ỉ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ache\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ache-cori-f4d86d36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ache-aru0-f4d86d36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ache-aru5-f4d86d36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ache-aru6-f4d86d36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ache-aru10-f4d86d36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ache-aru9-f4d86d36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ache-aru3-f4d86d36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ache-aru7-f4d86d36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ache-aru8-f4d86d36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ache-aru2-f4d86d36.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunci