('b7ec636c-7979-56cd-bb84-641b52f091b6', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c6c16da3-9d91-52dc-84c6-154fca4a26af', '5f383099-cf3d-5681-97fa-859dd98dafff', 'present', '/ˈprɛzənt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thời điểm đang diễn ra; hiện tại.', 'the period of time that is happening now, not the past or the future.', 'Let\'s focus on the present moment and enjoy our time together.', 'Hãy tập trung vào khoảnh khắc hiện tại và tận hưởng thời gian bên nhau.', '{\"en\": \"At present, the company is focusing on expanding its services to international markets.\", \"vi\": \"Hiện tại, công ty đang tập trung vào việc mở rộng dịch vụ sang các thị trường quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-ljspeech-50644481.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-cori-50644481.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/present-3dd5f7e7.webp', '[\"now\", \"currently\"]', '[\"past\", \"future\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"at present\", \"meaning\": \"hiện tại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in the present\", \"meaning\": \"trong thời điểm hiện tại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"present\", \"note_vi\": \"Present (danh từ) là hiện tại, (tính từ) là có mặt. (adj)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"presence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"presently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-cori-50644481.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-aru0-50644481.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-aru5-50644481.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-aru6-50644481.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-aru10-50644481.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-aru9-50644481.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-aru3-50644481.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-aru7-50644481.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-aru8-50644481.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-aru2-50644481.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-ljspeech-50644481.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-lt408-50644481.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-lt138-50644481.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-lt624-50644481.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-lt396-50644481.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-lt498-50644481.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-lt132-50644481.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-lt288-50644481.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-lt42-50644481.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/present-lt90-50644481.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'at present\' rất phổ biến trong email công việc.', 'office', 1, 9),
('43ff52df-a6a3-5998-b833-645508f8ce79', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c6c16da3-9d91-52dc-84c6-154fca4a26af', '5f383099-cf3d-5681-97fa-859dd98dafff', 'photography', '/fəˈtɒɡrəfi/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Nghệ thuật hoặc quá trình tạo ra hình ảnh bằng máy ảnh.', 'the activity of taking and processing pictures using a camera or digital device.', 'He developed a passion for photography during his travels.', 'Anh ấy đã phát triển niềm đam mê nhiếp ảnh trong những chuyến đi của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing department hired a professional for the product photography session next week.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng tiếp thị đã thuê một chuyên gia cho buổi chụp ảnh sản phẩm vào tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-ljspeech-9aa15b5b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-cori-9aa15b5b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/photography-b1a31d45.webp', '[\"imaging\", \"picture-taking\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"digital photography\", \"meaning\": \"nhiếp ảnh kỹ thuật số\"}, {\"phrase\": \"professional photography\", \"meaning\": \"nhiếp ảnh chuyên nghiệp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"photograph\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"photographer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-cori-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru0-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru5-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru6-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru10-9aa15b5b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru9-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru3-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru7-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru8