('e44b8bcc-63eb-50cb-95d5-44c1fadbf96d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c6c16da3-9d91-52dc-84c6-154fca4a26af', '5f383099-cf3d-5681-97fa-859dd98dafff', 'acute angle', '/əˈkjuːt ˈæŋɡl̩/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một góc có số đo nhỏ hơn 90 độ.', 'a geometric shape formed by two lines that measure less than ninety degrees.', 'A triangle with three acute angles is called an acute triangle.', 'Một tam giác có ba góc nhọn được gọi là tam giác nhọn.', '{\"en\": \"The architect designed the roof with an acute angle to prevent snow accumulation.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư đã thiết kế mái nhà với một góc nhọn để ngăn tuyết tích tụ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acute-angle-ljspeech-6b3e6a2d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acute-angle-cori-6b3e6a2d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/acute-angle-7cfde5a4.webp', NULL, '[\"obtuse angle\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"measure an acute angle\", \"meaning\": \"đo một góc nhọn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"obtuse angle\", \"note_vi\": \"obtuse angle là góc tù (lớn hơn 90 độ)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acute-angle-cori-6b3e6a2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acute-angle-aru0-6b3e6a2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acute-angle-aru5-6b3e6a2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acute-angle-aru6-6b3e6a2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acute-angle-aru10-6b3e6a2d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acute-angle-aru9-6b3e6a2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acute-angle-aru3-6b3e6a2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acute-angle-aru7-6b3e6a2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acute-angle-aru8-6b3e6a2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acute-angle-aru2-6b3e6a2d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acute-ang