('e74e3cd0-13e8-526b-b904-b5fc2f2d11e2', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'c6c16da3-9d91-52dc-84c6-154fca4a26af', '5f383099-cf3d-5681-97fa-859dd98dafff', 'skinny', '/ˈskɪni/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Gầy gò, mảnh khảnh.', 'very thin and often unattractively so; lean in build.', 'The stray cat was skinny and hungry, so we gave it some food.', 'Con mèo hoang gầy gò và đói, nên chúng tôi đã cho nó một ít thức ăn.', '{\"en\": \"The skinny intern looked tired after working late on the report.\", \"vi\": \"Thực tập sinh gầy gò trông mệt mỏi sau khi làm báo cáo muộn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-ljspeech-689b8c7e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-cori-689b8c7e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/skinny-3f6ec9ff.webp', '[\"thin\", \"lean\", \"scrawny\"]', '[\"fat\", \"plump\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"skinny jeans\", \"meaning\": \"quần bó sát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"skinny figure\", \"meaning\": \"dáng gầy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"skinny model\", \"meaning\": \"người mẫu gầy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"skin\", \"note_vi\": \"skin là da, skinny là gầy\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"skin\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"skinny\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-cori-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru0-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru5-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru6-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru10-689b8c7e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru9-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru3-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru7-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru8-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru2-689b8c7e.mp