('b27ba11e-cacd-5a27-8e71-327aa4ff7454', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'cd15d81d-d0cd-5432-a20a-4dacf135487c', '4b0c3d76-dd4a-57ce-a635-bf8149f82fce', 'motor', 'UK: /ˈməʊtər/ | US: /ˈmoʊtər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'động cơ', 'A machine that supplies power to impart motion to a vehicle or device.', 'The electric motor powers the fan efficiently.', 'Động cơ điện cấp năng lượng cho quạt một cách hiệu quả.', '{\"en\": \"Technicians inspected the electric motor of the conveyor belt before starting operations.\", \"vi\": \"Các kỹ thuật viên đã kiểm tra động cơ điện của băng tải trước khi bắt đầu vận hành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-ljspeech-32405e88.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-cori-32405e88.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/motor-612df222.webp', '[\"engine\", \"drive unit\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"electric motor\", \"meaning\": \"động cơ điện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"motor vehicle\", \"meaning\": \"xe cơ giới\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"engine\", \"note_vi\": \"động cơ (thường chạy bằng nhiên liệu đốt như xăng/dầu)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"motorized\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-cori-32405e88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-aru0-32405e88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-aru5-32405e88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-aru6-32405e88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-aru10-32405e88.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-aru9-32405e88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-aru3-32405e88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-aru7-32405e88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-aru8-32405e88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-aru2-32405e88.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-ljspeech-32405e88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-lt408-32405e88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-lt138-32405e88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-lt624-32405e88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-lt396-32405e88.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-lt498-32405e88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-lt132-32405e88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-lt288-32405e88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-lt42-32405e88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motor-lt90-32405e88.mp3\"]}}', '\'Motor\' là động cơ điện hoặc máy móc nhỏ; khác với \'engine\' thường là động cơ đốt trong (xăng, dầu).', 'manufacturing', 1, 17),
('8b0c8a73-6858-50d5-8484-ea4da72f1cbe', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'cd15d81d-d0cd-5432-a20a-4dacf135487c', '4b0c3d76-dd4a-57ce-a635-bf8149f82fce', 'myth', '/mɪθ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Câu chuyện cổ xưa, truyền thuyết giải thích về thế giới hoặc các vị thần.', 'an ancient traditional story about gods or historical events that explains natural phenomena.', 'Many cultures have a myth explaining how the world was created.', 'Nhiều nền văn hóa có một câu chuyện thần thoại giải thích về cách thế giới được tạo ra.', '{\"en\": \"It is a common myth that working longer hours always leads to higher business productivity.\", \"vi\": \"Có một quan niệm sai lầm phổ biến rằng làm việc nhiều giờ hơn luôn dẫn đến năng suất cao hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-ljspeech-b5941e5f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-cori-b5941e5f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/myth-b7dd7865.webp', '[\"legend\", \"fable\"]', '[\"fact\", \"truth\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"popular myth\", \"meaning\": \"quan niệm sai lầm phổ biến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"explode a myth\", \"meaning\": \"đập tan một lầm tưởng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"legend\", \"note_vi\": \"Legend là truyền thuyết về nhân vật có thật, myth là thần thoại/lầm tưởng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mythical\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mythology\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-cori-b5941e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-aru0-b5941e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-aru5-b5941e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-aru6-b5941e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-aru10-b5941e5f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-aru9-b5941e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-aru3-b5941e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-aru7-b5941e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-aru8-b5941e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-aru2-b5941e5f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-ljspeech-b5941e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-lt408-b5941e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-lt138-b5941e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-lt624-b5941e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-lt396-b5941e5f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-lt498-b5941e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-lt132-b5941e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-lt288-b5941e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-lt42-b5941e5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/myth-lt90-b5941e5f.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh doanh nghiệp, \'myth\' còn mang nghĩa là quan niệm sai lầm.', 'business', 1, 18),
('7e8bdbac-6681-546e-b710-c8afab366a0e', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'cd15d81d-d0cd-5432-a20a-4dacf135487c', '4b0c3d76-dd4a-57ce-a635-bf8149f82fce', 'avoid', '/əˈvɔɪd/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Tránh xa, né tránh một người, vật hoặc tình huống.', 'to stay away from something or someone unpleasant or harmful.', 'She tried to avoid eye contact with her boss after making a mistake.', 'Cô ấy cố gắng tránh giao tiếp bằng mắt với sếp sau khi mắc lỗi.', '{\"en\": \"We should avoid scheduling meetings during the lunch break to respect staff.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta nên tránh lên lịch họp trong giờ nghỉ trưa để tôn trọng nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-ljspeech-dec07345.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-cori-dec07345.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/avoid-9f6ae2e7.webp', '[\"evade\", \"dodge\"]', '[\"seek\", \"confront\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"avoid doing\", \"meaning\": \"tránh làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"avoid conflict\", \"meaning\": \"tránh xung đột\"}, {\"phrase\": \"avoid risk\", \"meaning\": \"tránh rủi ro\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"avert\", \"note_vi\": \"avert là ngăn chặn, avoid là tránh xa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"avoidance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"avoidable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-cori-dec07345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-aru0-dec07345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-aru5-dec07345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-aru6-dec07345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-aru10-dec07345.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-aru9-dec07345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-aru3-dec07345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-aru7-dec07345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-aru8-dec07345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-aru2-dec07345.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-ljspeech-dec07345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-lt408-dec07345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-lt138-dec07345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-lt624-dec07345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-lt396-dec07345.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-lt498-dec07345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-lt132-dec07345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-lt288-dec07345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-lt42-dec07345.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avoid-lt90-dec07345.mp3\"]}}', 'Sau avoid dùng V-ing, không dùng to-infinitive.', 'office', 1, 19),
