('448996de-561f-5aa0-bf9f-1d7411ad12fd', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'cd15d81d-d0cd-5432-a20a-4dacf135487c', '4b0c3d76-dd4a-57ce-a635-bf8149f82fce', 'useless', '/ˈjuːsləs/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Không có ích, không có giá trị hoặc không hiệu quả.', 'having no purpose or function and failing to achieve the desired result or effect.', 'Trying to fix the old computer was a useless effort; it was too broken.', 'Cố gắng sửa chiếc máy tính cũ là một nỗ lực vô ích; nó đã quá hỏng rồi.', '{\"en\": \"The new software is useless because it crashes every time we try to open it.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm mới thật vô dụng vì nó bị lỗi mỗi khi chúng tôi cố mở nó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useless-ljspeech-9384dbba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useless-cori-9384dbba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/useless-bbdb7eae.webp', '[\"ineffective\", \"futile\", \"worthless\"]', '[\"useful\", \"helpful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"useless information\", \"meaning\": \"thông tin vô ích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"useless item\", \"meaning\": \"vật vô dụng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"use\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"useful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useless-cori-9384dbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useless-aru0-9384dbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useless-aru5-9384dbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useless-aru6-9384dbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useless-aru10-9384dbba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useless-aru9-9384dbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useless-aru3-9384dbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useless-aru7-9384dbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useless-aru8-9384dbba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/useless-ar