('44425ef2-56a6-5078-aba3-93d25b5795ca', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'cd15d81d-d0cd-5432-a20a-4dacf135487c', '4b0c3d76-dd4a-57ce-a635-bf8149f82fce', 'terrified', '/ˈterɪfaɪd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất sợ hãi, hoảng loạn.', 'feeling very strong fear or panic about something or someone.', 'She was absolutely terrified of flying after her first bad experience.', 'Cô ấy hoàn toàn hoảng sợ khi đi máy bay sau trải nghiệm tồi tệ đầu tiên.', '{\"en\": \"The new employee was terrified of presenting the quarterly report to senior management.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên mới rất sợ hãi khi phải trình bày báo cáo quý cho ban lãnh đạo cấp cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-ljspeech-e8bce6ef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-cori-e8bce6ef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/terrified-aee38b03.webp', '[\"frightened\", \"petrified\", \"horrified\"]', '[\"calm\", \"fearless\", \"brave\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"terrified of\", \"meaning\": \"rất sợ điều gì đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"absolutely terrified\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn kinh hãi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"terrified look\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ mặt hoảng sợ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"terrifying\", \"note_vi\": \"terrifying mô tả thứ gây sợ hãi, terrified mô tả người đang cảm thấy sợ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"terrify\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"terror\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"terrifying\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"terrifyingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-cori-e8bce6ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-aru0-e8bce6ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-aru5-e8bce6ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-aru6-e8bce6ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-aru10-e8bce6ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-aru9-e8bce6ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-aru3-e8bce6ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-aru7-e8bce6ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-aru8-e8bce6ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-aru2-e8bce6ef.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-ljspeech-e8bce6ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-lt408-e8bce6ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-lt138-e8bce6ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-lt624-e8bce6ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-lt396-e8bce6ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-lt498-e8bce6ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-lt132-e8bce6ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-lt288-e8bce6ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-lt42-e8bce6ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrified-lt90-e8bce6ef.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt: terrified (người cảm thấy sợ) và terrifying (thứ gây ra nỗi sợ).', 'daily', 1, 26),
('515c51fe-3f5e-57a8-bd97-32f244c0def2', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'cd15d81d-d0cd-5432-a20a-4dacf135487c', '4b0c3d76-dd4a-57ce-a635-bf8149f82fce', 'fortunately', '/ˈfɔːtʃənətli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Do may mắn hoặc tình cờ tốt.', 'used to say that something good has happened, often when it was not expected.', 'Fortunately, the team managed to submit the quarterly sales report before the deadline.', 'May mắn thay, nhóm đã kịp nộp báo cáo doanh số hàng quý trước thời hạn.', '{\"en\": \"Fortunately, the shipment arrived at the warehouse just before the storm caused major transport delays.\", \"vi\": \"May mắn thay, lô hàng đã đến kho ngay trước khi cơn bão gây ra sự chậm trễ lớn trong vận chuyển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-ljspeech-7ef172de.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-cori-7ef172de.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fortunately-d073df1f.webp', '[\"luckily\", \"happily\"]', '[\"unfortunately\", \"regrettably\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fortunately for\", \"meaning\": \"thật may mắn cho\"}, {\"phrase\": \"quite fortunately\", \"meaning\": \"khá may mắn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fortune\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fortunate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-cori-7ef172de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-aru0-7ef172de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-aru5-7ef172de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-aru6-7ef172de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-aru10-7ef172de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-aru9-7ef172de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-aru3-7ef172de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunately-aru7-7ef172de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun