('b0dddf0a-b3f8-50fb-91ae-40eac86fe8f6', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'cd15d81d-d0cd-5432-a20a-4dacf135487c', '4b0c3d76-dd4a-57ce-a635-bf8149f82fce', 'artifact', '/ˈɑːtɪfækt/', '', 'noun', 'Một vật thể do con người tạo ra, thường có giá trị lịch sử.', 'an object made by a person, especially one of historical or cultural interest.', 'Archaeologists recently discovered a rare historical artifact during their excavation near the river.', 'Các nhà khảo cổ gần đây đã phát hiện một đồ tạo tác lịch sử hiếm có trong cuộc khai quật gần sông.', '{\"en\": \"The historical artifact was carefully packed for transport to the international exhibition center today.\", \"vi\": \"Cổ vật lịch sử đã được đóng gói cẩn thận để vận chuyển đến trung tâm triển lãm quốc tế hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-ljspeech-1e5dcbb5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-cori-1e5dcbb5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/artifact-e74e1abb.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-cori-1e5dcbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-aru0-1e5dcbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-aru5-1e5dcbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-aru6-1e5dcbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-aru10-1e5dcbb5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-aru9-1e5dcbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-aru3-1e5dcbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-aru7-1e5dcbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-aru8-1e5dcbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-aru2-1e5dcbb5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-ljspeech-1e5dcbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-lt408-1e5dcbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-lt138-1e5dcbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-lt624-1e5dcbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-lt396-1e5dcbb5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-lt498-1e5dcbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-lt132-1e5dcbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-lt288-1e5dcbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-lt42-1e5dcbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artifact-lt90-1e5dcbb5.mp3\"]}}', '', 'other', 1, 29),
('c3784c22-a096-5f22-91b3-ebad74a7542b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'd13d786f-6d39-5f65-8484-e341e633e7cd', 'd187bd9c-17c6-5b7c-831e-5a7d5531fd98', 'youthful', '/ˈjuːθfl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có vẻ ngoài hoặc đặc điểm của tuổi trẻ.', 'having the qualities that are typical of young people, such as energy and fresh appearance.', 'Her youthful energy and enthusiasm inspired everyone in the team.', 'Năng lượng và sự nhiệt tình trẻ trung của cô ấy đã truyền cảm hứng cho mọi người trong đội.', '{\"en\": \"The clothing brand is launching a new line designed to appeal to a more youthful demographic.\", \"vi\": \"Thương hiệu quần áo đang ra mắt một dòng sản phẩm mới được thiết kế để thu hút nhóm khách hàng trẻ trung hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-ljspeech-8c40013e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-cori-8c40013e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/youthful-d98a66ae.webp', '[\"young\", \"energetic\", \"fresh\"]', '[\"aged\", \"old\", \"elderly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"youthful appearance\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ ngoài trẻ trung\"}, {\"phrase\": \"youthful energy\", \"meaning\": \"năng lượng trẻ trung\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"young\", \"note_vi\": \"young là trẻ tuổi thật, youthful là có vẻ trẻ trung (dù có thể đã già)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"youth\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-cori-8c40013e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-aru0-8c40013e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-aru5-8c40013e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-aru6-8c40013e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-aru10-8c40013e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-aru9-8c40013e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-aru3-8c40013e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-aru7-8c40013e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-aru8-8c40013e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-aru2-8c40013e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-ljspeech-8c40013e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-lt408-8c40013e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-lt138-8c40013e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-lt624-8c40013e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-lt396-8c40013e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-lt498-8c40013e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-lt132-8c40013e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-lt288-8c40013e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-lt42-8c40013e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/youthful-lt90-8c40013e.mp3\"]}}', 'Mang nghĩa tích cực, khen ngợi sự trẻ trung, năng động.', 'marketing', 1, 0),
('3938a8ac-a114-50a7-ab8c-7d7360e9ac91', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'd13d786f-6d39-5f65-8484-e341e633e7cd', 'd187bd9c-17c6-5b7c-831e-5a7d5531fd98', 'respect', '/rɪˈspekt/', 'A2', 'verb', 'kính trọng, quý trọng ai đó hoặc điều gì', 'to admire someone or something deeply because of their abilities, qualities, or achievements.', 'You should always respect your elders and listen to their advice.', 'Bạn nên luôn tôn trọng người lớn tuổi và lắng nghe lời khuyên của họ.', '{\"en\": \"All employees are expected to respect corporate policies and deadlines strictly.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên được kỳ vọng tôn trọng nghiêm ngặt các quy định và thời hạn của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-ljspeech-14012cd1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-cori-14012cd1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/respect-7165bb72.webp', '[\"admire\", \"value\", \"honor\"]', '[\"disrespect\", \"scorn\", \"despise\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deeply respect\", \"meaning\": \"kính trọng sâu sắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"respect privacy\", \"meaning\": \"tôn trọng sự riêng tư\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"respectful\", \"note_vi\": \"Respectful là thể hiện sự tôn trọng; respectable là đáng kính.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"respect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"respectful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"respectable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"respective\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-cori-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru0-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru5-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru6-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru10-14012cd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru9-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru3-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru7-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru8-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-aru2-14012cd1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-ljspeech-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt408-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt138-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt624-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt396-14012cd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt498-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt132-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt288-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt42-14012cd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respect-lt90-14012cd1.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm giữa tính từ \'respectful\' (tôn trọng người khác) và \'respective\' (tương ứng).', 'office', 1, 1),
('2a3cb354-d373-5424-b3d0-9207f3e07303', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'd13d786f-6d39-5f65-8484-e341e633e7cd', 'd187bd9c-17c6-5b7c-831e-5a7d5531fd98', 'painkiller', '/peɪnˌkɪlə/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Loại thuốc dùng để làm giảm hoặc loại bỏ cơn đau.', 'A pharmaceutical substance formulated to alleviate or eliminate physical suffering.', 'The doctor prescribed a mild painkiller to manage the patient\'s post-surgery discomfort.', 'Bác sĩ đã kê một loại thuốc giảm đau nhẹ để kiểm soát sự khó chịu sau phẫu thuật của bệnh nhân.', '{\"en\": \"The doctor prescribed a strong painkiller to help the patient recover after surgery.\", \"vi\": \"Bác sĩ đã kê một loại thuốc giảm đau mạnh để giúp bệnh nhân hồi phục sau phẫu thuật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painkiller-ljspeech-811a2e4d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painkiller-cori-811a2e4d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/painkiller-0e25815a.webp', '[\"analgesic\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take a painkiller\", \"meaning\": \"uống thuốc giảm đau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strong painkiller\", \"meaning\": \"thuốc giảm đau liều mạnh\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painkiller-cori-811a2e4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painkiller-aru0-811a2e4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painkiller-aru5-811a2e4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painkiller-aru6-811a2e4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painkiller-aru10-811a2e4d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painkiller-aru9-811a2e4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painkiller-aru3-811a2e4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painkiller-aru7-811a2e4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painkiller-aru8-811a2e4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painkiller-aru2-811a2e4d.mp