('8850b816-2749-5a2a-bbe1-2f0224152166', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'd13d786f-6d39-5f65-8484-e341e633e7cd', 'd187bd9c-17c6-5b7c-831e-5a7d5531fd98', 'productive', '/prəˈdʌktɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Tạo ra nhiều kết quả tốt, có năng suất cao.', 'making or growing a large amount of useful things or results.', 'We had a very productive meeting and made significant progress on the project.', 'Chúng tôi đã có một cuộc họp rất hiệu quả và đạt được tiến bộ đáng kể trong dự án.', '{\"en\": \"To remain productive, employees are encouraged to take short breaks during the workday.\", \"vi\": \"Để duy trì năng suất, nhân viên được khuyến khích nghỉ giải lao ngắn trong ngày làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-ljspeech-f3f80621.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-cori-f3f80621.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/productive-7335048c.webp', '[\"fruitful\", \"efficient\", \"prolific\"]', '[\"unproductive\", \"unfruitful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly productive\", \"meaning\": \"năng suất cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"productive discussion\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc thảo luận hiệu quả\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"produce\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"production\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"productively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-cori-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru0-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru5-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru6-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru10-f3f80621.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru9-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru3-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru7-f3f806