('9522e381-a9c4-5659-8ec7-b8ebae4d3125', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'd60bddca-1289-5511-bbee-f91a540eb339', 'c03a5703-8788-5884-8325-324d5f44cac0', 'soften', '/ˈsɒfn/', 'B1', 'verb', 'làm cho cái gì đó trở nên mềm hơn', 'to make something less hard or firm than it was before.', 'You can soften the butter by leaving it out at room temperature.', 'Bạn có thể làm mềm bơ bằng cách để nó ở nhiệt độ phòng.', '{\"en\": \"The chef softened the vegetables before adding them to the sauce.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu bếp đã làm mềm rau củ trước khi cho vào nước sốt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-ljspeech-5937f600.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-cori-5937f600.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/soften-ad3a9bb1.webp', '[\"loosen\", \"ease\", \"mellow\"]', '[\"harden\", \"stiffen\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"soften butter\", \"meaning\": \"làm mềm bơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"soften the blow\", \"meaning\": \"giảm nhẹ tác động tiêu cực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"soften one\'s stance\", \"meaning\": \"làm dịu lập trường của ai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"smooth\", \"note_vi\": \"smooth nghĩa là làm phẳng bề mặt, không phải làm mềm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"soft\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"softly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"softness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-cori-5937f600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-aru0-5937f600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-aru5-5937f600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-aru6-5937f600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-aru10-5937f600.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-aru9-5937f600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-aru3-5937f600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-aru7-5937f600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-aru8-5937f600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-aru2-5937f600.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-ljspeech-5937f600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-lt408-5937f600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-lt138-5937f600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-lt624-5937f600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-lt396-5937f600.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-lt498-5937f600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-lt132-5937f600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-lt288-5937f600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-lt42-5937f600.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soften-lt90-5937f600.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm \'soften\' (làm mềm vật chất) với \'soften the blow\' (giảm nhẹ tác động tiêu cực).', 'dining', 1, 19),
('63a7da9e-0f74-5d8c-8c99-6b92fdd96403', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'd60bddca-1289-5511-bbee-f91a540eb339', 'c03a5703-8788-5884-8325-324d5f44cac0', 'trust', '/trʌst/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Niềm tin, sự tin cậy vào ai đó hoặc điều gì đó.', 'a strong belief that someone or something is honest, reliable, and effective.', 'Building trust is essential for any strong relationship.', 'Xây dựng lòng tin là điều cần thiết cho bất kỳ mối quan hệ bền chặt nào.', '{\"en\": \"Building mutual trust between management and employees helps improve overall office productivity.\", \"vi\": \"Xây dựng sự tin tưởng lẫn nhau giữa ban quản lý và nhân viên giúp nâng cao năng suất làm việc tổng thể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-ljspeech-fcbc333b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-cori-fcbc333b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trust-9deff589.webp', '[\"faith\", \"confidence\", \"reliance\"]', '[\"distrust\", \"suspicion\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"earn trust\", \"meaning\": \"giành được sự tin tưởng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mutual trust\", \"meaning\": \"sự tin tưởng lẫn nhau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"truth\", \"note_vi\": \"truth là sự thật, còn trust là niềm tin hoặc sự tin cậy.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"trustworthy\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"trustee\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-cori-fcbc333b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-aru0-fcbc333b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-aru5-fcbc333b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-aru6-fcbc333b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-aru10-fcbc333b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-aru9-fcbc333b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-aru3-fcbc333b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-aru7-fcbc333b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-aru8-fcbc333b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-aru2-fcbc333b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-ljspeech-fcbc333b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-lt408-fcbc333b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-lt138-fcbc333b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-lt624-fcbc333b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-lt396-fcbc333b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-lt498-fcbc333b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-lt132-fcbc333b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-lt288-fcbc333b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-lt42-fcbc333b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trust-lt90-fcbc333b.mp3\"]}}', 'Cần phân biệt danh từ trust (sự tin tưởng) và truth (sự thật).', 'business', 1, 20),
('cd07b3c1-cc7a-5d4a-9b6a-eceee06b6755', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'd60bddca-1289-5511-bbee-f91a540eb339', 'c03a5703-8788-5884-8325-324d5f44cac0', 'unintelligent', '/ˌʌnɪnˈtelɪdʒənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không thông minh, chậm hiểu.', 'not able to learn or understand things quickly; lacking mental ability.', 'Some people mistakenly believe that being quiet means you are unintelligent.', 'Một số người lầm tưởng rằng im lặng có nghĩa là bạn kém thông minh.', '{\"en\": \"It is unfair to label a candidate as unintelligent simply because they seem nervous during interviews.\", \"vi\": \"Thật không công bằng khi gán nhãn ứng viên là kém thông minh chỉ vì họ có vẻ lo lắng trong buổi phỏng vấn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-ljspeech-bc48fb1d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-cori-bc48fb1d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unintelligent-60454576.webp', '[\"slow\", \"dim\", \"obtuse\"]', '[\"intelligent\", \"smart\", \"bright\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"seem unintelligent\", \"meaning\": \"có vẻ kém thông minh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"considered unintelligent\", \"meaning\": \"bị coi là không thông minh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unintelligent response\", \"meaning\": \"câu trả lời thiếu suy nghĩ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unintelligible\", \"note_vi\": \"unintelligible nghĩa là không thể hiểu được (lời nói/chữ viết), khác với unintelligent.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intelligence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"intelligent\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"intelligently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-cori-bc48fb1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-aru0-bc48fb1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-aru5-bc48fb1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-aru6-bc48fb1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-aru10-bc48fb1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-aru9-bc48fb1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-aru3-bc48fb1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-aru7-bc48fb1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-aru8-bc48fb1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-aru2-bc48fb1d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-ljspeech-bc48fb1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-lt408-bc48fb1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-lt138-bc48fb1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-lt624-bc48fb1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-lt396-bc48fb1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-lt498-bc48fb1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-lt132-bc48fb1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-lt288-bc48fb1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-lt42-bc48fb1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintelligent-lt90-bc48fb1d.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm unintelligent (không thông minh) với unintelligible (không thể hiểu được).', 'hr', 1, 21),
('6fd11a3d-6441-51e8-93bb-26b241c6c4fb', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'd60bddca-1289-5511-bbee-f91a540eb339', 'c03a5703-8788-5884-8325-324d5f44cac0', 'multiple', '/ˈmʌltɪpl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Bao gồm nhiều hơn một, hoặc nhiều loại khác nhau.', 'involving or consisting of many different parts, people, or things.', 'The software platform allows users to manage multiple client accounts simultaneously from one dashboard.', 'Nền tảng phần mềm cho phép người dùng quản lý nhiều tài khoản khách hàng cùng lúc từ một bảng điều khiển.', '{\"en\": \"The manager rejected the proposal because it contained multiple errors in the budget section.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng đã bác bỏ bản đề xuất vì nó chứa nhiều lỗi trong phần ngân sách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multiple-ljspeech-88fc77e7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multiple-cori-88fc77e7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/multiple-2ce95604.webp', '[\"several\", \"various\", \"numerous\"]', '[\"single\", \"sole\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"multiple choices\", \"meaning\": \"nhiều sự lựa chọn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"multiple sources\", \"meaning\": \"nhiều nguồn khác nhau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"multiply\", \"note_vi\": \"multiply là động từ nhân lên, còn multiple là tính từ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"multiply\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"multiplicity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multiple-cori-88fc77e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multiple-aru0-88fc77e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multiple-aru5-88fc77e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multiple-aru6-88fc77e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multiple-aru10-88fc77e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multiple-aru9-88fc77e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/multiple-aru3-88fc77e7.mp3\", \"/stor