('dddd2e7d-0dcd-5acd-83bf-ce4190d3b828', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'd867f5a3-2127-525b-af01-dfff33b49dc4', 'bbdffcb9-fa73-5613-91a0-db7e68097635', 'probability', '/ˌprɒbəˈbɪləti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Khả năng một điều gì đó xảy ra.', 'the chance or likelihood that something will happen.', 'The financial analysts calculated a low probability of market decline this quarter.', 'Các nhà phân tích tài chính đã tính toán khả năng suy giảm thị trường trong quý này là rất thấp.', '{\"en\": \"The sales team calculated the probability of closing the deal before the end of the quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm bán hàng đã tính toán khả năng chốt hợp đồng trước khi kết thúc quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-ljspeech-a88397b6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-cori-a88397b6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/probability-75d40612.webp', '[\"likelihood\", \"chance\", \"possibility\"]', '[\"impossibility\", \"improbability\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"high probability\", \"meaning\": \"khả năng cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"probability of success\", \"meaning\": \"xác suất thành công\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in all probability\", \"meaning\": \"rất có thể, nhiều khả năng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"possibility\", \"note_vi\": \"possibility: điều có thể xảy ra; probability: mức độ khả năng xảy ra — probability mang tính đo lường hơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"probable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"probably\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"improbable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-cori-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru0-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru5-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru6-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru10-a88397b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru9-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru3-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru7-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru8-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-aru2-a88397b6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-ljspeech-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-lt408-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-lt138-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-lt624-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-lt396-a88397b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-lt498-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-lt132-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-lt288-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-lt42-a88397b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/probability-lt90-a88397b6.mp3\"]}}', 'In all probability (rất có thể) là cụm hay gặp trong văn bản kinh doanh và đề đọc TOEIC.', 'business', 1, 0),
('1ce8cf21-91b6-58e2-add3-3073da4fa4db', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'd867f5a3-2127-525b-af01-dfff33b49dc4', 'bbdffcb9-fa73-5613-91a0-db7e68097635', 'cramp', '/kræmp/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cơn co thắt cơ đột ngột, đau đớn.', 'a sudden severe pain in a muscle when it becomes narrow and tight.', 'The marathon runner experienced a severe muscle cramp during the final mile of the race.', 'Vận động viên chạy marathon đã bị chuột rút cơ nghiêm trọng trong dặm cuối cùng của cuộc đua.', '{\"en\": \"The company nurse treated a worker who suffered a muscle cramp during heavy lifting.\", \"vi\": \"Y tế công ty đã điều trị cho một công nhân bị chuột rút cơ khi nâng vật nặng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cramp-ljspeech-fb243d2d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cramp-cori-fb243d2d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cramp-c13fd849.webp', '[\"spasm\", \"stiffness\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"muscle cramp\", \"meaning\": \"chuột rút cơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stomach cramp\", \"meaning\": \"cơn co thắt dạ dày\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cramped\", \"note_vi\": \"cramped là tính từ mô tả không gian chật hẹp, tù túng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"cramp\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"cramped\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cramp-cori-fb243d2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cramp-aru0-fb243d2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cramp-aru5-fb243d2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cramp-aru6-fb243d2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cramp-aru10-fb243d2d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cramp-aru9-fb243d2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cramp-aru3-fb243d2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cramp-aru7-fb243d2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cramp-aru8-fb243d2d.mp3\", \"/storage/