('0066b78a-1119-5118-bd1b-0f27aeca0962', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'd867f5a3-2127-525b-af01-dfff33b49dc4', 'bbdffcb9-fa73-5613-91a0-db7e68097635', 'off and on', '/ɒf ən ɒn/', 'B2', 'phrase', 'Thỉnh thoảng, không liên tục.', 'happening sometimes but not regularly or continuously over a period of time.', 'It rained off and on all morning, so we couldn\'t go for a picnic.', 'Trời mưa lúc có lúc không suốt buổi sáng, nên chúng tôi không đi dã ngoại được.', '{\"en\": \"The internet connection in the conference room has been working off and on all morning.\", \"vi\": \"Kết nối internet trong phòng họp đã hoạt động chập chờn suốt cả buổi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-and-on-ljspeech-cb98dfae.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-and-on-cori-cb98dfae.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/off-and-on-38052c25.webp', '[\"intermittently\", \"occasionally\", \"sporadically\"]', '[\"continuously\", \"constantly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rain off and on\", \"meaning\": \"mưa ngắt quãng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work off and on\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc không liên tục\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-and-on-cori-cb98dfae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-and-on-aru0-cb98dfae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-and-on-aru5-cb98dfae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-and-on-aru6-cb98dfae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-and-on-aru10-cb98dfae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-and-on-aru9-cb98dfae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-and-on-aru3-cb98dfae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-and-on-aru7-cb98dfae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-and-on-aru8-cb98dfae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/off-and-on-aru2-cb98dfae.mp3\"]}, \"