('a5260764-9aed-55a8-8208-48e18b510619', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'd9fa20cb-1244-5fc7-bfc9-71b51255b0fb', '7b1c5b5d-d05e-5275-9e75-471f1b0b2e94', 'square', '/skweə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Hình có bốn cạnh bằng nhau và bốn góc vuông.', 'a flat shape with four equal sides and four right angles.', 'She drew a perfect square on the paper with a ruler.', 'Cô ấy đã vẽ một hình vuông hoàn hảo trên giấy bằng thước kẻ.', '{\"en\": \"The architect designed the office layout using a square floor plan.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư thiết kế bố cục văn phòng theo mặt bằng hình vuông.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-ljspeech-bfed89e8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-cori-bfed89e8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/square-933b0be4.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"perfect square\", \"meaning\": \"hình vuông hoàn hảo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"town square\", \"meaning\": \"quảng trường thị trấn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"square meter\", \"meaning\": \"mét vuông\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rectangle\", \"note_vi\": \"\'rectangle\' có bốn góc vuông nhưng các cạnh không bằng nhau, còn \'square\' thì bằng nhau\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"square\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"square\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-cori-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru0-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru5-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru6-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru10-bfed89e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru9-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru3-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru7-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/square-aru8-bfed89e8.mp3\", \"/sto