('5d383695-5607-535e-bb27-0480598f579f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'db768eab-416f-5f32-a822-dba0ea97e15a', 'd175cce1-ac5e-5098-a408-6476b9beb53d', 'pope', '/pəʊp/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người đứng đầu Giáo hội Công giáo La Mã.', 'the leader and head of the roman catholic church, chosen for life.', 'The Pope delivered his weekly address to a large crowd in St. Peter\'s Square.', 'Giáo hoàng đã đọc bài diễn văn hàng tuần của mình trước một đám đông lớn tại Quảng trường Thánh Phêrô.', '{\"en\": \"The conference centre was secured ahead of the Pope\'s scheduled visit next month.\", \"vi\": \"Trung tâm hội nghị được bảo vệ an ninh trước chuyến thăm theo kế hoạch của Giáo hoàng vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-ljspeech-b29488f0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-cori-b29488f0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pope-6942679d.webp', '[\"pontiff\", \"holy father\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"the Pope\'s address\", \"meaning\": \"bài phát biểu của Giáo hoàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"papal visit\", \"meaning\": \"chuyến thăm của Giáo hoàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"Pope Francis\", \"meaning\": \"Giáo hoàng Phanxicô\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pope\", \"note_vi\": \"bishop là giám mục cấp thấp hơn, pope là người đứng đầu tối cao\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"papal\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"papacy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-cori-b29488f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-aru0-b29488f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-aru5-b29488f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-aru6-b29488f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-aru10-b29488f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-aru9-b29488f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-aru3-b29488f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-aru7-b29488f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-aru8-b29488f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-aru2-b29488f0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-ljspeech-b29488f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-lt408-b29488f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-lt138-b29488f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-lt624-b29488f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-lt396-b29488f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-lt498-b29488f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-lt132-b29488f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-lt288-b29488f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-lt42-b29488f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pope-lt90-b29488f0.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết hoa \"Pope\" khi dùng như danh hiệu trước tên, ví dụ: Pope Francis.', 'other', 1, 0),
('76592930-9ec6-54f6-9d5a-9ef4329721c8', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'db768eab-416f-5f32-a822-dba0ea97e15a', 'd175cce1-ac5e-5098-a408-6476b9beb53d', 'serve', 'UK: /sɜːv/ | US: /sɜːrv/', 'A2', 'verb', 'phục vụ', 'To provide food, drinks, or hospitality to guests or patrons at a table or venue.', 'Dinner will be served at 7 PM.', 'Bữa tối sẽ được phục vụ lúc 7 giờ tối.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel cafeteria will serve breakfast until 10:00 AM for all conference attendees.\", \"vi\": \"Quán ăn tự phục vụ của khách sạn sẽ phục vụ bữa sáng cho đến 10:00 sáng cho tất cả người tham dự hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-ljspeech-b88fb872.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-cori-b88fb872.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/serve-5540c86d.webp', '[\"cater\", \"provide\", \"assist\", \"attend\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"serve as\", \"meaning\": \"đóng vai trò là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"first-come, first-served\", \"meaning\": \"đến trước phục vụ trước\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"service\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"server\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-cori-b88fb872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-aru0-b88fb872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-aru5-b88fb872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-aru6-b88fb872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-aru10-b88fb872.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-aru9-b88fb872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-aru3-b88fb872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-aru7-b88fb872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-aru8-b88fb872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-aru2-b88fb872.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-ljspeech-b88fb872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-lt408-b88fb872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-lt138-b88fb872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-lt624-b88fb872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-lt396-b88fb872.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-lt498-b88fb872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-lt132-b88fb872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-lt288-b88fb872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-lt42-b88fb872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/serve-lt90-b88fb872.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa phục vụ đồ ăn trong nhà hàng, \'serve\' còn mang nghĩa đảm nhiệm vị trí/vai trò (e.g., serve as director).', 'dining', 1, 1),
('38a4f1b3-b14c-538b-9986-c223a5278237', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'db768eab-416f-5f32-a822-dba0ea97e15a', 'd175cce1-ac5e-5098-a408-6476b9beb53d', 'sit', '/sɪt/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Đặt cơ thể ở tư thế thẳng đứng, dựa trên mông.', 'to rest your weight on your bottom instead of standing.', 'Visitors may sit in the waiting lounge until the hiring manager calls them.', 'Khách ghé thăm có thể ngồi ở phòng chờ cho đến khi quản lý tuyển dụng gọi họ.', '{\"en\": \"Please sit at the reception desk until the manager is ready to see you.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng ngồi ở bàn lễ tân cho đến khi người quản lý sẵn sàng gặp bạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-ljspeech-abdcde66.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-cori-abdcde66.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sit-4f788b3d.webp', '[\"perch\", \"rest\"]', '[\"stand\", \"rise\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sit at a desk\", \"meaning\": \"ngồi tại bàn làm việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sit in a chair\", \"meaning\": \"ngồi trên ghế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"seat\", \"note_vi\": \"seat là danh từ chỗ ngồi hoặc ngoại động từ đặt ai ngồi xuống\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"seat\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sitting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-cori-abdcde66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-aru0-abdcde66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-aru5-abdcde66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-aru6-abdcde66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-aru10-abdcde66.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-aru9-abdcde66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-aru3-abdcde66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-aru7-abdcde66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-aru8-abdcde66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-aru2-abdcde66.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-ljspeech-abdcde66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-lt408-abdcde66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-lt138-abdcde66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-lt624-abdcde66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-lt396-abdcde66.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-lt498-abdcde66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-lt132-abdcde66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-lt288-abdcde66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-lt42-abdcde66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sit-lt90-abdcde66.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt sit (tự ngồi, nội động từ) và seat (xếp chỗ cho ai, ngoại động từ).', 'office', 1, 2),
('31cd1e2c-76fe-5d17-8e92-7675c3cce3b0', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'db768eab-416f-5f32-a822-dba0ea97e15a', 'd175cce1-ac5e-5098-a408-6476b9beb53d', 'extension', '/ɪkˈstenʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc kết quả của việc mở rộng, kéo dài.', 'the act of making something longer in time or size, or an added part.', 'The company announced an extension of the deadline for project submissions.', 'Công ty đã thông báo gia hạn thời hạn nộp dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The client requested a two-week extension on the contract signing deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng yêu cầu gia hạn thêm hai tuần cho thời hạn ký hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-ljspeech-f9896101.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-cori-f9896101.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extension-469cf64b.webp', '[\"prolongation\", \"expansion\", \"addition\"]', '[\"reduction\", \"shortening\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deadline extension\", \"meaning\": \"gia hạn thời hạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"file extension\", \"meaning\": \"phần mở rộng tệp tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extension of contract\", \"meaning\": \"gia hạn hợp đồng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"expansion\", \"note_vi\": \"expansion nhấn mạnh mở rộng quy mô, extension nhấn mạnh kéo dài thêm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"extend\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"extensive\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"extensively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-cori-f9896101.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-aru0-f9896101.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-aru5-f9896101.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-aru6-f9896101.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-aru10-f9896101.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-aru9-f9896101.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-aru3-f9896101.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-aru7-f9896101.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-aru8-f9896101.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-aru2-f9896101.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-ljspeech-f9896101.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-lt408-f9896101.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-lt138-f9896101.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-lt624-f9896101.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-lt396-f9896101.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-lt498-f9896101.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-lt132-f9896101.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-lt288-f9896101.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-lt42-f9896101.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extension-lt90-f9896101.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, extension thường gặp với deadline hoặc số điện thoại nội bộ (phone extension).', 'office', 1, 3),
('a87b49b8-2943-512f-b254-288d9ede8f8a', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'db768eab-416f-5f32-a822-dba0ea97e15a', 'd175cce1-ac5e-5098-a408-6476b9beb53d', 'communicate', '/kəˈmjuːnɪkeɪt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Trao đổi thông tin, ý kiến với người khác.', 'To exchange information, news, or thoughts with others through speech, writing, or signals.', 'It\'s important to communicate clearly with your team members.', 'Điều quan trọng là phải giao tiếp rõ ràng với các thành viên trong nhóm của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"Team leaders must communicate project updates to stakeholders every week.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng nhóm phải truyền đạt cập nhật dự án cho các bên liên quan mỗi tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-ljspeech-4ab2558b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-cori-4ab2558b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/communicate-403fe572.webp', '[\"convey\", \"transmit\", \"express\"]', '[\"withhold\", \"conceal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"communicate clearly\", \"meaning\": \"giao tiếp rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"communicate effectively\", \"meaning\": \"giao tiếp hiệu quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"communicate with\", \"meaning\": \"giao tiếp với\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"communicative\", \"note_vi\": \"communicate động từ, communicative tính từ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"communication\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"communicative\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"communicatively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-cori-4ab2558b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-aru0-4ab2558b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-aru5-4ab2558b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-aru6-4ab2558b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-aru10-4ab2558b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-aru9-4ab2558b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-aru3-4ab2558b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-aru7-4ab2558b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-aru8-4ab2558b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-aru2-4ab2558b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-ljspeech-4ab2558b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-lt408-4ab2558b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-lt138-4ab2558b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-lt624-4ab2558b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-lt396-4ab2558b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-lt498-4ab2558b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-lt132-4ab2558b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-lt288-4ab2558b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-lt42-4ab2558b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/communicate-lt90-4ab2558b.mp3\"]}}', 'Communicate là động từ, communication là danh từ.', 'office', 1, 4),
('4296b0f7-6d55-52bc-93b5-bea9a456e52e', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'db768eab-416f-5f32-a822-dba0ea97e15a', 'd175cce1-ac5e-5098-a408-6476b9beb53d', 'misery', '/ˈmɪzəri/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng rất đau khổ, bất hạnh về thể chất hoặc tinh thần.', 'a state of great suffering or unhappiness of mind or body.', 'The war brought widespread misery to millions of people.', 'Cuộc chiến đã mang lại sự đau khổ lan rộng cho hàng triệu người.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden budget cuts brought great misery to the employees facing layoffs.\", \"vi\": \"Việc cắt giảm ngân sách đột ngột đã mang lại sự đau khổ lớn cho những nhân viên đối mặt với việc sa thải.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-ljspeech-f40b6f1d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-cori-f40b6f1d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/misery-9610b6d6.webp', '[\"suffering\", \"distress\", \"sadness\"]', '[\"happiness\", \"joy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"live in misery\", \"meaning\": \"sống trong cảnh khổ cực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"untold misery\", \"meaning\": \"nỗi khổ không tả xiết\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"miser\", \"note_vi\": \"người keo kiệt, còn misery là sự đau khổ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"miserable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"miserably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-cori-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru0-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru5-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru6-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru10-f40b6f1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru9-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru3-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru7-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru8-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-aru2-f40b6f1d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-ljspeech-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-lt408-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-lt138-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-lt624-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-lt396-f40b6f1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-lt498-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-lt132-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-lt288-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-lt42-f40b6f1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misery-lt90-f40b6f1d.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ của \'miserable\'. Tránh nhầm với \'miser\' (kẻ hà tiện).', 'hr', 1, 5),
('c737cb1b-ad0f-50d3-8b87-bcc0d3974c65', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'db768eab-416f-5f32-a822-dba0ea97e15a', 'd175cce1-ac5e-5098-a408-6476b9beb53d', 'economics', '/ˌiːkəˈnɒmɪks/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Môn khoa học nghiên cứu cách xã hội quản lý tài nguyên khan hiếm.', 'the study of the way in which money, industry, and trade are organized in a society.', 'She decided to major in economics because she was interested in global markets.', 'Cô ấy quyết định học chuyên ngành kinh tế học vì cô ấy quan tâm đến thị trường toàn cầu.', '{\"en\": \"He holds a degree in economics and has worked as a financial analyst for ten years.\", \"vi\": \"Anh ấy có bằng kinh tế học và đã làm chuyên viên phân tích tài chính được mười năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-ljspeech-17a7fac7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-cori-17a7fac7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/economics-2ea179cb.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"study economics\", \"meaning\": \"học kinh tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"degree in economics\", \"meaning\": \"bằng kinh tế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"economy\", \"note_vi\": \"economy là nền kinh tế, economics là môn kinh tế học\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"economic\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"economist\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"economy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-cori-17a7fac7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-aru0-17a7fac7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-aru5-17a7fac7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-aru6-17a7fac7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-aru10-17a7fac7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-aru9-17a7fac7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-aru3-17a7fac7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-aru7-17a7fac7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-aru8-17a7fac7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-aru2-17a7fac7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-ljspeech-17a7fac7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-lt408-17a7fac7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-lt138-17a7fac7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-lt624-17a7fac7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-lt396-17a7fac7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-lt498-17a7fac7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-lt132-17a7fac7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-lt288-17a7fac7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-lt42-17a7fac7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economics-lt90-17a7fac7.mp3\"]}}', 'Mặc dù kết thúc bằng \'s\' nhưng đây là danh từ số ít, động từ theo sau chia số ít.', 'academic', 1, 6),
('fc410ee8-b187-5e2e-bb71-fb1fb3c90c34', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'db768eab-416f-5f32-a822-dba0ea97e15a', 'd175cce1-ac5e-5098-a408-6476b9beb53d', 'analyze', '/ˈænəlaɪz/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Phân tích, mổ xẻ vấn đề.', 'to examine something carefully in order to understand it or explain it.', 'Scientists need to analyze the data carefully before drawing conclusions.', 'Các nhà khoa học cần phân tích dữ liệu cẩn thận trước khi đưa ra kết luận.', '{\"en\": \"The financial consultant will analyze our quarterly sales reports to find ways to cut costs.\", \"vi\": \"Cố vấn tài chính sẽ phân tích các báo cáo doanh số hàng quý của chúng tôi để tìm cách cắt giảm chi phí.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-ljspeech-6257f84c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-cori-6257f84c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/analyze-f40eca88.webp', '[\"examine\", \"investigate\", \"evaluate\"]', '[\"synthesize\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"analyze data\", \"meaning\": \"phân tích dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"analyze results\", \"meaning\": \"phân tích kết quả\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"assess\", \"note_vi\": \"assess là đánh giá giá trị/chất lượng; analyze là phân tích chi tiết cấu trúc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"analysis\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"analyst\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"analytical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-cori-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru0-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru5-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru6-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru10-6257f84c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru9-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru3-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/p