('3f1990a0-c4a7-51ba-bf6f-668dec24e7f1', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'db768eab-416f-5f32-a822-dba0ea97e15a', 'd175cce1-ac5e-5098-a408-6476b9beb53d', 'prose', '/prəʊz/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hình thức viết thông thường, không có nhịp điệu hay vần điệu như thơ.', 'written language in ordinary form, not in verse or poetry.', 'Most novels are written in prose, allowing for a natural flow of language.', 'Hầu hết tiểu thuyết được viết bằng văn xuôi, cho phép ngôn ngữ trôi chảy tự nhiên.', '{\"en\": \"The editor asked the writer to simplify the prose in the report.\", \"vi\": \"Biên tập viên yêu cầu tác giả đơn giản hóa văn xuôi trong báo cáo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-ljspeech-ca70aa1f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-cori-ca70aa1f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prose-32ac879c.webp', '[\"writing\", \"text\", \"composition\"]', '[\"poetry\", \"verse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"prose writing\", \"meaning\": \"viết văn xuôi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"plain prose\", \"meaning\": \"văn xuôi giản dị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prose style\", \"meaning\": \"phong cách văn xuôi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pose\", \"note_vi\": \"pose là tư thế hoặc đặt ra, phát âm gần prose.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"prosaic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-cori-ca70aa1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-aru0-ca70aa1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-aru5-ca70aa1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-aru6-ca70aa1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-aru10-ca70aa1f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-aru9-ca70aa1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-aru3-ca70aa1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-aru7-ca70aa1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-aru8-ca70aa1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-aru2-ca70aa1f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-ljspeech-ca70aa1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-lt408-ca70aa1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-lt138-ca70aa1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-lt624-ca70aa1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-lt396-ca70aa1f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-lt498-ca70aa1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-lt132-ca70aa1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-lt288-ca70aa1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-lt42-ca70aa1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prose-lt90-ca70aa1f.mp3\"]}}', 'Prose là văn xuôi; không nhầm với pose (tư thế) hay poetry (thơ).', 'academic', 1, 11),
('bc0a2a57-8058-5b3d-8aa9-1e144edfab59', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'db768eab-416f-5f32-a822-dba0ea97e15a', 'd175cce1-ac5e-5098-a408-6476b9beb53d', 'recent', 'UK: /ˈriːsnt/ | US: /ˈriːsnt/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'gần đây', 'Having happened, begun, or been produced a short period of time ago.', 'The company announced recent changes in policy.', 'Công ty đã công bố những thay đổi chính sách gần đây.', '{\"en\": \"According to a recent market survey, customer satisfaction has increased significantly.\", \"vi\": \"Theo một khảo sát thị trường gần đây, sự hài lòng của khách hàng đã tăng lên đáng kể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recent-ljspeech-7a7d1b8a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recent-cori-7a7d1b8a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/recent-67e86a0c.webp', '[\"latest\", \"current\", \"fresh\"]', '[\"old\", \"past\", \"former\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"recent survey\", \"meaning\": \"khảo sát gần đây\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in recent years\", \"meaning\": \"trong những năm gần đây\"}, {\"phrase\": \"recent developments\", \"meaning\": \"những diễn biến gần đây\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"decent\", \"note_vi\": \"decent nghĩa là lịch sự, đàng hoàng, khá tốt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"recently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recent-cori-7a7d1b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recent-aru0-7a7d1b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recent-aru5-7a7d1b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recent-aru6-7a7d1b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recent-aru10-7a7d1b8a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recent-aru9-7a7d1b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recent-aru3-7a7d1b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recent-aru7-7a7d1b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recent-aru8-7a