('7d0765c5-5aa6-5e56-a11b-28dc7c67a93a', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'dbc9b2d9-452a-5f0d-bf98-089ea438f358', '79a05286-a666-5aaf-81a0-9b0c63c7521b', 'sink', 'UK: /sɪŋk/ | US: /sɪŋk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'bồn rửa', 'a fixed basin with a water supply and drain, used for washing hands or dishes.', 'The dirty dishes are in the sink.', 'Những đĩa bẩn đang ở trong bồn rửa.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance technician fixed the leaking pipe under the office kitchen sink.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên bảo trì đã sửa đường ống bị rò rỉ bên dưới bồn rửa trong bếp văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-ljspeech-6f2b8356.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-cori-6f2b8356.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sink-15dbc638.webp', '[\"basin\", \"washbasin\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"kitchen sink\", \"meaning\": \"bồn rửa bát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clogged sink\", \"meaning\": \"bồn rửa bị tắc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sink\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-cori-6f2b8356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-aru0-6f2b8356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-aru5-6f2b8356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-aru6-6f2b8356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-aru10-6f2b8356.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-aru9-6f2b8356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-aru3-6f2b8356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-aru7-6f2b8356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-aru8-6f2b8356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-aru2-6f2b8356.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-ljspeech-6f2b8356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-lt408-6f2b8356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-lt138-6f2b8356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-lt624-6f2b8356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-lt396-6f2b8356.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-lt498-6f2b8356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-lt132-6f2b8356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-lt288-6f2b8356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-lt42-6f2b8356.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sink-lt90-6f2b8356.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC Part 1 (mô tả tranh), hay gặp \'kitchen sink\' (bồn rửa bát) hoặc \'restroom sink\' (bồn rửa tay).', 'office', 1, 25),
('d7aeb493-70ab-59d2-93f7-75ebc7159faf', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'dbc9b2d9-452a-5f0d-bf98-089ea438f358', '79a05286-a666-5aaf-81a0-9b0c63c7521b', 'delegate', '/ˈdelɪɡət/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Giao phó, ủy quyền một nhiệm vụ hoặc quyền hạn cho người khác.', 'to assign duties or authority to a subordinate team member within an organization.', 'A good leader knows when to delegate responsibilities to their team members.', 'Một nhà lãnh đạo giỏi biết khi nào nên giao phó trách nhiệm cho các thành viên trong nhóm của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Managers should delegate tasks effectively to ensure that all deadlines are met by the team.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhà quản lý nên giao phó nhiệm vụ hiệu quả để đảm bảo mọi thời hạn đều được nhóm hoàn thành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-ljspeech-52934c29.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-cori-52934c29.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/delegate-987605d7.webp', '[\"assign\", \"entrust\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"delegate authority\", \"meaning\": \"ủy quyền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"delegate responsibility\", \"meaning\": \"giao trách nhiệm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"delegation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-cori-52934c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-aru0-52934c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-aru5-52934c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-aru6-52934c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-aru10-52934c29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-aru9-52934c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-aru3-52934c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-aru7-52934c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-aru8-52934c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-aru2-52934c29.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-ljspeech-52934c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-lt408-52934c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-lt138-52934c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-lt624-52934c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-lt396-52934c29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-lt498-52934c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-lt132-52934c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-lt288-52934c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-lt42-52934c29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegate-lt90-52934c29.mp3\"]}}', 'Kỹ năng ủy quyền là yếu tố quan trọng của nhà lãnh đạo giỏi.', 'hr', 1, 26),
('f3bd040a-a6cf-51d9-8159-7d78ffa804cd', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'dbc9b2d9-452a-5f0d-bf98-089ea438f358', '79a05286-a666-5aaf-81a0-9b0c63c7521b', 'sharp', '/ʃɑːp/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Sắc, nhọn, có khả năng cắt hoặc xuyên qua dễ dàng.', 'having a thin edge or point that can cut or make holes easily.', 'He used a sharp pair of scissors to cut through the thick cardboard packaging.', 'Anh ấy đã dùng một đôi kéo sắc để cắt qua bao bì bìa cứng dày.', '{\"en\": \"The company reported a sharp increase in sales during the third quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã báo cáo một sự tăng trưởng mạnh mẽ về doanh số trong quý ba.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-ljspeech-ca0b6293.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-cori-ca0b6293.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sharp-6647d5c0.webp', '[\"keen\", \"acute\", \"pointed\"]', '[\"blunt\", \"dull\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sharp decline\", \"meaning\": \"sự sụt giảm mạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sharp increase\", \"meaning\": \"sự gia tăng đột ngột\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"smart\", \"note_vi\": \"smart là thông minh, sharp ngoài sắc nhọn còn chỉ sự tăng/giảm mạnh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sharpen\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"sharply\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sharpness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-cori-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-aru0-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-aru5-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-aru6-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-aru10-ca0b6293.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-aru9-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-aru3-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-aru7-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-aru8-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-aru2-ca0b6293.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-ljspeech-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-lt408-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-lt138-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-lt624-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-lt396-ca0b6293.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-lt498-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-lt132-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-lt288-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-lt42-ca0b6293.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sharp-lt90-ca0b6293.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, sharp thường đi với increase/drop nghĩa là tăng/giảm mạnh.', 'business', 1, 27),
('efe9e825-eb43-5513-bbb1-05832264db7b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'dbc9b2d9-452a-5f0d-bf98-089ea438f358', '79a05286-a666-5aaf-81a0-9b0c63c7521b', 'next', '/nɛkst/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người hoặc vật tiếp theo trong một chuỗi.', 'Denoting an entity following directly behind another specified item within a given order.', 'Who\'s next in line for the tickets?', 'Ai là người tiếp theo trong hàng để lấy vé?', '{\"en\": \"The manager asked who was next to present the monthly sales report.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý hỏi ai là người tiếp theo trình bày báo cáo bán hàng tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/next-ljspeech-edee9402.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/next-cori-edee9402.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/next-25f60568.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"next in line\", \"meaning\": \"người hoặc vật tiếp theo trong hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"next customer\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng tiếp theo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"the next day\", \"meaning\": \"ngày hôm sau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"nest\", \"note_vi\": \"next nghĩa là tiếp theo, nest nghĩa là tổ chim.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/next-cori-edee9402.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/next-aru0-edee9402.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/next-aru5-edee9402.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/next-aru6-edee9402.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/next-aru10-edee9402.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/next-aru9-edee9402.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/next-aru3-edee9402.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/next-aru7-edee9402.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/next-aru8-edee9402.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/next-aru2-edee9402.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/next-ljspeech-