('d426a5e1-f01e-580c-b0a4-9196ef421c63', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'dbc9b2d9-452a-5f0d-bf98-089ea438f358', '79a05286-a666-5aaf-81a0-9b0c63c7521b', 'push', '/pʊʃ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hành động đẩy một vật gì đó.', 'an exertive movement intended to drive an object forward or away from the body.', 'With a gentle push, the door slowly opened.', 'Với một cú đẩy nhẹ, cánh cửa từ từ mở ra.', '{\"en\": \"The heavy glass door requires a firm push to open for customers entering the lobby.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa kính nặng cần một lực đẩy mạnh để mở cho khách hàng bước vào sảnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-ljspeech-dc867c03.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-cori-dc867c03.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/push-d180176f.webp', '[\"shove\", \"thrust\"]', '[\"pull\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"give a push\", \"meaning\": \"đẩy một cái\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a gentle push\", \"meaning\": \"một cú đẩy nhẹ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pull\", \"note_vi\": \"Push là đẩy ra xa, pull là kéo về phía mình.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"push\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-cori-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru0-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru5-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru6-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru10-dc867c03.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru9-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru3-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru7-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru8-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-aru2-dc867c03.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-ljspeech-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt408-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt138-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt624-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt396-dc867c03.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt498-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt132-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt288-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt42-dc867c03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/push-lt90-dc867c03.mp3\"]}}', 'Cần phân biệt rõ với \'pull\' (kéo) khi đọc các biển báo tại công sở.', 'daily', 1, 29),
('70671ef7-2230-5654-9028-69ebdc25e981', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'dd6b86a1-a064-5ef1-84f8-17fa532e2848', '5f8f925f-d7ec-5b88-b111-b72972c9e612', 'voice', '/vɔɪs/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Âm thanh được tạo ra khi nói hoặc hát; khả năng nói.', 'the sound produced by humans when speaking, singing, or expressing thoughts and feelings.', 'Her clear voice carried easily across the large hall.', 'Giọng nói trong trẻo của cô ấy dễ dàng vang khắp hội trường lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The customer service agent maintained a calm voice while speaking with the client.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên dịch vụ khách hàng duy trì giọng nói bình tĩnh khi nói chuyện với khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voice-ljspeech-47ef6589.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voice-cori-47ef6589.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/voice-73eaba21.webp', '[\"sound\", \"tone\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tone of voice\", \"meaning\": \"giọng điệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clear voice\", \"meaning\": \"giọng nói rõ ràng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sound\", \"note_vi\": \"sound là âm thanh chung, voice chỉ giọng người\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"vocal\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"vocalize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voice-cori-47ef6589.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voice-aru0-47ef6589.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voice-aru5-47ef6589.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voice-aru6-47ef6589.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voice-aru10-47ef6589.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voice-aru9-47ef6589.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voice-aru3-47ef6589.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voice-aru7-47ef6589.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voice-aru8-47ef6589.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v