"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/question-aru8-3b2be2e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/question-aru2-3b2be2e2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/question-ljspeech-3b2be2e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/question-lt408-3b2be2e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/question-lt138-3b2be2e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/question-lt624-3b2be2e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/question-lt396-3b2be2e2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/question-lt498-3b2be2e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/question-lt132-3b2be2e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/question-lt288-3b2be2e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/question-lt42-3b2be2e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/question-lt90-3b2be2e2.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ \'out of the question\' rất hay gặp trong TOEIC Listening nghĩa là \'không thể nào\'.', 'office', 1, 26),
('ccbf6a4b-5988-5f9c-a419-680dba34414b', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'dd6b86a1-a064-5ef1-84f8-17fa532e2848', '5f8f925f-d7ec-5b88-b111-b72972c9e612', 'course', '/kɔːs/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một chuỗi bài giảng hoặc buổi học về một môn học cụ thể.', 'a series of lessons or a period of study on a particular subject.', 'I\'m planning to enroll in an online marketing course next month.', 'Tôi đang có kế hoạch đăng ký một khóa học marketing trực tuyến vào tháng tới.', '{\"en\": \"The company will pay for employees to take a professional development course this summer.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty sẽ chi trả cho nhân viên tham gia một khóa học phát triển chuyên môn vào mùa hè này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-ljspeech-4809561b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-cori-4809561b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/course-aec5ebef.webp', '[\"class\", \"program\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"training course\", \"meaning\": \"khóa đào tạo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"enroll in a course\", \"meaning\": \"đăng ký một khóa học\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-cori-4809561b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-aru0-4809561b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-aru5-4809561b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-aru6-4809561b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-aru10-4809561b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-aru9-4809561b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-aru3-4809561b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-aru7-4809561b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-aru8-4809561b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-aru2-4809561b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-ljspeech-4809561b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-lt408-4809561b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-lt138-4809561b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-lt624-4809561b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-lt396-4809561b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-lt498-4809561b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-lt132-4809561b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-lt288-4809561b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-lt42-4809561b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/course-lt90-4809561b.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, từ này thường gắn liền với các khóa đào tạo kỹ năng cho nhân viên.', 'education', 1, 27),
('90fa09d8-4bdb-5401-b1fd-e4e255f39120', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'dd6b86a1-a064-5ef1-84f8-17fa532e2848', '5f8f925f-d7ec-5b88-b111-b72972c9e612', 'thoughtless', '/ˈθɔːtləs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Thiếu suy nghĩ, vô tâm, không quan tâm đến người khác.', 'not considering how your actions or words might upset other people.', 'It was thoughtless of him to make such a loud noise when his neighbors were sleeping.', 'Anh ấy thật vô tâm khi gây ra tiếng ồn lớn như vậy trong khi hàng xóm đang ngủ.', '{\"en\": \"It was a thoughtless mistake to send the confidential invoice to the wrong client.\", \"vi\": \"Thật là một sai lầm thiếu suy nghĩ khi gửi hóa đơn bảo mật cho nhầm khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtless-ljspeech-eb415a91.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtless-cori-eb415a91.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thoughtless-db7d2b16.webp', '[\"inconsiderate\", \"careless\", \"insensitive\"]', '[\"thoughtful\", \"considerate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"thoughtless remark\", \"meaning\": \"lời nói vô tâm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thoughtless behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi thiếu suy nghĩ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"thoughtlessly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"thoughtlessness\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"thought\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"think\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtless-cori-eb415a91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtless-aru0-eb415a91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtless-aru5-eb415a91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtless-aru6-eb415a91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtless-aru10-eb415a91.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtless-aru9-eb415a91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtless-aru3-eb415a91.mp3\"