('9ebe3261-4e85-5433-80d4-2cb5278dc55d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'ddda6dea-84df-5e4b-8594-907b911cdcaf', '93aef7b5-ba57-533c-a699-8293770889aa', 'small-scale', '/ˈsmɔːlˌskeɪl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có quy mô nhỏ, phạm vi hạn hẹp.', 'involving a limited number of people, things, or activities.', 'The company started with a small-scale project before expanding globally.', 'Công ty bắt đầu với một dự án quy mô nhỏ trước khi mở rộng ra toàn cầu.', '{\"en\": \"The factory started a small-scale production test before launching the product nationwide.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy đã bắt đầu một thử nghiệm sản xuất quy mô nhỏ trước khi tung sản phẩm ra toàn quốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/small-scale-ljspeech-fb1f94d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/small-scale-cori-fb1f94d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/small-scale-361afc8b.webp', '[\"limited\", \"minor\", \"restricted\"]', '[\"large-scale\", \"massive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"small-scale business\", \"meaning\": \"doanh nghiệp quy mô nhỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"small-scale project\", \"meaning\": \"dự án quy mô nhỏ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/small-scale-cori-fb1f94d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/small-scale-aru0-fb1f94d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/small-scale-aru5-fb1f94d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/small-scale-aru6-fb1f94d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/small-scale-aru10-fb1f94d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/small-scale-aru9-fb1f94d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/small-scale-aru3-fb1f94d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/small-scale-aru7-fb1f94d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/small-scale-aru8-fb1f94d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/small-scale-aru2-fb1