('ebbab329-3051-5536-bc9c-7850cb05177a', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'ddda6dea-84df-5e4b-8594-907b911cdcaf', '93aef7b5-ba57-533c-a699-8293770889aa', 'sigh', '/saɪ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Thở ra một hơi dài, thường thể hiện sự mệt mỏi, buồn bã hoặc nhẹ nhõm.', 'to let out a long, loud breath because of being tired, sad, or relieved.', 'She let out a deep sigh of relief when she finished her exams.', 'Cô ấy thở phào nhẹ nhõm một hơi dài khi hoàn thành các kỳ thi.', '{\"en\": \"The manager could only sigh when she saw the stack of invoices waiting for approval.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý chỉ biết thở dài khi nhìn thấy chồng hóa đơn đang chờ phê duyệt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-ljspeech-49ac96a9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-cori-49ac96a9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sigh-42454ec2.webp', '[\"breathe\", \"exhale\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sigh with relief\", \"meaning\": \"thở phào nhẹ nhõm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deep sigh\", \"meaning\": \"tiếng thở dài\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-cori-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru0-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru5-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru6-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru10-49ac96a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru9-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru3-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru7-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru8-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-aru2-49ac96a9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-ljspeech-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-lt408-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-lt138-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-lt624-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-lt396-49ac96a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-lt498-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-lt132-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-lt288-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-lt42-49ac96a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sigh-lt90-49ac96a9.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mô tả cảm xúc tiêu cực hoặc áp lực trong môi trường làm việc.', 'office', 1, 21),
('2fff78da-0f64-53cf-84b4-be43d7c2ef70', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'ddda6dea-84df-5e4b-8594-907b911cdcaf', '93aef7b5-ba57-533c-a699-8293770889aa', 'plain', '/pleɪn/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Đơn giản, không trang trí hoặc phức tạp.', 'simple and not decorated, or easy to see, hear, or understand.', 'The technician requested a plain white envelope to submit the confidential report.', 'Kỹ thuật viên đã xin một chiếc phong bì màu trắng trơn để nộp báo cáo bảo mật.', '{\"en\": \"Please print the contract on plain white paper without any company logos.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng in hợp đồng trên giấy trắng trơn không có bất kỳ logo công ty nào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-ljspeech-68c46e84.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-cori-68c46e84.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/plain-413c45ec.webp', '[\"simple\", \"clear\", \"unadorned\"]', '[\"fancy\", \"decorated\", \"complex\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"plain paper\", \"meaning\": \"giấy trơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"plain English\", \"meaning\": \"tiếng Anh giản dị, dễ hiểu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"plain clothes\", \"meaning\": \"thường phục\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"plane\", \"note_vi\": \"plane là máy bay hoặc mặt phẳng, đồng âm với plain.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"plainly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"plainness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-cori-68c46e84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-aru0-68c46e84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-aru5-68c46e84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-aru6-68c46e84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-aru10-68c46e84.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-aru9-68c46e84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-aru3-68c46e84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-aru7-68c46e84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-aru8-68c46e84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-aru2-68c46e84.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-ljspeech-68c46e84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-lt408-68c46e84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-lt138-68c46e84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-lt624-68c46e84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-lt396-68c46e84.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-lt498-68c46e84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-lt132-68c46e84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-lt288-68c46e84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-lt42-68c46e84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plain-lt90-68c46e84.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt plain (đơn giản/trơn) với plane (máy bay/mặt phẳng) dù phát âm giống hệt nhau.', 'office', 1, 22),
('df1a7e17-23b3-5343-b773-df0cf533b5d1', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'ddda6dea-84df-5e4b-8594-907b911cdcaf', '93aef7b5-ba57-533c-a699-8293770889aa', 'respectful', '/rɪˈspektfl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Thể hiện sự tôn trọng, lễ phép.', 'showing politeness and care for the feelings or rights of other people.', 'It\'s important to be respectful towards people of all ages.', 'Điều quan trọng là phải thể hiện sự tôn trọng đối với mọi người ở mọi lứa tuổi.', '{\"en\": \"It is vital to remain respectful when dealing with dissatisfied customers on the phone.\", \"vi\": \"Việc giữ thái độ lễ phép khi làm việc với những khách hàng không hài lòng qua điện thoại là rất quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respectful-ljspeech-72ebe942.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respectful-cori-72ebe942.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/respectful-5eb09ff0.webp', '[\"polite\", \"courteous\"]', '[\"rude\", \"disrespectful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"remain respectful\", \"meaning\": \"giữ thái độ tôn trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly respectful\", \"meaning\": \"rất lễ phép\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"respect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"respectfully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respectful-cori-72ebe942.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respectful-aru0-72ebe942.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respectful-aru5-72ebe942.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respectful-aru6-72ebe942.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respectful-aru10-72ebe942.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respectful-aru9-72ebe942.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respectful-aru3-72ebe942.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respectful-aru7-72ebe942.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/respectful-aru8-72ebe942.m