('075f6e1a-e30a-555c-9bf8-74c6d0302b66', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'e04a84ec-5303-5eff-bd3f-4c15883b8965', 'bf577af5-f2b4-5e57-aa02-3e8dc5f1e9e8', 'baddy', '/ˈbædi/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Nhân vật phản diện, kẻ ác trong truyện hoặc phim.', 'a person in a book or film who does bad things and fights against the hero.', 'In most superhero movies, the baddy is always defeated in the end.', 'Trong hầu hết các bộ phim siêu anh hùng, kẻ xấu luôn bị đánh bại vào cuối phim.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team used a cartoon baddy in the advertisement to represent computer viruses.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã sử dụng một kẻ ác hoạt hình trong quảng cáo để đại diện cho virus máy tính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baddy-ljspeech-69b08cde.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baddy-cori-69b08cde.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/baddy-811fef91.webp', '[\"villain\", \"antagonist\", \"bad guy\"]', '[\"hero\", \"good guy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"play the baddy\", \"meaning\": \"đóng vai ác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"defeat the baddy\", \"meaning\": \"đánh bại kẻ ác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"buddy\", \"note_vi\": \"buddy là bạn bè, baddy là kẻ ác.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bad\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baddy-cori-69b08cde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baddy-aru0-69b08cde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baddy-aru5-69b08cde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baddy-aru6-69b08cde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baddy-aru10-69b08cde.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baddy-aru9-69b08cde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baddy-aru3-69b08cde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baddy-aru7-69b08cde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baddy-aru8-69b08cde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/