('c0260666-bfea-5dd2-b41f-97bf6924cab0', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'e7bfddc6-de3a-5763-b679-be67046a8d30', 'fce1321d-1243-51df-ac86-ef771dfeffb1', 'folk', 'UK: /fəʊk/ | US: /foʊk/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'dân gian, dân tộc', 'Traditional and typical of the ordinary people belonging to a particular culture.', 'She enjoys listening to folk tunes on the radio.', 'Cô ấy thích nghe những giai điệu dân ca trên đài.', '{\"en\": \"The annual cultural festival will highlight regional folk crafts and traditional music.\", \"vi\": \"Lễ hội văn hóa hàng năm sẽ làm nổi bật các sản phẩm thủ công dân gian vùng miền và âm nhạc truyền thống.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-ljspeech-2d02ecf8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-cori-2d02ecf8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/folk-5dbc66dc.webp', '[\"traditional\", \"indigenous\", \"ethnic\"]', '[\"modern\", \"contemporary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"folk art\", \"meaning\": \"nghệ thuật dân gian\"}, {\"phrase\": \"folk music\", \"meaning\": \"nhạc dân ca\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-cori-2d02ecf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-aru0-2d02ecf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-aru5-2d02ecf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-aru6-2d02ecf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-aru10-2d02ecf8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-aru9-2d02ecf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-aru3-2d02ecf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-aru7-2d02ecf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-aru8-2d02ecf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-aru2-2d02ecf8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-ljspeech-2d02ecf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-lt408-2d02ecf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-lt138-2d02ecf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-lt624-2d02ecf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-lt396-2d02ecf8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-lt498-2d02ecf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-lt132-2d02ecf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-lt288-2d02ecf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-lt42-2d02ecf8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/folk-lt90-2d02ecf8.mp3\"]}}', 'Là tính từ chỉ nét truyền thống dân gian (folk art, folk music). Cần phân biệt với danh từ số nhiều \'folks\' (mọi người, người nhà).', 'entertainment', 1, 7),
('633c54e4-b873-59a2-9494-d99126c59f68', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'e7bfddc6-de3a-5763-b679-be67046a8d30', 'fce1321d-1243-51df-ac86-ef771dfeffb1', 'justice', '/ˈdʒʌstɪs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự công bằng, công lý trong xã hội.', 'the quality of being fair and acting according to the law and moral rules.', 'The community demanded justice for the victims of the crime.', 'Cộng đồng yêu cầu công lý cho các nạn nhân của vụ án.', '{\"en\": \"The company board sought justice for the shareholders after discovering the fraudulent accounting practices.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị công ty đã tìm kiếm công lý cho các cổ đông sau khi phát hiện các hành vi kế toán gian lận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-ljspeech-050d859c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-cori-050d859c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/justice-815fbdfe.webp', '[\"fairness\", \"equity\"]', '[\"injustice\", \"unfairness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"seek justice\", \"meaning\": \"tìm kiếm công lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"social justice\", \"meaning\": \"công bằng xã hội\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"just\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"justify\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-cori-050d859c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru0-050d859c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru5-050d859c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru6-050d859c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru10-050d859c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru9-050d859c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru3-050d859c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru7-050d859c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/justice-aru8-050d859c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jus