('5dabda97-43a3-55f9-b231-17f0a42eb01f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'e7bfddc6-de3a-5763-b679-be67046a8d30', 'fce1321d-1243-51df-ac86-ef771dfeffb1', 'bored', '/bɔːd/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy chán nản, không có hứng thú.', 'feeling unhappy or tired because you have nothing interesting to do.', 'I get bored easily if a movie doesn\'t have an exciting plot.', 'Tôi dễ bị chán nếu một bộ phim không có cốt truyện hấp dẫn.', '{\"en\": \"The long training session made the employees feel bored and lose their focus.\", \"vi\": \"Buổi đào tạo kéo dài khiến nhân viên cảm thấy chán nản và mất tập trung.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-ljspeech-aa6897a9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-cori-aa6897a9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bored-e08d15ec.webp', '[\"uninterested\", \"weary\"]', '[\"interested\", \"excited\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bored with\", \"meaning\": \"chán nản với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bored stiff\", \"meaning\": \"chán ngấy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"boring\", \"note_vi\": \"Bored là cảm giác của người, boring là tính chất của vật.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"boring\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"boredom\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-cori-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru0-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru5-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru6-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru10-aa6897a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru9-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru3-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru7-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-aru8-aa6897a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bored-ar