('6ce7ccbc-52fc-5302-a625-85131bc45bdc', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'e7bfddc6-de3a-5763-b679-be67046a8d30', 'fce1321d-1243-51df-ac86-ef771dfeffb1', 'valuable', '/ˈvæljuəbl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có giá trị lớn, đáng quý.', 'worth a lot of money or very useful and important for someone.', 'The consultant offered valuable recommendations on how to reduce operational expenses effectively.', 'Chuyên gia tư vấn đã đưa ra những khuyến nghị có giá trị về cách giảm chi phí vận hành một cách hiệu quả.', '{\"en\": \"The training session provided valuable information on how to handle difficult clients.\", \"vi\": \"Buổi đào tạo đã cung cấp thông tin quý giá về cách xử lý những khách hàng khó tính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/valuable-ljspeech-fc3fb5a9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/valuable-cori-fc3fb5a9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/valuable-10cb653d.webp', '[\"precious\", \"worthwhile\", \"priceless\"]', '[\"worthless\", \"useless\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"valuable asset\", \"meaning\": \"tài sản quý giá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"valuable experience\", \"meaning\": \"kinh nghiệm quý báu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"invaluable\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là vô giá (cực kỳ giá trị), không phải vô dụng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"value\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"value\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"invaluable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/valuable-cori-fc3fb5a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/valuable-aru0-fc3fb5a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/valuable-aru5-fc3fb5a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/valuable-aru6-fc3fb5a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/valuable-aru10-fc3fb5a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/valuable-aru9-fc3fb5a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/valuable-aru3-fc3fb5