('a8c17167-53c8-5e93-b278-4b18fa9f45b6', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'e7bfddc6-de3a-5763-b679-be67046a8d30', 'fce1321d-1243-51df-ac86-ef771dfeffb1', 'fence', '/fens/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Kết cấu dùng để bao quanh một khu vực.', 'a structure made of wood or metal that surrounds a piece of land.', 'They decided to build a wooden fence around their garden for privacy.', 'Họ quyết định xây một hàng rào gỗ quanh khu vườn để có sự riêng tư.', '{\"en\": \"The contractor will install a new security fence around the warehouse next Monday.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thầu sẽ lắp đặt một hàng rào bảo vệ mới xung quanh nhà kho vào thứ Hai tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fence-ljspeech-212e1d38.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fence-cori-212e1d38.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fence-24b25890.webp', '[\"barrier\", \"border\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"build a fence\", \"meaning\": \"xây hàng rào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"security fence\", \"meaning\": \"hàng rào bảo vệ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"fence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fence-cori-212e1d38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fence-aru0-212e1d38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fence-aru5-212e1d38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fence-aru6-212e1d38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fence-aru10-212e1d38.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fence-aru9-212e1d38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fence-aru3-212e1d38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fence-aru7-212e1d38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fence-aru8-212e1d38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fence-aru2-212e1d38.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fence-ljspeech-212e1d38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pro