('32648a52-a7a2-5475-bf84-6c2f4ee779e3', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'e9193d2b-e30c-5b09-a477-3a95df052b5b', '37a9e4d0-4302-5d46-852e-74fd7cfd8e06', 'program', '/ˈprəʊɡræm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một tập hợp các lệnh được máy tính thực hiện hoặc một kế hoạch hoạt động.', 'a set of instructions for a computer or a planned series of future events.', 'I need to install a new software program on my computer.', 'Tôi cần cài đặt một chương trình phần mềm mới vào máy tính của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Our company will launch a new training program for all employees starting next month.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi sẽ khởi động chương trình đào tạo mới cho nhân viên vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-ljspeech-81d9aeea.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-cori-81d9aeea.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/program-abd535e7.webp', '[\"plan\", \"schedule\", \"software\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"training program\", \"meaning\": \"chương trình đào tạo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"software program\", \"meaning\": \"chương trình phần mềm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"programme\", \"note_vi\": \"program là Anh-Mỹ, programme là Anh-Anh.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"programmer\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"programmatic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-cori-81d9aeea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-aru0-81d9aeea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-aru5-81d9aeea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-aru6-81d9aeea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-aru10-81d9aeea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-aru9-81d9aeea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-aru3-81d9aeea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-aru7-81d9aeea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-aru8-81d9aeea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-aru2-81d9aeea.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-ljspeech-81d9aeea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-lt408-81d9aeea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-lt138-81d9aeea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-lt624-81d9aeea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-lt396-81d9aeea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-lt498-81d9aeea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-lt132-81d9aeea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-lt288-81d9aeea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-lt42-81d9aeea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/program-lt90-81d9aeea.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong tiếng Anh-Mỹ, \'program\' viết như vậy; Anh-Anh thường là \'programme\'.', 'office', 1, 20),
('16e6e9b1-9f7c-514e-b59a-4bba91dbdadb', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'e9193d2b-e30c-5b09-a477-3a95df052b5b', '37a9e4d0-4302-5d46-852e-74fd7cfd8e06', 'teeny', '/ˈtiːni/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất nhỏ, bé tí.', 'extremely small in size, often used in informal contexts to describe something very little.', 'The baby wore a teeny tiny hat that barely covered her head.', 'Em bé đội một chiếc mũ bé xíu hầu như không che hết đầu.', '{\"en\": \"There is a teeny error in the financial report that needs to be corrected before submission.\", \"vi\": \"Có một lỗi rất nhỏ trong báo cáo tài chính cần được sửa trước khi nộp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-ljspeech-60f99303.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-cori-60f99303.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/teeny-a773679e.webp', '[\"tiny\", \"minuscule\"]', '[\"huge\", \"enormous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"teeny tiny\", \"meaning\": \"bé tí tẹo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a teeny bit\", \"meaning\": \"một chút xíu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tiny\", \"note_vi\": \"teeny là dạng thân mật hơn của tiny.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-cori-60f99303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-aru0-60f99303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-aru5-60f99303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-aru6-60f99303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-aru10-60f99303.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-aru9-60f99303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-aru3-60f99303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-aru7-60f99303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-aru8-60f99303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-aru2-60f99303.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-ljspeech-60f99303.mp