('e649261c-aeb6-576f-a0d3-85878ce29098', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'eb0df1b4-d335-5faf-9061-d17aa981bdfb', 'd20b534d-db6d-5ed7-aa8d-a83689909c47', 'clipboard', '/ˈklɪpbɔːd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một tấm bảng cứng có kẹp để giữ giấy tờ.', 'a small board with a clip at the top for holding papers in place.', 'The nurse carried a clipboard with patient records during her rounds.', 'Y tá mang theo một bìa kẹp hồ sơ bệnh án trong các vòng đi thăm bệnh.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse supervisor checked the inventory list on his clipboard before starting the shift.\", \"vi\": \"Giám sát kho đã kiểm tra danh sách hàng tồn kho trên bảng kẹp giấy trước khi bắt đầu ca làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-ljspeech-e2ab8561.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-cori-e2ab8561.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clipboard-c1439222.webp', '[\"board\", \"pad\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hold a clipboard\", \"meaning\": \"cầm bảng kẹp giấy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"check the clipboard\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm tra bảng kẹp\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-cori-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru0-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru5-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru6-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru10-e2ab8561.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru9-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru3-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru7-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru8-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-aru2-e2ab8561.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-ljspeech-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt408-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt138-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt624-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt396-e2ab8561.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt498-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt132-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt288-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt42-e2ab8561.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clipboard-lt90-e2ab8561.mp3\"]}}', 'Dụng cụ phổ biến trong kiểm kê hoặc làm việc hiện trường.', 'office', 1, 21),
('7bd6da96-37fe-5d37-a4ee-b84fb2187ce2', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'eb0df1b4-d335-5faf-9061-d17aa981bdfb', 'd20b534d-db6d-5ed7-aa8d-a83689909c47', 'for example', '/fər ɪɡˈzɑːmpəl/', 'A1', 'phrase', 'Chẳng hạn như; ví dụ.', 'used to introduce something that explains or supports what you are saying.', 'Several European countries, for example France and Germany, have high tax rates.', 'Một số quốc gia Châu Âu, chẳng hạn như Pháp và Đức, có thuế suất cao.', '{\"en\": \"We offer various training courses; for example, classes on project management and leadership.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi cung cấp nhiều khóa đào tạo khác nhau; ví dụ, các lớp học về quản lý dự án và lãnh đạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-example-ljspeech-7e2fb968.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-example-cori-7e2fb968.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/for-example-9606de97.webp', '[\"for instance\", \"such as\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-example-cori-7e2fb968.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-example-aru0-7e2fb968.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-example-aru5-7e2fb968.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-example-aru6-7e2fb968.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-example-aru10-7e2fb968.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-example-aru9-7e2fb968.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-example-aru3-7e2fb968.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-example-aru7-7e2fb968.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-example-aru8-7e2fb968.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-example-aru2-7e2fb968.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-example-ljspeech-7e2fb968.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-example-lt