('09d64659-2425-56f4-b26a-9501bb813b46', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'eb0df1b4-d335-5faf-9061-d17aa981bdfb', 'd20b534d-db6d-5ed7-aa8d-a83689909c47', 'quarter', 'UK: /ˈkwɔː.tər/ | US: /ˈkwɔːr.tər/', 'A2', 'noun', 'quý (thời gian)', 'One of four three-month periods that make up a financial or business year.', 'Sales improved in the third quarter.', 'Doanh số bán hàng được cải thiện trong quý thứ ba.', '{\"en\": \"Our revenue for the second quarter exceeded the projections set by the board.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh thu quý hai của chúng tôi đã vượt quá dự báo do hội đồng quản trị đưa ra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-ljspeech-7fa1f943.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-cori-7fa1f943.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/quarter-dbdbcb4a.webp', '[\"term\", \"period\", \"three-month period\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"financial quarter\", \"meaning\": \"quý tài chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"first quarter results\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả quý một\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adv/adj\", \"word\": \"quarterly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-cori-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru0-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru5-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru6-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru10-7fa1f943.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru9-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru3-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru7-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru8-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-aru2-7fa1f943.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quarter-ljspeech-7fa1f943.mp3\", \"