('22fdc607-146d-52ae-a726-29a5eb039745', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f1847af7-d792-5c8e-85c1-6b7ab475af29', '186a3080-3097-5966-b75e-fc94322e0674', 'engage', '/ɪnˈɡeɪdʒ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Tham gia vào một hoạt động hoặc công việc.', 'to participate or become involved in a specific task or conversation with others.', 'It\'s important to engage actively in classroom discussions.', 'Điều quan trọng là phải tích cực tham gia vào các cuộc thảo luận trên lớp.', '{\"en\": \"The manager tries to engage all team members during the weekly project planning meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý cố gắng thu hút tất cả các thành viên trong nhóm tham gia vào cuộc họp lập kế hoạch dự án hàng tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-ljspeech-7d7289b5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-cori-7d7289b5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/engage-4e0936e4.webp', '[\"participate\", \"involve\"]', '[\"ignore\", \"withdraw\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"engage in\", \"meaning\": \"tham gia vào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"engage with\", \"meaning\": \"tương tác với\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"engagement\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"engaging\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-cori-7d7289b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-aru0-7d7289b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-aru5-7d7289b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-aru6-7d7289b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-aru10-7d7289b5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-aru9-7d7289b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-aru3-7d7289b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-aru7-7d7289b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-aru8-7d7289b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-aru2-7d7289b5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-ljspeech-7d7289b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-lt408-7d7289b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-lt138-7d7289b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-lt624-7d7289b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-lt396-7d7289b5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-lt498-7d7289b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-lt132-7d7289b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-lt288-7d7289b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-lt42-7d7289b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engage-lt90-7d7289b5.mp3\"]}}', 'nghĩa phổ biến trong công sở là thu hút sự chú ý hoặc tham gia.', 'business', 1, 12),
('0e6ac249-2e3a-54a7-a539-7aba1819fed7', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f1847af7-d792-5c8e-85c1-6b7ab475af29', '186a3080-3097-5966-b75e-fc94322e0674', 'likely', '/ˈlaɪkli/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng xảy ra hoặc đúng.', 'having a good chance of happening or being true in the near future.', 'It\'s likely to rain later this afternoon, so don\'t forget your umbrella.', 'Chiều nay có khả năng trời mưa, nên đừng quên mang ô nhé.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors is highly likely to approve the proposed budget for next year.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc rất có khả năng sẽ phê duyệt ngân sách được đề xuất cho năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-ljspeech-3dd3164f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-cori-3dd3164f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/likely-2acf96df.webp', '[\"probable\", \"possible\"]', '[\"unlikely\", \"improbable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly likely\", \"meaning\": \"rất có khả năng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"most likely\", \"meaning\": \"có khả năng nhất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"alike\", \"note_vi\": \"alike là giống nhau, likely là có khả năng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"likelihood\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-cori-3dd3164f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-aru0-3dd3164f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-aru5-3dd3164f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-aru6-3dd3164f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-aru10-3dd3164f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-aru9-3dd3164f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-aru3-3dd3164f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-aru7-3dd3164f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-aru8-3dd3164f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-aru2-3dd3164f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-ljspeech-3dd3164f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-lt408-3dd3164f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-lt138-3dd3164f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-lt624-3dd3164f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-lt396-3dd3164f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-lt498-3dd3164f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-lt132-3dd3164f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-lt288-3dd3164f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-lt42-3dd3164f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/likely-lt90-3dd3164f.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc phổ biến: \'be likely to do something\' (có khả năng làm gì).', 'business', 1, 13),
('fd38bb2e-1d12-53c6-812f-944c69d109f4', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f1847af7-d792-5c8e-85c1-6b7ab475af29', '186a3080-3097-5966-b75e-fc94322e0674', 'gesture', '/ˈdʒestʃə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một chuyển động của cơ thể, đặc biệt là tay hoặc đầu, để bày tỏ điều gì đó.', 'A bodily motion involving hands or posture intended to communicate a specific message.', 'He made a friendly gesture by waving to us from across the street.', 'Anh ấy đã có một cử chỉ thân thiện bằng cách vẫy tay chào chúng tôi từ bên kia đường.', '{\"en\": \"The manager made a kind gesture by offering extra support to the new employee.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã có một cử chỉ tử tế bằng cách đề nghị hỗ trợ thêm cho nhân viên mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-ljspeech-a820fe7d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-cori-a820fe7d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gesture-80073a0f.webp', '[\"sign\", \"signal\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"kind gesture\", \"meaning\": \"cử chỉ tử tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"friendly gesture\", \"meaning\": \"cử chỉ thân thiện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"posture\", \"note_vi\": \"gesture là cử chỉ, posture là tư thế đứng hoặc ngồi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"gesticulate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-cori-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru0-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru5-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru6-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru10-a820fe7d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru9-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru3-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru7-a820fe7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gesture-aru8-a820fe7