('0af5504e-0244-5e5c-ad23-48636c571b29', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f1847af7-d792-5c8e-85c1-6b7ab475af29', '186a3080-3097-5966-b75e-fc94322e0674', 'fifth', 'UK: /fɪfθ/ | US: /fɪfθ/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'thứ năm', 'coming immediately after the fourth position in a numerical sequence or order.', 'His office is on the fifth floor.', 'Văn phòng của anh ấy ở tầng năm.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate headquarters relocated to the fifth floor of the newly built commercial tower.\", \"vi\": \"Trụ sở chính của công ty đã chuyển sang tầng thứ năm của tòa tháp thương mại mới xây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-ljspeech-5ad43148.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-cori-5ad43148.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fifth-e7e45fd5.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fifth anniversary\", \"meaning\": \"kỷ niệm lần thứ 5\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fifth floor\", \"meaning\": \"tầng 5\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fifty\", \"note_vi\": \"Fifty là số lượng 50, trong khi fifth là số thứ tự thứ 5.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"number\", \"word\": \"five\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-cori-5ad43148.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-aru0-5ad43148.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-aru5-5ad43148.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-aru6-5ad43148.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-aru10-5ad43148.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-aru9-5ad43148.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-aru3-5ad43148.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-aru7-5ad43148.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-aru8-5ad43148.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-aru2-5ad43148.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-ljspeech-5ad43148.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-lt408-5ad43148.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-lt138-5ad43148.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-lt624-5ad43148.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-lt396-5ad43148.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-lt498-5ad43148.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-lt132-5ad43148.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-lt288-5ad43148.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-lt42-5ad43148.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fifth-lt90-5ad43148.mp3\"]}}', 'Số thứ tự xuất phát từ \'five\'. Chú ý biến đổi chính tả từ \'v\' sang \'f\': five -> fifth.', 'office', 1, 21),
('d3e155d9-d02c-5d02-a297-6ccf1caa3671', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f1847af7-d792-5c8e-85c1-6b7ab475af29', '186a3080-3097-5966-b75e-fc94322e0674', 'simplify', '/ˈsɪmplɪfaɪ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm cho điều gì đó dễ hiểu hoặc dễ làm hơn.', 'to make something less complicated and easier to do or understand for everyone.', 'The software update will simplify the checkout procedure for all online shoppers.', 'Bản cập nhật phần mềm sẽ đơn giản hóa quy trình thanh toán cho tất cả người mua sắm trực tuyến.', '{\"en\": \"The new software will significantly simplify the process of tracking inventory in our warehouse.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm mới sẽ làm đơn giản hóa đáng kể quy trình theo dõi hàng tồn kho trong nhà kho của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-ljspeech-e1d6f3c1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-cori-e1d6f3c1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/simplify-6b5456dc.webp', '[\"streamline\", \"clarify\", \"facilitate\"]', '[\"complicate\", \"confuse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"simplify a process\", \"meaning\": \"đơn giản hóa quy trình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"simplify matters\", \"meaning\": \"đơn giản hóa vấn đề\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"clarify\", \"note_vi\": \"clarify là làm rõ nghĩa, simplify là làm cho bớt phức tạp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"simple\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"simplification\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-cori-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru0-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru5-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru6-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru10-e1d6f3c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru9-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru3-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru7-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru8-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru2-e1d6f3c1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-ljspeech-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt408-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt138-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt624-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt396-e1d6f3c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt498-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt132-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt288-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt42-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt90-e1d6f3c1.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất hay gặp trong bài thi TOEIC khi nói về cải tiến quy trình làm việc.', 'business', 1, 22),
('cbd087a2-aaf4-5cf3-9264-87b0ae064382', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f1847af7-d792-5c8e-85c1-6b7ab475af29', '186a3080-3097-5966-b75e-fc94322e0674', 'mash', '/mæʃ/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Nghiền nát thức ăn thành một khối mềm.', 'to crush food into a soft, smooth mass by pressing it with a tool.', 'You need to mash the potatoes thoroughly to make a smooth puree.', 'Bạn cần nghiền khoai tây thật kỹ để làm món nghiền mịn.', '{\"en\": \"The chef will mash the fresh vegetables to create a creamy soup for the guests.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu bếp sẽ nghiền nát các loại rau tươi để tạo ra món súp kem cho thực khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mash-ljspeech-411e48bf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mash-cori-411e48bf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mash-326c0390.webp', '[\"crush\", \"squash\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"mash potatoes\", \"meaning\": \"nghiền khoai tây\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mashed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mash-cori-411e48bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mash-aru0-411e48bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mash-aru5-411e48bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mash-aru6-411e48bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mash-aru10-411e48bf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mash-aru9-411e48bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mash-aru3-411e48bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mash-aru7-411e48bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mash-aru8-411e48bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mash-aru2-411e48bf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mash-ljspeech-411e48bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mash-lt408-411e48bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mash-lt138-