('171cf567-6747-569d-b568-5d3c166b99d5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f2fde855-ada3-5dc9-a874-de0918a83a83', '1f416edf-6942-55ff-8893-d56d12625b8c', 'baking', '/ˈbeɪkɪŋ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'việc làm bánh hoặc nướng thực phẩm', 'the activity of cooking food in an oven using dry heat.', 'My grandmother loves baking cookies and cakes for the holidays.', 'Bà tôi rất thích nướng bánh quy và bánh ngọt cho các dịp lễ.', '{\"en\": \"The catering company specializes in baking fresh bread and pastries for corporate breakfast meetings.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cung cấp dịch vụ ăn uống chuyên nướng bánh mì và bánh ngọt tươi cho các buổi họp sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-ljspeech-096291b9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-cori-096291b9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/baking-83889524.webp', '[\"cooking\", \"roasting\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"baking soda\", \"meaning\": \"bột nở\"}, {\"phrase\": \"baking time\", \"meaning\": \"thời gian nướng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bake\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"baker\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-cori-096291b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-aru0-096291b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-aru5-096291b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-aru6-096291b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-aru10-096291b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-aru9-096291b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-aru3-096291b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-aru7-096291b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-aru8-096291b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-aru2-096291b9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-ljspeech-096291b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-lt408-096291b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-lt138-096291b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-lt624-096291b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-lt396-096291b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-lt498-096291b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-lt132-096291b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-lt288-096291b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-lt42-096291b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baking-lt90-096291b9.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ dùng cho việc nướng trong lò, không dùng cho chiên xào.', 'dining', 1, 7),
('79de17fc-1e81-59db-9a1c-b592515988e7', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f2fde855-ada3-5dc9-a874-de0918a83a83', '1f416edf-6942-55ff-8893-d56d12625b8c', 'paraphrase', '/ˈpærəfreɪz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Diễn đạt lại ý của người khác bằng lời của mình để làm rõ hơn.', 'to express the meaning of something using different words to make it clearer.', 'Could you please paraphrase that complex idea in simpler terms for me?', 'Bạn có thể vui lòng diễn đạt lại ý tưởng phức tạp đó bằng những từ ngữ đơn giản hơn cho tôi được không?', '{\"en\": \"The trainer asked the trainees to paraphrase the company policy in their own words.\", \"vi\": \"Người đào tạo yêu cầu các thực tập sinh diễn đạt lại chính sách công ty bằng ngôn ngữ của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paraphrase-ljspeech-b70ce0e0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paraphrase-cori-b70ce0e0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/paraphrase-33e57dd2.webp', '[\"rephrase\", \"restate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"paraphrase the text\", \"meaning\": \"diễn đạt lại văn bản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"paraphrase the idea\", \"meaning\": \"diễn đạt lại ý tưởng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paraphrase-cori-b70ce0e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paraphrase-aru0-b70ce0e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paraphrase-aru5-b70ce0e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paraphrase-aru6-b70ce0e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paraphrase-aru10-b70ce0e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paraphrase-aru9-b70ce0e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paraphrase-aru3-b70ce0e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paraphrase-aru7-b70ce0e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paraphrase-aru8-b70ce0e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paraphras