('29aea801-9884-582f-b7a7-2f6d082e8aec', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f2fde855-ada3-5dc9-a874-de0918a83a83', '1f416edf-6942-55ff-8893-d56d12625b8c', 'still', '/stɪl/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Vẫn còn, tiếp tục xảy ra.', 'happening or continuing to exist at the present time, even after a long period.', 'Even after all these years, he still remembers her name.', 'Ngay cả sau ngần ấy năm, anh ấy vẫn nhớ tên cô.', '{\"en\": \"We are still waiting for the shipment of office supplies to arrive at our warehouse.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi vẫn đang chờ lô hàng văn phòng phẩm đến kho của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-ljspeech-677c1bfa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-cori-677c1bfa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/still-e98fc6ee.webp', '[\"yet\", \"even now\"]', '[\"no longer\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"still waiting\", \"meaning\": \"vẫn đang chờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"still working\", \"meaning\": \"vẫn đang làm việc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"still\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-cori-677c1bfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-aru0-677c1bfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-aru5-677c1bfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-aru6-677c1bfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-aru10-677c1bfa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-aru9-677c1bfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-aru3-677c1bfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-aru7-677c1bfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-aru8-677c1bfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-aru2-677c1bfa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-ljspeech-677c1bfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-lt