('a9d3dd90-8262-5525-b0ee-fb747a410069', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f2fde855-ada3-5dc9-a874-de0918a83a83', '1f416edf-6942-55ff-8893-d56d12625b8c', 'location', 'UK: /ləʊˈkeɪʃən/ | US: /loʊˈkeɪʃən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'vị trí, địa điểm', 'a particular spot, place, or geographical area where a person, business, or event is situated.', 'The new office location is more convenient for employees.', 'Địa điểm văn phòng mới thuận tiện hơn cho nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"The franchise chose a prime location near the subway station to maximize customer foot traffic.\", \"vi\": \"Nhượng quyền thương mại đã chọn một vị trí đắc địa gần ga tàu điện ngầm để tối đa hóa lượng khách qua lại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-ljspeech-6469ac84.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-cori-6469ac84.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/location-15ed47c7.webp', '[\"site\", \"place\", \"spot\", \"venue\", \"position\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"prime location\", \"meaning\": \"vị trí đắc địa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"convenient location\", \"meaning\": \"vị trí thuận tiện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"allocation\", \"note_vi\": \"Sự phân bổ (ngân sách, nguồn lực), không phải vị trí địa lý\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"locate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"locational\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-cori-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru0-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru5-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru6-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru10-6469ac84.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru9-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru3-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru7-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru8-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-aru2-6469ac84.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-ljspeech-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt408-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt138-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt624-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt396-6469ac84.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt498-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt132-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt288-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt42-6469ac84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/location-lt90-6469ac84.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện trong TOEIC với các cụm từ chỉ vị trí thuận lợi kinh doanh như \'prime location\' hay \'convenient location\'.', 'real estate', 1, 17),
('a09d9b5b-5d0c-53e6-9acf-68c35a463dc5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f2fde855-ada3-5dc9-a874-de0918a83a83', '1f416edf-6942-55ff-8893-d56d12625b8c', 'insecurity', '/ˌɪnsɪˈkjʊərəti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác thiếu tự tin, lo lắng hoặc không an toàn.', 'a lack of confidence or feeling unsafe in a particular situation.', 'His constant insecurity made it difficult for him to make decisions.', 'Sự bất an thường trực của anh ấy khiến anh ấy khó đưa ra quyết định.', '{\"en\": \"Job insecurity often causes employees to seek higher stability in public sectors.\", \"vi\": \"Tình trạng công việc không ổn định thường khiến nhân viên tìm kiếm sự ổn định cao hơn ở khu vực công.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-ljspeech-f77262f0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-cori-f77262f0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/insecurity-0a8284b5.webp', '[\"uncertainty\", \"vulnerability\", \"self-doubt\"]', '[\"confidence\", \"security\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"job insecurity\", \"meaning\": \"sự không ổn định về việc làm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feelings of insecurity\", \"meaning\": \"cảm giác bất an\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"security\", \"note_vi\": \"security là sự an toàn, bảo mật; insecurity là sự thiếu an toàn/bất an\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"insecure\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"insecurely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-cori-f77262f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-aru0-f77262f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-aru5-f77262f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-aru6-f77262f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-aru10-f77262f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-aru9-f77262f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-aru3-f77262f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-aru7-f77262f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-aru8-f77262f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-aru2-f77262f0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-ljspeech-f77262f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-lt408-f77262f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-lt138-f77262f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-lt624-f77262f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-lt396-f77262f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-lt498-f77262f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-lt132-f77262f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-lt288-f77262f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-lt42-f77262f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insecurity-lt90-f77262f0.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh công sở, \'job insecurity\' (sự bất an về việc làm) là thuật ngữ TOEIC rất quen thuộc.', 'hr', 1, 18),
('ac6b01fc-d420-54b0-920e-88d9448494c5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f2fde855-ada3-5dc9-a874-de0918a83a83', '1f416edf-6942-55ff-8893-d56d12625b8c', 'verse', '/vɜːs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một đoạn trong bài thơ hoặc bài hát, thường có vần điệu và nhịp điệu riêng.', 'a grouped set of lines within a poem or song with rhythm.', 'The second verse of the song has a beautiful melody and profound lyrics.', 'Khổ thứ hai của bài hát có giai điệu đẹp và ca từ sâu sắc.', '{\"en\": \"The training video included a short verse to help memorize the safety rules.\", \"vi\": \"Video đào tạo bao gồm một đoạn thơ ngắn để giúp ghi nhớ quy tắc an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verse-ljspeech-28146f20.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verse-cori-28146f20.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/verse-e9a1973e.webp', '[\"stanza\", \"lyric\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"verse of song\", \"meaning\": \"khổ bài hát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"read verse\", \"meaning\": \"đọc thơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"verse poem\", \"meaning\": \"đoạn thơ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"versus\", \"note_vi\": \"versus viết tắt vs nghĩa là đối đầu, khác verse\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verse-cori-28146f20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verse-aru0-28146f20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verse-aru5-28146f20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verse-aru6-28146f20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verse-aru10-28146f20.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verse-aru9-28146f20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verse-aru3-28146f20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verse-aru7-28146f20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verse-aru8-28146f20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verse-aru2-28146f20.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/stor