('4a7baf24-acc1-5465-bf13-27731f51157d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f96d1247-647b-5e58-9798-c07aea668c99', 'b69fd548-640c-59db-b495-1c7a12720e38', 'little', '/ˈlɪtl̩/', 'A1', 'determiner', 'Một lượng nhỏ, không nhiều.', 'small in size, amount, or degree, and not very much.', 'There is little hope for improvement if we don\'t change our approach.', 'Có rất ít hy vọng cải thiện nếu chúng ta không thay đổi cách tiếp cận.', '{\"en\": \"There is little time left to submit the budget proposal for next year.\", \"vi\": \"Còn rất ít thời gian để nộp đề xuất ngân sách cho năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-ljspeech-45022297.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-cori-45022297.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/little-c89237fa.webp', '[\"few\", \"slight\", \"minimal\"]', '[\"much\", \"a lot of\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"little progress\", \"meaning\": \"ít tiến triển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"little interest\", \"meaning\": \"ít sự quan tâm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"a little\", \"note_vi\": \"có một chút (đủ dùng), còn little là hầu như không có\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-cori-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru0-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru5-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru6-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru10-45022297.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru9-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru3-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru7-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru8-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-aru2-45022297.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-ljspeech-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt408-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt138-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt624-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt396-45022297.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt498-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt132-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt288-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt42-45022297.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/little-lt90-45022297.mp3\"]}}', 'Little đi với danh từ không đếm được và mang nghĩa phủ định (rất ít, gần như không).', 'finance', 1, 10),
('43c10a68-753e-5c3b-8581-5f2ac058ebf1', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f96d1247-647b-5e58-9798-c07aea668c99', 'b69fd548-640c-59db-b495-1c7a12720e38', 'stair', 'UK: /steɪz/ | US: /sterz/', 'A2', 'noun', 'cầu thang', 'A single step or a series of steps used for passing between different floor levels.', 'She decided to take the stairs instead of the elevator.', 'Cô ấy quyết định đi cầu thang bộ thay vì thang máy.', '{\"en\": \"Since the main elevator was being serviced, employees were advised to take the stairs.\", \"vi\": \"Vì thang máy chính đang được bảo trì nên nhân viên được khuyên nên đi thang bộ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stair-ljspeech-bb31fd64.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stair-cori-bb31fd64.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stair-cf8eb162.webp', '[\"step\", \"staircase\", \"stairway\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"flight of stairs\", \"meaning\": \"dãy bậc thang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"climb the stairs\", \"meaning\": \"leo cầu thang\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stare\", \"note_vi\": \"Stare có phát âm giống \'stair\' nhưng mang nghĩa là nhìn chằm chằm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"staircase\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stairway\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stair-cori-bb31fd64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stair-aru0-bb31fd64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stair-aru5-bb31fd64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stair-aru6-bb31fd64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stair-aru10-bb31fd64.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stair-aru9-bb31fd64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stair-aru3-bb31fd64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stair-aru7-bb31fd64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stair-aru8-bb31fd64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/