('fbaa1d4a-f039-55fe-a2ff-ae6f92b281e8', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f96d1247-647b-5e58-9798-c07aea668c99', 'b69fd548-640c-59db-b495-1c7a12720e38', 'galaxy', '/ˈɡæləksi/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một hệ thống khổng lồ gồm các ngôi sao, khí, bụi và vật chất tối được giữ lại bởi lực hấp dẫn.', 'A massive system of interstellar dust, gas, and dark matter bound by gravitational attraction.', 'Astronomers discovered a distant galaxy containing millions of newly formed stars.', 'Các nhà thiên văn học đã phát hiện một thiên hà xa xôi chứa hàng triệu ngôi sao mới hình thành.', '{\"en\": \"The science museum features a new exhibition about stars and the distant galaxy systems.\", \"vi\": \"Bảo tàng khoa học có một cuộc triển lãm mới về các ngôi sao và các hệ thiên hà xa xôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-ljspeech-cc803b57.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-cori-cc803b57.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/galaxy-bd2dfe47.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"distant galaxy\", \"meaning\": \"thiên hà xa xôi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spiral galaxy\", \"meaning\": \"thiên hà xoắn ốc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"galactic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-cori-cc803b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-aru0-cc803b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-aru5-cc803b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-aru6-cc803b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-aru10-cc803b57.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-aru9-cc803b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-aru3-cc803b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-aru7-cc803b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-aru8-cc803b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-aru2-cc803b57.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-ljspeech-cc803b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-lt408-cc803b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-lt138-cc803b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-lt624-cc803b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-lt396-cc803b57.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-lt498-cc803b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-lt132-cc803b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-lt288-cc803b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-lt42-cc803b57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galaxy-lt90-cc803b57.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết hoa \'Galaxy\' khi nói về dòng điện thoại của Samsung hoặc tên riêng.', 'nature', 1, 26),
('50883769-8227-503b-b9d5-cf39096e74f0', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f96d1247-647b-5e58-9798-c07aea668c99', 'b69fd548-640c-59db-b495-1c7a12720e38', 'fortunate', 'UK: /ˈfɔː.tʃə.nət/ | US: /ˈfɔːr.tʃə.nət/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'may mắn', 'Having good luck or experiencing favorable circumstances in a particular situation.', 'It was a fortunate coincidence.', 'Đó là một sự trùng hợp may mắn.', '{\"en\": \"We were fortunate to secure funding from a reputable venture capital firm before the product launch.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã may mắn đảm bảo được nguồn vốn từ một quỹ đầu tư mạo hiểm uy tín trước khi ra mắt sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-ljspeech-552b515b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-cori-552b515b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fortunate-e218ca58.webp', '[\"lucky\", \"blessed\", \"favorable\"]', '[\"unfortunate\", \"unlucky\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be fortunate enough to\", \"meaning\": \"có đủ may mắn để làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fortunate circumstance\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn cảnh may mắn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"fortunately\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fortune\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unfortunate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-cori-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru0-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru5-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru6-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru10-552b515b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru9-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru3-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru7-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru8-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru2-552b515b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-ljspeech-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt408-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt138-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt624-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt396-552b515b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt498-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt132-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt288-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt42-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-lt90-552b515b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng theo cấu trúc \'be fortunate to do something\' hoặc \'be fortunate that...\'.', 'business', 1, 27),
('acbdd946-5417-5860-9c5d-72be14cc7231', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'f96d1247-647b-5e58-9798-c07aea668c99', 'b69fd548-640c-59db-b495-1c7a12720e38', 'universe', '/ˈjuːnɪvɜːs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Toàn bộ không gian, thời gian, vật chất và năng lượng tồn tại.', 'everything that exists everywhere including all stars, planets, and all space around us.', 'Scientists are still trying to understand the vastness of the universe.', 'Các nhà khoa học vẫn đang cố gắng hiểu sự rộng lớn của vũ trụ.', '{\"en\": \"The research center explores how the universe affects global communication systems and satellite technology.\", \"vi\": \"Trung tâm nghiên cứu khám phá cách vũ trụ ảnh hưởng đến hệ thống liên lạc toàn cầu và công nghệ vệ tinh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universe-ljspeech-244fb75b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universe-cori-244fb75b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/universe-cb2555d7.webp', '[\"cosmos\", \"space\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"the entire universe\", \"meaning\": \"toàn bộ vũ trụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"laws of the universe\", \"meaning\": \"các quy luật vũ trụ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"universal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universe-cori-244fb75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universe-aru0-244fb75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universe-aru5-244fb75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universe-aru6-244fb75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universe-aru10-244fb75b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universe-aru9-244fb75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universe-aru3-244fb75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universe-aru7-244fb75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universe-aru8-244fb75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun