('9f24b092-0856-5537-9ae0-bac72f05a516', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fa57be82-fbc0-5419-b53f-3e35055c09a5', '75c7466b-1f0d-52cc-ae99-f6ca5e86ad86', 'deepen', '/ˈdiːpən/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm cho thứ gì đó trở nên sâu hơn hoặc mạnh mẽ hơn.', 'To expand the intensity, extent, or understanding of a condition or subject.', 'Their shared experiences helped to deepen their friendship over the years.', 'Những trải nghiệm chung đã giúp tình bạn của họ sâu sắc hơn theo thời gian.', '{\"en\": \"The company plans to deepen its partnership with local suppliers next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty có kế hoạch thắt chặt mối quan hệ đối tác với các nhà cung cấp địa phương vào quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-ljspeech-1931162a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-cori-1931162a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deepen-fce4ea50.webp', '[\"strengthen\", \"intensify\", \"increase\"]', '[\"weaken\", \"decrease\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deepen understanding\", \"meaning\": \"hiểu sâu sắc hơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deepen cooperation\", \"meaning\": \"tăng cường hợp tác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"depend\", \"note_vi\": \"depend nghĩa là phụ thuộc, khác với deepen là làm sâu sắc thêm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"depth\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"deep\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"deeply\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-cori-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru0-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru5-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru6-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru10-1931162a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru9-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru3-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru7-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru8-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru2-1931162a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-ljspeech-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-lt408-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-lt138-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-lt624-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-lt396-1931162a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-lt498-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-lt132-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-lt288-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-lt42-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-lt90-1931162a.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với depend (phụ thuộc) do cách phát âm gần giống.', 'business', 1, 19),
('a15d2501-9430-5eaf-8ad4-53b41ccc9809', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fa57be82-fbc0-5419-b53f-3e35055c09a5', '75c7466b-1f0d-52cc-ae99-f6ca5e86ad86', 'monument', 'UK: /ˈmɒn.jə.mənt/ | US: /ˈmɑːn.jə.mənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'đài tưởng niệm, di tích', 'A structure erected to commemorate a person, historic event, or heritage.', 'Many tourists visit the national monument every year.', 'Nhiều khách du lịch ghé thăm di tích quốc gia mỗi năm.', '{\"en\": \"The guided city tour includes a visit to the historic monument near the harbor.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyến tham quan thành phố có hướng dẫn viên bao gồm điểm đến là đài tưởng niệm lịch sử gần cảng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-ljspeech-e10fc4ad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-cori-e10fc4ad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/monument-5fe9eb84.webp', '[\"memorial\", \"landmark\", \"shrine\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"historic monument\", \"meaning\": \"di tích lịch sử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"national monument\", \"meaning\": \"đài tưởng niệm quốc gia\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"monumental\", \"note_vi\": \"tính từ: cực kỳ hoành tráng, vĩ đại\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"monumental\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-cori-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru0-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru5-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru6-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru10-e10fc4ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru9-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru3-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru7-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monument-aru8-e10fc4ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub