('4bf12475-a1a2-537a-9db9-cd74752d2fc5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fa57be82-fbc0-5419-b53f-3e35055c09a5', '75c7466b-1f0d-52cc-ae99-f6ca5e86ad86', 'write', '/raɪt/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Tạo ra chữ cái, từ ngữ hoặc văn bản trên bề mặt.', 'to put words or symbols on paper or a screen using a pen or keyboard.', 'Our supervisor asked everyone to write a detailed report about the conference.', 'Giám sát của chúng tôi đã yêu cầu mọi người viết một báo cáo chi tiết về hội nghị.', '{\"en\": \"Please write a brief summary of the meeting and send it to the manager today.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng viết bản tóm tắt ngắn gọn về cuộc họp và gửi cho quản lý hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-ljspeech-e1d0c6c1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-cori-e1d0c6c1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/write-2301dbf0.webp', '[\"record\", \"compose\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"write down\", \"meaning\": \"ghi chép lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"write a report\", \"meaning\": \"viết báo cáo\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"writer\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"writing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-cori-e1d0c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-aru0-e1d0c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-aru5-e1d0c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-aru6-e1d0c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-aru10-e1d0c6c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-aru9-e1d0c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-aru3-e1d0c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-aru7-e1d0c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-aru8-e1d0c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-aru2-e1d0c6c1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-ljspeech-e1d0c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-lt408-e1d0c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-lt138-e1d0c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-lt624-e1d0c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-lt396-e1d0c6c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-lt498-e1d0c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-lt132-e1d0c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-lt288-e1d0c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-lt42-e1d0c6c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/write-lt90-e1d0c6c1.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ cơ bản, chú ý dùng kèm giới từ \'down\' khi muốn ghi chú thông tin.', 'office', 1, 28),
('2da1a257-7c66-5d36-8127-55d585aad862', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fa57be82-fbc0-5419-b53f-3e35055c09a5', '75c7466b-1f0d-52cc-ae99-f6ca5e86ad86', 'prominent', '/ˈprɒmɪnənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Dễ thấy, dễ nhận ra hoặc quan trọng.', 'very easy to see or notice, or very important and well-known.', 'She invited a prominent scientist to deliver the keynote speech at the seminar.', 'Cô ấy đã mời một nhà khoa học nổi bật đến trình bày bài phát biểu chủ đạo tại buổi thảo luận.', '{\"en\": \"The company logo is in a prominent position on the front page of the brochure.\", \"vi\": \"Logo công ty nằm ở vị trí nổi bật trên trang bìa của tờ quảng cáo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-ljspeech-91383af9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-cori-91383af9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prominent-e2b3f04f.webp', '[\"noticeable\", \"famous\"]', '[\"hidden\", \"obscure\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"prominent position\", \"meaning\": \"vị trí nổi bật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prominent feature\", \"meaning\": \"đặc điểm nổi bật\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"prominence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-cori-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru0-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru5-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru6-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru10-91383af9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru9-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru3-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru7-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru8-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-aru2-91383af9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-ljspeech-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt408-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt138-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt624-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt396-91383af9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt498-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt132-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt288-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt42-91383af9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prominent-lt90-91383af9.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ vị trí dễ thấy hoặc người nổi tiếng, quan trọng.', 'marketing', 1, 29),
('6ed71b3b-beb5-5427-a9ae-45afa233a7a9', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fb7928b7-609f-51e8-a461-2c7efcd09e03', '53fec109-8f5f-5106-ad9b-b95d3c5fc830', 'literally', '/ˈlɪtərəli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Theo nghĩa đen, không phải nghĩa bóng; thực sự.', 'used to emphasize that something is actually true, not just said.', 'I was so tired I literally fell asleep standing up.', 'Tôi mệt đến mức thực sự đã ngủ gật khi đang đứng.', '{\"en\": \"The server literally stopped working during the important video conference.\", \"vi\": \"Máy chủ thực sự ngừng hoạt động trong cuộc họp video quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-ljspeech-f4eb97c6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-cori-f4eb97c6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/literally-1fa56160.webp', '[\"exactly\", \"actually\", \"precisely\"]', '[\"figuratively\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"literally mean\", \"meaning\": \"nghĩa đen là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"literally true\", \"meaning\": \"đúng sự thật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"literally explode\", \"meaning\": \"thực sự phát nổ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"literary\", \"note_vi\": \"literary nghĩa văn học, khác literally theo nghĩa đen\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"literal\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"literalism\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-cori-f4eb97c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-aru0-f4eb97c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-aru5-f4eb97c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-aru6-f4eb97c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-aru10-f4eb97c6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-aru9-f4eb97c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-aru3-f4eb97c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-aru7-f4eb97c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-aru8-f4eb97c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-aru2-f4eb97c6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-ljspeech-f4eb97c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-lt408-f4eb97c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-lt138-f4eb97c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-lt624-f4eb97c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-lt396-f4eb97c6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-lt498-f4eb97c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-lt132-f4eb97c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-lt288-f4eb97c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-lt42-f4eb97c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/literally-lt90-f4eb97c6.mp3\"]}}', 'Literally nhấn mạnh sự thật, nhiều người dùng sai như \'rất\'.', 'technology', 1, 0),
('820a5922-b2b4-59cf-bae1-9132d3eb2cc9', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fb7928b7-609f-51e8-a461-2c7efcd09e03', '53fec109-8f5f-5106-ad9b-b95d3c5fc830', 'tape', 'UK: /teɪp/ | US: /teɪp/', 'B1', 'noun', 'băng dính', 'A narrow strip of material coated with adhesive used for joining or sealing things together.', 'Use tape to seal the box.', 'Sử dụng băng dính để dán kín hộp.', '{\"en\": \"Please use heavy-duty packing tape to secure the boxes before shipping them.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng dùng băng dính đóng gói chuyên dụng để dán chặt các thùng hàng trước khi vận chuyển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-ljspeech-e9b6c75d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-cori-e9b6c75d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tape-54d2191b.webp', '[\"adhesive\", \"strip\", \"ribbon\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"adhesive tape\", \"meaning\": \"băng dính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"packing tape\", \"meaning\": \"băng dính đóng hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tap\", \"note_vi\": \"\'tap\' nghĩa là vòi nước hoặc hành động gõ nhẹ, khác với \'tape\' (băng dính).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"tape\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-cori-e9b6c75d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-aru0-e9b6c75d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-aru5-e9b6c75d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-aru6-e9b6c75d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-aru10-e9b6c75d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-aru9-e9b6c75d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-aru3-e9b6c75d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-aru7-e9b6c75d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-aru8-e9b6c75d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-aru2-e9b6c75d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-ljspeech-e9b6c75d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-lt408-e9b6c75d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-lt138-e9b6c75d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-lt624-e9b6c75d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-lt396-e9b6c75d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-lt498-e9b6c75d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-lt132-e9b6c75d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-lt288-e9b6c75d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-lt42-e9b6c75d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tape-lt90-e9b6c75d.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong văn phòng, \'tape\' thường dùng để chỉ băng dính đóng hàng (packing tape) hoặc băng dính văn phòng (adhesive tape).', 'office', 1, 1),
('2e05f681-e0e3-52cf-9f92-a8bb6c03525a', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fb7928b7-609f-51e8-a461-2c7efcd09e03', '53fec109-8f5f-5106-ad9b-b95d3c5fc830', 'yet', '/jet/', 'B1', 'conjunction', 'Nhưng, tuy nhiên (dùng để nối hai ý đối lập).', 'used to connect two opposite ideas or statements in a sentence.', 'He studied hard for the exam, yet he still felt nervous.', 'Anh ấy đã học rất chăm chỉ cho kỳ thi, vậy mà anh ấy vẫn cảm thấy lo lắng.', '{\"en\": \"The proposal was well written, yet the board decided to reject it.\", \"vi\": \"Bản đề xuất được viết rất tốt, nhưng ban giám đốc vẫn quyết định bác bỏ nó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yet-ljspeech-1002ea7f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yet-cori-1002ea7f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/yet-e903c8cd.webp', '[\"however\", \"nevertheless\", \"but\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"and yet\", \"meaning\": \"ấy vậy mà, tuy nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"simple yet effective\", \"meaning\": \"đơn giản nhưng hiệu quả\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"still\", \"note_vi\": \"vẫn còn (chỉ sự tiếp diễn), khác với nghĩa tuy nhiên\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yet-cori-1002ea7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yet-aru0-1002ea7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yet-aru5-1002ea7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yet-aru6-1002ea7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yet-aru10-1002ea7f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yet-aru9-1002ea7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yet-aru3-1002ea7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yet-aru7-1002ea7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yet-aru8-1002ea7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yet-aru2-1002ea7f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yet-ljspeech-1002ea7f.