('043dc009-b89a-5faf-80ab-5af6bf36ceee', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fb7928b7-609f-51e8-a461-2c7efcd09e03', '53fec109-8f5f-5106-ad9b-b95d3c5fc830', 'election', '/ɪˈlekʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Quá trình chọn ra người đại diện bằng cách bỏ phiếu.', 'the process of choosing a person or group for a position by voting.', 'The results of the presidential election will be announced tonight.', 'Kết quả của cuộc bầu cử tổng thống sẽ được công bố tối nay.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors held an emergency election to select a new chief executive officer.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã tổ chức một cuộc bầu cử khẩn cấp để chọn ra giám đốc điều hành mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-ljspeech-ed9c23ea.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-cori-ed9c23ea.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/election-3bfc0f0a.webp', '[\"vote\", \"ballot\", \"selection\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hold an election\", \"meaning\": \"tổ chức bầu cử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"presidential election\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc bầu cử tổng thống\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"selection\", \"note_vi\": \"Selection là sự lựa chọn chung, election là bầu cử qua bỏ phiếu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"elect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"elective\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-cori-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru0-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru5-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru6-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru10-ed9c23ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru9-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru3-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru7-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru8-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru2-ed9c23ea.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-ljspeech-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt408-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt138-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt624-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt396-ed9c23ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt498-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt132-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt288-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt42-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt90-ed9c23ea.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC kinh doanh, election thường chỉ việc bỏ phiếu bầu lãnh đạo, hội đồng quản trị.', 'business', 1, 10),
('4fa6ed12-c82a-53cb-9c57-a144687f81c5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fb7928b7-609f-51e8-a461-2c7efcd09e03', '53fec109-8f5f-5106-ad9b-b95d3c5fc830', 'opportunity', 'UK: /ˌɒpəˈtjuːnəti/ | US: /ˌɑpərˈtunəti/', 'B1', 'noun', 'cơ hội', 'A favorable situation or time that makes it possible to do something.', 'This is a great opportunity to expand our customer base.', 'Đây là một cơ hội tuyệt vời để mở rộng lượng khách hàng của chúng ta.', '{\"en\": \"This conference presents a great opportunity for networking with industry experts.\", \"vi\": \"Hội thảo này mang lại một cơ hội tuyệt vời để kết nối với các chuyên gia trong ngành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opportunity-ljspeech-198e7188.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opportunity-cori-198e7188.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/opportunity-5638fcdc.webp', '[\"chance\", \"prospect\", \"possibility\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"job opportunity\", \"meaning\": \"cơ hội việc làm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seize an opportunity\", \"meaning\": \"nắm bắt cơ hội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"miss an opportunity\", \"meaning\": \"bỏ lỡ cơ hội\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"opportunistic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opportunity-cori-198e7188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opportunity-aru0-198e7188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opportunity-aru5-198e7188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opportunity-aru6-198e7188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opportunity-aru10-198e7188.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opportunity-aru9-198e7188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opportunity-aru3-198e7188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opportunity-aru7-198e7188.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opportunity-aru8-198e7188.mp3\", \"/storag