('8b5c38f2-fc44-5f96-8313-bbd25fc36fc2', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fb7928b7-609f-51e8-a461-2c7efcd09e03', '53fec109-8f5f-5106-ad9b-b95d3c5fc830', 'brake', '/breɪk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Bộ phận dùng để hãm tốc độ hoặc dừng xe.', 'a device used to slow down or stop a moving vehicle by applying pressure to wheels.', 'She pressed the brake pedal firmly to avoid hitting the car in front.', 'Cô ấy đạp phanh mạnh để tránh đâm vào chiếc xe phía trước.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery truck failed its safety inspection because the brake system was not working properly.\", \"vi\": \"Xe tải giao hàng không vượt qua kiểm tra an toàn vì hệ thống phanh không hoạt động bình thường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-ljspeech-39cabc71.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-cori-39cabc71.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/brake-632fc686.webp', '[\"stopper\", \"check\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"apply the brake\", \"meaning\": \"đạp phanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"brake system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống phanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"break\", \"note_vi\": \"break là làm vỡ, brake là cái phanh xe.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"brake\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-cori-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru0-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru5-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru6-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru10-39cabc71.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru9-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru3-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru7-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru8-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru2-39cabc71.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-ljspeech-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt408-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt138-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt624-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt396-39cabc71.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt498-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt132-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt288-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt42-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt90-39cabc71.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận nhầm với \'break\' (làm vỡ); \'brake\' có chữ \'e\' ở cuối giống \'drive\'.', 'manufacturing', 1, 12),
('db14b94b-a15a-5dea-9cb0-5c70e49b5d9c', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fb7928b7-609f-51e8-a461-2c7efcd09e03', '53fec109-8f5f-5106-ad9b-b95d3c5fc830', 'dizziness', '/ˈdɪzinəs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác quay cuồng, mất thăng bằng hoặc sắp ngất.', 'a feeling of spinning around and being unable to balance properly.', 'She sometimes experiences dizziness when she stands up too quickly.', 'Cô ấy đôi khi bị chóng mặt khi đứng dậy quá nhanh.', '{\"en\": \"The worker reported mild dizziness after spending hours near the hot machinery.\", \"vi\": \"Người công nhân báo cáo bị chóng mặt nhẹ sau nhiều giờ làm việc gần máy móc nóng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizziness-ljspeech-9db845af.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizziness-cori-9db845af.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dizziness-bcea4ee9.webp', '[\"giddiness\", \"vertigo\", \"lightheadedness\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cause dizziness\", \"meaning\": \"gây ra cảm giác chóng mặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"experience dizziness\", \"meaning\": \"bị chóng mặt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"drowsiness\", \"note_vi\": \"Cảm giác buồn ngủ, khác với dizziness là chóng mặt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dizzy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizziness-cori-9db845af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizziness-aru0-9db845af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizziness-aru5-9db845af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizziness-aru6-9db845af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizziness-aru10-9db845af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizziness-aru9-9db845af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizziness-aru3-9db845af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizziness-aru7-9db845af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizziness-aru8-9db845af.mp3\", \"/stor