('c9b68936-e496-53e6-b81c-ed8fc4db3c11', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fb7928b7-609f-51e8-a461-2c7efcd09e03', '53fec109-8f5f-5106-ad9b-b95d3c5fc830', 'previous', 'UK: /ˈpriːviəs/ | US: /ˈpriviəs/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'trước đó', 'existing or occurring prior to a specific time, event, or item in a sequence', 'The previous quarter showed strong sales growth.', 'Quý trước đã cho thấy sự tăng trưởng doanh số mạnh mẽ.', '{\"en\": \"Applicants are required to have at least three years of previous experience in retail management.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên được yêu cầu có ít nhất ba năm kinh nghiệm làm việc trước đó trong quản lý bán lẻ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-ljspeech-355f28f2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-cori-355f28f2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/previous-e7dec852.webp', '[\"prior\", \"former\", \"earlier\", \"preceding\"]', '[\"subsequent\", \"following\", \"next\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"previous experience\", \"meaning\": \"kinh nghiệm trước đây\"}, {\"phrase\": \"previous year\", \"meaning\": \"năm trước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"preceding\", \"note_vi\": \"Ngay trước (về thứ tự liên tiếp), previous mang nghĩa thời điểm trước nói chung\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"previously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-cori-355f28f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-aru0-355f28f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-aru5-355f28f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-aru6-355f28f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-aru10-355f28f2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-aru9-355f28f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-aru3-355f28f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-aru7-355f28f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-aru8-355f28f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-aru2-355f28f2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-ljspeech-355f28f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-lt408-355f28f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-lt138-355f28f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-lt624-355f28f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-lt396-355f28f2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-lt498-355f28f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-lt132-355f28f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-lt288-355f28f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-lt42-355f28f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/previous-lt90-355f28f2.mp3\"]}}', 'Tính từ đứng trước danh từ, ví dụ: \'previous experience\' (kinh nghiệm trước đây), \'previous job\'. Không đứng sau động từ to be làm vị ngữ.', 'personnel', 1, 19),
('74d54e3f-3c66-5201-aeef-0069d02fa283', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fb7928b7-609f-51e8-a461-2c7efcd09e03', '53fec109-8f5f-5106-ad9b-b95d3c5fc830', 'laze', '/leɪz/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Nghỉ ngơi một cách lười biếng, không làm gì nhiều.', 'to relax and enjoy yourself without doing any work or activity.', 'On sunny afternoons, I love to laze by the pool with a good book.', 'Vào những buổi chiều nắng đẹp, tôi thích nằm dài bên hồ bơi với một cuốn sách hay.', '{\"en\": \"During their paid vacation, employees often choose to laze on the beach to relieve stress.\", \"vi\": \"Trong kỳ nghỉ có lương, nhân viên thường chọn thư giãn trên bãi biển để giải tỏa căng thẳng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-ljspeech-defceaab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-cori-defceaab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/laze-211dba19.webp', '[\"lounge\", \"relax\", \"idle\"]', '[\"toil\", \"labor\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"laze around\", \"meaning\": \"thong thả nghỉ ngơi không làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"laze away\", \"meaning\": \"phung phí thời gian nghỉ ngơi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"glaze\", \"note_vi\": \"laze là nghỉ ngơi thong thả, glaze là tráng men hoặc phủ lớp bóng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"lazy\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"laziness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"lazily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-cori-defceaab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-aru0-defceaab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-aru5-defceaab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-aru6-defceaab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-aru10-defceaab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-aru9-defceaab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-aru3-defceaab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-aru7-defceaab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-aru8-defceaab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-aru2-defceaab.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-ljspeech-defceaab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-lt408-defceaab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-lt138-defceaab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-lt624-defceaab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-lt396-defceaab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-lt498-defceaab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-lt132-defceaab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-lt288-defceaab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-lt42-defceaab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laze-lt90-defceaab.mp3\"]}}', 'Laze thường đi với giới từ \'around\' hoặc \'about\' để diễn tả sự thong dong.', 'travel', 1, 20),
('bf4b1b80-979a-5fa4-aa44-39eb1531978a', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fb7928b7-609f-51e8-a461-2c7efcd09e03', '53fec109-8f5f-5106-ad9b-b95d3c5fc830', 'shame', '/ʃeɪm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác khó chịu, nhục nhã vì đã làm điều gì đó sai trái hoặc đáng xấu hổ.', 'an uncomfortable feeling of guilt or embarrassment caused by doing something wrong.', 'He felt a deep sense of shame for having lied to his parents.', 'Anh ấy cảm thấy vô cùng xấu hổ vì đã nói dối bố mẹ.', '{\"en\": \"It is a shame that the company had to cancel the annual dinner.\", \"vi\": \"Thật đáng tiếc khi công ty phải hủy bỏ bữa tiệc tối thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-ljspeech-d4ef5822.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-cori-d4ef5822.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shame-ee53eb1f.webp', '[\"humiliation\", \"embarrassment\", \"guilt\"]', '[\"pride\", \"honor\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel shame\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy xấu hổ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"what a shame\", \"meaning\": \"thật đáng tiếc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pity\", \"note_vi\": \"thường dùng để chỉ sự thương hại hoặc đáng tiếc nhẹ nhàng hơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"shame\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"shameful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"shameless\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-cori-d4ef5822.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-aru0-d4ef5822.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-aru5-d4ef5822.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-aru6-d4ef5822.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-aru10-d4ef5822.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-aru9-d4ef5822.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-aru3-d4ef5822.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shame-aru7-d4ef5822.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu