('8787296f-9396-5d6c-b270-420e11470293', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fb7928b7-609f-51e8-a461-2c7efcd09e03', '53fec109-8f5f-5106-ad9b-b95d3c5fc830', 'stationery', 'UK: /ˈsteɪʃənəri/ | US: /ˈsteɪʃəˌnɛri/', 'B1', 'noun', 'văn phòng phẩm', 'writing materials and office supplies such as paper, envelopes, pens, and notebooks.', 'I need to buy some stationery for the new office.', 'Tôi cần mua một ít văn phòng phẩm cho văn phòng mới.', '{\"en\": \"The administrative assistant ordered extra stationery, including letterheads and envelopes, for the upcoming conference.\", \"vi\": \"Trợ lý hành chính đã đặt thêm văn phòng phẩm, bao gồm tiêu đề thư và phong bì, cho hội nghị sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-ljspeech-3b12ea31.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-cori-3b12ea31.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stationery-5e70bf40.webp', '[\"office supplies\", \"writing materials\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"stationery supplies\", \"meaning\": \"vật dụng văn phòng phẩm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"office stationery\", \"meaning\": \"văn phòng phẩm công ty\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stationary\", \"note_vi\": \"tĩnh, đứng yên một chỗ (tính từ, đuôi -ary)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-cori-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru0-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru5-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru6-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru10-3b12ea31.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru9-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru3-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru7-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru8-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru2-3b12ea31.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-ljspeech-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-lt408-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-lt138-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-lt624-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-lt396-3b12ea31.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-lt498-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-lt132-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-lt288-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-lt42-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-lt90-3b12ea31.mp3\"]}}', 'Mẹo nhớ: \'stationery\' có đuôi \'er\' như \'paper\' (giấy), dùng chỉ đồ dùng văn phòng phẩm; khác với \'stationary\' (tĩnh, đứng yên) có đuôi \'ar\'.', 'office', 1, 26),
('f47b7885-dc50-5660-b59c-1098422905f7', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fb7928b7-609f-51e8-a461-2c7efcd09e03', '53fec109-8f5f-5106-ad9b-b95d3c5fc830', 'physics', '/ˈfɪzɪks/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Môn khoa học nghiên cứu về vật chất, năng lượng và chuyển động.', 'A branch of science concerned with physical properties of reality, forces, motion, and energy.', 'He found his physics class quite challenging but fascinating.', 'Anh ấy thấy lớp vật lý của mình khá thử thách nhưng cũng rất hấp dẫn.', '{\"en\": \"The engineering firm requires all applicants to have a solid background in applied physics.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty kỹ thuật yêu cầu tất cả ứng viên phải có nền tảng vững chắc về vật lý ứng dụng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physics-ljspeech-4122fa5d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physics-cori-4122fa5d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/physics-1dca5949.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"applied physics\", \"meaning\": \"vật lý ứng dụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"laws of physics\", \"meaning\": \"các quy luật vật lý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"physique\", \"note_vi\": \"Physique là vóc dáng cơ thể, còn physics là môn vật lý.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"physicist\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"physical\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"physically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physics-cori-4122fa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physics-aru0-4122fa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physics-aru5-4122fa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physics-aru6-4122fa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physics-aru10-4122fa5d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physics-aru9-4122fa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physics-aru3-4122fa5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physics-aru7-4122fa5