('dbb364e2-9340-5dbd-9a07-e16c34accb2e', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fc7b95cc-1eb9-5ef4-9632-2ca30d8d27a5', '72530315-221e-55db-8135-bec87cb126a9', 'circular', '/ˈsɜːkjələ(r)/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có hình dạng giống hình tròn hoặc liên quan đến hình tròn.', 'having the shape of a circle or moving in a circle.', 'The children sat in a circular formation around the storyteller.', 'Những đứa trẻ ngồi thành vòng tròn quanh người kể chuyện.', '{\"en\": \"The new office building features a circular lobby with a large reception desk.\", \"vi\": \"Tòa nhà văn phòng mới có sảnh hình tròn với quầy lễ tân lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-ljspeech-3c7f4b0f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-cori-3c7f4b0f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/circular-ce1358a2.webp', '[\"round\", \"ring-shaped\"]', '[\"square\", \"linear\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"circular motion\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển động tròn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"circular table\", \"meaning\": \"bàn tròn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"circular\", \"note_vi\": \"circular (danh từ) còn có nghĩa là tờ quảng cáo/thông báo gửi hàng loạt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"circle\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"circulate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"circulation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-cori-3c7f4b0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-aru0-3c7f4b0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-aru5-3c7f4b0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-aru6-3c7f4b0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-aru10-3c7f4b0f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-aru9-3c7f4b0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-aru3-3c7f4b0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-aru7-3c7f4b0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-aru8-3c7f4b0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-aru2-3c7f4b0f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-ljspeech-3c7f4b0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-lt408-3c7f4b0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-lt138-3c7f4b0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-lt624-3c7f4b0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-lt396-3c7f4b0f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-lt498-3c7f4b0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-lt132-3c7f4b0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-lt288-3c7f4b0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-lt42-3c7f4b0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circular-lt90-3c7f4b0f.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh văn phòng, circular (danh từ) nghĩa là thông báo gửi cho nhiều người.', 'office', 1, 13),
('5aea4469-7378-52d2-acd2-e9bc29793d2d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fc7b95cc-1eb9-5ef4-9632-2ca30d8d27a5', '72530315-221e-55db-8135-bec87cb126a9', 'moderate', '/ˈmɒdərət/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không quá nhiều hoặc quá ít; ở mức độ trung bình.', 'keeping within reasonable limits and not going to extremes in behavior or amount.', 'The weather today is quite moderate, neither too hot nor too cold.', 'Thời tiết hôm nay khá ôn hòa, không quá nóng cũng không quá lạnh.', '{\"en\": \"The manager requested a moderate increase in the budget for the upcoming marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã yêu cầu một mức tăng vừa phải trong ngân sách cho chiến dịch tiếp thị sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moderate-ljspeech-78cd1257.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moderate-cori-78cd1257.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/moderate-57833fd0.webp', '[\"average\", \"reasonable\"]', '[\"extreme\", \"excessive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"moderate growth\", \"meaning\": \"tăng trưởng vừa phải\"}, {\"phrase\": \"moderate temperature\", \"meaning\": \"nhiệt độ ôn hòa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"modest\", \"note_vi\": \"Modest là khiêm tốn, moderate là mức độ trung bình.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"moderation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"moderately\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moderate-cori-78cd1257.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moderate-aru0-78cd1257.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moderate-aru5-78cd1257.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moderate-aru6-78cd1257.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moderate-aru10-78cd1257.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moderate-aru9-78cd1257.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moderate-aru3-78cd1257.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moderate-aru7-78