('4e3a1270-3209-5151-b5ac-d78d4630541d', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fc7b95cc-1eb9-5ef4-9632-2ca30d8d27a5', '72530315-221e-55db-8135-bec87cb126a9', 'jazz', 'UK: /dʒæz bænd/ | US: /dʒæz bænd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'ban nhạc jazz', 'A style of music created by African Americans characterized by strong rhythm and improvisation.', 'Are you playing in a jazz band at the recital?', 'Bạn có chơi trong ban nhạc jazz ở buổi biểu diễn không?', '{\"en\": \"The corporate event will feature a live jazz performance during the opening cocktail hour.\", \"vi\": \"Sự kiện doanh nghiệp sẽ có buổi biểu diễn nhạc jazz trực tiếp trong giờ uống cocktail khai mạc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-ljspeech-6abc743b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-cori-6abc743b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/jazz-708b14e6.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"jazz band\", \"meaning\": \"ban nhạc jazz\"}, {\"phrase\": \"jazz festival\", \"meaning\": \"liên hoan nhạc jazz\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-cori-6abc743b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-aru0-6abc743b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-aru5-6abc743b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-aru6-6abc743b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-aru10-6abc743b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-aru9-6abc743b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-aru3-6abc743b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-aru7-6abc743b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-aru8-6abc743b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-aru2-6abc743b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-ljspeech-6abc743b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-lt408-6abc743b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-lt138-6abc743b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-lt624-6abc743b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-lt396-6abc743b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-lt498-6abc743b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-lt132-6abc743b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-lt288-6abc743b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-lt42-6abc743b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jazz-lt90-6abc743b.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC Part 3/4 hay xuất hiện các đoạn quảng cáo hoặc thông báo về sự kiện giải trí (jazz concert, jazz festival).', 'entertainment', 1, 25),
('29da2971-70fa-5b50-a29f-59d7f08db3b5', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fc7b95cc-1eb9-5ef4-9632-2ca30d8d27a5', '72530315-221e-55db-8135-bec87cb126a9', 'powerful', '/ˈpaʊəfl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có sức mạnh, quyền lực lớn; có tác động mạnh.', 'having a lot of strength, influence, or the ability to produce a significant effect.', 'The new engine is incredibly powerful, allowing the car to accelerate very quickly.', 'Động cơ mới cực kỳ mạnh mẽ, giúp xe tăng tốc rất nhanh.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO delivered a powerful speech that motivated the entire sales team to work harder.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành đã có một bài phát biểu đầy sức thuyết phục thúc đẩy toàn bộ đội ngũ bán hàng làm việc chăm chỉ hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-ljspeech-0e1ce4b9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-cori-0e1ce4b9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/powerful-25e49367.webp', '[\"strong\", \"influential\"]', '[\"weak\", \"feeble\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"powerful tool\", \"meaning\": \"công cụ mạnh mẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"powerful influence\", \"meaning\": \"tầm ảnh hưởng lớn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"power\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"powerfully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-cori-0e1ce4b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-aru0-0e1ce4b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-aru5-0e1ce4b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-aru6-0e1ce4b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-aru10-0e1ce4b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-aru9-0e1ce4b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-aru3-0e1ce4b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-aru7-0e1ce4b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powerful-aru8-0e1ce4b9.mp3