('94af3891-3a28-53e6-bee2-fcd934ad550f', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fc7b95cc-1eb9-5ef4-9632-2ca30d8d27a5', '72530315-221e-55db-8135-bec87cb126a9', 'command', '/kəˈmɑːnd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Lệnh, mệnh lệnh; sự chỉ huy.', 'an official order given by someone in a position of power or authority.', 'The soldiers followed the command of their captain without hesitation.', 'Những người lính tuân theo mệnh lệnh của đội trưởng mà không chút do dự.', '{\"en\": \"The manager issued a command to stop all production lines until the safety inspection finished.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã đưa ra lệnh dừng tất cả các dây chuyền sản xuất cho đến khi việc kiểm tra an toàn hoàn tất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-ljspeech-1925f793.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-cori-1925f793.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/command-bdf46780.webp', '[\"order\", \"instruction\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"follow a command\", \"meaning\": \"tuân theo mệnh lệnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"issue a command\", \"meaning\": \"ban hành mệnh lệnh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"commander\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-cori-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru0-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru5-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru6-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru10-1925f793.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru9-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru3-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru7-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru8-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru2-1925f793.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-ljspeech-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt408-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt138-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt624-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt396-1925f793.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt498-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt132-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt288-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt42-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt90-1925f793.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong công sở, từ này mang sắc thái uy quyền, thường dùng cho cấp trên.', 'office', 1, 27),
('e741fd43-cad8-5089-9e2a-903f848a8dab', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fc7b95cc-1eb9-5ef4-9632-2ca30d8d27a5', '72530315-221e-55db-8135-bec87cb126a9', 'complicated', '/ˈkɒmplɪkeɪtɪd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Khó hiểu, rắc rối, gồm nhiều phần.', 'involving a lot of different parts, in a way that is difficult to understand.', 'Solving this technical issue requires analyzing a set of highly complicated financial formulas.', 'Việc giải quyết vấn đề kỹ thuật này đòi hỏi phải phân tích một tập hợp các công thức tài chính rất phức tạp.', '{\"en\": \"The new billing software is too complicated for the staff to use without proper training.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm thanh toán mới quá phức tạp để nhân viên sử dụng mà không được đào tạo bài bản.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-ljspeech-d27c7a19.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-cori-d27c7a19.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/complicated-6d2b412e.webp', '[\"complex\", \"intricate\", \"difficult\"]', '[\"simple\", \"easy\", \"straightforward\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly complicated\", \"meaning\": \"vô cùng phức tạp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"complicated process\", \"meaning\": \"quy trình phức tạp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"complex\", \"note_vi\": \"complex thường chỉ sự phức tạp về cấu trúc, ít mang nghĩa tiêu cực như complicated.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"complicate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"complication\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-cori-d27c7a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-aru0-d27c7a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-aru5-d27c7a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-aru6-d27c7a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-aru10-d27c7a19.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-aru9-d27c7a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-aru3-d27c7a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-aru7-d27c7a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-aru8-d27c7a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-aru2-d27c7a19.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-ljspeech-d27c7a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-lt408-d27c7a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-lt138-d27c7a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-lt624-d27c7a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-lt396-d27c7a19.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-lt498-d27c7a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-lt132-d27c7a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-lt288-d27c7a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-lt42-d27c7a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complicated-lt90-d27c7a19.mp3\"]}}', '\"Complicated\" thường mang sắc thái tiêu cực (rắc rối), trong khi \"complex\" mang tính trung lập hơn.', 'technology', 1, 28),
('16164e64-cc31-537b-9628-f30a7a86b3ac', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fc7b95cc-1eb9-5ef4-9632-2ca30d8d27a5', '72530315-221e-55db-8135-bec87cb126a9', 'percentage', '/pəˈsentɪdʒ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một phần trăm của tổng số; tỷ lệ phần trăm.', 'a portion or share of a whole expressed as a number out of one hundred.', 'The company reinvests a substantial percentage of its profits into research and development.', 'Công ty tái đầu tư một tỷ lệ phần trăm đáng kể lợi nhuận vào nghiên cứu và phát triển.', '{\"en\": \"A large percentage of our customers prefer to pay for their orders using credit cards.\", \"vi\": \"Một tỷ lệ lớn khách hàng của chúng tôi thích thanh toán đơn hàng bằng thẻ tín dụng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percentage-ljspeech-5138292f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percentage-cori-5138292f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/percentage-30f58ec9.webp', '[\"proportion\", \"rate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"high percentage\", \"meaning\": \"tỷ lệ cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"small percentage\", \"meaning\": \"tỷ lệ nhỏ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"percent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percentage-cori-5138292f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percentage-aru0-5138292f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percentage-aru5-5138292f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percentage-aru6-5138292f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percentage-aru10-5138292f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percentage-aru9-5138292f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percentage-aru3-5138292f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percentage-aru7-5138292f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percentage-aru8-5138292f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percentage-aru2-5138292f