('56eb6fe7-709f-574f-bc58-c6018e14d265', '4daa5e92-69f0-5c9b-a310-9387e8bc4326', 'fe367fce-4a7f-5f03-a55b-92317f7e3f7f', '477ab190-6248-5606-8a28-648310a1b857', 'storm', '/stɔːm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thời tiết xấu với gió mạnh, mưa lớn hoặc tuyết.', 'a period of very bad weather with strong wind and rain or snow.', 'A sudden storm caused widespread power outages in the region.', 'Một cơn bão bất ngờ đã gây mất điện trên diện rộng trong khu vực.', '{\"en\": \"The flight was delayed because the storm damaged the airport radar system.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyến bay bị hoãn vì cơn bão làm hỏng hệ thống radar sân bay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-ljspeech-6ad3a947.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-cori-6ad3a947.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/storm-a4f53b99.webp', '[\"tempest\", \"gale\", \"squall\"]', '[\"calm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"thunder storm\", \"meaning\": \"bão giông\"}, {\"phrase\": \"storm damage\", \"meaning\": \"thiệt hại do bão\"}, {\"phrase\": \"storm surge\", \"meaning\": \"sóng bão\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"swarm\", \"note_vi\": \"swarm là đàn đông, phát âm gần storm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stormy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"stormily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-cori-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru0-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru5-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru6-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru10-6ad3a947.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru9-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru3-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru7-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storm-aru8-6ad3a947.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub