('c26ff385-0fc7-5b71-81eb-2647c4a3f025', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '034a54ef-4655-524b-b0b2-faf42190701e', 'd15cc9dd-7f37-502b-8913-963f113df91a', 'fatherhood', '/ˈfɑːðəhʊd/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Trạng thái hoặc trách nhiệm của một người cha.', 'the state or period of being a parent, specifically the role and responsibilities of a man.', 'He embraced fatherhood with joy and quickly learned to change diapers.', 'Anh ấy đón nhận cương vị làm cha với niềm vui và nhanh chóng học cách thay tã.', '{\"en\": \"The company offers flexible hours to support employees during the early stages of their fatherhood.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cung cấp giờ làm việc linh hoạt để hỗ trợ nhân viên trong giai đoạn đầu làm cha.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-ljspeech-3f92596b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-cori-3f92596b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fatherhood-8f8232ac.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"embrace fatherhood\", \"meaning\": \"đảm nhận vai trò làm cha\"}, {\"phrase\": \"experience fatherhood\", \"meaning\": \"trải nghiệm làm cha\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"father\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-cori-3f92596b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-aru0-3f92596b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-aru5-3f92596b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-aru6-3f92596b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-aru10-3f92596b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-aru9-3f92596b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-aru3-3f92596b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-aru7-3f92596b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-aru8-3f92596b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-aru2-3f92596b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-ljspeech-3f92596b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-lt408-3f92596b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-lt138-3f92596b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-lt624-3f92596b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-lt396-3f92596b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-lt498-3f92596b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-lt132-3f92596b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-lt288-3f92596b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-lt42-3f92596b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatherhood-lt90-3f92596b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong các chính sách phúc lợi nhân sự liên quan đến nghỉ phép làm cha.', 'hr', 1, 5),
('68e5ebe5-a1a8-538c-8702-d99087fc8842', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '034a54ef-4655-524b-b0b2-faf42190701e', 'd15cc9dd-7f37-502b-8913-963f113df91a', 'neutral', '/ˈnjuːtrəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không ủng hộ hoặc đứng về phía nào trong một cuộc tranh chấp.', 'not supporting or helping either side in a disagreement, competition, or war.', 'It\'s hard to remain neutral when your best friends are arguing.', 'Thật khó để giữ thái độ trung lập khi những người bạn thân nhất của bạn đang cãi nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The mediator remained neutral during the contract negotiations between the two companies.\", \"vi\": \"Người hòa giải vẫn giữ thái độ trung lập trong suốt cuộc đàm phán hợp đồng giữa hai công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-ljspeech-e7fb41a6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-cori-e7fb41a6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/neutral-2026933f.webp', '[\"impartial\", \"unbiased\", \"objective\"]', '[\"biased\", \"partial\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"neutral stance\", \"meaning\": \"lập trường trung lập\"}, {\"phrase\": \"neutral ground\", \"meaning\": \"địa điểm trung lập\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"natural\", \"note_vi\": \"natural nghĩa là tự nhiên, dễ nhầm cách viết\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"neutrality\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"neutralize\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"neutrally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-cori-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru0-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru5-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru6-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru10-e7fb41a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru9-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neutral-aru3-e7fb41a6.mp3\", \"