('b52882f8-76a9-55c2-9b65-e328dc897522', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '034a54ef-4655-524b-b0b2-faf42190701e', 'd15cc9dd-7f37-502b-8913-963f113df91a', 'drama', '/ˈdrɑːmə/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một vở kịch được viết để biểu diễn trên sân khấu.', 'a play for theater, radio, or television that tells a serious story.', 'She enjoys watching historical dramas at the local theater.', 'Cô ấy thích xem các vở kịch lịch sử tại nhà hát địa phương.', '{\"en\": \"The local theater company will perform a classic drama to attract more tourists this weekend.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty kịch địa phương sẽ biểu diễn một vở kịch cổ điển để thu hút thêm du khách vào cuối tuần này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-ljspeech-63b12989.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-cori-63b12989.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/drama-09f86b16.webp', '[\"play\", \"show\", \"production\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"historical drama\", \"meaning\": \"kịch lịch sử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"family drama\", \"meaning\": \"kịch gia đình\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dramatic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"dramatically\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dramatist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-cori-63b12989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-aru0-63b12989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-aru5-63b12989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-aru6-63b12989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-aru10-63b12989.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-aru9-63b12989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-aru3-63b12989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-aru7-63b12989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-aru8-63b12989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-aru2-63b12989.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-ljspeech-63b12989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-lt408-63b12989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-lt138-63b12989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-lt624-63b12989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-lt396-63b12989.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-lt498-63b12989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-lt132-63b12989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-lt288-63b12989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-lt42-63b12989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drama-lt90-63b12989.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong đời sống còn có nghĩa bóng là sự việc kịch tính, rắc rối.', 'media', 1, 24),
('8b228c2e-a198-5b3e-a7cc-c105c79ad851', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '034a54ef-4655-524b-b0b2-faf42190701e', 'd15cc9dd-7f37-502b-8913-963f113df91a', 'yoga', '/ˈjəʊɡə/', 'A2', 'noun', 'môn tập luyện thể chất và tinh thần có nguồn gốc từ Ấn Độ', 'a physical and mental practice that involves stretching and breathing to improve health.', 'Practicing yoga regularly can improve flexibility and reduce stress.', 'Tập yoga thường xuyên có thể cải thiện sự dẻo dai và giảm căng thẳng.', '{\"en\": \"The company wellness program now includes weekly yoga sessions to help employees reduce their stress.\", \"vi\": \"Chương trình chăm sóc sức khỏe của công ty hiện bao gồm các buổi tập yoga hàng tuần để giúp nhân viên giảm căng thẳng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-ljspeech-6b3bebb6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-cori-6b3bebb6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/yoga-32877acf.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"yoga class\", \"meaning\": \"lớp học yoga\"}, {\"phrase\": \"practice yoga\", \"meaning\": \"tập yoga\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-cori-6b3bebb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-aru0-6b3bebb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-aru5-6b3bebb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-aru6-6b3bebb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-aru10-6b3bebb6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-aru9-6b3bebb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-aru3-6b3bebb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-aru7-6b3bebb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-aru8-6b3bebb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-aru2-6b3bebb6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-ljspeech-6b3bebb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-lt408-6b3bebb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-lt138-6b3bebb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-lt624-6b3bebb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-lt396-6b3bebb6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-lt498-6b3bebb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-lt132-6b3bebb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-lt288-6b3bebb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-lt42-6b3bebb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yoga-lt90-6b3bebb6.mp3\"]}}', 'Yoga không chỉ là ngồi thiền, nó bao gồm cả các bài tập vận động cơ thể.', 'health', 1, 25),
('3d033276-5494-5fc8-b6e8-da0d7b7309e5', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '034a54ef-4655-524b-b0b2-faf42190701e', 'd15cc9dd-7f37-502b-8913-963f113df91a', 'business class', '/ˈbɪz.nɪs klɑːs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hạng ghế cao cấp trên máy bay hoặc tàu hỏa, có nhiều tiện nghi hơn.', 'a more expensive and comfortable way to travel on a plane or train.', 'For long flights, many people prefer to travel in business class for the extra comfort.', 'Đối với các chuyến bay dài, nhiều người thích đi hạng thương gia để có thêm sự thoải mái.', '{\"en\": \"The company policy allows senior executives to book business class for all international flights.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách công ty cho phép các giám đốc cấp cao đặt vé hạng thương gia cho mọi chuyến bay quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-ljspeech-3cb90535.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-cori-3cb90535.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/business-class-596897b7.webp', '[\"premium class\", \"executive class\"]', '[\"economy class\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fly business class\", \"meaning\": \"bay hạng thương gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"upgrade to business class\", \"meaning\": \"nâng hạng lên thương gia\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"economy class\", \"note_vi\": \"Hạng vé phổ thông, rẻ hơn hạng thương gia.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-cori-3cb90535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-aru0-3cb90535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-aru5-3cb90535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-aru6-3cb90535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-aru10-3cb90535.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-aru9-3cb90535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-aru3-3cb90535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-aru7-3cb90535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-aru8-3cb90535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-aru2-3cb90535.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-ljspeech-3cb90535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-lt408-3cb90535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-lt138-3cb90535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-lt624-3cb90535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-lt396-3cb90535.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-lt498-3cb90535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-lt132-3cb90535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-lt288-3cb90535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-lt42-3cb90535.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/business-class-lt90-3cb90535.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện trong các đoạn hội thoại về công tác phí.', 'travel', 1, 26),
('b66f7a54-65f8-552b-9b88-74b56034b026', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '034a54ef-4655-524b-b0b2-faf42190701e', 'd15cc9dd-7f37-502b-8913-963f113df91a', 'quote', '/kwəʊt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một đoạn văn hoặc câu nói được trích dẫn từ ai đó hoặc từ một tác phẩm.', 'a group of words from a book or speech that is repeated by someone else.', 'My favorite quote from the book is about the importance of perseverance.', 'Câu trích dẫn yêu thích của tôi trong cuốn sách là về tầm quan trọng của sự kiên trì.', '{\"en\": \"The manager included an inspiring quote from the founder in the annual company report.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã đưa một câu trích dẫn đầy cảm hứng từ người sáng lập vào báo cáo thường niên của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-ljspeech-f5d98dda.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-cori-f5d98dda.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/quote-fd8fa6cb.webp', '[\"quotation\", \"citation\", \"excerpt\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"famous quote\", \"meaning\": \"câu trích dẫn nổi tiếng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"direct quote\", \"meaning\": \"trích dẫn trực tiếp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"quota\", \"note_vi\": \"quota nghĩa là hạn ngạch hoặc chỉ tiêu, không phải trích dẫn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"quote\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"quotable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-cori-f5d98dda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-aru0-f5d98dda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-aru5-f5d98dda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-aru6-f5d98dda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-aru10-f5d98dda.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-aru9-f5d98dda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-aru3-f5d98dda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-aru7-f5d98dda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-aru8-f5d98dda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-aru2-f5d98dda.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-ljspeech-f5d98dda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-lt408-f5d98dda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-lt138-f5d98dda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-lt624-f5d98dda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-lt396-f5d98dda.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-lt498-f5d98dda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-lt132-f5d98dda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-lt288-f5d98dda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-lt42-f5d98dda.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quote-lt90-f5d98dda.mp3\"]}}', 'Quote vừa là động từ (trích dẫn) vừa là danh từ (sự trích dẫn, câu trích dẫn).', 'office', 1, 27),
('9f511303-c63f-5f9d-9064-4bf7165d7d6c', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '034a54ef-4655-524b-b0b2-faf42190701e', 'd15cc9dd-7f37-502b-8913-963f113df91a', 'economy', 'UK: /ɪˈkɒnəmi/ | US: /ɪˈkɑːnəmi/', 'B1', 'noun', 'nền kinh tế', 'The system of trade, industry, and financial activity existing within a country or region.', 'The government is working to boost the national economy.', 'Chính phủ đang nỗ lực thúc đẩy nền kinh tế quốc gia.', '{\"en\": \"The national economy showed signs of recovery after the government introduced new tax cuts.\", \"vi\": \"Nền kinh tế quốc gia đã xuất hiện các dấu hiệu phục hồi sau khi chính phủ đưa ra các khoản cắt giảm thuế mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-ljspeech-8ec4382b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-cori-8ec4382b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/economy-24b1536a.webp', '[\"market\", \"financial system\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"global economy\", \"meaning\": \"nền kinh tế toàn cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"economy class\", \"meaning\": \"hạng phổ thông (máy bay)\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"economic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"economical\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"economically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-cori-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru0-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru5-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru6-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru10-8ec4382b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru9-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru3-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru7-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru8-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru2-8ec4382b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-ljspeech-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt408-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt138-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt624-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt396-8ec4382b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt498-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt132-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt288-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt42-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt90-8ec4382b.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'economy\' không chỉ mang nghĩa nền kinh tế mà còn dùng trong cụm \'economy class\' (hạng vé phổ thông).', 'finance', 1, 28),
('224a259c-b94a-5c32-89d2-7bc28c61f2ab', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '034a54ef-4655-524b-b0b2-faf42190701e', 'd15cc9dd-7f37-502b-8913-963f113df91a', 'analyst', '/ˈænəlɪst/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người chuyên nghiên cứu và phân tích dữ liệu, thông tin.', 'a person whose job involves examining facts or materials in order to give an opinion.', 'A financial analyst provides advice on investments and market trends.', 'Một nhà phân tích tài chính đưa ra lời khuyên về đầu tư và xu hướng thị trường.', '{\"en\": \"The senior market analyst will present the quarterly sales report at the board meeting tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyên viên phân tích thị trường cấp cao sẽ trình bày báo cáo doanh thu hàng quý tại cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị vào ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-ljspeech-e366805d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-cori-e366805d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/analyst-ad14f3af.webp', '[\"researcher\", \"examiner\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"financial analyst\", \"meaning\": \"chuyên viên phân tích tài chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"data analyst\", \"meaning\": \"chuyên viên phân tích dữ liệu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"analysis\", \"note_vi\": \"analysis là sự phân tích (vật), analyst là người phân tích.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"analyze\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"analysis\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"analytical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-cori-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru0-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru5-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru6-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru10-e366805d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru9-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru3-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru7-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru8-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru2-e366805d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-ljspeech-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt408-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt138-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt624-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt396-e366805d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt498-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt132-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt288-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt42-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt90-e366805d.mp3\"]}}', 'Trọng âm rơi vào âm tiết đầu tiên: /ˈæn.ə.lɪst/.', 'finance', 1, 29),
('780b8556-0b9a-5b79-8cb0-005452d96a75', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '1458bacf-c6c2-5cc2-b485-abce31312a03', '8750b518-c1f1-5af2-b093-e3a77ea5523d', 'efficient', '/ɪˈfɪʃnt/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'làm việc hoặc hoạt động tốt mà không lãng phí thời gian, năng lượng', 'working well and producing good results without wasting time, money, or energy.', 'Automating the administrative tasks made our workflow significantly more efficient.', 'Việc tự động hóa các nhiệm vụ hành chính đã làm cho quy trình làm việc của chúng tôi hiệu quả hơn đáng kể.', '{\"en\": \"Our office implemented an efficient filing system to help staff manage documents more quickly.\", \"vi\": \"Văn phòng chúng tôi đã triển khai hệ thống lưu trữ hồ sơ hiệu quả để giúp nhân viên quản lý tài liệu nhanh hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-ljspeech-8527edb7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-cori-8527edb7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/efficient-020a87a4.webp', '[\"productive\", \"effective\"]', '[\"inefficient\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly efficient\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ hiệu quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"energy efficient\", \"meaning\": \"tiết kiệm năng lượng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"efficiency\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"efficiently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-cori-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru0-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru5-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru6-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru10-8527edb7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru9-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru3-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru7-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru8-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-aru2-8527edb7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-ljspeech-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt408-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt138-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt624-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt396-8527edb7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt498-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt132-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt288-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt42-8527edb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficient-lt90-8527edb7.mp3\"]}}', 'Cần phân biệt với \'effective\' (tạo ra kết quả mong muốn) và \'efficient\' (tạo ra kết quả với ít lãng phí nhất).', 'office', 1, 0),
('76ab2e24-eeb6-5ca2-b35a-25d3e5b50c2c', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '1458bacf-c6c2-5cc2-b485-abce31312a03', '8750b518-c1f1-5af2-b093-e3a77ea5523d', 'diagonal', '/daɪˈæɡənl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Theo đường chéo, nối hai góc đối diện hoặc cắt ngang qua.', 'joining two opposite corners of a square, rectangle, or other straight-sided shape.', 'The architect added diagonal support beams to reinforce the building against strong winds.', 'Kiến trúc sư đã thêm các thanh chống chéo để gia cố tòa nhà trước những cơn gió mạnh.', '{\"en\": \"The designer suggested a diagonal pattern for the office carpet to make the space look larger.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thiết kế đã gợi ý một họa tiết chéo cho thảm văn phòng để làm cho không gian trông rộng hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-ljspeech-6159f6bc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-cori-6159f6bc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/diagonal-066de447.webp', '[\"slanted\", \"oblique\", \"crosswise\"]', '[\"horizontal\", \"vertical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"diagonal line\", \"meaning\": \"đường chéo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"diagonal stripe\", \"meaning\": \"sọc chéo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"horizontal\", \"note_vi\": \"horizontal là nằm ngang, diagonal là nằm chéo.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"diagonally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-cori-6159f6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-aru0-6159f6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-aru5-6159f6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-aru6-6159f6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-aru10-6159f6bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-aru9-6159f6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-aru3-6159f6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-aru7-6159f6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-aru8-6159f6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-aru2-6159f6bc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-ljspeech-6159f6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-lt408-6159f6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-lt138-6159f6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-lt624-6159f6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-lt396-6159f6bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-lt498-6159f6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-lt132-6159f6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-lt288-6159f6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-lt42-6159f6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagonal-lt90-6159f6bc.mp3\"]}}', 'Phát âm nhấn vào âm tiết thứ hai: /daɪˈæɡ.ən.əl/.', 'office', 1, 1),
('1e17e6ad-6a3d-551a-b08e-7ea918d8c913', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '1458bacf-c6c2-5cc2-b485-abce31312a03', '8750b518-c1f1-5af2-b093-e3a77ea5523d', 'complexion', '/kəmˈplekʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Vẻ ngoài tự nhiên, màu sắc và chất lượng của da mặt.', 'the natural color and appearance of the skin, especially on the face of a person.', 'She has a fair complexion and rarely gets a tan.', 'Cô ấy có làn da trắng sáng và hiếm khi bị rám nắng.', '{\"en\": \"The new beauty product is designed to improve your complexion and make your skin glow.\", \"vi\": \"Sản phẩm làm đẹp mới được thiết kế để cải thiện làn da và làm cho da bạn sáng bóng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexion-ljspeech-be8a907c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexion-cori-be8a907c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/complexion-203c74f4.webp', '[\"skin tone\", \"skin\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"clear complexion\", \"meaning\": \"làn da sáng sạch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"healthy complexion\", \"meaning\": \"làn da khỏe mạnh\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexion-cori-be8a907c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexion-aru0-be8a907c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexion-aru5-be8a907c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexion-aru6-be8a907c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexion-aru10-be8a907c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexion-aru9-be8a907c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexion-aru3-be8a907c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexion-aru7-be8a907c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexion-aru8-be8a907c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexion-aru2-be8a907c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complexion-lj