('41d5c2fc-e869-539b-8033-8c96ddf16ccf', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '1458bacf-c6c2-5cc2-b485-abce31312a03', '8750b518-c1f1-5af2-b093-e3a77ea5523d', 'leopard', '/ˈlepəd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Loài mèo lớn, có đốm, sống ở châu Phi và châu Á.', 'a large wild cat with a yellowish-brown coat and black spots that lives in trees.', 'The leopard is known for its distinctive spotted coat and stealthy hunting skills.', 'Báo hoa mai nổi tiếng với bộ lông đốm đặc trưng và kỹ năng săn mồi lén lút.', '{\"en\": \"The nature documentary featured a leopard hunting in the wild during the evening hours.\", \"vi\": \"Phim tài liệu về thiên nhiên đã chiếu cảnh một con báo hoa mai đi săn trong tự nhiên vào buổi tối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-ljspeech-0438d484.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-cori-0438d484.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/leopard-47362363.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"spotted leopard\", \"meaning\": \"báo hoa mai có đốm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-cori-0438d484.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-aru0-0438d484.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-aru5-0438d484.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-aru6-0438d484.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-aru10-0438d484.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-aru9-0438d484.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-aru3-0438d484.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-aru7-0438d484.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-aru8-0438d484.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-aru2-0438d484.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-ljspeech-0438d484.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-lt408-0438d484.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-lt138-0438d484.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-lt624-0438d484.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-lt396-0438d484.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-lt498-0438d484.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-lt132-0438d484.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-lt288-0438d484.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-lt42-0438d484.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leopard-lt90-0438d484.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ về báo hoa mai rất phổ biến để nói về bản tính con người.', 'nature', 1, 11),
('b83565fa-bc47-5140-9c2d-73bcb421f8e0', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '1458bacf-c6c2-5cc2-b485-abce31312a03', '8750b518-c1f1-5af2-b093-e3a77ea5523d', 'checkout', '/ˈtʃɛkaʊt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Khu vực trong cửa hàng nơi khách hàng trả tiền cho hàng hóa đã mua.', 'the place where you pay for the things that you are buying.', 'There was a long queue at the checkout, so I had to wait a while.', 'Có một hàng dài ở quầy thanh toán, nên tôi phải đợi một lúc.', '{\"en\": \"Customers are requested to present their loyalty cards at the checkout to receive discounts.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng được yêu cầu xuất trình thẻ thành viên tại quầy thanh toán để được giảm giá.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checkout-ljspeech-d5491e7e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checkout-cori-d5491e7e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/checkout-6136cc3f.webp', '[\"cashier\", \"pay desk\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"checkout counter\", \"meaning\": \"quầy thanh toán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"self-service checkout\", \"meaning\": \"quầy tự thanh toán\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"check-in\", \"note_vi\": \"checkout là thanh toán/ra về, check-in là làm thủ tục vào\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"check out\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checkout-cori-d5491e7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checkout-aru0-d5491e7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checkout-aru5-d5491e7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checkout-aru6-d5491e7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checkout-aru10-d5491e7e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checkout-aru9-d5491e7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checkout-aru3-d5491e7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checkout-aru7-d5491e7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/checkout-aru8-d5491e7e.mp3\", \"/s