('5911a6b0-518e-5201-9297-5568821fef46', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '1458bacf-c6c2-5cc2-b485-abce31312a03', '8750b518-c1f1-5af2-b093-e3a77ea5523d', 'fair', 'UK: /feə/ | US: /fɛr/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'hợp lý, công bằng', 'Treating people equally without bias, or reasonable and acceptable in amount.', 'This is a fair price for the quality of work.', 'Đây là mức giá hợp lý cho chất lượng công việc.', '{\"en\": \"Both parties agreed that the proposed terms of the merger were fair.\", \"vi\": \"Cả hai bên đều đồng ý rằng các điều khoản sáp nhập được đề xuất là hợp lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-ljspeech-187770cf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-cori-187770cf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fair-2419a4b8.webp', '[\"reasonable\", \"just\", \"impartial\", \"equitable\"]', '[\"unfair\", \"biased\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fair price\", \"meaning\": \"giá cả hợp lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fair competition\", \"meaning\": \"cạnh tranh bình đẳng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fare\", \"note_vi\": \"Fare là tiền vé (xe, tàu, xe buýt), còn fair là hợp lý/công bằng hoặc hội chợ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"fairly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fairness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-cori-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru0-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru5-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru6-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru10-187770cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru9-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru3-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru7-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru8-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-aru2-187770cf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-ljspeech-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-lt408-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-lt138-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-lt624-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-lt396-187770cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-lt498-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-lt132-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-lt288-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-lt42-187770cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fair-lt90-187770cf.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'fair price\' chỉ mức giá hợp lý, chấp nhận được.', 'business', 1, 27),
('a4a86ae6-e29a-5bff-b75c-2e3019f6fa75', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '1458bacf-c6c2-5cc2-b485-abce31312a03', '8750b518-c1f1-5af2-b093-e3a77ea5523d', 'stout', '/staʊt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'To lớn, vạm vỡ hoặc mập mạp.', 'having a large, strong, and fat body.', 'The old man, though stout, was surprisingly agile for his age.', 'Ông lão, dù mập mạp, vẫn nhanh nhẹn đáng ngạc nhiên so với tuổi của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The stout security guard stood at the entrance of the corporate office all day.\", \"vi\": \"Người bảo vệ mập mạp đứng ở lối vào của văn phòng công ty cả ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stout-ljspeech-50205bcc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stout-cori-50205bcc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stout-09f5f96a.webp', '[\"plump\", \"chubby\", \"portly\"]', '[\"thin\", \"slender\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stout man\", \"meaning\": \"người đàn ông mập mạp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stout build\", \"meaning\": \"vóc dáng đậm người\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"scout\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là hướng đạo sinh hoặc trinh sát\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stoutness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"stoutly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stout-cori-50205bcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stout-aru0-50205bcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stout-aru5-50205bcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stout-aru6-50205bcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stout-aru10-50205bcc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stout-aru9-50205bcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stout-aru3-50205bcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stout-aru7-50205bcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stout-aru8-50205bcc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stout-aru2-50205bcc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\