('d50db06f-7033-5b71-a1da-77f957ce3665', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '14a92d46-8fc4-558b-82de-65258d67f5a9', '3dfb8f7f-c50f-5639-b176-bc4d2f514475', 'fit', '/fɪt/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có sức khỏe tốt, vóc dáng cân đối nhờ tập thể dục.', 'healthy and strong, especially as a result of doing physical exercise regularly.', 'Regular exercise and a balanced diet help employees remain fit and active.', 'Tập thể dục thường xuyên và chế độ ăn uống cân bằng giúp nhân viên luôn khỏe mạnh và năng động.', '{\"en\": \"The company offers free gym memberships to help employees stay fit and reduce stress.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cung cấp thẻ thành viên phòng gym miễn phí để giúp nhân viên giữ gìn sức khỏe và giảm căng thẳng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-ljspeech-9c20b9ba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-cori-9c20b9ba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fit-c58c36be.webp', '[\"healthy\", \"strong\", \"athletic\"]', '[\"unfit\", \"unhealthy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"keep fit\", \"meaning\": \"giữ dáng, giữ sức khỏe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"physically fit\", \"meaning\": \"khỏe mạnh về thể chất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fit\", \"note_vi\": \"động từ fit nghĩa là vừa vặn, tính từ fit là khỏe mạnh (verb)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fitness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-cori-9c20b9ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-aru0-9c20b9ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-aru5-9c20b9ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-aru6-9c20b9ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-aru10-9c20b9ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-aru9-9c20b9ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-aru3-9c20b9ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-aru7-9c20b9ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-aru8-9c20b9ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-aru2-9c20b9ba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-ljspeech-9c20b9ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-lt408-9c20b9ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-lt138-9c20b9ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-lt624-9c20b9ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-lt396-9c20b9ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-lt498-9c20b9ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-lt132-9c20b9ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-lt288-9c20b9ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-lt42-9c20b9ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fit-lt90-9c20b9ba.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, fit thường đi với các chủ đề về sức khỏe nhân viên hoặc phòng tập.', 'health', 1, 12),
('8cbabef1-51fd-5516-9eff-e058559fa0e8', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '14a92d46-8fc4-558b-82de-65258d67f5a9', '3dfb8f7f-c50f-5639-b176-bc4d2f514475', 'even-tempered', '/ˈiːvənˌtɛmpəd/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có tính cách bình tĩnh, ít khi tức giận hoặc khó chịu.', 'always calm and not easily excited, annoyed, or angered.', 'My boss is very even-tempered, which makes the workplace a calm environment.', 'Sếp tôi rất điềm đạm, điều đó khiến môi trường làm việc trở nên yên bình.', '{\"en\": \"An even-tempered manager is essential for maintaining a peaceful working environment.\", \"vi\": \"Một người quản lý điềm đạm là điều cần thiết để duy trì môi trường làm việc hòa nhã.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-ljspeech-86fb8df2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-cori-86fb8df2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/even-tempered-539c9b6d.webp', '[\"calm\", \"placid\", \"composed\"]', '[\"quick-tempered\", \"irritable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"even-tempered nature\", \"meaning\": \"bản tính điềm đạm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remain even-tempered\", \"meaning\": \"giữ vẻ điềm đạm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bad-tempered\", \"note_vi\": \"bad-tempered nghĩa là nóng tính, dễ nổi giận\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-cori-86fb8df2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-aru0-86fb8df2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-aru5-86fb8df2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-aru6-86fb8df2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-aru10-86fb8df2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-aru9-86fb8df2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-aru3-86fb8df2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-aru7-86fb8df2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-aru8-86fb8df2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-aru2-86fb8df2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-ljspeech-86fb8df2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-lt408-86fb8df2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-lt138-86fb8df2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-lt624-86fb8df2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-lt396-86fb8df2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-lt498-86fb8df2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-lt132-86fb8df2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-lt288-86fb8df2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-lt42-86fb8df2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/even-tempered-lt90-86fb8df2.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này ghép bởi \'even\' (bằng phẳng, đều) và \'tempered\' (tính khí).', 'hr', 1, 13),
('452e311a-8111-594f-a0d9-38c9d1a96698', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '14a92d46-8fc4-558b-82de-65258d67f5a9', '3dfb8f7f-c50f-5639-b176-bc4d2f514475', 'object', '/ˈɒbdʒɪkt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Bày tỏ sự không đồng tình hoặc phản đối mạnh mẽ.', 'to express a strong disagreement or disapproval regarding a plan or an idea.', 'Many residents object to the new construction plan in their neighborhood.', 'Nhiều cư dân phản đối kế hoạch xây dựng mới trong khu phố của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The board members decided to object to the new budget proposal during the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Các thành viên hội đồng đã quyết định phản đối đề xuất ngân sách mới trong cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-ljspeech-1615307c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-cori-1615307c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/object-890fb2be.webp', '[\"oppose\", \"disagree\"]', '[\"agree\", \"accept\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"object to something\", \"meaning\": \"phản đối việc gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strongly object\", \"meaning\": \"phản đối mạnh mẽ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"objective\", \"note_vi\": \"Objective là danh từ (mục tiêu) hoặc tính từ (khách quan).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"objection\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"objective\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-cori-1615307c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-aru0-1615307c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-aru5-1615307c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-aru6-1615307c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-aru10-1615307c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-aru9-1615307c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-aru3-1615307c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-aru7-1615307c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-aru8-1615307c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-aru2-1615307c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-ljspeech-1615307c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-lt408-1615307c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-lt138-1615307c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-lt624-1615307c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-lt396-1615307c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-lt498-1615307c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-lt132-1615307c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-lt288-1615307c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-lt42-1615307c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/object-lt90-1615307c.mp3\"]}}', 'Lưu ý luôn đi kèm giới từ \'to\' khi muốn diễn đạt sự phản đối.', 'business', 1, 14),
('da5db889-5fbf-5778-8e26-5ca903ab7e29', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '14a92d46-8fc4-558b-82de-65258d67f5a9', '3dfb8f7f-c50f-5639-b176-bc4d2f514475', 'abbreviation', '/əˌbriːviˈeɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Dạng rút gọn của một từ hoặc cụm từ.', 'a short form of a word or phrase, used to save space.', 'In business emails, ASAP serves as a well-known abbreviation for as soon as possible.', 'Trong thư điện tử công việc, ASAP là một chữ viết tắt quen thuộc của cụm từ càng sớm càng tốt.', '{\"en\": \"Please use the standard abbreviation for state names on the shipping labels.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng sử dụng chữ viết tắt tiêu chuẩn cho tên các bang trên nhãn vận chuyển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-ljspeech-0d72f71e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-cori-0d72f71e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/abbreviation-e9672b56.webp', '[\"shortening\", \"contraction\", \"acronym\"]', '[\"expansion\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"standard abbreviation\", \"meaning\": \"chữ viết tắt tiêu chuẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"common abbreviation\", \"meaning\": \"chữ viết tắt phổ biến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"acronym\", \"note_vi\": \"abbreviation là viết tắt nói chung, acronym là từ cấu tạo từ các chữ đầu (như NATO).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"abbreviate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-cori-0d72f71e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-aru0-0d72f71e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-aru5-0d72f71e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-aru6-0d72f71e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-aru10-0d72f71e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-aru9-0d72f71e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-aru3-0d72f71e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati