('879d4e25-a15e-5b46-80ba-10e3bfe50a5e', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '14a92d46-8fc4-558b-82de-65258d67f5a9', '3dfb8f7f-c50f-5639-b176-bc4d2f514475', 'subtle', '/ˈsʌtl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Khó nhận ra, không rõ ràng nhưng quan trọng hoặc có ý nghĩa.', 'not very obvious or easy to notice, often involving small details or changes.', 'There was a subtle change in her expression that told me she was upset.', 'Có một sự thay đổi tinh tế trong biểu cảm của cô ấy cho tôi biết cô ấy đang buồn.', '{\"en\": \"The manager made a subtle change to the meeting schedule to accommodate the visiting clients.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã thực hiện một thay đổi nhỏ trong lịch họp để đáp ứng các khách hàng đến thăm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-ljspeech-10a4d47a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-cori-10a4d47a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/subtle-050e21fe.webp', '[\"faint\", \"delicate\"]', '[\"obvious\", \"blatant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"subtle difference\", \"meaning\": \"sự khác biệt tinh tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"subtle hint\", \"meaning\": \"gợi ý kín đáo\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"subtlety\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-cori-10a4d47a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-aru0-10a4d47a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-aru5-10a4d47a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-aru6-10a4d47a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-aru10-10a4d47a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-aru9-10a4d47a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-aru3-10a4d47a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-aru7-10a4d47a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-aru8-10a4d47a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-aru2-10a4d47a.mp3\