('c1438a2c-d79a-52de-9670-2569812cdb04', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '14a92d46-8fc4-558b-82de-65258d67f5a9', '3dfb8f7f-c50f-5639-b176-bc4d2f514475', 'craft', '/krɑːft/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Nghề đòi hỏi kỹ năng đặc biệt, thường là làm bằng tay.', 'an activity involving skill in making things by hand.', 'Pottery is a beautiful ancient craft that requires patience and skill.', 'Làm gốm là một nghề thủ công cổ xưa tuyệt đẹp đòi hỏi sự kiên nhẫn và kỹ năng.', '{\"en\": \"The local market sells beautiful items made by people who practice traditional craft.\", \"vi\": \"Chợ địa phương bán những mặt hàng đẹp mắt được làm bởi những người thực hành nghề thủ công truyền thống.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-ljspeech-8e3e95f3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-cori-8e3e95f3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/craft-38a75b6b.webp', '[\"handicraft\", \"trade\", \"skill\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"traditional craft\", \"meaning\": \"nghề thủ công truyền thống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"arts and crafts\", \"meaning\": \"nghệ thuật và thủ công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"art\", \"note_vi\": \"art thiên về nghệ thuật sáng tạo, craft thiên về kỹ năng làm bằng tay\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"craftsman\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"crafty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-cori-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru0-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru5-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru6-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru10-8e3e95f3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru9-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru3-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru7-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru8-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru2-8e3e95f3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-ljspeech-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt408-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt138-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt624-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt396-8e3e95f3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt498-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt132-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt288-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt42-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt90-8e3e95f3.mp3\"]}}', 'Craft vừa là danh từ chỉ nghề thủ công, vừa có thể làm động từ nghĩa là chế tác khéo léo.', 'shopping', 1, 23),
('010a7c98-58e0-59cb-862c-7f66869603b4', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '14a92d46-8fc4-558b-82de-65258d67f5a9', '3dfb8f7f-c50f-5639-b176-bc4d2f514475', 'edit', 'UK: /ˈedɪt/ | US: /ˈedɪt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'bản chỉnh sửa', 'A change or modification made to a piece of written material, video, or audio text.', 'The author made several edits before publication.', 'Tác giả đã thực hiện một số chỉnh sửa trước khi xuất bản.', '{\"en\": \"The manager approved the final edit of the promotional brochure before sending it to print.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã phê duyệt bản chỉnh sửa cuối cùng của cuốn cẩm nang quảng cáo trước khi gửi đi in.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-ljspeech-9ead47a8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-cori-9ead47a8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/edit-a3a52503.webp', '[\"revision\", \"alteration\", \"modification\", \"correction\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"final edit\", \"meaning\": \"bản chỉnh sửa cuối cùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make edits\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện các chỉnh sửa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"audit\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Audit\' là kiểm toán tài chính hoặc kiểm tra quy trình, còn \'edit\' là chỉnh sửa văn bản/nội dung.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"edit\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"edition\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"editor\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"editorial\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-cori-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru0-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru5-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru6-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru10-9ead47a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru9-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru3-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru7-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru8-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-aru2-9ead47a8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-ljspeech-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt408-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt138-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt624-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt396-9ead47a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt498-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt132-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt288-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt42-9ead47a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edit-lt90-9ead47a8.mp3\"]}}', '\'Edit\' có thể là động từ (chỉnh sửa) hoặc danh từ (sự chỉnh sửa/bản chỉnh sửa). Dạng danh từ chỉ người là \'editor\'.', 'media', 1, 24),
('3306cf37-29f5-58fe-b490-cc883c035c32', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '14a92d46-8fc4-558b-82de-65258d67f5a9', '3dfb8f7f-c50f-5639-b176-bc4d2f514475', 'exclamation mark', '/ˌekskləˈmeɪʃn̩ mɑːk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Dấu câu (!) dùng để thể hiện cảm xúc mạnh hoặc sự ngạc nhiên.', 'a symbol written after a sentence to show excitement or strong feeling.', 'Remember to use an exclamation mark at the end of an excited sentence!', 'Hãy nhớ dùng dấu chấm than ở cuối câu biểu lộ sự phấn khích!', '{\"en\": \"Please do not use an exclamation mark in formal business emails to clients.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng không dùng dấu chấm than trong email công việc trang trọng gửi khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-ljspeech-19e01f14.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-cori-19e01f14.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exclamation-mark-e56994a5.webp', '[\"exclamation point\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"use an exclamation mark\", \"meaning\": \"dùng dấu chấm than\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"question mark\", \"note_vi\": \"question mark là dấu hỏi chấm (?).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-cori-19e01f14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-aru0-19e01f14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-aru5-19e01f14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-aru6-19e01f14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-aru10-19e01f14.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-aru9-19e01f14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-aru3-19e01f14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-aru7-19e01f14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-aru8-19e01f14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-aru2-19e01f14.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-ljspeech-19e01f14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-lt408-19e01f14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-lt138-19e01f14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-lt624-19e01f14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-lt396-19e01f14.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-lt498-19e01f14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-lt132-19e01f14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-lt288-19e01f14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-lt42-19e01f14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exclamation-mark-lt90-19e01f14.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong tiếng Anh Mỹ, người ta thường dùng \'exclamation point\' nhiều hơn.', 'office', 1, 25),
('3becc82e-30c0-541c-b664-95c376a691dd', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '14a92d46-8fc4-558b-82de-65258d67f5a9', '3dfb8f7f-c50f-5639-b176-bc4d2f514475', 'economical', 'UK: /ˌiːkəˈnɒmɪkəl/ | US: /ˌɛkəˈnɑmɪkəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'tiết kiệm, hiệu quả về chi phí', 'Giving good value or service in relation to the amount of money, time, or effort spent.', 'The company seeks economical solutions to reduce expenses.', 'Công ty tìm kiếm các giải pháp tiết kiệm để giảm chi phí.', '{\"en\": \"Switching to energy-efficient LED lighting is an economical choice for large office buildings.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyển sang chiếu sáng bằng đèn LED tiết kiệm năng lượng là một lựa chọn tiết kiệm chi phí cho các tòa nhà văn phòng lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-ljspeech-49462195.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-cori-49462195.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/economical-127027e7.webp', '[\"cost-effective\", \"thrifty\", \"frugal\", \"saving\"]', '[\"extravagant\", \"wasteful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"economical choice\", \"meaning\": \"lựa chọn tiết kiệm chi phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"economical option\", \"meaning\": \"phương án tiết kiệm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"economic\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Economical\' có nghĩa là tiết kiệm tiền/chi phí, còn \'economic\' liên quan đến hoạt động/thị trường kinh tế.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"economy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"economic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"economically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-cori-49462195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-aru0-49462195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-aru5-49462195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-aru6-49462195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-aru10-49462195.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-aru9-49462195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-aru3-49462195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-aru7-49462195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-aru8-49462195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-aru2-49462195.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-ljspeech-49462195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-lt408-49462195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-lt138-49462195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-lt624-49462195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-lt396-49462195.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-lt498-49462195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-lt132-49462195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-lt288-49462195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-lt42-49462195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economical-lt90-49462195.mp3\"]}}', '\'Economical\' miêu tả máy móc, phương pháp giúp tiết kiệm chi phí/năng lượng. Đừng nhầm với \'economic\' (thuộc kinh tế).', 'office', 1, 26),
('92bf529f-465b-5d26-9a62-a61a96095c7a', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '14a92d46-8fc4-558b-82de-65258d67f5a9', '3dfb8f7f-c50f-5639-b176-bc4d2f514475', 'first floor', '/fɜːst flɔː/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Tầng ngay trên tầng trệt của một tòa nhà (theo cách dùng của Anh).', 'the level of a building that is level with the ground, or the level above it.', 'Our office is located on the first floor, just above the main entrance.', 'Văn phòng của chúng tôi nằm ở tầng một, ngay trên lối vào chính.', '{\"en\": \"The human resources department is located on the first floor of the main building.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng nhân sự nằm ở tầng một của tòa nhà chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-floor-ljspeech-94e27b28.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-floor-cori-94e27b28.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/first-floor-e1080ca4.webp', '[\"ground floor\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"on the first floor\", \"meaning\": \"ở tầng một\"}, {\"phrase\": \"first floor lobby\", \"meaning\": \"sảnh tầng một\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ground floor\", \"note_vi\": \"Anh-Anh dùng ground floor cho tầng trệt, first floor cho tầng hai\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-floor-cori-94e27b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-floor-aru0-94e27b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-floor-aru5-94e27b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-floor-aru6-94e27b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-floor-aru10-94e27b28.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-floor-aru9-94e27b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-floor-aru3-94e27b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-floor-aru7-94e27b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/first-floor-aru8-94e27b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati