('9ba4a808-ab35-5e76-8194-121f4edd3f3a', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '22697786-e692-5965-a503-7f8f377c7533', 'c8280924-93d0-55c8-9554-334592519fee', 'eager', 'UK: /ˈiːɡə/ | US: /ˈiːɡər/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Háo hức, nhiệt tình', 'strongly wanting to do or have something, showing keen interest and enthusiasm.', 'She was eager to start her new job.', 'Cô ấy háo hức bắt đầu công việc mới của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The new recruits are eager to learn about the company\'s new software system.\", \"vi\": \"Những nhân viên mới tuyển dụng rất háo hức muốn tìm hiểu về hệ thống phần mềm mới của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-ljspeech-a5a6b9cc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-cori-a5a6b9cc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eager-e19c1751.webp', '[\"enthusiastic\", \"keen\", \"excited\"]', '[\"unenthusiastic\", \"indifferent\", \"reluctant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be eager to learn\", \"meaning\": \"háo hức học hỏi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"eagerly anticipated\", \"meaning\": \"được háo hức chờ đón\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"eagerly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"eagerness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-cori-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru0-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru5-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru6-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru10-a5a6b9cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru9-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru3-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru7-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru8-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru2-a5a6b9cc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-ljspeech-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt408-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt138-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt624-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt396-a5a6b9cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt498-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt132-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt288-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt42-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt90-a5a6b9cc.mp3\"]}}', '\'eager\' luôn đi với cấu trúc \'be eager to + V\' (háo hức làm gì) hoặc \'be eager for + N\' (háo hức chờ điều gì).', 'personnel', 1, 1),
('3f4c4826-50c3-51fc-884c-b684c992ed9e', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '22697786-e692-5965-a503-7f8f377c7533', 'c8280924-93d0-55c8-9554-334592519fee', 'poetry', '/ˈpəʊətri/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Thể loại văn học dùng ngôn ngữ có vần điệu, nhịp điệu để biểu đạt cảm xúc.', 'literary works written in verse with rhythmic and aesthetic quality.', 'She enjoys reading poetry, especially works by classic poets.', 'Cô ấy thích đọc thơ, đặc biệt là các tác phẩm của các nhà thơ cổ điển.', '{\"en\": \"The company published a book of poetry for the annual event.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty xuất bản một tập thơ cho sự kiện thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-ljspeech-0e23246b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-cori-0e23246b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/poetry-3ee214d2.webp', NULL, '[\"prose\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"write poetry\", \"meaning\": \"viết thơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"classical poetry\", \"meaning\": \"thơ cổ điển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"poetry collection\", \"meaning\": \"tập thơ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"poem\", \"note_vi\": \"poem là bài thơ cụ thể, poetry là thi ca nói chung.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"poet\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"poetic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"poetically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-cori-0e23246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-aru0-0e23246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-aru5-0e23246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-aru6-0e23246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-aru10-0e23246b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-aru9-0e23246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-aru3-0e23246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-aru7-0e23246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-aru8-0e23246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-aru2-0e23246b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-ljspeech-0e23246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-lt408-0e23246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-lt138-0e23246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-lt624-0e23246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-lt396-0e23246b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-lt498-0e23246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-lt132-0e23246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-lt288-0e23246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-lt42-0e23246b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poetry-lt90-0e23246b.mp3\"]}}', 'Poetry không đếm được, dùng \'a poem\' cho bài thơ đơn lẻ.', 'media', 1, 2),
('265a8b53-50cf-5961-8be1-412116bf2772', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '22697786-e692-5965-a503-7f8f377c7533', 'c8280924-93d0-55c8-9554-334592519fee', 'intransitive verb', '/ɪnˈtrænsɪtɪv vɜːb/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Động từ không cần tân ngữ trực tiếp để hoàn thành nghĩa.', 'a word that describes an action but does not need an object to complete its meaning.', 'The verb \"sleep\" is an intransitive verb because it doesn\'t take a direct object.', 'Động từ \"sleep\" là một nội động từ vì nó không cần tân ngữ trực tiếp.', '{\"en\": \"The instructor explained that an intransitive verb cannot be followed directly by a direct object.\", \"vi\": \"Giảng viên giải thích rằng nội động từ không thể theo sau trực tiếp bởi một tân ngữ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-ljspeech-3e9eb862.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-cori-3e9eb862.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intransitive-verb-720e8b43.webp', NULL, '[\"transitive verb\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"use an intransitive verb\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng nội động từ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"identify an intransitive verb\", \"meaning\": \"nhận diện nội động từ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-cori-3e9eb862.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-aru0-3e9eb862.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-aru5-3e9eb862.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-aru6-3e9eb862.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-aru10-3e9eb862.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-aru9-3e9eb862.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-aru3-3e9eb862.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-aru7-3e9eb862.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-aru8-3e9eb862.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-aru2-3e9eb862.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-ljspeech-3e9eb862.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-lt408-3e9eb862.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-lt138-3e9eb862.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-lt624-3e9eb862.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-lt396-3e9eb862.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-lt498-3e9eb862.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-lt132-3e9eb862.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-lt288-3e9eb862.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-lt42-3e9eb862.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intransitive-verb-lt90-3e9eb862.mp3\"]}}', 'Ghi nhớ: nội động từ không tác động trực tiếp lên đối tượng nào cả.', 'academic', 1, 3),
('7ab3fcad-d353-5cf5-9780-a58f350a975b', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '22697786-e692-5965-a503-7f8f377c7533', 'c8280924-93d0-55c8-9554-334592519fee', 'avenue', '/ˈævənjuː/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Con đường lớn, rộng, thường có cây xanh hai bên.', 'a wide street in a town or city, often with trees along it.', 'They live on a beautiful avenue lined with old oak trees.', 'Họ sống trên một đại lộ tuyệt đẹp với những hàng cây sồi cổ thụ.', '{\"en\": \"Our new corporate headquarters will be located on a busy avenue in the city center.\", \"vi\": \"Trụ sở công ty mới của chúng ta sẽ nằm trên một đại lộ sầm uất ở trung tâm thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avenue-ljspeech-fccce48f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avenue-cori-fccce48f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/avenue-13597671.webp', '[\"boulevard\", \"street\", \"road\"]', '[\"alley\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tree-lined avenue\", \"meaning\": \"đại lộ rợp bóng cây\"}, {\"phrase\": \"broad avenue\", \"meaning\": \"đại lộ rộng lớn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"street\", \"note_vi\": \"avenue thường rộng hơn và có cây hai bên so với street\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avenue-cori-fccce48f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avenue-aru0-fccce48f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avenue-aru5-fccce48f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avenue-aru6-fccce48f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avenue-aru10-fccce48f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avenue-aru9-fccce48f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avenue-aru3-fccce48f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avenue-aru7-fccce48f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avenue-aru8-fccce48f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avenue-aru2-fccce48f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/stora