('d4620dc4-c699-5ac3-abf3-855a25432311', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '22697786-e692-5965-a503-7f8f377c7533', 'c8280924-93d0-55c8-9554-334592519fee', 'feasibility', 'UK: /ˌfiːzəˈbɪləti/ | US: /ˌfiːzəˈbɪləti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'tính khả thi', 'The state or degree of being easily or conveniently done or achieved.', 'The feasibility of the project is currently under review.', 'Tính khả thi của dự án hiện đang được xem xét.', '{\"en\": \"Before investing in the new facility, the board requested a detailed feasibility study.\", \"vi\": \"Trước khi đầu tư vào cơ sở mới, hội đồng quản trị đã yêu cầu một nghiên cứu tính khả thi chi tiết.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-ljspeech-dd45fbb5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-cori-dd45fbb5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/feasibility-1c11caac.webp', '[\"viability\", \"practicability\", \"workability\"]', '[\"unfeasibility\", \"impracticability\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feasibility study\", \"meaning\": \"nghiên cứu tính khả thi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"assess the feasibility\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá tính khả thi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"feasible\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"feasibly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-cori-dd45fbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-aru0-dd45fbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-aru5-dd45fbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-aru6-dd45fbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-aru10-dd45fbb5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-aru9-dd45fbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-aru3-dd45fbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-aru7-dd45fbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-aru8-dd45fbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-aru2-dd45fbb5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-ljspeech-dd45fbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-lt408-dd45fbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-lt138-dd45fbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-lt624-dd45fbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-lt396-dd45fbb5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-lt498-dd45fbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-lt132-dd45fbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-lt288-dd45fbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-lt42-dd45fbb5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feasibility-lt90-dd45fbb5.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay đi cùng danh từ \'study\' tạo thành cụm từ cố định \'feasibility study\' (nghiên cứu tính khả thi của dự án).', 'project management', 1, 14),
('b7de5326-1497-5384-a89b-fe380f199986', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '22697786-e692-5965-a503-7f8f377c7533', 'c8280924-93d0-55c8-9554-334592519fee', 'retire', '/rɪˈtaɪə(r)/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Ngừng làm việc vì đã đến tuổi hoặc vì lý do sức khỏe.', 'To leave one\'s employment and cease working upon reaching a designated official age.', 'Many senior staff members decide to retire after completing thirty years of service.', 'Nhiều nhân viên lâu năm quyết định nghỉ hưu sau khi hoàn tất ba mươi năm công tác.', '{\"en\": \"The senior accountant decided to retire after thirty years of dedicated service to the company.\", \"vi\": \"Kế toán trưởng quyết định nghỉ hưu sau ba mươi năm cống hiến tận tụy cho công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retire-ljspeech-f5a82842.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retire-cori-f5a82842.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/retire-ea92dc0b.webp', '[\"resign\", \"quit\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"retire from\", \"meaning\": \"nghỉ hưu từ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"early retirement\", \"meaning\": \"nghỉ hưu sớm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"retiree\", \"note_vi\": \"Retire là động từ, còn retiree là danh từ chỉ người đã nghỉ hưu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"retirement\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"retired\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retire-cori-f5a82842.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retire-aru0-f5a82842.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retire-aru5-f5a82842.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retire-aru6-f5a82842.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retire-aru10-f5a82842.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retire-aru9-f5a82842.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retire-aru3-f5a82842.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retire-aru7-f5a82842.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object