('7a8a2d5b-6695-5f24-9bb0-b562f9591c21', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '22697786-e692-5965-a503-7f8f377c7533', 'c8280924-93d0-55c8-9554-334592519fee', 'pet', '/pet/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Động vật được nuôi trong nhà để bầu bạn, giải trí.', 'an animal that you keep in your home for pleasure and companionship.', 'Many people find comfort and joy in having a pet like a dog or a cat.', 'Nhiều người tìm thấy sự an ủi và niềm vui khi nuôi một con thú cưng như chó hoặc mèo.', '{\"en\": \"The company policy strictly prohibits employees from bringing any pet to the office.\", \"vi\": \"Quy định của công ty nghiêm cấm nhân viên mang bất kỳ thú cưng nào đến văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-ljspeech-1b034c38.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-cori-1b034c38.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pet-c35f7dbf.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"house pet\", \"meaning\": \"thú cưng trong nhà\"}, {\"phrase\": \"family pet\", \"meaning\": \"thú cưng của gia đình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pat\", \"note_vi\": \"vỗ nhẹ, khác hoàn toàn về nghĩa\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"pet\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-cori-1b034c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-aru0-1b034c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-aru5-1b034c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-aru6-1b034c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-aru10-1b034c38.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-aru9-1b034c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-aru3-1b034c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-aru7-1b034c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-aru8-1b034c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-aru2-1b034c38.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-ljspeech-1b034c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-lt408-1b034c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-lt138-1b034c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-lt624-1b034c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-lt396-1b034c38.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-lt498-1b034c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-lt132-1b034c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-lt288-1b034c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-lt42-1b034c38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pet-lt90-1b034c38.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này còn được dùng như một động từ mang nghĩa vuốt ve.', 'office', 1, 20),
('8bcfaeb9-f1d3-5b35-9a2b-109884e84fd5', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '22697786-e692-5965-a503-7f8f377c7533', 'c8280924-93d0-55c8-9554-334592519fee', 'parallel', '/ˈpærəlel/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Hai đường hoặc mặt phẳng không bao giờ gặp nhau.', 'two lines or objects that stay the same distance apart and never touch.', 'The two roads run parallel to each other for several miles before diverging.', 'Hai con đường chạy song song với nhau trong vài dặm trước khi tách ra.', '{\"en\": \"The new office desks are arranged in parallel rows to maximize the available floor space.\", \"vi\": \"Các bàn làm việc mới được sắp xếp thành các hàng song song để tối đa hóa không gian sàn có sẵn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-ljspeech-1a925201.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-cori-1a925201.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/parallel-fce2e8bf.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"run parallel\", \"meaning\": \"chạy song song\"}, {\"phrase\": \"parallel to\", \"meaning\": \"song song với\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-cori-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru0-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru5-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru6-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru10-1a925201.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru9-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru3-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru7-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru8-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-aru2-1a925201.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-ljspeech-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt408-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt138-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt624-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt396-1a925201.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt498-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt132-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt288-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt42-1a925201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parallel-lt90-1a925201.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng trong toán học hoặc mô tả cách sắp xếp đồ đạc, quy trình công việc.', 'office', 1, 21),
('c58bacc8-c293-5937-ba04-200e8fa9d0de', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '22697786-e692-5965-a503-7f8f377c7533', 'c8280924-93d0-55c8-9554-334592519fee', 'souvenir', '/ˌsuːvəˈnɪə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Món đồ mua hoặc giữ lại để gợi nhớ về một nơi hoặc sự kiện.', 'something that you buy or keep to remind yourself of a place you have visited.', 'She picked a handmade wooden handicraft as a souvenir for her colleague in London.', 'Cô ấy đã chọn một sản phẩm thủ công mỹ nghệ bằng gỗ làm món quà lưu niệm cho đồng nghiệp ở Luân Đôn.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel gift shop sells various local souvenirs for guests visiting the city on business trips.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng quà tặng của khách sạn bán nhiều loại quà lưu niệm địa phương cho khách đến thành phố công tác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-ljspeech-e59e3db3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-cori-e59e3db3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/souvenir-2028d3d0.webp', '[\"memento\", \"keepsake\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"buy a souvenir\", \"meaning\": \"mua quà lưu niệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keep as a souvenir\", \"meaning\": \"giữ làm kỷ niệm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-cori-e59e3db3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-aru0-e59e3db3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-aru5-e59e3db3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-aru6-e59e3db3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-aru10-e59e3db3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-aru9-e59e3db3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-aru3-e59e3db3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-aru7-e59e3db3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-aru8-e59e3db3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-aru2-e59e3db3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-ljspeech-e59e3db3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-lt408-e59e3db3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-lt138-e59e3db3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-lt624-e59e3db3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-lt396-e59e3db3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-lt498-e59e3db3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-lt132-e59e3db3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-lt288-e59e3db3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-lt42-e59e3db3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/souvenir-lt90-e59e3db3.mp3\"]}}', 'Trọng âm rơi vào âm tiết cuối: /ˌsuːvəˈnɪər/.', 'travel', 1, 22),
('67c2c51b-3977-5a12-bce9-8525777a5648', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '22697786-e692-5965-a503-7f8f377c7533', 'c8280924-93d0-55c8-9554-334592519fee', 'abroad', '/əˈbrɔːd/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'ở hoặc đến một quốc gia khác.', 'in or to a foreign country, away from your home country.', 'Many students choose to study abroad to experience different cultures.', 'Nhiều sinh viên chọn đi du học để trải nghiệm các nền văn hóa khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was sent abroad to negotiate a new trade deal with partners.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý được cử ra nước ngoài để đàm phán hợp đồng thương mại mới với đối tác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-ljspeech-5fcf5cdf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-cori-5fcf5cdf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/abroad-e5d15781.webp', '[\"overseas\", \"internationally\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"study abroad\", \"meaning\": \"du học nước ngoài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work abroad\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc ở nước ngoài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"travel abroad\", \"meaning\": \"đi du lịch nước ngoài\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"board\", \"note_vi\": \"\'abroad\' là nước ngoài, \'board\' là bảng hoặc lên tàu/máy bay\"}, {\"word\": \"broad\", \"note_vi\": \"\'broad\' nghĩa là rộng, không liên quan đến địa lý\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-cori-5fcf5cdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-aru0-5fcf5cdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-aru5-5fcf5cdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-aru6-5fcf5cdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-aru10-5fcf5cdf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-aru9-5fcf5cdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-aru3-5fcf5cdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-aru7-5fcf5cdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-aru8-5fcf5cdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-aru2-5fcf5cdf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-ljspeech-5fcf5cdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-lt408-5fcf5cdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-lt138-5fcf5cdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-lt624-5fcf5cdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-lt396-5fcf5cdf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-lt498-5fcf5cdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-lt132-5fcf5cdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-lt288-5fcf5cdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-lt42-5fcf5cdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abroad-lt90-5fcf5cdf.mp3\"]}}', '\'Abroad\' là trạng từ, không dùng \'go to abroad\' mà chỉ dùng \'go abroad\'.', 'travel', 1, 23),
('1cea11a9-d401-5529-8793-70716a362c3d', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '22697786-e692-5965-a503-7f8f377c7533', 'c8280924-93d0-55c8-9554-334592519fee', 'tornado', '/tɔːˈneɪdəʊ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'cơn lốc xoáy dữ dội có hình dạng cột quay tròn.', 'a violent storm with very strong winds that move in a circle.', 'The small town was devastated after a powerful tornado swept through it.', 'Thị trấn nhỏ bị tàn phá sau khi một cơn lốc xoáy mạnh quét qua.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse operations were suspended because a tornado warning was issued for the local area.\", \"vi\": \"Hoạt động kho bãi đã bị đình chỉ vì cảnh báo lốc xoáy được đưa ra cho khu vực địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tornado-ljspeech-474446ad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tornado-cori-474446ad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tornado-02e21229.webp', '[\"cyclone\", \"twister\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tornado warning\", \"meaning\": \"cảnh báo lốc xoáy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tornado damage\", \"meaning\": \"thiệt hại do lốc xoáy\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tornado-cori-474446ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tornado-aru0-474446ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tornado-aru5-474446ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tornado-aru6-474446ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tornado-aru10-474446ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tornado-aru9-474446ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tornado-aru3-474446ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tornado-aru7-474446ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tornado-aru8-474446ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tornado-aru2-474446ad.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tornado-ljspeech-474446ad.