('dd76f15e-e270-5c71-9183-4e6937672e7c', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '22697786-e692-5965-a503-7f8f377c7533', 'c8280924-93d0-55c8-9554-334592519fee', 'downstairs', '/ˌdaʊnˈsteəz/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Tầng thấp hơn hoặc khu vực ở tầng dưới của một tòa nhà.', 'the lower floor or ground floor of a house or building.', 'The kitchen is downstairs, so we need to go down to eat.', 'Nhà bếp ở tầng dưới, vì vậy chúng ta cần đi xuống để ăn.', '{\"en\": \"The downstairs of our office building features a modern reception area and a cafeteria.\", \"vi\": \"Tầng dưới của tòa nhà văn phòng chúng tôi có khu vực lễ tân hiện đại và một nhà ăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-ljspeech-83663496.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-cori-83663496.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/downstairs-5bd7f98d.webp', '[\"ground floor\", \"lower floor\"]', '[\"upstairs\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"clean the downstairs\", \"meaning\": \"dọn dẹp tầng dưới\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"downward\", \"note_vi\": \"downward là tính từ/trạng từ chỉ hướng đi xuống, downstairs là tầng dưới.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-cori-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru0-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru5-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru6-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru10-83663496.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru9-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru3-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru7-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru8-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-aru2-83663496.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-ljspeech-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt408-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt138-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt624-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt396-83663496.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt498-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt132-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt288-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt42-83663496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/downstairs-lt90-83663496.mp3\"]}}', 'Downstairs thường dùng làm trạng từ, nhưng cũng có thể làm danh từ chỉ tầng dưới.', 'housing', 1, 25),
('03be7b7e-8ef9-5c59-bb56-a677db828832', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '22697786-e692-5965-a503-7f8f377c7533', 'c8280924-93d0-55c8-9554-334592519fee', 'for the time being', '/fə ðə taɪm biːɪŋ/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Tạm thời, trong khoảng thời gian hiện tại.', 'used to say that something is true or will happen only until something else changes.', 'We\'ll stay at this hotel for the time being until we find an apartment.', 'Tạm thời chúng tôi sẽ ở khách sạn này cho đến khi tìm được căn hộ.', '{\"en\": \"The company will use paper invoices for the time being.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty sẽ sử dụng hóa đơn giấy trong lúc này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-ljspeech-3ce506b3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-cori-3ce506b3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/for-the-time-being-d8f641a4.webp', '[\"for now\", \"for the moment\"]', '[\"permanently\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"for the time being only\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ trong lúc này\"}, {\"phrase\": \"just for the time being\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ tạm thời\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-cori-3ce506b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-aru0-3ce506b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-aru5-3ce506b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-aru6-3ce506b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-aru10-3ce506b3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-aru9-3ce506b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-aru3-3ce506b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-aru7-3ce506b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-aru8-3ce506b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-aru2-3ce506b3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-ljspeech-3ce506b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-lt408-3ce506b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-lt138-3ce506b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-lt624-3ce506b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-lt396-3ce506b3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-lt498-3ce506b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-lt132-3ce506b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-lt288-3ce506b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-lt42-3ce506b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-the-time-being-lt90-3ce506b3.mp3\"]}}', '', 'office', 1, 26),
('a540c163-e70b-5a50-a261-496aa3fa323d', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '22697786-e692-5965-a503-7f8f377c7533', 'c8280924-93d0-55c8-9554-334592519fee', 'familiar', 'UK: /fəˈmɪliə/ | US: /fəˈmɪliər/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'quen thuộc', 'Well known or easily recognized from previous experience or close association.', 'I am familiar with the new software.', 'Tôi đã quen thuộc với phần mềm mới.', '{\"en\": \"All new hires must become familiar with the employee handbook within their first week.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên mới phải làm quen với sổ tay nhân viên trong tuần đầu tiên của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-ljspeech-1b7e649f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-cori-1b7e649f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/familiar-ca9f2a69.webp', '[\"accustomed\", \"acquainted\", \"known\"]', '[\"unfamiliar\", \"strange\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be familiar with\", \"meaning\": \"quen thuộc / hiểu biết rõ về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"familiar surroundings\", \"meaning\": \"môi trường quen thuộc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"familiarize\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"familiarity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-cori-1b7e649f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-aru0-1b7e649f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-aru5-1b7e649f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-aru6-1b7e649f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-aru10-1b7e649f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-aru9-1b7e649f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-aru3-1b7e649f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-aru7-1b7e649f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-aru8-1b7e649f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-aru2-1b7e649f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-ljspeech-1b7e649f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-lt408-1b7e649f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-lt138-1b7e649f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-lt624-1b7e649f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-lt396-1b7e649f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-lt498-1b7e649f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-lt132-1b7e649f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-lt288-1b7e649f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-lt42-1b7e649f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/familiar-lt90-1b7e649f.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt: be familiar WITH something (quen với cái gì) và be familiar TO someone (quen thuộc đối với ai).', 'human resources', 1, 27),
('301684eb-0cef-515e-a28a-8a4efdccb566', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '22697786-e692-5965-a503-7f8f377c7533', 'c8280924-93d0-55c8-9554-334592519fee', 'sightseeing', '/ˈsaɪtsiːɪŋ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hoạt động đi thăm thú các địa điểm nổi tiếng, ngắm cảnh.', 'the activity of visiting interesting places and famous buildings while on a holiday or a trip.', 'We spent the whole day sightseeing in Paris, visiting the Eiffel Tower and the Louvre.', 'Chúng tôi dành cả ngày để tham quan ở Paris, ghé thăm Tháp Eiffel và bảo tàng Louvre.', '{\"en\": \"Our business trip schedule allows us some free time for sightseeing around the historic city center.\", \"vi\": \"Lịch trình chuyến công tác cho phép chúng tôi có thời gian rảnh để tham quan trung tâm thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-ljspeech-f4c00539.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-cori-f4c00539.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sightseeing-5477ff3c.webp', '[\"touring\", \"sightseeing trip\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"go sightseeing\", \"meaning\": \"đi tham quan\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sightseeing tour\", \"meaning\": \"chuyến tham quan\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sightsee\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-cori-f4c00539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-aru0-f4c00539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-aru5-f4c00539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-aru6-f4c00539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-aru10-f4c00539.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-aru9-f4c00539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-aru3-f4c00539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-aru7-f4c00539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-aru8-f4c00539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-aru2-f4c00539.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-ljspeech-f4c00539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-lt408-f4c00539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-lt138-f4c00539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-lt624-f4c00539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-lt396-f4c00539.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-lt498-f4c00539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-lt132-f4c00539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-lt288-f4c00539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-lt42-f4c00539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sightseeing-lt90-f4c00539.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với động từ \'go\' (go sightseeing).', 'travel', 1, 28),
('358b5154-0173-5a17-8183-0352a4688f59', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '22697786-e692-5965-a503-7f8f377c7533', 'c8280924-93d0-55c8-9554-334592519fee', 'worried', '/ˈwʌrid/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy lo lắng, không yên tâm về điều gì đó.', 'feeling unhappy and afraid because you are thinking about problems or unpleasant things.', 'She was very worried about her exam results, even though she had studied hard.', 'Cô ấy rất lo lắng về kết quả thi của mình, mặc dù cô ấy đã học rất chăm chỉ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was worried about the delay in shipping the products to the client.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc đã lo lắng về sự chậm trễ trong việc vận chuyển sản phẩm đến khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-ljspeech-7c3dc388.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-cori-7c3dc388.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/worried-0a27c451.webp', '[\"anxious\", \"concerned\", \"apprehensive\"]', '[\"calm\", \"confident\", \"relaxed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"worried about\", \"meaning\": \"lo lắng về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"look worried\", \"meaning\": \"trông có vẻ lo lắng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"worrying\", \"note_vi\": \"worrying là gây lo lắng (chủ động), worried là cảm thấy lo lắng (bị động).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"worry\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"worry\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"worrying\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-cori-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru0-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru5-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru6-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru10-7c3dc388.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru9-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru3-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru7-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru8-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-aru2-7c3dc388.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-ljspeech-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt408-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt138-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt624-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt396-7c3dc388.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt498-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt132-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt288-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt42-7c3dc388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worried-lt90-7c3dc388.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'about\' hoặc \'that\' + mệnh đề.', 'hr', 1, 29),
('1d20c425-1284-54d3-945f-eb9d00628073', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '2ff3bb37-4187-5dea-b09b-013b73756946', 'f66367b2-933b-59ff-a29d-8d1030a9b3d1', 'credit', '/ˈkredɪt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'sự tin tưởng vào khả năng thanh toán nợ, hoặc số tiền được cấp.', 'an arrangement to receive goods or money now and pay for them later.', 'It\'s important to build good credit if you want to borrow money in the future.', 'Điều quan trọng là phải xây dựng tín dụng tốt nếu bạn muốn vay tiền trong tương lai.', '{\"en\": \"Customers can purchase new office equipment on credit with low monthly interest rates.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng có thể mua thiết bị văn phòng mới bằng tín dụng với lãi suất hàng tháng thấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-ljspeech-9cf5e7cd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-cori-9cf5e7cd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/credit-302e1372.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"credit card\", \"meaning\": \"thẻ tín dụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"credit limit\", \"meaning\": \"hạn mức tín dụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"credit score\", \"meaning\": \"điểm tín dụng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"debit\", \"note_vi\": \"debit là trừ tiền trực tiếp từ tài khoản, credit là vay nợ trước trả sau\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"creditor\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"credible\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-cori-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru0-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru5-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru6-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru10-9cf5e7cd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru9-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru3-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru7-9