('ac24bff9-94bc-51f1-9cbc-e3f2ecef682a', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '2ff3bb37-4187-5dea-b09b-013b73756946', 'f66367b2-933b-59ff-a29d-8d1030a9b3d1', 'endangered', '/ɪnˈdeɪndʒəd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Đang đối mặt với nguy cơ tuyệt chủng hoặc biến mất.', 'describing a group of living things that are at risk of disappearing from the earth forever.', 'Many species of animals are currently endangered due to habitat loss.', 'Nhiều loài động vật hiện đang bị đe dọa do mất môi trường sống.', '{\"en\": \"The company is funding a project to protect several endangered species in the local forest area.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đang tài trợ cho một dự án bảo vệ một số loài bị đe dọa trong khu vực rừng địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-ljspeech-7896a9df.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-cori-7896a9df.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/endangered-ad8be42d.webp', '[\"threatened\", \"vulnerable\"]', '[\"safe\", \"protected\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"endangered species\", \"meaning\": \"loài bị đe dọa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"critically endangered\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ nguy cấp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"endanger\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"danger\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-cori-7896a9df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-aru0-7896a9df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-aru5-7896a9df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-aru6-7896a9df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-aru10-7896a9df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-aru9-7896a9df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-aru3-7896a9df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endangered-aru7-7896a9df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2