('d388335d-e435-5f9f-b634-f35563c1c10c', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '2ff3bb37-4187-5dea-b09b-013b73756946', 'f66367b2-933b-59ff-a29d-8d1030a9b3d1', 'calendar', '/ˈkælɪndə(r)/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Sổ hoặc bảng ghi ngày, tháng, năm.', 'a document or digital tool that shows the days, weeks, and months of the year.', 'I marked my appointments on the calendar so I wouldn\'t forget them.', 'Tôi đã đánh dấu các cuộc hẹn của mình trên lịch để không quên.', '{\"en\": \"Please mark the deadline on your calendar so that we can finish the project on time.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đánh dấu hạn chót trên lịch của bạn để chúng ta có thể hoàn thành dự án đúng hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-ljspeech-e4ffacba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-cori-e4ffacba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/calendar-a0501e17.webp', '[\"schedule\", \"planner\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"check the calendar\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm tra lịch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wall calendar\", \"meaning\": \"lịch treo tường\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-cori-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru0-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru5-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru6-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru10-e4ffacba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru9-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru3-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru7-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru8-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru2-e4ffacba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-ljspeech-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt408-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt138-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt624-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt396-e4ffacba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt498-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt132-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt288-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt42-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt90-e4ffacba.mp3\"]}}', 'thường dùng để quản lý thời gian và các cuộc hẹn công việc.', 'office', 1, 6),
('3130db50-6377-556b-a6ee-b6874ff0f95e', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '2ff3bb37-4187-5dea-b09b-013b73756946', 'f66367b2-933b-59ff-a29d-8d1030a9b3d1', 'consistent', '/kənˈsɪstənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Nhất quán, không thay đổi, hoặc luôn giữ vững lập trường.', 'always behaving or happening in a similar, especially positive, way over a period of time.', 'The team delivered consistent results throughout the entire fiscal year.', 'Nhóm đã mang lại kết quả nhất quán trong suốt cả năm tài chính.', '{\"en\": \"We need to maintain a consistent level of customer service across all our retail branches.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần duy trì mức độ dịch vụ khách hàng nhất quán trên tất cả các chi nhánh bán lẻ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-ljspeech-8c305a07.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-cori-8c305a07.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/consistent-4d00128c.webp', '[\"steady\", \"constant\", \"reliable\"]', '[\"inconsistent\", \"erratic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"consistent with\", \"meaning\": \"phù hợp với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly consistent\", \"meaning\": \"rất kiên định/nhất quán\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"constant\", \"note_vi\": \"constant là liên tục không ngừng, consistent là nhất quán, không đổi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"consistently\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"consistency\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-cori-8c305a07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-aru0-8c305a07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-aru5-8c305a07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-aru6-8c305a07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-aru10-8c305a07.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-aru9-8c305a07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-aru3-8c305a07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-aru7-8c305a07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-aru8-8c305a07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-aru2-8c305a07.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-ljspeech-8c305a07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-lt408-8c305a07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-lt138-8c305a07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-lt624-8c305a07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-lt396-8c305a07.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-lt498-8c305a07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-lt132-8c305a07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-lt288-8c305a07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-lt42-8c305a07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistent-lt90-8c305a07.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'with\' (consistent with: nhất quán với).', 'business', 1, 7),
('3056dcba-2e88-55d0-80ae-1f73633b7aa8', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '2ff3bb37-4187-5dea-b09b-013b73756946', 'f66367b2-933b-59ff-a29d-8d1030a9b3d1', 'bladder', '/ˈblædə(r)/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Cơ quan trong cơ thể chứa nước tiểu.', 'an organ in the body that holds liquid waste before it is passed.', 'It\'s important to drink enough water to keep your bladder healthy.', 'Điều quan trọng là uống đủ nước để giữ cho bàng quang của bạn khỏe mạnh.', '{\"en\": \"The medical insurance policy covers surgery for conditions related to the kidney and bladder.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách bảo hiểm y tế bao gồm phẫu thuật cho các tình trạng liên quan đến thận và bàng quang.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-ljspeech-03a396ca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-cori-03a396ca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bladder-ce321a29.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"urinary bladder\", \"meaning\": \"bàng quang tiết niệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bladder infection\", \"meaning\": \"nhiễm trùng bàng quang\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-cori-03a396ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-aru0-03a396ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-aru5-03a396ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-aru6-03a396ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-aru10-03a396ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-aru9-03a396ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-aru3-03a396ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-aru7-03a396ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-aru8-03a396ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-aru2-03a396ca.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-ljspeech-03a396ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-lt408-03a396ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-lt138-03a396ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-lt624-03a396ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-lt396-03a396ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-lt498-03a396ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-lt132-03a396ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-lt288-03a396ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-lt42-03a396ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bladder-lt90-03a396ca.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ chuyên ngành y tế, ít gặp trong TOEIC trừ phần bảo hiểm.', 'health', 1, 8),
('f66ea0cd-098d-57e1-9b90-ca4d9434c695', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '2ff3bb37-4187-5dea-b09b-013b73756946', 'f66367b2-933b-59ff-a29d-8d1030a9b3d1', 'amazement', '/əˈmeɪzmənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác rất ngạc nhiên hoặc sửng sốt.', 'A state of overwhelming astonishment caused by extraordinary or unexpected events.', 'To everyone\'s amazement, the young engineer solved the complex computer problem quickly.', 'Trước sự kinh ngạc của mọi người, vị kỹ sư trẻ đã nhanh chóng giải quyết được sự cố máy tính phức tạp.', '{\"en\": \"To the amazement of the board, the new product doubled company sales this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Trước sự kinh ngạc của hội đồng quản trị, sản phẩm mới đã làm tăng gấp đôi doanh số công ty trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-ljspeech-278c42cb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-cori-278c42cb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/amazement-cc79692f.webp', '[\"astonishment\", \"wonder\"]', '[\"indifference\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in amazement\", \"meaning\": \"trong sự kinh ngạc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"to one\'s amazement\", \"meaning\": \"trước sự kinh ngạc của ai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"amusement\", \"note_vi\": \"amusement là sự giải trí, thích thú, còn amazement là sự kinh ngạc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"amaze\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"amazing\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"amazed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-cori-278c42cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-aru0-278c42cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-aru5-278c42cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-aru6-278c42cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-aru10-278c42cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-aru9-278c42cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-aru3-278c42cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-aru7-278c42cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-aru8-278c42cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-aru2-278c42cb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-ljspeech-278c42cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-lt408-278c42cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-lt138-278c42cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-lt624-278c42cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-lt396-278c42cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-lt498-278c42cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-lt132-278c42cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-lt288-278c42cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-lt42-278c42cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amazement-lt90-278c42cb.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'to somebody\'s amazement\' rất hay gặp trong các bài đọc tiếng Anh.', 'business', 1, 9),
('01b9aca3-7ebd-5375-9bb3-950216ccb117', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '2ff3bb37-4187-5dea-b09b-013b73756946', 'f66367b2-933b-59ff-a29d-8d1030a9b3d1', 'shoplift', '/ˈʃɒplɪft/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Lấy trộm hàng hóa từ cửa hàng mà không trả tiền.', 'to take items from a store without paying for them during business hours.', 'The security guard caught a teenager trying to shoplift a video game.', 'Nhân viên bảo vệ đã bắt được một thiếu niên đang cố gắng trộm một trò chơi điện tử.', '{\"en\": \"Security cameras were installed throughout the retail store to prevent customers from attempting to shoplift.\", \"vi\": \"Camera an ninh đã được lắp đặt khắp cửa hàng bán lẻ để ngăn khách hàng cố tình trộm đồ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoplift-ljspeech-da8c7e48.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoplift-cori-da8c7e48.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shoplift-f7191d21.webp', '[\"steal\", \"pilfer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"shoplift items\", \"meaning\": \"trộm hàng hóa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prevent shoplifting\", \"meaning\": \"ngăn chặn nạn trộm cắp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"shoplifter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoplift-cori-da8c7e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoplift-aru0-da8c7e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoplift-aru5-da8c7e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoplift-aru6-da8c7e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoplift-aru10-da8c7e48.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoplift-aru9-da8c7e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoplift-aru3-da8c7e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoplift-aru7-da8c7e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoplift-aru8-da8c7e48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoplift-aru2-da8c7e48.mp