('7bbcfb96-a7ac-5bb1-9da8-fc841b9f780b', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '2ff3bb37-4187-5dea-b09b-013b73756946', 'f66367b2-933b-59ff-a29d-8d1030a9b3d1', 'dormitory', '/ˈdɔːmətri/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Tòa nhà có nhiều phòng ngủ cho sinh viên hoặc người lao động.', 'a large building at a college or university where students live.', 'Many university students choose to live in the dormitory during their first year.', 'Nhiều sinh viên đại học chọn sống trong ký túc xá trong năm đầu tiên.', '{\"en\": \"The university plans to renovate the student dormitory before the new semester begins.\", \"vi\": \"Trường đại học có kế hoạch cải tạo ký túc xá sinh viên trước khi học kỳ mới bắt đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-ljspeech-2cb0256c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-cori-2cb0256c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dormitory-852b5087.webp', '[\"dorm\", \"residence hall\", \"hostel\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dormitory room\", \"meaning\": \"phòng ký túc xá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"college dormitory\", \"meaning\": \"ký túc xá đại học\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"territory\", \"note_vi\": \"territory là lãnh thổ, đuôi -tory giống nhau\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-cori-2cb0256c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-aru0-2cb0256c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-aru5-2cb0256c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-aru6-2cb0256c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-aru10-2cb0256c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-aru9-2cb0256c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-aru3-2cb0256c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-aru7-2cb0256c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-aru8-2cb0256c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-aru2-2cb0256c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-ljspeech-2cb0256c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-lt408-2cb0256c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-lt138-2cb0256c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-lt624-2cb0256c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-lt396-2cb0256c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-lt498-2cb0256c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-lt132-2cb0256c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-lt288-2cb0256c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-lt42-2cb0256c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dormitory-lt90-2cb0256c.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường được viết tắt là dorm trong giao tiếp hàng ngày.', 'housing', 1, 21),
('14bb3d5f-e681-5150-9576-b702a5196bb4', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '2ff3bb37-4187-5dea-b09b-013b73756946', 'f66367b2-933b-59ff-a29d-8d1030a9b3d1', 'tourism', '/ˈtʊərɪzəm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Ngành công nghiệp liên quan đến việc đi du lịch và các dịch vụ cho du khách.', 'the business of providing services for people who are visiting places for pleasure or interest.', 'The local economy relies heavily on tourism during the summer months.', 'Nền kinh tế địa phương phụ thuộc rất nhiều vào du lịch trong những tháng mùa hè.', '{\"en\": \"The local government is investing heavily in tourism to attract more international business travelers annually.\", \"vi\": \"Chính quyền địa phương đang đầu tư mạnh vào du lịch để thu hút thêm khách công tác quốc tế hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-ljspeech-7d8710ce.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-cori-7d8710ce.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tourism-7f01fc3a.webp', '[\"travel\", \"sightseeing\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tourism industry\", \"meaning\": \"ngành du lịch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mass tourism\", \"meaning\": \"du lịch đại chúng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tourist\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"tour\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-cori-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-aru0-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-aru5-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-aru6-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-aru10-7d8710ce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-aru9-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-aru3-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-aru7-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-aru8-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-aru2-7d8710ce.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-ljspeech-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-lt408-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-lt138-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-lt624-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-lt396-7d8710ce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-lt498-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-lt132-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-lt288-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-lt42-7d8710ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tourism-lt90-7d8710ce.mp3\"]}}', 'Tourism là ngành công nghiệp, còn tourist là người đi du lịch.', 'travel', 1, 22),
('96a12375-1fb9-5b4b-b2ab-8f07ec15a958', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '2ff3bb37-4187-5dea-b09b-013b73756946', 'f66367b2-933b-59ff-a29d-8d1030a9b3d1', 'ingredient', '/ɪnˈɡriːdiənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một trong các thành phần dùng để tạo ra món ăn, đồ uống hoặc hỗn hợp.', 'one of the foods or substances that are combined to make a particular dish.', 'Fresh herbs are essential ingredients for this traditional Italian sauce.', 'Các loại thảo mộc tươi là những nguyên liệu thiết yếu cho món sốt Ý truyền thống này.', '{\"en\": \"The chef uses only fresh, organic ingredients to prepare the daily lunch specials.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu bếp chỉ sử dụng các nguyên liệu hữu cơ tươi ngon để chuẩn bị các món đặc biệt cho bữa trưa hàng ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-ljspeech-611a2ab1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-cori-611a2ab1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ingredient-5bca8853.webp', '[\"component\", \"element\", \"constituent\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"key ingredient\", \"meaning\": \"nguyên liệu chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"active ingredient\", \"meaning\": \"hoạt chất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"material\", \"note_vi\": \"material chỉ nguyên vật liệu xây dựng hoặc sản xuất công nghiệp\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-cori-611a2ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-aru0-611a2ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-aru5-611a2ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-aru6-611a2ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-aru10-611a2ab1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-aru9-611a2ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-aru3-611a2ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-aru7-611a2ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-aru8-611a2ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-aru2-611a2ab1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-ljspeech-611a2ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-lt408-611a2ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-lt138-611a2ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-lt624-611a2ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-lt396-611a2ab1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-lt498-611a2ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-lt132-611a2ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-lt288-611a2ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-lt42-611a2ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingredient-lt90-611a2ab1.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này có thể dùng nghĩa bóng để chỉ yếu tố cấu thành sự thành công.', 'dining', 1, 23),
('62ecaaa1-2110-5e19-b223-cc964e5a013f', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '2ff3bb37-4187-5dea-b09b-013b73756946', 'f66367b2-933b-59ff-a29d-8d1030a9b3d1', 'gift card', '/ɡɪft kɑːd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thẻ có giá trị tiền mặt dùng để mua hàng tại cửa hàng cụ thể.', 'a plastic document with a specific value of money used to buy goods at a particular store.', 'Employees received a fifty-dollar gift card as a reward for their hard work.', 'Các nhân viên đã nhận được một thẻ quà tặng trị giá 50 đô la như một phần thưởng cho sự chăm chỉ của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The department store offers a fifty-dollar gift card to customers who spend over two hundred dollars.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng bách hóa tặng một thẻ quà tặng trị giá năm mươi đô la cho khách hàng chi tiêu trên hai trăm đô la.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-ljspeech-3a59507b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-cori-3a59507b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gift-card-36a15525.webp', '[\"gift voucher\", \"gift certificate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"redeem a gift card\", \"meaning\": \"đổi thẻ quà tặng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"digital gift card\", \"meaning\": \"thẻ quà tặng điện tử\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"credit card\", \"note_vi\": \"Thẻ tín dụng dùng để thanh toán trả sau, không phải thẻ quà tặng.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-cori-3a59507b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-aru0-3a59507b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-aru5-3a59507b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-aru6-3a59507b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-aru10-3a59507b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-aru9-3a59507b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-aru3-3a59507b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-aru7-3a59507b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-aru8-3a59507b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-aru2-3a59507b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-ljspeech-3a59507b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-lt408-3a59507b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-lt138-3a59507b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-lt624-3a59507b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-lt396-3a59507b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-lt498-3a59507b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-lt132-3a59507b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-lt288-3a59507b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-lt42-3a59507b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gift-card-lt90-3a59507b.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với credit card (thẻ tín dụng) hoặc debit card (thẻ ghi nợ).', 'shopping', 1, 24),
('ba256792-f51c-50c3-8068-cd6c09de96ec', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '2ff3bb37-4187-5dea-b09b-013b73756946', 'f66367b2-933b-59ff-a29d-8d1030a9b3d1', 'tasteless', '/ˈteɪstləs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không có hương vị, nhạt nhẽo; hoặc thiếu thẩm mỹ, không tinh tế.', 'having no flavor or not being attractive in terms of style or appearance to others.', 'The soup was so bland and tasteless that I added more salt.', 'Món súp nhạt nhẽo và vô vị đến mức tôi phải cho thêm muối.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team rejected the advertisement because the slogan was considered too boring and quite tasteless.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã từ chối quảng cáo đó vì khẩu hiệu bị coi là quá nhàm chán và khá vô vị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-ljspeech-f57535f1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-cori-f57535f1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tasteless-ab6bc07c.webp', '[\"bland\", \"flavorless\"]', '[\"tasty\", \"stylish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tasteless joke\", \"meaning\": \"trò đùa vô duyên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tasteless food\", \"meaning\": \"đồ ăn nhạt nhẽo\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"taste\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"tasteful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-cori-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru0-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru5-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru6-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru10-f57535f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru9-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru3-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru7-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru8-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru2-f57535f1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-ljspeech-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt408-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt138-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt624-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt396-f57535f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt498-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt132-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt288-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt42-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt90-f57535f1.mp3\"]}}', 'có thể dùng cho đồ ăn (nhạt) hoặc hành vi (vô duyên/kém sang).', 'marketing', 1, 25),
('208a5fa9-2e9c-537c-8b18-9f5b2e39c188', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '2ff3bb37-4187-5dea-b09b-013b73756946', 'f66367b2-933b-59ff-a29d-8d1030a9b3d1', 'active voice', '/ˈæktɪv vɔɪs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'dạng ngữ pháp trong đó chủ ngữ thực hiện hành động', 'a grammatical structure where the subject performs the action of the verb directly.', 'Using active voice makes your writing clearer and more direct.', 'Sử dụng thể chủ động làm cho bài viết của bạn rõ ràng và trực tiếp hơn.', '{\"en\": \"Our editor recommends writing reports using the active voice to keep sentences clear.\", \"vi\": \"Biên tập viên của chúng tôi khuyên nên viết báo cáo sử dụng thể chủ động để giữ cho các câu rõ ràng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-ljspeech-b2906953.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-cori-b2906953.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/active-voice-c84e4e0b.webp', NULL, '[\"passive voice\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"use the active voice\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng thể chủ động\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"passive voice\", \"note_vi\": \"Thể bị động, chủ ngữ nhận tác động của hành động.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-cori-b2906953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-aru0-b2906953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-aru5-b2906953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-aru6-b2906953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-aru10-b2906953.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-aru9-b2906953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-aru3-b2906953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-aru7-b2906953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-aru8-b2906953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-aru2-b2906953.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-ljspeech-b2906953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-lt408-b2906953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-lt138-b2906953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-lt624-b2906953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-lt396-b2906953.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-lt498-b2906953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-lt132-b2906953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-lt288-b2906953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-lt42-b2906953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/active-voice-lt90-b2906953.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngược nghĩa với passive voice (thể bị động).', 'education', 1, 26),
('5774d215-2dae-5d88-ab4c-1e0b9e48e9d2', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '2ff3bb37-4187-5dea-b09b-013b73756946', 'f66367b2-933b-59ff-a29d-8d1030a9b3d1', 'calf', '/kɑːf/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Con non của bò hoặc một số động vật có vú lớn khác.', 'the young offspring of domestic cattle or certain other large mammal species.', 'The farmer watched as the mother cow licked her newborn calf.', 'Người nông dân nhìn con bò mẹ liếm con bê mới sinh của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The farm\'s new calf was born during the agricultural trade exhibition last week.\", \"vi\": \"Con bê mới của trang trại được sinh ra trong tuần lễ triển lãm thương mại nông nghiệp tuần trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-ljspeech-12117187.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-cori-12117187.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/calf-b494b32d.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"newborn calf\", \"meaning\": \"con bê sơ sinh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dairy calf\", \"meaning\": \"con bê sữa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"raise a calf\", \"meaning\": \"nuôi một con bê\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"calf\", \"note_vi\": \"calf còn có nghĩa là bắp chân, cần xem ngữ cảnh để phân biệt (body part)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-cori-12117187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-aru0-12117187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-aru5-12117187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-aru6-12117187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-aru10-12117187.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-aru9-12117187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-aru3-12117187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-aru7-12117187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-aru8-12117187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-aru2-12117187.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-ljspeech-12117187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-lt408-12117187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-lt138-12117187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-lt624-12117187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-lt396-12117187.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-lt498-12117187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-lt132-12117187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-lt288-12117187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-lt42-12117187.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calf-lt90-12117187.mp3\"]}}', 'Calf có hai nghĩa: con bê và bắp chân; chú ý ngữ cảnh khi đọc.', 'nature', 1, 27),
('4ebdc2dd-1e03-5e89-a22a-65bde3c217a3', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '2ff3bb37-4187-5dea-b09b-013b73756946', 'f66367b2-933b-59ff-a29d-8d1030a9b3d1', 'assistant', '/əˈsɪstənt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người giúp việc cho người khác, thường trong công việc.', 'a person who helps another in their work or duties.', 'My new assistant is very efficient and helps me a lot with my tasks.', 'Trợ lý mới của tôi rất hiệu quả và giúp tôi rất nhiều trong công việc.', '{\"en\": \"The sales assistant prepared the presentation before the client meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Trợ lý bán hàng chuẩn bị bài thuyết trình trước cuộc họp khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-ljspeech-27a9612b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-cori-27a9612b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/assistant-c1be7189.webp', '[\"helper\", \"aide\", \"deputy\"]', '[\"boss\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"personal assistant\", \"meaning\": \"trợ lý cá nhân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"assistant manager\", \"meaning\": \"trợ lý quản lý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"assistance\", \"note_vi\": \"assistant là người trợ lý, assistance là sự giúp đỡ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"assist\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"assistance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-cori-27a9612b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-aru0-27a9612b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-aru5-27a9612b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-aru6-27a9612b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-aru10-27a9612b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-aru9-27a9612b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-aru3-27a9612b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-aru7-27a9612b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-aru8-27a9612b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-aru2-27a9612b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-ljspeech-27a9612b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-lt408-27a9612b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-lt138-27a9612b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-lt624-27a9612b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-lt396-27a9612b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-lt498-27a9612b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-lt132-27a9612b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-lt288-27a9612b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-lt42-27a9612b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistant-lt90-27a9612b.mp3\"]}}', 'Assistant là người; assistance là khái niệm giúp đỡ, không dùng như người.', 'office', 1, 28),
('fdac99b4-4696-5038-ac93-b74715fb048b', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '2ff3bb37-4187-5dea-b09b-013b73756946', 'f66367b2-933b-59ff-a29d-8d1030a9b3d1', 'faculty', 'UK: /ˈfækəlti/ | US: /ˈfækəlti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'đội ngũ giảng viên, khoa', 'The teaching staff of a university, college, or academic department.', 'The university faculty met to discuss the new curriculum.', 'Đội ngũ giảng viên của trường đại học đã họp để thảo luận về chương trình giảng dạy mới.', '{\"en\": \"Several faculty members will present their findings at the annual educational conference.\", \"vi\": \"Một số giảng viên sẽ trình bày kết quả nghiên cứu của họ tại hội thảo giáo dục hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faculty-ljspeech-5cee1c23.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faculty-cori-5cee1c23.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/faculty-837daff1.webp', '[\"professors\", \"academic staff\", \"teachers\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"faculty member\", \"meaning\": \"thành viên giảng viên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"faculty meeting\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc họp khoa/giảng viên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"facility\", \"note_vi\": \"Facility là cơ sở vật chất, còn faculty là đội ngũ giảng viên hoặc khoa.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faculty-cori-5cee1c23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faculty-aru0-5cee1c23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faculty-aru5-5cee1c23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faculty-aru6-5cee1c23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faculty-aru10-5cee1c23.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faculty-aru9-5cee1c23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faculty-aru3-5cee1c23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faculty-aru7-5cee1c23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faculty-aru8-5cee1c23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/