('c62edd98-8779-5c56-a652-c73add472730', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '33f1d5f8-7819-587c-a1fb-648bce97f94c', '4690112d-5612-5fc6-aa2f-e400c7f07a59', 'favorable', 'UK: /ˈfeɪvərəbəl/ | US: /ˈfeɪvərəbəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'có lợi, thuận lợi', 'Expressing approval, giving an advantage, or creating good conditions for success.', 'The company received a favorable review from critics.', 'Công ty nhận được đánh giá thuận lợi từ các nhà phê bình.', '{\"en\": \"The startup secured a substantial business loan thanks to favorable market conditions.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty khởi nghiệp đã đảm bảo được một khoản vay kinh doanh lớn nhờ điều kiện thị trường thuận lợi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-ljspeech-8f8a4885.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-cori-8f8a4885.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/favorable-7d048a2f.webp', '[\"advantageous\", \"beneficial\", \"promising\"]', '[\"unfavorable\", \"disadvantageous\", \"adverse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"favorable conditions\", \"meaning\": \"điều kiện thuận lợi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"favorable terms\", \"meaning\": \"các điều khoản có lợi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"favorite\", \"note_vi\": \"favorite có nghĩa là được ưa thích nhất, còn favorable là thuận lợi, có lợi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"favor\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"favor\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"favorably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-cori-8f8a4885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-aru0-8f8a4885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-aru5-8f8a4885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-aru6-8f8a4885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-aru10-8f8a4885.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-aru9-8f8a4885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-aru3-8f8a4885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-aru7-8f8a4885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-aru8-8f8a4885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-aru2-8f8a4885.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-ljspeech-8f8a4885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-lt408-8f8a4885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-lt138-8f8a4885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-lt624-8f8a4885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-lt396-8f8a4885.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-lt498-8f8a4885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-lt132-8f8a4885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-lt288-8f8a4885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-lt42-8f8a4885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/favorable-lt90-8f8a4885.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường ghép với terms (điều khoản), conditions (điều kiện), reviews (đánh giá). Phân biệt với \'favorite\' (được yêu thích nhất).', 'finance', 1, 0),
('bbccec23-e7f7-5975-953b-03d91b22aded', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '33f1d5f8-7819-587c-a1fb-648bce97f94c', '4690112d-5612-5fc6-aa2f-e400c7f07a59', 'waist', '/weɪst/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Phần giữa của cơ thể, nằm giữa xương sườn và hông.', 'the middle part of the human body between the chest and hips.', 'The tailor measured the customer\'s waist before altering the suit trousers.', 'Thợ may đã đo vòng eo của khách hàng trước khi sửa chiếc quần âu.', '{\"en\": \"The uniform policy requires staff to wear a badge at waist level at all times.\", \"vi\": \"Quy định đồng phục yêu cầu nhân viên đeo thẻ ngang thắt lưng mọi lúc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waist-ljspeech-5501fdb7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waist-cori-5501fdb7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/waist-6a7b8ada.webp', '[\"midsection\", \"midriff\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"waist size\", \"meaning\": \"kích thước vòng eo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"waist level\", \"meaning\": \"ngang tầm eo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"slim waist\", \"meaning\": \"eo thon\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"waste\", \"note_vi\": \"\'waste\' là lãng phí, \'waist\' là eo; phát âm giống nhau nhưng nghĩa khác\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waist-cori-5501fdb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waist-aru0-5501fdb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waist-aru5-5501fdb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waist-aru6-5501fdb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waist-aru10-5501fdb7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waist-aru9-5501fdb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waist-aru3-5501fdb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waist-aru7-5501fdb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waist-aru8-5501fdb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waist-aru2-5501fdb7.mp