('4d0204b5-7fca-563a-a0d3-5676b666d7e3', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '33f1d5f8-7819-587c-a1fb-648bce97f94c', '4690112d-5612-5fc6-aa2f-e400c7f07a59', 'excitement', '/ɪkˈsaɪtmənt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác vui sướng, hào hứng, hoặc kích động mạnh mẽ.', 'a feeling of being very happy and enthusiastic about something that will happen.', 'There was a lot of excitement in the crowd as the band took the stage.', 'Có rất nhiều sự phấn khích trong đám đông khi ban nhạc lên sân khấu.', '{\"en\": \"There was great excitement in the office when the company announced the annual bonus program.\", \"vi\": \"Có sự phấn khích lớn trong văn phòng khi công ty công bố chương trình thưởng hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-ljspeech-a66cd1a2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-cori-a66cd1a2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/excitement-74f375ac.webp', '[\"enthusiasm\", \"thrill\"]', '[\"boredom\", \"indifference\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"great excitement\", \"meaning\": \"sự phấn khích lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cause excitement\", \"meaning\": \"gây ra sự phấn khích\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"excite\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"exciting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-cori-a66cd1a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-aru0-a66cd1a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-aru5-a66cd1a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-aru6-a66cd1a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-aru10-a66cd1a2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-aru9-a66cd1a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-aru3-a66cd1a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-aru7-a66cd1a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitement-