('c7571a3c-92fa-559a-a20d-ad8111eb1b3b', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '33f1d5f8-7819-587c-a1fb-648bce97f94c', '4690112d-5612-5fc6-aa2f-e400c7f07a59', 'cream', '/kriːm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Chất lỏng đặc màu trắng, thường dùng trong nấu ăn hoặc mỹ phẩm.', 'a thick white liquid used in food or cosmetics.', 'I like to put fresh cream on my strawberries.', 'Tôi thích cho kem tươi lên dâu tây của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel restaurant serves coffee with fresh cream and sugar.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng khách sạn phục vụ cà phê với kem tươi và đường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-ljspeech-7bdd161c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-cori-7bdd161c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cream-21d58e80.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fresh cream\", \"meaning\": \"kem tươi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cream cake\", \"meaning\": \"bánh kem\"}, {\"phrase\": \"face cream\", \"meaning\": \"kem mặt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cram\", \"note_vi\": \"cram phát âm khác, nghĩa nhồi nhét.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"creamy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-cori-7bdd161c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-aru0-7bdd161c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-aru5-7bdd161c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-aru6-7bdd161c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-aru10-7bdd161c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-aru9-7bdd161c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-aru3-7bdd161c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-aru7-7bdd161c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-aru8-7bdd161c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-aru2-7bdd161c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-ljspeech-7bdd161c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-lt408-7bdd161c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-lt138-7bdd161c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-lt624-7bdd161c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-lt396-7bdd161c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-lt498-7bdd161c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-lt132-7bdd161c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-lt288-7bdd161c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-lt42-7bdd161c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cream-lt90-7bdd161c.mp3\"]}}', 'Cream có thể là kem ăn hoặc màu kem, chú ý ngữ cảnh.', 'dining', 1, 11),
('b1ec57c5-2ab7-5bee-8612-aec619c2d03e', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '33f1d5f8-7819-587c-a1fb-648bce97f94c', '4690112d-5612-5fc6-aa2f-e400c7f07a59', 'amphibian', '/æmˈfɪbiən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Loài động vật có xương sống sống được cả trên cạn và dưới nước, như ếch hoặc cóc.', 'an animal that can live both on land and in water, like a frog.', 'Frogs are a common example of an amphibian, known for their ability to live in both water and on land.', 'Ếch là một ví dụ phổ biến về động vật lưỡng cư, nổi tiếng với khả năng sống cả dưới nước và trên cạn.', '{\"en\": \"The nature reserve is home to many rare species of bird and amphibian.\", \"vi\": \"Khu bảo tồn thiên nhiên là nơi sinh sống của nhiều loài chim và động vật lưỡng cư quý hiếm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-ljspeech-40a4cd26.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-cori-40a4cd26.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/amphibian-90d7c6a0.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"rare amphibian\", \"meaning\": \"động vật lưỡng cư quý hiếm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"amphibian species\", \"meaning\": \"loài lưỡng cư\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reptile\", \"note_vi\": \"amphibian là lưỡng cư (sống cả trên cạn/dưới nước), reptile là bò sát.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"amphibious\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-cori-40a4cd26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-aru0-40a4cd26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-aru5-40a4cd26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-aru6-40a4cd26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-aru10-40a4cd26.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-aru9-40a4cd26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-aru3-40a4cd26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-aru7-40a4cd26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-aru8-40a4cd26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-aru2-40a4cd26.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-ljspeech-40a4cd26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-lt408-40a4cd26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-lt138-40a4cd26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-lt624-40a4cd26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-lt396-40a4cd26.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-lt498-40a4cd26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-lt132-40a4cd26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-lt288-40a4cd26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-lt42-40a4cd26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amphibian-lt90-40a4cd26.mp3\"]}}', 'Bắt nguồn từ tiếng Hy Lạp \'amphi\' nghĩa là cả hai (sống cả trên cạn và dưới nước).', 'nature', 1, 12),
('8fa3725f-8467-50d6-a5ff-a56576045f13', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '33f1d5f8-7819-587c-a1fb-648bce97f94c', '4690112d-5612-5fc6-aa2f-e400c7f07a59', 'article', '/ˈɑːtɪkl/', 'A2', 'determiner', 'Từ dùng trước danh từ để xác định hoặc không xác định đối tượng (a, an, the).', 'a word used before a noun to show if it refers to something specific.', 'In English grammar, \'the\' is a definite article.', 'Trong ngữ pháp tiếng Anh, \'the\' là một mạo từ xác định.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure that you use the correct definite article before the noun in your report.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo rằng bạn sử dụng đúng mạo từ xác định trước danh từ trong báo cáo của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-ljspeech-565cecd7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-cori-565cecd7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/article-3e9a3b23.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"definite article\", \"meaning\": \"mạo từ xác định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"indefinite article\", \"meaning\": \"mạo từ bất định\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-cori-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru0-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru5-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru6-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru10-565cecd7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru9-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru3-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru7-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru8-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-aru2-565cecd7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-ljspeech-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt408-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt138-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt624-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt396-565cecd7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt498-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt132-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt288-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt42-565cecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/article-lt90-565cecd7.mp3\"]}}', 'Các mạo từ phổ biến trong tiếng Anh là a, an, the.', 'academic', 1, 13),
('fa005936-6bb7-56a5-8494-7af70aa49f93', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '33f1d5f8-7819-587c-a1fb-648bce97f94c', '4690112d-5612-5fc6-aa2f-e400c7f07a59', 'extensive', 'UK: /ɪkˈstɛnsɪv/ | US: /ɪkˈstɛnsɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'rộng lớn, sâu rộng', 'covering or affecting a large area, scope, amount, or degree of detail.', 'The project required extensive research.', 'Dự án yêu cầu nghiên cứu sâu rộng.', '{\"en\": \"The candidate has extensive experience in international marketing and client relations.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên có kinh nghiệm sâu rộng trong lĩnh vực tiếp thị quốc tế và quan hệ khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-ljspeech-e9691a0d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-cori-e9691a0d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extensive-c51edc63.webp', '[\"comprehensive\", \"broad\", \"vast\", \"far-reaching\"]', '[\"limited\", \"narrow\", \"restricted\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"extensive knowledge\", \"meaning\": \"kiến thức sâu rộng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extensive experience\", \"meaning\": \"kinh nghiệm phong phú/dày dặn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extensive repairs\", \"meaning\": \"việc sửa chữa toàn diện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intensive\", \"note_vi\": \"intensive mang nghĩa cấp tốc, tập trung cao độ; còn extensive là rộng lớn, trên phạm vi rộng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"extend\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"extension\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"extensively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-cori-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru0-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru5-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru6-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru10-e9691a0d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru9-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru3-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru7-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru8-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-aru2-e9691a0d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-ljspeech-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt408-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt138-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt624-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt396-e9691a0d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt498-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt132-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt288-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt42-e9691a0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extensive-lt90-e9691a0d.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay đi với các danh từ như \'experience\' (kinh nghiệm dày dặn), \'research\' (nghiên cứu sâu rộng), \'renovation\' (cải tạo toàn diện).', 'personnel', 1, 14),
('6e73f9c1-af84-5c14-b382-630277eebdae', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '33f1d5f8-7819-587c-a1fb-648bce97f94c', '4690112d-5612-5fc6-aa2f-e400c7f07a59', 'round trip', '/raʊnd trɪp/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Chuyến đi bao gồm cả lượt đi và lượt về.', 'a journey to a place and back again to where you started.', 'A round trip flight ticket usually costs less than buying two separate one-way tickets.', 'Một vé máy bay khứ hồi thường có giá rẻ hơn so với việc mua hai vé một chiều riêng biệt.', '{\"en\": \"She booked a round trip flight to Tokyo for the annual sales conference.\", \"vi\": \"Cô ấy đặt vé máy bay khứ hồi đến Tokyo cho hội nghị bán hàng thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-ljspeech-1f401922.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-cori-1f401922.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/round-trip-895bd2b6.webp', '[\"return trip\", \"two-way trip\"]', '[\"one-way trip\", \"single trip\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"round trip ticket\", \"meaning\": \"vé khứ hồi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"round trip fare\", \"meaning\": \"giá vé khứ hồi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"book a round trip\", \"meaning\": \"đặt vé khứ hồi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"one-way\", \"note_vi\": \"one-way chỉ đi một chiều, round trip là đi và về\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-cori-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru0-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru5-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru6-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru10-1f401922.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru9-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru3-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru7-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru8-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-aru2-1f401922.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-ljspeech-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt408-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt138-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt624-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt396-1f401922.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt498-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt132-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt288-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt42-1f401922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-trip-lt90-1f401922.mp3\"]}}', 'Round trip = khứ hồi; one-way = một chiều. Hay gặp trong phần đặt vé TOEIC.', 'travel', 1, 15),
('6bc658fd-e654-561a-a1c2-3543041f440e', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '33f1d5f8-7819-587c-a1fb-648bce97f94c', '4690112d-5612-5fc6-aa2f-e400c7f07a59', 'mother-in-law', '/ˈmʌðərɪnˌlɔː/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Mẹ của vợ hoặc chồng.', 'the female parent of your husband or your wife.', 'My mother-in-law is visiting us next week from her hometown.', 'Mẹ chồng/vợ tôi sẽ đến thăm chúng tôi vào tuần tới từ quê nhà.', '{\"en\": \"He booked a comfortable hotel room for his mother-in-law during her visit to the city.\", \"vi\": \"Anh ấy đã đặt một phòng khách sạn thoải mái cho mẹ chồng trong chuyến thăm thành phố của bà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mother-in-law-ljspeech-15abc87f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mother-in-law-cori-15abc87f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mother-in-law-f0fa6a64.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"future mother-in-law\", \"meaning\": \"mẹ chồng/mẹ vợ tương lai\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"father-in-law\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"brother-in-law\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mother-in-law-cori-15abc87f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mother-in-law-aru0-15abc87f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mother-in-law-aru5-15abc87f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mother-in-law-aru6-15abc87f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mother-in-law-aru10-15abc87f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mother-in-law-aru9-15abc87f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mother-in-law-aru3-15abc87f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mother-in-law-aru7-15abc87f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mother-in-law-aru8-15abc87f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mother-in-law-aru2-15abc87f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pron