('27d099ed-bf64-5fc8-a5c2-ce07fb3d10d4', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '33f1d5f8-7819-587c-a1fb-648bce97f94c', '4690112d-5612-5fc6-aa2f-e400c7f07a59', 'common noun', '/ˈkɒmən naʊn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Danh từ chỉ người, vật, địa điểm hoặc ý tưởng nói chung, không cụ thể.', 'a word that refers to a general class of people, places, or things.', '\"Table\" and \"city\" are examples of common nouns.', '\"Bàn\" và \"thành phố\" là những ví dụ về danh từ chung.', '{\"en\": \"The training manual explains that a common noun should not be capitalized unless it starts a sentence.\", \"vi\": \"Sổ tay đào tạo giải thích rằng danh từ chung không được viết hoa trừ khi nó bắt đầu một câu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-ljspeech-2786a2d0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-cori-2786a2d0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/common-noun-aab0aa4c.webp', NULL, '[\"proper noun\"]', NULL, '[{\"word\": \"proper noun\", \"note_vi\": \"proper noun là danh từ riêng (phải viết hoa), common noun là danh từ chung\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-cori-2786a2d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-aru0-2786a2d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-aru5-2786a2d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-aru6-2786a2d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-aru10-2786a2d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-aru9-2786a2d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-aru3-2786a2d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-aru7-2786a2d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-aru8-2786a2d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-aru2-2786a2d0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-ljspeech-2786a2d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-lt408-2786a2d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-lt138-2786a2d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-lt624-2786a2d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-lt396-2786a2d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-lt498-2786a2d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-lt132-2786a2d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-lt288-2786a2d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-lt42-2786a2d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/common-noun-lt90-2786a2d0.mp3\"]}}', 'Khái niệm ngữ pháp cơ bản, ít khi bị hỏi trực tiếp trong bài thi.', 'education', 1, 26),
('6c492d34-2da0-5dbe-adb3-126eb1d79ef3', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '33f1d5f8-7819-587c-a1fb-648bce97f94c', '4690112d-5612-5fc6-aa2f-e400c7f07a59', 'leisure', '/ˈleʒə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'thời gian rảnh rỗi để làm những việc mình thích.', 'time when you are not working and can do things that you enjoy.', 'Most office employees prefer spending their leisure hours outdoors with family and friends.', 'Hầu hết nhân viên văn phòng đều thích dành giờ rảnh rỗi ngoài trời cùng gia đình và bạn bè.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers many leisure activities for guests to enjoy during their business trip.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp nhiều hoạt động giải trí cho khách hàng tận hưởng trong chuyến công tác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-ljspeech-6188ba09.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-cori-6188ba09.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/leisure-04af67ce.webp', '[\"free time\", \"recreation\"]', '[\"work\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"leisure time\", \"meaning\": \"thời gian rảnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"leisure activities\", \"meaning\": \"hoạt động giải trí\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-cori-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru0-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru5-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru6-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru10-6188ba09.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru9-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru3-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru7-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru8-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru2-6188ba09.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-ljspeech-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt408-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt138-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt624-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt396-6188ba09.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt498-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt132-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt288-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt42-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt90-6188ba09.mp3\"]}}', 'thường dùng trong các bài quảng cáo dịch vụ du lịch hoặc nghỉ dưỡng.', 'travel', 1, 27),
('5aacc635-a9a5-518f-9afb-5450a11c7840', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '33f1d5f8-7819-587c-a1fb-648bce97f94c', '4690112d-5612-5fc6-aa2f-e400c7f07a59', 'lung', '/lʌŋ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cơ quan hô hấp chính giúp trao đổi khí trong cơ thể.', 'either of the two organ parts inside your chest used for breathing air.', 'Regular exercise can help improve the capacity of your lungs.', 'Tập thể dục thường xuyên có thể giúp cải thiện dung tích phổi của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"Employees in the factory must wear protective masks to prevent lung damage from dust.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên trong nhà máy phải đeo khẩu trang bảo hộ để tránh tổn thương phổi do bụi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-ljspeech-633871c4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-cori-633871c4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lung-e14ac9ba.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"lung cancer\", \"meaning\": \"ung thư phổi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lung capacity\", \"meaning\": \"dung tích phổi\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-cori-633871c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-aru0-633871c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-aru5-633871c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-aru6-633871c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-aru10-633871c4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-aru9-633871c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-aru3-633871c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-aru7-633871c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-aru8-633871c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-aru2-633871c4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-ljspeech-633871c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-lt408-633871c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-lt138-633871c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-lt624-633871c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-lt396-633871c4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-lt498-633871c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-lt132-633871c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-lt288-633871c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-lt42-633871c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lung-lt90-633871c4.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ đếm được, cơ thể người có 2 lá phổi (lungs).', 'health', 1, 28),
('4f780d34-8dad-5643-b49d-a1d22b1d8ba9', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '33f1d5f8-7819-587c-a1fb-648bce97f94c', '4690112d-5612-5fc6-aa2f-e400c7f07a59', 'starter', '/ˈstɑːtə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Món ăn nhẹ dùng trước bữa chính.', 'a small amount of food that you eat before the main meal.', 'For our starter, we ordered a fresh garden salad.', 'Món khai vị của chúng tôi là một đĩa salad rau tươi.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant offers a free starter for guests who order a main course.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng cung cấp một món khai vị miễn phí cho những khách gọi món chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-ljspeech-f16ecba5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-cori-f16ecba5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/starter-77f97f20.webp', '[\"appetizer\", \"first course\"]', '[\"dessert\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"soup starter\", \"meaning\": \"món khai vị bằng súp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"order a starter\", \"meaning\": \"gọi món khai vị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"start\", \"note_vi\": \"sự bắt đầu hoặc khởi đầu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"start\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-cori-f16ecba5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-aru0-f16ecba5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-aru5-f16ecba5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-aru6-f16ecba5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-aru10-f16ecba5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-aru9-f16ecba5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-aru3-f16ecba5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-aru7-f16ecba5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-aru8-f16ecba5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-aru2-f16ecba5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-ljspeech-f16ecba5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-lt408-f16ecba5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-lt138-f16ecba5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-lt624-f16ecba5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-lt396-f16ecba5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-lt498-f16ecba5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-lt132-f16ecba5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-lt288-f16ecba5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-lt42-f16ecba5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/starter-lt90-f16ecba5.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong tiếng Anh-Mỹ, người ta thường dùng từ appetizer thay cho starter.', 'dining', 1, 29),
('d2f87773-6011-5da7-b746-e605a992ba4f', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '3a081bea-c545-58fb-bb50-bb5ae11fbcc0', 'e3a0da12-50fe-5865-8151-cae3bd62444b', 'continuously', '/kənˈtɪnjuəsli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách liên tục, không ngừng nghỉ.', 'in a way that happens without stopping or being interrupted.', 'The rain fell continuously for three days, causing floods in the area.', 'Mưa rơi liên tục trong ba ngày, gây ra lũ lụt trong khu vực.', '{\"en\": \"The factory machines operate continuously to meet the high demand for the new product.\", \"vi\": \"Các máy móc trong nhà máy hoạt động liên tục để đáp ứng nhu cầu cao đối với sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-ljspeech-8649013b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-cori-8649013b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/continuously-0acaa629.webp', '[\"constantly\", \"uninterruptedly\", \"persistently\"]', '[\"intermittently\", \"occasionally\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"operate continuously\", \"meaning\": \"vận hành liên tục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"improve continuously\", \"meaning\": \"cải tiến liên tục\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"continually\", \"note_vi\": \"lặp đi lặp lại có ngắt quãng, khác với liên tục không ngừng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"continuous\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"continue\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"continuity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-cori-8649013b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-aru0-8649013b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-aru5-8649013b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-aru6-8649013b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-aru10-8649013b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-aru9-8649013b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-aru3-8649013b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-aru7-8649013b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-aru8-8649013b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-aru2-8649013b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-ljspeech-8649013b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-lt408-8649013b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-lt138-8649013b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-lt624-8649013b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-lt396-8649013b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-lt498-8649013b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-lt132-8649013b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-lt288-8649013b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-lt42-8649013b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/continuously-lt90-8649013b.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với \'continually\' (lặp đi lặp lại có khoảng nghỉ).', 'manufacturing', 1, 0),
('8eef93bf-aea4-5239-8fe7-9c2e97f8e9c5', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '3a081bea-c545-58fb-bb50-bb5ae11fbcc0', 'e3a0da12-50fe-5865-8151-cae3bd62444b', 'keen', '/kiːn/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất nhiệt tình, hăm hở hoặc mong muốn làm gì đó.', 'very interested, enthusiastic, or wanting to do something very much.', 'She is very keen to learn new languages and travel the world.', 'Cô ấy rất háo hức học ngôn ngữ mới và đi du lịch khắp thế giới.', '{\"en\": \"The manager is keen to hire candidates with strong communication skills for this role.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý rất háo hức tuyển dụng các ứng viên có kỹ năng giao tiếp tốt cho vị trí này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-ljspeech-ec00cfc2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-cori-ec00cfc2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/keen-72d5ba27.webp', '[\"eager\", \"enthusiastic\"]', '[\"reluctant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"keen on\", \"meaning\": \"thích thú với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keen to do\", \"meaning\": \"háo hức làm gì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"keenly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-cori-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru0-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru5-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru6-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru10-ec00cfc2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru9-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru3-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru7-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru8-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru2-ec00cfc2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-ljspeech-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/o