('5e9ea69e-8d1b-598c-8ba0-2d7b634268ec', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '3a081bea-c545-58fb-bb50-bb5ae11fbcc0', 'e3a0da12-50fe-5865-8151-cae3bd62444b', 'empower', 'UK: /ɪmˈpaʊə/ | US: /ɪmˈpaʊər/', 'B2', 'verb', 'trao quyền, ủy quyền', 'To give someone the authority, confidence, or freedom to take control of their own actions.', 'We empower employees to make decisions for their teams.', 'Chúng tôi trao quyền cho nhân viên đưa ra quyết định cho nhóm của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager decided to empower team leaders to make final decisions on project budgets.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã quyết định trao quyền cho các trưởng nhóm đưa ra quyết định cuối cùng về ngân sách dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-ljspeech-f0529720.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-cori-f0529720.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/empower-b6a4b640.webp', '[\"authorize\", \"enable\", \"delegate\"]', '[\"restrict\", \"disempower\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"empower employees\", \"meaning\": \"trao quyền cho nhân viên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"empower someone to make decisions\", \"meaning\": \"trao quyền cho ai đưa ra quyết định\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"empowerment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-cori-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru0-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru5-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru6-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru10-f0529720.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru9-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru3-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru7-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru8-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-aru2-f0529720.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-ljspeech-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt408-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt138-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt624-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt396-f0529720.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt498-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt132-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt288-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt42-f0529720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empower-lt90-f0529720.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với cấu trúc \'empower somebody to do something\' (trao quyền cho ai làm gì).', 'management', 1, 2),
('7ac6e643-ef5f-5a9d-bd29-2c06f287bb28', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '3a081bea-c545-58fb-bb50-bb5ae11fbcc0', 'e3a0da12-50fe-5865-8151-cae3bd62444b', 'cattle', '/ˈkætl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Các loài động vật nuôi lớn như bò, trâu, được nuôi để lấy thịt, sữa hoặc sức kéo.', 'cows and bulls kept on a farm for their meat or milk.', 'Large herds of cattle graze peacefully across the open plains of North America.', 'Những đàn gia súc lớn gặm cỏ thanh bình trên các đồng bằng bao la của Bắc Mỹ.', '{\"en\": \"The agricultural company invests in modern technology to monitor the health of their cattle.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty nông nghiệp đầu tư vào công nghệ hiện đại để theo dõi sức khỏe của đàn gia súc của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-ljspeech-7ba71fae.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-cori-7ba71fae.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cattle-6999916f.webp', '[\"cows\", \"livestock\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dairy cattle\", \"meaning\": \"bò sữa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"herd of cattle\", \"meaning\": \"đàn gia súc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"kettle\", \"note_vi\": \"kettle là ấm đun nước, cattle là gia súc.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-cori-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru0-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru5-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru6-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru10-7ba71fae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru9-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru3-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru7-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru8-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-aru2-7ba71fae.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-ljspeech-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-lt408-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-lt138-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-lt624-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-lt396-7ba71fae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-lt498-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-lt132-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-lt288-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-lt42-7ba71fae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cattle-lt90-7ba71fae.mp3\"]}}', 'Cattle là danh từ số nhiều tập hợp, đi với động từ chia ở số nhiều.', 'nature', 1, 3),
('4edefe98-b147-5069-ab51-0667f4013389', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '3a081bea-c545-58fb-bb50-bb5ae11fbcc0', 'e3a0da12-50fe-5865-8151-cae3bd62444b', 'safari', '/səˈfɑːri/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Chuyến đi khám phá, thường là ở châu Phi, để quan sát động vật hoang dã.', 'a trip to see or hunt wild animals in their natural environment, often in africa.', 'We saw many wild animals during our safari in Kenya.', 'Chúng tôi đã nhìn thấy nhiều động vật hoang dã trong chuyến đi safari ở Kenya.', '{\"en\": \"Our travel agency offers a luxury safari package for clients visiting the national park next month.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch của chúng tôi cung cấp gói safari sang trọng cho khách hàng ghé thăm vườn quốc gia vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-ljspeech-40102dbf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-cori-40102dbf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/safari-b5a805b5.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"go on a safari\", \"meaning\": \"đi xem động vật hoang dã\"}, {\"phrase\": \"safari park\", \"meaning\": \"công viên hoang dã\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-cori-40102dbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-aru0-40102dbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-aru5-40102dbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-aru6-40102dbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-aru10-40102dbf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-aru9-40102dbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-aru3-40102dbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-aru7-40102dbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-aru8-40102dbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-aru2-40102dbf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-ljspeech-40102dbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-lt408-40102dbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-lt138-40102dbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-lt624-40102dbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-lt396-40102dbf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-lt498-40102dbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-lt132-40102dbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-lt288-40102dbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-lt42-40102dbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/safari-lt90-40102dbf.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh du lịch khám phá thiên nhiên.', 'travel', 1, 4),
('8fab6a45-c87d-5ea9-a9b1-5da6b1e0bae2', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '3a081bea-c545-58fb-bb50-bb5ae11fbcc0', 'e3a0da12-50fe-5865-8151-cae3bd62444b', 'acne', '/ˈækni/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng da có nhiều mụn, thường gặp ở tuổi dậy thì.', 'a skin condition causing spots and pimples on the face.', 'She uses a special cream to treat her acne.', 'Cô ấy dùng một loại kem đặc biệt để trị mụn trứng cá.', '{\"en\": \"The clinic offers a skincare plan for staff suffering from acne.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng khám cung cấp kế hoạch chăm sóc da cho nhân viên bị mụn trứng cá.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acne-ljspeech-cc0dd2d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acne-cori-cc0dd2d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/acne-c56336da.webp', '[\"pimples\", \"spots\", \"blemishes\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"severe acne\", \"meaning\": \"mụn trứng cá nặng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"acne treatment\", \"meaning\": \"điều trị mụn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"acne scars\", \"meaning\": \"sẹo mụn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pimple\", \"note_vi\": \"pimple là mụn riêng lẻ, acne là tình trạng chung.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acne-cori-cc0dd2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acne-aru0-cc0dd2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acne-aru5-cc0dd2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acne-aru6-cc0dd2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acne-aru10-cc0dd2d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acne-aru9-cc0dd2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acne-aru3-cc0dd2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acne-aru7-cc0dd2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acne-aru8-cc0dd2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acne-aru2-cc0dd2d7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acne-ljspeech-c