('107797a2-2836-5a79-a3f1-03c282772575', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '3a081bea-c545-58fb-bb50-bb5ae11fbcc0', 'e3a0da12-50fe-5865-8151-cae3bd62444b', 'slim', '/slɪm/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Mỏng và thon gọn một cách hấp dẫn.', 'thin in a way that is attractive or healthy rather than thin.', 'She has a very slim figure and exercises regularly.', 'Cô ấy có vóc dáng rất mảnh mai và tập thể dục thường xuyên.', '{\"en\": \"The new laptop model has a slim design that fits easily into any briefcase.\", \"vi\": \"Mẫu máy tính xách tay mới có thiết kế mỏng nhẹ, vừa vặn dễ dàng vào bất kỳ cặp tài liệu nào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slim-ljspeech-80a9a73f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slim-cori-80a9a73f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/slim-79f51031.webp', '[\"slender\", \"thin\", \"lean\"]', '[\"fat\", \"thick\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"slim figure\", \"meaning\": \"vóc dáng mảnh khảnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"slim chance\", \"meaning\": \"cơ hội mong manh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"skinny\", \"note_vi\": \"gầy gò, mang nghĩa tiêu cực hơn slim\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"slimness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slim-cori-80a9a73f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slim-aru0-80a9a73f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slim-aru5-80a9a73f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slim-aru6-80a9a73f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slim-aru10-80a9a73f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slim-aru9-80a9a73f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slim-aru3-80a9a73f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slim-aru7-80a9a73f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slim-aru8-80a9a73f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slim-aru2-80a9a73f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunc