('e5138621-1cdb-5ae4-b9bf-3377496d4471', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '3a081bea-c545-58fb-bb50-bb5ae11fbcc0', 'e3a0da12-50fe-5865-8151-cae3bd62444b', 'yield', 'UK: /jiːld/ | US: /jiːld/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sản lượng, lợi nhuận', 'The total amount of crop, profit, or result produced by a process.', 'The yield from this year\'s harvest exceeded all expectations.', 'Sản lượng vụ thu hoạch năm nay vượt mọi kỳ vọng.', '{\"en\": \"The high yield on government bonds attracted a significant amount of capital investment.\", \"vi\": \"Lợi tức cao của trái phiếu chính phủ đã thu hút một lượng vốn đầu tư đáng kể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-ljspeech-f12e1e8f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-cori-f12e1e8f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/yield-cfbddf2f.webp', '[\"return\", \"revenue\", \"output\", \"profit\"]', '[\"loss\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dividend yield\", \"meaning\": \"tỷ suất cổ tức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"crop yield\", \"meaning\": \"sản lượng thu hoạch mùa màng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"yield\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-cori-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru0-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru5-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru6-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru10-f12e1e8f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru9-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru3-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru7-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru8-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-aru2-f12e1e8f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yield-ljspeech-f12e1e8f.mp3\", \"/stor