('204399cc-4991-5cc7-9ca4-c367c16f85f3', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '3a081bea-c545-58fb-bb50-bb5ae11fbcc0', 'e3a0da12-50fe-5865-8151-cae3bd62444b', 'skull', '/skʌl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Bộ xương đầu bảo vệ não.', 'the framework of bones enclosing the brain and supporting the facial features in vertebrates.', 'Archaeologists found an ancient human skull during the excavation.', 'Các nhà khảo cổ đã tìm thấy một hộp sọ người cổ đại trong cuộc khai quật.', '{\"en\": \"The safety helmet is designed to protect the skull from impact during construction site accidents.\", \"vi\": \"Mũ bảo hiểm an toàn được thiết kế để bảo vệ hộp sọ khỏi va đập tại công trường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skull-ljspeech-15e9abb2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skull-cori-15e9abb2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/skull-d7de295c.webp', '[\"cranium\", \"head bone\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"protect the skull\", \"meaning\": \"bảo vệ hộp sọ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"skull fracture\", \"meaning\": \"nứt sọ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skull-cori-15e9abb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skull-aru0-15e9abb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skull-aru5-15e9abb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skull-aru6-15e9abb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skull-aru10-15e9abb2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skull-aru9-15e9abb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skull-aru3-15e9abb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skull-aru7-15e9abb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skull-aru8-15e9abb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skull-aru2-15e9abb2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skull-ljspeech-15e9abb2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati