('40e366ad-7d20-582b-b841-7fb17e6d3faa', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '3a081bea-c545-58fb-bb50-bb5ae11fbcc0', 'e3a0da12-50fe-5865-8151-cae3bd62444b', 'housework', '/ˈhaʊswɜːk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Các công việc dọn dẹp, nấu nướng và chăm sóc nhà cửa.', 'the routine work involved in cleaning, cooking, and caring for a home.', 'My grandmother always says that she enjoys doing housework.', 'Bà tôi luôn nói rằng bà thích làm công việc nhà.', '{\"en\": \"The cleaning agency offers professional services to help busy managers with housework.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty dịch vụ vệ sinh cung cấp dịch vụ chuyên nghiệp giúp các quản lý bận rộn việc nhà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-ljspeech-6f2e0609.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-cori-6f2e0609.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/housework-adfa8c15.webp', '[\"chores\", \"housekeeping\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"do housework\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc nhà\"}, {\"phrase\": \"daily housework\", \"meaning\": \"công việc nhà hàng ngày\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"homework\", \"note_vi\": \"Homework là bài tập về nhà do giáo viên giao, khác với housework.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-cori-6f2e0609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-aru0-6f2e0609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-aru5-6f2e0609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-aru6-6f2e0609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-aru10-6f2e0609.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-aru9-6f2e0609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-aru3-6f2e0609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-aru7-6f2e0609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-aru8-6f2e0609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-aru2-6f2e0609.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-ljspeech-6f2e0609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-lt408-6f2e0609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-lt138-6f2e0609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-lt624-6f2e0609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-lt396-6f2e0609.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-lt498-6f2e0609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-lt132-6f2e0609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-lt288-6f2e0609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-lt42-6f2e0609.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/housework-lt90-6f2e0609.mp3\"]}}', 'Housework là danh từ không đếm được, dùng động từ do (do housework).', 'housing', 1, 16),
('d1e19438-cf4b-5d73-a196-d94819769fde', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '3a081bea-c545-58fb-bb50-bb5ae11fbcc0', 'e3a0da12-50fe-5865-8151-cae3bd62444b', 'portion', '/ˈpɔːʃn/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Chia một thứ gì đó thành các phần.', 'to divide something into smaller parts or shares to be given to different people.', 'The chef carefully portioned out the soup into individual bowls for the guests.', 'Đầu bếp cẩn thận chia súp vào từng bát riêng cho khách.', '{\"en\": \"The manager will portion the project tasks among the team members to ensure timely completion.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý sẽ chia các nhiệm vụ dự án cho các thành viên trong nhóm để đảm bảo hoàn thành đúng hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-ljspeech-7b813d63.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-cori-7b813d63.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/portion-680cf0a7.webp', '[\"divide\", \"allocate\"]', '[\"combine\", \"unite\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"portion out\", \"meaning\": \"chia nhỏ ra\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"portion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-cori-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru0-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru5-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru6-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru10-7b813d63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru9-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru3-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru7-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru8-7b813d63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-aru2-7b813d63.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portion-ljspeech-7b813d63.mp3\", 