('54747bc5-efc4-5f25-9136-d2e8a1fcc2e4', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '3a081bea-c545-58fb-bb50-bb5ae11fbcc0', 'e3a0da12-50fe-5865-8151-cae3bd62444b', 'court', '/kɔːt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một khu vực phẳng được đánh dấu để chơi các môn thể thao.', 'an area marked with lines where games like tennis or basketball are played.', 'The lawyer prepared all relevant documents before presenting the case in court.', 'Luật sư đã chuẩn bị tất cả tài liệu liên quan trước khi trình bày vụ án tại tòa án.', '{\"en\": \"The company renovated the outdoor basketball court to encourage employee physical health and wellness.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã cải tạo sân bóng rổ ngoài trời để khuyến khích sức khỏe thể chất của nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-ljspeech-21304eff.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-cori-21304eff.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/court-be5f3b86.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tennis court\", \"meaning\": \"sân quần vợt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"basketball court\", \"meaning\": \"sân bóng rổ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"court surface\", \"meaning\": \"bề mặt sân\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"course\", \"note_vi\": \"court là sân quần vợt/bóng rổ, course là sân golf hoặc khóa học\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-cori-21304eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-aru0-21304eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-aru5-21304eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-aru6-21304eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-aru10-21304eff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-aru9-21304eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-aru3-21304eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-aru7-21304eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-aru8-21304eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-aru2-21304eff.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-ljspeech-21304eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-lt408-21304eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-lt138-21304eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-lt624-21304eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-lt396-21304eff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-lt498-21304eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-lt132-21304eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-lt288-21304eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-lt42-21304eff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/court-lt90-21304eff.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt court (sân bóng rổ, tennis), pitch (sân bóng đá) và course (sân golf).', 'daily', 1, 18),
('cecc134c-b3c9-5933-a36f-b21503826d6a', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '3a081bea-c545-58fb-bb50-bb5ae11fbcc0', 'e3a0da12-50fe-5865-8151-cae3bd62444b', 'predator', '/ˈpredətə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Động vật săn bắt và ăn thịt động vật khác.', 'an animal that hunts, kills, and eats other animals to survive in the wild.', 'Lions are powerful predators that hunt in groups.', 'Sư tử là những kẻ săn mồi mạnh mẽ, chúng săn mồi theo đàn.', '{\"en\": \"The nature documentary highlights how the apex predator maintains the balance of the local ecosystem.\", \"vi\": \"Phim tài liệu về thiên nhiên làm nổi bật cách loài săn mồi đầu bảng duy trì sự cân bằng của hệ sinh thái địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predator-ljspeech-e9dcba39.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predator-cori-e9dcba39.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/predator-28b9c5f1.webp', '[\"hunter\", \"carnivore\"]', '[\"prey\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"natural predator\", \"meaning\": \"kẻ săn mồi tự nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"apex predator\", \"meaning\": \"kẻ săn mồi đầu bảng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"predatory\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predator-cori-e9dcba39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predator-aru0-e9dcba39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predator-aru5-e9dcba39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predator-aru6-e9dcba39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predator-aru10-e9dcba39.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predator-aru9-e9dcba39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predator-aru3-e9dcba39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predator-aru7-e9dcba39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predator-aru8-e9dcba39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predator-aru2-e9dcba39.mp3\"]}, \"u