('286657f7-84cd-5c6f-a2c6-dc784c05e065', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '3a081bea-c545-58fb-bb50-bb5ae11fbcc0', 'e3a0da12-50fe-5865-8151-cae3bd62444b', 'blackness', '/ˈblæknəs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Trạng thái hoặc sự vắng mặt hoàn toàn của ánh sáng.', 'the state or quality of being completely dark or without any light.', 'We were lost in the complete blackness of the cave after the light went out.', 'Chúng tôi bị lạc trong bóng tối hoàn toàn của hang động sau khi đèn tắt.', '{\"en\": \"The security cameras can capture clear images even in the total blackness of night.\", \"vi\": \"Camera an ninh có thể ghi lại hình ảnh rõ nét ngay cả trong bóng tối hoàn toàn của ban đêm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blackness-ljspeech-2c985d30.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blackness-cori-2c985d30.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/blackness-ff333bb8.webp', '[\"darkness\"]', '[\"brightness\", \"whiteness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"total blackness\", \"meaning\": \"bóng tối hoàn toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"complete blackness\", \"meaning\": \"sự đen kịt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"black\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blackness-cori-2c985d30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blackness-aru0-2c985d30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blackness-aru5-2c985d30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blackness-aru6-2c985d30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blackness-aru10-2c985d30.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blackness-aru9-2c985d30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blackness-aru3-2c985d30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blackness-aru7-2c985d30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blackness-aru8-2c985d30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blackness-aru2-2c985d30.mp3\