('e2aad287-be63-5b15-8730-704ab31f3599', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '3f44e21a-32aa-5eef-9a60-ca0346d2bcc2', 'e9958ef6-a6c6-56f5-b0f5-6a7969582115', 'pitch', '/pɪtʃ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sân thể thao, đặc biệt là bóng đá hoặc cricket.', 'an area of ground specially prepared and marked for playing a sports game.', 'The football match was postponed due to the heavy rain making the pitch unplayable.', 'Trận đấu bóng đá bị hoãn vì mưa lớn khiến sân không thể thi đấu được.', '{\"en\": \"The company rented a local football pitch for the annual staff sports day.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một sân bóng đá địa phương cho ngày hội thể thao thường niên của nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-ljspeech-5bfb7116.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-cori-5bfb7116.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pitch-597a9236.webp', '[\"field\", \"ground\", \"court\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"football pitch\", \"meaning\": \"sân bóng đá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cricket pitch\", \"meaning\": \"sân cricket\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"court\", \"note_vi\": \"court dùng cho tennis/basketball, còn pitch dùng cho football/rugby/cricket\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"pitch\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-cori-5bfb7116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-aru0-5bfb7116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-aru5-5bfb7116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-aru6-5bfb7116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-aru10-5bfb7116.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-aru9-5bfb7116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-aru3-5bfb7116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-aru7-5bfb7116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-aru8-5bfb7116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/