('ca5c420c-54db-556e-b3fe-827eb26ea9e6', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '3f44e21a-32aa-5eef-9a60-ca0346d2bcc2', 'e9958ef6-a6c6-56f5-b0f5-6a7969582115', 'emission', 'UK: /ɪˈmɪʃ.ən/ | US: /ɪˈmɪʃ.ən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự phát thải, khí thải', 'The act of sending out gas, heat, light, or other substances into the environment.', 'New regulations aim to reduce carbon emissions from factories.', 'Các quy định mới nhằm mục đích giảm lượng khí thải carbon từ các nhà máy.', '{\"en\": \"The manufacturing plant installed eco-friendly filters to reduce carbon emissions.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy sản xuất đã lắp đặt các bộ lọc thân thiện với môi trường để giảm lượng phát thải carbon.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-ljspeech-b5da25e0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-cori-b5da25e0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/emission-9b88e204.webp', '[\"discharge\", \"release\", \"output\"]', '[\"absorption\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"carbon emissions\", \"meaning\": \"lượng phát thải carbon\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reduce emissions\", \"meaning\": \"cắt giảm khí thải\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"omission\", \"note_vi\": \"sự bỏ sót, sự bỏ qua\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"emit\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-cori-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru0-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru5-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru6-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru10-b5da25e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru9-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru3-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru7-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emission-aru8-b5da25e0.mp3\", \"/storage