('8b04951a-fb4a-5a7f-bde4-c505408f462b', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '4553fefa-30ce-5e06-b350-6c30768614d2', '499ff33c-7562-5f6e-94a2-d7d4fc179ef1', 'skeleton', '/ˈskelɪtn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Khung xương nâng đỡ cơ thể người hoặc động vật.', 'the complete set of bones that form the structure inside the body of a person or animal.', 'A human skeleton has 206 bones.', 'Một bộ xương người có 206 chiếc xương.', '{\"en\": \"The health and safety training included a diagram of the human skeleton.\", \"vi\": \"Khóa đào tạo an toàn sức khỏe bao gồm sơ đồ bộ xương người.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-ljspeech-260916a2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-cori-260916a2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/skeleton-3b89b63b.webp', '[\"frame\", \"bones\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"human skeleton\", \"meaning\": \"bộ xương người\"}, {\"phrase\": \"skeleton key\", \"meaning\": \"chìa khóa vạn năng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"skeleton crew\", \"meaning\": \"đội ngũ tối thiểu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"skeletal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-cori-260916a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-aru0-260916a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-aru5-260916a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-aru6-260916a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-aru10-260916a2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-aru9-260916a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-aru3-260916a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-aru7-260916a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-aru8-260916a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-aru2-260916a2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-ljspeech-260916a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-lt408-260916a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-lt138-260916a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-lt624-260916a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-lt396-260916a2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-lt498-260916a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-lt132-260916a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-lt288-260916a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-lt42-260916a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeleton-lt90-260916a2.mp3\"]}}', 'Skeleton crew là cụm hay gặp trong TOEIC, nghĩa là đội ngũ nhân sự tối thiểu để duy trì hoạt động.', 'health', 1, 17),
('0e00d021-ca39-510e-ad54-1d426eabb718', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '4553fefa-30ce-5e06-b350-6c30768614d2', '499ff33c-7562-5f6e-94a2-d7d4fc179ef1', 'face', 'UK: /feɪs/ | US: /feɪs/', 'B1', 'verb', 'đối mặt, hướng về', 'to front or be positioned looking towards a specific direction or location.', 'The building faces the park.', 'Toà nhà hướng về phía công viên.', '{\"en\": \"The two managers sat across the table and faced each other during the discussion.\", \"vi\": \"Hai người quản lý ngồi đối diện bàn và hướng mặt về phía nhau trong suốt cuộc thảo luận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-ljspeech-49dc1cb0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-cori-49dc1cb0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/face-ff147a1e.webp', '[\"confront\", \"encounter\", \"front\", \"orient\"]', '[\"evade\", \"avoid\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"face a challenge\", \"meaning\": \"đối mặt với thử thách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"face each other\", \"meaning\": \"đối mặt/hướng vào nhau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be faced with\", \"meaning\": \"phải đối mặt với\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"confront\", \"note_vi\": \"confront mang sắc thái đối đầu mang tính xung đột/thử thách mạnh mẽ hơn face\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"face\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"facial\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-cori-49dc1cb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-aru0-49dc1cb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-aru5-49dc1cb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-aru6-49dc1cb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-aru10-49dc1cb0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-aru9-49dc1cb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-aru3-49dc1cb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-aru7-49dc1cb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-aru8-49dc1cb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-aru2-49dc1cb0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-ljspeech-49dc1cb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-lt408-49dc1cb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-lt138-49dc1cb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-lt624-49dc1cb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-lt396-49dc1cb0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-lt498-49dc1cb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-lt132-49dc1cb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-lt288-49dc1cb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-lt42-49dc1cb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/face-lt90-49dc1cb0.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong Part 1 TOEIC: \'face each other\' (đối diện nhau), \'face the screen\' (hướng về phía màn hình). Trong Part 7: \'face challenges\' (đối mặt thử thách).', 'office', 1, 18),
('e330c439-bdca-522f-9024-fa1de3f2b5e9', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '4553fefa-30ce-5e06-b350-6c30768614d2', '499ff33c-7562-5f6e-94a2-d7d4fc179ef1', 'hostel', '/ˈhɒstl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Nơi ở giá rẻ, thường có phòng ngủ chung, dành cho du khách.', 'a cheap place to stay, especially for young people, with shared rooms and bathrooms.', 'We stayed in a friendly youth hostel during our backpacking trip through Europe.', 'Chúng tôi đã ở một nhà nghỉ tập thể thân thiện trong chuyến đi ba lô xuyên châu Âu.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency recommended a budget hostel near the conference venue for the students.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch đã đề xuất một nhà nghỉ tập thể giá rẻ gần địa điểm hội nghị cho các sinh viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-ljspeech-028cd03a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-cori-028cd03a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hostel-763b2123.webp', '[\"inn\", \"guesthouse\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"youth hostel\", \"meaning\": \"nhà nghỉ giá rẻ cho thanh niên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hostel room\", \"meaning\": \"phòng nhà nghỉ tập thể\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hotel\", \"note_vi\": \"hotel là khách sạn riêng tư, hostel là nhà nghỉ tập thể giá rẻ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-cori-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru0-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru5-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru6-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru10-028cd03a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru9-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru3-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru7-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru8-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage