('6ace0a40-b08a-5818-8958-6671dd31b586', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '544bb5bb-f1ba-58ac-b10a-bea7871f3ad2', 'dc3118ff-6fbd-5a76-b2d8-fb019f59cac3', 'stock', 'UK: /stɒk/ | US: /stɑk/', 'B2', 'verb', 'xếp hàng lên kệ, dự trữ', 'to fill shelves or a storage space with goods available for sale or future use.', 'We need to stock the shelves before opening.', 'Chúng ta cần xếp hàng lên kệ trước giờ mở cửa.', '{\"en\": \"Employees will stock the shelves with new merchandise after the store closes tonight.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên sẽ xếp hàng hóa mới lên kệ sau khi cửa hàng đóng cửa tối nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-ljspeech-ed487e1e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-cori-ed487e1e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stock-1d7e9a63.webp', '[\"store\", \"supply\", \"replenish\"]', '[\"deplete\", \"empty\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stock shelves\", \"meaning\": \"xếp hàng lên kệ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stock up on\", \"meaning\": \"tích trữ đồ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stock\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stockholder\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-cori-ed487e1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-aru0-ed487e1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-aru5-ed487e1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-aru6-ed487e1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-aru10-ed487e1e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-aru9-ed487e1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-aru3-ed487e1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-aru7-ed487e1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-aru8-ed487e1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-aru2-ed487e1e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-ljspeech-ed487e1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-lt408-ed487e1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-lt138-ed487e1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-lt624-ed487e1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-lt396-ed487e1e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-lt498-ed487e1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-lt132-ed487e1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-lt288-ed487e1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-lt42-ed487e1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stock-lt90-ed487e1e.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi làm động từ, \'stock\' nghĩa là xếp hàng lên kệ (stock shelves) hoặc tích trữ (stock up on); khác danh từ là cổ phiếu/hàng tồn kho.', 'shopping', 1, 0),
('a1ac165c-1bbe-520e-9311-1ded9af01ac9', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '544bb5bb-f1ba-58ac-b10a-bea7871f3ad2', 'dc3118ff-6fbd-5a76-b2d8-fb019f59cac3', 'motel', '/məʊˈtel/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Khách sạn nhỏ dành cho người đi đường, thường có chỗ đậu xe riêng.', 'a hotel designed for people traveling by car, usually near a main road.', 'We decided to stay at a small motel on the outskirts of the town.', 'Chúng tôi quyết định ở lại một nhà nghỉ nhỏ ở ngoại ô thị trấn.', '{\"en\": \"Our sales representatives stayed at a comfortable motel near the highway during their business trip.\", \"vi\": \"Các đại diện kinh doanh của chúng tôi đã ở lại một nhà nghỉ ven đường thoải mái gần đường cao tốc trong chuyến công tác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motel-ljspeech-5db34efb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motel-cori-5db34efb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/motel-5f1b5ca6.webp', '[\"inn\", \"lodge\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"roadside motel\", \"meaning\": \"nhà nghỉ ven đường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"motel room\", \"meaning\": \"phòng nhà nghỉ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hotel\", \"note_vi\": \"hotel là khách sạn lớn, motel là nhà nghỉ ven đường cho tài xế.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motel-cori-5db34efb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motel-aru0-5db34efb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motel-aru5-5db34efb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motel-aru6-5db34efb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motel-aru10-5db34efb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motel-aru9-5db34efb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motel-aru3-5db34efb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motel-aru7-5db34efb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motel-aru8-5db34efb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motel-