('980cf8e8-53f7-5448-b369-1c52c47d69ea', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '544bb5bb-f1ba-58ac-b10a-bea7871f3ad2', 'dc3118ff-6fbd-5a76-b2d8-fb019f59cac3', 'breed', '/briːd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một giống loài động vật cụ thể, thường là chó hoặc mèo.', 'a particular type of animal that has been developed by people for specific traits.', 'This particular breed of dog is known for its loyalty and intelligence.', 'Giống chó đặc biệt này nổi tiếng về lòng trung thành và sự thông minh.', '{\"en\": \"The pet shop specializes in a rare breed of dog that is suitable for small apartments.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng thú cưng chuyên về một giống chó hiếm phù hợp với các căn hộ nhỏ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-ljspeech-42211867.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-cori-42211867.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/breed-e61ee84a.webp', '[\"variety\", \"type\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dog breed\", \"meaning\": \"giống chó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rare breed\", \"meaning\": \"giống hiếm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"breed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-cori-42211867.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-aru0-42211867.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-aru5-42211867.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-aru6-42211867.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-aru10-42211867.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-aru9-42211867.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-aru3-42211867.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-aru7-42211867.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-aru8-42211867.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-aru2-42211867.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-ljspeech-42211867.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-lt408-42211867.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-lt138-42211867.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-lt624-42211867.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-lt396-42211867.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-lt498-42211867.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-lt132-42211867.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-lt288-42211867.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-lt42-42211867.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breed-lt90-42211867.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ dùng cho động vật, không dùng cho con người.', 'other', 1, 2),
('4a5b1589-5cd3-5ac3-afe8-7eec991769e4', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '544bb5bb-f1ba-58ac-b10a-bea7871f3ad2', 'dc3118ff-6fbd-5a76-b2d8-fb019f59cac3', 'latter', '/ˈlætə(r)/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Cái thứ hai trong số hai điều đã được nhắc đến; phần sau.', 'referring to the second of two things or people that have just been mentioned.', 'Between the two options, I prefer the latter, as it\'s more practical.', 'Giữa hai lựa chọn, tôi thích cái sau hơn vì nó thực tế hơn.', '{\"en\": \"Between the two proposed marketing plans, the board decided to approve the latter option today.\", \"vi\": \"Giữa hai kế hoạch tiếp thị được đề xuất, hội đồng quản trị đã quyết định phê duyệt phương án sau vào hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/latter-ljspeech-e0a06c2e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/latter-cori-e0a06c2e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/latter-0a7cbca4.webp', '[\"second\", \"last\"]', '[\"former\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"the latter part\", \"meaning\": \"phần sau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"latter half\", \"meaning\": \"nửa sau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"later\", \"note_vi\": \"later chỉ thời gian (sau này), còn latter chỉ thứ tự (cái sau).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/latter-cori-e0a06c2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/latter-aru0-e0a06c2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/latter-aru5-e0a06c2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/latter-aru6-e0a06c2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/latter-aru10-e0a06c2e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/latter-aru9-e0a06c2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/latter-aru3-e0a06c2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/latter-aru7-e0a06c2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/latter-aru8-e0a06c2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/latter-