('aca81db7-0224-5981-b2e2-e9f4ceca853f', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '544bb5bb-f1ba-58ac-b10a-bea7871f3ad2', 'dc3118ff-6fbd-5a76-b2d8-fb019f59cac3', 'carbohydrate', '/ˌkɑːbəʊˈhaɪdreɪt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Chất dinh dưỡng chính trong thức ăn, cung cấp năng lượng cho cơ thể, như đường và tinh bột.', 'a substance found in food like sugar and bread that provides energy.', 'Nutritionists advise office workers to limit simple carbohydrate intake during late hours.', 'Các chuyên gia dinh dưỡng khuyên nhân viên văn phòng nên hạn chế nạp carbohydrate đơn vào giờ muộn.', '{\"en\": \"The office cafeteria now offers meals with low carbohydrate options for health-conscious employees.\", \"vi\": \"Căng tin văn phòng hiện cung cấp các bữa ăn ít tinh bột cho những nhân viên quan tâm đến sức khỏe.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-ljspeech-d1402d57.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-cori-d1402d57.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/carbohydrate-c42c6980.webp', '[\"sugar\", \"starch\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"complex carbohydrate\", \"meaning\": \"carbohydrate phức hợp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"low carbohydrate diet\", \"meaning\": \"chế độ ăn ít tinh bột\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-cori-d1402d57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-aru0-d1402d57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-aru5-d1402d57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-aru6-d1402d57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-aru10-d1402d57.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-aru9-d1402d57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-aru3-d1402d57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-aru7-d1402d57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v