('141bba11-b0a7-5dc0-9061-f3a7fbd1a70f', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '544bb5bb-f1ba-58ac-b10a-bea7871f3ad2', 'dc3118ff-6fbd-5a76-b2d8-fb019f59cac3', 'flexible', '/ˈfleksəbl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có thể uốn cong, dễ thay đổi hoặc thích nghi.', 'able to change or be changed easily according to the situation.', 'The new work schedule is very flexible, allowing employees to choose their hours.', 'Lịch làm việc mới rất linh hoạt, cho phép nhân viên tự chọn giờ làm của mình.', '{\"en\": \"We offer flexible working hours to help employees balance their professional and personal lives.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi cung cấp giờ làm việc linh hoạt để giúp nhân viên cân bằng cuộc sống công việc và cá nhân.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexible-ljspeech-ac6636e3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexible-cori-ac6636e3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flexible-0272a990.webp', '[\"adaptable\", \"adjustable\"]', '[\"rigid\", \"inflexible\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"flexible schedule\", \"meaning\": \"lịch trình linh hoạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"flexible working hours\", \"meaning\": \"giờ làm việc linh hoạt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"flexibility\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexible-cori-ac6636e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexible-aru0-ac6636e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexible-aru5-ac6636e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexible-aru6-ac6636e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexible-aru10-ac6636e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexible-aru9-ac6636e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexible-aru3-ac6636e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexible-aru7-ac6636e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flexible-aru8-ac6636e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub