('0be7a618-55fb-5407-b169-a699dd7c85ab', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '56bb7420-0358-50fe-bff0-9719ea9eef41', '7b0b6f2b-298e-5f90-a636-35741fb65b8c', 'artery', '/ˈɑːtəri/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Mạch máu lớn mang máu từ tim đi khắp cơ thể.', 'a blood vessel that carries blood away from the heart.', 'The doctor explained how blocked arteries can lead to heart problems.', 'Bác sĩ giải thích cách các động mạch bị tắc có thể dẫn đến các vấn đề về tim.', '{\"en\": \"The company nurse advised him to protect his artery health daily.\", \"vi\": \"Y tá công ty khuyên anh ấy bảo vệ sức khỏe động mạch hàng ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artery-ljspeech-af727c74.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artery-cori-af727c74.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/artery-308bae7b.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"coronary artery\", \"meaning\": \"động mạch vành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"blocked artery\", \"meaning\": \"động mạch tắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"artery disease\", \"meaning\": \"bệnh động mạch\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"vein\", \"note_vi\": \"artery mang máu đi, vein mang máu về tim\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"arterial\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artery-cori-af727c74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artery-aru0-af727c74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artery-aru5-af727c74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artery-aru6-af727c74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artery-aru10-af727c74.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artery-aru9-af727c74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artery-aru3-af727c74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artery-aru7-af727c74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artery-aru8-af727c74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artery-aru2-af727c74.mp3\"]}, \"u