('b14b59c8-6663-5563-91b2-7826046dadec', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '56bb7420-0358-50fe-bff0-9719ea9eef41', '7b0b6f2b-298e-5f90-a636-35741fb65b8c', 'eventually', '/ɪˈventʃuəli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Rốt cuộc, sau một thời gian hoặc nhiều sự việc xảy ra.', 'at the end of a period of time or after a series of events.', 'After many attempts, she eventually succeeded in passing the exam.', 'Sau nhiều lần thử, cuối cùng cô ấy đã thi đỗ.', '{\"en\": \"Although the negotiations were difficult, the two companies eventually signed the contract.\", \"vi\": \"Mặc dù các cuộc đàm phán rất khó khăn, hai công ty cuối cùng đã ký hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-ljspeech-5865020f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-cori-5865020f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eventually-56fb6a72.webp', '[\"finally\", \"ultimately\", \"in the end\"]', '[\"initially\", \"immediately\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"eventually lead to\", \"meaning\": \"cuối cùng dẫn đến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"possibly\", \"note_vi\": \"possibly là có khả năng, eventually là cuối cùng sẽ xảy ra.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"eventual\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-cori-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru0-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru5-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru6-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru10-5865020f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru9-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru3-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru7-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru8-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-aru2-5865020f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-ljspeech-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-lt408-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-lt138-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-lt624-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-lt396-5865020f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-lt498-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-lt132-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-lt288-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-lt42-5865020f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eventually-lt90-5865020f.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm \'eventually\' với \'possibly\' hay \'accidentally\'.', 'business', 1, 9),
('979e1f2e-eac4-5d80-9c4d-f8272c202252', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '56bb7420-0358-50fe-bff0-9719ea9eef41', '7b0b6f2b-298e-5f90-a636-35741fb65b8c', 'currently', 'UK: /ˈkʌrəntli/ | US: /ˈkɜrəntli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'hiện tại', 'At the present moment in time, or under existing present circumstances.', 'The manager is currently reviewing the project.', 'Người quản lý hiện đang xem xét dự án.', '{\"en\": \"Ms. Davis is currently reviewing the quarterly financial statements prepared by the accounting team.\", \"vi\": \"Cô Davis hiện đang xem xét các báo cáo tài chính quý do nhóm kế toán chuẩn bị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currently-ljspeech-0517dc15.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currently-cori-0517dc15.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/currently-41f017d3.webp', '[\"presently\", \"at present\", \"now\"]', '[\"formerly\", \"previously\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"currently available\", \"meaning\": \"hiện đang có sẵn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"currently under review\", \"meaning\": \"hiện đang được xem xét\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"current\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currently-cori-0517dc15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currently-aru0-0517dc15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currently-aru5-0517dc15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currently-aru6-0517dc15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currently-aru10-0517dc15.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currently-aru9-0517dc15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currently-aru3-0517dc15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currently-aru7-0517dc15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currently-aru8-0517dc15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currently-aru2-0517dc15.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/st