('065604a0-20bd-5cfe-a9f5-db2a88cdfc69', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '56bb7420-0358-50fe-bff0-9719ea9eef41', '7b0b6f2b-298e-5f90-a636-35741fb65b8c', 'enormous', '/ɪˈnɔːməs/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất lớn về kích thước, số lượng hoặc mức độ.', 'extremely large in size, amount, or degree compared to normal things.', 'They built an enormous new shopping mall on the edge of town.', 'Họ đã xây dựng một trung tâm mua sắm mới khổng lồ ở rìa thị trấn.', '{\"en\": \"The company reported an enormous increase in online sales during the last quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã báo cáo sự gia tăng to lớn về doanh số bán hàng trực tuyến trong quý vừa qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-ljspeech-b3d6a9b7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-cori-b3d6a9b7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enormous-ff055793.webp', '[\"huge\", \"immense\", \"massive\"]', '[\"tiny\", \"small\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"enormous amount\", \"meaning\": \"số lượng to lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"enormous success\", \"meaning\": \"thành công to lớn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"enormity\", \"note_vi\": \"sự tàn ác hoặc quy mô cực kỳ lớn (thường mang ý tiêu cực)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"enormously\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"enormity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-cori-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-aru0-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-aru5-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-aru6-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-aru10-b3d6a9b7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-aru9-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-aru3-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enormous-aru7-b3d6a9b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publi