('3cc871f8-dfe9-5f21-bbce-1a60462e2e1f', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '56bb7420-0358-50fe-bff0-9719ea9eef41', '7b0b6f2b-298e-5f90-a636-35741fb65b8c', 'defense', '/dɪˈfens/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành động bảo vệ, chống lại sự tấn công hoặc nguy hiểm.', 'the action of protecting someone or something against attack or danger.', 'The country invested heavily in its defense system to protect its borders.', 'Quốc gia đã đầu tư mạnh vào hệ thống phòng thủ để bảo vệ biên giới của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The company upgraded its cybersecurity defense to protect sensitive client data from hackers.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã nâng cấp hệ thống phòng thủ an ninh mạng để bảo vệ dữ liệu nhạy cảm của khách hàng khỏi tin tặc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-ljspeech-7df726a5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-cori-7df726a5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/defense-497721b8.webp', '[\"protection\", \"shield\", \"guard\"]', '[\"offense\", \"attack\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"air defense\", \"meaning\": \"phòng không\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in defense of\", \"meaning\": \"để bảo vệ cho\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"defend\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"defensive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-cori-7df726a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-aru0-7df726a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-aru5-7df726a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-aru6-7df726a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-aru10-7df726a5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-aru9-7df726a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-aru3-7df726a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-aru7-7df726a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-aru8-7df726a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-aru2-7df726a5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-ljspeech-7df726a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-lt408-7df726a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-lt138-7df726a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-lt624-7df726a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-lt396-7df726a5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-lt498-7df726a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-lt132-7df726a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-lt288-7df726a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-lt42-7df726a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defense-lt90-7df726a5.mp3\"]}}', 'Người Anh viết là \'defence\', người Mỹ viết là \'defense\'.', 'technology', 1, 20),
('7e4520e2-78ba-5323-8885-bcb9383a5ae8', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '56bb7420-0358-50fe-bff0-9719ea9eef41', '7b0b6f2b-298e-5f90-a636-35741fb65b8c', 'imperative verb', '/ɪmˈperətɪv vɜːb/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Dạng động từ dùng để ra lệnh, yêu cầu hoặc đưa ra hướng dẫn.', 'a word used to give a direct order, instruction, or request to someone else.', 'In the sentence \"Close the door,\" \"close\" is an imperative verb.', 'Trong câu \"Close the door\" (Đóng cửa lại), \"close\" là một động từ mệnh lệnh.', '{\"en\": \"The safety manual uses an imperative verb to tell staff how to operate machinery.\", \"vi\": \"Sổ tay an toàn sử dụng động từ mệnh lệnh để hướng dẫn nhân viên cách vận hành máy móc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-verb-ljspeech-2e77554a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-verb-cori-2e77554a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/imperative-verb-5619c093.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"use an imperative\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng câu mệnh lệnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"imperative sentence\", \"meaning\": \"câu mệnh lệnh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"imperative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-verb-cori-2e77554a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-verb-aru0-2e77554a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-verb-aru5-2e77554a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-verb-aru6-2e77554a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-verb-aru10-2e77554a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-verb-aru9-2e77554a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-verb-aru3-2e77554a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-verb-aru7-2e77554a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imperative-verb-aru8-2e77554a.mp3\", \"/s