('827fd527-30df-55f2-911e-de52cf01f461', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '56bb7420-0358-50fe-bff0-9719ea9eef41', '7b0b6f2b-298e-5f90-a636-35741fb65b8c', 'surprised', '/səˈpraɪzd/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy bất ngờ hoặc kinh ngạc trước điều gì đó.', 'Experiencing mild astonishment or disbelief due to an unforeseen event or news.', 'She was genuinely surprised when her friends threw her a birthday party.', 'Cô ấy thực sự ngạc nhiên khi bạn bè tổ chức tiệc sinh nhật cho cô.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was surprised by the sudden increase in quarterly sales figures.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng đã ngạc nhiên trước sự gia tăng đột ngột của số liệu doanh thu quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprised-ljspeech-39da98e5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprised-cori-39da98e5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/surprised-09861654.webp', '[\"astonished\", \"amazed\", \"startled\"]', '[\"unmoved\", \"indifferent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"surprised at\", \"meaning\": \"ngạc nhiên về cái gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pleasantly surprised\", \"meaning\": \"ngạc nhiên một cách thú vị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"surprising\", \"note_vi\": \"surprised chỉ cảm xúc người, surprising chỉ tính chất vật\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"surprise\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"surprise\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"surprising\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"surprisingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprised-cori-39da98e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprised-aru0-39da98e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprised-aru5-39da98e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprised-aru6-39da98e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprised-aru10-39da98e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surprised-aru9-39da98e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/