('4438127d-5bcb-5ea2-a115-64c046b360b3', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '5ccb966e-1727-5abc-b990-3fc297dfa50d', 'da401ca6-5f2f-5177-8dc7-33ba5610e2a6', 'settle', 'UK: /ˈsɛtl/ | US: /ˈsɛtl/', 'B2', 'verb', 'giải quyết', 'To reach an official agreement or resolve a dispute through discussion or compromise.', 'They hope to settle the dispute by the end of the week.', 'Họ hy vọng sẽ giải quyết tranh chấp vào cuối tuần.', '{\"en\": \"The two companies managed to settle their contract dispute out of court.\", \"vi\": \"Hai công ty đã giải quyết được tranh chấp hợp đồng ngoài tòa án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-ljspeech-d424af29.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-cori-d424af29.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/settle-b2b56afc.webp', '[\"resolve\", \"finalize\", \"reconcile\", \"conclude\"]', '[\"dispute\", \"prolong\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"settle an account\", \"meaning\": \"thanh toán một tài khoản / hóa đơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"settle a dispute\", \"meaning\": \"giải quyết tranh chấp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"settlement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-cori-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru0-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru5-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru6-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru10-d424af29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru9-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru3-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru7-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru8-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-aru2-d424af29.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-ljspeech-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt408-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt138-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt624-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt396-d424af29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt498-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt132-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt288-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt42-d424af29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/settle-lt90-d424af29.mp3\"]}}', '\'Settle a dispute/claim/invoice\': giải quyết tranh chấp/yêu cầu/thanh toán hóa đơn. Cụm \'settle out of court\' là hòa giải ngoài tòa.', 'legal', 1, 6),
