('27068ead-4b06-5bc9-baa9-281535eb817f', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '5ccb966e-1727-5abc-b990-3fc297dfa50d', 'da401ca6-5f2f-5177-8dc7-33ba5610e2a6', 'explicit', 'UK: /ɪkˈsplɪsɪt/ | US: /ɪkˈsplɪsɪt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'rõ ràng, dứt khoát', 'expressed in a clear and direct manner, leaving no doubt about the meaning.', 'The instructions were explicit about the new policy.', 'Các hướng dẫn rất rõ ràng về chính sách mới.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor gave explicit instructions on how to process the refund.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát đã đưa ra các hướng dẫn rõ ràng về cách xử lý khoản hoàn tiền.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-ljspeech-a45c2264.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-cori-a45c2264.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/explicit-6dcfdff6.webp', '[\"clear\", \"direct\", \"unambiguous\", \"precise\"]', '[\"implicit\", \"vague\", \"ambiguous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"explicit instructions\", \"meaning\": \"hướng dẫn rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"explicit permission\", \"meaning\": \"sự cho phép rõ ràng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"implicit\", \"note_vi\": \"Explicit là nói trực tiếp rõ ràng, còn implicit là ngầm hiểu/không thể hiện ra ngoài bằng lời.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"explicitly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-cori-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-aru0-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-aru5-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-aru6-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-aru10-a45c2264.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-aru9-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-aru3-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explicit-aru7-a45c2264.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pron