('cc8a7107-e4fd-5ce6-b600-3200de231aaf', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '5ccb966e-1727-5abc-b990-3fc297dfa50d', 'da401ca6-5f2f-5177-8dc7-33ba5610e2a6', 'kick', '/kɪk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hành động đá bằng chân.', 'an act of hitting something or someone with your foot.', 'The soccer player scored with a powerful kick from outside the box.', 'Cầu thủ bóng đá đã ghi bàn bằng một cú sút mạnh từ ngoài vòng cấm.', '{\"en\": \"The athlete damaged his ankle after giving a powerful kick during the charity match.\", \"vi\": \"Vận động viên đã bị thương ở cổ chân sau khi thực hiện một cú đá mạnh trong trận đấu từ thiện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-ljspeech-eac61365.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-cori-eac61365.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/kick-097c4237.webp', '[\"strike\", \"hit\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"powerful kick\", \"meaning\": \"cú đá mạnh mẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"free kick\", \"meaning\": \"cú sút phạt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"kick\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-cori-eac61365.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-aru0-eac61365.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-aru5-eac61365.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-aru6-eac61365.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-aru10-eac61365.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-aru9-eac61365.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-aru3-eac61365.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-aru7-eac61365.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-aru8-eac61365.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-aru2-eac61365.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-ljspeech-eac61365.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-lt408-eac61365.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-lt138-eac61365.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-lt624-eac61365.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-lt396-eac61365.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-lt498-eac61365.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-lt132-eac61365.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-lt288-eac61365.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-lt42-eac61365.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/kick-lt90-eac61365.mp3\"]}}', 'Kick làm danh từ nghĩa là cú đá, ngoài ra còn mang nghĩa thích thú trong \'get a kick out of\'.', 'daily', 1, 23),
('ccb5df12-74e6-5b1e-b163-9b963a227852', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '5ccb966e-1727-5abc-b990-3fc297dfa50d', 'da401ca6-5f2f-5177-8dc7-33ba5610e2a6', 'photography', '/fəˈtɒɡrəfi/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Nghệ thuật hoặc quá trình chụp ảnh.', 'The action or profession of capturing images on light-sensitive paper or digital sensors.', 'My hobby is wildlife photography, and I love capturing animals in their natural habitats.', 'Sở thích của tôi là nhiếp ảnh động vật hoang dã, và tôi thích chụp ảnh động vật trong môi trường tự nhiên của chúng.', '{\"en\": \"The company hired a specialist to handle event photography for the product launch.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một chuyên gia đảm nhận việc chụp ảnh sự kiện cho lễ ra mắt sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-ljspeech-9aa15b5b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-cori-9aa15b5b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/photography-b1a31d45.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"digital photography\", \"meaning\": \"nhiếp ảnh kỹ thuật số\"}, {\"phrase\": \"commercial photography\", \"meaning\": \"nhiếp ảnh thương mại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"photographer\", \"note_vi\": \"photography là nghề/nghệ thuật chụp ảnh, photographer là thợ chụp ảnh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"photograph\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"photographer\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"photographic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-cori-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru0-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru5-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru6-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru10-9aa15b5b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru9-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru3-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru7-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru8-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-aru2-9aa15b5b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-ljspeech-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-lt408-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-lt138-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-lt624-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-lt396-9aa15b5b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-lt498-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-lt132-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-lt288-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-lt42-9aa15b5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/photography-lt90-9aa15b5b.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý nhấn trọng âm vào âm tiết thứ hai: pho-TOG-ra-phy.', 'media', 1, 24),
('d7631250-7c53-5b1c-861e-40c7e52f8c3a', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '5ccb966e-1727-5abc-b990-3fc297dfa50d', 'da401ca6-5f2f-5177-8dc7-33ba5610e2a6', 'ape', '/eɪp/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Loài linh trưởng lớn, không có đuôi, như tinh tinh hay đười ươi.', 'a large animal like a monkey with no tail, such as a chimpanzee.', 'Gorillas are the largest living species of ape.', 'Khỉ đột là loài vượn lớn nhất còn sống.', '{\"en\": \"The wildlife documentary about the endangered ape attracted millions of viewers last night.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phim tài liệu về động vật hoang dã về loài khỉ không đuôi có nguy cơ tuyệt chủng đã thu hút hàng triệu người xem tối qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-ljspeech-abc1f33c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-cori-abc1f33c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ape-9b83cb39.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"great ape\", \"meaning\": \"loài khỉ lớn không đuôi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"monkey\", \"note_vi\": \"monkey thường có đuôi, ape thì không có đuôi.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-cori-abc1f33c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-aru0-abc1f33c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-aru5-abc1f33c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-aru6-abc1f33c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-aru10-abc1f33c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-aru9-abc1f33c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-aru3-abc1f33c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-aru7-abc1f33c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-aru8-abc1f33c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-aru2-abc1f33c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-ljspeech-abc1f33c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-lt408-abc1f33c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-lt138-abc1f33c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-lt624-abc1f33c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-lt396-abc1f33c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-lt498-abc1f33c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-lt132-abc1f33c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-lt288-abc1f33c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-lt42-abc1f33c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ape-lt90-abc1f33c.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt ape (không đuôi, kích thước lớn) với monkey (có đuôi).', 'nature', 1, 25),
('1b409ca3-daf4-5780-94f7-0a530174659b', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '5ccb966e-1727-5abc-b990-3fc297dfa50d', 'da401ca6-5f2f-5177-8dc7-33ba5610e2a6', 'freckle', '/ˈfrekl/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Chấm nhỏ màu nâu trên da, thường xuất hiện do tiếp xúc với nắng.', 'a small, pale brown spot on the skin, usually caused by the sun.', 'Her face was covered with cute little freckles after spending a summer at the beach.', 'Khuôn mặt cô ấy đầy những đốm tàn nhang nhỏ xinh sau một mùa hè ở bãi biển.', '{\"en\": \"The cosmetics company launched a new cream that helps reduce the appearance of a freckle.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty mỹ phẩm đã ra mắt một loại kem mới giúp làm giảm sự xuất hiện của tàn nhang.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-ljspeech-c2307d67.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-cori-c2307d67.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/freckle-93f9e35f.webp', '[\"spot\", \"blemish\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sun freckle\", \"meaning\": \"tàn nhang do nắng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mole\", \"note_vi\": \"mole là nốt ruồi (thường lồi và sẫm màu), freckle là tàn nhang (phẳng)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"freckled\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-cori-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru0-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru5-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru6-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru10-c2307d67.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru9-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru3-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru7-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru8-c2307d67.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freckle-aru2-c23