('08563c46-cb01-56b8-b1e7-46613ce336d2', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '5ccb966e-1727-5abc-b990-3fc297dfa50d', 'da401ca6-5f2f-5177-8dc7-33ba5610e2a6', 'stress', '/stres/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Trạng thái căng thẳng tinh thần hoặc thể chất.', 'Mental or emotional strain resulting from demanding operational environments or personal hardship.', 'Too much work can lead to high levels of stress and burnout.', 'Làm việc quá nhiều có thể dẫn đến mức độ căng thẳng cao và kiệt sức.', '{\"en\": \"The company introduced wellness workshops to help employees reduce workplace stress effectively.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã giới thiệu các buổi hội thảo sức khỏe để giúp nhân viên giảm căng thẳng nơi làm việc một cách hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-ljspeech-165bd364.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-cori-165bd364.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stress-a40673be.webp', '[\"tension\", \"pressure\"]', '[\"relaxation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"relieve stress\", \"meaning\": \"giải tỏa căng thẳng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"workplace stress\", \"meaning\": \"căng thẳng nơi làm việc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stressful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stressed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-cori-165bd364.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-aru0-165bd364.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-aru5-165bd364.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-aru6-165bd364.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-aru10-165bd364.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-aru9-165bd364.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-aru3-165bd364.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-aru7-165bd364.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-aru8-165bd364.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-aru2-165bd364.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-ljspeech-165bd364.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-lt408-165bd364.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-lt138-165bd364.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-lt624-165bd364.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-lt396-165bd364.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-lt498-165bd364.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-lt132-165bd364.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-lt288-165bd364.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-lt42-165bd364.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stress-lt90-165bd364.mp3\"]}}', 'Cả danh từ và động từ đều là stress; tính từ mô tả vụ việc là stressful, mô tả người là stressed.', 'hr', 1, 27),
('f7071862-4e77-5951-b41e-5d15977e8efc', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '5ccb966e-1727-5abc-b990-3fc297dfa50d', 'da401ca6-5f2f-5177-8dc7-33ba5610e2a6', 'grammatical', '/ɡrəˈmætɪkl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về hoặc liên quan đến ngữ pháp.', 'relating to the rules of language and how words are put together.', 'You need to check your essay for any grammatical errors before submitting it.', 'Bạn cần kiểm tra bài luận của mình xem có lỗi ngữ pháp nào không trước khi nộp.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure that all business emails are free of spelling and grammatical errors before sending.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo rằng tất cả email công việc không có lỗi chính tả và ngữ pháp trước khi gửi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grammatical-ljspeech-c33f5ed6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grammatical-cori-c33f5ed6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grammatical-cd4101ea.webp', '[\"syntactic\"]', '[\"ungrammatical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"grammatical error\", \"meaning\": \"lỗi ngữ pháp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"grammatical structure\", \"meaning\": \"cấu trúc ngữ pháp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"grammar\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"grammatically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grammatical-cori-c33f5ed6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grammatical-aru0-c33f5ed6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grammatical-aru5-c33f5ed6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grammatical-aru6-c33f5ed6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grammatical-aru10-c33f5ed6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grammatical-aru9-c33f5ed6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grammatical-aru3-c33f5ed6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grammatical-aru7-c33f5ed6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grammatical-aru8-c33