('18e40209-2f6b-5cd2-9731-ee31713f70b3', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '5ccb966e-1727-5abc-b990-3fc297dfa50d', 'da401ca6-5f2f-5177-8dc7-33ba5610e2a6', 'embrace', 'UK: /ɪmˈbreɪs/ | US: /ɪmˈbreɪs/', 'B2', 'verb', 'đón nhận, ủng hộ (một ý tưởng, quan điểm)', 'To willingly accept or enthusiastically support a new belief, concept, or change.', 'The company decided to embrace new technologies.', 'Công ty quyết định đón nhận những công nghệ mới.', '{\"en\": \"Management encourages staff to embrace new digital tools to increase work efficiency.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý khuyến khích nhân viên đón nhận các công cụ kỹ thuật số mới để tăng hiệu quả công việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-ljspeech-c88f94de.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-cori-c88f94de.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/embrace-5dbef951.webp', '[\"adopt\", \"accept\", \"welcome\"]', '[\"reject\", \"refuse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"embrace new technology\", \"meaning\": \"đón nhận công nghệ mới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"embrace change\", \"meaning\": \"sẵn sàng tiếp nhận sự thay đổi\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-cori-c88f94de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-aru0-c88f94de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-aru5-c88f94de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-aru6-c88f94de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-aru10-c88f94de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-aru9-c88f94de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-aru3-c88f94de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-aru7-c88f94de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-aru8-c88f94de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-aru2-c88f94de.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-ljspeech-c88f94de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-lt408-c88f94de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-lt138-c88f94de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-lt624-c88f94de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-lt396-c88f94de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-lt498-c88f94de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-lt132-c88f94de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-lt288-c88f94de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-lt42-c88f94de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/embrace-lt90-c88f94de.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa ôm, trong công sở từ này có nghĩa là hào hứng tiếp thu sự thay đổi/công nghệ mới (embrace change/technology).', 'management', 1, 29),
('ee891a29-04c7-5356-8377-4df260f358fd', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '6fcb6b2b-4e65-59d9-a8d5-ff4c6264d8f2', '50473f88-20d1-5564-8bdb-eec32e3f5746', 'pulse', '/pʌls/', 'B1', 'noun', 'nhịp đập của tim mà bạn có thể cảm nhận được ở cổ tay hoặc cổ.', 'the regular movement of blood in the body that can be felt in the wrist.', 'The doctor checked the patient\'s pulse to measure their heart rate.', 'Bác sĩ kiểm tra mạch của bệnh nhân để đo nhịp tim.', '{\"en\": \"The doctor checked the patient\'s pulse to ensure his heart rate was stable after surgery.\", \"vi\": \"Bác sĩ kiểm tra mạch của bệnh nhân để đảm bảo nhịp tim ổn định sau ca phẫu thuật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-ljspeech-8439fc48.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-cori-8439fc48.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pulse-b18e85b8.webp', '[\"heartbeat\", \"rhythm\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"check pulse\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm tra mạch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fast pulse\", \"meaning\": \"mạch nhanh\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-cori-8439fc48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-aru0-8439fc48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-aru5-8439fc48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-aru6-8439fc48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-aru10-8439fc48.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-aru9-8439fc48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-aru3-8439fc48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-aru7-8439fc48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-aru8-8439fc48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-aru2-8439fc48.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-ljspeech-8439fc48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-lt408-8439fc48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-lt138-8439fc48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-lt624-8439fc48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-lt396-8439fc48.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-lt498-8439fc48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-lt132-8439fc48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-lt288-8439fc48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-lt42-8439fc48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pulse-lt90-8439fc48.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh y tế hoặc kiểm tra sức khỏe.', 'health', 1, 0),
('866be34b-1b59-5d6e-bd8a-aef25ad73ebe', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '6fcb6b2b-4e65-59d9-a8d5-ff4c6264d8f2', '50473f88-20d1-5564-8bdb-eec32e3f5746', 'sale', '/seɪl/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Hành động bán hàng hóa hoặc dịch vụ; sự kiện giảm giá.', 'an act of exchanging something for money or a period when goods are sold at lower prices.', 'Electronic devices are available at discounted prices during the annual holiday sale.', 'Các thiết bị điện tử được bán với giá ưu đãi trong đợt giảm giá dịp lễ hàng năm.', '{\"en\": \"The retail store announced a clearance sale to clear out last season\'s inventory.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng bán lẻ đã thông báo một đợt bán thanh lý để dọn sạch hàng tồn kho mùa trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-ljspeech-5b8a763b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-cori-5b8a763b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sale-a7716eb8.webp', '[\"selling\", \"transaction\", \"discount\"]', '[\"purchase\", \"buying\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"clearance sale\", \"meaning\": \"bán thanh lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"for sale\", \"meaning\": \"để bán\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sell\", \"note_vi\": \"sell là động từ bán, sale là danh từ sự bán hoặc đợt giảm giá.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sell\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-cori-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru0-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru5-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru6-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru10-5b8a763b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru9-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru3-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru7-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sale-aru8-5b8a763b.mp3\", \"/stora