('424de2a5-b3da-55ff-8226-9900b8935e1d', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '6fcb6b2b-4e65-59d9-a8d5-ff4c6264d8f2', '50473f88-20d1-5564-8bdb-eec32e3f5746', 'hockey', '/ˈhɒki/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Môn thể thao dùng gậy đánh bóng hoặc đĩa vào khung thành.', 'a sport played on a field or ice where players use sticks to hit a ball.', 'The university team practices hockey every afternoon to prepare for the regional tournament.', 'Đội bóng của trường đại học tập luyện khúc côn cầu mỗi chiều để chuẩn bị cho giải đấu khu vực.', '{\"en\": \"Our company is sponsoring a local hockey team to improve our brand visibility in the community.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đang tài trợ cho một đội khúc côn cầu địa phương để cải thiện độ nhận diện thương hiệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-ljspeech-f2847b1b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-cori-f2847b1b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hockey-c06bca0f.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ice hockey\", \"meaning\": \"khúc côn cầu trên băng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"field hockey\", \"meaning\": \"khúc côn cầu trên sân cỏ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-cori-f2847b1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-aru0-f2847b1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-aru5-f2847b1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-aru6-f2847b1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-aru10-f2847b1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-aru9-f2847b1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-aru3-f2847b1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-aru7-f2847b1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-aru8-f2847b1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-aru2-f2847b1b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-ljspeech-f2847b1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-lt408-f2847b1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-lt138-f2847b1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-lt624-f2847b1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-lt396-f2847b1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-lt498-f2847b1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-lt132-f2847b1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-lt288-f2847b1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-lt42-f2847b1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hockey-lt90-f2847b1b.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh TOEIC, từ này thường xuất hiện trong các bài đọc về tài trợ thể thao.', 'other', 1, 7),
('e5e49cc9-d21c-5b3e-9e58-6b450cc42c8f', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '6fcb6b2b-4e65-59d9-a8d5-ff4c6264d8f2', '50473f88-20d1-5564-8bdb-eec32e3f5746', 'dimension', '/daɪˈmenʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một trong các số đo như chiều dài, rộng, cao của vật thể.', 'a measurement of the length, width, or height of something.', 'We need to measure the exact dimensions of the room before buying new furniture.', 'Chúng ta cần đo kích thước chính xác của căn phòng trước khi mua đồ nội thất mới.', '{\"en\": \"Please double-check the dimensions of the shipping boxes before placing the order.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng kiểm tra kỹ kích thước của các hộp vận chuyển trước khi đặt hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-ljspeech-2e2815c7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-cori-2e2815c7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dimension-d43f4130.webp', '[\"measurement\", \"size\", \"proportion\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"exact dimensions\", \"meaning\": \"kích thước chính xác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"physical dimensions\", \"meaning\": \"kích thước vật lý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"size\", \"note_vi\": \"size là cỡ chung chung, dimension là số đo chi tiết dài/rộng/cao\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dimensional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-cori-2e2815c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-aru0-2e2815c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-aru5-2e2815c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-aru6-2e2815c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-aru10-2e2815c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-aru9-2e2815c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-aru3-2e2815c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-aru7-2e2815c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-aru8-2e2815c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-aru2-2e2815c7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-ljspeech-2e2815c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-lt408-2e2815c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-lt138-2e2815c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-lt624-2e2815c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-lt396-2e2815c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-lt498-2e2815c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-lt132-2e2815c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-lt288-2e2815c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-lt42-2e2815c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dimension-lt90-2e2815c7.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, từ này thường xuất hiện ở dạng số nhiều \'dimensions\'.', 'manufacturing', 1, 8),
('b3bea484-3ca7-5d93-a4c2-fcfa58510e50', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '6fcb6b2b-4e65-59d9-a8d5-ff4c6264d8f2', '50473f88-20d1-5564-8bdb-eec32e3f5746', 'extended family', '/ɪkˈstendɪd ˈfæməlɪ/', 'B1', 'phrase', 'Gia đình gồm nhiều thế hệ cùng chung sống hoặc có quan hệ gần gũi.', 'a group consisting of parents, children, grandparents, and other close relatives.', 'In many cultures, living with your extended family is a common practice.', 'Ở nhiều nền văn hóa, việc sống cùng đại gia đình là một thông lệ phổ biến.', '{\"en\": \"The luxury resort offers special packages suitable for hosting large extended family reunions.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng sang trọng cung cấp các gói đặc biệt phù hợp để tổ chức đoàn tụ đại gia đình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-ljspeech-30412fb6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-cori-30412fb6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extended-family-e8d99d19.webp', NULL, '[\"nuclear family\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"extended family members\", \"meaning\": \"các thành viên đại gia đình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extended family network\", \"meaning\": \"mạng lưới đại gia đình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"nuclear family\", \"note_vi\": \"nuclear family là gia đình hạt nhân chỉ gồm bố mẹ và con cái\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"extend\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"extension\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-cori-30412fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-aru0-30412fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-aru5-30412fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-aru6-30412fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-aru10-30412fb6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-aru9-30412fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-aru3-30412fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-aru7-30412fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-aru8-30412fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-aru2-30412fb6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-ljspeech-30412fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-lt408-30412fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-lt138-30412fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-lt624-30412fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-lt396-30412fb6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-lt498-30412fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-lt132-30412fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-lt288-30412fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-lt42-30412fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extended-family-lt90-30412fb6.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt đại gia đình (extended family) với gia đình hạt nhân (nuclear family).', 'daily', 1, 9),
('c1b10b53-caee-55c9-ac01-90145c4f0331', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '6fcb6b2b-4e65-59d9-a8d5-ff4c6264d8f2', '50473f88-20d1-5564-8bdb-eec32e3f5746', 'feedback', 'UK: /ˈfiːdbæk/ | US: /ˈfiːdbæk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'ý kiến phản hồi', 'Information about reactions to a product or performance used as a basis for improvement.', 'We welcome your feedback on our new product.', 'Chúng tôi hoan nghênh phản hồi của bạn về sản phẩm mới của chúng tôi.', '{\"en\": \"Management relies heavily on customer feedback to continuously enhance product quality.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý phụ thuộc rất nhiều vào ý kiến phản hồi của khách hàng để liên tục nâng cao chất lượng sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feedback-ljspeech-ef15f48c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feedback-cori-ef15f48c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/feedback-f743a190.webp', '[\"response\", \"comments\", \"input\", \"evaluation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"constructive feedback\", \"meaning\": \"phản hồi mang tính xây dựng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"customer feedback\", \"meaning\": \"phản hồi từ khách hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"provide feedback\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra phản hồi\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feedback-cori-ef15f48c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feedback-aru0-ef15f48c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feedback-aru5-ef15f48c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feedback-aru6-ef15f48c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feedback-aru10-ef15f48c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feedback-aru9-ef15f48c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feedback-aru3-ef15f48c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feedback-aru7-ef15f48c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feedback-aru8-ef15f48c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pro