('ee667185-939e-571e-a4ee-68b8c120c701', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '6fcb6b2b-4e65-59d9-a8d5-ff4c6264d8f2', '50473f88-20d1-5564-8bdb-eec32e3f5746', 'catch', '/kætʃ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hành động bắt lấy một vật đang bay hoặc rơi.', 'the action of taking hold of something that is moving through the air.', 'The outfielder made an amazing catch to save the game.', 'Cầu thủ ngoài sân đã có một pha bắt bóng tuyệt vời để cứu vãn trận đấu.', '{\"en\": \"The company picnic featured a friendly baseball game where the director made an amazing catch.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyến dã ngoại của công ty có một trận bóng chày giao hữu, nơi giám đốc đã có một pha bắt bóng tuyệt vời.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-ljspeech-9ebad64e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-cori-9ebad64e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/catch-f423d9d3.webp', '[\"grab\", \"capture\"]', '[\"drop\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"make a catch\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện pha bắt bóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"great catch\", \"meaning\": \"pha bắt bóng tuyệt vời\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"catch\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"catcher\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-cori-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru0-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru5-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru6-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru10-9ebad64e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru9-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru3-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru7-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru8-9ebad64e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-aru2-9ebad64e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/st