('b8e4149a-2c11-5bc7-b30e-37342c8611c1', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '6fcb6b2b-4e65-59d9-a8d5-ff4c6264d8f2', '50473f88-20d1-5564-8bdb-eec32e3f5746', 'skinny', '/ˈskɪni/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất gầy.', 'very thin in a way that is not attractive or healthy.', 'After being sick for a week, he looked quite skinny.', 'Sau khi ốm một tuần, anh ấy trông khá gầy nhom.', '{\"en\": \"The clothing store updated its inventory to include more sizes, not just for skinny models.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng quần áo đã cập nhật danh mục hàng hóa để có nhiều kích cỡ hơn, không chỉ dành cho người mẫu gầy nhom.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-ljspeech-689b8c7e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-cori-689b8c7e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/skinny-3f6ec9ff.webp', '[\"thin\", \"scrawny\"]', '[\"fat\", \"plump\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"skinny jeans\", \"meaning\": \"quần jean bó sát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"skinny boy\", \"meaning\": \"cậu bé gầy nhom\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"slim\", \"note_vi\": \"slim mang nghĩa tích cực (mảnh mai), skinny mang nghĩa tiêu cực (gầy nhom)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"skin\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"skinniness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-cori-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru0-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru5-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru6-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru10-689b8c7e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru9-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru3-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru7-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru8-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-aru2-689b8c7e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-ljspeech-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-lt408-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-lt138-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-lt624-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-lt396-689b8c7e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-lt498-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-lt132-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-lt288-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-lt42-689b8c7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skinny-lt90-689b8c7e.mp3\"]}}', 'Skinny thường mang nghĩa tiêu cực (gầy gò, thiếu sức sống) hơn so với slim.', 'shopping', 1, 16),
('c33ff194-9fdc-518c-82e8-d0f51b8a548e', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '6fcb6b2b-4e65-59d9-a8d5-ff4c6264d8f2', '50473f88-20d1-5564-8bdb-eec32e3f5746', 'passive voice', '/ˈpæsɪv vɔɪs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'cấu trúc ngữ pháp mà chủ ngữ chịu tác động của hành động.', 'a grammatical structure where the object of an action becomes the subject of the sentence.', 'Using the passive voice can sometimes make your writing sound more formal.', 'Sử dụng thể bị động đôi khi có thể làm cho văn viết của bạn nghe trang trọng hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor requested that the formal report be written in the passive voice for objectivity.\", \"vi\": \"Giám sát viên yêu cầu báo cáo chính thức phải được viết ở thể bị động để đảm bảo tính khách quan.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-voice-ljspeech-6912b276.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-voice-cori-6912b276.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/passive-voice-b864b228.webp', NULL, '[\"active voice\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"use passive voice\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng thể bị động\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-voice-cori-6912b276.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-voice-aru0-6912b276.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-voice-aru5-6912b276.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-voice-aru6-6912b276.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-voice-aru10-6912b276.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-voice-aru9-6912b276.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-voice-aru3-6912b276.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-voice-aru7-6912b276.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-voice-aru8-6912b276.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-voice-aru2-6912b276.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\"