('37bda23e-48ab-524e-a510-7091405b7af4', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '6fcb6b2b-4e65-59d9-a8d5-ff4c6264d8f2', '50473f88-20d1-5564-8bdb-eec32e3f5746', 'chubby', '/ˈtʃʌbi/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Hơi béo, tròn trĩnh, thường dùng để mô tả trẻ em.', 'slightly fat in a way that people often find attractive or pleasant to look at.', 'My nephew became quite chubby after spending two months at his grandmother\'s house.', 'Cháu trai của tôi trở nên khá mập mạp sau khi ở nhà bà ngoại hai tháng.', '{\"en\": \"The advertisement featured a chubby mascot to make the brand seem friendly and approachable.\", \"vi\": \"Quảng cáo có hình ảnh linh vật mập mạp để làm cho thương hiệu có vẻ thân thiện và dễ gần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chubby-ljspeech-847d0a86.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chubby-cori-847d0a86.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chubby-08d49ba9.webp', '[\"plump\", \"round\"]', '[\"thin\", \"slim\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"chubby cheeks\", \"meaning\": \"má phúng phính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"chubby hands\", \"meaning\": \"bàn tay mập mạp\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chubby-cori-847d0a86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chubby-aru0-847d0a86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chubby-aru5-847d0a86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chubby-aru6-847d0a86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chubby-aru10-847d0a86.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chubby-aru9-847d0a86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chubby-aru3-847d0a86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chubby-aru7-847d0a86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chubby-aru8-847d0a86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chubby-aru2-847d0a86.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ch