('73145f9e-5f57-51af-a0ac-1fdeb35999af', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '74e8d70e-07fd-54af-a2e6-fde505c7abfd', '40810875-f2f8-579a-8a7c-8a8c7abb4012', 'interior', '/ɪnˈtɪəriə(r)/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về hoặc nằm ở bên trong.', 'relating to the inside part of something like a building, a room, or a vehicle.', 'The interior design of the new building is very modern and spacious.', 'Thiết kế nội thất của tòa nhà mới rất hiện đại và rộng rãi.', '{\"en\": \"The interior design of the new office building focuses on natural light and open workspace areas.\", \"vi\": \"Thiết kế nội thất của tòa nhà văn phòng mới tập trung vào ánh sáng tự nhiên và không gian mở.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-ljspeech-cfa582c0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-cori-cfa582c0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/interior-1b3c696a.webp', '[\"inner\", \"internal\"]', '[\"exterior\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"interior design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế nội thất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"interior wall\", \"meaning\": \"tường bên trong\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"interior\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"interiorly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-cori-cfa582c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-aru0-cfa582c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-aru5-cfa582c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-aru6-cfa582c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-aru10-cfa582c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-aru9-cfa582c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-aru3-cfa582c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-aru7-cfa582c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-aru8-cfa582c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-aru2-cfa582c0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-ljspeech-cfa582c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-lt408-cfa582c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-lt138-cfa582c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-lt624-cfa582c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-lt396-cfa582c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-lt498-cfa582c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-lt132-cfa582c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-lt288-cfa582c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-lt42-cfa582c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interior-lt90-cfa582c0.mp3\"]}}', 'Trái nghĩa với \'exterior\' (bên ngoài).', 'office', 1, 14),
('7d91c94b-259e-5f62-81d3-48758a44a63c', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '74e8d70e-07fd-54af-a2e6-fde505c7abfd', '40810875-f2f8-579a-8a7c-8a8c7abb4012', 'carsick', '/ˈkɑːsɪk/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy buồn nôn hoặc chóng mặt khi đi ô tô.', 'feeling ill because of the movement of a vehicle while you are traveling inside it.', 'My little brother always gets carsick on long journeys, so we have to stop frequently.', 'Em trai tôi luôn bị say xe khi đi đường dài, nên chúng tôi phải dừng lại thường xuyên.', '{\"en\": \"The business traveler felt quite carsick during the long bus ride to the factory site.\", \"vi\": \"Người đi công tác cảm thấy khá say xe trong suốt chuyến xe buýt dài đến địa điểm nhà máy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carsick-ljspeech-0038d3ad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carsick-cori-0038d3ad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/carsick-a3e08708.webp', '[\"motion-sick\", \"nauseous\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"get carsick\", \"meaning\": \"bị say xe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel carsick\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy say xe\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carsick-cori-0038d3ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carsick-aru0-0038d3ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carsick-aru5-0038d3ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carsick-aru6-0038d3ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carsick-aru10-0038d3ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carsick-aru9-0038d3ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carsick-aru3-0038d3ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carsick-aru7-0038d3ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carsick-aru8-0038d3ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carsick-aru2-0038d3ad.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia