('6235c0bf-45ab-5ab3-8ea2-2a0ffaf6205a', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '74e8d70e-07fd-54af-a2e6-fde505c7abfd', '40810875-f2f8-579a-8a7c-8a8c7abb4012', 'elsewhere', 'UK: /ˈelsweər/ | US: /ˈelsweər/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'nơi khác', 'In, at, or to some other place or location besides the current one.', 'We looked for the book, but couldn\'t find it elsewhere.', 'Chúng tôi đã tìm cuốn sách, nhưng không thể tìm thấy nó ở nơi khác.', '{\"en\": \"If the required items are out of stock here, we can check if they are available elsewhere.\", \"vi\": \"Nếu các mặt hàng cần thiết hết hàng ở đây, chúng tôi có thể kiểm tra xem chúng có sẵn ở nơi khác không.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-ljspeech-8baf1a85.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-cori-8baf1a85.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/elsewhere-1782586d.webp', '[\"somewhere else\", \"in another place\"]', '[\"here\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"look elsewhere\", \"meaning\": \"tìm kiếm ở nơi khác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"available elsewhere\", \"meaning\": \"có sẵn ở nơi khác\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-cori-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru0-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru5-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru6-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru10-8baf1a85.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru9-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru3-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru7-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru8-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-aru2-8baf1a85.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-ljspeech-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt408-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt138-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt624-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt396-8baf1a85.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt498-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt132-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt288-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt42-8baf1a85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elsewhere-lt90-8baf1a85.mp3\"]}}', 'Là trạng từ chỉ vị trí, thường đứng ở cuối câu hoặc sau động từ (look elsewhere, available elsewhere).', 'shopping', 1, 23),
('96bc34f9-0c98-5f64-903f-d1d2d7127081', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '74e8d70e-07fd-54af-a2e6-fde505c7abfd', '40810875-f2f8-579a-8a7c-8a8c7abb4012', 'delivery', '/dɪˈlɪvəri/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Việc vận chuyển hàng hóa đến người nhận.', 'the act of bringing goods, letters, or packages to a specific person or place.', 'The online store promised next-day delivery for all orders placed before noon.', 'Cửa hàng trực tuyến hứa giao hàng vào ngày hôm sau cho tất cả các đơn đặt hàng trước buổi trưa.', '{\"en\": \"The courier confirmed that the express delivery will arrive at the office by noon.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên chuyển phát nhanh xác nhận rằng đơn hàng giao nhanh sẽ đến văn phòng trước buổi trưa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-ljspeech-391cb1e0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-cori-391cb1e0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/delivery-6c635460.webp', '[\"shipment\", \"distribution\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"free delivery\", \"meaning\": \"giao hàng miễn phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"delivery date\", \"meaning\": \"ngày giao hàng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"deliver\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-cori-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru0-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru5-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru6-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru10-391cb1e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru9-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru3-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru7-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru8-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru2-391cb1e0.mp3\"]