('481ed729-4aaf-567d-b687-1e1209767536', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '74e8d70e-07fd-54af-a2e6-fde505c7abfd', '40810875-f2f8-579a-8a7c-8a8c7abb4012', 'bid', '/bɪd/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Lời đề nghị mua hàng hóa, dịch vụ hoặc làm một công việc với giá nhất định.', 'A stated price offered by a party to buy goods, services, or win a contract.', 'Several contractors placed a high bid to secure the commercial renovation contract.', 'Nhiều nhà thầu đã đưa ra mức giá đấu thầu cao để giành được hợp đồng cải tạo thương mại.', '{\"en\": \"Our company submitted a competitive bid for the government construction contract.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đã nộp hồ sơ bỏ thầu cạnh tranh cho hợp đồng xây dựng của chính phủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-ljspeech-a65df709.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-cori-a65df709.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bid-bf23e85a.webp', '[\"offer\", \"tender\", \"proposal\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"submit a bid\", \"meaning\": \"nộp hồ sơ dự thầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"winning bid\", \"meaning\": \"hồ sơ thầu thắng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"competitive bid\", \"meaning\": \"hồ sơ thầu cạnh tranh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tender\", \"note_vi\": \"tender và bid đều là đấu thầu, nhưng tender thường dùng trong văn bản chính thức hơn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bid\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bidder\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bidding\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-cori-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru0-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru5-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru6-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru10-a65df709.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru9-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru3-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru7-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru8-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru2-a65df709.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-ljspeech-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt408-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt138-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt624-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt396-a65df709.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt498-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt132-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt288-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt42-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt90-a65df709.mp3\"]}}', 'Bid (noun/verb) rất phổ biến trong đề TOEIC phần đấu thầu và mua sắm.', 'business', 1, 27),
('4b77d796-6197-5ad3-99b4-1b14d7dad3f2', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '74e8d70e-07fd-54af-a2e6-fde505c7abfd', '40810875-f2f8-579a-8a7c-8a8c7abb4012', 'while', '/waɪl/', 'A1', 'conjunction', 'Từ dùng để chỉ hai hành động xảy ra cùng lúc.', 'during the time that something else is happening.', 'She listened to music while she was studying for her exam.', 'Cô ấy nghe nhạc trong khi đang học bài thi.', '{\"en\": \"The manager reviewed the contract while the client waited in the reception lobby.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng đã xem xét hợp đồng trong khi khách hàng đợi ở sảnh tiếp tân.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/while-ljspeech-6517f89c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/while-cori-6517f89c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/while-621f9d42.webp', '[\"whereas\", \"although\", \"meanwhile\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"while doing\", \"meaning\": \"trong khi đang làm gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"during\", \"note_vi\": \"during là giới từ, while là liên từ đi với mệnh đề.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/while-cori-6517f89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/while-aru0-6517f89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/while-aru5-6517f89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/while-aru6-6517f89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/while-aru10-6517f89c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/while-aru9-6517f89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/while-aru3-6517f89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/while-aru7-6517f89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/while-aru8-6517f89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/while-aru2-6517f89c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/while-ljspeech-6517f89c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/while-lt408-6517f89c.