('da029397-8ef0-5626-9557-b4a76ce78781', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '826bac8a-8882-5821-859f-23924614b7eb', '8a4ea394-7479-5a0b-acf7-3766e6c68da0', 'bulky', '/ˈbʌlki/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Lớn, chiếm nhiều không gian, khó mang vác.', 'taking up much space and difficult to move or carry.', 'Winter coats can be quite bulky, taking up a lot of closet space.', 'Áo khoác mùa đông có thể khá cồng kềnh, chiếm nhiều diện tích trong tủ đồ.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse stored many bulky packages for the online shipment.\", \"vi\": \"Kho hàng lưu trữ nhiều kiện hàng cồng kềnh cho lô hàng trực tuyến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-ljspeech-9af59206.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-cori-9af59206.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bulky-ecf7960a.webp', '[\"cumbersome\", \"unwieldy\"]', '[\"compact\", \"small\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bulky item\", \"meaning\": \"món đồ cồng kềnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bulky package\", \"meaning\": \"gói hàng cồng kềnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bulk\", \"note_vi\": \"bulk là khối lượng lớn, bulky là tính từ cồng kềnh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bulk\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"bulkily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-cori-9af59206.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru0-9af59206.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru5-9af59206.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru6-9af59206.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru10-9af59206.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru9-9af59206.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru3-9af59206.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru7-9af59206.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru8-9af59206.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru2-9af59206