('4a8541b2-d741-5134-89aa-dbc9bd3ffad4', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '848c9007-25b4-5abd-ae48-c9aad3b257ab', '7f81e384-7aed-5b25-b1eb-158cf7486072', 'annoyed', '/əˈnɔɪd/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy hơi bực mình hoặc khó chịu về điều gì đó.', 'feeling slightly angry or unhappy because of something that happens repeatedly.', 'She was annoyed by the constant noise from her neighbor\'s party.', 'Cô ấy bực mình vì tiếng ồn liên tục từ bữa tiệc của hàng xóm.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was annoyed by the constant interruptions during the important quarterly budget presentation.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý cảm thấy khó chịu vì những lần gián đoạn liên tục trong buổi thuyết trình ngân sách quý quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annoyed-ljspeech-2c4bbb20.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annoyed-cori-2c4bbb20.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/annoyed-566d8aba.webp', '[\"irritated\", \"bothered\"]', '[\"pleased\", \"calm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel annoyed\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy khó chịu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get annoyed\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên khó chịu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"annoying\", \"note_vi\": \"Annoyed là cảm giác của người, annoying là tính chất của sự vật.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"annoy\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"annoyance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annoyed-cori-2c4bbb20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annoyed-aru0-2c4bbb20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annoyed-aru5-2c4bbb20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annoyed-aru6-2c4bbb20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annoyed-aru10-2c4bbb20.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annoyed-aru9-2c4bbb20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annoyed-aru3-2c4bbb20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annoyed-aru7-2c4