('d66ce8ac-f3eb-5e62-b111-93fef6da8aef', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '848c9007-25b4-5abd-ae48-c9aad3b257ab', '7f81e384-7aed-5b25-b1eb-158cf7486072', 'hormone', '/ˈhɔːməʊn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Chất hóa học do cơ thể tiết ra, điều hòa các chức năng sinh lý.', 'a chemical substance produced in the body that controls specific organic functions.', 'Growth hormones play a crucial role in a child\'s development.', 'Hoóc-môn tăng trưởng đóng vai trò quan trọng trong sự phát triển của trẻ.', '{\"en\": \"The pharmaceutical firm is conducting clinical trials on a new hormone treatment.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty dược phẩm đang tiến hành các thử nghiệm lâm sàng đối với một phương pháp điều trị hoóc-môn mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hormone-ljspeech-70b446aa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hormone-cori-70b446aa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hormone-036879e4.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"growth hormone\", \"meaning\": \"hoóc-môn tăng trưởng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hormone level\", \"meaning\": \"nồng độ hoóc-môn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hormonal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hormone-cori-70b446aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hormone-aru0-70b446aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hormone-aru5-70b446aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hormone-aru6-70b446aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hormone-aru10-70b446aa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hormone-aru9-70b446aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hormone-aru3-70b446aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hormone-aru7-70b446aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hormone-aru8-70b446aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hormone-aru2-70b446aa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/ob