('98219b68-8f10-5b95-9eba-18ad1088520c', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '848c9007-25b4-5abd-ae48-c9aad3b257ab', '7f81e384-7aed-5b25-b1eb-158cf7486072', 'basketball', '/ˈbɑːskɪtbɔːl/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Môn thể thao dùng bóng và hai rổ để ghi điểm.', 'a game played by two teams who try to throw a ball through a net.', 'The school built a new basketball court and training facility for the upcoming sports season.', 'Trường học đã xây dựng một sân bóng rổ mới và cơ sở tập luyện cho mùa thể thao sắp tới.', '{\"en\": \"The company is sponsoring a local basketball tournament to promote healthy lifestyles among employees.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đang tài trợ cho một giải đấu bóng rổ địa phương để thúc đẩy lối sống lành mạnh cho nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-ljspeech-468ee5cb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-cori-468ee5cb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/basketball-c4334fc3.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"play basketball\", \"meaning\": \"chơi bóng rổ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"basketball court\", \"meaning\": \"sân bóng rổ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-cori-468ee5cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru0-468ee5cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru5-468ee5cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru6-468ee5cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru10-468ee5cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru9-468ee5cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru3-468ee5cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru7-468ee5cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru8-468ee5cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/basketball-aru2-468ee5cb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\":