('17fe7afe-bd6c-5a0e-9c52-037b09bcdc52', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '934cec82-8c10-5eb7-9e97-f02d06303e29', '44d927c4-e99d-5654-9d14-4c1c568008e4', 'calligraphy', '/kəˈlɪɡrəfi/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Nghệ thuật viết chữ đẹp bằng tay, thường dùng bút lông.', 'the art of producing decorative handwriting with a special pen or brush.', 'She took a class to learn the art of traditional Chinese calligraphy.', 'Cô ấy đã tham gia một lớp học để tìm hiểu nghệ thuật thư pháp truyền thống Trung Quốc.', '{\"en\": \"Our shop sells custom calligraphy sets for new business openings.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng chúng tôi bán bộ thư pháp tùy chỉnh cho các buổi khai trương doanh nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-ljspeech-7df8e9af.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-cori-7df8e9af.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/calligraphy-1ca39b5f.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"practice calligraphy\", \"meaning\": \"tập thư pháp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"calligraphy set\", \"meaning\": \"bộ thư pháp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"Chinese calligraphy\", \"meaning\": \"thư pháp Trung Quốc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"calliper\", \"note_vi\": \"calliper là thước kẹp, phát âm gần nhưng nghĩa khác.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"calligraphic\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"calligrapher\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-cori-7df8e9af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-aru0-7df8e9af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-aru5-7df8e9af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-aru6-7df8e9af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-aru10-7df8e9af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-aru9-7df8e9af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-aru3-7df8e9af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-aru7-7df8e9af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-aru8-7df8e9af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-aru2-7df8e9af.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-ljspeech-7df8e9af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-lt408-7df8e9af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-lt138-7df8e9af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-lt624-7df8e9af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-lt396-7df8e9af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-lt498-7df8e9af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-lt132-7df8e9af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-lt288-7df8e9af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-lt42-7df8e9af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calligraphy-lt90-7df8e9af.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết đúng chính tả: calligraphy có hai chữ l.', 'shopping', 1, 15),
('a6fff4a5-d0e0-57c2-844f-ae6b8d76b2b5', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '934cec82-8c10-5eb7-9e97-f02d06303e29', '44d927c4-e99d-5654-9d14-4c1c568008e4', 'outfit', '/ˈaʊtfɪt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một bộ quần áo hoàn chỉnh mặc cho một dịp cụ thể.', 'a set of clothes that are worn together, especially for a particular occasion or purpose.', 'She chose a stylish outfit for the party, including a new dress and matching shoes.', 'Cô ấy đã chọn một bộ trang phục sành điệu cho bữa tiệc, bao gồm một chiếc váy mới và đôi giày hợp tông.', '{\"en\": \"She selected a professional outfit for her interview at the multinational corporation next Monday morning.\", \"vi\": \"Cô ấy đã chọn một bộ trang phục chuyên nghiệp cho buổi phỏng vấn tại tập đoàn đa quốc gia vào sáng thứ Hai tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outfit-ljspeech-87817d68.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outfit-cori-87817d68.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/outfit-2549f111.webp', '[\"costume\", \"attire\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"business outfit\", \"meaning\": \"trang phục công sở\"}, {\"phrase\": \"casual outfit\", \"meaning\": \"trang phục thường ngày\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"outfit\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outfit-cori-87817d68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outfit-aru0-87817d68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outfit-aru5-87817d68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outfit-aru6-87817d68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outfit-aru10-87817d68.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outfit-aru9-87817d68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outfit-aru3-87817d68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outfit-aru7-87817d68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outfit-aru8-87817d68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public