('5730485f-fc75-58f5-bf87-0065c44d22a9', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '934cec82-8c10-5eb7-9e97-f02d06303e29', '44d927c4-e99d-5654-9d14-4c1c568008e4', 'mean', '/miːn/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Có ý nghĩa, biểu thị hoặc muốn nói điều gì đó.', 'to have a particular significance, value, or importance.', 'What does this symbol mean in the context of the entire document?', 'Biểu tượng này có nghĩa là gì trong ngữ cảnh của toàn bộ tài liệu?', '{\"en\": \"A red light on the printer does not always mean that it is broken.\", \"vi\": \"Đèn đỏ trên máy in không phải lúc nào cũng có nghĩa là nó bị hỏng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mean-ljspeech-5f00f7a0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mean-cori-5f00f7a0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mean-d6a7218a.webp', '[\"signify\", \"indicate\", \"denote\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"mean to say\", \"meaning\": \"ý muốn nói là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mean business\", \"meaning\": \"thực sự nghiêm túc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"meaning\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"meaningful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mean-cori-5f00f7a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mean-aru0-5f00f7a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mean-aru5-5f00f7a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mean-aru6-5f00f7a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mean-aru10-5f00f7a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mean-aru9-5f00f7a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mean-aru3-5f00f7a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mean-aru7-5f00f7a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mean-aru8-5f00f7a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mean-aru2-5f00f7a0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mean-ljspeech-5f00f7a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v