('82597c26-3604-596a-9824-a6c3a1949ef8', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '934cec82-8c10-5eb7-9e97-f02d06303e29', '44d927c4-e99d-5654-9d14-4c1c568008e4', 'millennium', '/mɪˈleniəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'khoảng thời gian một nghìn năm.', 'a period of one thousand years, often used to mark a new era.', 'The year 2000 marked the beginning of a new millennium.', 'Năm 2000 đánh dấu sự khởi đầu của một thiên niên kỷ mới.', '{\"en\": \"The city celebrated the new millennium with a large festival in the central square.\", \"vi\": \"Thành phố đã kỷ niệm thiên niên kỷ mới bằng một lễ hội lớn tại quảng trường trung tâm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millennium-ljspeech-fcd17b71.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millennium-cori-fcd17b71.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/millennium-9632a464.webp', '[\"thousand years\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"new millennium\", \"meaning\": \"thiên niên kỷ mới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"turn of the millennium\", \"meaning\": \"bước ngoặt thiên niên kỷ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"millennial\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millennium-cori-fcd17b71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millennium-aru0-fcd17b71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millennium-aru5-fcd17b71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millennium-aru6-fcd17b71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millennium-aru10-fcd17b71.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millennium-aru9-fcd17b71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millennium-aru3-fcd17b71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millennium-aru7-fcd17b71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millennium-aru8-fcd17b71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millennium-aru2-fcd17b71.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia