('f1ba4384-b1b2-51ec-b98a-a4306b7598c7', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', '934cec82-8c10-5eb7-9e97-f02d06303e29', '44d927c4-e99d-5654-9d14-4c1c568008e4', 'pleasure', '/ˈpleʒə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác vui sướng, hài lòng.', 'A state or sense of gratification, delight, and contentment experienced by someone.', 'Reading classic novels in the garden gives her immense pleasure on weekends.', 'Đọc các cuốn tiểu thuyết cổ điển trong vườn mang lại cho cô ấy niềm vui to lớn vào cuối tuần.', '{\"en\": \"It is a great pleasure to welcome our new marketing director to the company today.\", \"vi\": \"Thật là một niềm vinh hạnh lớn khi được chào đón giám đốc tiếp thị mới của chúng ta đến công ty hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-ljspeech-59ea4ada.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-cori-59ea4ada.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pleasure-5d0cb5ba.webp', '[\"delight\", \"enjoyment\", \"satisfaction\"]', '[\"displeasure\", \"pain\", \"sorrow\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take pleasure in\", \"meaning\": \"tìm thấy niềm vui trong\"}, {\"phrase\": \"with pleasure\", \"meaning\": \"rất sẵn lòng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pleasing\", \"note_vi\": \"pleasing là tính từ mang lại sự hài lòng, dễ chịu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"please\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"pleasant\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-cori-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-aru0-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-aru5-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-aru6-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-aru10-59ea4ada.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-aru9-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-aru3-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-aru7-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-aru8-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-aru2-59ea4ada.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-ljspeech-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-lt408-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-lt138-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-lt624-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-lt396-59ea4ada.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-lt498-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-lt132-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-lt288-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-lt42-59ea4ada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasure-lt90-59ea4ada.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ \'My pleasure\' rất thường dùng để đáp lại lời cảm ơn một cách lịch sự.', 'office', 1, 29),
('88198744-3206-5ebb-9735-6dc3bddee405', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'b05b2ae8-21a7-582c-9600-500c1466edf6', '26e5a2ef-0177-551f-bf4f-b362574fa48f', 'lightning', '/ˈlaɪtnɪŋ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Ánh sáng lóe lên trên bầu trời do sự phóng điện trong cơn giông.', 'a powerful electrical discharge occurring between clouds or between a cloud and the ground.', 'We saw a flash of lightning followed by a loud clap of thunder.', 'Chúng tôi thấy một tia chớp lóe lên theo sau là tiếng sấm lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The office building lost power temporarily after a strike of lightning hit the main transformer.\", \"vi\": \"Tòa nhà văn phòng bị mất điện tạm thời sau khi một tia chớp đánh trúng máy biến áp chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightning-ljspeech-71f49778.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightning-cori-71f49778.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lightning-18dfd2b6.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"lightning strike\", \"meaning\": \"sét đánh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a flash of lightning\", \"meaning\": \"một tia chớp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lightening\", \"note_vi\": \"Là dạng V-ing của lighten (làm sáng/nhẹ hơn), khác với lightning (sét).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightning-cori-71f49778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightning-aru0-71f49778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightning-aru5-71f49778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightning-aru6-71f49778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightning-aru10-71f49778.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightning-aru9-71f49778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightning-aru3-71f49778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightning-aru7-71f49778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lightning-aru8-71f49778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pu