('54c928a0-07e9-5486-9ade-b6d87b4f4127', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'bdac7f13-5fef-511e-b986-bb8328cb39af', 'a692586a-4c3d-56da-a436-035af0072e4a', 'ensure', 'UK: /ɪnˈʃɔː/ | US: /ɪnˈʃʊr/', 'B1', 'verb', 'đảm bảo', 'To make certain that something will happen or that a particular situation will exist.', 'Please ensure all data is accurate before submission.', 'Vui lòng đảm bảo tất cả dữ liệu là chính xác trước khi nộp.', '{\"en\": \"Please check the financial report carefully to ensure that all numbers are completely accurate.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng kiểm tra kỹ báo cáo tài chính để đảm bảo rằng tất cả con số đều hoàn toàn chính xác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-ljspeech-03503cd8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-cori-03503cd8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ensure-8a53bf66.webp', '[\"guarantee\", \"secure\", \"confirm\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ensure compliance\", \"meaning\": \"đảm bảo sự tuân thủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ensure safety\", \"meaning\": \"đảm bảo an toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ensure success\", \"meaning\": \"đảm bảo sự thành công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"assure\", \"note_vi\": \"Assure phải đi với tân ngữ chỉ người (assure someone that...), còn ensure đi thẳng với mệnh đề hoặc danh từ.\"}, {\"word\": \"insure\", \"note_vi\": \"Insure liên quan đến dịch vụ bảo hiểm bồi thường tiền bạc.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-cori-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru0-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru5-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru6-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru10-03503cd8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru9-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru3-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru7-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru8-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-aru2-03503cd8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-ljspeech-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt408-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt138-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt624-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt396-03503cd8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt498-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt132-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt288-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt42-03503cd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ensure-lt90-03503cd8.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng \'ensure that + mệnh đề\' hoặc \'ensure + danh từ\'. Phân biệt với assure (trấn an người khác) và insure (mua bảo hiểm).', 'office', 1, 6),
('393f9270-05e4-5191-ae24-466f87884f86', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'bdac7f13-5fef-511e-b986-bb8328cb39af', 'a692586a-4c3d-56da-a436-035af0072e4a', 'narrow', '/ˈnærəʊ/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có chiều rộng nhỏ; không rộng rãi.', 'having a small distance from one side to the other, especially in comparison with the length.', 'The committee decided to narrow the list of job candidates to three.', 'Hội đồng đã quyết định thu hẹp danh sách ứng viên xin việc xuống còn ba người.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery truck could not pass through the narrow street to reach the warehouse.\", \"vi\": \"Xe tải giao hàng không thể đi qua con phố chật hẹp để đến nhà kho.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-ljspeech-e1b335fb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-cori-e1b335fb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/narrow-0daa1c03.webp', '[\"tight\", \"cramped\"]', '[\"wide\", \"broad\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"narrow street\", \"meaning\": \"con phố hẹp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"narrow margin\", \"meaning\": \"tỉ lệ sát sao\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"narrowly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"narrowness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-cori-e1b335fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-aru0-e1b335fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-aru5-e1b335fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-aru6-e1b335fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-aru10-e1b335fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-aru9-e1b335fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-aru3-e1b335fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-aru7-e1b335fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-aru8-e1b335fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/narrow-aru2-e1b335fb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\":