('faabcab4-87aa-57d9-9f3d-440fbdca1063', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'bdac7f13-5fef-511e-b986-bb8328cb39af', 'a692586a-4c3d-56da-a436-035af0072e4a', 'brotherhood', '/ˈbrʌðəhʊd/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình cảm gắn bó sâu sắc, sự đoàn kết giữa những người có chung mục đích hoặc hoàn cảnh.', 'a feeling of friendship and loyalty shared among a group of men.', 'The team developed a strong sense of brotherhood after winning the championship together.', 'Đội bóng đã phát triển tình anh em gắn bó sau khi cùng nhau giành chức vô địch.', '{\"en\": \"The new manager worked hard to build brotherhood among his team members.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý mới đã nỗ lực xây dựng tình anh em trong nhóm của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brotherhood-ljspeech-dde3f725.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brotherhood-cori-dde3f725.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/brotherhood-5029bd08.webp', '[\"camaraderie\", \"solidarity\", \"fellowship\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sense of brotherhood\", \"meaning\": \"cảm giác tình anh em\"}, {\"phrase\": \"build brotherhood\", \"meaning\": \"xây dựng tình đoàn kết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spirit of brotherhood\", \"meaning\": \"tinh thần anh em\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sisterhood\", \"note_vi\": \"\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"brother\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"brotherly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brotherhood-cori-dde3f725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brotherhood-aru0-dde3f725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brotherhood-aru5-dde3f725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brotherhood-aru6-dde3f725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brotherhood-aru10-dde3f725.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brotherhood-aru9-dde3f725.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brotherhood-aru3-dde3f