('cf34a80d-b775-565c-ba8c-3247959297c9', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'ddcdba98-f5f5-588e-8b94-666515d48a67', 'd7df4016-047a-56bf-9d92-fd48e1aa9ddd', 'purse', '/pɜːs/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Túi nhỏ dùng để đựng tiền, thẻ hoặc đồ cá nhân, thường dành cho phụ nữ.', 'a small bag used by women to carry money, cards, and personal items.', 'She reached into her purse to find her keys.', 'Cô ấy thò tay vào ví để tìm chìa khóa.', '{\"en\": \"She left her leather purse on the desk after finishing the meeting with the director.\", \"vi\": \"Cô ấy đã để quên chiếc ví da trên bàn sau khi kết thúc cuộc họp với giám đốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-ljspeech-a7e54671.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-cori-a7e54671.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/purse-47ad9d63.webp', '[\"wallet\", \"handbag\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"handbag\", \"meaning\": \"túi xách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"leather purse\", \"meaning\": \"ví da\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"push\", \"note_vi\": \"Push là động từ đẩy, purse là danh từ cái ví.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-cori-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru0-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru5-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru6-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru10-a7e54671.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru9-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru3-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru7-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru8-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-aru2-a7e54671.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-ljspeech-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-lt408-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-lt138-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-lt624-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-lt396-a7e54671.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-lt498-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-lt132-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-lt288-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-lt42-a7e54671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/purse-lt90-a7e54671.mp3\"]}}', 'Ở Anh, purse thường là ví nhỏ, handbag là túi xách tay.', 'shopping', 1, 8),
('601c4d9e-3b68-588d-a473-1160107813cf', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'ddcdba98-f5f5-588e-8b94-666515d48a67', 'd7df4016-047a-56bf-9d92-fd48e1aa9ddd', 'receptionist', '/rɪˈsepʃənɪst/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người làm công việc tiếp khách, trả lời điện thoại ở văn phòng, khách sạn.', 'a person who greets visitors and answers phones in an office.', 'The new receptionist answered several client phone calls efficiently this morning.', 'Nhân viên lễ tân mới đã trả lời một số cuộc điện thoại của khách hàng một cách hiệu quả vào sáng nay.', '{\"en\": \"The friendly receptionist directed the visitors to the conference room on the third floor.\", \"vi\": \"Người nhân viên tiếp tân thân thiện đã hướng dẫn khách đến phòng hội nghị ở tầng ba.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-ljspeech-3b6f5b1c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-cori-3b6f5b1c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/receptionist-e9b01ab3.webp', '[\"front desk clerk\", \"greeter\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hotel receptionist\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp tân khách sạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"medical receptionist\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp tân phòng khám\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"recipient\", \"note_vi\": \"recipient là người nhận thư/quà, receptionist là nhân viên tiếp tân.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reception\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"receive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-cori-3b6f5b1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-aru0-3b6f5b1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-aru5-3b6f5b1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-aru6-3b6f5b1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-aru10-3b6f5b1c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-aru9-3b6f5b1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-aru3-3b6f5b1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-aru7-3b6f5b1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-aru8-3b6f5b1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-aru2-3b6f5b1c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-ljspeech-3b6f5b1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-lt408-3b6f5b1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-lt138-3b6f5b1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-lt624-3b6f5b1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-lt396-3b6f5b1c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-lt498-3b6f5b1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-lt132-3b6f5b1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-lt288-3b6f5b1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-lt42-3b6f5b1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/receptionist-lt90-3b6f5b1c.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này chỉ người làm việc ở bàn tiếp tân (reception desk).', 'hr', 1, 9),
('029ea44c-16ac-5b47-b6ad-ce7cdc3f8113', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'ddcdba98-f5f5-588e-8b94-666515d48a67', 'd7df4016-047a-56bf-9d92-fd48e1aa9ddd', 'father-in-law', '/ˈfɑːðərɪnˌlɔː/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Bố của vợ hoặc chồng bạn.', 'the male parent of a person\'s husband or wife.', 'My father-in-law is a very kind and supportive man.', 'Bố chồng tôi là một người đàn ông rất tốt bụng và luôn ủng hộ.', '{\"en\": \"My father-in-law will visit our head office during his business trip next week.\", \"vi\": \"Bố chồng của tôi sẽ đến thăm trụ sở chính của chúng tôi trong chuyến công tác tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-in-law-ljspeech-b2331022.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-in-law-cori-b2331022.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/father-in-law-43cc0d4a.webp', NULL, '[\"mother-in-law\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"future father-in-law\", \"meaning\": \"bố chồng/bố vợ tương lai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stepfather\", \"note_vi\": \"stepfather là bố dượng (chồng mới của mẹ), khác với father-in-law.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-in-law-cori-b2331022.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-in-law-aru0-b2331022.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-in-law-aru5-b2331022.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-in-law-aru6-b2331022.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-in-law-aru10-b2331022.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-in-law-aru9-b2331022.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-in-law-aru3-b2331022.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-in-law-aru7-b2331022.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-in-law-aru8-b2331022.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/father-in-law-aru2-b2331022.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/objec