('b5c703a5-5e44-5342-9fe7-3580c039dfe0', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'ddcdba98-f5f5-588e-8b94-666515d48a67', 'd7df4016-047a-56bf-9d92-fd48e1aa9ddd', 'expo', 'UK: /ˈɛkspəʊ/ | US: /ˈɛkspoʊ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'triển lãm', 'a large public exhibition showing products, technology, art, or industrial accomplishments.', 'The annual tech expo attracted many international visitors.', 'Triển lãm công nghệ thường niên đã thu hút nhiều du khách quốc tế.', '{\"en\": \"Our marketing team set up an interactive booth at the international tech expo.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị của chúng tôi đã dựng một gian hàng tương tác tại triển lãm công nghệ quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-ljspeech-41f8b48e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-cori-41f8b48e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/expo-3a41ad4f.webp', '[\"exhibition\", \"fair\", \"trade show\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"trade expo\", \"meaning\": \"triển lãm thương mại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"attend an expo\", \"meaning\": \"tham dự triển lãm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"exposition\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-cori-41f8b48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-aru0-41f8b48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-aru5-41f8b48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-aru6-41f8b48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-aru10-41f8b48e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-aru9-41f8b48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-aru3-41f8b48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-aru7-41f8b48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-aru8-41f8b48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-aru2-41f8b48e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-ljspeech-41f8b48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-lt408-41f8b48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-lt138-41f8b48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-lt624-41f8b48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-lt396-41f8b48e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-lt498-41f8b48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-lt132-41f8b48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-lt288-41f8b48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-lt42-41f8b48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expo-lt90-41f8b48e.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết tắt của \'exposition\', thường dùng để chỉ hội chợ thương mại hoặc triển lãm công nghệ (e.g., trade expo, tech expo).', 'marketing', 1, 11),
('ff1367d4-8ac1-568e-a489-8d87f1234075', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'ddcdba98-f5f5-588e-8b94-666515d48a67', 'd7df4016-047a-56bf-9d92-fd48e1aa9ddd', 'bargain', '/ˈbɑːɡən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'món hàng được mua với giá rẻ hơn bình thường', 'something bought for a lower price than its actual value.', 'I found this beautiful dress at a real bargain price.', 'Tôi tìm thấy chiếc váy đẹp này với giá thực sự hời.', '{\"en\": \"The new office chairs were bought at a bargain during the annual supplier sale.\", \"vi\": \"Những chiếc ghế văn phòng mới đã được mua với giá hời trong đợt giảm giá hàng năm của nhà cung cấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-ljspeech-a5e12c16.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-cori-a5e12c16.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bargain-fc6d6614.webp', '[\"buy\", \"deal\", \"discount\"]', '[\"rip-off\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"real bargain\", \"meaning\": \"món hời thực sự\"}, {\"phrase\": \"drive a hard bargain\", \"meaning\": \"mặc cả cứng rắn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"barter\", \"note_vi\": \"barter là trao đổi hàng hóa không dùng tiền.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bargain\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-cori-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru0-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru5-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru6-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru10-a5e12c16.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru9-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru3-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru7-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru8-a5e12c16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bargain-aru2-a5e12c16.mp3\"]