('78bd9806-daa9-530f-b0a3-6bfb9edc84b3', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'ddcdba98-f5f5-588e-8b94-666515d48a67', 'd7df4016-047a-56bf-9d92-fd48e1aa9ddd', 'leap year', '/liːp jɪə/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Năm có 366 ngày, thêm một ngày vào tháng Hai.', 'a year that has three hundred and sixty-six days instead of the usual three hundred sixty-five.', 'The next leap year will be in 2024, so February will have 29 days.', 'Năm nhuận tiếp theo sẽ là vào năm 2024, vì vậy tháng Hai sẽ có 29 ngày.', '{\"en\": \"Our company contract expires on February twenty-ninth, which only occurs during a leap year cycle.\", \"vi\": \"Hợp đồng công ty chúng tôi hết hạn vào ngày 29 tháng 2, chỉ có trong năm nhuận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-ljspeech-6f9d26fd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-cori-6f9d26fd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/leap-year-bcae5c1f.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"during a leap year\", \"meaning\": \"trong năm nhuận\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-cori-6f9d26fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-aru0-6f9d26fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-aru5-6f9d26fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-aru6-6f9d26fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-aru10-6f9d26fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-aru9-6f9d26fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-aru3-6f9d26fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-aru7-6f9d26fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-aru8-6f9d26fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-aru2-6f9d26fd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-ljspeech-6f9d26fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-lt408-6f9d26fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-lt138-6f9d26fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-lt624-6f9d26fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-lt396-6f9d26fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-lt498-6f9d26fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-lt132-6f9d26fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-lt288-6f9d26fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-lt42-6f9d26fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leap-year-lt90-6f9d26fd.mp3\"]}}', 'Năm nhuận có 366 ngày, tháng 2 có 29 ngày thay vì 28.', 'daily', 1, 17),
('f5effd52-090c-5ba6-bb4c-00a361566e34', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'ddcdba98-f5f5-588e-8b94-666515d48a67', 'd7df4016-047a-56bf-9d92-fd48e1aa9ddd', 'class', '/klɑːs/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Một nhóm người hoặc vật có cùng đặc điểm, trình độ, hoặc chất lượng.', 'a group of people or things ranked by quality or level.', 'This hotel offers first-class service and luxurious amenities.', 'Khách sạn này cung cấp dịch vụ hạng nhất và các tiện nghi sang trọng.', '{\"en\": \"All business class passengers May board the flight first.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả hành khách hạng thương gia có thể lên máy bay trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-ljspeech-8d767bf5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-cori-8d767bf5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/class-9f106c2c.webp', '[\"category\", \"grade\", \"tier\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"first class\", \"meaning\": \"hạng nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business class\", \"meaning\": \"hạng thương gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"economy class\", \"meaning\": \"hạng phổ thông\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"grade\", \"note_vi\": \"grade nhấn mạnh thứ bậc chất lượng; class rộng nghĩa hơn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"classify\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"classic\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"classification\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-cori-8d767bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-aru0-8d767bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-aru5-8d767bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-aru6-8d767bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-aru10-8d767bf5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-aru9-8d767bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-aru3-8d767bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-aru7-8d767bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-aru8-8d767bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-aru2-8d767bf5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-ljspeech-8d767bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-lt408-8d767bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-lt138-8d767bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-lt624-8d767bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-lt396-8d767bf5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-lt498-8d767bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-lt132-8d767bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-lt288-8d767bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-lt42-8d767bf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/class-lt90-8d767bf5.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'class\' hay gặp ở ngữ cảnh vé máy bay: business class, economy class.', 'travel', 1, 18),
('b19816aa-5bf7-57be-b8f6-701b5a4abcbd', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'ddcdba98-f5f5-588e-8b94-666515d48a67', 'd7df4016-047a-56bf-9d92-fd48e1aa9ddd', 'fasten', 'UK: /ˈfɑːsn̩/ | US: /ˈfæsn̩/', 'B1', 'verb', 'buộc chặt, thắt chặt', 'To close or join together securely two parts of something like a belt.', 'Please fasten your seatbelt before takeoff.', 'Vui lòng thắt dây an toàn trước khi cất cánh.', '{\"en\": \"Passengers are requested to fasten their seatbelts as the aircraft prepares for takeoff.\", \"vi\": \"Hành khách được yêu cầu thắt dây an toàn khi máy bay chuẩn bị cất cánh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-ljspeech-8d787ecf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-cori-8d787ecf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fasten-68f19049.webp', '[\"secure\", \"attach\", \"bind\", \"tie\"]', '[\"unfasten\", \"loosen\", \"untie\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fasten seatbelts\", \"meaning\": \"thắt dây an toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fasten securely\", \"meaning\": \"buộc/chốt chặt an toàn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hasten\", \"note_vi\": \"hasten nghĩa là thúc giục, làm nhanh lên; khác với fasten là buộc chặt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fastener\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-cori-8d787ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-aru0-8d787ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-aru5-8d787ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-aru6-8d787ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-aru10-8d787ecf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-aru9-8d787ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-aru3-8d787ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-aru7-8d787ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-aru8-8d787ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-aru2-8d787ecf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-ljspeech-8d787ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-lt408-8d787ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-lt138-8d787ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-lt624-8d787ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-lt396-8d787ecf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-lt498-8d787ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-lt132-8d787ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-lt288-8d787ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-lt42-8d787ecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fasten-lt90-8d787ecf.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất phổ biến trong hướng dẫn an toàn máy bay: \'Please fasten your seatbelt\' (Vui lòng thắt dây an toàn).', 'travel', 1, 19),
('5c9f1e04-dd4c-5f15-8578-46cb5d66d14f', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'ddcdba98-f5f5-588e-8b94-666515d48a67', 'd7df4016-047a-56bf-9d92-fd48e1aa9ddd', 'round', '/raʊnd/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Có hình dạng cong tròn, không có góc cạnh.', 'shaped like a circle or ball rather than having flat surfaces or angles.', 'The children sat in a round circle on the carpet, listening to the story.', 'Lũ trẻ ngồi thành vòng tròn trên thảm, lắng nghe câu chuyện.', '{\"en\": \"The conference room features a large round table designed for group discussions.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng hội nghị có một chiếc bàn tròn lớn được thiết kế cho các cuộc thảo luận nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-ljspeech-f0590a6d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-cori-f0590a6d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/round-899a5308.webp', '[\"circular\", \"curved\"]', '[\"square\", \"flat\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"round table\", \"meaning\": \"bàn tròn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"round shape\", \"meaning\": \"hình dáng tròn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"around\", \"note_vi\": \"around là trạng từ/giới từ (xung quanh), round là tính từ (tròn).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"round\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"round\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"roundly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-cori-f0590a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-aru0-f0590a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-aru5-f0590a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-aru6-f0590a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-aru10-f0590a6d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-aru9-f0590a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-aru3-f0590a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-aru7-f0590a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-aru8-f0590a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-aru2-f0590a6d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-ljspeech-f0590a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-lt408-f0590a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-lt138-f0590a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-lt624-f0590a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-lt396-f0590a6d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-lt498-f0590a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-lt132-f0590a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-lt288-f0590a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-lt42-f0590a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/round-lt90-f0590a6d.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này vừa là tính từ (tròn), vừa là danh từ (vòng/hiệp), vừa là động từ.', 'office', 1, 20),
('68271926-e915-5c71-be75-0368313da6e0', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'ddcdba98-f5f5-588e-8b94-666515d48a67', 'd7df4016-047a-56bf-9d92-fd48e1aa9ddd', 'equally', 'UK: /ˈiːkwəli/ | US: /ˈiːkwəli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'bằng nhau, công bằng', 'To the same degree or in a fair and uniform manner for everyone.', 'The tasks were equally divided among all team members.', 'Các nhiệm vụ được chia đều cho tất cả các thành viên trong nhóm.', '{\"en\": \"The workload will be distributed equally among team members.\", \"vi\": \"Khối lượng công việc sẽ được phân chia đều giữa các thành viên trong nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equally-ljspeech-c51c9a5d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equally-cori-c51c9a5d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/equally-b8f3d51c.webp', '[\"evenly\", \"fairly\", \"uniformly\"]', '[\"unequally\", \"disproportionately\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"equally important\", \"meaning\": \"quan trọng như nhau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"divide equally\", \"meaning\": \"chia đều\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"equal\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"equality\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equally-cori-c51c9a5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equally-aru0-c51c9a5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equally-aru5-c51c9a5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equally-aru6-c51c9a5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equally-aru10-c51c9a5d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equally-aru9-c51c9a5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equally-aru3-c51c9a5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equally-aru7-c51c9a5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equally-aru8-c51c9a5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equally-aru2-c51c9a5d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/