('58849c2e-33a8-58c4-9e4c-64096571c6eb', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'ddcdba98-f5f5-588e-8b94-666515d48a67', 'd7df4016-047a-56bf-9d92-fd48e1aa9ddd', 'passive', '/ˈpæsɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không hoạt động, không chủ động; trong ngữ pháp là dạng bị động.', 'describing a verb form used when the subject receives the action of something.', 'The passive voice is often used when the action is more important than the doer.', 'Thể bị động thường được dùng khi hành động quan trọng hơn người thực hiện.', '{\"en\": \"The editor revised the sentence structure from passive to active voice for clarity.\", \"vi\": \"Biên tập viên đã sửa cấu trúc câu từ dạng bị động sang dạng chủ động để rõ ràng hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-ljspeech-8cf03f5f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-cori-8cf03f5f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/passive-083bfb85.webp', '[\"inactive\", \"submissive\", \"receptive\"]', '[\"active\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"passive voice\", \"meaning\": \"thể bị động\"}, {\"phrase\": \"passive role\", \"meaning\": \"vai trò thụ động\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"passively\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"passivity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-cori-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru0-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru5-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru6-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru10-8cf03f5f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru9-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru3-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru7-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru8-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru2-8cf03f5f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-ljspeech-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt408-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt138-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt624-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt396-8cf03f5f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt498-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt132-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt288-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt42-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt90-8cf03f5f.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ pháp, \'passive voice\' là thể bị động; trong giao tiếp, \'passive\' chỉ sự thụ động.', 'office', 1, 27),
('537909d2-fee5-50d8-9904-f0fb565b432f', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'ddcdba98-f5f5-588e-8b94-666515d48a67', 'd7df4016-047a-56bf-9d92-fd48e1aa9ddd', 'reflexive', '/rɪˈfleksɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', '(Ngữ pháp) Chỉ hành động tác động trở lại chính chủ thể.', 'showing that the action of the verb returns to the person doing it.', 'In English, words like \"myself\" and \"yourself\" are examples of reflexive pronouns.', 'Trong tiếng Anh, các từ như \"myself\" và \"yourself\" là ví dụ của đại từ phản thân.', '{\"en\": \"In the business writing seminar, employees learned how to use reflexive pronouns correctly.\", \"vi\": \"Trong hội thảo viết lách thương mại, các nhân viên đã học cách sử dụng đại từ phản thân một cách chính xác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-ljspeech-5a9a6a79.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-cori-5a9a6a79.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reflexive-c477ea49.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"reflexive pronoun\", \"meaning\": \"đại từ phản thân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reflexive action\", \"meaning\": \"hành động phản xạ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reflective\", \"note_vi\": \"reflective nghĩa là phản chiếu hoặc suy nghĩ sâu sắc, khác với reflexive.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reflex\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-cori-5a9a6a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-aru0-5a9a6a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-aru5-5a9a6a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-aru6-5a9a6a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-aru10-5a9a6a79.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-aru9-5a9a6a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-aru3-5a9a6a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-aru7-5a9a6a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-aru8-5a9a6a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-aru2-5a9a6a79.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-ljspeech-5a9a6a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-lt408-5a9a6a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-lt138-5a9a6a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-lt624-5a9a6a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-lt396-5a9a6a79.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-lt498-5a9a6a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-lt132-5a9a6a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-lt288-5a9a6a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-lt42-5a9a6a79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflexive-lt90-5a9a6a79.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ pháp, từ này chủ yếu dùng trong cụm \'reflexive pronoun\' (myself, yourself...).', 'education', 1, 28),
('8a59c792-7855-502e-bc8f-c60cdfec2f89', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'ddcdba98-f5f5-588e-8b94-666515d48a67', 'd7df4016-047a-56bf-9d92-fd48e1aa9ddd', 'organ', '/ˈɔːɡən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'bộ phận của cơ thể có chức năng cụ thể, hoặc nhạc cụ lớn có ống sáo.', 'a part of the body that has a particular purpose or function.', 'The heart is a vital organ responsible for pumping blood throughout the body.', 'Tim là một cơ quan quan trọng chịu trách nhiệm bơm máu đi khắp cơ thể.', '{\"en\": \"The health insurance policy covers surgeries related to vital organ transplants.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách bảo hiểm y tế chi trả cho các ca phẫu thuật liên quan đến cấy ghép cơ quan quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-ljspeech-1c5ce0db.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-cori-1c5ce0db.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/organ-7d3ddcac.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"vital organ\", \"meaning\": \"cơ quan sinh tồn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"internal organ\", \"meaning\": \"cơ quan nội tạng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"organ donor\", \"meaning\": \"người hiến tạng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"organization\", \"note_vi\": \"organization là tổ chức, organ là cơ quan cơ thể\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"organic\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"organism\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-cori-1c5ce0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-aru0-1c5ce0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-aru5-1c5ce0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-aru6-1c5ce0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-aru10-1c5ce0db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-aru9-1c5ce0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-aru3-1c5ce0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-aru7-1c5ce0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-aru8-1c5ce0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-aru2-1c5ce0db.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-ljspeech-1c5ce0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-lt408-1c5ce0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-lt138-1c5ce0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-lt624-1c5ce0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-lt396-1c5ce0db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-lt498-1c5ce0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-lt132-1c5ce0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-lt288-1c5ce0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-lt42-1c5ce0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/organ-lt90-1c5ce0db.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa cơ quan cơ thể, organ còn là đàn phong cầm (đàn oóc-gan).', 'health', 1, 29),
('cfcea3c4-53fb-5392-bddd-8bf78852ca47', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'de4121d8-ff4d-560d-9b95-7f65dc4eb105', '73ff9ad9-ceb8-5e3a-8a17-6b1f7899e48a', 'sufficient', 'UK: /səˈfɪʃnt/ | US: /səˈfɪʃnt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'đủ, đầy đủ', 'enough for a particular purpose or meeting a specific requirement', 'We have sufficient resources for the project.', 'Chúng tôi có đủ nguồn lực cho dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The budget allocated for the marketing project was not sufficient to cover nationwide advertising.\", \"vi\": \"Ngân sách được phân bổ cho dự án tiếp thị không đủ để chi trả cho việc quảng cáo trên toàn quốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-ljspeech-073c168c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-cori-073c168c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sufficient-1ac6ec8b.webp', '[\"adequate\", \"enough\", \"ample\"]', '[\"insufficient\", \"inadequate\", \"deficient\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sufficient evidence\", \"meaning\": \"bằng chứng đầy đủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sufficient funds\", \"meaning\": \"nguồn vốn đầy đủ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"efficient\", \"note_vi\": \"efficient nghĩa là hiệu quả (tối ưu thời gian/chi phí), trong khi sufficient nghĩa là đủ về số lượng/yêu cầu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"sufficiently\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sufficiency\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"suffice\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-cori-073c168c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-aru0-073c168c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-aru5-073c168c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-aru6-073c168c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-aru10-073c168c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-aru9-073c168c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-aru3-073c168c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-aru7-073c168c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-aru8-073c168c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-aru2-073c168c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-ljspeech-073c168c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-lt408-073c168c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-lt138-073c168c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-lt624-073c168c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-lt396-073c168c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-lt498-073c168c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-lt132-073c168c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-lt288-073c168c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-lt42-073c168c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sufficient-lt90-073c168c.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong cấu trúc \'sufficient for sth\' hoặc \'sufficient to do sth\'. Trái nghĩa là \'insufficient\'.', 'finance', 1, 0),
('e38d66b2-6aa2-509b-9ed8-0bbd6c55961d', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'de4121d8-ff4d-560d-9b95-7f65dc4eb105', '73ff9ad9-ceb8-5e3a-8a17-6b1f7899e48a', 'entertain', 'UK: /ˌɛntəˈteɪnɪŋ/ | US: /ˌɛntərˈteɪnɪŋ/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'mang tính giải trí, thú vị', 'Providing amusement or interest to people so that they enjoy themselves.', 'The presentation was quite entertaining and informative.', 'Buổi thuyết trình khá thú vị và nhiều thông tin.', '{\"en\": \"The keynote speaker delivered an entertain presentation that kept the audience completely engaged.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả chính đã trình bày một bài thuyết trình thú vị, thu hút toàn bộ khán giả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entertain-ljspeech-52a0a5c2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entertain-cori-52a0a5c2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/entertain-1dff434a.webp', '[\"amusing\", \"engaging\", \"enjoyable\"]', '[\"boring\", \"dull\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"entertain clients\", \"meaning\": \"chiêu đãi đối tác/khách hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"entertain an offer\", \"meaning\": \"cân nhắc một đề xuất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"entertainment\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"entertainer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entertain-cori-52a0a5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entertain-aru0-52a0a5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entertain-aru5-52a0a5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entertain-aru6-52a0a5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entertain-aru10-52a0a5c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entertain-aru9-52a0a5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entertain-aru3-52a0a5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entertain-aru7-52a0a5c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entertain-aru8-52a0a5c2.mp3\", \"/s