('c9b6fc3e-770a-5e7f-9514-44bf3b354ad6', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'de4121d8-ff4d-560d-9b95-7f65dc4eb105', '73ff9ad9-ceb8-5e3a-8a17-6b1f7899e48a', 'expectation', 'UK: /ˌɛk.spɛkˈteɪ.ʃən/ | US: /ˌɛk.spɛkˈteɪ.ʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'kỳ vọng, mong đợi', 'A strong belief that something will happen or be achieved in the future.', 'The new product launch generated high expectations.', 'Buổi ra mắt sản phẩm mới tạo ra nhiều kỳ vọng.', '{\"en\": \"The quarterly financial results exceeded customer and investor expectations.\", \"vi\": \"Kết quả tài chính quý đã vượt quá kỳ vọng của khách hàng và các nhà đầu tư.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-ljspeech-7a99455e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-cori-7a99455e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/expectation-020df020.webp', '[\"anticipation\", \"prospect\", \"hope\", \"assumption\"]', '[\"disappointment\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"exceed expectations\", \"meaning\": \"vượt quá kỳ vọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"meet expectations\", \"meaning\": \"đáp ứng kỳ vọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"exception\", \"note_vi\": \"exception là ngoại lệ, khác với expectation là kỳ vọng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"expect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"expected\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-cori-7a99455e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-aru0-7a99455e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-aru5-7a99455e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-aru6-7a99455e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-aru10-7a99455e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-aru9-7a99455e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-aru3-7a99455e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-aru7-7a99455e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-aru8-7a99455e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-aru2-7a99455e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-ljspeech-7a99455e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-lt408-7a99455e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-lt138-7a99455e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-lt624-7a99455e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-lt396-7a99455e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-lt498-7a99455e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-lt132-7a99455e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-lt288-7a99455e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-lt42-7a99455e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expectation-lt90-7a99455e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm các động từ như \'exceed / meet / fall short of expectations\' (vượt / đạt / không đạt kỳ vọng).', 'business', 1, 2),
('97fb4cf6-b95e-510f-9f0a-dcd38d9756c1', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'de4121d8-ff4d-560d-9b95-7f65dc4eb105', '73ff9ad9-ceb8-5e3a-8a17-6b1f7899e48a', 'argument', '/ˈɑːɡjumənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'cuộc tranh luận gay gắt hoặc lý lẽ được đưa ra để chứng minh điều gì đó.', 'a situation where two or more people disagree strongly and express their different opinions in anger.', 'The board members reached a final settlement after a brief argument over budget allocation.', 'Các thành viên hội đồng quản trị đã đạt được thỏa thuận cuối cùng sau một cuộc tranh luận ngắn về việc phân bổ ngân sách.', '{\"en\": \"The department heads had a heated argument regarding the budget allocation for the next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Các trưởng bộ phận đã có một cuộc tranh cãi nảy lửa về việc phân bổ ngân sách cho quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-ljspeech-0f380231.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-cori-0f380231.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/argument-605cef6c.webp', '[\"dispute\", \"disagreement\"]', '[\"agreement\", \"consensus\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"heated argument\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc tranh cãi nảy lửa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"settle an argument\", \"meaning\": \"giải quyết tranh cãi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"argue\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"argumentative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-cori-0f380231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-aru0-0f380231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-aru5-0f380231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-aru6-0f380231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-aru10-0f380231.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-aru9-0f380231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-aru3-0f380231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-aru7-0f380231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-aru8-0f380231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-aru2-0f380231.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-ljspeech-0f380231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-lt408-0f380231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-lt138-0f380231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-lt624-0f380231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-lt396-0f380231.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-lt498-0f380231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-lt132-0f380231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-lt288-0f380231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-lt42-0f380231.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/argument-lt90-0f380231.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận lỗi chính tả: bỏ chữ \'e\' ở cuối từ \'argue\' khi thêm đuôi \'ment\'.', 'office', 1, 3),
('907edbd0-6ad7-5809-ae42-da0e8aca4aa7', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'de4121d8-ff4d-560d-9b95-7f65dc4eb105', '73ff9ad9-ceb8-5e3a-8a17-6b1f7899e48a', 'booking', '/ˈbʊkɪŋ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Sự sắp xếp để có chỗ ngồi, phòng, vé, v.v. trước.', 'an arrangement to have a seat, room, or event saved for future use.', 'We confirmed our flight booking online a week before our trip.', 'Chúng tôi đã xác nhận đặt vé chuyến bay trực tuyến một tuần trước chuyến đi.', '{\"en\": \"The receptionist will process your flight booking as soon as payment is confirmed.\", \"vi\": \"Lễ tân sẽ xử lý việc đặt vé máy bay của bạn ngay khi thanh toán được xác nhận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-ljspeech-2065075f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-cori-2065075f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/booking-fb601c9a.webp', '[\"reservation\"]', '[\"cancellation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"make a booking\", \"meaning\": \"đặt chỗ trước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cancel a booking\", \"meaning\": \"hủy đặt chỗ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"advance booking\", \"meaning\": \"sự đặt chỗ trước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reservation\", \"note_vi\": \"tương tự nhau, booking thường dùng cho vé và chuyến đi\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"book\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-cori-2065075f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-aru0-2065075f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-aru5-2065075f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-aru6-2065075f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-aru10-2065075f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-aru9-2065075f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-aru3-2065075f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-aru7-2065075f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-aru8-2065075f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-aru2-2065075f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-ljspeech-2065075f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-lt408-2065075f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-lt138-2065075f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-lt624-2065075f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-lt396-2065075f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-lt498-2065075f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-lt132-2065075f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-lt288-2065075f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-lt42-2065075f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booking-lt90-2065075f.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ dạng V-ing nhưng đóng vai trò danh từ đếm được chỉ việc đặt chỗ.', 'travel', 1, 4),
('f28c81de-77ba-5025-b47e-5071dfeca0ab', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'de4121d8-ff4d-560d-9b95-7f65dc4eb105', '73ff9ad9-ceb8-5e3a-8a17-6b1f7899e48a', 'travel agency', '/ˈtræv.əl ˌeɪ.dʒən.si/', 'A2', 'phrase', 'Công ty chuyên tổ chức và bán các chuyến đi, tour du lịch cho khách hàng.', 'a company that plans holidays and books tickets or hotels for customers.', 'The corporate travel agency arranged flight tickets and hotel accommodations for all conference attendees.', 'Đại lý du lịch của doanh nghiệp đã sắp xếp vé máy bay và phòng khách sạn cho tất cả người tham dự hội thảo.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate travel agency booked our flights and hotel rooms for the annual conference.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch của công ty đã đặt vé máy bay và phòng khách sạn cho hội nghị thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-ljspeech-5cc328cb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-cori-5cc328cb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/travel-agency-e06a2c5e.webp', '[\"travel bureau\", \"tour operator\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"local travel agency\", \"meaning\": \"đại lý du lịch địa phương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"online travel agency\", \"meaning\": \"đại lý du lịch trực tuyến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tour operator\", \"note_vi\": \"tour operator tự thiết kế tour, travel agency chỉ bán tour.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-cori-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-aru0-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-aru5-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-aru6-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-aru10-5cc328cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-aru9-5cc328cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/travel-agency-aru3-5c