('3bee4d01-bbc2-5936-bc0f-892d7770a1c8', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'de4121d8-ff4d-560d-9b95-7f65dc4eb105', '73ff9ad9-ceb8-5e3a-8a17-6b1f7899e48a', 'experience', 'UK: /ɪkˈspɪəriəns/ | US: /ɪkˈspɪriəns/', 'B1', 'verb', 'trải qua, gặp phải', 'to undergo or feel a particular situation, event, or change directly yourself.', 'Customers experience delays due to high demand.', 'Khách hàng gặp phải sự chậm trễ do nhu cầu cao.', '{\"en\": \"Our online system experienced technical difficulties during peak hours.\", \"vi\": \"Hệ thống trực tuyến của chúng tôi đã gặp phải sự cố kỹ thuật trong giờ cao điểm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-ljspeech-f96da029.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-cori-f96da029.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/experience-33f448f8.webp', '[\"undergo\", \"encounter\", \"face\", \"go through\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"experience delays\", \"meaning\": \"bị chậm trễ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"experience growth\", \"meaning\": \"trải qua sự tăng trưởng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"experience\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"experienced\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-cori-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru0-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru5-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru6-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru10-f96da029.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru9-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru3-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru7-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru8-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru2-f96da029.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-ljspeech-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt408-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt138-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt624-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt396-f96da029.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt498-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt132-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt288-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt42-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt90-f96da029.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi là động từ, \'experience\' thường đi với các danh từ như \'delays\' (sự hoãn), \'difficulties\' (khó khăn), \'growth\' (sự tăng trưởng).', 'office', 1, 17),
('b2afc611-4ca0-5bef-a9a2-4a7191f70543', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'de4121d8-ff4d-560d-9b95-7f65dc4eb105', '73ff9ad9-ceb8-5e3a-8a17-6b1f7899e48a', 'apostrophe', '/əˈpɒstrəfi/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Dấu nháy đơn dùng trong tiếng Anh để chỉ sở hữu hoặc rút gọn từ.', 'a mark used in writing to show possession or missing letters in a word.', 'In English, an apostrophe is used to show possession, like \"the dog\'s toy.\"', 'Trong tiếng Anh, dấu nháy đơn được dùng để chỉ sự sở hữu, ví dụ như \"đồ chơi của con chó.\"', '{\"en\": \"Please check the document carefully for any missing apostrophe before sending it to clients.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng kiểm tra kỹ tài liệu để tìm dấu nháy đơn bị thiếu trước khi gửi cho khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apostrophe-ljspeech-99b7a1aa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apostrophe-cori-99b7a1aa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/apostrophe-9af9c7e4.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"possessive apostrophe\", \"meaning\": \"dấu nháy đơn thể hiện sở hữu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apostrophe-cori-99b7a1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apostrophe-aru0-99b7a1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apostrophe-aru5-99b7a1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apostrophe-aru6-99b7a1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apostrophe-aru10-99b7a1aa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apostrophe-aru9-99b7a1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apostrophe-aru3-99b7a1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apostrophe-aru7-99b7a1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apostrophe-aru8-99b7a1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apostrophe-aru2-99b7a1aa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apostrop