('6bb07b85-da4a-5a9c-b228-8678ad60c858', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f0efdd85-515c-5415-8ebe-c28307c14b9f', '32c126ad-e0a2-5270-825f-2b8968b3dcd9', 'flesh', '/fleʃ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Phần mềm của cơ thể người hoặc động vật, bao gồm cơ và mỡ.', 'the soft part of an animal or human body between skin and bones.', 'The wound was deep, exposing the raw flesh beneath the skin.', 'Vết thương sâu, để lộ phần thịt sống bên dưới da.', '{\"en\": \"The chef carefully removed the outer skin without damaging the delicate fruit flesh.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu bếp cẩn thận loại bỏ lớp vỏ bên ngoài mà không làm hỏng phần thịt quả mềm mại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-ljspeech-3496ae53.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-cori-3496ae53.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flesh-1914afea.webp', '[\"tissue\", \"meat\", \"pulp\"]', '[\"bone\", \"skeleton\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"flesh and blood\", \"meaning\": \"người thân máu mủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in the flesh\", \"meaning\": \"bằng xương bằng thịt (gặp trực tiếp)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fresh\", \"note_vi\": \"fresh nghĩa là tươi mới, khác hẳn với flesh (thịt).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fleshy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-cori-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru0-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru5-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru6-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru10-3496ae53.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru9-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru3-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru7-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru8-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-aru2-3496ae53.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-ljspeech-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt408-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt138-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt624-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt396-3496ae53.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt498-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt132-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt288-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt42-3496ae53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flesh-lt90-3496ae53.mp3\"]}}', 'Flesh dùng cho thịt người/động vật/hoa quả; còn \'meat\' dùng cho thịt động vật làm thức ăn.', 'dining', 1, 7),
('d783a436-899e-5779-9a8e-628b0c3cab17', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f0efdd85-515c-5415-8ebe-c28307c14b9f', '32c126ad-e0a2-5270-825f-2b8968b3dcd9', 'excess', 'UK: /ɪkˈsɛs/ | US: /ˈɛkˌsɛs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'số lượng dư thừa', 'An amount of something that is more than necessary, useful, or permitted.', 'There was an excess of food at the party.', 'Có một lượng thức ăn dư thừa trong bữa tiệc.', '{\"en\": \"The company reduced production to avoid creating an excess of unsold inventory.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã giảm sản xuất để tránh tạo ra một lượng dư thừa hàng tồn kho chưa bán được.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-ljspeech-6266c5db.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-cori-6266c5db.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/excess-1eb9760c.webp', '[\"surplus\", \"abundance\", \"glut\"]', '[\"shortage\", \"deficit\", \"scarcity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in excess of\", \"meaning\": \"vượt quá (một con số)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"excess inventory\", \"meaning\": \"hàng tồn kho dư thừa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"access\", \"note_vi\": \"excess là lượng dư thừa, trong khi access là quyền truy cập hoặc tiếp cận.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"excessive\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"excessively\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"exceed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-cori-6266c5db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-aru0-6266c5db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-aru5-6266c5db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-aru6-6266c5db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-aru10-6266c5db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-aru9-6266c5db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-aru3-6266c5db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-aru7-6266c5db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-aru8-6266c5db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-aru2-6266c5db.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-ljspeech-6266c5db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-lt408-6266c5db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-lt138-6266c5db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-lt624-6266c5db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-lt396-6266c5db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-lt498-6266c5db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-lt132-6266c5db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-lt288-6266c5db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-lt42-6266c5db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excess-lt90-6266c5db.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi trong cụm \'in excess of\' (vượt quá một mốc số lượng) hoặc đóng vai trò như tính từ trong \'excess inventory\' (hàng dư thừa).', 'manufacturing', 1, 8),
('eb77dbb6-c5ae-5249-9e30-c170f9c3d13c', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f0efdd85-515c-5415-8ebe-c28307c14b9f', '32c126ad-e0a2-5270-825f-2b8968b3dcd9', 'tolerant', '/ˈtɒlərənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng chấp nhận hoặc tôn trọng những ý kiến, hành vi khác biệt.', 'able to accept what other people say or do without getting angry.', 'It\'s important to be tolerant of other people\'s beliefs, even if they differ from your own.', 'Điều quan trọng là phải bao dung với niềm tin của người khác, ngay cả khi chúng khác với niềm tin của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"Managers should be tolerant of different working styles to maintain a peaceful office environment.\", \"vi\": \"Các quản lý nên bao dung với các phong cách làm việc khác nhau để duy trì môi trường văn phòng hòa bình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-ljspeech-c442f1a7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-cori-c442f1a7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tolerant-11333cac.webp', '[\"understanding\", \"patient\", \"lenient\"]', '[\"intolerant\", \"prejudiced\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tolerant of\", \"meaning\": \"khoan dung với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tolerant attitude\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ bao dung\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tolerable\", \"note_vi\": \"tolerable là có thể chịu đựng được, khá tốt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tolerance\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"tolerate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-cori-c442f1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-aru0-c442f1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-aru5-c442f1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-aru6-c442f1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-aru10-c442f1a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-aru9-c442f1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-aru3-c442f1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-aru7-c442f1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-aru8-c442f1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-aru2-c442f1a7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-ljspeech-c442f1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-lt408-c442f1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-lt138-c442f1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-lt624-c442f1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-lt396-c442f1a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-lt498-c442f1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-lt132-c442f1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-lt288-c442f1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-lt42-c442f1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tolerant-lt90-c442f1a7.mp3\"]}}', 'Tolerant thường đi với giới từ \'of\' hoặc \'towards\'.', 'hr', 1, 9),
('3d0923fb-d430-5961-859a-92c70de83620', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f0efdd85-515c-5415-8ebe-c28307c14b9f', '32c126ad-e0a2-5270-825f-2b8968b3dcd9', 'belt', '/belt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Dải vật liệu đeo quanh eo để giữ quần áo hoặc làm phụ kiện.', 'a long narrow piece of leather or cloth worn around the waist to hold clothes.', 'He always wears a leather belt with his jeans.', 'Anh ấy luôn đeo một chiếc dây lưng da với quần jean của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The factory worker must wear a safety belt to prevent injuries while operating heavy machinery.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân nhà máy phải đeo dây đai an toàn để tránh chấn thương khi vận hành máy móc hạng nặng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-ljspeech-aec3c10f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-cori-aec3c10f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/belt-fd8cca6f.webp', '[\"strap\", \"band\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"seat belt\", \"meaning\": \"dây an toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"safety belt\", \"meaning\": \"dây đai an toàn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-cori-aec3c10f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-aru0-aec3c10f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-aru5-aec3c10f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-aru6-aec3c10f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-aru10-aec3c10f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-aru9-aec3c10f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-aru3-aec3c10f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-aru7-aec3c10f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-aru8-aec3c10f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-aru2-aec3c10f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-ljspeech-aec3c10f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-lt408-aec3c10f