('4d3ae66d-65e4-58a0-a862-bfae8947c25a', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f0efdd85-515c-5415-8ebe-c28307c14b9f', '32c126ad-e0a2-5270-825f-2b8968b3dcd9', 'awkward', '/ˈɔːkwəd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gây cảm giác lúng túng, khó xử hoặc không thoải mái.', 'causing or feeling embarrassment, problems, or a lack of comfort in social situations.', 'There was an awkward silence after he told the inappropriate joke.', 'Có một sự im lặng khó xử sau khi anh ấy kể câu chuyện đùa không phù hợp.', '{\"en\": \"There was an awkward silence during the meeting when the manager mentioned the delay.\", \"vi\": \"Có một sự im lặng khó xử trong cuộc họp khi người quản lý đề cập đến sự chậm trễ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awkward-ljspeech-f7d4c2e5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awkward-cori-f7d4c2e5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/awkward-0fd4626e.webp', '[\"embarrassing\", \"uncomfortable\", \"clumsy\"]', '[\"comfortable\", \"graceful\", \"convenient\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"awkward silence\", \"meaning\": \"sự im lặng khó xử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"awkward situation\", \"meaning\": \"tình huống khó xử\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"awkwardly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"awkwardness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awkward-cori-f7d4c2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awkward-aru0-f7d4c2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awkward-aru5-f7d4c2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awkward-aru6-f7d4c2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awkward-aru10-f7d4c2e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awkward-aru9-f7d4c2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awkward-aru3-f7d4c2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awkward-aru7-f7d4c2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/awkward-aru8-f7d4