('745edbb7-bd4c-51f0-af99-5bc26269f2e6', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f0efdd85-515c-5415-8ebe-c28307c14b9f', '32c126ad-e0a2-5270-825f-2b8968b3dcd9', 'acid rain', '/æsɪd reɪn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hiện tượng mưa có tính axit cao do ô nhiễm không khí.', 'precipitation that is chemically polluted and harms the natural environment.', 'Acid rain can damage forests and lakes, harming the environment.', 'Mưa axit có thể làm hại rừng và hồ, gây tổn thương môi trường.', '{\"en\": \"The factory\'s emissions were blamed for the acid rain issue.\", \"vi\": \"Khí thải của nhà máy bị đổ lỗi cho vấn đề mưa axit.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-ljspeech-a0821474.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-cori-a0821474.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/acid-rain-8587bd29.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cause acid rain\", \"meaning\": \"gây mưa axit\"}, {\"phrase\": \"acid rain damage\", \"meaning\": \"thiệt hại do mưa axit\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rainwater\", \"note_vi\": \"rainwater là nước mưa sạch, khác mưa axit\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-cori-a0821474.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru0-a0821474.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru5-a0821474.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru6-a0821474.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru10-a0821474.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru9-a0821474.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru3-a0821474.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru7-a0821474.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru8-a0821474.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru2-a0821474.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ac