('cf7c0c9a-2346-53a9-854d-25d21a8e3b82', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f0efdd85-515c-5415-8ebe-c28307c14b9f', '32c126ad-e0a2-5270-825f-2b8968b3dcd9', 'custody', '/ˈkʌstədi/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Quyền hợp pháp để chăm sóc và kiểm soát một đứa trẻ hoặc tài sản.', 'the legal right to take care of a child, given by a court.', 'After the divorce, the parents shared joint custody of their children.', 'Sau khi ly hôn, cha mẹ chia sẻ quyền nuôi con chung.', '{\"en\": \"The company\'s legal team helped the employee understand her custody rights during the dispute.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm pháp lý của công ty đã giúp nhân viên hiểu quyền nuôi con của cô trong vụ tranh chấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-ljspeech-bb610c5e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-cori-bb610c5e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/custody-aa8b0683.webp', '[\"guardianship\", \"care\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"full custody\", \"meaning\": \"quyền nuôi con toàn phần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"joint custody\", \"meaning\": \"quyền nuôi con chung\"}, {\"phrase\": \"custody battle\", \"meaning\": \"tranh chấp quyền nuôi con\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"custom\", \"note_vi\": \"\'custom\' là phong tục hoặc thói quen, khác hoàn toàn \'custody\'\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"custodian\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"custodial\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-cori-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-aru0-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-aru5-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-aru6-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-aru10-bb610c5e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-aru9-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-aru3-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-aru7-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-aru8-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-aru2-bb610c5e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-ljspeech-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-lt408-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-lt138-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-lt624-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-lt396-bb610c5e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-lt498-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-lt132-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-lt288-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-lt42-bb610c5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custody-lt90-bb610c5e.mp3\"]}}', '\'Custody\' trong luật pháp chỉ quyền nuôi con; trong ngữ cảnh khác có thể nghĩa là giam giữ.', 'law', 1, 18),
('fd0927d6-dbd9-5189-947d-ef09f1105451', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f0efdd85-515c-5415-8ebe-c28307c14b9f', '32c126ad-e0a2-5270-825f-2b8968b3dcd9', 'cholesterol', '/kəˈlestərɒl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'chất béo có trong máu, có thể gây bệnh tim mạch nếu quá cao.', 'a waxy substance found in the blood that can cause health problems if levels are high.', 'Eating a balanced diet can help manage your cholesterol levels.', 'Ăn một chế độ ăn uống cân bằng có thể giúp kiểm soát mức cholesterol của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"The doctor advised him to change his diet to lower his cholesterol for better health.\", \"vi\": \"Bác sĩ khuyên anh ấy nên thay đổi chế độ ăn để giảm cholesterol nhằm có sức khỏe tốt hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cholesterol-ljspeech-479f2055.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cholesterol-cori-479f2055.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cholesterol-8062ea39.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"lower cholesterol\", \"meaning\": \"giảm cholesterol\"}, {\"phrase\": \"high cholesterol\", \"meaning\": \"cholesterol cao\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cholesterol-cori-479f2055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cholesterol-aru0-479f2055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cholesterol-aru5-479f2055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cholesterol-aru6-479f2055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cholesterol-aru10-479f2055.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cholesterol-aru9-479f2055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cholesterol-aru3-479f2055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cholesterol-aru7-479f2055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cholesterol-aru8-479f2055.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cholesterol-aru2-479f2055.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storag