('cb230c03-8f83-516e-98ee-bbc45f0692ea', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f1404bc4-8ff4-5146-a87c-c92c40fa6199', 'e2e1e6e3-d9f8-58a2-b2de-b648ba90dcc3', 'beast', '/biːst/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một loài động vật lớn hoặc hoang dã.', 'a large or dangerous animal that lives in the wild and is not kept by people.', 'The story tells of a brave knight who fought a fearsome beast.', 'Câu chuyện kể về một hiệp sĩ dũng cảm đã chiến đấu với một con thú đáng sợ.', '{\"en\": \"The logistics company faced a beast of a challenge when trying to deliver goods during the storm.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty logistics đã phải đối mặt với một thử thách cực kỳ khó khăn khi giao hàng trong bão.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-ljspeech-1173cbc9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-cori-1173cbc9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/beast-91e65654.webp', '[\"animal\", \"creature\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wild beast\", \"meaning\": \"thú hoang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"beast of burden\", \"meaning\": \"súc vật thồ hàng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"beastly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-cori-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru0-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru5-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru6-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru10-1173cbc9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru9-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru3-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru7-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru8-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-aru2-1173cbc9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-ljspeech-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-lt408-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-lt138-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-lt624-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-lt396-1173cbc9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-lt498-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-lt132-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-lt288-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-lt42-1173cbc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beast-lt90-1173cbc9.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa bóng chỉ người thô lỗ hoặc thử thách khó khăn.', 'other', 1, 9),
('b9dddb91-234f-5991-a041-b15fa4c19a63', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f1404bc4-8ff4-5146-a87c-c92c40fa6199', 'e2e1e6e3-d9f8-58a2-b2de-b648ba90dcc3', 'torrent', '/ˈtɒrənt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Dòng chảy mạnh, xiết của nước hoặc vật chất khác.', 'a large amount of water moving very quickly and with great force.', 'Continuous heavy rainfall turned the small creek into a fast-moving torrent.', 'Trận mưa lớn kéo dài đã biến con suối nhỏ thành một dòng nước xiết chảy nhanh.', '{\"en\": \"Heavy rain turned the small stream near the factory into a dangerous torrent yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Cơn mưa lớn đã biến con suối nhỏ gần nhà máy thành một dòng nước chảy xiết nguy hiểm vào ngày hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-ljspeech-a2ec67d8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-cori-a2ec67d8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/torrent-650f1cfd.webp', '[\"flood\", \"rush\", \"stream\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"raging torrent\", \"meaning\": \"dòng nước chảy xiết dữ dội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"torrent of rain\", \"meaning\": \"mưa như trút nước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"current\", \"note_vi\": \"current là dòng hải lưu hoặc dòng điện, torrent là dòng nước chảy xiết mạnh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"torrential\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-cori-a2ec67d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-aru0-a2ec67d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-aru5-a2ec67d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-aru6-a2ec67d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-aru10-a2ec67d8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-aru9-a2ec67d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-aru3-a2ec67d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-aru7-a2ec67d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-aru8-a2ec67d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-aru2-a2ec67d8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-ljspeech-a2ec67d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-lt408-a2ec67d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-lt138-a2ec67d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-lt624-a2ec67d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-lt396-a2ec67d8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-lt498-a2ec67d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-lt132-a2ec67d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-lt288-a2ec67d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-lt42-a2ec67d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torrent-lt90-a2ec67d8.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong công nghệ, torrent còn chỉ phương thức chia sẻ file ngang hàng.', 'nature', 1, 10)
