('3815d5fe-568b-5ca9-9563-d932547ae335', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f1404bc4-8ff4-5146-a87c-c92c40fa6199', 'e2e1e6e3-d9f8-58a2-b2de-b648ba90dcc3', 'queue', '/kjuː/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một hàng người hoặc vật chờ đợi.', 'A row of individuals or vehicles standing sequentially to await service or entry.', 'We had to wait in a long queue to buy tickets for the concert.', 'Chúng tôi đã phải xếp hàng dài để mua vé xem buổi hòa nhạc.', '{\"en\": \"Customers complained about the long queue at the checkout counter during the holiday sales event.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng phàn nàn về hàng đợi dài tại quầy thanh toán trong sự kiện giảm giá ngày lễ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-ljspeech-1038345e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-cori-1038345e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/queue-99279138.webp', '[\"line\", \"row\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"stand in a queue\", \"meaning\": \"đứng xếp hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"jump the queue\", \"meaning\": \"chen ngang hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cue\", \"note_vi\": \"cue là gợi ý/tín hiệu, queue là hàng đợi (phát âm giống nhau).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"queue\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-cori-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru0-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru5-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru6-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru10-1038345e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru9-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru3-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru7-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru8-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-aru2-1038345e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-ljspeech-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt408-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt138-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt624-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt396-1038345e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt498-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt132-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt288-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt42-1038345e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/queue-lt90-1038345e.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này phổ biến trong tiếng Anh-Anh, tiếng Anh-Mỹ thường dùng \'line\'.', 'shopping', 1, 11),
('7f3dc17e-73c7-5c85-b169-5c8c10690299', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f1404bc4-8ff4-5146-a87c-c92c40fa6199', 'e2e1e6e3-d9f8-58a2-b2de-b648ba90dcc3', 'hobby', '/ˈhɒbi/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Hoạt động làm lúc rảnh rỗi để giải trí, thư giãn.', 'an activity that you enjoy doing in your free time for relaxation.', 'Gardening is a relaxing hobby that helps my grandmother unwind.', 'Làm vườn là một sở thích thư giãn giúp bà tôi xả hơi.', '{\"en\": \"The human resources manager asked the job applicant about her main hobby during interview.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng nhân sự đã hỏi ứng viên xin việc về sở thích chính của cô ấy trong buổi phỏng vấn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-ljspeech-54b7e849.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-cori-54b7e849.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hobby-d07cdbcc.webp', '[\"pastime\", \"interest\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pursue a hobby\", \"meaning\": \"theo đuổi một sở thích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"favorite hobby\", \"meaning\": \"sở thích yêu thích\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"habit\", \"note_vi\": \"thói quen lặp đi lặp lại, còn hobby là sở thích giải trí\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-cori-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru0-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru5-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru6-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru10-54b7e849.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru9-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru3-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru7-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru8-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-aru2-54b7e849.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-ljspeech-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-lt408-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-lt138-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-lt624-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-lt396-54b7e849.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-lt498-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-lt132-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-lt288-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-lt42-54b7e849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hobby-lt90-54b7e849.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với habit (thói quen mang tính tự động).', 'hr', 1, 12),
('6fa8bf69-68d6-5cd2-9f15-f91d11503934', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f1404bc4-8ff4-5146-a87c-c92c40fa6199', 'e2e1e6e3-d9f8-58a2-b2de-b648ba90dcc3', 'umpire', '/ˈʌmpaɪə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'người điều khiển trận đấu thể thao để đảm bảo luật được tuân thủ', 'an official who controls a sports game and ensures rules are followed correctly.', 'An experienced umpire was selected to supervise the championship tennis match.', 'Một trọng tài giàu kinh nghiệm đã được chọn để giám sát trận đấu quần vợt vô địch.', '{\"en\": \"The sports venue hired an experienced umpire to oversee the corporate tennis tournament.\", \"vi\": \"Địa điểm thể thao đã thuê một trọng tài có kinh nghiệm để giám sát giải đấu quần vợt của doanh nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-ljspeech-f798779b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-cori-f798779b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/umpire-80cdca4e.webp', '[\"referee\", \"official\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"chief umpire\", \"meaning\": \"trọng tài chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"umpire decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định của trọng tài\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"referee\", \"note_vi\": \"Umpire dùng trong tennis, bóng chày; referee dùng trong bóng đá, bóng rổ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"umpire\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-cori-f798779b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-aru0-f798779b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-aru5-f798779b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-aru6-f798779b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-aru10-f798779b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-aru9-f798779b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-aru3-f798779b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-aru7-f798779b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-aru8-f798779b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-aru2-f798779b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-ljspeech-f798779b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-lt408-f798779b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-lt138-f798779b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-lt624-f798779b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-lt396-f798779b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-lt498-f798779b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-lt132-f798779b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-lt288-f798779b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-lt42-f798779b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/umpire-lt90-f798779b.mp3\"]}}', 'Trọng tài bắt chính trong quần vợt, bóng chày.', 'other', 1, 13),
('0a095f12-51d4-5a0c-b840-5f85149c3c87', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f1404bc4-8ff4-5146-a87c-c92c40fa6199', 'e2e1e6e3-d9f8-58a2-b2de-b648ba90dcc3', 'chronological', '/ˌkrɒnəˈlɒdʒɪkl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'theo thứ tự thời gian xảy ra của các sự kiện.', 'arranged in the order that events happened from the earliest to the latest time.', 'Applicants should list their previous work experiences in reverse chronological order on their resumes.', 'Ứng viên nên liệt kê các kinh nghiệm làm việc trước đây của mình theo thứ tự thời gian đảo ngược trên sơ yếu lý lịch.', '{\"en\": \"Please organize all your project reports in chronological order for the upcoming annual review.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng sắp xếp tất cả các báo cáo dự án của bạn theo thứ tự thời gian cho buổi đánh giá hàng năm sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-ljspeech-a8f24508.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-cori-a8f24508.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chronological-1b00b6c6.webp', '[\"sequential\", \"ordered\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"chronological order\", \"meaning\": \"thứ tự thời gian\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in chronological sequence\", \"meaning\": \"theo trình tự thời gian\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"chronology\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-cori-a8f24508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-aru0-a8f24508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-aru5-a8f24508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-aru6-a8f24508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-aru10-a8f24508.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-aru9-a8f24508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-aru3-a8f24508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-aru7-a8f24508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-aru8-a8f24508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-aru2-a8f24508.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-ljspeech-a8f24508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-lt408-a8f24508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-lt138-a8f24508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-lt624-a8f24508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-lt396-a8f24508.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-lt498-a8f24508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-lt132-a8f24508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-lt288-a8f24508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-lt42-a8f24508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronological-lt90-a8f24508.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc từ \'chrono\' nghĩa là thời gian, giúp bạn dễ nhớ nghĩa từ này.', 'office', 1, 14),
('49869304-9f21-54bb-9e48-048868530943', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f1404bc4-8ff4-5146-a87c-c92c40fa6199', 'e2e1e6e3-d9f8-58a2-b2de-b648ba90dcc3', 'tax', '/tæks/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Khoản tiền bắt buộc phải trả cho chính phủ.', 'an amount of money paid to the government based on income.', 'Many people complain about the high income tax they have to pay each year.', 'Nhiều người phàn nàn về khoản thuế thu nhập cao mà họ phải trả hàng năm.', '{\"en\": \"The accounting department calculated the annual corporate tax before filing the official financial report.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận kế toán đã tính toán thuế doanh nghiệp hàng năm trước khi nộp báo cáo tài chính chính thức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tax-ljspeech-e8e27c0a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tax-cori-e8e27c0a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tax-d56e1a93.webp', '[\"duty\", \"levy\", \"tariff\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"income tax\", \"meaning\": \"thuế thu nhập\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tax return\", \"meaning\": \"tờ khai thuế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tax reform\", \"meaning\": \"cải cách thuế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fee\", \"note_vi\": \"fee là phí dịch vụ trả cho tổ chức/cá nhân, tax là thuế nộp cho nhà nước\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"taxation\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"tax\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"taxable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tax-cori-e8e27c0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tax-aru0-e8e27c0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tax-aru5-e8e27c0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tax-aru6-e8e27c0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tax-aru10-e8e27c0a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tax-aru9-e8e27c0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tax-aru3-e8e27c0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tax-ar