('9c20b1f8-f2c9-5633-a77e-3859e90871f1', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f1404bc4-8ff4-5146-a87c-c92c40fa6199', 'e2e1e6e3-d9f8-58a2-b2de-b648ba90dcc3', 'cloudy', '/ˈklaʊdi/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có nhiều mây, không trong xanh.', 'having many clouds in the sky so that it is not bright or sunny outside.', 'The weather forecast predicts a cloudy day with a chance of rain.', 'Dự báo thời tiết cho biết một ngày nhiều mây với khả năng có mưa.', '{\"en\": \"The weather forecast predicts a cloudy day, so please bring an umbrella for your outdoor meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Dự báo thời tiết cho biết hôm nay trời nhiều mây, vì vậy hãy mang ô cho cuộc họp ngoài trời.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-ljspeech-5a53260b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-cori-5a53260b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cloudy-1fa2d7fd.webp', '[\"overcast\", \"gloomy\"]', '[\"sunny\", \"clear\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"partly cloudy\", \"meaning\": \"có mây rải rác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cloudy weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết nhiều mây\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cloud\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-cori-5a53260b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru0-5a53260b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru5-5a53260b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru6-5a53260b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru10-5a53260b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru9-5a53260b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru3-5a53260b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru7-5a53260b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru8-5a53260b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cloudy-aru2-5a53260b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunci