('8ce884e7-02f1-5b45-ae1c-e7afd70a4859', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f1404bc4-8ff4-5146-a87c-c92c40fa6199', 'e2e1e6e3-d9f8-58a2-b2de-b648ba90dcc3', 'election', 'UK: /ɪˈlɛkʃən/ | US: /ɪˈlɛkʃən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'cuộc bầu cử', 'A formal process in which people vote to choose individuals for public or official positions.', 'The results of the city election will be announced today.', 'Kết quả cuộc bầu cử thành phố sẽ được công bố hôm nay.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors will hold an election next month to choose the new CEO.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị sẽ tổ chức một cuộc bầu cử vào tháng tới để chọn ra CEO mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-ljspeech-ed9c23ea.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-cori-ed9c23ea.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/election-3bfc0f0a.webp', '[\"vote\", \"ballot\", \"selection\", \"poll\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hold an election\", \"meaning\": \"tổ chức một cuộc bầu cử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"election results\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả bầu cử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"upcoming election\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc bầu cử sắp tới\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"elect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"elective\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-cori-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru0-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru5-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru6-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru10-ed9c23ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru9-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru3-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru7-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru8-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-aru2-ed9c23ea.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-ljspeech-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt408-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt138-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt624-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt396-ed9c23ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt498-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt132-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt288-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt42-ed9c23ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/election-lt90-ed9c23ea.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh doanh nghiệp, \'election\' chỉ việc bầu cử hội đồng quản trị hoặc công đoàn. Thường đi với động từ \'hold\' (tổ chức).', 'corporate governance', 1, 22),
('e81f84e2-6530-590d-974b-d60854de553d', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f1404bc4-8ff4-5146-a87c-c92c40fa6199', 'e2e1e6e3-d9f8-58a2-b2de-b648ba90dcc3', 'GPS', '/ˌdʒiː piː ˈes/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hệ thống định vị toàn cầu dùng vệ tinh để xác định vị trí.', 'a system that uses radio signals from satellites to show your exact position.', 'We used a GPS device to navigate through the unfamiliar city streets and find our hotel.', 'Chúng tôi đã sử dụng thiết bị GPS để định vị qua các con phố lạ trong thành phố và tìm khách sạn của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Our delivery trucks are equipped with GPS to help drivers find the fastest routes.\", \"vi\": \"Xe tải giao hàng của chúng tôi được trang bị GPS để giúp tài xế tìm đường nhanh nhất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gps-ljspeech-34d734a4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gps-cori-34d734a4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gps-32201559.webp', '[\"satellite navigation\", \"satnav\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"GPS navigation\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống dẫn đường GPS\"}, {\"phrase\": \"GPS tracking\", \"meaning\": \"định vị theo dõi bằng GPS\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gps-cori-34d734a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gps-aru0-34d734a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gps-aru5-34d734a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gps-aru6-34d734a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gps-aru10-34d734a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gps-aru9-34d734a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gps-aru3-34d734a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gps-aru7-34d734a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gps-aru8-34d734a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gps-aru2-34d734a4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciat