('d7d0a315-6f47-50c7-96d6-2ad5b676f6aa', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f1404bc4-8ff4-5146-a87c-c92c40fa6199', 'e2e1e6e3-d9f8-58a2-b2de-b648ba90dcc3', 'beige', '/beɪʒ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một màu nâu nhạt hoặc vàng nhạt.', 'a pale yellowish-brown color, often used for paint or clothing in professional settings.', 'The walls of the living room were painted a soft beige, creating a calm atmosphere.', 'Các bức tường của phòng khách được sơn màu be nhạt, tạo ra một bầu không khí yên bình.', '{\"en\": \"We decided to paint the office walls a neutral beige to create a calm atmosphere.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi quyết định sơn các bức tường văn phòng màu be trung tính để tạo ra bầu không khí yên tĩnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-ljspeech-911ae51d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-cori-911ae51d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/beige-e3d8e07d.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"light beige\", \"meaning\": \"màu be nhạt\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-cori-911ae51d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-aru0-911ae51d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-aru5-911ae51d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-aru6-911ae51d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-aru10-911ae51d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-aru9-911ae51d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-aru3-911ae51d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-aru7-911ae51d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-aru8-911ae51d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-aru2-911ae51d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-ljspeech-911ae51d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-lt408-911ae51d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-lt138-911ae51d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-lt624-911ae51d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-lt396-911ae51d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-lt498-911ae51d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-lt132-911ae51d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-lt288-911ae51d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-lt42-911ae51d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beige-lt90-911ae51d.mp3\"]}}', 'Màu sắc trung tính, rất phổ biến trong thiết kế nội thất văn phòng.', 'daily', 1, 29),
('ee42f5ed-ff05-59ab-b8d2-8a08710cb02e', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f1813054-cee0-5b6f-b0b4-14e070a1216f', '72d17bef-64c8-560a-99bb-e773cafffdf6', 'enclose', 'UK: /ɪnˈkləʊzd/ | US: /ɪnˈkloʊzd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'đính kèm, gửi kèm', 'Attached or put inside the same envelope, package, or email alongside a primary message.', 'Please find the enclosed document for your review.', 'Vui lòng xem tài liệu đính kèm để xem xét.', '{\"en\": \"Please review the enclosed contract before attending tomorrow\'s board meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng xem lại hợp đồng được đính kèm trước khi tham dự cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enclose-ljspeech-13531957.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enclose-cori-13531957.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enclose-f7288088.webp', '[\"attached\", \"included\", \"accompanying\"]', '[\"detached\", \"separate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"enclosed document\", \"meaning\": \"tài liệu đính kèm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"please find enclosed\", \"meaning\": \"xin vui lòng xem tài liệu đính kèm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"attach\", \"note_vi\": \"\'enclose\' truyền thống dùng cho tài liệu bỏ vào trong phong bì thư, còn \'attach\' phổ biến cho tệp đính kèm trong email.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"enclose\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"enclosure\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enclose-cori-13531957.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enclose-aru0-13531957.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enclose-aru5-13531957.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enclose-aru6-13531957.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enclose-aru10-13531957.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enclose-aru9-13531957.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enclose-aru3-13531957.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publi