('058a6942-f266-55c7-a135-44501413439a', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f1813054-cee0-5b6f-b0b4-14e070a1216f', '72d17bef-64c8-560a-99bb-e773cafffdf6', 'detective', '/dɪˈtektɪv/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người điều tra tội phạm hoặc thu thập thông tin bí mật.', 'a police officer or person whose job is to find out who committed a crime.', 'The detective carefully examined the crime scene for any clues.', 'Viên thám tử đã cẩn thận kiểm tra hiện trường vụ án để tìm bất kỳ manh mối nào.', '{\"en\": \"The company hired a private detective to investigate the missing inventory.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty thuê một thám tử tư để điều tra hàng tồn kho bị mất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-ljspeech-ef097008.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-cori-ef097008.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/detective-bb40227e.webp', '[\"investigator\", \"sleuth\", \"inspector\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"private detective\", \"meaning\": \"thám tử tư\"}, {\"phrase\": \"detective agency\", \"meaning\": \"văn phòng thám tử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"detective work\", \"meaning\": \"công việc điều tra\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inspector\", \"note_vi\": \"inspector là thanh tra hoặc cảnh sát cấp cao, detective chuyên điều tra vụ án\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"detect\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"detection\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"detective\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-cori-ef097008.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-aru0-ef097008.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-aru5-ef097008.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-aru6-ef097008.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-aru10-ef097008.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-aru9-ef097008.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-aru3-ef097008.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-aru7-ef097008.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-aru8-ef097008.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-aru2-ef097008.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-ljspeech-ef097008.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-lt408-ef097008.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-lt138-ef097008.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-lt624-ef097008.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-lt396-ef097008.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-lt498-ef097008.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-lt132-ef097008.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-lt288-ef097008.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-lt42-ef097008.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detective-lt90-ef097008.mp3\"]}}', 'Detective có thể là cảnh sát hoặc tư nhân; private detective là thám tử tư.', 'law', 1, 18),
('cb008ad7-e93c-56f3-9ce5-c7f1806e409b', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f1813054-cee0-5b6f-b0b4-14e070a1216f', '72d17bef-64c8-560a-99bb-e773cafffdf6', 'vegetarian', '/ˌvedʒəˈteəriən/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người không ăn thịt hoặc cá.', 'a person who does not eat meat or fish for various reasons.', 'She has been a vegetarian for five years and feels much healthier.', 'Cô ấy đã ăn chay được năm năm và cảm thấy khỏe mạnh hơn nhiều.', '{\"en\": \"The catering service confirmed they will provide several options for any vegetarian attending the annual conference.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ ăn uống xác nhận họ sẽ cung cấp một vài lựa chọn cho bất kỳ người ăn chay nào tham dự hội nghị thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarian-ljspeech-35a14b14.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarian-cori-35a14b14.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vegetarian-aa839e8d.webp', '[\"vegan\"]', '[\"meat-eater\", \"carnivore\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strict vegetarian\", \"meaning\": \"người ăn chay trường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vegetarian diet\", \"meaning\": \"chế độ ăn chay\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"vegan\", \"note_vi\": \"người ăn chay hoàn toàn, không dùng cả trứng, sữa\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"vegetarianism\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarian-cori-35a14b14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarian-aru0-35a14b14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarian-aru5-35a14b14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarian-aru6-35a14b14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarian-aru10-35a14b14.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarian-aru9-35a14b14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarian-aru3-35a14b14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vegetarian-aru7-35a14b14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pro