('6a90e458-cb5a-542c-b9e5-df3e88f9b147', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f86af2d7-ee0f-569a-a8cd-d038c752fdec', 'cf36cb28-caf4-5fea-8b18-6c513c6097ca', 'adventure', '/ədˈventʃə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một trải nghiệm thú vị, mạo hiểm hoặc không bình thường.', 'an exciting and unusual experience or activity, often involving some risk or danger.', 'Hiking through the dense rainforest was an unforgettable adventure for the young researchers.', 'Đi bộ đường dài qua khu rừng nhiệt đới rậm rạp là một cuộc phiêu lưu đáng nhớ đối với các nhà nghiên cứu trẻ.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency introduced a new adventure package for tourists visiting the mountains.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch đã giới thiệu gói du lịch phiêu lưu mới cho du khách tham quan vùng núi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-ljspeech-ae78612a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-cori-ae78612a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/adventure-46f40602.webp', '[\"expedition\", \"escapade\", \"journey\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sense of adventure\", \"meaning\": \"tinh thần phiêu lưu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"adventure travel\", \"meaning\": \"du lịch trải nghiệm phiêu lưu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"adventurous\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"adventurer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-cori-ae78612a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-aru0-ae78612a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-aru5-ae78612a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-aru6-ae78612a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-aru10-ae78612a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-aru9-ae78612a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-aru3-ae78612a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-aru7-ae78612a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-aru8-ae78612a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-aru2-ae78612a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-ljspeech-ae78612a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-lt408-ae78612a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-lt138-ae78612a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-lt624-ae78612a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-lt396-ae78612a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-lt498-ae78612a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-lt132-ae78612a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-lt288-ae78612a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-lt42-ae78612a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adventure-lt90-ae78612a.mp3\"]}}', 'Tính từ của adventure là adventurous (thích phiêu lưu/mạo hiểm).', 'travel', 1, 5),
('38cf9813-00c1-5188-ae9d-83c6964a53a6', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f86af2d7-ee0f-569a-a8cd-d038c752fdec', 'cf36cb28-caf4-5fea-8b18-6c513c6097ca', 'determiner', '/dɪˈtɜːmɪnə(r)/', 'B2', 'determiner', 'Từ đứng trước danh từ để giới hạn hoặc xác định nghĩa của nó.', 'a word used before a noun to specify which one is meant.', 'A possessive word like \"my\" functions as a determiner before the noun in this phrase.', 'Một từ sở hữu như \"my\" đóng vai trò như một từ hạn định đứng trước danh từ trong cụm từ này.', '{\"en\": \"The training manual explains how to use a determiner correctly.\", \"vi\": \"Sổ tay đào tạo giải thích cách dùng từ hạn định đúng cách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-ljspeech-f84ee77a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-cori-f84ee77a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/determiner-371610d5.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"definite determiner\", \"meaning\": \"từ hạn định xác định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"possessive determiner\", \"meaning\": \"từ hạn định sở hữu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"determinant\", \"note_vi\": \"determiner là từ loại, determinant là yếu tố quyết định\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"determine\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"determination\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-cori-f84ee77a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-aru0-f84ee77a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-aru5-f84ee77a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-aru6-f84ee77a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-aru10-f84ee77a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-aru9-f84ee77a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-aru3-f84ee77a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-aru7-f84ee77a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-aru8-f84ee77a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-aru2-f84ee77a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-ljspeech-f84ee77a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-lt408-f84ee77a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-lt138-f84ee77a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-lt624-f84ee77a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-lt396-f84ee77a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-lt498-f84ee77a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-lt132-f84ee77a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-lt288-f84ee77a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-lt42-f84ee77a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determiner-lt90-f84ee77a.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ hạn định đứng trước danh từ như the, a, this, my.', 'academic', 1, 6),
('4cb5b7b5-a6bb-545a-bb2d-f937ad785ccd', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f86af2d7-ee0f-569a-a8cd-d038c752fdec', 'cf36cb28-caf4-5fea-8b18-6c513c6097ca', 'blended family', '/blɛndɪd fæmɪli/', 'B2', 'phrase', 'Gia đình gồm vợ chồng và con riêng của một hoặc cả hai người từ cuộc hôn nhân trước.', 'a unit formed by two adults and their children from previous marriages.', 'Building a strong bond in a blended family often requires patience and understanding from everyone.', 'Xây dựng mối quan hệ bền chặt trong một gia đình hỗn hợp thường đòi hỏi sự kiên nhẫn và thấu hiểu từ mọi người.', '{\"en\": \"The company provides comprehensive health insurance options for every employee\'s blended family.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cung cấp các lựa chọn bảo hiểm y tế toàn diện cho gia đình hỗn hợp của mỗi nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-ljspeech-d430413e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-cori-d430413e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/blended-family-91474c2e.webp', '[\"stepfamily\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"raise a blended family\", \"meaning\": \"nuôi dưỡng một gia đình hỗn hợp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"nuclear family\", \"note_vi\": \"gia đình hạt nhân, chỉ gồm bố mẹ và con cái ruột\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-cori-d430413e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-aru0-d430413e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-aru5-d430413e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-aru6-d430413e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-aru10-d430413e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-aru9-d430413e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-aru3-d430413e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-aru7-d430413e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-aru8-d430413e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-aru2-d430413e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-ljspeech-d430413e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-lt408-d430413e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-lt138-d430413e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-lt624-d430413e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-lt396-d430413e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-lt498-d430413e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-lt132-d430413e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-lt288-d430413e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-lt42-d430413e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blended-family-lt90-d430413e.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ gia đình gồm vợ/chồng và con riêng của một hoặc cả hai bên.', 'hr', 1, 7),
('31fe9422-4f2e-5b2c-b7cd-2a5e448833bc', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f86af2d7-ee0f-569a-a8cd-d038c752fdec', 'cf36cb28-caf4-5fea-8b18-6c513c6097ca', 'freelance', '/ˈfriːlɑːns/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người làm việc độc lập cho nhiều công ty hoặc khách hàng khác nhau.', 'a self-employed person who works for different companies on temporary projects.', 'After leaving her full-time job, she decided to work as a freelance graphic designer.', 'Sau khi nghỉ việc toàn thời gian, cô ấy quyết định làm nhà thiết kế đồ họa tự do.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing firm hired a skilled freelance to design their new product logo.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty tiếp thị đã thuê một người làm việc tự do có tay nghề để thiết kế logo sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-ljspeech-2e048910.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-cori-2e048910.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/freelance-ed2d461a.webp', '[\"freelancer\", \"independent contractor\"]', '[\"full-time employee\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"work as a freelance\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc tự do\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"freelancer\", \"note_vi\": \"Cả hai đều chỉ người làm việc tự do.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"freelance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"freelance\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"freelancer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-cori-2e048910.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-aru0-2e048910.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-aru5-2e048910.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-aru6-2e048910.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-aru10-2e048910.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-aru9-2e048910.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-aru3-2e048910.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-aru7-2e048910.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-aru8-2e048910.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-aru2-2e048910.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-ljspeech-2e048910.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-lt408-2e048910.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-lt138-2e048910.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-lt624-2e048910.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-lt396-2e048910.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-lt498-2e048910.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-lt132-2e048910.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-lt288-2e048910.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-lt42-2e048910.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/freelance-lt90-2e048910.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường hay dùng dạng freelancer trong văn bản giao tiếp.', 'hr', 1, 8),
('8a4ee984-1cda-56d6-8433-38c86acfabfe', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f86af2d7-ee0f-569a-a8cd-d038c752fdec', 'cf36cb28-caf4-5fea-8b18-6c513c6097ca', 'foul', '/faʊl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hành động phạm luật trong thể thao, thường dẫn đến bị phạt.', 'an action that breaks the rules in a game or a professional situation.', 'The referee blew his whistle and called a foul on the defender.', 'Trọng tài thổi còi và phạt lỗi hậu vệ.', '{\"en\": \"The referee called a foul when the player pushed his opponent during the important match.\", \"vi\": \"Trọng tài đã thổi phạt khi cầu thủ đẩy đối thủ của mình trong trận đấu quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foul-ljspeech-1754625c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foul-cori-1754625c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/foul-29407b91.webp', '[\"infraction\", \"violation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"commit a foul\", \"meaning\": \"phạm lỗi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"technical foul\", \"meaning\": \"lỗi kỹ thuật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fowl\", \"note_vi\": \"Fowl là gia cầm (gà, vịt), foul là phạm lỗi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"foul\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foul-cori-1754625c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foul-aru0-1754625c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foul-aru5-1754625c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foul-aru6-1754625c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foul-aru10-1754625c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foul-aru9-1754625c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foul-aru3-1754625c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foul-aru7-1754625c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foul-aru8-1754625c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foul-aru2-1754625c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati