('7f4700be-d61a-5343-9042-e0bce5b6a74d', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f86af2d7-ee0f-569a-a8cd-d038c752fdec', 'cf36cb28-caf4-5fea-8b18-6c513c6097ca', 'conflict', '/ˈkɒnflɪkt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự bất đồng, tranh chấp hoặc mâu thuẫn.', 'a serious disagreement or argument between people, groups, or countries about important ideas or needs.', 'The manager scheduled a meeting to resolve the scheduling conflict among staff members.', 'Quản lý đã xếp lịch một cuộc họp để giải quyết xung đột lịch trình giữa các nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"We must resolve the conflict between the two departments to ensure the project finishes on time.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta phải giải quyết xung đột giữa hai phòng ban để đảm bảo dự án hoàn thành đúng hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-ljspeech-ae214513.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-cori-ae214513.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conflict-51e2fb36.webp', '[\"disagreement\", \"dispute\"]', '[\"agreement\", \"harmony\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"resolve a conflict\", \"meaning\": \"giải quyết xung đột\"}, {\"phrase\": \"avoid conflict\", \"meaning\": \"tránh xung đột\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"confront\", \"note_vi\": \"confront là đối mặt, conflict là xung đột\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"conflicting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-cori-ae214513.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-aru0-ae214513.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-aru5-ae214513.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-aru6-ae214513.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-aru10-ae214513.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-aru9-ae214513.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-aru3-ae214513.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-aru7-ae214513.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-aru8-ae214513.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-aru2-ae214513.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-ljspeech-ae214513.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-lt408-ae214513.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-lt138-ae214513.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-lt624-ae214513.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-lt396-ae214513.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-lt498-ae214513.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-lt132-ae214513.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-lt288-ae214513.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-lt42-ae214513.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conflict-lt90-ae214513.mp3\"]}}', 'Dễ nhầm với \'confront\' (đối mặt).', 'office', 1, 10),
('b7d58eb9-5c9b-5f13-a651-ca6b201c62ab', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f86af2d7-ee0f-569a-a8cd-d038c752fdec', 'cf36cb28-caf4-5fea-8b18-6c513c6097ca', 'part of speech', '/pɑːt əv spiːtʃ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một loại từ dựa trên chức năng ngữ pháp của nó.', 'one of the grammatical groups, like noun or verb, that words belong to.', 'Nouns, verbs, and adjectives are common parts of speech in English.', 'Danh từ, động từ và tính từ là những từ loại phổ biến trong tiếng Anh.', '{\"en\": \"The language trainer asked the employees to identify the part of speech of each technical term.\", \"vi\": \"Giảng viên ngôn ngữ yêu cầu nhân viên xác định từ loại của mỗi thuật ngữ kỹ thuật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-of-speech-ljspeech-54a81520.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-of-speech-cori-54a81520.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/part-of-speech-1c58119f.webp', '[\"word class\", \"lexical category\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"identify the part of speech\", \"meaning\": \"xác định từ loại\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-of-speech-cori-54a81520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-of-speech-aru0-54a81520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-of-speech-aru5-54a81520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-of-speech-aru6-54a81520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-of-speech-aru10-54a81520.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-of-speech-aru9-54a81520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-of-speech-aru3-54a81520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-of-speech-aru7-54a81520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-of-speech-aru8-54a81520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/part-of-speech-aru2-54a81520.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/ob