('2b046bc4-9ab6-569e-965b-a927e1f45d4c', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f86af2d7-ee0f-569a-a8cd-d038c752fdec', 'cf36cb28-caf4-5fea-8b18-6c513c6097ca', 'contraction', '/kənˈtrækʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'dạng rút gọn của một từ hoặc cụm từ.', 'a short form of a word or combination of words.', 'The economic analyst warned that a sharp contraction in consumer spending could trigger a recession.', 'Chuyên gia phân tích kinh tế cảnh báo rằng sự sụt giảm mạnh trong chi tiêu tiêu dùng có thể gây ra suy thoái.', '{\"en\": \"Please avoid using any informal contraction in the official business proposal.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng tránh sử dụng bất kỳ dạng rút gọn thân mật nào trong bản đề xuất kinh doanh chính thức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-ljspeech-55b349cf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-cori-55b349cf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/contraction-32bbb919.webp', '[\"abbreviation\", \"shortening\"]', '[\"expansion\", \"growth\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"grammatical contraction\", \"meaning\": \"dạng rút gọn ngữ pháp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"economic contraction\", \"meaning\": \"sự suy thoái/co cụm kinh tế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"contract\", \"note_vi\": \"hợp đồng (danh từ) hoặc ký hợp đồng (động từ)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"contract\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"contract\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"contractible\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-cori-55b349cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-aru0-55b349cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-aru5-55b349cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-aru6-55b349cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-aru10-55b349cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-aru9-55b349cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-aru3-55b349cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-aru7-55b349cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-aru8-55b349cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-aru2-55b349cf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-ljspeech-55b349cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-lt408-55b349cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-lt138-55b349cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-lt624-55b349cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-lt396-55b349cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-lt498-55b349cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-lt132-55b349cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-lt288-55b349cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-lt42-55b349cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contraction-lt90-55b349cf.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ pháp là dạng rút gọn (như don\'t), trong kinh tế nghĩa là sự co hẹp/suy thoái.', 'office', 1, 12),
('a576f478-0511-5035-968a-283956539acd', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'f86af2d7-ee0f-569a-a8cd-d038c752fdec', 'cf36cb28-caf4-5fea-8b18-6c513c6097ca', 'afterwards', '/ˈɑːftəwədz/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Sau đó, về sau.', 'at a later time or after something else has happened in the past or future.', 'We had dinner and went for a walk afterwards.', 'Chúng tôi ăn tối và đi dạo sau đó.', '{\"en\": \"We will discuss the project details during the meeting and sign the contract immediately afterwards.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi sẽ thảo luận chi tiết dự án trong cuộc họp và ký hợp đồng ngay sau đó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-ljspeech-ad61e7ac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-cori-ad61e7ac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/afterwards-70454789.webp', '[\"later\", \"subsequently\"]', '[\"beforehand\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"shortly afterwards\", \"meaning\": \"ngay sau đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"immediately afterwards\", \"meaning\": \"ngay lập tức sau đó\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-cori-ad61e7ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-aru0-ad61e7ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-aru5-ad61e7ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-aru6-ad61e7ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-aru10-ad61e7ac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-aru9-ad61e7ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-aru3-ad61e7ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-aru7-ad61e7ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-aru8-ad61e7ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-aru2-ad61e7ac.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afterwards-ljspeech-ad61e7ac.mp3\", \"/st