('c6957b78-c7d8-58d8-94c8-c31b61705114', '6a1d39c9-c971-58f9-8a58-d75deeb5a60f', 'ff3ec754-137f-5deb-9829-50f96a071cd2', '0be60532-ac46-52cd-a08f-803335420a67', 'vapor', '/ˈveɪpə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Chất khí tạo thành từ chất lỏng hoặc rắn, như hơi nước.', 'a mass of very small drops of liquid in the air that looks like a cloud.', 'We could see the vapor rising from the hot coffee cup.', 'Chúng tôi có thể thấy hơi nước bốc lên từ cốc cà phê nóng.', '{\"en\": \"The factory installed a new ventilation system to remove harmful chemical vapor from the workspace.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy đã lắp đặt hệ thống thông gió mới để loại bỏ hơi hóa chất độc hại khỏi không gian làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vapor-ljspeech-2654cee4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vapor-cori-2654cee4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vapor-bd984a48.webp', '[\"steam\", \"mist\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"water vapor\", \"meaning\": \"hơi nước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"toxic vapor\", \"meaning\": \"hơi độc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"vaporize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vapor-cori-2654cee4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vapor-aru0-2654cee4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vapor-aru5-2654cee4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vapor-aru6-2654cee4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vapor-aru10-2654cee4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vapor-aru9-2654cee4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vapor-aru3-2654cee4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vapor-aru7-2654cee4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vapor-aru8-2654cee4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vapor-aru2-2654cee4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vapor-ljspeech-2654cee4.mp3\", \"/stor